INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68045920567516','15502250049756','Vinyl STREET ver. - Limited Edition | Booklet, Gatefold LP Jacket, Photo / Photo Card','823375364931','Cortis expand their musical world with GREENGREEN_PLAYEXTENDED, presented here in the collectible Vinyl Street Version.','11/6/2026',NULL,'46.29','30.55','46879726076124',1,'70033626726620',1,1.080000000000000072,'POUNDS','823375364931');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68045869285596','15502250115292','Standard','5056556182931','Shygirl calls SWALLOW! a reintroduction. Her 2022 debut, Nymph, took her from the electronic underground to the foreground of contemporary pop. She''s collaborated with Sega Bodega and Mura Masa, Charli xcx, Arca, SOPHIE, fka twigs, and Björk. Swallow! Is a new kind of rapturous indie songwriting, woven through the electronica she came from, recorded with Karma Kid and Casey MQ. "I want people to remember how big the world is even when you feel so small and singular" she says. Available on classic black vinyl.','11/6/2026',NULL,'30.50','20.13','46879726436572',1,'70033575444700',1,0.5600000000000000533,'POUNDS','5056556182931');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68072002158812','15502249984220','Limited Edition | Brick Red Vinyl | Extended Play, Bonus Track','881061327097','Devon Again -"In Order" [Brick Red 12" EP] [Signed] Celebrating it''s one-year anniversary, Devon Again''s beloved ''In Order'' EP is available on vinyl for the first time with SIGNED sleeve, featuring "cherry cola," "skittles," and a brand-new bonus track "heavy bend," available only on vinyl. Pressed on brick red color 12" vinyl. Limited Edition. EXPLICIT','11/6/2026',NULL,'31.23','20.61','46879725682908',1,'70059938447580',3,0.589999999999999969,'POUNDS','881061327097');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68072332624092','15502249918684','Standard | Red Vinyl','729920167722','On November 6th, Asthmatic Kitty Records will release ''Worst Christmas Ever!,'' a single-LP collection that distills Sufjan Stevens'' expansive holiday catalog-drawn from the box sets ''Songs for Christmas'' and ''Silver & Gold''-into one definitive collection. The album pairs fifteen favorites, selected from more than one hundred Christmas recordings, with the newly released original song "On This Christmas (It Only Gets Better)," Sufjan''s first new Christmas song in nearly fifteen years.','11/6/2026',NULL,'24.55','16.2','46879725387996',1,'70060268945628',0,0.05000000000000000277,'POUNDS','729920167722');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68073882419420','15502249885916','20th Anniversary Deluxe Edition | Chili Pepper Red Vinyl | 180g','634457280144','Deluxe Chili Pepper Red pressing of Glorietta''s iconic self-titled album in honor of Nine Mile Records'' 20th Anniversary.','11/6/2026',NULL,'27.76','18.32','46879725355228',1,'70061819756764',1,0.6199999999999999956,'POUNDS','31296952');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68074302931164','15502249820380','Limited Edition - Indie Exclusive | Galaxy Ruby Translucent Black Opaque Vinyl | 180g','199957697620','Tom Petty And The Heartbreakers / No Sleep Til L.A. [Indie Exclusive Galaxy Ruby Translucent Black Opaque 180g]No Sleep Til L.A. captures the sonic formation of Tom Petty and The Heartbreakers in the white hot ''70s era. Chronicled through unheard and rare original songs from Tom Petty''s first eight years as a recording artist, this 12-track collection features seven previously unreleased and five rare recordings, all newly mixed from the original multi-tracks by Ryan Ulyate. Highlights include the previously unreleased Heartbreakers songs "Parade of Loons" and "Sin City," new mixes of the earliest Mudcrutch recordings "Up In Mississippi Tonight," "Depot Street" and "Wild Eyes," plus never-before-heard gems including "Unheard of Kind of Hero" and "Satisfy Yourself." Pressed on 180-gram Indie Exclusive Galaxy Ruby Translucent Black Opaque vinyl.','11/6/2026',NULL,'34.53','22.79','46879724962012',1,'70062243938524',1,0.660000000000000031,'POUNDS','55517237');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68074306666716','15502249754844','Anniversary Edition - Reissue | Red & Milky Clear Ghostly Vinyl','647379774820','Red & Milky Clear Ghostly Vinyl. Class is back in session! In celebration of it''s 18th birthday, The Academy Is...''s beloved third album, Fast Times at Barrington High, is finally returning to vinyl for the first time since 2009. Featuring fan favorites "About a Girl," "Summer Hair = Forever Young," and "The Test," this long-awaited reissue is the perfect graduation present for anyone.','11/6/2026',NULL,'29.52','19.48','46879724634332',1,'70062248624348',3,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','42758684');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68074312663260','15502249689308','Indie Exclusive | Baby Blue Vinyl','840526517107','Baby blue vinyl. "These songs were written just before and while in my first stint in rehab at 20 years old. They were recorded about 4 days after I got out. Broke, walking on freshly sober baby giraffe legs, I sold my car and moved back in with my mom to make that recording happened. At a time where I had no direction, the mission of capturing sonically the love that unraveled my heart at that age became my North Star. These songs have sat in the vault for 8 years, and somehow never managed to collect dust. Anytime I''d revisit them, the glow they carried upon conception still shined bright. For years I''ve known there would be a time to let them loose, and that time has finally come. It took nearly a decade of gaining life experience and perspective to truly appreciate the beauty of young love, courage in the face of unknowing at such a formative time in a lifespan, and belief in magic that can break your heart as quickly as it can mend it. I hope these songs can serve as a reminder of the lessons we all learn from early heartbreak and that belief, and even more so, a looking glass at how our hearts are capable of forever expanding to find love that''s true." - Briston Maroney','11/6/2026',NULL,'24.39','16.1','46879724372188',1,'70062254620892',2,0.589999999999999969,'POUNDS','72596569');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68074314629340','15502249427164','Indie Exclusive | Red & Blue Vinyl | 2Lp''s','823375309185','Kings of Leon return with 10th album, O My Beloved. For this release, the four-time Grammy-winning family band draws from their own history and builds on their storied legacy to deliver their most personal effort to date. Frontman Caleb Followill describes this-their first self-produced studio album-as "emotional" and a "love letter to family" that explores themes of "gratitude and appreciation." Available on 2LP and CD, featuring packaging adorned with vintage family photos. 2xLP Indie Exclusive "Thicker Than Water" Vinyl','11/6/2026',NULL,'30.30','20.0','46879723454684',1,'70062256586972',2,0.8699999999999999956,'POUNDS','53506870');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68074312859868','15502249623772','Standard','199584195018','George Michael is captured during the era of his blockbuster Faith album, showcasing the commanding vocals, sophisticated pop songwriting and star power that established his solo career on a global scale.','11/6/2026',NULL,'53.27','35.16','46879724077276',1,'70062254817500',2,1.340000000000000079,'POUNDS','96817090');
