INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259187163356','15531554373852','20th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Organic Earth Brown Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','881061379201','Celebrate the 20th anniversary of 2Pac''s Pac''s Life with this special Record Store Day Black Friday exclusive vinyl edition. Originally released on November 21, 2006, Pac''s Life became 2Pac''s tenth Top 10 album in the U.S., further cementing his enduring legacy a decade after his passing. Featuring collaborations with artists including T.I., Ashanti, Snoop Dogg, Ludacris, Keyshia Cole, and more, the album introduced a new generation to 2Pac''s unmistakable voice and influence. This 20th anniversary edition features all-new packaging and is pressed on Organic Earth Brown vinyl 2LP.','11/26/2026',NULL,'48.99','30.13',NULL,1,'70249390407900',0,1.060000000000000053,'POUNDS','93597318');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259222028508','15531565514972','RSD Exclusive | Clear Vinyl | 180g, Lithograph BF 2026','018771230618','The 1966 album represented a milestone for The Rolling Stones as it was the first to consist solely of Jagger/Richards original songs.  The US version includes "Paint It, Black," an eerily insistent No. 1 hit, graced by some of the best-ever use of sitar.  The album is now pressed on 180g clear vinyl, mastered directly from the original 1966 Decca flat stereo tape sources made for US London Records mastering, using an all-analog chain. It also comes with an exclusive lithograph print. Released exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'34.99','22.58',NULL,1,'70249425862876',0,0.6400000000000000133,'POUNDS','34283166');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259294019804','15531585798364','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','045778814671','For Record Store Day Black Friday, Thrice''s Audiotree From Nothing arrives on vinyl for the first time, capturing a band at it''s most precise, expansive, and emotionally attuned. Recorded around Horizons/West, the session distills the genre-defying force of Thrice into four riveting performances: "Vesper Light," "Albatross," "Holding On," and "Gnash." Delicate passages give way to controlled eruptions, revealing the tension-and-release architecture that has become central to the band''s singular sound. Released in 2025, Horizons/West continued the story of Horizons/East, pairing post-rock scale and cinematic textures with themes of identity, spirituality, and life in an increasingly technological world. On Audiotree From Nothing, those ideas become immediate and physical, showcasing the musicianship behind Thrice''s enduring impact. With major 2026 touring-including Europe, Sonic Temple, dates with Jimmy Eat World, and a Hollywood Bowl performance with My Chemical Romance-this limited Record Store Day Black Friday vinyl release offers fans a rare, tangible snapshot of a band still pushing rock forward. This RSD Black Friday Exclusive is pressed on Koi Pond colored vinyl - featuring splashes of Black and Orange, and includes a postcard insert from the band. Pressing limited to 1650 units.','11/26/2026',NULL,'29.99','17.5',NULL,1,'70249497854172',2,0.4000000000000000222,'POUNDS','01865495');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259684516060','15531678728412','RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single BF 2026','048612091016','First time on vinyl in 40 years; rap 7"','11/26/2026',NULL,'14.99','9.13',NULL,1,'70249954869468',0,0.1700000000000000122,'POUNDS','63710471');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259685171420','15531679351004','RSD Exclusive | Pink Vinyl BF 2026','051497534158','One-of-a-kind live performance by Jeff Tweedy with his "Twilight Override" touring band. Recorded Valentines Day 2026 in Paris at the Alhambra Théâtre Music-Hall. 21 tracks across two pink vinyl LPs in a gatefold jacket.  Includes new versions of "Enough," "Lou Reed Was My Babysitter," "Out In the Dark" and many more.','11/26/2026',NULL,'48.99','29.55',NULL,1,'70249955524828',0,1.110000000000000098,'POUNDS','68816759');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259720823004','15531708121308','25th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single, Cream Vinyl BF 2026','067003016988','Duvet" remains one of alternative music''s most quietly influential tracks: an instantly recognisable touchstone of late-''90s alternative rock that continues to resonate across generations. More than twenty-five years after it''s original release, the song has reached a new audience online, amassing over one billion streams and inspiring hundreds of thousands of TikTok creations. Released to celebrate the 25th anniversary of bôa''s album Twilight, this exclusive coloured-vinyl 7" pairs "Duvet" with "Walk With Me", the lead single from the band''s acclaimed 2024 album Whiplash. Featuring newly commissioned artwork, this release brings together two defining singles that span bôa''s career, from their breakthrough years to the present day.','11/26/2026',NULL,'19.99','11.04','47054855143644',1,'70249991176412',2,0.1900000000000000022,'POUNDS','67298068');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259726131420','15531710152924','RSD Exclusive | Bonus Tracks BF 2026','075678579264','More than 12 years ago we made this album as the Madden Brothers. Soon after releasing it we felt like we wanted to take it back and keep it just for us. All these years later we realized this could have been a Good Charlotte record all along, so we''ve put some time and love into repackaging this re-release it, and it''s really meaningful to get to share it again. We''ve learned a lot thru the years and have come to appreciate all these stories and experiences. The journey was the destination all along.','11/26/2026',NULL,'52.99','34.93','47054859436252',1,'70249996484828',0,1.080000000000000072,'POUNDS','60121240');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259726262492','15531710218460','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','075678590979','The songs on this project have been released as singles on streaming platforms previously, but have never been pressed on vinyl. This vinyl offering is the first time these songs are being released physically, repackaged into one product.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054859469020',1,'70249996615900',0,0.5500000000000000444,'POUNDS','35508280');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259726328028','15531710251228','RSD Exclusive | 180g, 2Lp''s, Gatefold LP Jacket BF 2026','081227801090','Her second solo appearance at NYC''s world famous Carnegie Hall. Previously included on Joni Mitchell Archives, Vol. 3, this is the first time on vinyl for this historic concert. 2-LP black vinyl in gatefold jacket','11/26/2026',NULL,'44.99','31.05','47054859796700',1,'70249996681436',0,1.070000000000000062,'POUNDS','38720588');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259731636444','15531710513372','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','081227801281','The legendary performance from Hootie & the Blowfish recorded for MTV Unplugged ahead of the release of their sophmore album Fairweather Johnson. Recorded at The Horseshoe at University of South Carolina in Columbia, SC on April 19, 1996.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054860648668',1,'70250001989852',0,0.5100000000000000088,'POUNDS','70408320');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259747299548','15531712381148','Remastered - RSD Exclusive | 12-inch Single, Crystal Clear Vinyl BF 2026','081227801731','First time as a 12" single for this perennial Christmas favorite by The Eagles. Remastered from original analog tapes by Chris Bellman at Bernie Grundman Mastering. 12" single in board sleeve on crystal clear vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'25.99','17.08','47054863827164',1,'70250017652956',0,0.5200000000000000177,'POUNDS','03517153');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259846160604','15531725357276','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','081227801755','Earth, Wind & Fire (1971) is a bold, genre-blending debut that showcases the band''s early mix of funk, soul, jazz, and social consciousness, foreshadowing the innovative sound that would make them one of the decade''s most influential groups.','11/26/2026',NULL,'36.99','24.84','47054893646044',1,'70250116514012',0,0.7800000000000000266,'POUNDS','50767672');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259851632860','15531725816028','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','081227801779','"Funk Or Walk" is the 1978 debut album by Brides of Funkenstein, produced by George Clinton. The album combines funk, disco, soul, and the imaginative style of the P-Funk collective, featuring strong lead vocals from Lynn Mabry and Dawn Silva. It''s biggest hit, Disco to Go, helped make the album a funk classic. Known for it''s infectious grooves, rich harmonies, and futuristic sound, the album is considered one of the standout female-led releases from the P-Funk era.','11/26/2026',NULL,'36.99','24.84','47054894727388',1,'70250121986268',0,0.7299999999999999823,'POUNDS','67354273');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68259925131484','9047818666204','RSD Exclusive | Picture Disc Vinyl | Die-Cut BF 2026','081227801854','Her quadruple platinum 1981 album on picture disc for the first time. 1-LP picture disc in die cut jacket.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054911013084',1,'70250195484892',0,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','00560653');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260070654172','15531751833820','RSD Exclusive | Yellow Vinyl BF 2026','081227801939','14 demos for their 7th studio album recorded in 1982, and their last for the time being with Marky Ramone on drums. All tracks make their vinyl debut, with 11 tracks previously unreleased. 1-LP color vinyl in single pocket sleeve.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054961672412',1,'70250341007580',0,0.5200000000000000177,'POUNDS','64446318');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260077502684','15531753013468','RSD Exclusive | Brown Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','081227801991','The long awaited second volume in the Shinola series from Ween. This is a collection of previously unreleased outtakes, fan favorites and rare B-sides spanning the length of the band''s recording career. 2LP on just brown vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'44.99','31.05','47054963704028',1,'70250347856092',0,1.040000000000000035,'POUNDS','86132665');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260086513884','15531754782940','RSD Exclusive | Pink Vinyl BF 2026','081227802356','Welcome To Wherever You Are is INXS'' 1992 platinum-certified album. Considered to be their most experimental work, the album incorporates ambitious musical techniques such as sitars and a 60-piece orchestra, and spawned their hits "Baby Don''t Cry," "Beautiful Girl," and "Not Enough Time." This album is now available on hot pink vinyl in the US and Canada for the first time in celebration of Black Friday Record Store Day.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054968029404',1,'70250356867292',0,0.7299999999999999823,'POUNDS','13670598');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260096377052','15531756257500','20th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Tan Clear Vinyl BF 2026','081227805531','20th anniversary of this 2006 album. First time on vinyl. Mostly performed entirely by Lindsey, but with a couple of guest appearances from Mick Fleetwood & John McVie. 1-LP translucent tan vinyl in single pocket jacket with insert.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054972059868',1,'70250366730460',0,0.5400000000000000355,'POUNDS','91426298');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260105289948','15531757633756','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','081227805906','Previously unreleased studio album from Grateful Dead lyricist Robert Hunter. Originally recorded in 1976 with the band Comfort and scheduled for release in 1978, the album was ultimately shelved until now. A handful of the songs from this album later appeared on the Robert Hunter compilation Promontory Rider released in 1982.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47054974484700',1,'70250375643356',0,0.02999999999999999889,'POUNDS','06937890');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260112662748','15531758878940','RSD Exclusive | Silver Vinyl | Extended Play BF 2026','093624814399','Marking it''s first-ever vinyl release, Sombr''s debut EP, originally released in September 2023, arrives exclusively for Record Store Day. This single-LP collection is pressed on silver-colored vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'32.99','23.3','47054978023644',1,'70250383016156',0,0.4799999999999999823,'POUNDS','91475629');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260118462684','15531759763676','Standard | Milky Clear Galaxy Vinyl BF 2026','093624814801','Celebrating the anniversary of Benson Boone''s debut EP "Walk Me Home," this Record Store Day exclusive is available on vinyl for the very first time. Pressed on Black + Milky Clear Galaxy colored vinyl, this single-LP release features an exclusive 12" x 24" insert.','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','23.3','47054981005532',1,'70250388816092',0,0.5699999999999999512,'POUNDS','62711828');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260145463516','15531763499228','RSD Exclusive | Red Eco Vinyl | Extended Play BF 2026','093624817628','Celebrate Christmas in 2026 with this exclusive Record Store Release from the one-and-only Cher. This special collection is pressed on color vinyl and features five tracks appearing on vinyl for the first time ever. "Christmas Is Here," three distinct versions of the hit "DJ Play A Christmas Song," and the "Angels In The Snow (Discotastique! Mix).','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','23.3','47054993948892',1,'70250415816924',0,0.5300000000000000266,'POUNDS','27885276');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260149100764','15531764285660','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','093624829379','Available for the first time ever on a physical format, this exclusive Record Store Day release brings together The Goo Goo Dolls'' celebrated cover versions of classic tracks by iconic artists, including Prince, Tom Petty, Fleetwood Mac, and INXS. Pressed on Pawn Shop Patina colored vinyl and packaged in a standard jacket featuring all-new artwork, this single-LP collection is an essential addition for fans and collectors alike.','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','23.3','47054996111580',1,'70250419454172',0,0.5400000000000000355,'POUNDS','21772866');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260158046428','15531765661916','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','198029996210','Experience one of the most celebrated singer-songwriters live in concert. Live at the BBC, 1974 features Bill Withers at his finest in an intimate, stripped back performance recorded for the BBC''s "In Concert" series. Featuring selections from his first two landmark albums, Just As I Am and Still Bill, this vinyl edition marks the recording''s first physical release. Hear new renditions of the timeless classics "Ain''t No Sunshine" and "Lean On Me" in a raw and captivating live setting.','11/26/2026',NULL,'27.99','17.0','47054999290076',1,'70250428399836',0,0.5300000000000000266,'POUNDS','01348619');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260325228764','15531776442588','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','198029996326','Experience one of the most celebrated singer-songwriters live in concert. Live at the BBC, 1974 features Bill Withers at his finest in an intimate, stripped back performance recorded for the BBC''s "In Concert" series. Featuring selections from his first two landmark albums, Just As I Am and Still Bill, this vinyl edition marks the recording''s first physical release. Hear new renditions of the timeless classics "Ain''t No Sunshine" and "Lean On Me" in a raw and captivating live setting.','11/26/2026',NULL,'16.99','10.37','47055033565404',1,'70250595582172',0,0.1900000000000000022,'POUNDS','66897991');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260333060316','15531777294556','RSD Exclusive | Tan Brown Vinyl BF 2026','199316745481','Before dominating the Grammys and defining the sound of modern R&B, Victoria Monét delivered two of her most intimate, foundational projects: Life After Love, Pt. 1 and Life After Love, Pt. 2. Released individually in 2018, these twin EPs captured a pivotal chapter in Monét''s evolution as a solo artist, establishing the lush vocal arrangements, cinematic production, and razor-sharp songwriting that would later captivate the world. Now, for the first time ever, both transformative projects are combined into a single physical release, debuting exclusively on vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday 2026. The dual project charts a complete emotional arc, chronicling the delicate journey from heartbreak to self-actualization. Part 1 delves into the raw vulnerability and quiet introspection of a breakup''s immediate fallout, anchored by sultry, unfiltered anthems like "Freak." Part 2 turns the page toward rediscovery, blooming into an exploration of newfound confidence and sensuality through standout cuts like "New Love" and the shimmering, bass-heavy fan favorite "Ass Like That." Seamlessly bridging pain and empowerment across it''s tracklist, the combined collection showcases Monét''s innate ability to translate personal grief into universal, groove-heavy solace. By pressing these two landmark EPs together on wax, this release offers long-time fans and vinyl collectors the ultimate way to experience Monét''s early masterwork as a unified narrative. It stands as a long-overdue physical grail, celebrating the resilient spirit of an artist taking back her narrative-and serving as a reminder that the best music often blooms from the ashes of heartache. 1xLP, pressed on Brown & Tan Galaxy vinyl and limited to 2000 units worldwide.','11/26/2026',NULL,'34.99','20.79','47055036514524',1,'70250603413724',0,0.5300000000000000266,'POUNDS','23430294');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260345577692','15531779129564','RSD Exclusive | 4Lp''s, Boxed Set BF 2026','199584555515','Recorded live on New Year''s Eve during Bruce Springsteen & the E Street Band''s legendary stand at Philadelphia''s Tower Theater in 1975, this 4LP set captures the electric 18-song set in it''s entirety. Including early live favorites, "Tenth Avenue Freeze-Out" and "Jungleland" plus powerhouse hits "Born To Run," ''Rosalita (Come Out Tonight)" and more.','11/26/2026',NULL,'79.99','48.01','47055042183388',1,'70250615931100',0,2.540000000000000035,'POUNDS','59455312');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260349149404','15531780014300','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','199584555621','Recorded live on New Year''s Eve during Bruce Springsteen & the E Street Band''s legendary stand at Philadelphia''s Tower Theater in 1975, this 2CD set captures the electric 18-song set in it''s entirety. Including early live favorites, "Tenth Avenue Freeze-Out" and "Jungleland" plus powerhouse hits "Born To Run," "Rosalita (Come Out Tonight)" and more.','11/26/2026',NULL,'24.99','15.93','47055045427420',1,'70250619502812',0,0.1499999999999999945,'POUNDS','45048932');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260351934684','15531780931804','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','199584598314','Billy Joel Tonight captures Billy''s December 5, 1976 performance at Connecticut College, recorded for his first-ever television special. For nearly fifty years, most of the concert''s multitrack recordings remained unreleased. Now, for the first time, the show is presented in stereo, newly mixed from the original tapes. This release features the bulk of the concert from those multitrack recordings, along with performances of "I''ve Loved These Days" and "Souvenir" recorded during a December 6 production session. Also included are "Miami 2017 (Seen The Lights Go Out On Broadway)" and "Captain Jack, " from the original 1977 TV special master. Also included with this Black Friday release is an exclusive 12"x12" print. Together, all these pieces offer a newly restored document of the important era surrounding Turnstiles.','11/26/2026',NULL,'44.99','27.33','47055049130204',1,'70250622288092',0,0.8800000000000000044,'POUNDS','67124083');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260353966300','15531781619932','RSD Exclusive | Blue Vinyl BF 2026','199584630311','By the beginning of 2007, Prince had spent a few years conquering pop culture all over again. After his volcanic Rock & Roll Hall of Fame induction late in 2004, his huge Musicology album and it''s massive, game-changing tour, Prince then topped the charts with his 2006 album 3121 and was getting ready to mount his legendary Super Bowl performance. His 6-month Per4ming Live @ 3121 Las Vegas residency in 2006-2007 was a triumph and this release captures the magic of those intimate shows. Captured January 20, 2007, and featuring over 2 hours of sweaty brilliance across 3 LPs pressed on crystal blue curaçao vinyl housed in a gorgeous gatefold, the setlist deftly combines hits from throughout Prince''s career with highlight tracks from 3121 and Musicology and amazing covers (from "Pass The Peas" to Gnarls Barkley''s "Crazy, " to "Play That Funky Music").','11/26/2026',NULL,'55.99','36.94','47055052603612',1,'70250624319708',0,1.629999999999999894,'POUNDS','47004205');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260361830620','15531782471900','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','199584630427','By the beginning of 2007, Prince had spent a few years conquering pop culture all over again. After his volcanic Rock & Roll Hall of Fame induction late in 2004, his huge Musicology album and it''s massive, game-changing tour, Prince then topped the charts with his 2006 album 3121 and was getting ready to mount his legendary Super Bowl performance. His 6-month Per4ming Live @ 3121 Las Vegas residency in 2006-2007 was a triumph and this release captures the magic of those intimate shows. Captured January 20, 2007, and featuring over 2 hours of sweaty brilliance, this setlist deftly combines hits from throughout Prince''s career with highlight tracks from 3121 and Musicology and amazing covers (from "Pass The Peas" to Gnarls Barkley''s "Crazy, " to "Play That Funky Music").','11/26/2026',NULL,'24.99','15.93','47055056011484',1,'70250632184028',0,0.1100000000000000005,'POUNDS','08055381');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260370415836','15531783356636','RSD Exclusive | 2Lp''s BF 2026','199584650111','Miles Davis - Copenhagen Live 1969 documents an important chapter in Miles Davis'' transition into his electric period. This live recording captured in November of that year features Miles'' "lost quintet" of Wayne Shorter, Chick Corea, Dave Holland and Jack DeJohnette performing a handful of songs from the recently recorded but not yet released Bitches Brew ("Miles Runs the Voodoo Down," "Sanctuary", title track), a track from the recently released In A Silent Way plus reimagined songs from his earlier periods. Previously available on video or through a highly limited vinyl release, this recording is now available as a 2LP set on black vinyl. The package features mind-bending gatefold artwork by Mati Klarwein, whose work adorns Miles classics like Bitches Brew and Live-Evil.','11/26/2026',NULL,'36.99','22.17','47055060861148',1,'70250640769244',0,1.070000000000000062,'POUNDS','10274856');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260380967132','15531784143068','Deluxe Edition - RSD Exclusive | Red Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','199957574792','MUSIC - SORRY 4 DA WAIT available on vinyl for the first time. The deluxe edition of Playboi Carti''s 2025 album includes "Different Day," "2024," "BACKR00MS," and "FOMDJ." Pressed on red vinyl 2LP for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'56.99','36.38','47055066235100',1,'70250651320540',0,0.8900000000000000133,'POUNDS','81123435');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260390437084','15531784995036','Afterlife Tour Edition | Neon Pink Vinyl BF 2026','199957866538','To celebrate the biggest and most successful tour run of their career, Empire of the Sun present a new limited-edition pressing of Ask That God on striking neon pink vinyl, complete with an exclusive matching OBI strip. The release arrives as Empire of the Sun''s spectacular Ask That God: Afterlife Tour continues it''s journey across Europe, Latin America and the U.S., introducing a new generation of fans to the band''s singular world for the very first time. The tour has marked a new career high for the Australian duo, including an extraordinary three consecutive sold-out nights at London''s Alexandra Palace, alongside major festival appearances including Outside Lands and Lollapalooza. A vivid physical memento of one of the defining chapters in Empire of the Sun''s career, this collectible edition pairs the technicolor universe of Ask That God with the spectacle and imagery of their record-breaking live return. Released for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'48.99','34.11','47055069610204',1,'70250660790492',0,0.7700000000000000177,'POUNDS','28934843');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260397220060','15531785683164','RSD Exclusive | Aqua Blue Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','4099964275551','Motörhead presents the next volume in their popular archival series, The Lost Tapes. Featuring a previously unreleased live double album recorded on November 5, 1984 at Winter Gardens in Margate, UK. Capturing the band''s legendary live power at it''s peak, the 2LP set is available on aqua blue colored vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'49.99','31.84','47055072264412',1,'70250667573468',0,1.010000000000000008,'POUNDS','17918223');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260429299932','15531786207452','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Picture Disc Vinyl BF 2026','4099964275889','The most acclaimed supergroup in history, The Traveling Wilburys (George Harrison, Bob Dylan, Tom Petty and Jeff Lynne) release a limited-edition, picture disc vinyl of their second album (humorously titled Vol. 3,) featuring "She''s My Baby," "Inside Out," and "Wilbury Twist." Released exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'39.99','26.73','47055074033884',1,'70250699653340',0,0.6099999999999999867,'POUNDS','12530457');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260448043228','15531787190492','45th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Black & White Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','4099964280777','Celebrating the 45th anniversary of the world''s most notorious band with the 35th anniversary reissue of this long out-of-print "best of" collection. This 2LP gatefold edition is pressed on black/white marbled vinyl and includes the rare tracks, "Angela," "Anarchy in the U.K.," "Rock ''N'' Roll Junkie," and "Teaser." Released exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'49.99','31.84','47055076098268',1,'70250718396636',0,1.209999999999999965,'POUNDS','33547202');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260452696284','15531787780316','RSD Exclusive | Translucent Red Vinyl | Import (Japan) BF 2026','4988002955749','This carefully curated compilation features some of the finest recordings that Masayoshi Takanaka (including tracks recorded under the name Sadistics) made during his years with Victor. Showcasing his signature guitar sound and the golden era of Japanese fusion, this essential collection is a must-have for longtime fans and newcomers alike.','11/26/2026',NULL,'50.99','34.99','47055077900508',1,'70250723049692',5,0.660000000000000031,'POUNDS','85699662');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260455973084','15531788239068','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Clear Vinyl | 180g, Poster BF 2026','4988031871072','Building on the tropical sound introduced on his debut album, SEYCHELLES, TAKANAKA further expands Takanaka''s unique musical vision by seamlessly blending Latin, jazz fusion, funk, and pop. Widely regarded as a landmark release, the album helped establish the signature sound that would define his illustrious career. The album features "READY TO FLY," one of Takanaka''s most iconic compositions and a perennial highlight of his live performances. Originally performed during his time with Sadistics, the track was re-recorded here as a solo version. It''s uplifting melody, infectious groove, and exhilarating guitar work continue to captivate audiences, making it one of the defining songs in Masayoshi Takanaka''s remarkable catalog. This special RSD Black Friday 2026 edition is the perfect opportunity for longtime fans and new listeners alike to experience one of the essential classics of Japanese jazz fusion. RSD Black Friday 2026 Exclusive Special Poster will be included!','11/26/2026',NULL,'55.99','38.39','47055084323036',1,'70250726359260',1,0.8900000000000000133,'POUNDS','74278352');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260461838556','15531789615324','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Yellow Vinyl | 180g BF 2026','4988031871089','Originally released on March 1, 1980, Masayoshi Takanaka''s SUPER TAKANAKA LIVE!, his first live album, returns for Record Store Day Black Friday 2026 with an exclusive free poster. Recorded during his nationwide tour in December 1979, the album captures the excitement and electrifying energy of Takanaka''s live performances just a few years after his solo debut. Featuring many of his signature compositions, the performances deliver an intensity and spontaneity that take the original studio recordings to new heights. A defining feature of the album is it''s dynamic live arrangements and the exceptional musicianship of Takanaka and his band. Classics including "BLUE LAGOON, " "EXPLOSION, " "READY TO FLY, " and "KUROFUNE (Black Ship)" are brought to life through thrilling improvisation, powerful ensemble playing, and an unmistakable concert atmosphere that showcases Takanaka''s extraordinary talent as a guitarist. Among the album''s highlights, the live version of "READY TO FLY" stands as one of the most celebrated performances of Takanaka''s career. It''s soaring guitar solos, infectious energy, and remarkable band interplay have made it a fan favorite and one of the defining live recordings in Japanese jazz fusion. Serving as the foundation for later acclaimed live releases such as OCEAN BREEZE and THE RAINBOW GOBLINS STORY LIVE AT BUDOKAN, SUPER TAKANAKA LIVE! Remains an essential live album that perfectly captures the excitement, virtuosity, and joyful spirit of Masayoshi Takanaka''s performances. This special RSD Black Friday 2026 edition offers both longtime fans and new listeners the opportunity to experience one of the greatest live albums in the history of Japanese jazz fusion. RSD Black Friday 2026 Exclusive Special Poster will be included!','11/26/2026',NULL,'55.99','38.39','47055088353500',1,'70250732191964',1,0.8699999999999999956,'POUNDS','44011625');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260485333212','15531794727132','RSD Exclusive | Translucent Yellow Vinyl | Import (Japan) BF 2026','4988031881309','Hiromasa Suzuki''s Colgen World returns on vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday 2026! Originally released in 1981, Colgen World by renowned Japanese jazz pianist, composer, and arranger Hiromasa Suzuki is set to return on vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday 2026. Widely regarded as one of the standout albums from Japan''s golden era of jazz fusion, Colgen World showcases Suzuki''s masterful arrangements, sophisticated melodies, and seamless blend of jazz, fusion, and crossover sounds. Rich in musical depth and exceptional performances, the album has remained a favorite among collectors and fans of Japanese jazz and fusion around the world. After 45 years, this celebrated masterpiece is finally available on vinyl once again-an essential addition for longtime fans and anyone discovering the timeless appeal of Japanese jazz fusion.','11/26/2026',NULL,'50.99','35.99','47055104803036',1,'70250755686620',1,0.6500000000000000222,'POUNDS','20275859');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260490346716','15531795546332','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Saffron Yellow Vinyl | Import (UK) BF 2026','5014797913851','Singer, songwriter, humanitarian, activist, poet, philosopher, artist... as the music legend Labi Siffre prepares to release his first album of new music in 28 years, Demon are making his stellar catalogue available again as a series of vinyl reissues and 3CD collections. Exclusive to Black Friday 2026, we''re delighted to announce a fresh reissue of one of the jewels in Labi''s crown... The influential 1975 masterpiece ''Remember My Song''. Recorded during an especially prolific period in Labi''s career (he released two studio albums in 1975 alone), ''Remember My Song'' combined emotional honesty, reflective introspection and tight funk-soul grooves in a heady mix... at the time it was seen as something of a gritty departure from the singer-songwriter''s trademark sweeter sound. Since it''s release, ''Remember My Song'' has come to be seen as a bona-fide mid-''70s classic, kicking off in fine style with the iconic ''I Got The...'', known to millions as the key sample loop behind 1999''s Eminem / Dr Dre single, ''My Name Is''. Presented with original album artwork and a new inner bag containing for the first time the album''s lyrics supplied by Labi himself. Pressed on saffron yellow vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'39.99','24.99','47055107326172',1,'70250760700124',0,0.5200000000000000177,'POUNDS','31026939');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260563517660','15531810652380','30th Anniversary - Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Gold, Green & Red Vinyl | 3Lp''s, Import (UK)  BF 2026','5014797914094','Demon Records are proud to be releasing a live version of ''Teenager Of The Year'' the incredible second album released by Frank Black. The album originally released in 1994 is often referred to as ''The best album Pixies never made'' and this incredible live recording captures Frank Black and band on fire during their 2025 30th anniversary tour celebrating the album which took place across the USA and Europe, culminating in an incredible final show at the London Palladium which was recorded for this release. ''Teenager Of The Year - Live'' features the album in full and in sequence and is topped and tailed by five live cuts from the self-titled debut solo album ''Frank Black''. The show includes blistering live versions of many of the most loved Frank Black solo tracks including ''Headache'', ''Calistan'', ''Speedy Marie'' as well as ''Los Angeles'' and ''I Heard Ramona Sing''. This 3LP set is a necessary memento for both anyone lucky enough to attend one of the shows, or anyone not so lucky and is a must have release for all Frank Black and Pixies fans and is pressed on Gold, Green and Red vinyl LPs.','11/26/2026',NULL,'79.99','51.99','47055164145884',1,'70250833871068',0,1.409999999999999921,'POUNDS','24142371');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260565614812','15531811995868','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Hot Pink Vinyl | Import (UK) BF 2026','5014797914322','Demon Records are delighted to partner with electronic music pioneers Fischerspooner on a reappraisal of their hugely influential and endlessly inventive catalogue. The first release to be announced is this tasty hot pink vinyl reissue of the album that started it all - 2000''s peerless ''#1''. THE definitive electroclash studio album from THE definitive electroclash band... can it really be 25 years since Fischerspooner spearheaded a synth revolution for a new generation? #1 includes one of the defining EDM dance anthems of all time in the shape of Emerge - which has 28M streams to date on Spotify alone - but there''s so much more besides. Wire cover versions, ambient diversions, wit, wisdom, sensuality and the millennial zeitgeist running deep in every groove. Unavailable on vinyl since 2003, recent second-hand copies of the original LP release have changed hands for seriously high prices.','11/26/2026',NULL,'39.99','24.99','47055168372956',1,'70250835968220',0,0.7199999999999999734,'POUNDS','19910540');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260567089372','15531813306588','RSD Exclusive | Red & Yellow Vinyl BF 2026','5055006516050','Celebrating 30 years of Swansong! Fifth studio album from metal pioneers Carcass, pressed on limited edition merge vinyl with alternate artwork sleeve. Exclusive to RSD BLACK FRIDAY Retailers.','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','20.0','47055171748060',1,'70250837442780',1,0.5400000000000000355,'POUNDS','70758422');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260574888156','15531816386780','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | 180g BF 2026','603497802210','Dogfish Head Brewery & Grateful Dead invite you for another round of good times with On A Back Porch, Vol. 4. Support indie record stores while enjoying easy-listening live Dead and easy-drinking beer. Limited Edition, 180-gram LP. Produced for release by David Lemieux.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','21.74','47055181676764',1,'70250845241564',0,0.660000000000000031,'POUNDS','10978354');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260576559324','15531817369820','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','603497802418','"Widely considered one of the greatest examples of Primal Grateful Dead, 2/14/68 features some of the finest music the Dead ever performed. Recorded as part of the hybrid live/studio album Anthem of the Sun, this show features the entirety of what was included on Anthem of the Sun, along with spectacular renditions of nascent future Grateful Dead classics including "Dark Star," "China Cat Sunflower," and "The Eleven." Rounding out the setlist are "old school" Dead songs going way back to 1965-1966, including "Morning Dew," "Good Morning Little Schoolgirl," and "Midnight Hour." - David Lemieux','11/26/2026',NULL,'114.99','77.61','47055184396508',1,'70250846912732',0,2.740000000000000213,'POUNDS','67083710');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260577673436','15531818549468','RSD Exclusive | RED & YELLOW SPLATTER Vinyl | 3Lp''s BF 2026','607396707911','Few live albums capture the raw energy of a band in their element quite like Alive & Wired - the Old 97''s legendary document of two scorching summer nights at Gruene Hall outside of Austin, Texas in 2005. Spanning 30 tracks across their six-album catalog, it''s a masterclass in high-octane cowpunk and proof that few bands have ever been as explosive on stage as Rhett Miller and company. Now, for the first time ever, Alive & Wired comes to vinyl as a stunning 3-LP set pressed on limited red and yellow splatter vinyl, exclusively for Record Store Day. This is a 2026 Black Friday Record Store Day release.','11/26/2026',NULL,'66.99','41.06','47055187640540',1,'70250848026844',3,1.229999999999999983,'POUNDS','90665214');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260578394332','15531819139292','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','628425432246','10-inch, 45 RPM zoetrope featuring music from Charlie Brown''s All Stars! On Side A and related baseball themes from other Vince Guaraldi soundtracks on Side B. Includes two unreleased tracks that will premiere on a subsequent release in 2027.','11/26/2026',NULL,'29.99','19.74','47055189770460',1,'70250848747740',0,0.3699999999999999956,'POUNDS','27260930');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260579311836','15531819892956','Deluxe Edition - RSD Exclusive BF 2026','634457274303','King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard returns to the officially sanctioned Bootlegger Series through Having Fun Records with what the label believes to be the first-ever 3D zoetrope record, complete with 3D glasses. Designed by zoetrope wizard (see what we did there), Drew Tetz, the album features songs from the band''s 2025 Bulgaria performances.','11/26/2026',NULL,'43.99','28.6','47055197012188',1,'70250849698012',5,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','29530543');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260580655324','15531820941532','RSD Exclusive | Red & Green Vinyl BF 2026','711574987214','Recorded on September 12, 1971, shortly after the release of Maggot Brain, Live At Meadowbrook 1971 is the only official live recording from Funkadelic''s classic early era. Drawn from the original soundboard master tapes, it captures George Clinton, Eddie Hazel, Bernie Worrell, Billy "Bass" Nelson, and features the first recorded appearances of guitarist Harold Beane and drummer Tyrone Lampkin with Funkadelic, documenting the band at a pivotal moment in it''s evolution toward the P-Funk powerhouse it would soon become.','11/26/2026',NULL,'56.99','37.04','47055199731932',1,'70250851008732',3,1.09000000000000008,'POUNDS','72224015');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260581933276','15531821564124','RSD Exclusive | Yellow & Cream Vinyl BF 2026','738582016996','TMBG performed live at the KEXP Seattle studios on June 16, 2025. Featuring their 8-piece live band including a 3-piece horn section, this recording is an outstanding encapsulation of a TMBG live show. Mixed and mastered by longtime TMBG engineer Scott Bozack and full of hit songs like Ana Ng, Doctor Worm, and Particle Man, this is a collector''s dream. (Mustard Bone)','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','22.84','47055202615516',1,'70250852286684',0,0.04000000000000000083,'POUNDS','03883510');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260593369308','15531828674780','30th Anniversary - Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | Import (UK) BF 2026','740155747336','Demon Records are proud to be releasing a live version of ''Teenager Of The Year'' the incredible second album released by Frank Black. The album originally released in 1994 is often referred to as ''The best album Pixies never made'' and this incredible live recording captures Frank Black and band on fire during their 2025 30th anniversary tour celebrating the album which took place across the USA and Europe, culminating in an incredible final show at the London Palladium which was recorded for this release. ''Teenager Of The Year - Live'' features the album in full and in sequence and is topped and tailed by five live cuts from the self-titled debut solo album ''Frank Black''. The show includes blistering live versions of many of the most loved Frank Black solo tracks including ''Headache'', ''Calistan'', ''Speedy Marie'' as well as ''Los Angeles'' and ''I Heard Ramona Sing''. This 2CD set packaged in a 6 panel digisleeve with booklet is a necessary memento for both anyone lucky enough to attend one of the shows, or anyone not so lucky and is a must have release for all Frank Black and Pixies fans.','11/26/2026',NULL,'23.99','13.99','47055225684188',1,'70250863722716',0,0.1499999999999999945,'POUNDS','44740548');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260601069788','15531833295068','40th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Opaque Turquoise Vinyl BF 2026','760137217404','40th anniversary deluxe edition of the 1986 album, remastered at half speed by Phil Nicolo from the original tapes. Features opaque turquoise vinyl, reimagined cover art, a deluxe gatefold with archival photographs and sketches, a lyric sheet/poster insert, and a QR code for remastered WAV and MP3 downloads. 10% of label profits are donated to Rock to the Future.','11/26/2026',NULL,'40.99','28.19','47055239807196',1,'70250871455964',0,1.050000000000000044,'POUNDS','56061822');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260603265244','15531834736860','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','784085107617','A compilation of vocal tracks from the band''s previously released albums spanning their 25 year career. The album features collaborations with Bootsy Collins, Jungle Boogie Big Tony, Alecia Chakour, Marcus King, and Nigel Hall.','11/26/2026',NULL,'49.99','31.54','47055243739356',1,'70250873651420',0,1.020000000000000017,'POUNDS','49913831');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260620632284','15531844665564','15 Year Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Seafoam Green Vinyl BF 2026','784085107624','15 year anniversary of the third studio album by Cisco Adler with the Malibu rapper Shwayze. This will be the first time the album as been relesaed on vinyl. The vinyl itself will be a unique seafoam green variant. The album features one of Cisco''s biggest streaming songs "Drunk Off Your Love. "','11/26/2026',NULL,'32.99','20.04','47055271297244',1,'70250891018460',0,0.6099999999999999867,'POUNDS','06143265');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260622270684','15531845910748','RSD Exclusive | Picture Disc Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','792755883167','Christmas Comes Alive! Is a live album/holiday record that''s a rollicking hybrid of jump blues and rockabilly. Brian Setzer leads his swinging orchestra through seasonal tunes making "Sleigh Ride" and "Winter Wonderland" jump, jive and wail. He digs out R&B and rock & roll standards like "Zat You Santa Claus?" and "Run Rudolph Run" and finds a way to make a medley of "Stray Cat Strut" and "You''re A Mean One, Mr, Grinch." Pressed on double picture disc vinyl exclusively for RSD Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'42.99','23.5','47055275065564',1,'70250892656860',2,1.030000000000000026,'POUNDS','14881376');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260709564636','9218961998044','RSD Exclusive | Metallic Blue Vinyl | Digital Download Card BF 2026','823375063438','Poppy''s highly anticipated new album "Empty Hands" on RSD Black Friday 2026 Exclusive Metallic Blue Vinyl. Housed in a numbered gatefold jacket with alternate artwork and includes a double-sided lyric insert and download card.','11/26/2026',NULL,'32.99','22.0','47055342239964',1,'70250979950812',4,0.7199999999999999734,'POUNDS','25792530');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260879466716','8926974410972','RSD Exclusive | Bonus Track BF 2026','823375153900','I Love Rock ''N Roll: The Shadow Album had been lost for decades. Recently unearthed, this collection features alternate, unreleased versions of the seminal groundbreaking album, recorded in 1980. Far from rough demos, The Shadow Album captures the first version of I Love Rock ''N Roll, featuring the original recordings of "Little Drummer Boy" and "Crimson and Clover." More than 45 years later, these recordings offer a rare look at Joan Jett and the Blackhearts just before I Love Rock ''N Roll changed everything. I Love Rock ''N Roll is Joan Jett and the Blackhearts'' most celebrated album and continues to be streamed by millions across all generations, worldwide.','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','20.0','47055447359708',1,'70251149852892',0,0.6099999999999999867,'POUNDS','84694788');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260884381916','15531887132892','RSD Exclusive | Purple Vinyl | Poster BF 2026','823375193852','Czarface is back, hot off the heels of their collaboration with the enigmatic Frankie Pulitzer. Operating somewhere between bona fide hip-hop and the pages of a Silver Age comic book, they return with a vengeance. "Special Presentation" keeps that spirit intact, pairing sharp rhymes and head-nod production with their trademark humor and larger-than-life braggadocio. Strange, clever, and built for repeated spins, it''s another unique chapter in the Czarface universe. Available exclusively for Record Store Day. RSD Black Friday 2026 Exclusive Translucent Grape Vinyl in Standard Jacket with Fold-Out Poster and Sticker Sheet','11/26/2026',NULL,'35.99','20.0','47055451324636',1,'70251154768092',3,0.6800000000000000488,'POUNDS','96556618');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260892279004','9230298185948','Deluxe Edition - RSD Exclusive | Black Pearl Vinyl | 2Lp''s BF 2026','823375296768','Piss In The Wind is Joji''s long-awaited 4th album, containing singles "PIXELATED KISSES", "Past Won''t Leave My Bed", and "LOVE YOU LESS". Upon release, the album debuted at #5 Billboard 200, #1 Indie Store Albums Sales, #1 Current Alternative, and #1 Current Pop Albums in the US. This 2X LP Deluxe Edition includes 9 new songs and 10 instrumentals exclusive to RSD. Special packaging includes Metallic Foil Two-Pocket Gatefold Jacket, 24-page collector''s booklet, and Black Pearl vinyl colorway.','11/26/2026',NULL,'58.99','35.0','47055456239836',1,'70251162665180',7,1.129999999999999893,'POUNDS','21124356');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260899356892','15531890082012','RSD Exclusive | Red Vinyl BF 2026','840381616762','As a companion piece to their recently released album, Union Made, OCMS continues the celebration of the USA''s 250th Birthday by releasing an RSD Black Friday piece called Union Made: Overtime. With this piece, the band included unreleased tracks from the Union Made session along with some special live covers from some of America''s greatest songwriters.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','18.8','47055460335836',1,'70251169743068',3,0.6199999999999999956,'POUNDS','38535967');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260907745500','15531891491036','RSD Exclusive | 180g, 2Lp''s BF 2026','8435395505441','Two never-before-released complete sets by the unforgettable Art Blakey''s Jazz Messengers are presented here. The first, recorded in 1963 at the iconic Olympia Theatre in Paris, features a stellar lineup: Freddie Hubbard on trumpet, Curtis Fuller on trombone, Wayne Shorter on tenor saxophone, Cedar Walton on piano, Reggie Workman on bass, and the leader himself on drums. Highlights include an impressive arrangement of Henry Mancini''s "Moon River" and an extraordinary take on Duke Ellington''s "Caravan." The second set, taped in 1968 at the equally renowned Salle Pleyel, also in Paris, finds Blakey joined by Bill Hardman on trumpet, Julian Priester on trombone, Billy Harper on tenor saxophone, Ronnie Mathews on piano, and Lawrence Evans on bass. Among the many highlights are an extended performance of the rarely heard "Blues for Eros" and a dazzling version of Bobby Timmons'' "Moanin''." Transferred from the original tape reels preserved at INA and restored and mastered by Matthew Lutthans at The Mastering Lab, this limited-edition 180-gram 2-LP set includes an extensive insert featuring rare photographs and specially prepared liner notes.','11/26/2026',NULL,'52.99','30.98','47055464038620',1,'70251178131676',2,1.300000000000000044,'POUNDS','60823132');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260917412060','15531893457116','RSD Exclusive | 180g, 2Lp''s BF 2026','8435395505465','This release marks the first appearance of these historic trio performances by Bill Evans, recorded in Lugano, Switzerland, in 1967 and in Pescara, Italy, in 1969. Evans is joined by bassist Eddie Gomez on both recordings, with Arnie Wise and Marty Morell alternating on drums. The Lugano set offers a particularly rare opportunity to hear Wise''s interplay with Evans, as this trio configuration was seldom recorded. Transferred from the original tape reels and restored and mastered by Matthew Lutthans at The Mastering Lab, this limited-edition 180-gram 2-LP set includes an extensive insert featuring rare photographs and liner notes by acclaimed jazz critic and author Marc Myers, along with statements by Marty Morell, Sylvie Courvoisier, and others.','11/26/2026',NULL,'54.99','30.98','47055470166236',1,'70251187798236',0,1.320000000000000062,'POUNDS','87975476');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260925178076','15531895357660','RSD Exclusive | 180g, 2Lp''s BF 2026','8435395505526','Bobby Womack was one of the most distinctive voices in soul music-singer, songwriter, and guitarist whose work bridged gospel, R&B, and funk. From his early days with The Valentinos to his classic solo recordings for United Artists Records, Womack shaped the sound of modern soul with raw emotion and fearless creativity. His songs have influenced generations of artists across soul, rock, and hip-hop. Recorded in Paris on March 15, 1976, Live at the Élysée Montmartre captures Womack at the height of his powers, delivering the intensity and charisma that made him a legendary stage performer. A powerful, previously unheard document of one of soul music''s most enduring and influential artists. Transferred from the original tape reels preserved at INA, this limited-edition 180-gram 2-LP set includes an extensive insert featuring rare photographs and specially prepared liner notes.','11/26/2026',NULL,'54.99','30.98','47055476097244',1,'70251195597020',0,1.209999999999999965,'POUNDS','52391722');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260932714716','15531897127132','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | LIGHT BLUE Vinyl BF 2026','848064021766','It was a top 20 album from 2018 and it''s single "Mine" rocketed around the internet, going to #11 on the charts and acting as a Snapchat filter among many other viral uses. But Bazzi''s Cosmic album has never been released to music retail on vinyl and never been on colored vinyl at all. We''ve had it remastered for the medium, and pressed up 2000 in light blue wax, complete with a color printed inner sleeve. A hip hop-tinged indie pop treasure! This is a 2026 Black Friday Record Store Day release.','11/26/2026',NULL,'41.99','27.12','47055481372892',1,'70251203100892',2,0.5500000000000000444,'POUNDS','56189019');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260950868188','15531907875036','30th Anniversary Deluxe Edition - RSD Exclusive | Cobalt Blue Vinyl | Bonus Tracks BF 2026','848064021896','Barenaked Ladies'' 1996 album Born on a Pirate Ship went gold in the U. S. and Canada when it was originally released, and now it arrives on vinyl for it''s 30th anniversary loaded with even more treasure! "The Old Apartment" notched their first U. S. hit, and the record also included such gems as "I Know" and "Straw Hat and Old Dirty Hank" (fans of the TV show Friends will also recognize "Shoe Box" from it''s inclusion on the soundtrack). For it''s first-ever LP release, we''ve remastered Born on a Pirate Ship for vinyl and added a couple of bonus tracks, "Trust Me" (from the Shoe Box EP) and "Back" (a B-Side on the American Brian Wilson CD single). That''s just the first three sides... we''ve saved the last side for a skull and crossbones etching! And the cover has been reworked especially for this release. Cobalt blue double-LP pressing limited to 3000 copies. This is a 2026 Black Friday Record Store Day release.','11/26/2026',NULL,'64.99','44.0','47055513157852',1,'70251221254364',0,1.050000000000000044,'POUNDS','90440972');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260959617244','15531913838812','30th Anniversary - Remastered - RSD Exclusive | Orange Vinyl BF 2026','848064021902','This is how good Rock Spectacle is as a live album: even though "Brian Wilson" had been released as a studio track back in 1992, it took the rollicking performance on this 1996 live release to make the song a hit. But, in retrospect, it''s not that surprising; Barenaked Ladies were and are great on stage (you can hear the connection they have with their audience throughout this recording), so the success of Rock Spectacle totally makes sense. Indeed, this album really represented their breakthrough in the U.S., and teed up their ascent to superstardom with it''s Stunt follow-up. For it''s vinyl debut on it''s 30th anniversary, we''ve remastered the album for vinyl and pressed 3500 copies in orange vinyl, complete with a printed inner sleeve. One of the great live acts of their generation, caught at their best!This is a 2026 Black Friday Record Store Day release.','11/26/2026',NULL,'41.99','27.12','47055526723804',1,'70251230003420',0,0.5400000000000000355,'POUNDS','98312334');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260961648860','15531915215068','RSD Exclusive | 4Lp''s, Bonus Tracks BF 2026','880882707712','One of the most beloved installments in the GarciaLive series is pressed to vinyl for the first time. GarciaLive Volume Eight: November 23rd, 1991 Bradley Center presents the Jerry Garcia Band''s electrifying two-set performance captured on a snowy evening in Milwaukee during the band''s legendary Fall tour. The 4xLP set is housed in a clamshell box and includes two previously unreleased bonus tracks, "Stop That Train" and "Forever Young", from Nov. 16th, 1991 at Albany''s Knickerbocker Arena.','11/26/2026',NULL,'87.99','53.39','47055530492124',1,'70251232035036',0,2.709999999999999965,'POUNDS','49294522');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260963680476','15531916427484','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','880882711917','Brigitte Calls Me Baby cap their massive year of sold out shows, festival dates and multiple radio hits ("Slumber Party", "I Can Take The Sun Out of the Sky") with "Live in Chicago", an exclusive vinyl release for Record Store Day recorded at Thalia Hall in Chicago this past April. The 11-track album features songs from both "Irreversible" and "The Future Is The Way Out." Press on "black ice" vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'27.99','15.49','47055534031068',1,'70251234066652',5,0.5600000000000000533,'POUNDS','99647956');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260967612636','15531918688476','50th Anniversary | White Vinyl BF 2026','881061074588','Released for Record Store Day Black Friday in honor of the 50th anniversary of Night Moves by Bob Seger & the Silver Bullet Band. Pressed at Third Man Records, which also hails from Detroit, on limited-edition white vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'37.99','24.45','47055540977884',1,'70251237998812',0,0.6400000000000000133,'POUNDS','26650539');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260969185500','15531919704284','Deluxe Edition - RSD Exclusive | Sticker, Stickers, Gatefold LP Jacket','881061124573','KPop Demon Hunters, a Netflix film from Sony Pictures Animation, follows K-Pop superstars HUNTR/X - when they aren''t selling out stadiums, they use their secret identities as badass demon hunters to protect their fans from an ever-present supernatural threat. Together, they must face their biggest enemy yet - an irresistible rival boy band of demons in disguise. This version of the soundtrack features exclusive, all-new art created by official KPop Demon Hunters production designer Mingjue Helen Chen and visual development artist Marion Bordeyne. This "Derpy Sussie Splatter" vinyl includes exclusive, holographic art on both the front cover and triple gatefold, 3 of 6 mini inserts, 1 of 3 holographic mini inserts, a sticker sheet, and an oversized poster! Please note that each vinyl is a unique, custom color blend, so will appear slightly different from the image displayed. Released for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'52.99','36.38','47055544877276',1,'70251239571676',0,1.120000000000000107,'POUNDS','03605405');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260972560604','15531921637596','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','881061125082','Royel Otis puts their electrifying performance at the Greek Theater in Los Angeles onto vinyl. This new live album, pressed on soda pop colored vinyl, features fan-favorite tracks such as "Sofa King," "Oysters in My Pocket," "I hate this tune," and "who''s your boyfriend." Equal parts intimate and exhilarating, Royel Otis showcases their raw energy and unmistakable live performance that has earned them global success.','11/26/2026',NULL,'34.99','22.58','47055552086236',1,'70251242946780',0,0.5999999999999999778,'POUNDS','44213455');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260997464284','15531934843100','RSD Exclusive | Red Vinyl | Extended Play BF 2026','881061131335','Recorded just weeks before the release of The Forever Story, this performance features live debuts alongside reimagined versions of fan favorites. Backed by a live band and background singers, the set highlights his sharp lyricism and ability to move effortlessly between sounds and styles. Strippeddown versions of tracks like "Never" and "Surround Sound" showcases the detail in Jid''s flow and the energy of the band behind him, while the soulful closing performance of "Kody Blu 31" leaves a lasting impact and shows the full range of Jid''s artistry.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','22.58','47055610216668',1,'70251267850460',0,0.4899999999999999912,'POUNDS','54789424');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68260999856348','15531935727836','RSD Exclusive | Clear & Red Transparent Vinyl BF 2026','881061184270','Playing Along, Volume 2 captures performances from the second season of Norah Jones'' podcast of the same name, where the multi-GRAMMY-winning singer and pianist welcomes artists into the studio for candid conversation and spontaneous collaboration. Featuring intimate duet performances with Joshua Homme, María Zardoya (of The Marías), Josh Groban, Jason Isbell, and more, it is pressed on transparent red vinyl exclusively for RSD Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'34.99','22.58','47055614378204',1,'70251270144220',0,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','46283217');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261001560284','15531936645340','RSD Exclusive | Yellow Vinyl | Extended Play BF 2026','881061190950','Featuring the long-awaited dance break versions from the BEAUTIFUL CHAOS Tour, this Record Store Day Black Friday exclusive is pressed on a Katseye logo-etched 12" yellow vinyl. Experience the fan-favorite live arrangements of "Debut," "Gnarly," and "Gabriela" for the first time on vinyl. Includes 2 of 6 randomly selected unique photocards.','11/26/2026',NULL,'33.99','22.58','47055617851612',1,'70251271946460',0,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','30269361');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261003198684','15531937595612','RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single BF 2026','881061208259','Recorded during Holly Humberstone''s 2026 BBC Radio 1 Live Lounge session, Live from Cruel World brings together two special performances on 7" color vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday. Side A features an intimate rendition of "Cruel World," the title track from Holly''s acclaimed second album, while Side B captures her take on Harry Styles'' "Coming Up Roses," reimagined in Holly''s unmistakable style.','11/26/2026',NULL,'18.99','13.08','47055621259484',1,'70251273584860',0,0.08999999999999999667,'POUNDS','87428221');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261010407644','15531940839644','5th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | Extended Play BF 2026','881061254461','For the first time ever on vinyl, Stephen Sanchez''s debut ''What Was, Not Now'' arrives on Record Store Day Black Friday as a special 5th anniversary edition, pressed on 12" black vinyl and featuring an exclusive etched B-side. Originally released in 2021, the 6-track EP - including beloved tracks "The Pool" and "Hold Her While You Can" - showcases the heartfelt songwriting that introduced the world to Stephen''s nostalgic, romantic sound. Written largely before signing with Mercury Records, ''What Was, Not Now'' remains a defining chapter in the early career of one of today''s most captivating artists.','11/26/2026',NULL,'29.99','19.22','47055632105692',1,'70251280793820',0,0.5500000000000000444,'POUNDS','72241432');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261013422300','15531942641884','RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single, Red Vinyl BF 2026','881061257516','Parker McCollum''s self-titled debut, winner of the 2026 ACM Album of the Year. Celebrate with two versions of the fan-favorite, "Big Ole Fancy House," one full-band version and one acoustic version. Available on red 7" vinyl single for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'18.99','13.08','47055639707868',1,'70251283808476',0,0.1400000000000000134,'POUNDS','87637024');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261014995164','15531943395548','Deluxe Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive BF 2026','881061295549','KONNAKOL is ZAYN''s fifth studio album and his most culturally inspired project to date. Expanding on the pop-forward sound fans first heard on his record-breaking debut, Mind of Mine. KONNAKOL, in it''s definition, is the act of creating percussive sounds with one''s voice, but what it means to ZAYN lies deeper, drawing inspiration from his own heritage. This 18-track Deluxe Edition is pressed exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday on special, limited-edition Concrete Jungle colored vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'54.99','34.11','47055642689756',1,'70251285381340',0,1.070000000000000062,'POUNDS','38259025');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261062443228','9120063684828','Chamber Version - RSD Exclusive | 10-inch, Brunette Vinyl | Extended Play BF 2026','881061297437','This new vinyl piece features alternate chamber versions of 4 songs from the deluxe edition of Florence + The Machine''s critically acclaimed album, Everybody Scream. This Record Store Day Black Friday exclusive is a 10" vinyl with printed inners on brunette colored vinyl.','11/26/2026',NULL,'31.99','22.58','47055732408540',1,'70251332829404',0,0.4600000000000000199,'POUNDS','44304981');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261063917788','15531970625756','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single | Bonus Track BF 2026','881061300946','This limited-edition 7" vinyl features a previously unreleased track, "Black Is The New Black," from In Times of Dragons that was not included on the original album tracklist. The song continues the album''s metaphorical exploration of the battle between democracy and tyranny in modern America. This collectible release includes a custom etched B-side and exclusive sleeve artwork created specifically for this pressing, making it an essential piece for fans, collectors, and vinyl enthusiasts alike. Released exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'19.99','14.45','47055735816412',1,'70251334336732',0,0.1499999999999999945,'POUNDS','25473430');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261065687260','15531971969244','10th Anniversary - RSD Exclusive | 2Lp''s BF 2026','881061304470','Ten years after redefining the sound of modern hip-hop, Rae Sremmurd''s SremmLife 2 returns for the first time as an expanded Record Store Day Black Friday edition! Featuring five additional tracks that were absent from the original vinyl pressing, alongside never-before-seen imagery of Swae Lee & Slim Jxmmi, this anniversary release celebrates the album that further cemented the duo''s cultural impact - proving that even a decade later, the SremmLife still hits different. Pressed on dark indigo vinyl 2LP.','11/26/2026',NULL,'54.99','34.11','47055739814108',1,'70251336073436',0,1.020000000000000017,'POUNDS','83089422');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261068931292','15531974394076','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','881061306627','George Strait''s Blue Clear Sky makes it''s long-awaited vinyl debut with this Record Store Day Black Friday exclusive release. Originally released in 1996, the triple-platinum album debuted at No. 1 on the Billboard Top Country Albums chart and features hits, "Carried Away," and "I Can Still Make Cheyenne."','11/26/2026',NULL,'39.99','26.16','47055746531548',1,'70251339317468',0,0.5100000000000000088,'POUNDS','61748875');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261083644124','15531985076444','RSD Exclusive | 12-inch, Red Vinyl | 2Lp''s, Extended Play, Bonus Tracks BF 2026','881061313700','Carly Rae Jepsen''s 2026 studio album, Day and Night, imagines a world expansive enough to embrace every facet of her identity. This first-ever pressing on red vinyl 2LP features all 8 bonus tracks previously available only on the digital edition, making their physical debut for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'30.99','20.42','47055779692764',1,'70251354030300',0,0.5799999999999999601,'POUNDS','71392101');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261085380828','15531986419932','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | 7-inch Single, Porcelain Powder Vinyl BF 2026','881061336211','This 7" single, featuring Noah Kahan''s "Draw You Out" from the highly anticipated The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping - The Album. Pressed on limited-edition Porcelain Powder colored vinyl, this collectible release offers fans an exclusive way to celebrate the music inspired by the next chapter in The Hunger Games saga.','11/26/2026',NULL,'19.99','14.45','47055783362780',1,'70251355767004',0,0.08999999999999999667,'POUNDS','70722472');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261087051996','15531987697884','Limited Edition - RSD Exclusive | 12-inch Single BF 2026','881061354208','Dexter and The Moonrocks release their breakthrough hit, "Freakin'' Out," on limited-edition 12" vinyl single, exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday. Featuring the studio & live versions on Side A and an etching of Texas on Side B.','11/26/2026',NULL,'23.99','15.71','47055786967260',1,'70251357438172',0,0.5200000000000000177,'POUNDS','73129351');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261120409820','15532008014044','RSD Exclusive | Orange Vinyl | Bonus Track BF 2026','881061377764','17 years after it''s initial release, Lil Wayne''s No Ceilings mixtape is now available for the first time on burnt orange colored vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday. The album includes the bonus track, "Kobe Bryant."','11/26/2026',NULL,'34.99','22.58','47055843786972',1,'70251390959836',0,0.5400000000000000355,'POUNDS','23908550');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261137088732','15532011552988','RSD Exclusive BF 2026 | 12-inch, Orange Vinyl | Extended Play, Bonus Tracks','881061385974','The Last of the Bugs features the 4 bonus tracks taken from Noah Kahan''s latest album, The Great Divide. Pressed on 12" vinyl, the EP includes the single, "Orbiter", fan-favorite, "Staying Still," and more. Produced by Gabe Simon & Aaron Dessner. Released exclusively for Record Store Day Black Friday.','11/26/2026',NULL,'30.99','20.42','47055854600412',1,'70251407638748',0,0.8499999999999999778,'POUNDS','02706985');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261150130396','15532014960860','RSD Exclusive BF 2026','884400477378','All four of TV Girl''s full length albums are now available on CD in a 2CD set. Albums include French Exit, Who Really Cares, Death Of A Party Girl, and the Grapes Upon The Vine. This RSD version is the first time ever available in Jewel Box packaging having only ever been relased as a digi pack and limited to 500 units.','11/26/2026',NULL,'30.99','19.29','47055870558428',1,'70251420680412',0,0.4799999999999999823,'POUNDS','97716566');
INSERT INTO shopify_variants VALUES('68261160878300','15532017221852','Advent Calendar Edition - RSD Exclusive | Red Eco Vinyl BF 2026','888072803114','The beloved holiday album and best-selling jazz album of all time, Vince Guaraldi Trio''s A Charlie Brown Christmas, is now available in this limited Advent Calendar edition on eco-mix red vinyl for Record Store Day Black Friday. Housed in a gatefold jacket featuring 24 openable windows, each revealing a different design from the PEANUTS holiday special. This perennial classic continues to introduce generations of children and adults to the joys of jazz through holiday favorites including "Christmas Time is Here," "O Tannenbaum," "Skating," and "Linus and Lucy."','11/26/2026',NULL,'37.99','24.45','47055878750428',1,'70251431428316',0,0.839999999999999969,'POUNDS','24835834');
