INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179736,'smell of female red vinyl import|the cramps|the cramps|lp','Smell Of Female - Red Vinyl [Import]','The Cramps','The Cramps','LP','BGB6703081.1','029667030816',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46176226','2026-11-10 23:51:27','2026-11-10 23:51:27','/02966703081','(Colored Vinyl, Red, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Originally released in 1983, "Smell Of Female" was a 12" 45rpm mini-LP that captured Lux Interior (vocals), Poison Ivy (guitar), Kid Congo Powers (guitar) and Nick Knox (drums) live at the Peppermint Lounge in New York on 25 and 26 February of that same year. Comprising six tracks, "Smell OF Female" shows The Cramps in all their glory, powering through ''Faster Pussycat'', ''Call Of The Wighat'', ''I Ain''t Nuthin'' But A Gorehound'', ''Psychotic Reaction'', ''You Got Good Taste'' and ''Thee Most Exalted Potentate Of Love''. Back on red vinyl as per our original 1983 release. Limited pressing.','6/5/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4509655-3569593.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179737,'it s not us|umphrey s mcgee|umphrey s mcgee|lp','It''s Not Us','Umphrey''s McGee','Umphrey''s McGee','LP','NGTF117.1','020286224983',24.94999999999999929,24.94999999999999929,'35528777','2026-11-10 23:51:27','2026-11-10 23:51:27','/02028622498',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Umphrey''s McGee entered I.V. Labs Studio in Chicago in November of 2016 to record what would become the band''s eleventh full-length studio album. The result was It''s Not Us, the most vibrant, mature expression of the band''s growing studio prowess to date. "We decided to go in for a week, live, eat, and breathe Umphrey''s McGee," recalls Joel Cummins. "We''re known as a strong live band, but we take so much pride in our writing. [In this album] the focus is on that writing." The first single "The Silent Type" is powered by a bombastic beat, funkified rhythms, fiery fretwork, and a chantable refrain, introducing It''s Not Us with a bright and brilliant bang. "Half Delayed" builds from airy guitar into an iridescent refrain, meanwhile, the bass strut anthemic beat production and percussive wallop of "Looks" could be the love child of Nine Inch Nails and Talking Heads. The metallic shredfest outro of "Remind Me" bleeds effortlessly into the gorgeous acoustic love song "You & You Alone."','1/12/2018',1.229999999999999983,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/8/8/8/3748881.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179738,'star wars trilogy utah symphony orchestra original soundtrack|john williams|john williams|lp','Star Wars Trilogy (Utah Symphony Orchestra) (Original Soundtrack)','John Williams','John Williams','LP','VAR067392.1','030206739213',20.94000000000000127,20.94000000000000127,'30800458','2026-11-10 23:51:27','2026-11-10 23:51:27','/03020673921',NULL,0,'Limited vinyl LP reissue of this best-selling album. First released in 1983, this compilation of music from the original three films, (Star Wars/Empire/Jedi) is one of the best-selling albums ever released by the seminal film music label, Var├¿se Sarabande. Officially endorsed by Lucasfilm and composer John Williams, the outer packaging contains actual stills from each of the three original Star Wars films and a letter from John Williams that consumers can read on the back of the album. While it features music composed by Williams, the music contained on this release was performed by the Utah Symphony Orchestra conducted by Varujan Kojian. The album was produced for That''s Entertainment Records and Varese Sarabande Records by George Korngold.','4/1/2016',0.4699999999999999734,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/1/0/6/3116016.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179739,'lullaby renditions of grateful dead|andrew bissell|andrew bissell|lp','Lullaby Renditions of Grateful Dead','Andrew Bissell','Andrew Bissell','LP','BBRR9711.1','027297971110',19.89000000000000056,19.89000000000000056,'43895281','2026-11-10 23:51:28','2026-11-10 23:51:28','/02729797111',NULL,0,'Do you wake from the flood of tears, parents? If your little ones are dead set on staying up, play these blanket soft versions of Grateful Dead''s psychedelic rock favorites. You just might get some sleep tonight.','4/15/2015',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4258612-3474099.jpg?ae=4621895153','Children''s Video');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179740,'senor boombox|the disco biscuits|the disco biscuits|lp','Senor Boombox','The Disco Biscuits','The Disco Biscuits','LP','ME1301.1','020286225706',14.00999999999999979,14.00999999999999979,'38818967','2026-11-10 23:51:28','2026-11-10 23:51:28','/02028622570',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Available on vinyl for the first time, Se├▒or Boombox is a 2002 Megaforce Records release from Philadelphia, PA trance fusion pioneers The Disco Biscuits. The group bridges the gap between electronic music and jam bands here with groovy and genre jumping good-time party anthems that are built on stellar musicianship and improvisation and are tailor made for the stage. The album made a dent on both Billboard''s Top Electronic Albums (No. 13) and Top Independent Albums (No. 46) charts.','4/19/2019',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/3650157-3150063.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179741,'the front bottoms|the front bottoms|the front bottoms|lp','The Front Bottoms','The Front Bottoms','The Front Bottoms','LP','BN12.1','032862901218',14.25,14.25,'19102856','2026-11-10 23:51:28','2026-11-10 23:51:28','/03286290121','(MP3 Download)',0,'The Front Bottoms are an American indie band that originated in Woodcliff Lake, New Jersey. In August 2007, after Brian Sella (vocals, guitar, lyricist) finished his first year of college, he and childhood friend Mathew Uychich (drums) began playing together under the name The Front Bottoms. Soon after, Uychich''s brother Brian Uychich (keyboard, vocals) began sitting in on their practices. Brian asked to join the band, playing an old keyboard he found in the Uychich family attic.','11/13/2012',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/9/3/6/2036392.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179742,'in the aeroplane over the sea|neutral milk hotel|neutral milk hotel|cd','In the Aeroplane Over the Sea','Neutral Milk Hotel','Neutral Milk Hotel','CD','MRG136.2','036172943623',5.700000000000000177,5.700000000000000177,'03463130','2026-11-10 23:51:28','2026-11-10 23:51:28','/03617294362',NULL,0,'Named Best Album of the 1990s by Magnet Magazine, In the Aeroplane Over the Sea gives us Jeff Mangum''s powerful solo acoustic work, full horn-section marches, history, religion, and sex-everything you hoped for and more!','2/10/1998',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/9/2/8/208298.jpg?ae=4621895153','Indie Rock/Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179743,'pride prejudice original soundtrack|dario marianelli|dario marianelli|lp','Pride & Prejudice (Original Soundtrack)','Dario Marianelli','Dario Marianelli','LP','DCA170563.1','028948712274',32.25,32.25,'45192111','2026-11-10 23:51:29','2026-11-10 23:51:29','/02894871227','(Limited Edition, Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Dario Marianelli/Jean-Yves Thibaudet - "Pride & Prejudice (Music From The Motion Picture)". In honor of it''s 20th anniversary, the acclaimed soundtrack to Pride & Prejudice makes it''s long-awaited return to vinyl. Dario Marianelli''s beloved score for Joe Wright''s 2005 film adaptation - starring Keira Knightley and Matthew Macfadyen - is performed by acclaimed pianist Jean-Yves Thibaudet and the English Chamber Orchestra. Nominated for an Academy Award and two World Soundtrack Awards, and newly certified Gold by the RIAA, the soundtrack continues to enchant a new generation of listeners. The newly designed Twentieth Anniversary Edition is housed in a deluxe gatefold jacket and contains a 16-page booklet with rare photos. Limited Edition.','9/19/2025',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4427601-3431622.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179744,'rose|the front bottoms|the front bottoms|lp','Rose','The Front Bottoms','The Front Bottoms','LP','BN227.1','032862022715',9.5,9.5,'26783376','2026-11-10 23:51:29','2026-11-10 23:51:29','/03286202271',NULL,0,'The Front Bottoms rip it up on these new recordings of fan favorites including the sing-along go-to graduation number "12 Feet Deep" Six songs in all. Mixed by Chris "Frenchie" Smith. Touring this year with the likes of say Anything, Brand New and Saves the Day.','9/16/2014',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/9/4/1/2601490.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
