INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179912,'cheetah licious christmas|the cheetah girls|the cheetah girls|lp','Cheetah-licious Christmas','The Cheetah Girls','The Cheetah Girls','LP','DSN249488.1','050087610906',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46607591','2026-11-10 23:52:01','2026-11-10 23:52:01','/05008761090','(Clear Vinyl, Glitter)',0,'The holiday classic from The Cheetah Girls arrives on vinyl. Cheetah-licious Christmas features fan-favorite originals, festive pop anthems, and timeless holiday standards performed by one of Disney''s most beloved groups. From "Five More Days ''Til Christmas" to "Feliz Navidad," this cheerful collection delivers the perfect blend of seasonal fun and Disney nostalgia. Available on clear glitter vinyl.','11/13/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/4543641-3737096.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179913,'disney hits 2 original soundtrack|various artists|various artists|cd','Disney Hits 2 (Original Soundtrack)','Various Artists','Various Artists','CD','DSN244243.2','050087601027',9.74000000000000021,9.74000000000000021,'46429629','2026-11-10 23:52:01','2026-11-10 23:52:01','/05008760102',NULL,0,'More of your favorites in one magical collection. Disney Hits, Volume 2 brings together unforgettable songs from Zootopia, Frozen, Coco, Encanto, The Lion King, and beyond. Featuring "Try Everything," "Hakuna Matata," "Surface Pressure," and "I See the Light." Packed with iconic voices and feel-good moments, it''s a must-have for Disney fans.','8/14/2026',0.0100000000000000002,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4527831-3688453.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179914,'everyone s talking|all time low|all time low|lp','Everyone''s Talking! [Explicit Content]','All Time Low','All Time Low','LP','PFNR490632.1','0604675490632',15.49000000000000021,15.49000000000000021,'45366093','2026-11-10 23:52:01','2026-11-10 23:52:01','/060467549063','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, White, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Multi-platinum Maryland quartet All Time Low - Alex Gaskarth, Jack Barakat, Rian Dawson and Zack Merrick - known for their anthemic, inimitable sound and fiercely loyal fanbase, announce the forthcoming release of their tenth full-length studio release, Everyone''s Talking!, due on October 17 via their own imprint, Basement Noise Records, in partnership with Photo Finish Records.','10/17/2025',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4443689-3421220.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179915,'i want you|marvin gaye|marvin gaye|lp','I Want You','Marvin Gaye','Marvin Gaye','LP','MOT95292.1','050109529216',22.16000000000000014,22.16000000000000014,'13744038','2026-11-10 23:52:01','2026-11-10 23:52:01','/05010952921','(Reissue)',0,'180 Gram Vinyl Record LP. I Want You is a 1976 album by Marvin Gaye. The album was his first recorded studio material released in three years and marked a change in direction for Gaye, leaving his trademark Motown soul for funky, light-disco soul. Much of Gaye''s music encompassed spirituality, sexuality, and vulnerability. With a career spanning over more than a decade, it''s no wonder that many of today''s artists continue to honor and emulate Gaye. Although no longer a physical presence, his existence as an artist is one that is sure to be a vital part of the millennium and beyond.','7/29/2008',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/6/2/0/1370266.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179916,'innervisions|stevie wonder|stevie wonder|lp','Innervisions','Stevie Wonder','Stevie Wonder','LP','MOT83972.1','050109032617',23.25,23.25,'43897681','2026-11-10 23:52:01','2026-11-10 23:52:01','/05010903261',NULL,0,'Ranked 23/500 on Rolling Stone Magazine''s 500 Greatest Albums of All Time. The sixteenth album by American musician Stevie Wonder, released August 3, 1973 on Motown Records; a landmark recording of his "classic period".The nine tracks of Innervisions encompass a wide range of themes and issues: from drug abuse in "Too High, " through social anger in "Living for the City, " to love in the ballads "All in Love is Fair" and "Golden Lady."As with many of Stevie Wonder''s albums the lyrics, composition and production are almost entirely his own work, with the ARP synthesizer used prominently throughout the album. This instrument was a common motif among musicians of the time because of it''s ability to construct a complete sound environment. Wonder was the first black artist to experiment with this technology on a mass scale, and Innervisions was hugely influential on the subsequent future of commercial black music. He also played all or virtually all instruments on six of the album''s nine tracks, making most of Innervisions a representative one-man band.','1/1/1991',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/4/7/1/1431746.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179917,'vision of dennis brown|dennis brown|dennis brown|lp','Vision Of Dennis Brown','Dennis Brown','Dennis Brown','LP','VP54185.1','054645418515',19.69000000000000127,19.69000000000000127,'33282169','2026-11-10 23:52:02','2026-11-10 23:52:02','/05464541851',NULL,0,NULL,'12/17/2013',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/3229920-3153928.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179918,'can t stop a man the best of|beres hammond|beres hammond|lp','Can''t Stop A Man: The Best Of','Beres Hammond','Beres Hammond','LP','VP1664.1','054645166416',45.68999999999999773,45.68999999999999773,'09605985','2026-11-10 23:52:02','2026-11-10 23:52:02','/05464516641','(Boxed Set)',0,NULL,'11/25/2003',1.439999999999999947,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/4/2/5/565244.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179919,'heart of the congos|the congos|the congos|lp','Heart Of The Congos','The Congos','The Congos','LP','VP4237.1','054645423717',19.69000000000000127,19.69000000000000127,'43672103','2026-11-10 23:52:02','2026-11-10 23:52:02','/05464542371','(Remastered)',0,NULL,'7/29/2022',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4235160-3021564.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179920,'everyone s talking|all time low|all time low|lp','Everyone''s Talking! [Explicit Content]','All Time Low','All Time Low','LP','PFNR154343.1','0604675154343',15.49000000000000021,15.49000000000000021,'45366048','2026-11-10 23:52:02','2026-11-10 23:52:02','/060467515434','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, White, Green, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Multi-platinum Maryland quartet All Time Low - Alex Gaskarth, Jack Barakat, Rian Dawson and Zack Merrick - known for their anthemic, inimitable sound and fiercely loyal fanbase, announce the forthcoming release of their tenth full-length studio release, Everyone''s Talking!, due on October 17 via their own imprint, Basement Noise Records, in partnership with Photo Finish Records.','10/17/2025',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4443684-3418429.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179921,'paris unplugged|syml|syml|lp','Paris Unplugged','SYML','SYML','LP','NTW301659.1','067003016599',17.5,17.5,'46479365','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/06700301659','(Green, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Prolific multi-diamond artist and producer SYML releases ''Paris Unplugged'' on Bottle Green Vinyl. Recorded while in Paris at Le Consulat, the album distills his emotional songwriting into an unfiltered performance that feels deeply personal and universally moving. Accompanied by Brian Eichelberger, Zawadi Morrow, and Kyle Moore, the songs are presented with acoustic delicacy, revealing the fragile heart at the center of his music and offering fans a chance to experience the closeness of his live shows. While the performance spans his catalogue and even includes a cover of Billie Eilish''s "When The Party''s Over," the primary focus is showcasing his third studio album, ''Nobody Lives Here.''','10/16/2026',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4532244-3681679.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179922,'cacophony|paris paloma|paris paloma|lp','Cacophony','Paris Paloma','Paris Paloma','LP','NTW300899.1','067003008990',26.64000000000000056,26.64000000000000056,'46482112','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/06700300899','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Paris Paloma is one of the most vital new feminist voices in music, continuing to turn personal catharsis into collective power; a worldbuilder weaving myth, grief, rage, and love into songs that are timeless and urgently of this moment. As her debut album, ''Cacophony'' captured that vital force, and features her undeniably iconic breakout release "labour". Now platinum-certified, "labour" has sparked more than 11 billion views on social media, 875 million streams, and soundtracked movements from reproductive rights campaigns to anti-sexual violence advocacy, and Kamala Harris'' own election campaign content. The wider album embraces beautiful and visceral themes of mythology, the mind and the feminine experience. As a release it is both inspired by icons and iconography, and in turn Paris Paloma became an iconic new voice to fans all over the world. 2LP Blue Jay vinyl in single sleeve with lyric insert and etching on side D.','10/23/2026',0.9200000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4532422-3682215.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179923,'heart of gold the songs of neil young various artists|various artists|various artists|lp','Heart of Gold: The Songs of Neil Young (Various Artists)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','KLLP1.1','051497484224',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'45055478','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/05149748422','(Colored Vinyl, White, Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Heart of Gold: The Songs of Neil Young, celebrates the music of the legendary musician, Neil Young, via Cinema Music Group and Killphonic Records. Volume I is an immersive album that invites you to journey through a rich tapestry of sound and sentiment, blending beloved classics with fresh interpretations of Neil Young''s songs that honor his legacy. Volume I features covers by Mumford & Sons, Eddie Vedder, Courtney Barnett, Sharon Van Etten, Stephen Marley, The Doobie Brothers with Allison Russell and more. Proceeds from the album will benefit The Bridge School in Hillsborough, California." Each track stands as a testament to Young''s enduring influence, while also showcasing how his songs can still resonate in different sonic landscapes. They honor his originals, but in doing so, they show just how vast and versatile his legacy truly is. This collection is proof that while the heart of Neil Young''s music is irreplaceable, there''s always room for new voices to join the chorus.','5/9/2025',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4415683-3394516.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179924,'two sevens clash|culture|culture|lp','Two Sevens Clash','Culture','Culture','LP','VP4178.1','054645417815',19.69000000000000127,19.69000000000000127,'15525048','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/05464541781',NULL,0,NULL,'1/25/2011',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/5/0/3/1793055.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179925,'crystal castles|crystal castles|crystal castles|lp','Crystal Castles','Crystal Castles','Crystal Castles','LP','LGAN100962.1','060270096219',18.78999999999999915,18.78999999999999915,'13647896','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/06027009621',NULL,0,'2008 debut album from the Toronto-based duo, who have amassed a cult following through their uncompromising and intense delivery, a slew of limited edition singles, and shows packed solely by word of mouth. Their vinyl singles have sold out instantly, they have toured extensively in the UK, Europe and North America with artists such as Metric and the Klaxons, and remixed songs for Bloc Party and the Klaxons among others. Substantial support from Pitchfork and the rest of the blogsphere with over 10,000 MySpace plays a day. Crystal Castles are making everyone''s ''Band to Watch'' list for 2008.','6/3/2008',0.8499999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/1196736-3502726.jpg?ae=4621895153','Indie Rock/Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179926,'the fatal flaw iex|paris paloma|paris paloma|lp','The Fatal Flaw (IEX)','Paris Paloma','Paris Paloma','LP','NTW301009.1','067003010092',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'46240309','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/06700301009','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Red, 140 Gram Vinyl, Poster)',0,'''The Fatal Flaw'' is the much anticipated sophomore album from Paris Paloma; and quite simply it is an album all about Love. Love as Art, Love under the Patriarchy, Love as a political and radical act - in short ''The Fatal Flaw'' examines Love from a deeper and philosophical perspective. Even the songs that aren''t about Love, also are. They are about the absence of love, and what happens in those spaces, so they are songs about the necessity of love, and the consequences of it''s absences. This Indie Exclusive version is pressed on Bloodshot vinyl and includes a fold-out poster.','9/4/2026',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4512659-3588899.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179927,'scrapyard|quadeca|quadeca|lp','Scrapyard','Quadeca','Quadeca','LP','DDAX8200.1','061297937950',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'46532800','2026-11-10 23:52:03','2026-11-10 23:52:03','/06129793795','(Colored Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Half White / Half Black (Inverted) Vinyl. SCRAPYARD is the finale in the Scrapyard series from Quadeca. Released on February 16, 2024, the mixtape contains 15 tracks and features from artists brakence and Kevin Abstract, the former of whom made an appearance in SCRAPYARD I, the series'' debut. Quadeca got his start on YouTube around ten years ago, posting mostly hip-hop freestyles, mixtapes and more, building a steady following through the years. His 2022 record, I Didn''t Mean To Haunt You, was his first major departure from hip-hop, containing folktronica, indie rock, shoegaze and many more genre elements. SCRAPYARD continues in this genre-fluid direction, containing both tracks that did not fit on I Didn''t Mean To Haunt You and new works.','11/20/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/4536807-3695751.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179928,'there is no neil frances|neil frances|neil frances|lp','There is no Neil Frances','NEIL FRANCES','NEIL FRANCES','LP','NTW31303-1.1','067003130318',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'43373086','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700313031','(Clear Vinyl, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Regular Jacket with Matte Varnish, Heavyweight 180g Clear Vinyl.. There is no Neil Frances. OK, sort of. Neil Frances is not a solo artist, it''s the name of a duo comprised of Sydney-born Jordan Feller and Southern California native Marc Gilfry. To help you remember that Neil Frances is not a person, the duo has named it''s debut LP There Is no Neil Frances. Neil Frances'' signature sound is beat-driven pop infused with a more organic warmth than most modern music. Putting special emphasis on their enthralling live sets-the group quickly developed a reputation as a must-see stage artist opening for SG Lewis, Jungle, and Unknown Mortal Orchestra. The band explains, "Our new album is about self-realization and becoming the person that you dream of. The concept is that we are insects on earth who ascend into outer space to become divas at a galactic ball." The album features both GRAE and Benny Sings.','6/2/2023',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/35/4192635-2958111.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179929,'illumination|miami horror|miami horror|lp','Illumination','Miami Horror','Miami Horror','LP','NTW25215.1','067003125215',17.10000000000000143,17.10000000000000143,'41386804','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700312521',NULL,0,'Miami Horror, which began as a solo project by producer Benjamin Plant, extract ethereal melodies from down-tempo nocturnal soundscapes punctuated by a funky strut, echoes of guitars, glossy electronics, and luminous pop. 2021 sees Miami Horror release a 10th anniversary reissue of their seminal 2010 debut, the ARIA-nominated album Illumination. "I started working on ''Illumination'' at around 19-years-old and finished it by 24," Plant explains. "You''re going through the crossover period of being a teenager to an adult. You still have a lot of life ahead of you, but you see the world innocently. The album was made during this crossover in my life where I got to see something come to fruition. I was in the imaginative period where you don''t have the burdens of adulthood yet. The music focuses on the wonder of the adventure itself. I had started to rekindle that feeling before the re-release. Everything was coming full circle, and it felt like the perfect moment to reintroduce this." Highlighted by such anthems as "I Look To You" (feat. Kimbra), "Holidays" (feat. Alan Paloma) and "Sometimes."','3/19/2021',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/3937263-2680060.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179930,'millions like stars in my hands the daggers in my heart wage war|single gun theory|single gun theory|lp','Millions, Like Stars In My Hands, The Daggers In My Heart wage war','Single Gun Theory','Single Gun Theory','LP','NTW31083.1','067003108317',14.90000000000000035,14.90000000000000035,'29033898','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700310831','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited edition 150 gm vinyl LP pressing includes digital download that has bonus tracks. Fusing Indian, Turkish, and South-East Asian sounds with Jacqui Hunt''s dream pop vocals and early 90''s electronica, millions, like stars in my hands, the daggers in my heart wage war brought international prominence to the Australian trio (rounded out by Pete Rivett-Carnac and Kath Power). Their sampled, catchy style lent itself well to film - several of these tracks found their way onto soundtracks while "I Am What I See" was used as the theme song for ABC.','11/20/2015',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/1/6/1/3011616.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179931,'filters|bayonne|bayonne|lp','Filters','Bayonne','Bayonne','LP','NTW300139.1','067003001397',17.10000000000000143,17.10000000000000143,'46164278','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700300139','(Clear Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Bayonne''s music captures the indescribable. For 10 years, the Austin, Texas-based experimental avant-pop/electronic musician, born Roger Sellers, has been creating atmospheric soundscapes brimming with layers, texture, and deep emotional resonance. On his fourth and most immersive album to date, ''Filters'', Sellers picks up where he left us on 2023''s mournful yet pop-minded ''Temporary Time''. With it''s elegantly constructed melodies, silken synth-work, a sprinkle of field recordings, and an upbeat yet blissful blend of piano and percussion, Filters finds Sellers entering a new phase of existence as he works through the grief around losing his father and into a place of acceptance.','9/4/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4508380-3566788.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179932,'da real thing|sizzla|sizzla|lp','Da Real Thing','Sizzla','Sizzla','LP','VP1649.1','054645164917',18.98999999999999843,18.98999999999999843,'08920515','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/05464516491',NULL,0,NULL,'11/19/2002',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/4/5/0/450545.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179933,'i m scared that s all there is|ben quad|ben quad|lp','I''m Scared That''s All There Is','Ben Quad','Ben Quad','LP','WXBO0310.1','061297937219',16.73999999999999843,16.73999999999999843,'44180324','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06129793721','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Lava Mix Vinyl. Ben Quad is a tightly-wound emo outfit with just the right balance of delicate vulnerability, careening guitar-driven energy, and melodic ingenuity. Despite tongue-in-cheek proclamations of being "emo butt-rock," the Oklahoma City-based quartet take their songcraft seriously, and the result is a vibrant chemical blend of winning sensitivity, a charming dash of goofiness, and propulsively hooky, cleverly-written gems. With the release of their debut full length, I''m Scared That''s All There Is, the band established themselves as a band to watch. Brooklyn Vegan has raved "mix of sincerity, hooks, and adrenaline is always a winning formula when it''s done well, and Ben Quad do it very, very well."','5/3/2024',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4302449-3118701.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179934,'here come the abcs|they might be giants|they might be giants|lp','Here Come The ABCs','They Might Be Giants','They Might Be Giants','LP','DSN144172.1','050087548889',23.25,23.25,'44239206','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/05008754888','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. Disney Sound has partnered with Grammy Award winning alternative rock legends They Might Be Giants to bring you a new imprint for Walt Disney Records designed to create original musical works by live artists the whole family can enjoy. HERE COMES THE ABC''S guarantees success with upbeat and contagious songs that make the alphabet fun and entertaining for children and parents.','4/26/2024',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Children''s Video');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179935,'days vibes pink green|vacations|vacations|lp','Days/ Vibes - Pink/ Green','Vacations','Vacations','LP','NTW317511.1','067003175111',17.10000000000000143,17.10000000000000143,'45257568','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700317511','(Colored Vinyl, Pink, Green, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'To celebrate the 10th anniversary of their acclaimed debut EP, double platinum-selling Australian band Vacations are releasing a combined LP featuring their 2015 released ''Days'' EP and 2016''s seminal ''Vibes'' EP - both on vinyl for the very first time. The two bodies of work feature a collection of pivotal early releases, including fan favorite "Day Dreamin''," double-platinum certified single "Young," and certified gold track "Relax." These formative EPs not only continue to resonate with longtime fans, but also played a pivotal role in catapulting the band to global recognition, laying the groundwork for their sustained success and cult following.','9/5/2025',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4433629-3403336.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179936,'evergreen green|the paper kites|the paper kites|lp','Evergreen - Green','The Paper Kites','The Paper Kites','LP','NTW315221.1','067003152211',17.0,17.0,'44558529','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700315221','(Colored Vinyl, Green, 180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Australian indie folk rock band The Paper Kites release Evergreen, a compilation featuring the band''s debut EP Woodland and follow-up EP Young North for the first time on vinyl. Notably the release includes standout single "Bloom" which has been certified platinum in the U.S.A, Canada, Australia, Italy & the Netherlands. It melds earthy instrumentals to create a perfect backdrop for the band''s trademark harmonies that have garnered them a dedicated audience and over 1 billion streams across their catalog.','10/11/2024',0.8499999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4364599-3219879.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179937,'eat myself|together pangea|together pangea|lp','Eat Myself','Together Pangea','Together Pangea','LP','NTW317121.1','067003171212',17.10000000000000143,17.10000000000000143,'45632662','2026-11-10 23:52:04','2026-11-10 23:52:04','/06700317121','(180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Los Angeles-based indie rock trio Together Pangea''s highly-anticipated sixth studio album ''Eat Myself'' follows a long gap since their stellar 2021 effort ''DYE''. Sonically, it''s a far cry from the band''s earlier garage rock and surf roots. Instead, it offers a sharp distillation of their artistic range, including an emphasis on their heavier, grunge-leaning tendencies. Songs such as "Sunkin" and the title track "Eat Myself" could easily be mistaken for lost relics from Seattle''s grunge era of the nineties. Together Pangea also explores new territory: wall-of-sound shoegaze ("Little Demon," "Molly Said"), mid-2000s indie rock ("Like Your Father"), and infectious synth pop ("Burn the Hillside"). With Grammy Award-winning producer Mikey Freedom Hart (Taylor Swift, Bleachers, Lana Del Rey) at the helm, Together Pangea are once again making a bold and uncompromising artistic statement with ''Eat Myself'', and show no signs of slowing down.','1/16/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4467443-3467375.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179938,'took a while stay strong play long|neil frances|neil frances|lp','Took A While/ Stay Strong Play Long','NEIL FRANCES','NEIL FRANCES','LP','NTW317401.1','067003174015',22.39000000000000056,22.39000000000000056,'45380013','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700317401','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Pink)',0,'COLOR-IN-COLOR BLUE & PINK VINYL. For the first time ever, NEIL FRANCES'' iconic early EPs Stay Strong Play Long and Took A While are pressed to vinyl in one limited-edition gatefold release. Double disc, color vinyl, packed with fan favorites like "Music Sounds Better With You," "Dumb Love," and "Teardrops." This edition includes a handwritten note from the band. Limited run. Don''t sleep.','11/27/2025',1.209999999999999965,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4444938-3680845.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179939,'changes blue|vacations|vacations|lp','Changes - Blue','Vacations','Vacations','LP','NTW313091.1','067003130912',17.10000000000000143,17.10000000000000143,'45257551','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700313091','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'"Changes" is the breakout 2018 album by the double platinum-selling Australian band Vacations, now available for the very first time on vinyl. Featuring platinum single "Telephones" and fan favorite "Honey" - this album not only continues to resonate with longtime fans, but also played a pivotal role in catapulting the band to global recognition, laying the groundwork for their sustained success and cult following.','9/5/2025',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4433628-3403335.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179940,'snow|angus julia stone|angus julia stone|lp','Snow [Explicit Content]','Angus & Julia Stone','Angus & Julia Stone','LP','NTW31064.1','067003106412',17.39999999999999857,17.39999999999999857,'33402192','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700310641','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl, Black, 45 RPM)',0,'The first notes of Snow are instantly transporting. The guitar is a scratchy, wooden memory laid over a moment of silence. The gently driving organ beat emerges and takes you with it, beginning the next enchanting journey from brother-sister duo, Angus and Julia Stone. "Running from the start, here we are again," Julia sings. "Running from the start, here we go again," comes her brother''s reply. Plot-wise, Snow is yet another confident advance on a story which now accounts for over half a million album sales in Angus & Julia''s homeland of Australia alone. The Sydney-born siblings produced and largely engineered it themselves, in Angus''s cottage studio, Belafont├⌐, in the Byron Bay hinterland.','10/6/2017',1.360000000000000097,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/6/9/0/3700961.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179941,'bloodline red|mon rovia|mon rovia|lp','Bloodline - Red','Mon Rovia','Mon Rovia','LP','NTW318141.1','067003181419',17.5,17.5,'45545689','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700318141','(Colored Vinyl, Red, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'''Bloodline'', the striking debut album from Mon Rov├«a transforms personal struggle into a powerful statement of resilience and hope. The record channels themes of identity, survival, and transformation into a sound and story that have already resonated with millions worldwide. Mon''s music is rooted in his groundbreaking Afro-Appalachian folk sound, a genre-defying blend that bridges folk tradition and modern storytelling. At the heart of Mon Rov├«a''s artistry is a commitment to fostering community and connection. Whether performed in intimate settings or reaching millions online, his work resonates as a call to gather, to reflect, and to imagine a more connected future together.','1/9/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/56/4459456-3473801.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179942,'no place like home|vacations|vacations|lp','No Place Like Home','Vacations','Vacations','LP','NTW31500.1','067003150019',16.73999999999999843,16.73999999999999843,'44298371','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700315001','(Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'"Home" is not always a literal place. Sometimes, "home" represents inner peace and simply learning to hold space for yourself. This is where Vacations lead singer and guitarist Campbell Burns has arrived as he and bandmates Jake Johnson, Nate Delizzotti, and Joseph Van Lier release their third LP, No Place Like Home. "I had this loose concept of No Place Like Home being an Americana-influenced album," Campbell says of the album''s sonic inspirations. "I wanted to incorporate more pianos, acoustic guitars, Nashville tuning, and country-inspired lap steel, but then also bringing in drum machines and synths and finding a mix between the two." Produced by Campbell and John Velasquez (Zella Day, Broods), No Place Like Home comprises 10 shimmering tracks brimming with indie-pop hooks and just a touch of bittersweet sensitivity. The new project follows an intense period of transformation for Campbell, who was forced to cancel all touring commitments due to COVID restrictions and subsequently came down with a severe bout of writer''s block. After seeking therapy, he was eventually diagnosed with Pure OCD, a subtype of Obsessive Compulsive Disorder. "Pure OCD is more mental compulsions rather than physical compulsions," Campbell explains. "If I have an intrusive thought, I''m giving that thought belief and power over myself." As the world began to open up, so did Campbell''s vibrant creative spirit. Vacations hit the road for the first time in two years, selling out The Fonda in LA and playing Austin City Limits Festival in Austin, experiences that partially inform No Place Like Home. First single and album opener "Next Exit" sparkles with danceable synth riffs and Campbell''s aching falsetto, all while setting the overall tone for what''s to come. "''Next Exit'' is about living in this monotonous cycle," Campbell reveals. "You realize that you need an out. You need to - metaphorically and literally - take the next exit out in order to break out of that cycle." The singer mines his Pure OCD diagnosis on the pondering "Over You," which thematically picks up where "Next Exit" drops off. Campbell remarks on how "it almost has this ownership over my thoughts and actions to the point where I''m stuck in these loops and rituals that are a direct result of having OCD." On the Americana-inspired "Midwest," which seamlessly blends pop electronics, drum machine, and ''80s synth with poignant lap steel tones, the song remarks on the comedic nature of repeatedly entering into romantic relationships prior to going on tour - only to have them fizzle out upon returning. As the band releases No Place Like Home, Campbell is ironically just fine with not putting down physical roots just yet having recently made the move to LA for exploration, expanding "I needed to get overseas if I wanted to keep progressing - from a career standpoint, but also on a personal level." The greater priority lies within building that sense of comfort within himself. In the meantime, millions of fans around the world are making a permanent home with Vacations.','6/7/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4330047-3145590.jpg?ae=4621895153','Indie Rock/Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179943,'paradises|ladytron|ladytron|lp','Paradises','Ladytron','Ladytron','LP','NTW318081.1','067003180818',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'45707247','2026-11-10 23:52:05','2026-11-10 23:52:05','/06700318081','(140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The iconic and influential electronic pop group Ladytron returns with a new album ''Paradises'' - their first since 2023''s critically acclaimed ''Time''s Arrow''. Spanning dance and indie movements since their formation in Liverpool at the end of the last millennium, Ladytron have earned a unique position by carving out new sonic and conceptual space, and refusing to abide by formula or trend. In the early 2000s, the fiercely individual group were placed at the forefront of the so-called electro-clash scene (which now enjoys another revival), but with time, they came to appreciate the pop cultural moment that they had reluctantly become part of. The new album follows a period of renewed cultural presence for the band. Their 2002 single "Seventeen" unexpectedly went viral on TikTok, introducing Ladytron''s sound to a new generation and amassing hundreds of thousands of fan-made clips. Their legacy was further acknowledged recently with "Destroy Everything You Touch," one of their most celebrated tracks, featured in the GRAMMY-nominated original Motion Picture Soundtrack of cult movie Saltburn, reaffirming Ladytron''s enduring appeal.','3/20/2026',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4472466-3478646.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179944,'cacophony|paris paloma|paris paloma|lp','Cacophony','Paris Paloma','Paris Paloma','LP','NTW315071.1','067003150712',26.64000000000000056,26.64000000000000056,'44473655','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700315071',NULL,0,'Paris Paloma releases her debut album ''Cacophony'', which includes her breakthrough single "labour." Written around themes of feminine rage, societal expectations on women and deeply embedded misogyny, the album continues the deep consideration and dissection of Paris Paloma''s own experiences and observations as a woman. Drawing comparisons to artists like Florence + The Machine and Hozier, Paloma''s songwriting taps into cultural movements across 15 tracks. The LP includes cover art and an illustrative double-sided poster insert designed by Paris Paloma, which includes full album lyrics. Additionally an exclusive etching on Side D, which was also created by Paris Paloma herself.','8/30/2024',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4354757-3518371.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179945,'if you go there i hope you find it rust|the paper kites|the paper kites|lp','If You Go There, I Hope You Find It - Rust','The Paper Kites','The Paper Kites','LP','NTW318211.1','067003182119',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'45500343','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700318211','(Colored Vinyl, Rust, 180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The Paper Kites have long been the quiet soundtrack to modern life-songs that slip into weddings, road trips, and late-night reflections with an intimacy that feels deeply personal. Their breakout single "Bloom" became a global phenomenon, inspiring billions of streams and even a luminous cover by Kelly Clarkson, while their music has underscored cultural touchstones like Grey''s Anatomy, This Is Us, and Virgin River. Along the way, they''ve quietly influenced a new generation of songwriters, with artists like Zach Bryan and Lizzie McAlpine citing them as inspiration. Now, with their seventh studio album ''If You Go There, I Hope You Find It'', The Paper Kites reaffirm their place as one of the most quietly influential bands of their time. "When the Lavender Blooms" is a tender meditation on letting love and joy in after seasons of distance. "Every Town" traces the haunting ways memory and longing follow us wherever we go. And "Change of the Wind" offers both a personal and universal plea-that while we can''t alter everything around us, we can change ourselves. Threaded with the band''s hallmark harmonies and understated beauty, the album is an invitation to pause, reflect, and rediscover something true.','1/23/2026',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4456209-3446711.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179946,'twilight 25th anniversary zoetrope|b a|b a|lp','Twilight (25th Anniversary Zoetrope)','b├┤a','b├┤a','LP','NTW323864.1','067003238649',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'46086204','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700323864','(Picture Disc Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'To celebrate 25 years since it''s original release, b├┤a presents a limited edition 1LP zoetrope pressing of Twilight, featuring 11 tracks and animated vinyl artwork by renowned zoetrope artist Drew Tetz. Released worldwide in 2001, the album introduced b├┤a''s distinctive blend of atmospheric alt-rock, melodic intensity, and emotional depth. It gained global recognition through "Duvet," featured as the opening theme to cult Japanese anime Serial Experiments Lain, and has since seen renewed global attention following a recent viral resurgence. Exploring themes of identity, longing, and connection, Twilight balances introspective lyricism with driving guitars and immersive arrangements. This anniversary pressing celebrates a landmark release that continues to resonate with both longtime fans and a new generation of listeners.','8/14/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4500920-3544855.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179947,'nightlife|ladytron|ladytron|lp','Nightlife','Ladytron','Ladytron','LP','NTW317671.1','067003176712',22.39000000000000056,22.39000000000000056,'45380020','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700317671',NULL,0,'This newly compiled release - housed in a deluxe gatefold jacket and featuring iconic band photography - presents reinterpreted fan favourites and unreleased gems, offering a fresh take on Ladytron''s signature synthpop, electro, and darkwave sound. Immerse yourself in pulsating club mixes and moody atmospheric reinterpretations from albums such as Light & Magic, 604, Velocifero & Witching Hour, that breathe new life into Ladytron classics. More than just a collector''s item, Nightlife is a testament to the band''s lasting impact on electronic music.','11/27/2025',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4444939-3679424.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179948,'for mary|olive jones|olive jones|lp','For Mary','Olive Jones','Olive Jones','LP','NTW318571.1','067003185714',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'46167125','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700318571','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Singer-songwriter Olive Jones has a unique way of making us feel heard through her music. With her gorgeous soul and blues-influenced sound, not to mention her stunning voice, this future star draws you into her world, as though she''s singing for you and you alone. Her debut album, ''For Mary'', encapsulates these talents into one cohesive work, placing her at the forefront of a British soul renaissance.','6/19/2026',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4508773-3568178.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179949,'dirt|alice in chains|alice in chains|cd','Dirt','Alice in Chains','Alice in Chains','CD','SNY52475.2','074645247526',7.730000000000000426,7.730000000000000426,'04827733','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/07464524752',NULL,0,'Dirt is the second studio album by American rock band Alice in Chains, released on September 29, 1992, by Columbia Records. It was the band''s last album recorded with all four original members. The majority of the songs were written by guitarist Jerry Cantrell, but for the first time, vocalist Layne Staley wrote two songs by himself ("Hate to Feel" and "Angry Chair"), both also featuring Staley on guitar. The track "Iron Gland" features Tom Araya from Slayer on vocals. The album''s lyrics explore depression, pain, anger, anti-social behavior, relationships, drug (primarily heroin) addiction, war, death, and other emotionally charged topics.','9/29/1992',0.2399999999999999912,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/0/1/9/149101.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179950,'paradises iex|ladytron|ladytron|lp','Paradises (IEX)','Ladytron','Ladytron','LP','NTW318611.1','067003186117',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'45707261','2026-11-10 23:52:06','2026-11-10 23:52:06','/06700318611','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Indie Exclusive, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Paradises Green Vinyl. The iconic and influential electronic pop group Ladytron returns with a new album ''Paradises'' - their first since 2023''s critically acclaimed ''Time''s Arrow''. Spanning dance and indie movements since their formation in Liverpool at the end of the last millennium, Ladytron have earned a unique position by carving out new sonic and conceptual space, and refusing to abide by formula or trend. In the early 2000s, the fiercely individual group were placed at the forefront of the so-called electro-clash scene (which now enjoys another revival), but with time, they came to appreciate the pop cultural moment that they had reluctantly become part of. The new album follows a period of renewed cultural presence for the band. Their 2002 single "Seventeen" unexpectedly went viral on TikTok, introducing Ladytron''s sound to a new generation and amassing hundreds of thousands of fan-made clips. Their legacy was further acknowledged recently with "Destroy Everything You Touch," one of their most celebrated tracks, featured in the GRAMMY-nominated original Motion Picture Soundtrack of cult movie Saltburn, reaffirming Ladytron''s enduring appeal.','3/20/2026',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4472468-3493742.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179951,'the one day lp|tate mcrae|tate mcrae|lp','The One Day LP','Tate McRae','Tate McRae','LP','NTW317521.1','067003175210',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'45368363','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-10 23:52:07','/06700317521','(Colored Vinyl, Pink, Cream, Limited Edition, Reissue)',0,'Tate McRae''s ''The One Day LP'' is the point of origin for one of the biggest pop artists in the world. Available for the first time with limited edition "blue sky" artwork and guava pink "cream" vinyl, these 9 songs capture the defining elements of Tate''s songwriting, including hits "One Day" and "Teenage Mind" which have amassed over a half a billion streams to date.','10/17/2025',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4443909-3429348.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179952,'the miseducation of lauryn hill|lauryn hill|lauryn hill|cd','The Miseducation of Lauryn Hill','Lauryn Hill','Lauryn Hill','CD','SNY69035.2','074646903520',7.879999999999999894,7.879999999999999894,'05840649','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-10 23:52:07','/07464690352',NULL,0,'Grammy-winner Lauryn Hill (The Fugees) presents her solo debut - written, produced and arranged by Lauryn. Often personal and consistently universal in it''s subject, the Miseducation of Lauryn Hill meets and exceeds expectations on every level. True lyrics, soul-drenched vocals and club-banging beats join Ms. Hill''s uncommonly inventive orchestration of live instruments. Highlights include duets with D''Angelo and Mary J. Blige. 1st single: "Doo Wop (That Thing)."','8/25/1998',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/7/7/5/235776.jpg?ae=4621895153','Urban');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179953,'grace|jeff buckley|jeff buckley|cd','Grace','Jeff Buckley','Jeff Buckley','CD','SNY57528.2','074645752822',7.879999999999999894,7.879999999999999894,'04845317','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-21 16:08:52','/074645752822',NULL,0,NULL,'8/23/1994',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/3/7/9/149733.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179954,'tapestry|carole king|carole king|cd','Tapestry','Carole King','Carole King','CD','SNY65850.2','074646585023',7.879999999999999894,7.879999999999999894,'06323868','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-10 23:52:07','/07464658502','(Remastered)',0,'Certified 11X platinum, this groundbreaking pop masterpiece smashed all existing sales records upon its 1971 release and continues to sell more than 20,000 units a month after almost 30 years! Tapestry was #1 for 15 weeks and earned 4 Grammys. Now this essential classic LP returns, newly mastered with 2 unreleased bonus cuts ("Out in the Cold" and "Smackwater Jack" - live). The expanded edition booklet sports unpublished photos and memorabilia, original artwork and lyrics.','5/25/1999',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/6/8/4/264865.jpg?ae=4621895153','Singer/Songwriter');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179955,'it s not going to be okay|joshua burnside|joshua burnside|lp','It''s Not Going to Be Okay','Joshua Burnside','Joshua Burnside','LP','NTW318561.1','067003185615',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'45860614','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-10 23:52:07','/06700318561','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'When Belfast songwriter Joshua Burnside began writing ''It''s Not Going to Be Okay'', he wasn''t chasing a concept. He was trying to survive. The album was born from loss, written in the quiet aftermath of his closest friend Dean Jendoubi''s passing. In that stillness, Burnside stripped everything back. Gone were the dense textures and surreal folk tales; what remained were bare, trembling songs that told the truth.','3/27/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4484183-3504852.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179956,'tracy chapman|tracy chapman|tracy chapman|cd','Tracy Chapman','Tracy Chapman','Tracy Chapman','CD','EA60774.2','075596077422',8.519999999999999574,8.519999999999999574,'02263793','2026-11-10 23:52:07','2026-11-10 23:52:07','/07559607742',NULL,0,'Certified Multi-Platinum (6 times) by the RIAA. (11/01)','10/25/1990',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/9/5/3/153599.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179957,'hypernormal iex green|shelf lives|shelf lives|lp','Hypernormal (IEX) Green','Shelf Lives','Shelf Lives','LP','NQTS40.1','0725806902906',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'45760105','2026-11-10 23:52:08','2026-11-10 23:52:08','/072580690290','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Indie Exclusive)',0,'Shelf Lives are an Electro-Bass Punk (a genre that probably doesn''t exist-but somehow makes perfect sense when you hear them). After years of creating, releasing, and caring-ish what people think, the band now operate with zero hesitation and total authenticity. The result of this controlled chaos is their debut album ''hypernormaL''. The 11-track album, produced by imdead, reveals that Shelf Lives are once again redefining the boundaries of modern punk and electronic music. It captures the duo at their most uncompromising - blistering, self-aware, and disturbingly danceable. Just when you think you''ve figured them out, Shelf Lives grin, twist the dial, and push the needle into the red. The album sees the band collaborating with an enviable list of who''s who, from Danio (Fred Again, Joy Anonymous, Jelani Blackman) on 60K, to writing with Pat Alvarez (Blessed Madonna, Joy Crookes, Good Neighbours) and Lola Sam from Hot Wax playing bass on ''like heR''.','3/13/2026',0.4699999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/4477004-3494763.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179958,'pursuit of anything|vacations|vacations|lp','Pursuit of Anything','Vacations','Vacations','LP','NTW318821.1','067003188210',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'46264190','2026-11-10 23:52:08','2026-11-10 23:52:08','/06700318821','(Colored Vinyl, Green, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Pursuit of Anything'' captures Vacations at a turning point as frontman Campbell Burns reflects on the disorienting, often contradictory experience of growing up, tracing his path from Newcastle (Australia) to Los Angeles and New York - caught between ambition and the more traditional lives unfolding back home. Written by the band and produced by Campbell Burns, the album finds Vacations operating as a fully creative force with Burns drawing constant inspiration from his bandmates'' lives and perspectives: exploring how they''re each living out different lives yet share a common experience, all in their own "pursuits." The result is a richer, more intricate, and emotionally expansive sound, with mixing by Beatriz Artola (Geese, Caamp). Arriving as the band solidify their place as one of the most globally resonant indie acts of their generation with sold-out world tours, double-platinum certified hits, and over 3.5 billion streams. The record turns inward, driven by the push and pull of devotion to music, relationships, and self-discovery. It is this tension that fuels an earnest, dreamy pop album that feels instantly classic. ''Pursuit of Anything'' is pressed on Evergreen vinyl and housed in a gatefold jacket.','10/2/2026',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4514420-3594294.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179959,'hoochie coochie man live at the rising sun celebrity jazz club|muddy waters|muddy waters|lp','Hoochie Coochie Man: Live At The Rising Sun Celebrity Jazz Club','Muddy Waters','Muddy Waters','LP','JUT449142.1','068944914210',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'30767607','2026-11-10 23:52:08','2026-11-10 23:52:08','/06894491421','(180 Gram Vinyl, Digital Download Card)',0,NULL,'4/16/2016',1.070000000000000062,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/0/2/9/3309202.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179960,'jar of flies ep|alice in chains|alice in chains|cd','Jar Of Flies (ep)','Alice in Chains','Alice in Chains','CD','SNY57628.2','074645762821',7.879999999999999894,7.879999999999999894,'04846284','2026-11-10 23:52:08','2026-11-21 16:08:51','/074645762821','(Extended Play)',0,'Jar of Flies is the second studio EP by the American rock band Alice in Chains, released on January 25, 1994, through Columbia Records. It is the first EP in music history to debut at number one on the Billboard 200 Chart with the first week sales exceeding 141, 000 copies in the United States. The EP was well received by critics and has since been certified triple-platinum by the RIAA and has gone on to sell 4 million copies worldwide, making Jar of Flies one of the band''s most successful releases.','1/25/1994',0.2300000000000000099,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/7/7/9/149774.jpg?ae=4662083153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179961,'saving grace all that glitters with suzi dian|robert plant|robert plant|lp','Saving Grace: All That Glitters... with Suzi Dian','Robert Plant','Robert Plant','LP','NNS789335.1','075597893359',17.44999999999999929,17.44999999999999929,'45973833','2026-11-10 23:52:08','2026-11-10 23:52:08','/07559789335','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'Nonesuch releases a vinyl EP from Robert Plant this Record Store Day, Saving Grace: All That Glitters... The record follows his recent critically acclaimed album, Saving Grace; both feature singer Suzi Dian, and a band of musicians from the English countryside that Plant calls home. The EP''s four tracks, recently recorded especially for RSD, explore the folk and Americana songs that Plant and the band love: the traditional tunes "The Blackest Crow" and "Two Coats," arranged by Robert Plant and Saving Grace, as well as Gillian Welch''s "Orphan Girl" and Bert Jansch''s "Poison."','4/18/2026',0.3900000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4491613-3522872.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179962,'the unsung adventures of punch brothers|punch brothers|punch brothers|lp','The Unsung Adventures Of Punch Brothers','Punch Brothers','Punch Brothers','LP','NNS728993.1','075597892369',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'46205605','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559789236','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold)',0,'The Unsung Adventures of Punch Brothers is the seventh album from the Grammy┬«-winning band-and it''s first comprising all instrumental tunes, as well as it''s first with fiddle player Brittany Haas, who joined the quintet in 2023. The album features eight new original compositions by Punch Brothers plus three traditional songs they arranged. The album''s title is more than a play on words: without lyrics to guide the listener, these are stories, impressions, and emotions communicated entirely with strings through melody, harmony, rhythm, and a literary sense of musical structure. For a band known for pushing acoustic music into unexpected places, going fully instrumental may be the most adventurous move they have made yet. The Unsung Adventures of Punch Brothers is produced by the band and engineered by Joseph Lorge.','7/24/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4512066-3665741.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179963,'honora|flea|flea|lp','Honora','Flea','Flea','LP','NNS728540.1','075597893588',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45921490','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559789358','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Red Vinyl, double LPs with music on three sides. The fourth side features silkscreen designs on the color pressings. After a nearly five-decade (and counting) career as one of his generation''s defining rock bassists, Flea releases his first full-length solo album, Honora, March 27, 2026, on Nonesuch Records. Time and space have finally allowed him to return to his first musical loves: jazz and playing the trumpet. The song "Traffic Lights, " co-written with Thom Yorke and Josh Johnson, accompanies the album announcement.','3/27/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4487568-3513591.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179964,'evergreen rsd|the paper kites||lp','Evergreen (RSD)','The Paper Kites',NULL,'LP','NTW31321.1','06700313211',16.0,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/the-paper-kites-evergreen-rsd/06700313211',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179965,'what did the blackbird say to the crow|rhiannon giddens|rhiannon giddens|lp','What Did The Blackbird Say To The Crow','Rhiannon Giddens','Rhiannon Giddens','LP','NNS727511.1','075597896756',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'44971984','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559789675',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Rhiannon Giddens reunites with her former Carolina Chocolate Drops bandmate Justin Robinson on What Did the Blackbird Say to the Crow, an album of North Carolina fiddle and banjo music. Produced by Giddens and Joseph "joebass" DeJarnette, the album features Giddens on banjo and Robinson on fiddle, with the duo playing eighteen of their favorite North Carolina tunes: a mix of instrumentals and tunes with words. Many were learned from their late mentor, the legendary North Carolina Piedmont musician Joe Thompson; one is from another musical hero, the late Etta Baker, from whom they also learned by listening to recordings of her playing. Giddens and Robinson recorded outdoors at Thompson''s and Baker''s North Carolina homes, as well as the former plantation Mill Prong House. They were accompanied by the sounds of nature, including two different broods of cicadas, which had not emerged simultaneously since 1803, creating a true once-in-a-lifetime soundscape','4/18/2025',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/4407033-3384092.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179966,'so long little miss sunshine|molly tuttle|molly tuttle|lp','So Long Little Miss Sunshine','Molly Tuttle','Molly Tuttle','LP','NNS727824.1','075597896299',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45265839','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559789629','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Pink, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'So Long Little Miss Sunshine (140grAm, Baby Pink Vinyl)(Indie Exclusive) Following back-to-back Grammy-winning albums with her band Golden Highway, along with a Best New Artist nomination, Molly Tuttle releases her new solo album, So Long Little Miss Sunshine, on August 15, 2025 via Nonesuch Records. Recorded in Nashville with producer Jay Joyce (Orville Peck, Miranda Lambert, Lainey Wilson), the fifth full album from the singer, songwriter, and virtuoso guitarist marks a sonic departure from her recent work and features twelve new songsΓÇöeleven originals and one cover, of Icona On her new albumΓÇöa hybrid of pop, country, rock, and flat-picking, plus one murder balladΓÇöTuttle goes to a whole new place. Her virtuoso guitar work takes center stage on this album more than ever, and for the first time, she introduces her banjo playing into two of her recordings.ΓÇ£I like to be a bit of a chameleon with my music. Keep people guessing and keep it full of surprises,ΓÇ¥ she says. So Long Little Miss Sunshine was recorded with drummer/percussionists Jay Bellerose and Fred Eltringham, bassist Byron House, and Joyce on multiple instruments. Ketch Secor (Old Crow Medicine Show) also plays banjo, fiddle, and harmonica, as well as singing harmony; much of the LP was co-written with Secor, who is also TuttleΓÇÖs partner. ΓÇ£We spend so much time together, we live together, and anytime I have a song idea, or he has one, itΓÇÖs just so easy to transition from whatever weΓÇÖre doing into writing a so Tuttle also conceived the artwork for So Long Little Miss Sunshine, which features multiple Mollys, each wearing a different wig except for one with nothing on her head at all. Tuttle has been bald since she was three years old due to the autoimmune condition alopecia areata; she acts as a spokesperson for the National Alopecia Areata Foundation. SO LONG LITTLE MISS SUNSHINE by MOLLY TUTTLE','8/15/2025',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4434228-3404958.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179967,'greatest hits|the cure|the cure|cd','Greatest Hits','The Cure','The Cure','CD','EA62726.2','075596272629',10.84999999999999965,10.84999999999999965,'08274649','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559627262',NULL,0,'Featuring sixteen of the The Cure''s essential best, along with 2 new songs, "Cut Here" and "Just Say Yes".','11/13/2001',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/8/6/4/394688.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(179968,'yankee hotel foxtrot 2022 remaster|wilco|wilco|lp','Yankee Hotel Foxtrot (2022 Remaster)','Wilco','Wilco','LP','NNS681024.1','075597910605',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'42664819','2026-11-10 23:52:09','2026-11-10 23:52:09','/07559791060','(Remastered)',0,'THIS IS A REMASTER OF THE ORIGINAL ALBUM Yankee Hotel Foxtrot was widely acclaimed as one of 2002ΓÇÖs best albums, appearing in year-end lists of Mojo, NME, Q, Rolling Stone, and Uncut, among many others. Yankee Hotel Foxtrot also was featured in multiple decade-end lists, with Rolling Stone naming it #3 Album of the 2000s, as well as many Greatest Albums of All Time lists, including in the NME. Among YankeeΓÇÖs inspirations was a recording Tweedy bought at Tower Records in the late 1990s, The Conet Project: Recordings of Shortwave Numbers Stations. As Bob Mehr points out in his new album note, the record got ΓÇ£deep under TweedyΓÇÖs skin.ΓÇ¥ Tweedy said in his 2017 memoir, LetΓÇÖs Go (So We Can Get Back), ΓÇ£It was as fascinating to me as anything being made by actual musicians using actual instruments ΓÇª I wanted to know why it was so hypnotic to me. Why could I listen to hours of this stuff, even though I had no clue what any of them were saying. That question became the foundation for Yankee Hotel Foxtrot ΓÇª the way people communicated or ultimately failed to communicate.ΓÇ¥ The album takes its title from a haunting recording of a woman repeating those words that is included in The Conet Project; that recording is sampled in the penultimate song on Yankee Hotel Foxtrot, ΓÇ£Poor Places.ΓÇ¥ΓÇ£ Conceptually, Tweedy had decided to focus on a big idea for the next album: the state of America. His lyricsΓÇöoften distilled from scribbled pages of free verse or poetryΓÇöbecame a form of inquiry,ΓÇ¥ Mehr continues. Tweedy said, in 2004, ΓÇ£I wanted to write about the stuff right in front of my eyes, microscopically looking at America and asking questions about each little thing ΓÇª How can there be all these good things and things that I love about America, alongside all of these things that IΓÇÖm ashamed of? And that was an internal question, too; I think I felt that way about myself.ΓÇ¥ Mehr says, ΓÇ£Exploring those questions, while weaving in strands of Eastern philosophy and bits of autobiographyΓÇöYankee lyrics would be loaded with the pained imagery of someone suffering from migraines and mental health issuesΓÇöTweedy would conjure a deep examination of both country and self.ΓÇ¥Describing the uncanny, strangely prescient feeling of the album, which Wilco began offering as a free stream on its website in 2001, Mehr notes: ΓÇ£In the wake of 9/11, Yankee Hotel Foxtrot would be burdened with unintended meaning. The disc had originally been scheduled for a September 11 release. Its coverΓÇöa Sam Jones-shot image of ChicagoΓÇÖs twin Marina Towers angled in looming fashionΓÇöbore an eerie resemblance to the felled World Trade Center towers. And the songsΓÇöwith titles like ΓÇÿAshes of American FlagsΓÇÖ and ΓÇÿWar on War,ΓÇÖ and lyrics about how ΓÇÿtall buildings shake, sad voices escapeΓÇÖΓÇötook on a terrible new resonance.ΓÇ¥ WILCO / YANKEE HOTEL FOXTROT (2022 REMASTER)','9/30/2022',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/53/4093853-2831547.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
