INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180092,'the vandalist|noga erez|noga erez|lp','The Vandalist','Noga Erez','Noga Erez','LP','ATL623776.1','075678623776',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'44451776','2026-11-10 23:52:29','2026-11-10 23:52:29','/07567862377','(Colored Vinyl, Black Ice)',0,'Limited black ice colored vinyl LP pressing.','9/20/2024',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4351952-3194527.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180093,'submarine|marias|marias|lp','Submarine','Marias','Marias','LP','ATL621918.1','075678621918',23.98999999999999844,23.98999999999999844,'44244552','2026-11-10 23:52:30','2026-11-10 23:52:30','/07567862191','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. 2024 release, the sophomore album from Grammy-nominated band The Mar├¡as. Submarine represents themes of solitude and exploration for The Mar├¡as, delving into the complexities of human emotion and what it means to choose solitude, and the pain and beauty so inextricably interwoven within it. New single "Run Your Mouth" is just the first introduction into the band''s immersive world inspired by this album. Submarine is a follow up to the band''s critically acclaimed GRAMMY-nominated debut album Cinema (2021), with lead single "Hush" going No.1on Billboard''s Adult Alternative Airplay chart. Known for delivering striking visuals that compliment their dreamlike songs, the band continues to create a unique and transformative experience for fans and audiences alike.','5/31/2024',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4320828-3726093.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180094,'don t get too close|skrillex|skrillex|lp','Don''t Get Too Close','Skrillex','Skrillex','LP','ATL625268.1','075678625268',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'43361281','2026-11-10 23:52:30','2026-11-10 23:52:30','/07567862526',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Don''t Get Too Close sees Skrillex stretching his multi-hyphenate prowess even further with an intricate and beautiful pop structured album offering up some of his most vulnerable and intimate work to date. After spending much time during the pandemic at Rick Rubin''s Shari-La Studios and traveling around Europe endlessly collaborating with some of the most forward thinking and avante garde voices in music, Skrillex was inspired with this project and delivered something completely open, brave and organic that is unique not just for him but for the music landscape at large and can be felt from the title track where he sings alongside close collaborator Bibi Bourelly. Don''t Get Too Close is an off kilter personal pop-leaning album where the masterful producer pours every ounce of skill and personality into the songs creating a highly personal and relatable album with small universes built into each song.','7/7/2023',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4190660-3027863.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180095,'an evening with silk sonic|bruno mars anderson paak silk sonic|bruno mars anderson paak silk sonic|lp','An Evening With Silk Sonic','Bruno Mars, Anderson .Paak, Silk Sonic','Bruno Mars, Anderson .Paak, Silk Sonic','LP','ATL626654.1','075678626654',23.98999999999999844,23.98999999999999844,'43258321','2026-11-10 23:52:30','2026-11-10 23:52:30','/07567862665',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The seeds of the collaboration were planted in 2017 when Anderson. Paak and Bruno Mars toured together on the European leg of his 24K Magic World Tour. One late-night jam session on the road unlocked immediate chemistry. Just before the world slipped into quarantine, Bruno called Anderson: "Remember that idea we had back in 2017? Let''s do it. " One studio session grew into to a months-long collaboration, culminating the "setlist of doom. " Legendary Bootsy Collins christened Silk Sonic and came in as the "special guest host" for An Evening With Silk Sonic, their debut album. Silk Sonic was finally set free on March 5th, 2021. Within less than a month, their debut single "Leave The Door Open" cracked over 230 million streams, and currently sits at 1. 2 billion streams with over 346 million official video views. It reeled in rave reviews, including Variety who noted it "could be a Best R&B Song Grammy winner from 1974."','3/10/2023',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4168474-2933110.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
