INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180105,'aurora|daisy jones the six|daisy jones the six|lp','Aurora','Daisy Jones & The Six','Daisy Jones & The Six','LP','ATL626272.1','075678626272',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43288212','2026-11-10 23:52:31','2026-11-10 23:52:31','/07567862627',NULL,0,'Daisy Jones & The Six - AURORA - In 1977, Daisy Jones & The Six were on top of the world. - Fronted by two charismatic lead singers-Daisy Jones (Riley Keough) and Billy Dunne (Sam Claflin)-the band had risen from obscurity to fame. And then, after a sold-out show at Chicago''s Soldier Field, they called it quits. Now, decades later, the band members finally agree to reveal the truth. This is the story of how an iconic band imploded at the height of it''s powers The "Daisy Jones & The Six" Show Cast includes, Sebastian Chacon, Reiley Keough, Sam Claflin, Suki Waterhouse, Camila Morrone','3/3/2023',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4179959-2943664.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180106,'the band camino|band camino|band camino|lp','The Band Camino','Band Camino','Band Camino','LP','EA659058.1','075678643422',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'41822210','2026-11-10 23:52:31','2026-11-10 23:52:31','/07567864342',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2021 release from the Nashville-based rock trio. The album follows the release of three previous EP releases.','6/10/2022',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/3988340-2722717.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180107,'caprisongs|fka twigs|fka twigs|lp','CAPRISONGS [Explicit Content]','FKA Twigs','FKA Twigs','LP','ATL635724.1','075678635724',17.80000000000000071,17.80000000000000071,'42970552','2026-11-10 23:52:31','2026-11-10 23:52:31','/07567863572','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl)',0,'FKAtwigs'' highly anticipated mixtape CAPRISONGS is now on vinyl. The mixtape documentstwigs'' "journey back to myself through my amazing collaborators and friends. " and showcases an evolution and expansion for this prolific artist who continues to thoughtfully push at the edges of her art. "CAPRISONGS... it''s bronzer in the sink, alco pop on the side, a cherry lolly, apple juice when you''re thirsty, friends in the park, your favourite person, that one sentence somebody said to you that changed everything, a club pre-game, your bestie who is always late but brings the most to the party, meeting a friend at the airport, just togetherness. " - FKAtwigs. CAPRISONGSfeatures collaborations with Pa Salieu (on "honda,"), Daniel Caesar ("careless"), Rema ("jealousy"), Jorja Smith and Unknown T ("darjeeling"), DYSTOPIA ("which way") and Shygirl ("papi bones") in addition to the previously released single "tears in the club", which sawtwigsteaming up with The Weeknd for her biggest track to date.','9/23/2022',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4131336-2877708.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180108,'tell me that it s over|wallows|wallows|lp','Tell Me That It''s Over','Wallows','Wallows','LP','ATL39364.1','075678639364',17.80000000000000071,17.80000000000000071,'42452522','2026-11-10 23:52:31','2026-11-10 23:52:31','/07567863936',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2022 release. Ever-evolving band Wallows announce their highly anticipated sophomore album, Tell Me That It''s Over. The album was produced by the multi-Grammy Award winning Ariel Rechtshaid (Vampire Weekend, Haim, Adele) and contains 10 tracks informed by everything from lo-fi post-punk to indie-folk to early-''90s dance-pop psychedelia.','3/25/2022',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4062610-2793475.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180109,'never trust a happy song|grouplove|grouplove|lp','Never Trust A Happy Song','Grouplove','Grouplove','LP','ATL659125.1','075678643125',24.23000000000000042,24.23000000000000042,'41921241','2026-11-10 23:52:31','2026-11-10 23:52:31','/07567864312','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'It''s been ten years since Grouplove met on a commune in Greece and brought the idea of forming a band back to California. They''d never have anticipated making it this far: five albums, multiple chart-topping singles across alternative and pop formats, a Grammy nomination, and critical acclaim from outlets such as Rolling Stone, which heralded the group as "a band who have perfected big, radio-friendly rock songs." As their debut album ''Never Trust A Happy Song'' approaches it''s tenth anniversary, Grouplove is ready to celebrate with the fans by releasing a limited edition vinyl, pressed on 180 gram green vinyl.','2/11/2022',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/3997348-2733879.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180110,'in the mountain in the cloud|portugal the man|portugal the man|lp','In The Mountain In The Cloud','Portugal the Man','Portugal the Man','LP','ATL666962.1','075678641862',17.96999999999999887,17.96999999999999887,'41946565','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567864186',NULL,0,'The sixth studio album by psychedelic rock band Portugal. The Man was recorded over a period of eight months, and produced by John Hill, the band''s frontman John Gourley, and Casey Bates. Originally released on July 19, 2011 through Atlantic Records, In The Mountain In The Cloud is Portugal. The Man''s major-label debut.','2/25/2022',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/3999810-2735356.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180111,'yourself or someone like you rocktober crystal clear diamond vinyl|matchbox twenty|matchbox twenty|lp','Yourself or Someone Like You (ROCKTOBER) [Crystal Clear Diamond Vinyl]','Matchbox Twenty','Matchbox Twenty','LP','ATL630217.1','075678630217',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'43806850','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567863021','(Clear Vinyl, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'Yourself or Someone Like You is Matchbox Twenty''s debut studio album, originally released in 1996. The album spawned several U.S. Top 40 smashes including "Push," "3am," "Real World" and "Back 2 Good". Featuring themes of adolescence, loneliness, psychological abuse, humiliation, depression, anger, and alcoholism, the album sold several million copies in the U.S., ultimately achieving a Diamond certification.','10/6/2023',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4247386-3039264.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180112,'an evening with silk sonic|bruno mars anderson paak silk sonic|bruno mars anderson paak silk sonic|cd','An Evening With Silk Sonic','Bruno Mars, Anderson .Paak, Silk Sonic','Bruno Mars, Anderson .Paak, Silk Sonic','CD','ATL642128.2','075678642128',14.07000000000000028,14.07000000000000028,'42151500','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567864212',NULL,0,'2021 release form this collaborative project featuring Bruno Mars and Anderson. Paak. The seeds of the collaboration were planted in 2017 when the two stars toured together in Europe. One late-night jam session on the road unlocked immediate chemistry. Just before the world slipped into quarantine, Bruno called Anderson: "Remember that idea we had back in 2017? Let''s do it. " One studio session grew into to a months-long collaboration, culminating the "setlist of doom. " Legendary Bootsy Collins christened Silk Sonic and came in as the "special guest host" for An Evening With Silk Sonic, their debut album.','11/12/2021',0.1799999999999999934,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4020681-2756306.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180113,'in these silent days|brandi carlile|brandi carlile|lp','In These Silent Days','Brandi Carlile','Brandi Carlile','LP','LWCY659119.1','075678643170',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'41901748','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567864317',NULL,0,'Brandi Carlile''s new album, In These Silent Days, October 2021 via Low Country Sound/Elektra Records. It''s the follow-up to her 2018 album By The Way, I Forgive You, and she recorded it at Nashville''s RCA Studio A with producers Dave Cobb and Shooter Jennings. Tim Hanseroth (vocals, bass), Phil Hanseroth (vocals, guitar), Cobb (guitar, percussion), Jennings (piano, organ, synth), Chris Powell (drums, percussion), and Josh Neumann (strings) all appear on the album, and Jess Wolfe and Holly Laessig of Lucius make a guest appearance, adding backing vocals to "You And Me On The Rock."','10/1/2021',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/3994889-2730723.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180114,'scaled and icy|twenty one pilots|twenty one pilots|lp','Scaled And Icy','Twenty One Pilots','Twenty One Pilots','LP','FUEL667027.1','075678641558',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'41937112','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567864155',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2021 release. Written and largely produced by Joseph in isolation over the course of the past year at his home studio, with Dun engineering the album''s drums from across the country, Scaled And Icy is the product of long-distance virtual sessions and finds the duo processing their upended routines along with the prevailing emotions of 2020 - anxiety, loneliness, boredom, and doubt. The duo had to forgo their normal studio sessions but reached a new of level of introspection in the process, adopting a more imaginative and bold approach to their songwriting. The result is a collection of songs that push forward through setbacks and focus on the possibilities worth remembering.','11/19/2021',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/3999186-2734175.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180115,'this is why|paramore|paramore|lp','This Is Why','Paramore','Paramore','LP','ATL635526.1','075678635526',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43048007','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567863552',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2023 release. This Is Why is the sixth studio album by Paramore. It is the band''s first album in nearly six years, following After Laughter (2017), as well as their first album to feature the same line-up as it''s predecessor. Includes the single This Is Why.','2/10/2023',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4140999-2948277.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180116,'when christmas comes around|kelly clarkson|kelly clarkson|lp','When Christmas Comes Around...','Kelly Clarkson','Kelly Clarkson','LP','ATL677252.1','075678639593',17.80000000000000071,17.80000000000000071,'42905424','2026-11-10 23:52:32','2026-11-10 23:52:32','/07567863959',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2021 holiday album from the American Idol winner. Led by the fabulously bold lead single "Christmas Isn''t Canceled (Just You)," the album explores a wide range of holiday emotions and experiences anchored by Clarkson''s incomparable vocal prowess. From the show-stopping duet "Santa, Can''t You Hear Me" featuring Ariana Grande to the hauntingly beautiful ballad "Merry Christmas (To The One I Used To Know), When Christmas Comes Around... explores a wide range of holiday emotions and experiences anchored by Clarkson''s incomparable vocal prowess. The album also features cheerful standout "Glow" featuring Chris Stapleton.','10/28/2022',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4123087-2865101.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal,Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180117,'yourself or someone like you|matchbox twenty|matchbox twenty|lp','Yourself Or Someone Like You','Matchbox Twenty','Matchbox Twenty','LP','ATL786410.1','075678641039',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'45027109','2026-11-10 23:52:34','2026-11-10 23:52:34','/07567864103',NULL,0,'Yourself Or Someone Like You (20th Anniversary) [Grey Vinyl] is a undefined Records & LPs from Matchbox Twenty','10/13/2023',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4412947-3681820.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180118,'rks live from athens georgia|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|lp','RKS! Live From Athens Georgia','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','LP','EA655980.1','075678643712',56.43999999999999773,56.43999999999999773,'41886786','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864371',NULL,0,'Triple vinyl LP pressing includes etched D side.. Genre-defying, Nashville-based quintet Rainbow Kitten Surprise have announced their first official live album, RKS! Live From Athens Georgia. The 25-song collection was recorded during a two-night stand at The Georgia Theatre in Athens, GA, on the band''s 2019 sold out North American tour.','8/13/2021',1.939999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/3993396-2729275.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180119,'the academy is almost here|academy is|academy is|lp','The Academy Is... Almost Here','Academy Is','Academy Is','LP','FUEL645941.1','075678645570',20.42999999999999972,20.42999999999999972,'41287217','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864557','(Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Silver, Reissue)',0,'Deluxe edition colored vinyl LP pressing. In celebration of Fueled By Ramen''s 25th anniversary, Chicago-based melodic pop-punk outfit The Academy Is...''s classic 2005 debut studio album, Almost Here is reissued here on colored vinyl! Slickly produced by James Paul Wisner and featuring the namemaking singles "Checkmarks," "Slow Down" and "The Phrase That Pays," "Almost Here is a non-stop whirlwind of glossy emo pop that could easily stand alongside any release this scene has witnessed. Not only was the album a near-perfect debut, it was also the best album the band would release during their startlingly brief career" (It''s All Dead).','1/29/2021',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/3917843-2662580.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180120,'in these silent days deluxe edition in the canyon haze|brandi carlile|brandi carlile|lp','In These Silent Days (Deluxe Edition) In The Canyon Haze','Brandi Carlile','Brandi Carlile','LP','EA638206.1','075678638206',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'42992769','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567863820','(Deluxe Edition)',0,'Brandi Carlile - In These Silent Days (Deluxe Edition) In The Canyon Haze - Hear the singer-songwriter team with her wife, Catherine Carlile, on a new version of "You And Me On The Rock" from the forthcoming deluxe edition.','12/2/2022',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4134087-2881522.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alt-Country & Americana');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180121,'take this to your grave fbr 25th anniversary edition silver vinyl|fall out boy|fall out boy|lp','Take This To Your Grave  (FBR 25th Anniversary Edition Silver Vinyl)','Fall Out Boy','Fall Out Boy','LP','FUEL645943.1','075678645594',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'41489895','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864559','(Colored Vinyl, Silver)',0,'Limited silver colored vinyl LP pressing. Take This to Your Grave is the debut studio album by rock band Fall Out Boy, originally released on May 6, 2003. When the band was signed to Island Records, the label employed an unusual strategy that allowed them to sign with independent label Fueled by Ramen for their debut and later move to Island for their second album. Sean O''Keefe had helped with the band''s demo, and they returned to Smart Studios in Madison, Wisconsin to record the bulk of their first album with him. Living on a stranger''s floor for part of the time and running out of money halfway through, the band recorded seven songs in nine days, bringing them together with the additional three from the demo.','4/30/2021',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/3949081-2702697.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180122,'flowers for vases descansos|hayley williams|hayley williams|lp','FLOWERS for VASES /  descansos','Hayley Williams','Hayley Williams','LP','ATL655970.1','075678643750',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'41916759','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864375',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Hayley Williams, lead singer of Paramore, recently celebrated the surprise release of her second solo project, Flowers For Vases/Descansos. The gripping album was written and performed in it''s entirety by Hayley Williams, a career first for the music industry titan. Recorded at her home in Nashville, the 14-track album spans from stories of love to stories of loss. "In a world that often requires us to ignore our deepest needs, Hayley Williams does not provide a light at the end of the tunnel or a closed door, but a new body, a new tongue, and possibly a new frame of reference to survive and even thrive," writes NPR. Named one of the best albums of the year so far by outlets such as Rolling Stone and SPIN.','9/10/2021',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/3996648-2731481.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180123,'glow on|turnstile|turnstile|lp','Glow On','Turnstile','Turnstile','LP','RRD654153.1','075678644436',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'41891056','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864443',NULL,0,'Recorded with producer Mike Elizondo and co-produced by Yates,GLOW ON follows TURNSTILEΓÇÖs 2018 album TIME & SPACE, which saw the Baltimore band charting new ground for hardcore, expanding stylistic boundaries and celebrating new possibilities. With GLOW ON that utopic vision is fully realized; 15 tracks devoid of borders, boundaries, or entry obstacles, only abundant imagination, heart, and grooves plucked from all corners of the musical spectrum. GLOW ON includes the singles ΓÇ£HOLIDAY,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£MYSTERY,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£NO SURPRISE,ΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£T.L.C. (TURNSTILE LOVE CONNECTION) from TURNSTILEΓÇÖs recent TURNSTILE LOVE CONNECTION EP and companion short film. GLOW ON also includes guest features from Blood Orange on ΓÇ£ALIEN LOVE CALL,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£LONELY DEZIRES,ΓÇ¥ with additional vocal contributions on ΓÇ£ENDLESS.ΓÇ¥ BAND: Brendan Yates (Vocals) Franz Lyons (Bass/Vocals) Brady Ebert (Guitars) Pat McCrory (Guitars) Daniel Fang (Drums) Comprised of Brendan Yates (Vocals), Franz Lyons (Bass/Vocals), Brady Ebert (Guitars), Pat McCrory (Guitars), and Daniel Fang (Drums), Turnstile has gripped listeners and press around the globe with their, "...melodic riffs, bright-eyed spirit, and riotous sets..." as noted by The New Yorker. NPR revered Turnstile as, "...freewheeling and heavy...with shout-along choruses and grooves that do more than just open up the pit," with The Washington Post adding, "...the unabashed funkiness of Turnstile feels so invigorating." Noisey declared, "...(Turnstile) has positively exploded, moving from exciting prospect to one of the most talked about bands in hardcore," while Stereogum asserted, "Right now, the biggest band in hardcore might be Turnstile... ." Thrasher Magazine wrote "These guys are powerful," with GQ agreeing, "Turnstile is more than a good hardcore band-they''ve got a whole movement behind them." TURNSTILE / GLOW ON','8/27/2021',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/3993976-2730124.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180124,'all we know is falling fbr 25th anniversary silver vinyl|paramore|paramore|lp','All We Know Is Falling (FBR 25th Anniversary silver vinyl)','Paramore','Paramore','LP','FUEL645946.1','075678645631',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'42109235','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864563','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited silver vinyl LP pressing. All We Know Is Falling is the debut studio album by Paramore, originally released in 2005. The production was led by James Paul Wisner, Mike Green, Nick Trevisick, and Roger Alan Nichols. All songs were written by vocalist Hayley Williams and guitarist Josh Farro. Mostly categorized as a pop punk album, the album received mostly positive reviews and has been labeled a "scene classic".','9/30/2022',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/4017145-2774226.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180125,'in these silent days|brandi carlile|brandi carlile|lp','In These Silent Days','Brandi Carlile','Brandi Carlile','LP','LWCY659120.1','075678643187',20.23000000000000042,20.23000000000000042,'41901991','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864318','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold)',0,NULL,'10/1/2021',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/90/3994890-2730724.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180126,'5 the gray chapter|slipknot|slipknot|lp','.5: The Gray Chapter','Slipknot','Slipknot','LP','RRD86457.1','075678645754',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'42768852','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864575','(Colored Vinyl, Pink)',0,'Limited pink colored vinyl LP pressing.5: The Gray Chapter is the fifth studio album by heavy metal band Slipknot, originally released in 2014. It was the first studio album by the band in six years and the first not to feature original founding members bassist Paul Gray and drummer Joey Jordison due to the death of Gray in 2010 (the title of the album being a reference to his surname), and Jordison being fired from the band in late 2013.','7/22/2022',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4107489-2846088.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180127,'vol 3 the subliminal verses|slipknot|slipknot|lp','Vol. 3 The Subliminal Verses','Slipknot','Slipknot','LP','RRD645935.1','075678645730',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'42661368','2026-11-10 23:52:35','2026-11-10 23:52:35','/07567864573','(Colored Vinyl, Violet)',0,'Slipknot - VOLUME 3 The Subliminal Verses (Violet Vinyl) Vol. 3: (The Subliminal Verses) is the third studio album by American heavy metal band Slipknot, released on May 25, 2004, by Roadrunner Records. A special edition, containing a bonus disc, was released on April 12, 2005. It is the band''s only album produced by Rick Rubin','7/1/2022',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4093391-2827441.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180128,'vessel fbr 25th anniversary silver vinyl|twenty one pilots|twenty one pilots|lp','Vessel (FBR 25th Anniversary Silver Vinyl)','Twenty One Pilots','Twenty One Pilots','LP','FUEL645686.1','075678645686',17.80000000000000071,17.80000000000000071,'42294061','2026-11-10 23:52:36','2026-11-10 23:52:36','/07567864568','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',1,'Fueled By Ramen 25th Anniversary Silver Vinyl version. 2021 Fueled By Ramen Celebrates it''s 25th Anniversary by reissuing a classic Fueled By Ramen release on limited edition silver vinyl.','1/14/2022',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4035361-2774227.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180129,'riot fbr 25th anniversary edition|paramore|paramore|lp','Riot! (FBR 25th Anniversary Edition)','Paramore','Paramore','LP','FUEL645950.1','075678645679',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'41640005','2026-11-10 23:52:36','2026-11-10 23:52:36','/07567864567','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited silver colored vinyl LP pressing. Fueled By Ramen is celebrating it''s 25th Anniversary by releasing classic albums from it''s history on silver vinyl.','5/28/2021',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/3967065-3243452.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180130,'blurryface silver vinyl fbr anniversary|twenty one pilots|twenty one pilots|lp','Blurryface (Silver Vinyl FBR Anniversary)','Twenty One Pilots','Twenty One Pilots','LP','FUEL645944.1','075678645617',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'42099574','2026-11-10 23:52:36','2026-11-21 16:09:02','/075678645617','(Colored Vinyl, Silver)',0,'In celebration of Fueled By Ramen''s 25th anniversary comes the release of Twenty One Pilots double platinum release, "Blurryface" on silver vinyl','10/15/2021',1.189999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4016483-2752691.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180131,'iowa|slipknot|slipknot|lp','Iowa','Slipknot','Slipknot','LP','RRD645934.1','075678645716',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'42614692','2026-11-10 23:52:36','2026-11-10 23:52:36','/07567864571','(Clear Vinyl, Coke Bottle Green)',0,'Double translucent coke bottle green colored vinyl LP pressing. Iowa is the second studio album by Slipknot. Released by Roadrunner Records on August 28, 2001, it was produced by Ross Robinson and Slipknot. The title derives from the band''s home state, Iowa, which members have stated is one of their greatest sources of inspiration. With much anticipation for the album following the success of their 1999 self-titled debut, pressures on the band were high. Their relationships with each other suffered and this was later described as the darkest time of their career. It was also the first full album to feature guitarist Jim Root after only appearing on two songs from their previous album.','5/13/2022',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4085672-2819491.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180132,'sound fury|sturgill simpson|sturgill simpson|lp','Sound & Fury','Sturgill Simpson','Sturgill Simpson','LP','EA865178.1','075678651786',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'39446725','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567865178','(Black)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2019 release from the Grammy Award winning artist. Produced by Simpson, Sound & Fury, was recorded primarily at the McGuire Motor Inn in Waterford, Michigan, with his bandmates Bobby Emmett, Chuck Bartels, Miles Miller, who all serve as co-producers along with Grammy nominee John Hill (Cage The Elephant, Portugal. The Man, Bleachers). The album - which Simpson describes as "a sleazy, steamy rock n roll record" - is a marked departure from 2016''s acclaimed A Sailor''s Guide To Earth, which won Best Country Album and was nominated for Album of the Year at the 59th Grammy Awards.','9/27/2019',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/3720696-2510490.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180133,'petals for armor|hayley williams|hayley williams|lp','Petals For Armor [Explicit Content]','Hayley Williams','Hayley Williams','LP','ATL627548.1','075678649950',29.96000000000000085,29.96000000000000085,'40215235','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567864995','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2020 release. Hayley Williams hugely anticipated debut solo album Petals For Armor arrives via Atlantic Records. Produced by Taylor York - Williams'' lead collaborator in the Grammy Award-winning Paramore - the album was heralded earlier this month by the acclaimed first single, "Simmer". The smoldering track arrived alongside it''s own Warren Fu-directed video, providing a compelling first chapter to a continuing storyline.','5/8/2020',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/3790792-2542168.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180134,'dirty computer|janelle monae|janelle monae|lp','Dirty Computer [Explicit Content]','Janelle Monae','Janelle Monae','LP','BAD567348.1','075678657900',20.23000000000000042,20.23000000000000042,'36576241','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567865790','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Digital Download Card)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2018 release, the third studio album by singer Janelle Mon├íe. Dirty Computer is the follow up to her critically acclaimed studio albums, The ArchAndroid (2010) and The Electric Lady (2013). Includes the singles "Make Me Feel" and "Django Jane". Janelle has already made waves with her two recent videos: the sexy, funky Prince-like "Make Me Feel" and "Django Jane," her riveting rap about being a black woman in the 21st century. She continues to defy expectations, blur genres, provoke and break new ground as you behold her new album featuring those two songs and the rest of this postmodern mash-up of soul, funk, pop, rock and hip-hop.','9/28/2018',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/2/0/8/3818024.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180135,'fever that you can t sweat out fbr 25th anniversary edition|panic at the disco|panic at the disco|lp','Fever That You Can''t Sweat Out (FBR 25th Anniversary Edition)','Panic! At the Disco','Panic! At the Disco','LP','FUEL645948.1','075678645655',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'41811771','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567864565','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited silver-colored vinyl LP pressing. Fueled By Ramen is celebrating it''s 25th Anniversary by releasing classic albums from it''s history on silver vinyl. Panic! At the Disco''s A Fever That You Can''t Sweat Out is a triple platinum release.','7/30/2021',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/3986631-2721414.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180136,'rks|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|cd','Rks','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','CD','RKSL65443.2','075678654435',7.75,7.75,'46514882','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567865443',NULL,0,'RKS is Rainbow Kitten Surprise''s debut album, released April 25, 2015 on Split Rail Records. At 11 tracks and just over 40 minutes, it''s the record that introduced the Boone, NC indie folk-pop band to the world - and it still sounds like nothing else. The album blends indie rock, alternative pop, and folk with a lo-fi, unpolished production aesthetic that feels intentional rather than rough. Songwriting credits belong to Ela Melo, and the band leans into vulnerability - lyrically and sonically - with a rawness that became their signature. The arc moves between anthemic momentum ("Run, " "American Shoes") and heavier introspective territory ("Cocaine Jesus, " "Bare Bones, " "The Comedown"), covering themes of love, escapism, restlessness, and emotional honesty.','10/23/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/3762077-3689791.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180137,'cinema|the marias|the marias|lp','Cinema','The Marias','The Marias','LP','ATL654198.1','075678644306',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'41663752','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567864430',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The Mar├¡as quickly grew a passionate local following, prompting the Los Angeles Times to declare them "the perfect indie band for L.A. kids." With sold out shows and rapidly increasing national attention, the band made an auspicious debut with their twin EPs: Superclean, Vol. I and Vol II. Cinema which features tracks in English and Spanish - draws inspiration from the classic films and directors that Mar├¡a and Josh grew up watching, including Pedro Almod├│var and Wes Anderson. The title also pays homage to how the band first began creating music in the first place.','6/25/2021',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/3969241-2705331.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180138,'all hope is gone|slipknot|slipknot|lp','All Hope Is Gone [Explicit Content]','Slipknot','Slipknot','LP','RRD645936.1','075678645747',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'42708445','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567864574','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Slipknot / ALL HOPE IS GONE - Originally released in 2008, the 2 x LP album, "All Hope Is Gone," is reissued in orange colored vinyl.','8/26/2022',1.139999999999999902,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4098957-2863324.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180139,'death of a bachelor limited silver colored vinyl|panic at the disco|panic at the disco|lp','Death Of A Bachelor (Limited Silver Colored VInyl)','Panic! At the Disco','Panic! At the Disco','LP','FUEL645940.1','075678645563',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'41393031','2026-11-10 23:52:37','2026-11-10 23:52:37','/07567864556','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited silver colored vinyl LP pressing. Death of a Bachelor is the fifth studio album by Panic! At the Disco, and their first as a solo project, originally released January 15, 2016. It is the follow-up to the band''s fourth studio album, Too Weird to Live, Too Rare to Die! (2013), with the entire album written and recorded by vocalist/multi-instrumentalist Brendon Urie, who collaborated with other writers including Jake Sinclair, Morgan Kibby, Lolo, and Sam Hollander. Death of a Bachelor debuted at number one on the US Billboard 200.','3/26/2021',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/3937919-2690945.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180140,'seven mary|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|cd','Seven + Mary','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','CD','RKSL65449.2','075678654497',7.75,7.75,'46514899','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865449',NULL,0,'Seven + Mary is Rainbow Kitten Surprise''s 2016 debut full-length (reissued on Elektra in 2019), pairing their Seven LP with an acoustic EP called Mary. Together, they clock in at just under 40 minutes across 11 tracks. Thematically it''s RKS at their most emotionally raw - melancholy, loss, infidelity, and the tension between order and chaos run throughout. The songwriting is deceptively simple on the surface, but the lyricism is dense with wordplay and imagery. Titles like "Fail!," "Devil Like Me," and "Shameful Company" give you the mood: introspective, a little bruised, but never mopey. The standouts are "Devil Like Me" (fan favorite, widely considered the emotional centerpiece), "First Class," and the title track "Seven," which uses a countdown structure as a metaphor for romantic dissolution. The Mary acoustic side is more stripped-down and contemplative - beautiful but sparse, and best taken as a mood piece rather than a standalone statement.','10/23/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/3762078-3689792.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180141,'rks|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|lp','Rks','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','LP','RKSL566661.1','075678658389',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'44045708','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865838',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing.','2/2/2024',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4284289-3497954.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180142,'nothing happens|wallows|wallows|lp','Nothing Happens','Wallows','Wallows','LP','ATL585083.1','075678653988',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'38702198','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865398',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2019 release. Recorded at Los Angeles'' Sargent Studios, the album sees Wallows reunited with Grammy award-winning producer John Congleton (St. Vincent, Alvvays, Future Islands) and captures the band''s journey towards adulthood through 11 intimate, introspective tracks.','3/22/2019',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/8/3/9/3899382.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180143,'you re welcome|a day to remember|a day to remember|lp','You''re Welcome','A Day to Remember','A Day to Remember','LP','FUEL607251.1','075678651250',20.42999999999999972,20.42999999999999972,'41157480','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865125',NULL,0,'Day to Remember has announced their Fueled By Ramen debut. The announcement was coupled with the release of the album''s latest single, "Brick Wall." The band''s frontman Jeremy McKinnon discussed the big news, "It''s finally here - almost! To all our fans around the world, we want to say, ''Thank you!'' You''ve waited patiently, and we can''t wait for you to hear this. There''s a lot of detail in everything we do from the mixes to the artwork, because it all tells a story. So, we made sure each element was perfect. Every line happens for a reason. We took what we envision modern music to be and made a hybrid of who we were, who we are, and who we want to be. It took a lot of maneuvering to get it right, but we feel like we did. We''re here now and very happy to present ''You''re Welcome''."','3/5/2021',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/3888048-2664886.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180144,'seven mary|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|lp','Seven + Mary','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','LP','RKSL566660.1','075678658396',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'44045715','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865839',NULL,0,'RKS independently released first album, Seven, and the band''s first EP joint album called Seven + Mary released on vinyl for the first time ever.','2/2/2024',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/4284288-3090500.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180145,'by the way i forgive you|brandi carlile|brandi carlile|lp','By The Way I Forgive You','Brandi Carlile','Brandi Carlile','LP','EA565226.1','075678659171',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'35523130','2026-11-10 23:52:38','2026-11-10 23:52:38','/07567865917','(Black)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2018 release from the singer/songwriter. By The Way, I Forgive You is not an album about forgiveness in the easy sense-where someone has hurt you and then suddenly there''s a great reconciliation and a remorse-filled scene with two people running across the golden wheatfield towards an embrace that somehow undoes a lifetime of pain and damage, as if the past has no meaning. It''s about radical acceptance (not to be confused with complacency) and unconditional love. Brandi Carlile is a Grammy-nominated singer/songwriter. Carlile''s music through the years has been categorized in several genres, including pop, rock, alternative country, and folk.','2/16/2018',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/3433286-3550045.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180146,'how to friend love freefall|rainbow kitten surprise|rainbow kitten surprise|lp','How To: Friend, Love, Freefall [Explicit Content]','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','Rainbow Kitten Surprise','LP','EA566449.1','075678658419',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'35848561','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567865841','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Black, Digital Download Card)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2018 release. Rainbow Kitten Surprise and all five of it''s members hail from the mountains of Boone, North Carolina. With chilling harmonies, dynamic instrumentation, and introspective lyrics, their genre-defying sound takes influence from artists like Modest Mouse and Kings of Leon as much as Frank Ocean and Schoolboy Q. Independently, they have over 75 million streams across digital platforms, and notched over 45 sold out shows on their first U.S. headline tour. Their engaging and distinct live performances have led to stand out sets at festivals such as Bonnaroo, Firefly, Shaky Knees, Hangout, Sasquatch, and Austin City Limits among others. The band worked with Grammy award-winning producer Jay Joyce (Cage The Elephant, Sleeper Agent) on their Elektra debut, How to: Friend, Love, Freefall.','4/6/2018',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/3/6/9/3769633.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180147,'deeper understanding|the war on drugs|the war on drugs|lp','Deeper Understanding','The War on Drugs','The War on Drugs','LP','ATL561934.1','075678660627',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'33043982','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866062','(Black, Digital Download Card)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 release. For much of the three and a half year period since the release of Lost In The Dream, The War on Drugs'' frontman, Adam Granduciel, led the charge for his Philadelphia-based sextet as he holed up in studios in New York and Los Angeles to write, record, edit, and tinker-but, above all, to busy himself in work. Teaming up with engineer Shawn Everett (Alabama Shakes, Weezer), Granduciel challenged the notion of what it means to create a fully realized piece of music in today''s modern landscape. Calling on his bandmates - bassist Dave Hartley, keyboarding Robbie Bennett, drummer Charlie Hall and multi-instrumentalists Anthony LaMarca and Jon Natchez - continuously throughout the process, the result is a "band record" in the noblest sense, featuring collaboration, coordination, and confidence at every turn. Through those years of relocation, the revisiting and reexamining of endless hours of recordings, unbridled exploration and exuberance, Granduciel''s gritty love of his craft succeeded in pushing the band to great heights.','8/25/2017',1.209999999999999965,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/8/4/5/3655487.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180148,'mad season|matchbox twenty|matchbox twenty|lp','Mad Season','Matchbox Twenty','Matchbox Twenty','LP','ATL660467.1','075678660467',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'43820214','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866046',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Following the stunning success of their explosive debut, the 2000 follow-up Mad Season''s soul-infused collection of modern classics demonstrated the band''s remarkably expressive range and power. Having further honed their craft through extensive touring, Matchbox Twenty grew into a creative musical machine, firing on all cylinders. This sophomore effort highlights the continued development of Rob Thomas'' gifts as a writer, with songs focusing on the binding elements of the increasingly unconnected world. In addition, the album featured a no-holds-barred sonic approach that introduced new musical textures such as intricate orchestrations and fierce horn sections.','10/13/2023',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4248997-3041215.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180149,'24k magic|bruno mars|bruno mars|lp','24k Magic','Bruno Mars','Bruno Mars','LP','ATL558305.1','075678662720',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'31642484','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866272','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2016 release, the highly-anticipated third album from critically-acclaimed, multi-Grammy winning international megastar Bruno Mars. 24K Magic is Bruno''s first solo release in nearly four years. Written and produced by Shampoo Press & Curl, the first single and title track, 24K Magic sees Bruno bringing the bounce to his adoring fans. Born and raised in Honolulu, Hawaii, by a family of musicians, Mars began making music at a young age and performed in various musical venues in his hometown throughout his childhood. After being dropped by Motown Records, Mars signed a recording contract with Atlantic Records in 2009. The rest is history','11/18/2016',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/3111465-3551852.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180150,'after laughter|paramore|paramore|lp','After Laughter','Paramore','Paramore','LP','ATL561588.1','075678660924',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'33394916','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866092','(Black, White, Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited colored vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 release, the fifth album from the alt-rock band and their first in four years. After Laughter was recorded at Nashville''s historic RCA Studio B - Paramore''s first time recording in their beloved hometown. The album was produced by Justin Meldal-Johnsen and Paramore''s own Taylor York. After Laughter also marks the return of original member Zac Farro back to the band. Paramore formed in Franklin, Tennessee in 2004. The group released it''s debut album All We Know Is Falling in 2005, with the album reaching number eight on the UK Rock Chart and number thirty on Billboard''s Heatseekers Chart. The band''s second album, Riot!, was released in 2007. Riot! Was a mainstream success and was certified Platinum in the United States. Their 2009 follow-up, Brand New Eyes, is the band''s second-highest charting album to date, landing at number two on the Billboard 200. Following the departure of Josh and Zac Farro in 2010, the band released their self-titled fourth album in 2013. It gave the band their first career number one on the US Billboard 200 and was also the number one album in the United Kingdom, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, Brazil, Argentina and Mexico.','9/8/2017',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/4/9/9/3699947.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180151,'woodstock|portugal the man|portugal the man|lp','Woodstock','Portugal the Man','Portugal the Man','LP','ATL561633.1','075678660825',20.62000000000000099,20.62000000000000099,'33247717','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866082','(180 Gram Vinyl, Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 release, the eighth studio album from the Wasilla, Alaska -based alt-rock band. "We worked with so many rad people on this album, but ended up with just the four of us in a basement at 4am trying to say something that mattered. Trying to write music that would help people feel they''re not alone, even if they''re angry or feeling lost." - John Gourley, lead singer. Portugal. The Man was originally started as John Gourley''s side project (he was previously with Anatomy Of A Ghost) with Zachary Carothers playing bass. Before they had a drummer, they used drum machines and synth-loops as the backing beat.','8/11/2017',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/15/3211115-2420140.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180152,'the hamilton mixtape|various artists|various artists|lp','The Hamilton Mixtape [Explicit Content]','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','ATL554553.1','075678665356',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'31903394','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567866535','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Digital Download Card)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2016 release, an unprecedented musical companion to the landmark Broadway musical by Tony, Grammy and Emmy Award-winner Lin-Manuel Miranda. Executive produced by The Roots'' Ahmir "Questlove" Thompson and Tarik "Black Thought" Trotter, The Hamilton Mixtape sees songs from the Pulitzer Prize-winning musical covered and remixed by a remarkable cast of contemporary artists. Superstars contributing to the one of it''s kind collection include Sia, Usher, Kelly Clarkson, The Roots, Alicia Keys, Nas, Wiz Khalifa, Chance The Rapper, John Legend, Regina Spektor, Ashanti, Ja Rule, Miguel, Queen Latifah, Common, Ben Folds, Andra Day, Jill Scott, Jimmy Fallon and others. The Hamilton Mixtape also includes three previously unreleased Hamilton demos.','2/10/2017',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/1/5/0/3520510.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180153,'slipknot|slipknot|slipknot|lp','Slipknot','Slipknot','Slipknot','LP','RRD645933.1','075678645693',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'42591108','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567864569','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Limited lemon yellow colored vinyl LP pressing. Slipknot is the eponymous debut studio album by the band Slipknot. It was released on June 29, 1999 It was the first release by the band to be produced by Ross Robinson, who sought to refine Slipknot''s sound rather than alter the group''s musical direction.','4/22/2022',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/4081904-2817044.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180154,'spring|wallows|wallows|lp','Spring [Explicit Content]','Wallows','Wallows','LP','ATL567664.1','075678657641',20.62000000000000099,20.62000000000000099,'36113545','2026-11-10 23:52:39','2026-11-10 23:52:39','/07567865764','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Pink, Green)',0,NULL,'5/25/2018',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/3/1/6/3786136.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180155,'hamilton original broadway cast recording|original cast recording|original cast recording|cd','Hamilton (Original Broadway Cast Recording)','Original Cast Recording','Original Cast Recording','CD','ATL551093.2','075678668432',21.69999999999999929,21.69999999999999929,'28679905','2026-11-10 23:52:40','2026-11-10 23:52:40','/07567866843',NULL,0,'Hamilton (Original Broadway Cast Recording) [Deluxe/Limited/Special Edition] Hamilton (Original Broadway Cast Recording) 2015 two CD set. The original Broadway cast album of Hamilton, a fusion of hip-hop and pop-driven musical theater, is now available from Atlantic Records. Cast members from the blockbuster new musical Hamilton, which recently opened to widespread critical acclaim at the Richard Rodgers Theatre, began recording their parts for this release in August of this year. This two-disc album was produced by Ahmir "Questlove" Thompson and Tariq "Black Thought" Trotter, founding members of the Grammy-winning hip-hop band, The Roots. Hamilton - which transferred to Broadway following a sold-out run at The Public Theater in NYC - is the acclaimed new musical about the scrappy young immigrant Alexander Hamilton, the $10 Founding Father who forever changed America with his revolutionary ideas and actions. During his life cut too short, he served as George Washington''s chief aide, was the first Treasury Secretary of the United States, a loving husband and father, despised by his fellow Founding Fathers, and shot to death by Aaron Burr in a legendary duel. The "HAMILTON (ORIGINAL BROADWAY CAST RECORDING)" is executive produced by Ahmir "Questlove" Thompson and Tariq "Black Thought" Trotter, founding members of the Grammy Award winning hip-hop band, The Roots. "HAMILTON" has book, music and lyrics by Tony and Grammy Award-winning composer Lin Manuel Miranda, who also plays the title role. The musical is directed by Thomas Kail, with choreography by Andy Blankenbuehler and music direction and orchestrations by Alex Lacamoire. "HAMILTON" is inspired by Ron Chernow''s biography "Alexander Hamilton." Band Members: Lead cast members: Lin-Manuel Miranda - Alexander Hamilton * Phillipa Soo - Eliza Hamilton Leslie Odom, Jr - Aaron Burr Renee Elise Goldsberry - Angelica Schuyler Christopher Jackson - George Washington Daveed Diggs - Marquis de Lafayette (act 1), Thomas Jefferson (act 2) Okieriete Onaodowan - Hercules Mulligan (act 1), James Madison (act 2) Anthony Ramos - John Laurens (act 1), Philip Hamilton (act 2) Jasmine Cephas Jones - Peggy Schuyler (act 1), Maria Reynolds (act 2) Jonathan Groff - King George* *denotes Tony-Award nominees and/or winners','10/16/2015',0.4400000000000000022,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/8/4/9/2969481.jpg?ae=4621895153','Musical Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180156,'saintmotelevision|saint motel|saint motel|lp','Saintmotelevision','Saint Motel','Saint Motel','LP','EA556953.1','075678663512',20.62000000000000099,20.62000000000000099,'35569756','2026-11-10 23:52:40','2026-11-10 23:52:40','/07567866351','(Clear Vinyl)',0,NULL,'12/2/2016',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/3438496-2480583.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180157,'trench|twenty one pilots|twenty one pilots|lp','Trench','Twenty One Pilots','Twenty One Pilots','LP','FUEL573985.1','075678654695',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'36737673','2026-11-10 23:52:40','2026-11-21 16:09:02','/075678654695','(Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'TWENTY ONE PILOTS / TRENCH - Twenty One Pilots shook the world with the release of their 2015 LP BLURRYFACE, an album that would go on to sell over 7 million copies worldwide and earn the band their first ever GRAMMY® Award as they shattered longstanding chart records, and captivated audiences worldwide on sold-out arena runs and at international festivals. Now three years later, the duo of Tyler Joseph and Josh Dun have returned to write the next chapter of their story with TRENCH, the band''s highly anticipated new studio album. TRENCH finds Twenty One Pilots fearlessly reimagining the possibilities of their music through the same candid expression and genuine identity that helped to cement their place as one of the largest bands in the world. FUELED BY RAMEN','10/5/2018',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/3575802.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180158,'fever you can t sweat out import|panic at the disco|panic at the disco|lp','Fever You Can''t Sweat Out [Import]','Panic! At the Disco','Panic! At the Disco','LP','WETL7866762.1','075678667626',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45109850','2026-11-10 23:52:40','2026-11-10 23:52:40','/07567866762',NULL,0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing. A Fever You Can''t Sweat Out is the debut studio album by Las Vegas-based alt-rock band Panic! At the Disco. Produced by Matt Squire, the album was released on September 27, 2005, on Decaydance and Fueled by Ramen. The group formed in Las Vegas in 2004 and began posting demos online, which caught the attention of Fall Out Boy bassist Pete Wentz. Wentz signed the group to his own imprint label, Decaydance, without them having ever performed live. The album was recorded on a small budget at SOMD! Studios in College Park, Maryland over several weeks in June 2005. The group had only graduated high school one month before. With lyrics written by lead guitarist/backing vocalist Ryan Ross, the record covers social issues and topics such as sanctity of marriage, adultery, mental health, alcoholism and prostitution are woven throughout the album. The album is divided into halves stylistically; the first half is primarily pop punk with elements of electronic, while the second employs more traditional instrumentation, with influences of baroque pop and swing.','5/12/2017',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/46/4420446-3564016.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180159,'this is all yours|alt j|alt j|lp','This Is All Yours','Alt-J','Alt-J','LP','ATL544594.1','075678672071',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'26995489','2026-11-10 23:52:40','2026-11-21 16:08:53','/075678672071','(Colored Vinyl, Digital Download Card)',0,'Double LP vinyl. Pinning down the precise sound of Alt-J is an impossibility. Undeniably addictive, frequently danceable, Alt-J defies easy definition. The band uses 2,000 years'' worth of musical traditions to pump out chart-eating albums. "This Is All Yours" was released in 2014 and samples musical styles ranging from chanting monks to rock to soul to new age to dub step to choral to folk...and it works in a perfect blend! It is an impressive mix from a bunch of guys who met not all that long ago at Leeds University in the U.K. The album peaked at #4 on the Billboard 200 chart with production help from Charlie Andrew. It''s most popular numbers are "Every Other Freckle," "Left Hand Free" and "Hunger of the Pine." The 2 LP album set offers the best possible sound. Atlantic Records.','9/23/2014',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/3/8/0/2750835.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180160,'doo wops and hooligans|bruno mars|bruno mars|cd','Doo-Wops and Hooligans','Bruno Mars','Bruno Mars','CD','EA525393.2','075678912153',10.84999999999999965,10.84999999999999965,'15237859','2026-11-10 23:52:41','2026-11-10 23:52:41','/07567891215',NULL,0,'Peter Hernandez (born October 8, 1985 in Waikiki, Hawaii), better known by his stage name Bruno Mars, is a Filipino-Puerto Rican American singer/songwriter, producer and multi-instrumentalist signed to Atlantic Records. He is most well known for singing and co-writing the hooks for the #1 hit Nothin'' on You by B.o.B, and Billionaire by Travie McCoy; he also co-wrote the international hits Right Round by Flo Rida and Wavin'' Flag by K''naan.','10/5/2010',0.02000000000000000041,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/6/5/2/1702564.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180161,'evil friends|portugal the man|portugal the man|lp','Evil Friends [Explicit Content]','Portugal. The Man','Portugal. The Man','LP','ATL535125.1','075678731884',20.23000000000000042,20.23000000000000042,'20631772','2026-11-10 23:52:41','2026-11-10 23:52:41','/07567873188','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2013 release, the seventh album from the Portland-based Alt-Rock band. Evil Friends was produced by Danger Mouse - AKA Brian Burton, the five-time Grammy award winning producer behind everything from Gnarls Barkley and Beck to the Black Keys and U2. Danger Mouse and the band agreed that they were game for the challenge and began production on what would become Evil Friends, the undaunted re-awakening for Portugal. The Man. As much as their collaborative imaginations melded, to construct songs that lived up to the ambitious visions they had would take some time. After all, here was a band with an evolving lineup building new songs with a new producer trying to do something neither of them had done before. Each track on Evil Friends is as different from the next as Portugal. The Man''s previous records were from each other, which is to say a piece of a growing mindscape, and wholly a part of the group''s tumbling fever dream.','6/4/2013',0.8499999999999999778,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/8/6/6/2196689.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180162,'mr wonderful|action bronson|action bronson|lp','Mr. Wonderful [Explicit Content]','Action Bronson','Action Bronson','LP','ATL547883.1','075678670633',24.69999999999999929,24.69999999999999929,'27907726','2026-11-10 23:52:41','2026-11-10 23:52:41','/07567867063','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing - 2015''s Mr. Wonderful is a culmination of every ingredient that''s made his discography delectable, then taken levels higher. The musicality is grade A; live instrumentation turns Mr. Wonderful into a wonderland of sonic discovery. ''A Light In The Addict,'' featuring Party Supplies and Fools Gold vocalist Black Atlass, and ''City Boy Blues,'' which boasts the bottom production of 88 Keys and top coating of Party Supplies, both soar with gorgeous orchestration. The latter track in such a zone that Bronson doesn''t spit a single bar, instead letting his vocals ride the wave of Soulful Rock.','7/24/2015',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/08/2733508-2576156.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180163,'doo wops and hooligans|bruno mars|bruno mars|lp','Doo-Wops and Hooligans','Bruno Mars','Bruno Mars','LP','EA525393.1','075678893032',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'15317704','2026-11-10 23:52:41','2026-11-10 23:52:41','/07567889303',NULL,0,'Peter Hernandez (born October 8, 1985 in Waikiki, Hawaii), better known by his stage name Bruno Mars, is a Filipino-Puerto Rican American singer/songwriter, producer and multi-instrumentalist signed to Atlantic Records. He is most well known for singing and co-writing the hooks for the #1 hit Nothin'' on You by B.o.B, and Billionaire by Travie McCoy; he also co-wrote the international hits Right Round by Flo Rida and Wavin'' Flag by K''naan.','12/7/2010',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/1653172-2629236.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
