INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180286,'lord of the rings the return of the king|howard shore|howard shore|lp','Lord Of The Rings: The Return Of The King','Howard Shore','Howard Shore','LP','RHI813291.1','081227813291',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45465840','2026-11-10 23:53:05','2026-11-10 23:53:05','/08122781329','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Lord Of The Rings: The Return Of The King (2LP Palantir Clear), (Indie Exclusive) by Howard Shore and Hollywood Studio Orchestra. - Howard Shore''s The Fellowship of the Ring score, certified platinum in the U.S., captivated audiences worldwide with it''s sweeping orchestration and unforgettable themes. Winner of both an Academy Award┬« and a GRAMMY, this iconic album features two stunning original songs by Enya, including the beloved "May It Be" and "An├¡ron (Theme for Aragorn and Arwen)." A must-have for any Lord of the Rings fan, this timeless soundtrack continues to inspire generations.','10/3/2025',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4453093-3440883.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180287,'grateful dead grateful dead skull roses|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Grateful Dead - Grateful Dead (Skull & Roses)','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','GRDW727201.1','081227812973',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'44842895','2026-11-10 23:53:05','2026-11-10 23:53:05','/08122781297','(Clear Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Grateful Dead Skull & Roses Translucent Lemonade Colored Vinyl Brick & Mortar Exclusive For the 50th anniversary of Grateful DeadΓÇÖs first album to be certified gold, the original album tracks are presented here on 180-gram 2LP newly remastered by Grammy-winning engineer David Glasser with Plangent Process Speed Correction. This process allows the tape playback to sound closer to the output of the mixing console than ever before. It yields better separation, less distortion and a solidity to the sound. Black vinyl with Stoughton Printing tip-on jacket plus a sticker insert. Produced for release by David Lemieux. The bandΓÇÖs second live double album, Skull & Roses was their best-selling album until the compilation Skeletons From The Closet was released in 1974. Originally, the band wanted the albumΓÇÖs title to be ΓÇ£Skull F***,ΓÇ¥ but Warner Bros refused, so the album was left without an official title. As a result, it has lovingly become known as Skull And Roses due to its famous cover art.','1/17/2025',1.070000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/08/4394408-3612259.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180288,'otis blue otis redding sings soul mono rhino reserve|otis redding|otis redding|lp','Otis Blue /  Otis Redding Sings Soul (Mono)(Rhino Reserve)','Otis Redding','Otis Redding','LP','ATL781169.1','081227811693',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45185885','2026-11-10 23:53:05','2026-11-10 23:53:05','/08122781169',NULL,0,'Recorded almost entirely in a single day, Otis Blue/Otis Redding Sings Soul delivers some of the strongest soul renditions ever put to tape. This includes the Redding original "I''ve Been Loving You Too Long", a cover of the Rolling Stones'' "Satisfaction", and an early recording of "Respect", which was later made popular by Aretha Franklin. Considered by critics to be the definitive soul album of it''s period, Otis Blue has been ranked one of Rolling Stone Magazine''s ''Greatest Albums of All Time'' as well as Time Magazine''s ''All-Time 100 Greatest Albums''. In celebration of Black Music Month, this album has been cut from the original tapes by Chris Bellman at Bernie Grundman Mastering and is pressed locally on 180 gram premium-quality vinyl at Fidelity Record Pressing''s brand new plant in Oxnard, California as part of Rhino''s new Rhino Reserve line.','6/27/2025',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4427022-3393123.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180289,'far beyond driven|pantera|pantera|lp','Far Beyond Driven','Pantera','Pantera','LP','ATL92302C.1','081227890971',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'41554500','2026-11-10 23:53:05','2026-11-10 23:53:05','/08122789097','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, White)',0,'Released on "marbled white and stronger than blue" vinyl. Success for Pantera continued with 1994''s Far Beyond Driven, notable for being one of the most abrasive and uncomprimising albums to ever debut at #1 on the Billboard chart. The album included "I''m Broken," "Becoming," "5 Minutes Alone," and the band''s startlingly mellow version of Black Sabbath''s "Planet Caravan."','4/23/2021',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/3956676-3149703.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180290,'now playing|van morrison|van morrison|lp','Now Playing','Van Morrison','Van Morrison','LP','RHI726305.1','081227816667',16.0,16.0,'44401733','2026-11-10 23:53:06','2026-11-10 23:53:06','/08122781666','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'Van Morrison - Now Playing / Following it''s release by Warner Bros. In February 1970, MOONDANCE would later be certified triple platinum by the RIAA, inducted into the Grammy Hall of Fame (1999) and named #65 on the list of the "500 Greatest Albums of All Time" published by Rolling Stone (2003).','7/5/2024',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4344051-3188760.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180291,'thank you rocktober opaque sky blue vinyl|stone temple pilots|stone temple pilots|lp','Thank You (ROCKTOBER) [Opaque Sky Blue Vinyl]','Stone Temple Pilots','Stone Temple Pilots','LP','ATL83586B.1','081227819316',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'43806898','2026-11-10 23:53:06','2026-11-10 23:53:06','/08122781931','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'This compilation from 2003 includes the band''s biggest hits, including Vasoline, Plush, Interstate Love Song and Creep amongst many other classics. This will be released on vinyl for the first time in blue vinyl with an etching on side 4.','10/6/2023',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4247391-3040144.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180292,'cowboys from hell|pantera|pantera|lp','Cowboys From Hell','Pantera','Pantera','LP','ATL91372A.1','081227890988',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'41554494','2026-11-10 23:53:06','2026-11-10 23:53:06','/08122789098','(Colored Vinyl, Brown)',0,'PANTERA / COWBOYS FROM HELL - Released on "marbled white and whiskey brown" vinyl. With their 1990 major label debut, Pantera unleashes one of the most acclaimed and imitated records in the history of the genre. Upon it''s release (and soon after unsuspecting fans took a gander at the band''s take-no prisoners live shows), songs like the album''s title track and "Cemetary Gates" helped Pantera to swiftly join America''s pantheon of great heavy metal bands.','4/23/2021',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/3956674-2693218.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180293,'being there|wilco|wilco|lp','Being There','Wilco','Wilco','LP','RHI563215.1','081227932893',64.68999999999999773,64.68999999999999773,'33799933','2026-11-10 23:53:07','2026-11-10 23:53:07','/08122793289',NULL,0,'Limited quadruple vinyl LP pressing. Deluxe edition of the alt-rock band builds on the original with 15 bonus tracks released for the first time, including alternate versions of tracks "I Got You" and "Say You Miss Me." Also included are four songs the band played on radio station KCRW on November 13, 1996. Being There is the second studio album by the American alternative rock band Wilco, released on October 29, 1996. Despite it''s release as a double album, Being There was sold at a single album price as a result of a deal between lead singer Jeff Tweedy and the band''s label Reprise Records. The album was an improvement for the band in both sales and critical reception, in contrast to their debut album A.M. (1995). Taking it''s name from the 1979 film of the same name, the self-produced album featured more surrealistic and introspective writing than on A.M.. This was due in part to several significant changes in Tweedy''s life, including the birth of his first child. Musically, it juxtaposed the alternative country styles songs reminiscent of Uncle Tupelo with psychedelic, surreal songs. It was the only Wilco album with steel guitarist Bob Egan, and their last with multi-instrumentalist Max Johnston.','12/1/2017',3.339999999999999858,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/3/5/9/3739533.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180294,'great southern trendkill|pantera|pantera|lp','Great Southern Trendkill','Pantera','Pantera','LP','ATL61908.1','081227890964',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'41554524','2026-11-10 23:53:07','2026-11-10 23:53:07','/08122789096','(Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,NULL,'4/23/2021',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/3956672-2693216.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180295,'greatest hits|chicago|chicago|lp','Greatest Hits','Chicago','Chicago','LP','RHI790697.1','081227906979',16.80000000000000071,16.80000000000000071,'40516981','2026-11-10 23:53:07','2026-11-10 23:53:07','/08122790697','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Walmart Exclusive. Chicago IX: Chicago''s Greatest Hits is the first greatest hits album, and ninth album overall, by the American band Chicago and was released in 1975. Walmart exclusive version on sun yellow vinyl.','7/17/2020',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/3827177-3205215.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
