INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180320,'12ers bf25 ex|phil collins||lp','12ers (BF25 EX)','Phil Collins',NULL,'LP','RHI81847.1','08122794177',16.23000000000000042,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/phil-collins-12ers-bf25-ex/08122794177',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180321,'40|foreigner|foreigner|lp','40','Foreigner','Foreigner','LP','ATL559755.1','081227940218',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'32774634','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794021',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 40 brings together the best songs from Foreigner''s nine studio albums, including Top 30 hits: "Feels Like The First Time," "Cold As Ice," "Waiting For A Girl Like You" and more. All prior recordings have been remastered and the album features two new tracks recorded especially for this release, "Give My Life For Love" and a new version of "I Don''t Want To Live Without You." This set contains tracks from Foreigner''s beloved albums: Foreigner (1977), Double Vision (1978), Head Games (1979), 4 (1981), Agent Provocateur (1984), Inside Information (1987), Unusual Heat (1991), Mr. Moonlight (1994) and Can''t Slow Down (2009).','6/2/2017',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/4/3/3/3603348.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180322,'cracked rear view|hootie the blowfish|hootie the blowfish|lp','Cracked Rear View','Hootie & the Blowfish','Hootie & the Blowfish','LP','ATL82613.1','081227941987',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'31848039','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794198',NULL,0,'Newly remastered, this monumental record is currently the tenth best-selling album of all time in the U.S., certified 21x Platinum by the RIAA since it''s 1994 debut, as well as the best-selling debut album of all time.','1/10/2017',0.4799999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/0/4/4/3514400.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180323,'paranoid|black sabbath|black sabbath|cd','Paranoid','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','CD','RHI3104.2','081227946715',8.679999999999999716,8.679999999999999716,'31218382','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794671',NULL,0,'Digitally remastered edition. Paranoid is the second studio album by English metal band Black Sabbath. Released in September 1970, it was the band''s only LP to top the UK Albums Chart until the release of 13 in 2013. Paranoid contains several of the band''s signature songs, including "Iron Man", "War Pigs" and the title track, which was the band''s only Top 20 hit, reaching #4 in the UK charts. It is often regarded as one of the most quintessential and influential albums in heavy metal history. Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ΓÇÿ70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.1300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/2/7/6/3396720.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180324,'master of reality|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','Master Of Reality','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RHI2562R.1','081227946739',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'31208895','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794673','(180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition, Black)',0,'Limited 180 gram black vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Master of Reality is the third studio album by Black Sabbath. Released in July 1971, it is widely regarded as the foundation of doom metal, stoner rock, and sludge metal. It was certified double platinum after having sold over 2 million copies. Master of Reality was Black Sabbath''s first and only top 10 album in the US until 13 forty-two years later. Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ''70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/3/9/0/3390936.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180325,'sabbath bloody sabbath|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','Sabbath Bloody Sabbath','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RHI2695R.1','081227946630',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'31218412','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794663','(180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition, Black)',0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Sabbath Bloody Sabbath is the fifth studio album by English heavy metal band Black Sabbath, released in December 1973. It was produced by the band and Tom Allom and recorded at Morgan Studios in London in September 1973. Black Sabbath released Sabbath Bloody Sabbath on 1 December 1973. For the first time in their career, the band began to receive favorable reviews in the mainstream press, with Rolling Stone calling the album "an extraordinarily gripping affair", and "nothing less than a complete success". Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ''70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/3069114-3298453.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180326,'farther along|dolly parton|dolly parton|lp','Farther Along','Dolly Parton','Dolly Parton','LP','RHI554095.1','081227947187',32.46999999999999887,32.46999999999999887,'31372749','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794718',NULL,0,'Limited double vinyl LP pressing. Dolly Parton, Linda Ronstadt, and Emmylou Harris have three careers unparalleled in music history. Together they have sold over 200 million albums worldwide and performed for decades in front of countless fans around the globe. When these music icons came together to release their debut collaboration, a powerhouse Trio of country and Americana sound was born. Farther Along is a double-LP set of all the newly remastered bonus material from the three CD set The Complete Trio Collection by Dolly Parton, Linda Ronstadt, and Emmylou Harris. Produced by Emmylou. Includes alternate takes and unreleased recordings from 1986 to 1994.','9/9/2016',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/2/6/1/3311625.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180327,'paranoid|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','Paranoid','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RHI3104.1','081227946708',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'31218399','2026-11-10 23:53:11','2026-11-10 23:53:11','/08122794670','(180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition, Black)',0,'Limited 180 gram black vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Paranoid is the second studio album by English metal band Black Sabbath. Released in September 1970, it was the band''s only LP to top the UK Albums Chart until the release of 13 in 2013. Paranoid contains several of the band''s signature songs, including "Iron Man", "War Pigs" and the title track, which was the band''s only Top 20 hit, reaching #4 in the UK charts. It is often regarded as one of the most quintessential and influential albums in heavy metal history. Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ''70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/15/3069115-3726096.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180328,'no jacket required|phil collins|phil collins|lp','No Jacket Required','Phil Collins','Phil Collins','LP','RHI81240.1','081227951894',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'30804432','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795189','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'No Jacket Required (180 Gram Vinyl) Phil Collins - Originally released in 1985, Collins'' third album No Jacket Required topped the charts in the UK, US, and numerous other countries all over the world on a journey that would result in three Grammy┬« Awards (for Best Album, Best Pop Vocal Performance, Male, and Producer of the Year for Collins and co-producer Hugh Padgham) and over 20 million sales. Mixing Collins'' trademark emotional ballads alongside strong funk and R&B influences, the album''s hit singles - "Sussudio," "One More Night," "Don''t Lose My Number," and "Take Me Home" - would also become staples of his live set in the years that followed. Available as a 180-gram heavyweight audiophile vinyl format which features the remastered album as a standalone product. Remastered by Nick Davis, who earned a Grammy nomination for Best Surround Sound album for his work on the Genesis ''1970-1975'' box set. All tracks are (2016 Remastered).','4/15/2016',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/5/7/7/3307758.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180329,'veronica electronica limited silver colored vinyl import|madonna||lp','Veronica Electronica - Limited Silver Colored Vinyl [Import]','Madonna',NULL,'LP','WETL2781978.1','08122781978',38.78999999999999915,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/madonna-veronica-electronica-limited-silver-colored-vinyl-import/08122781978',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180330,'greatest hits 1982 1989|chicago|chicago|lp','Greatest Hits 1982-1989','Chicago','Chicago','LP','RHI26080.1','081227944278',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'31208628','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122794427',NULL,0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing. Greatest Hits 1982-1989 is the third greatest hits album, and twentieth album overall, by the American band Chicago, released by Full Moon/Reprise Records on November 21, 1989. Covering the era that stretched from 1982''s Chicago 16 to Chicago 19 in 1988, the set is also balanced by the appearances of both Peter Cetera and his replacement Jason Scheff. Greatest Hits 1982-1989 - the band''s 20th release overall - is also notable for being Chicago''s last release before the departure of founding drummer Danny Seraphine and the home to a (slightly) remixed hit, "What Kind of Man Would I Be?" originally released on Chicago 19.','9/6/2016',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/1/8/3/3383810.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180331,'jagged little pill import|alanis morissette|alanis morissette|cd','Jagged Little Pill [Import]','Alanis Morissette','Alanis Morissette','CD','WBUK5036540.2','081227951917',6.639999999999999681,6.639999999999999681,'29002528','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795191','(Remastered, Canada - Import)',0,NULL,'11/6/2015',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/8/6/8/3018680.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180332,'diver down remastered|van halen|van halen|lp','Diver Down [Remastered]','Van Halen','Van Halen','LP','RHI3677.1','081227955007',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'28383482','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795500','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP repressing. Digitally remastered edition of this 1982 album by the hard rock quartet. Diver Down was the band''s fifth album, which ended up going four-times platinum. With vocals by the wildly entertaining David Lee Roth, the guitar masterwork of Eddie Van Halen and the irreplaceable rhythm section of drummer Alex Van Halen and bassist/backing vocalist Michael Anthony, Van Halen were one of the late ''70s and early ''80s greatest Rock ''n'' Roll bands. Mastering engineer Chris Bellman, who remastered the original albums at Bernie Grundman Mastering Studios, was enlisted for this new version. In order to produce the original sound the band intended, Bellman cut straight from the quarter-inch tapes.','7/10/2015',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/9/4/2/2912495.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180333,'black sabbath|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RHI1871R.1','081227946661',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'31208666','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122794666','(180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition, Black)',0,'Limited 180 gram black vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Black Sabbath is the eponymous debut studio album by English rock band Black Sabbath. Originally released on February 13, 1970 in the United Kingdom and on June 1, 1970 in the United States, the album reached #8 on the UK Albums Charts and #23 on the Billboard charts. Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ''70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/3/9/0/3390934.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180334,'pleased to meet me|the replacements|the replacements|lp','Pleased To Meet Me','The Replacements','The Replacements','LP','RHI25557.1','081227954772',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'31848121','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795477','(Indie Exclusive)',0,'The Replacements - Pleased To Meet Me','1/17/2017',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/1/4/4/3514411.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180335,'face value|phil collins|phil collins|lp','Face Value','Phil Collins','Phil Collins','LP','RHI16029.1','081227953935',20.62000000000000099,20.62000000000000099,'28856108','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795393','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited edition 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition of this 1981 album. Phil Collins revisits a career that can boast over 100 million sales and numerous worldwide #1 albums. Initially released shortly after Collins'' 30th birthday, Face Value was propelled to international multi-Platinum status with the help of the smash hit single ''In The Air Tonight''. Other notable tracks on the album include the follow-up singles ''I Missed Again'' and ''If Leaving Me Is Easy'', as well as ''Behind The Lines'' which was written with Collins'' Genesis colleagues Tony Banks and Mike Rutherford.','1/29/2016',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/2/9/8/2998928.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180336,'vol 4|black sabbath|black sabbath|cd','Vol. 4','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','CD','RHI2602.2','081227946616',8.519999999999999574,8.519999999999999574,'31218757','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122794661',NULL,0,'Digitally remastered edition. Vol. 4 is the fourth studio album by Black Sabbath, released in September 1972. It was the first album by Black Sabbath not produced by Rodger Bain; guitarist Tony Iommi assumed production duties. Patrick Meehan, the band''s then-manager, was listed as co-producer, though his actual involvement in the album''s production was minimal at best. Rock critic Lester Bangs, who had derided the band''s first two albums, applauded Vol. 4, writing in Creem, "We have seen the Stooges take on the night ferociously and go tumbling into the maw, and Alice Cooper is currently exploiting it for all it''s worth, turning it into a circus. But there is only one band that has dealt with it honestly on terms meaningful to vast portions of the audience, not only grappling with it in a mythic structure that''s both personal and powerful but actually managing to prosper as well. And that band is Black Sabbath."Black Sabbath was formed in Birmingham in 1968 by guitarist and main songwriter Tony Iommi, bassist and main lyricist Geezer Butler, singer Ozzy Osbourne, and drummer Bill Ward. Black Sabbath is often cited as pioneers of heavy metal music. The band helped define the genre with a clutch of groundbreaking albums in the ΓÇÿ70s. They have sold over 70 million records worldwide. Black Sabbath were inducted into the UK Music Hall of Fame in 2005 and the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2006.','8/5/2016',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/0/4/8/3398402.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180337,'houses of the holy|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|cd','Houses of the Holy','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','CD','ATL542493.2','081227958275',14.33999999999999986,14.33999999999999986,'26889917','2026-11-10 23:53:12','2026-11-10 23:53:12','/08122795827','(Deluxe Edition, Remastered)',0,'Two CD edition includes a bonus CD containing seven additional recordings taken from the album sessions. Digitally remastered edition of the British Rock quartet''s fifth studio album, originally released in 1973. Containing some of the band''s most famous songs, including ''The Song Remains the Same'', ''The Rain Song'' and ''No Quarter'', HOUSES OF THE HOLY became a huge success, and was certified eleven times platinum by the RIAA. In 1968, John Bonham, John Paul Jones, Jimmy Page and Robert Plant formed Led Zeppelin, one of the most influential, innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide with a celebrated catalog. The band rose from the ashes of the Yardbirds, when Page brought in Plant, Bonham and Jones to tour as the New Yardbirds. In 1969, Led Zeppelin released it''s self-titled debut. It marked the beginning of a 12-year reign, during which the group was widely considered to be the biggest rock band in the world.','10/27/2014',0.1700000000000000122,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/6/3/5/2755364.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180338,'long run|the eagles|the eagles|lp','Long Run','The Eagles','The Eagles','LP','RHI1508.1','081227961602',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'27617427','2026-11-10 23:53:13','2026-11-10 23:53:13','/08122796160','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. The Long Run is the sixth studio album by the American rock group The Eagles, it was released in 1979, on Asylum. Contains "I Can''t Tell You Why," "Heartache Tonight," "Those Shoes" and more. The Long Run is the sixth studio album by the American rock group The Eagles, it was released in 1979, on Asylum in the United States and in the United Kingdom. This was the first Eagles album not to feature their founding member, Randy Meisner who was replaced by Timothy B. Schmit. This was the last studio album until 2007''s Long Road Out of Eden (though four studio tracks were included on 1994''s Hell Freezes Over) and the final studio album for Asylum Records. When released in September 1979, The Long Run debuted at #2 on Billboard''s Pop Albums chart and a week later hit #1 dethroning Led Zeppelin''s In Through the Out Door. It was their last #1 album of the 1970s, and reigned for eight weeks in the #1 slot. The Long Run has sold more than seven million copies to date in the U.S. (it was certified Gold and Platinum in early 1980 by the R.I.A.A.). The album generated three Top 10 singles, the chart-topping rocker "Heartache Tonight", the album''s title cut, and the ballad "I Can''t Tell You Why". Those singles reached #1, #8 and #8 respectively. The band also won a Grammy Award for "Heartache Tonight". Also featured on the record was "In the City", a song first recorded by their guitarist Joe Walsh for the movie soundtrack for The Warriors. "The Sad Cafe" (about the band''s experiences at The Troubadour in Los Angeles) and "Those Shoes" also received substantial radio airplay.','2/24/2015',0.75,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/5/5/5/2805553.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Southern Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180339,'led zeppelin 3|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin 3','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL536182.1','081227964368',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'26103082','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122796436','(Deluxe Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Deluxe double vinyl LP pressing includes bonus LP that contains previously unreleased studio outtakes. Digitally remastered edition of the Hard Rock quartet''s 1970 album housed in a gatefold sleeve with eight page booklet. Led Zeppelin were one of the most innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide. Led Zeppelin continues to be honored for it''s pivotal role in music history. The band was inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 1995, received a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2005, and a year later was awarded with the Polar Music Prize in Stockholm.','6/3/2014',1.5,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/1/4/4/2534414.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180340,'classic linda ronstadt just one look|linda ronstadt|linda ronstadt|lp','Classic Linda Ronstadt: Just One Look','Linda Ronstadt','Linda Ronstadt','LP','EA551257.1','081227950392',40.85000000000000142,40.85000000000000142,'29120628','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122795039',NULL,0,'LINDA RONSTADT CLASSIC LINDA RONSTADT: JUST ONE LOOK Before her induction into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame last year, Linda Ronstadt was already one of the most successful female recording artists in history. Her incomparable voice has graced dozens of hits, she''s sold more than 100 million albums, won countless industry awards (including 11 Grammys) and is among the best-selling artists of all time. This 30-track collection spans 26 years and features selections from 11 studio albums. Part 1 retraces the groundbreaking singer''s rise to fame during the 1970s with songs like "You''re No Good" from her Grammy-winning, multi-platinum 1974 breakthrough Heart Like A Wheel, "Heat Wave" from 1975''s platinum-seller Prisoner In Disguise, "Crazy" from her third-straight million seller and "Blue Bayou" from her 1977 Grammy-winning, multi-platinum release Simple Dreams. Part 2 opens with the collection''s title track, "Just One Look," from Ronstadt''s sixth consecutive platinum album, 1978''s Living In The USA. Selections from four more albums are also featured, "Hurts So Bad" from the 1980''s platinum-certified Mad Love, her extraordinary duet with Aaron Neville on the #2 hit "Don''t Know Much" from 1989''s Cry Like A Rainstorm and "Heartbeats Accelerating" from 1993''s acclaimed Winter Light.','12/18/2015',1.239999999999999992,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/6/0/9/3029066.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180341,'hotel california|the eagles|the eagles|lp','Hotel California','The Eagles','The Eagles','LP','RHI1084B.1','081227961619',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'27617441','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122796161','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing. Hotel California was the fifth studio album by the American rock band Eagles, released on Asylum in late 1976. It is the first Eagles album without the appearance of their founding member Bernie Leadon and their first album with guitarist Joe Walsh. Contains the hit title track as well as "Life in the Fast Lane," "New Kid in Town," "The Last Resort" and more.','2/24/2015',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/2137189-3243503.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Southern Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180342,'greatest hits|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Greatest Hits','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI25801.1','081227959357',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26310381','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122795935',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP repressing. GREATEST HITS is a 1988 compilation album by British-American band Fleetwood Mac. It covers the period of the band''s greatest commercial success, from the mid-1970s to the late 1980s. The track listing for the US release differs slightly from that of other territories. It includes the 1975 track Over My Head but omits the 1987 track Seven Wonders.','6/24/2014',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/2115766-3726097.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180343,'dock of the bay|otis redding|otis redding|lp','Dock of the Bay','Otis Redding','Otis Redding','LP','ATL419.1','081227956394',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'27392140','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122795639','(180 Gram Vinyl, Mono Sound)',0,'Otis Redding Dock of the Bay'' on MONO LP here for the first time in a very, very long time. Old school heavy 180g vinyl as well! This album has both "(Sittin'' On) the Dock of the Bay" and "Tramp"- true classics.','12/9/2014',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/9/5/2/2802597.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180344,'a quiet normal life the best of warren zevon|warren zevon|warren zevon|lp','A Quiet Normal Life: The Best Of Warren Zevon','Warren Zevon','Warren Zevon','LP','RHI60503.1','081227944254',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'31367745','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122794425',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. A Quiet Normal Life: The Best Of Warren Zevon is a greatest hits album by Warren Zevon released in 1986. This collection features tracks from Zevon''s studio albums on the Elektra label - Warren Zevon (1976), Excitable Boy (1978), Bad Luck Streak In Dancing School (1980) and The Envoy (1982). Includes the Zevon classics "Werewolves Of London," "Roland The Headless Thompson Gunner," "Looking For The Next Best Thing," "Desperados Under The Eaves," "Lawyers Guns & Money," and many others.','9/6/2016',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/3/9/5/3425939.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180345,'best of the doobie brothers|the doobie brothers|the doobie brothers|lp','Best of the Doobie Brothers','The Doobie Brothers','The Doobie Brothers','LP','RHI2978.1','081227962364',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'22374905','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122796236',NULL,0,'Best of the Doobie Brothers on vinyl of course has their best songs from their decades long catalog. The 2nd album, "Toulouse Street" (which spawned the hits and classic rock staples, "Listen to the Music", and "Jesus Is Just Alright"), brought the band their breakthrough success after it''s release in July 1972 and it was from this release that showcased the Doobies'' trademark sound: an amalgam of R&B, country, bluegrass, hard rock, roadhouse boogie, funk, and rock and roll. The Doobie Brothers sold more than 40 million albums worldwide throughout it''s career.','12/3/2013',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/1996127-2595243.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180346,'led zeppelin 1|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin 1','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL536123.1','081227964603',49.17999999999999972,49.17999999999999972,'26102863','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122796460','(Deluxe Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Triple VInyl LP pressing includes a bonus live show on the second and third LPs. Digitally remastered edition of the Hard Rock quartet''s 1969 debut album housed in a gatefold sleeve with eight page booklet. Led Zeppelin were one of the most innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide. Led Zeppelin continues to be honored for it''s pivotal role in music history. The band was inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 1995, received a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2005, and a year later was awarded with the Polar Music Prize in Stockholm.','6/3/2014',1.790000000000000035,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/2/4/4/2534422.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180347,'in through the out door remastered|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','In Through The Out Door [Remastered]','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535343.1','081227965747',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'28340812','2026-11-10 23:53:15','2026-11-10 23:53:15','/08122796574','(Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP repressing. Digitally remastered edition of this album by the British hard rock icons. Digitally remastered edition of this album by the British hard rock icons. In Through The Out Door topped the U.S. and UK album charts and has since been certified six-times platinum. Sadly, it would be the last album that Led Zeppelin recorded prior to drummer John Bonham s passing the following year. Among the seven album tracks are ''Fool In The Rain'' and ''All My Love'', two songs that remain rock radio staples to this day.','7/31/2015',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/0/7/5/2905708.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180348,'led zeppelin iv|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin IV','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535340.1','081227965778',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26889740','2026-11-10 23:53:16','2026-11-10 23:53:16','/08122796577','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of the British Rock quartet''s fourth studio album, originally released in 1971. Although the album was untitled, it is commonly referred to as LED ZEPPELIN IV. Produced by guitarist Jimmy Page, it was recorded between December 1970 and March 1971 at several locations, most prominently the Victorian house Headley Grange. The album features many stone cold classics including ''Black Dog'', ''Rock And Roll'' and ''Stairway To Heaven''. In 1968, John Bonham, John Paul Jones, Jimmy Page and Robert Plant formed Led Zeppelin, one of the most influential, innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide with a celebrated catalog.','10/27/2014',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/2128704-3726098.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180349,'physical graffiti|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|cd','Physical Graffiti','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','CD','ATL535339.2','081227957957',14.19999999999999929,14.19999999999999929,'27722237','2026-11-10 23:53:16','2026-11-10 23:53:16','/08122795795','(Booklet, Remastered)',0,'Standard two CD pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of this 1975 album by the legendary British hard rock quartet. Certified 16x platinum in the U.S., the commercial success of Physical Graffiti was equaled by it''s critical reception. Generally regarded as one of the greatest double albums of all time, the original 15 tracks represent a creative tour de force that explores the band''s dynamic musical range, from the driving rock of ''Custard Pie'' and acoustic arrangement of ''Bron-Y-Aur Stomp'' to the Eastern raga of ''Kashmir'' and funky groove of ''Trampled Under Foot.''','2/24/2015',0.1600000000000000033,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/4/9/4/2834940.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180350,'led zeppelin 2|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|cd','Led Zeppelin 2','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','CD','ATL535225.2','081227964566',11.73000000000000042,11.73000000000000042,'26102887','2026-11-10 23:53:16','2026-11-10 23:53:16','/08122796456','(Remastered)',0,'2014 remastered reissue of the original edition of their landmark 1969 second album in a gatefold sleeve with an 8 page booklet.','6/3/2014',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/1/4/4/2534419.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180351,'speaking in tongues|talking heads|talking heads|lp','Speaking in Tongues','Talking Heads','Talking Heads','LP','SIRE23883.1','081227966652',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'20667849','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122796665','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP repressing of the New Wave band''s 1983 album.','6/4/2013',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/7/8/9/2209877.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180352,'led zeppelin 3|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin 3','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535341.1','081227965761',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26103051','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122796576','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of the Hard Rock quartet''s 1970 album housed in a gatefold sleeve with eight page booklet. Led Zeppelin were one of the most innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide. Led Zeppelin continues to be honored for it''s pivotal role in music history. The band was inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 1995, received a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2005, and a year later was awarded with the Polar Music Prize in Stockholm.','6/3/2014',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/2/4/4/2534423.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180353,'kiss me kiss me kiss me|the cure|the cure|lp','Kiss Me, Kiss Me, Kiss Me','The Cure','The Cure','LP','RHI60737.1','081227967451',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'20235123','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122796745','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Kiss Me, Kiss Me, Kiss Me (2 LP 180 Gram Black Vinyl) - Kiss Me Kiss Me Kiss Me is the seventh studio album by English rock band The Cure, originally released in May 1987. The album helped put The Cure into the American mainstream, becoming their first album to reach the Billboard Top 40 (achieving Platinum certification). It was also a big international success, as was it''s predecessor.','4/20/2013',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/1/4/1/2171416.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180354,'led zeppelin iv remastered original cd|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|cd','Led Zeppelin IV (Remastered Original CD)','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','CD','ATL535340.2','081227964481',11.96000000000000085,11.96000000000000085,'26889542','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122796448','(Remastered)',0,'Digitally remastered edition of the British Rock quartet''s fourth studio album, originally released in 1971. Although the album was untitled, it is commonly referred to as LED ZEPPELIN IV. Produced by guitarist Jimmy Page, it was recorded between December 1970 and March 1971 at several locations, most prominently the Victorian house Headley Grange. The album features many stone cold classics including ''Black Dog'', ''Rock And Roll'' and ''Stairway to Heaven''. in 1968, John Bonham, John Paul Jones, Jimmy Page and Robert Plant formed Led Zeppelin, one of the most influential, innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide with a celebrated catalog.','10/27/2014',0.08999999999999999667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/2128457-2722194.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180355,'their greatest hits 1971 1975|the eagles|the eagles|lp','Their Greatest Hits 1971-1975','The Eagles','The Eagles','LP','EA1052.1','081227979379',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'15423610','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122797937','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Is the fifth album by the American rock band The Eagles, a compilation of singles. Their Greatest Hits (1971-1975) comprises nine best-selling singles released between 1972 and 1975.','2/8/2011',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/1668668-3243507.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Southern Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180356,'workingman s dead import|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Workingman''s Dead [Import]','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','WETL2797815.1','081227978150',39.75999999999999802,39.75999999999999802,'44258405','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122797815','(Argentina - Import)',0,'Workingman''s Dead is the fourth studio album by The Grateful Dead. It was recorded in February 1970 and originally released on June 14, 1970. In 2003, the album was ranked number 262 on Rolling Stone magazine''s list of the 500 greatest albums of all time.','9/6/2011',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4322909-3132986.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180357,'three imaginary boys|the cure|the cure|lp','Three Imaginary Boys','The Cure','The Cure','LP','EA523247.1','081227981594',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'31372688','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122798159','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Three Imaginary Boys was released on 8 May 1979 by record label Fiction. The record company decided which songs were put on the album, as well as the cover artwork, without Robert Smith''s consent. For all Cure albums since, Smith has ensured he is given complete creative control over the final product before it goes on sale. The "Foxy Lady" soundcheck, with vocals sung by Michael Dempsey, was not supposed to be on the album, and was removed for the American release. Smith has stated that "songs like ''Object'' and ''World War'' and our cover of ''Foxy Lady'' were [Chris Parry''s] choice". Despite Smith''s displeasure with the record, Three Imaginary Boys was well-received critically at the time of it''s release. Sounds'' Dave McCullough praised it in a 5-star review and noted: "The Cure are going somewhere different on each track, the ideas are startling and disarming". McCullough noted the variety of the material and qualified "Grinding Halt" as a "pop song that reminds you of the Isley Brothers or the Buzzcocks".','9/6/2016',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/7/7/7/3377779.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180358,'live at the bowl 68 import|the doors|the doors|lp','Live At The Bowl 68 [Import]','The Doors','The Doors','LP','WETL7971199.1','081227971199',33.93999999999999773,33.93999999999999773,'39607461','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122797119',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Digitally restored live archive release. The Doors supplied plenty of post-Independence Day fireworks on July 5, 1968 when the legendary quartet played the Hollywood Bowl, a concert that is considered to be the band''s finest on film. For the first time, the film from the historic performance has been painstakingly restored using the original camera negatives and the audio has been remixed and mastered from original multi-tracks by the group''s engineer Bruce Botnick. Live at the Bowl ''68 includes three previously unreleased tracks from the performance. Technical issues with the recording of "Hello, I Love You, " "The WASP (Texas Radio And the Big Beat), " and "Spanish Caravan" prevented them from being released in the past. Now, through meticulous restoration of the audio, all three will be included, marking the first time the concert has been available in it''s entirety.','11/5/2012',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/94/3739194-2729459.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180359,'physical graffiti|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Physical Graffiti','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535339.1','081227965785',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'27722268','2026-11-10 23:53:17','2026-11-10 23:53:17','/08122796578','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Limited double 180gm vinyl LP pressing in top-loading wraparound die cut insert U-card, LPs in printed inner sleeves, replicating the original album arrives exactly 40 years after debut. Digitally remastered edition of this 1975 album by the British rock quartet. Certified 16x platinum in the U.S., the commercial success of Physical Graffiti was equaled by it''s critical reception. Generally regarded as one of the greatest double albums of all time, the original 15 tracks represent a creative tour de force that explores the band''s dynamic musical range, from the driving rock of "Custard Pie" and acoustic arrangement of "Bron-Y-Aur Stomp" to the Eastern raga of "Kashmir" and funky groove of "Trampled Under Foot."','2/24/2015',1.209999999999999965,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/2/9/4/2834925.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180360,'moondance|van morrison|van morrison|lp','Moondance','Van Morrison','Van Morrison','LP','RHI1835.1','081227990701',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'13864750','2026-11-10 23:53:25','2026-11-10 23:53:25','/08122799070','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Pressed on 180 gram vinyl at RTI. Mastered from the original analog master tapes by Kevin Grey at Acoustech Mastering. Features all original packaging. Highlights include ''Caravan'', ''Into the Mystic'' and ''Moondance''. Van Morrison''s 1970''s follow up album to Astral Weeks titled Moondance was every bit as brilliant; buoyant and optimistic where Astral Weeks had been dark and anguished it cracked the Top 40 and generated classic hits.','12/30/2008',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/1/8/7/1407811.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180361,'superfly|curtis mayfield|curtis mayfield|lp','Superfly','Curtis Mayfield','Curtis Mayfield','LP','RHI524044.1','081227980436',24.23000000000000042,24.23000000000000042,'15149107','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122798043','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Curtis Mayfield was best known for writing and producing the soundtrack to the film Super Fly. Super Fly is one of the few films ever to have been out grossed by it''s soundtrack.','9/28/2010',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/2/5/5/1665520.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180362,'jagged little pill|alanis morissette|alanis morissette|lp','Jagged Little Pill','Alanis Morissette','Alanis Morissette','LP','MAV45901.1','081227971687',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'19551401','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122797168','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Here it is, the 1995 multi-platinum smash that made Alanis an alt-rock superstar and earned a perennial spot in all the major "Best Rock Albums of All Time" lists (including Rolling Stone''s). This won five well-deserved Grammys: her hits "You Oughta Know," "Hand in My Pocket," "All I Really Want," "Ironic," "You','12/4/2012',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/1884850-2824771.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180363,'van halen|van halen|van halen|lp','Van Halen','Van Halen','Van Halen','LP','RHI547642.1','081227955250',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'27815830','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122795525',NULL,0,'Limited 180 gm vinyl LP pressing. With their 1978 eponymous debut, Van Halen simultaneously rewrote the rules of rock guitar and hard rock in general. Guitarist Eddie Van Halen redefined what the electric guitar could do, developing a blindingly fast technique with a variety of self-taught two-handed tapping, hammer-on''s, pull-offs, and effects that mimicked the sounds of machines and animals. It was wildly inventive and over the top, equaled only by vocalist David Lee Roth, who brought the role of a metal singer to near-performance art standards. Mastering engineer Chris Bellman, who remastered the original albums at Bernie Grundman Mastering Studios, was enlisted for this new version. In order to produce the original sound the band intended, Bellman cut straight from the quarter-inch tapes.','3/31/2015',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/3/4/4/2844434.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180364,'seventeen seconds|the cure|the cure|lp','Seventeen Seconds','The Cure','The Cure','LP','EA60784.1','081227981600',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'31372640','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122798160','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Seventeen Seconds is the second studio album by English rock band The Cure, recorded at Morgan Studio and released on 22 April 1980. Seventeen Seconds established the group''s gloomy sound that would continue until 1982''s Pornography. It is the only Cure album to feature keyboardist Matthieu Hartley. Inspiration was very high for the album, as Robert Smith wrote the lyrics and music for most of the record on just two occasions. Most of the music was composed by Smith in his parents'' home, on a Hammond organ with a built-in tape recorder. Interviewed in 2004, producer Mike Hedges does not recall any demo tracks, with the band generally playing the track in the studio before laying down a backing track to which overdubs were added. Two members of The Magazine Spies, bass guitarist Simon Gallup and keyboardist Matthieu Hartley, were added to the band''s lineup. Gallup replaced Michael Dempsey, which relieved Smith as he felt Dempsey''s basslines were too ornate and that they weren''t getting on socially. Hartley''s synth work added a new dimension to the band''s newly ethereal sound, although Smith and he clashed over complexity (Hartley enjoyed complex chords; Smith wanted single notes).','9/6/2016',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/8/7/7/3377780.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180365,'houses of the holy|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Houses of the Holy','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535344.1','081227965730',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26889924','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122796573','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited 180 gm vinyl LP pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of the British Rock quartet''s fifth studio album, originally released in 1973. Containing some of the band''s most famous songs, including ''The Song Remains the Same'', ''The Rain Song'' and ''No Quarter'', HOUSES OF THE HOLY became a huge success, and was certified eleven times platinum by the RIAA. In 1968, John Bonham, John Paul Jones, Jimmy Page and Robert Plant formed Led Zeppelin, one of the most influential, innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide with a celebrated catalog. The band rose from the ashes of The Yardbirds, when Page brought in Plant, Bonham and Jones to tour as The New Yardbirds. In 1969, Led Zeppelin released it''s self-titled debut. It marked the beginning of a 12-year reign, during which the group was widely considered to be the biggest Rock band in the world.','10/27/2014',0.7900000000000000355,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/7/3/5/2755372.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180366,'led zeppelin 2|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin 2','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535225.1','081227966409',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26102917','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122796640','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of the Hard Rock quartet''s 1969 sophomore album housed in a gatefold sleeve with eight page booklet. Led Zeppelin were one of the most innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide. Led Zeppelin continues to be honored for it''s pivotal role in music history. The band was inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 1995, received a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2005, and a year later was awarded with the Polar Music Prize in Stockholm.','6/3/2014',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/2/4/4/2534424.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180367,'1984|van halen|van halen|lp','1984','Van Halen','Van Halen','LP','RHI547641.1','081227955267',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'27815816','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122795526',NULL,0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition of this 1984 album. Six years and five albums after their debut, Van Halen had become one of the biggest bands in world around the release of 1984, which includes a number of the bandΓÇÖs most legendary songs such as the #1 hit, "Jump", "Panama" and "Hot For Teacher". Mastering engineer Chris Bellman, who remastered the original albums at Bernie Grundman Mastering Studios, was enlisted for this new version. In order to produce the original sound the band intended, Bellman cut straight from the quarter-inch tapes.','3/31/2015',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/3/4/4/2844432.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180368,'pornography|the cure|the cure|lp','Pornography','The Cure','The Cure','LP','EA60785.1','081227981617',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'31372466','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122798161','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Pornography is the fourth studio album by English rock band The Cure, originally released on May 4th, 1982 by the Fiction Records. Preceded by the non-album single "Charlotte Sometimes" late the previous year, Pornography was the band''s first album with a new producer, Phil Thornalley, and was recorded at RAK Studios from January to April. The sessions saw the group on the brink of collapse, with heavy drug use, band in-fighting and group leader Robert Smith''s depression fueling the album''s musical and lyrical content. Pornography represents the conclusion of the group''s early dark, gloomy musical phase which began with Seventeen Seconds in 1980. - Following it''s release, bass guitarist Simon Gallup left the band and the Cure switched to a much brighter and more radio-friendly new wave sound. While poorly received by critics at the time of release, Pornography was their most popular album to date, reaching number 8 in the UK charts. Pornography has since gone on to gain acclaim from critics, and is now considered an important milestone in the development of the gothic rock genre.','9/6/2016',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/8/7/7/3377781.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180369,'led zeppelin 1|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin 1','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL535224.1','081227966416',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'26102856','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122796641','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally re-mastered edition of the Hard Rock quartet''s 1969 debut album. Led Zeppelin were one of the most innovative and successful groups in modern music. The band has sold more than 300 million albums worldwide. Led Zeppelin continues to be honored for it''s pivotal role in music history. The band was inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 1995, received a Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2005, and a year later was awarded with the Polar Music Prize in Stockholm.','6/3/2014',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/1869797-3554155.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180370,'disintegration|the cure|the cure|lp','Disintegration','The Cure','The Cure','LP','RHI523284.1','081227981693',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'14923319','2026-11-10 23:53:26','2026-11-10 23:53:26','/08122798169','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double 180gm vinyl LP pressing in gatefold sleeve. Digitally remastered edition of The Cure''s seminal eighth album. Originally released in 1989, Disintegration has come of age and has been remastered by Robert Smith to coincide with it''s 21st anniversary. Features the hits ''Pictures of You'', ''Lovesong'', ''Fascination Street'' and ''Lullaby''. Universal.','6/15/2010',1.270000000000000017,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/6/4/6/1596469.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180371,'here comes the groom rsd|john wesley harding|john wesley harding|lp','Here Comes the Groom (RSD)','John Wesley Harding','John Wesley Harding','LP','BDOW2.1','085218127381',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'45918636','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08521812738','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red, Black, Bonus Vinyl)',0,'Deluxe LP reissue of John Wesley Harding''s critically acclaimed debut album Here Comes The Groom, plus an entire second LP comprised of bonus tracks from the Here Comes The Groom sessions, as well as the God Made Me Do It EP, and live tracks that feature members of The Attractions.','4/18/2026',1.070000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4487312-3512608.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180372,'to hell with it clear vinyl|pinkpantheress|pinkpantheress|lp','To Hell With It   (Clear Vinyl)','Pinkpantheress','Pinkpantheress','LP','TZZE802248.1','0827568022486',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'46675392','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/082756802248','(Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Pinkpantheress - To Hell with It (Limited Edition Anniversary Edition Clear Vinyl) Pinkpantheress'' breakthrough mixtape fuses bedroom pop, UK garage, drum-and-bass, and wistful vocals into a compact collection of infectious miniature pop songs.','11/13/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4549769-3736643.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180373,'far beyond driven|pantera|pantera|lp','Far Beyond Driven [Explicit Content]','Pantera','Pantera','LP','ATL92302B.1','081227981280',33.10000000000000142,33.10000000000000142,'14996948','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08122798128','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'(2-LP set) 1994 release.','4/17/2010',1.620000000000000106,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/3/5/3/1613532.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180374,'rabbit fur coat|jenny lewis|jenny lewis|lp','Rabbit Fur Coat','Jenny Lewis','Jenny Lewis','LP','LEWY700026.1','086155700026',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'42964100','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08615570002','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The Ten Year Anniversary Edition of Rabbit Fur Coat Completely Remastered Audio 180 gram - Red vinyl Gatefold Download Code Included Comes with booklet containing never before seen photos by Autumn de Wilde.','11/24/2023',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4130720-3124464.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180375,'astral weeks|van morrison|van morrison|lp','Astral Weeks','Van Morrison','Van Morrison','LP','RHI1768.1','081227990718',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'13864729','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08122799071','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Pressed on 180gram vinyl. Mastered from the original analog master tapes and it features all original packaging 1968''s Astral Weeks remains not only Morrison''s masterpiece, but one of the greatest records ever made. A haunting, deeply personal collection of impressionistic Folk styled epics recorded by an All Star Jazz backing unit including bassist Richard Davis and drummer Connie Kay, it''s poetic complexity earned critical raves but made only a minimal commercial impact. Astral Weeks had been dark and anguished.','12/30/2008',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/1/8/7/1407810.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180376,'the doors|the doors|the doors|lp','The Doors','The Doors','The Doors','LP','RHI519559.1','081227986506',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'14620959','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08122798650','(180 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'12" 180-gram HQ virgin vinyl reissues of the original stereo mixes of the legendary band''s six Jim Morrison-fronted studio albums. The reissues of these now historic albums - all originally released between 1967 and 1970 - are replicas of the initial vinyl offerings, including artwork and inner sleeves. The laquers were cut at Bernie Grundman Mastering in Hollywood, CA under the direct supervision of original Doors producer/engineer Bruce Botnick and Electra Records founder Jac Holzman. The Doors, first released in January 1967, is one of rock music''s most famous debuts. It hit #2 in Billboard, and delivered the #1 signature smash "Light My Fire" plus "Break on Through," "The Crystal Ship," and "The End."','9/15/2009',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/4/5/8/1518545.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180377,'the return of halloween nuggets|various artists|various artists|lp','The Return Of Halloween Nuggets','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','RKBT3471.1','089353347123',17.94000000000000127,17.94000000000000127,'44481988','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08935334712','(Colored Vinyl, Orange, Black, Splatter)',0,'Limited orange and black splatter colored vinyl LP pressing. Looking for a somewhat-camp-but-always-fun novelty rock''n''roll soundtrack for your next Halloween party? Look no further: Return of Halloween Nuggets, our latest collection of crate- (and grave-) digging favorites, collects 18 graveyard smashes (plus two spooky film trailers) on one ghoulish, orange/black splatter colored vinyl album. For fans of deep 1960s vintage Halloween themed tunes: witches, werewolves, graveyards, monsters, devils, space aliens, and zombies set the stage for a camp and entertaining holiday bash. Features the super-rare 1962 Bettye LaVette track, Witchcraft in the Air, and the trailer to the 1959 Vincent Price spooktacular, House on Haunted Hill.','8/23/2024',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4355709-3197863.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180378,'strange days|the doors|the doors|lp','Strange Days','The Doors','The Doors','LP','RHI519558.1','081227986513',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'14620935','2026-11-10 23:53:34','2026-11-10 23:53:34','/08122798651','(180 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'12" 180-gram HQ virgin vinyl reissues of the original stereo mixes of the legendary band''s six Jim Morrison-fronted studio albums. The reissues of these now historic albums - all originally released between 1967 and 1970 - are replicas of the initial vinyl offerings, including artwork and inner sleeves. The laquers were cut at Bernie Grundman Mastering in Hollywood, CA under the direct supervision of original Doors producer/engineer Bruce Botnick and Electra Records founder Jac Holzman. STRANGE DAYS, first out in October ''67, went to #3 and introduced The Doors classics "People Are Strange," "Love Me Two Times" and "Strange Days."','9/15/2009',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/4/5/8/1518544.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
