INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180407,'living things|linkin park|linkin park|lp','Living Things','Linkin Park','Linkin Park','LP','WB729814.1','093624815655',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'46677587','2026-11-10 23:53:45','2026-11-10 23:53:45','/09362481565','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red, Smoke)',0,'Linkin Park fuse electronic textures, hard-rock dynamics and melodic songwriting on a streamlined album bridging multiple eras of the band''s sound.','11/20/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4550061-3751828.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180408,'weezer|weezer|weezer|lp','Weezer','Weezer','Weezer','LP','RPRW481867.1','093624818670',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'46348104','2026-11-10 23:53:45','2026-11-10 23:53:45','/09362481867','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold)',0,'The new Weezer album - Weezer - is hands down the band''s most collaborative. They all took turns contributing songs; they all took turns writing ON songs together. Produced by Kenneth Blume and Klas Ahlund, Weezer is already shaping up to be another standout in the band''s incredible, timeless catalog following the release of recent acclaimed single "Shine Again."','8/21/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4520837-3676110.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180409,'mule|orville peck|orville peck|lp','Mule [Explicit Content]','Orville Peck','Orville Peck','LP','WB482097.1','093624820970',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'46474223','2026-11-10 23:53:45','2026-11-10 23:53:45','/09362482097','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Tan)',0,'Mule, Orville Peck''s fourth studio album, arrives as his most intimate and ambitious work to date. Following last year''s Appaloosa EP, the record unfolds as a chronological account of the year that reshaped his life, tracing the collapse of addiction, the difficult pursuit of sobriety, and the slow, often uncertain process of rebuilding. Told with unflinching honesty, humor, and compassion, Mule finds Peck confronting love, loss, and identity through songs that move fluidly between classic country storytelling, bluegrass, and expansive Americana.','9/18/2026',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4531768-3702502.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180410,'weezer|weezer|weezer|cd','Weezer','Weezer','Weezer','CD','RPRW481888.2','093624818885',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'46348111','2026-11-10 23:53:45','2026-11-10 23:53:45','/09362481888',NULL,0,'The new Weezer album - Weezer - is hands down the band''s most collaborative. They all took turns contributing songs; they all took turns writing ON songs together. Produced by Kenneth Blume and Klas Ahlund, Weezer is already shaping up to be another standout in the band''s incredible, timeless catalog following the release of recent acclaimed single "Shine Again."','8/21/2026',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4520786-3695945.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
