INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180421,'ultrasound|the neighbourhood|the neighbourhood|lp','(((((Ultrasound)))))+','The Neighbourhood','The Neighbourhood','LP','WB728648.1','093624825715',35.15999999999999658,35.15999999999999658,'45929052','2026-11-10 23:53:47','2026-11-10 23:53:47','/09362482571','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Purple)',0,'Double purple colored vinyl LP pressing. Each deluxe vinyl cover features a unique "house logo" speaker grill and title design, highlighting a different underwater stowaway from their time beneath the waves. UltraSOUND+ by The Neighbourhood includes 5 new songs including the focus track "Good Grief", The Neighbourhood spent 5 years underwater before coming back with UltraSOUND, now with UltraSOUND+, The Neighbourhood has surfaced at the beach.','2/20/2026',0.959999999999999965,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/03/4488103-3516393.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180422,'dizzy up the girl|goo goo dolls|goo goo dolls|lp','Dizzy Up The Girl','Goo Goo Dolls','Goo Goo Dolls','LP','WB481805.1','093624818052',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46551917','2026-11-10 23:53:47','2026-11-10 23:53:47','/09362481805','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Goo Goo Dolls - Dizzy Up the Girl - Vinyl "Dizzy Up the Girl" is the Goo Goo Doll''s sixth studio album. Originally released in 1998 it remains their most successful album to date in most parts of the world. With U.S. sales of more than four million copies (4x platinum) and over five million globally, it includes the rock ballad smash hit "Iris," which reached #1 on the Hot 100 Airplay chart upon its release in 1998 and stayed there for 18 weeks. It also hit #1 on Billboard''s Modern Rock, Adult Top 40 and Mainstream Top 40 charts, earned three Grammy nominations, and is the most-streamed ''90s song on Spotify. The single LP is pressed on Blue Iris vinyl.','10/2/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4538666-3725948.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180423,'confessions ii|madonna|madonna|lp','Confessions II','Madonna','Madonna','LP','WB728906.1','093624822417',35.15999999999999658,35.15999999999999658,'46188090','2026-11-10 23:53:47','2026-11-10 23:53:47','/09362482241','(Clear Vinyl, Pink, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',0,'Madonna TITLE: CONFESSIONS II (Deluxe) (Translucent Pink 2xLP) Get VIP treatment to Club Confessions with this 2LP set featuring the 16-song continuous mix of the album. Pressed on translucent pink vinyl and housed in gatefold sleeve with mirrored inner sleeves. This edition includes a printed clear outer sleeve, a double-sided poster, exclusive numbered coat check and track list prayer card. Includes the Madonna & Sabrina Carpenter "Bring Your Love" single and "I Feel So Free".','7/3/2026',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4510849-3697853.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180424,'peaches bone|the black keys|the black keys|lp','Peaches!   (Bone)','The Black Keys','The Black Keys','LP','WB728858.1','093624823575',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45994197','2026-11-10 23:53:47','2026-11-10 23:53:47','/09362482357','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Cream)',0,'The Black Keys Peaches! Is the Akron duo''s fourteenth studio album (their sixth since 2019), a visceral and raw 10-song collection described by singer Dan Auerbach as the band''s "most natural record" since their 2002 debut, The Big Come Up. In similar DIY spirit, the album was recorded with all musicians playing in same room with few overdubs, as is the first record mixed entirely by the band themselves since 2006''s Magic Potion. The songs chosen reflect Auerbach and bandmate Patrick Carney''s obsessive record-collecting habit, which in recent years has escalated into an ongoing series of Record Hang DJ-set dance parties where they spin vintage 45s for packed, high-energy dancefloors in the coolest spots across the globe. The cover art for Peaches! Is based around an iconic image from Memphis-born photographer, William Eggleston, and marks the return of Patrick''s brother, Michael Carney, overseeing the art direction.- Bone colored vinyl','5/1/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4493055-3532499.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180425,'mule|orville peck|orville peck|cd','Mule [Explicit Content]','Orville Peck','Orville Peck','CD','WB482111.2','093624821113',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'46474247','2026-11-10 23:53:47','2026-11-10 23:53:47','/09362482111','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Mule, Orville Peck''s fourth studio album, arrives as his most intimate and ambitious work to date. Following last year''s Appaloosa EP, the record unfolds as a chronological account of the year that reshaped his life, tracing the collapse of addiction, the difficult pursuit of sobriety, and the slow, often uncertain process of rebuilding. Told with unflinching honesty, humor, and compassion, Mule finds Peck confronting love, loss, and identity through songs that move fluidly between classic country storytelling, bluegrass, and expansive Americana.','9/18/2026',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4531770-3715654.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180426,'confessions ii white vinyl indie exclusive|madonna|madonna|lp','Confessions II   (White Vinyl) (Indie Exclusive)','Madonna','Madonna','LP','WB728901.1','093624822448',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'46188083','2026-11-10 23:53:48','2026-11-10 23:53:48','/09362482244','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, White, Alternate Cover)',0,'CONFESSIONS II (White Vinyl) (Indie Exclusive) non-stop mix of the 12-song album pressed on indie exclusive white vinyl. Comes in a 2-sided red jacket with alternate cover art and double-sided poster.','7/3/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/4510848-3602274.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180427,'i ve tried everything but therapy complete edition|teddy swims|teddy swims|cd','I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (complete Edition) [Explicit Content]','Teddy Swims','Teddy Swims','CD','WB728428.2','093624826859',19.73999999999999843,19.73999999999999843,'45621215','2026-11-10 23:53:48','2026-11-10 23:53:48','/09362482685','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Jewel Case Packaging, Complete)',0,'TEDDY SWIMS / I''VE TRIED EVERYTHING BUT THERAPY (COMPLETE) 2xCD : Teddy Swims concludes his career-defining breakout era with I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (Complete Edition). The final chapter of his debut album follows the massive success of Parts 1 and 2, which included global hits like "Lose Control," "The Door," and "Bad Dreams." Featuring 32 songs in total, with select tracks appearing on CD for the first time, this special collection captures the full scope of Swims'' debut chapter. The Atlanta-born powerhouse has earned a GRAMMY nomination, broken records on the Billboard Hot 100, sold out a world tour, and collaborated with artists like GIV─ÆON, Muni Long, Coco Jones, GloRilla, and Thomas Rhett. With a voice that fuses soul, pop, R&B, and country - and performances on stages from The GRAMMYs to The BRITs -Swims has transformed into one of the most dynamic voices of his generation.','11/28/2025',0.25,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/4466633-3510608.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180428,'danger days the true lives of the fabulous killjoys|my chemical romance|my chemical romance|lp','Danger Days: The True Lives Of The Fabulous Killjoys [Explicit Content]','My Chemical Romance','My Chemical Romance','LP','RPRW482617.1','093624826170',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'46297778','2026-11-10 23:53:50','2026-11-10 23:53:50','/09362482617','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'My Chemical Romance - Danger Days: The True Lives of the Fabulous Killjoys (Deluxe Edition) [Sea Blue 2LP] My Chemical Romance''s Danger Days: The True Lives of the Fabulous Killjoys Deluxe Edition double LP includes a remastered album, nine unreleased and rare bonus tracks including the "Mad Gear & Missile Kid'' EP, "Zero Percent", and the band''s cover of "Common People". Now available for the first time in physical edition pressed on Sea Blue vinyl, including 3D paper craft Killjoys Guns and Killjoys Character sticker sheets exclusive to this Deluxe Edition.','7/10/2026',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4516447-3628169.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
