INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180446,'i ve tried everything but therapy complete edition|teddy swims|teddy swims|lp','I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (Complete Edition) [Explicit Content]','Teddy Swims','Teddy Swims','LP','WB728428.1','093624827832',54.79999999999999716,54.79999999999999716,'45620881','2026-11-10 23:53:52','2026-11-10 23:53:52','/09362482783','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, White, Orange, Splatter)',0,'TEDDY SWIMS / I''VE TRIED EVERYTHING BUT THERAPY (COMPLETE) 3xLP : Teddy Swims concludes his career-defining breakout era with I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (Complete Edition) - a 3LP vinyl pressed on milky clear and orange splatter vinyl. The final chapter of his debut album follows the massive success of Parts 1 and 2, which included global hits like "Lose Control," "The Door," and "Bad Dreams." Featuring 32 songs in total, with select tracks appearing on vinyl for the first time, this special collection captures the full scope of Swims'' debut chapter. The Atlanta-born powerhouse has earned a GRAMMY nomination, broken records on the Billboard Hot 100, sold out a world tour, and collaborated with artists like GIV─ÆON, Muni Long, Coco Jones, GloRilla, and Thomas Rhett. With a voice that fuses soul, pop, R&B, and country - and performances on stages from The GRAMMYs to The BRITs - Swims has transformed into one of the most dynamic voices of his generation.','11/28/2025',1.620000000000000106,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/4466632-3510613.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180447,'make up is a lie blue|morrissey|morrissey|lp','Make-Up Is A Lie  (BLUE)','Morrissey','Morrissey','LP','SIRE728160.1','093624829799',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45907517','2026-11-10 23:53:52','2026-11-10 23:53:52','/09362482979','(Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Morrissey - Make-up is a Lie (Blue LP) The legendary singer/songwriter Morrissey returns with his much anticipated 14th solo album, his first in over 5 years. The album also marks his return to Sire Records, the home of the early Morrissey solo albums, and of course, The Smiths catalog. Morrissey is rightly acknowledged as one of the greatest lyricists of his generation, and a hugely influential figure in pop music over the last 40+ years. Make-Up Is A Lie was recorded in France and features 11 new songs, all which are certain to become classics in Morrissey''s catalog. A superb cover of Roxy Music''s "Amazona" rounds out the 12-track album."Make-Up Is A Lie", the album''s title track, is the first single and is the perfect introduction to the infectious grooves, melodies and lyrics that are a theme through the entire album. Morrissey''s legions of fans around the world will embrace this album with enthusiasm.','3/6/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4486328-3543776.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180448,'warning warning 25th anniversary deluxe edition|green day|green day|lp','Warning Warning (25th Anniversary Deluxe Edition)','Green Day','Green Day','LP','RPRW728158.1','093624829850',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45588525','2026-11-10 23:53:53','2026-11-10 23:53:53','/09362482985','(Limited Edition, Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Warning (25th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) - Green Day''s sixth studio album Warning was released on October 3, 2000, and has gone on to sell over 1 million copies in the US and over 3 million worldwide. - The album includes three hit singles: "Warning", "Waiting" and "Minority", a track that continues to be a live favorite. The album has been one of the most celebrated in the band''s catalogue, with the critics applauding the band''s adventurous musical direction and Billie Joe Armstrong''s strong song writing.','11/14/2025',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/94/4463694-3510618.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180449,'private music|deftones|deftones|cd','Private Music [Explicit Content]','Deftones','Deftones','CD','RPRW727849.2','093624832263',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'45362149','2026-11-10 23:53:53','2026-11-10 23:53:53','/09362483226','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Booklet)',0,'Deftones have always defined boundless creativity in the music space. Across nine studio albums, they have carved out an unmistakable sonic identity - ferocious yet dreamlike, while making space for constant refinement and surprise. Now, decades on from the groove-forward sound of their era-defining debut, Adrenaline, and following a long line of masterpieces including 2000''s White Pony, 2010''s Diamond Eyes and 2020''s Ohms- an album that earned them their second and third Grammy nominations - they return with one of the most focused statements of their career: private music. Joining the band''s creative core of Chino Moreno, Stephen Carpenter, Abe Cunningham and Frank Delgado (as well as touring bassist Fred Sablan, who appears on the album) is producer Nick Raskulinecz, who previously worked on Diamond Eyes and 2012''s riveting Koi No Yokan. The result is a lean, masterfully paced 11-song set that plays like a new Deftones benchmark. Meditating on the beauty and peril of nature, the challenge of cultivating a positive mindset and visions of a journey beyond the physical realm, private music showcases Deftones at their most evolved. At once a psychedelic voyage and a skull-rattling wallop, it''s the latest peak in a catalog filled with immersive, emotive triumphs.','8/22/2025',0.1199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4443313-3418893.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180450,'make up is a lie red|morrissey|morrissey|lp','Make-Up Is A Lie  (RED)','Morrissey','Morrissey','LP','SIRE728176.1','093624829775',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45907524','2026-11-10 23:53:53','2026-11-10 23:53:53','/09362482977','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'The legendary singer/songwriter Morrissey returns with his much anticipated 14th solo album, his first in over 5 years. The album also marks his return to Sire Records, the home of the early Morrissey solo albums, and of course, The Smiths catalog. Make-Up Is A Lie was recorded in France and features 11 new songs, all which are certain to become classics in Morrissey''s catalog. A superb cover of Roxy Music''s "Amazona" rounds out the 12-track album.','3/6/2026',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4486331-3534772.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180451,'i barely know her|sombr|sombr|cd','I Barely Know Her','Sombr','Sombr','CD','WB728430.2','093624827702',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'45470714','2026-11-10 23:53:53','2026-11-10 23:53:53','/09362482770',NULL,0,'A New York native raised on the Lower East Side, 20-year-old singer, songwriter, and producer Sombr (born Shane Boose) began making music in his bedroom while studying classical composition at LaGuardia High School. After breaking through with 2022''s viral hit "caroline," he''s quickly become one of music''s fastest-rising stars-amassing over 50 million monthly Spotify listeners, selling out shows worldwide, and making his late-night debut on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon. Now based in Los Angeles and signed to Warner Records, the MTV VMA Best New Artist nominee is set to release his highly anticipated debut albumI Barely Know Heron August 22, written entirely by Sombr and co-produced with Tony Berg (Phoebe Bridgers, Boygenius). With over 2 billion career streams, a record-breaking #1 at Alternative Radio, and chart-topping singles "back to friends," "undressed," and "12 to 12," Sombr continues to captivate a global audience with his intimate, self-written songs exploring young love and heartbreak.','11/7/2025',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4453536-3442063.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180452,'live at the legion|billy strings bryan sutton|billy strings bryan sutton|lp','Live At The Legion','Billy Strings & Bryan Sutton','Billy Strings & Bryan Sutton','LP','RPRW727977.1','093624831037',39.28000000000000113,39.28000000000000113,'45125225','2026-11-10 23:53:53','2026-11-10 23:53:53','/09362483103','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red, White)',0,'Recorded Live at the American Legion Inglewood Post 82 in 2024 Live at the Legion (Tri-color vinyl - red, white, blue) (Indie Exclusive)','8/1/2025',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4421736-3388234.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180453,'wildflowers one step|tom petty|tom petty|lp','Wildflowers (One Step)','Tom Petty','Tom Petty','LP','WB72794.1','093624831440',97.9599999999999938,97.9599999999999938,'45500060','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483144','(180 Gram Vinyl, Numbered)',0,'In a career full of great albums, most Tom Petty fans call ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ a masterpiece, likely his most acclaimed album. Produced by Rick Rubin with Tom Petty & Mike Campbell it was released in November of 1994 featuring 15 songs. ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ is considered a creative high point in TomΓÇÖs career. Originally conceived as a double album as Tom had written and recorded 25 songs ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ was eventually cut down to 15 songs. ΓÇ£You DonΓÇÖt Know How It FeelsΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£You Wreck MeΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£ItΓÇÖs Good To Be KingΓÇ¥, and ΓÇ£A Highe ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ was originally recorded, mixed and mastered on analog tape, so this One-Step version is a true All Analog presentation as Chris Bellman carefully cut 7 lacquers from the original master tapes as the source for this incredible sounding release! TomΓÇÖs audio archivist Ryan Ulyate was involved at every step and provided invaluable information and research along the way ΓÇô including keeping a close eye on the master tapes as lacquer after lacquer was cut. ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ original album package designer, Jeri Heiden was brought in to create the beautiful double gatefold jacket.  We listened to and analyzed many different vinyl pressings, CDs and Hi Rez audio to be certain the magic coming off the tapes would transcend every other pressing ΓÇô all of which s THE PROCESS:  One-Step vinyl is the ultimate vinyl pressing. Because Sound Matters'' meticulous One-Step process creates the definitive sounding audiophile version of the all-time classic Tom Petty album, ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ.  The original analog master tapes have been used to ensure ΓÇÿWildflowersΓÇÖ has never sounded better!  The initial pressing of this One-Step version is limited to 6,000 copies. The album is housed inside a top quality, uniquely designed numbered slipcase. The enclosed LP will feature an ΓÇ£Old StyleΓÇ¥ double pocket gatefold tip-on jacket for the first time. Special care has been taken to faithfully preserve the original sound with exceptional clarity and depth, capturing the recording''s nuances and subtleties at every step to create the best sounding record possible.  The One-Step process is highly regarded among audiophiles and collectors for its unparalleled sound fidelity and represents the pinnacle of vinyl manufacturing craftsmanship. FEATURES: Audio Source:  Original Analog Master Tapes Vinyl Compound: Neotech VR900-D2 180g High Performance Vinyl Vinyl Mastering: Chris Bellman at Bernie Grundman Mastering One-Step Process: Dorin Sauerbier at Record Technology, Inc. Pressing: Record Technology, Inc. Packaging & Print: Stoughton Printing Company (One Step) (Indie/D2C Exclusive), 2 x LP @180g High Performance D2 Vinyl, First Pressing Limited to 6,000 Numbered Copies','10/10/2025',2.089999999999999857,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/90/4456190-3462822.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180454,'coastal original soundtrack|neil young|neil young|lp','Coastal (Original Soundtrack)','Neil Young','Neil Young','LP','RPRW728114.1','093624830108',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45201028','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483010',NULL,0,'Coastal is a personal, behind-the-scenes documentary on Neil Young as he cruises the coast on his 2023 solo US tour. The film gives an intimate view of the maverick musician, as he navigates a return to the stage post-Covid. From his everyday observations on the bus to his candid banter with his audience. Coastal is a rare peek behind the curtain of this unguarded iconoclast. The film was shot and directed by Daryl Hannah. Coastal - The Soundtrack features 11 Neil Young songs including "Song X", "Vampire Blues" "Expecting To Fly", "Throw Your Hatred Down", "I Am A Child", and "Prime of Life".','9/19/2025',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4428309-3395705.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180455,'private music|deftones|deftones|lp','Private Music [Explicit Content]','Deftones','Deftones','LP','RPRW727849.1','093624832355',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45362125','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483235','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, Booklet)',0,'Deftones - Private Music - Vinyl Limited Clear vinyl first pressing, initial pressing (all versions incl. 8-panel booklet). Future pressings will be black vinyl.','8/22/2025',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4443289-3418894.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180456,'the live anthology from the vaults vol 1|petty tom heartbreakers|petty tom heartbreakers|lp','The Live Anthology: From The Vaults Vol. 1','PETTY,TOM / HEARTBREAKERS','PETTY,TOM / HEARTBREAKERS','LP','WB830399.1','093624830399',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45574658','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483039','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Turquoise, Numbered, Foil Embossed / Foil Stamped)',0,'Double-LP, foil stamped numbered cover. Color Vinyl: Turquoise Blue','11/27/2025',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/4462264-3460992.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180457,'no rain no flowers|the black keys|the black keys|lp','No Rain No Flowers','The Black Keys','The Black Keys','LP','WB727678.1','093624832904',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45219092','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483290','(Poster)',0,'No Rain, No Flowers - The Black Keys - 13th Studio Album featuring the hit single "The Night Before" plus "No Rain, No Flowers" and "Babygirl." Collaborating with iconic songwriters such as Rick Nowels, Daniel Tashian and legendary keys player Scott Storch, the GRAMMY winning Ohio band craft their most ambitious and adventurous album yet, braiding together the pair''s sprawling, eclectic musical influence. STANDARD LP This black vinyl LP package includes a printed inner sleeve and a 24" x 36" poster.','8/8/2025',0.7900000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4430002-3433671.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180458,'tonight s the night|neil young|neil young|lp','Tonight''s The Night','Neil Young','Neil Young','LP','RPRW727441.1','093624835134',39.28000000000000113,39.28000000000000113,'45639135','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483513','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,NULL,'11/28/2025',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4468155-3470332.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180459,'ten thousand fists yellow flame 2lp|disturbed|disturbed|lp','Ten Thousand Fists (Yellow Flame 2LP)','Disturbed','Disturbed','LP','RPRW728023.1','093624830801',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45341021','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483080','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Disturbed third studio album was released in September 2005. The album debuted at #1 on the Billboard Top 200 and it has since been certified 3 x Platinum by the RIAA. The album features the hit single "Stricken", one of the band''s most popular songs. Other singles released from the album include "Just Stop", "Guarded" and the Genesis cover "Land of Confusion". To celebrate the Ten Thousand Fists 20th Anniversary, this limited edition is being pressed on Yellow Flame vinyl.','9/19/2025',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4441263-3443743.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180460,'begin to hope yellow flame lp|regina spektor|regina spektor|lp','Begin to Hope (Yellow Flame LP)','Regina Spektor','Regina Spektor','LP','WB727395.1','093624835462',16.0,16.0,'45106675','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483546','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Regina Spektor''s 2006 break-out album available on limited edition Yellow Flame vinyl. As the follow-up to 2004''s Soviet Kitsch, which was recorded live to tape, Begin to Hope sees Spektor''s first collaboration with producer David Kahne. - She broadens her palette and expands her sonic vision with synth keyboards, drum machines, electronic loops, and layered vocal harmonies. The result is a trailblazing pop record. Includes "Fidelity", "Better", "On the Radio", "Samson" and more.','5/16/2025',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4420177-3395753.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180461,'warning 25th anniversary deluxe edition deluxe indie d2c vinyl box green yellow and orange with sign|green day|green day|lp','Warning (25th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) Deluxe Indie/ D2C Vinyl Box - Green, Yellow and Orange (with Sign)','Green Day','Green Day','LP','RPRW727636.1','093624833284',117.3599999999999995,117.3599999999999995,'45588518','2026-11-10 23:53:54','2026-11-10 23:53:54','/09362483328','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Warning (25th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) Deluxe Indie/D2C Vinyl Box - Green, Yellow and Orange (with Sign) - Green Day''s sixth studio album Warning was released on October 3, 2000, and has gone on to sell over 1 million copies in the US and over 3 million worldwide. - The album includes three hit singles: "Warning", "Waiting" and "Minority", a track that continues to be a live favorite. The album has been one of the most celebrated in the band''s catalogue, with the critics applauding the band''s adventurous musical direction and Billie Joe Armstrong''s strong song writing.','11/14/2025',4.400000000000000356,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4463693-3460940.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180462,'reverie|amble|amble|lp','Reverie','Amble','Amble','LP','WB727875.1','093624831884',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46127242','2026-11-10 23:53:55','2026-11-10 23:53:55','/09362483188','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Following an incredible year for the band, we''re delighted to be repressing the previously sold-out limited orange vinyl to coincide with their upcoming UK tour in November. The album peaked inside the UK Top 50 on release and topped the Official Folk Albums Chart following an impressive run of sold out in stores and intimate shows. After a US tour support with Hozier earlier this year, Amble were recently confirmed for a run of US stadium shows Ed Sheeran in 2026, along with their own sold-out international dates across the Ireland, US, Europe, Australia and Asia.','5/29/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4505071-3606469.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180463,'three cheers for sweet revenge deluxe edition|my chemical romance|my chemical romance|cd','Three Cheers For Sweet Revenge (Deluxe Edition) [Explicit Content]','My Chemical Romance','My Chemical Romance','CD','RPRW727129.2','093624838883',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'45126543','2026-11-10 23:53:55','2026-11-10 23:53:55','/09362483888','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'My Chemical Romance''s Three Cheers For Sweet Revenge (Deluxe Edition) available on CD. The entire 13-track album that includes the hits "I''m Not Okay (I Promise), "Helena", "The Ghost of You", and "You Know What They Do To Guys Like Us In Prison" has been remixed by Rich Costey and packaged in brand new artwork. Additionally, four bonus tracks recorded for BBC in 2005 have been included. Three of the bonus tracks are previously unreleased live versions of "I''m Not Okay (I Promise)", "Helena", and "The Ghost Of You". The fourth bonus track is a live version of "You Know What They Do To Guys Like Us In Prison" which was a B-side to limited edition UK CD single of "I''m Not Okay (I Promise)."','6/6/2025',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4421943-3384127.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180464,'from zero translucent sea blue vinyl|linkin park|linkin park|lp','From Zero (Translucent Sea Blue Vinyl)','Linkin Park','Linkin Park','LP','WB727041.1','093624839941',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'44640286','2026-11-10 23:53:55','2026-11-10 23:53:55','/09362483994','(Clear Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Linkin Park - From Zero - Vinyl Before Linkin Park, our first band name was Xero. This album title refers to both this humble beginning and the journey weΓÇÖre currently undertaking. Sonically and emotionally, it is about past, present, and futureΓÇöembracing our signature sound, but new and full of life. It was made with a deep appreciation for our new and longtime bandmates, our friends, our family, and our fans. We are proud of what Linkin Park has become over the years, and excited about the journey ahead.','11/15/2024',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4372816-3273289.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180465,'american heart|benson boone|benson boone|lp','American Heart','Benson Boone','Benson Boone','LP','WB727452.1','093624834953',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45142352','2026-11-10 23:53:55','2026-11-10 23:53:55','/09362483495','(Colored Vinyl, Red, White, Blue)',0,'Benson Boone - American Heart - Vinyl Red, White and Blue Marble Vinyl LP Benson Boone is quickly soaring to global pop stardom on the heels of a breakout year in 2024. His brand new album American Heart builds upon that success and expands his sonic landscape, creating a project that feels both larger-than-life and sincere at its core. Boasting lead single "Sorry I''m Here For Someone Else" in addition to standout tracks like "Mystical Magical," "I Wanna Be The One You Call," "Young American Heart," and the deeply personal "Momma Song," American Heart sees Benson hone in on compelling narratives and a rock-tinged, 70s pop sound that delivers a sense of nostalgia while feeling fresh and inventive.','6/20/2025',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4423537-3394698.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180466,'no rain no flowers|the black keys|the black keys|lp','No Rain No Flowers','The Black Keys','The Black Keys','LP','WB728064.1','093624830580',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45219108','2026-11-10 23:53:55','2026-11-10 23:53:55','/09362483058','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Ruby, Red)',0,'The Black Keys - INDIE LP No Rain, No Flowers - The Black Keys - 13th Studio Album featuring the hit single "The Night Before" plus "No Rain, No Flowers" and "Babygirl." Collaborating with iconic songwriters such as Rick Nowels, Daniel Tashian and legendary keys player Scott Storch, the GRAMMY winning Ohio band craft their most ambitious and adventurous album yet, braiding together the pair''s sprawling, eclectic musical influence. This Ruby Red vinyl LP package includes a printed inner sleeve and a 24" x 36" poster.','8/8/2025',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/4430004-3397862.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
