INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180475,'the sickness 25th anniversary edition limited green vinyl|disturbed|disturbed|lp','The Sickness (25th Anniversary Edition)  (limited green vinyl) [Explicit Content]','Disturbed','Disturbed','LP','RPRW726689.1','093624843283',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'44925772','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484328','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited green colored vinyl LP pressing. Celebrate 25 years of Disturbed''s debut album, The Sickness, with this limited vinyl reissue.','3/7/2025',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4401772-3327657.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180476,'the hunting party|linkin park|linkin park|lp','The Hunting Party','Linkin Park','Linkin Park','LP','WB726607.1','093624844075',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'44451738','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484407',NULL,0,'Double colored vinyl LP pressing. The Hunting Party was released in June 2014 and is Linkin Park''s sixth studio album. The 12 track album includes the singles "Final Masquerade,"Until It''s Gone," and "Guilty All The Same." Appearing on this album with Linkin Park are several guest collaborators: Daron Malakian (System of a Down), Page Hamilton (Helmet), Tom Morello (Rage Against The Machine / Audioslave) and Rakim.','7/26/2024',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4351943-3201529.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180477,'meteora|linkin park|linkin park|lp','Meteora','Linkin Park','Linkin Park','LP','WB726608.1','093624844051',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'44451707','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484405',NULL,0,'Limited splatter colored vinyl LP pressing. Meteora, Linkin Park''s ground-breaking second album, was released in March 2003 and includes the global hit singles "Somewhere I Belong", "Faint", "Numb", "Breaking The Habit" and "From The Inside." It has sold over 8 million copies in the US and has been certified multi-platinum, platinum, or gold in 15 countries.','7/26/2024',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4351944-3726101.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180478,'fireworks rollerblades clear vinyl|benson boone|benson boone|lp','Fireworks & Rollerblades (Clear Vinyl)','Benson Boone','Benson Boone','LP','WB725625.1','093624842866',23.98999999999999844,23.98999999999999844,'44453374','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484286','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Benson Boone''s intimate, diaristic pop songs are constantly evolving as he quickly becomes a global hitmaker. His latest single, the smash hit "Beautiful Things," quickly soared into the Top 10 of the Billboard Hot 100 after topping charts across the globe such as #1 Billboard Global 200 and #1 Billboard Global Excl. US for 7 consecutive weeks in a row as well as hitting #1 on both Top 40 and Hot AC Radio. Benson is reaching new heights in 2024, with over 4 billion career streams to date, a sold out world tour, and a debut albumFireworks & Rollerblades. Since it''s release the album has stayed in the Top 15 on the Billboard 200 Chart and continues to climb. Fireworks & Rollerbladesis a metaphor that details the ride that''s led Benson to this point in his relationships, coming of age & even his recent career success. This album includes not only new music, but his previous hit songs such as his breakout single "Ghost Town", which was Boone''s first entry on the Billboard Hot 100 and a Top 25 hit at both Top 40 and Hot AC radio, and "In The Stars," which is now certified Platinum.','7/26/2024',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4352391-3198976.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180479,'highway prayers|billy strings|billy strings|cd','Highway Prayers','Billy Strings','Billy Strings','CD','RPRW844792.2','093624844792',13.78999999999999915,13.78999999999999915,'44567194','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484479',NULL,0,'BILLY STRINGS Highway Prayers Modern bluegrass superstar Billy Strings has announced Highway Prayers, his first studio release since his 2022 father-son team-up LP Me/And/Dad and his first solo studio collection since 2021''s Renewal. The 20-track LP, co-produced by Billy Strings and Jon Brion, is due out on September 2024. CD','9/27/2024',0.1400000000000000134,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4365547-3228991.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180480,'saviors|green day|green day|lp','Saviors [Explicit Content]','Green Day','Green Day','LP','RPRW727560.1','093624833994',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45111150','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362483399','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Deluxe Edition, Clear Vinyl, Pink)',0,'Saviors (├⌐dition de luxe) (Clear with Hot Pink Splatter 2LP) (Indie Exclusive) Green Day is not your savior. - But the spirit of rock n roll might be. And as the greatest punk band alive, they''re the loudest vessel we have... to flip-off the oligarchy. - Now, a year into their Grammy-nominated Saviors era-one that''s reignited the music world (and Coachella stage) by storm. Green Day shows no signs of slowing down. Enter Saviors (├⌐dition de luxe), dropping May 23, 2025. - This expanded version includes 7 bonus tracks: the explosive "Smash It Like Belushi, " "F*** Off, " "Ballyhoo" and "Underdog, " a reflective "Stay Young, " plus acoustic renditions of "Suzie Chapstick" and "Father to a Son." Together, they amplify the fire that "The American Dream Is Killing Me" first sparked-now more Molotov cocktail than SOS flare. - Amazingly, Saviors represents Green Day''s 14th studio album, yet somehow this enduring power trio - Billie Joe Armstrong, Tr├⌐ Cool & Mike Dirnt - remain devoted to their defiant craft that has fueled their career-long destruction of every boundary bestowed on the genre, and landed 3 East Bay punks in the Rock n Roll Hall of Fame. - The album was recorded in both London and Los Angeles under the audacious ear and Rock prowess of Green Day''s longtime friend & collaborator, GRAMMY┬« Award-winning producer Rob Cavallo.','5/23/2025',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4420570-3384899.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180481,'zach bryan|zach bryan|zach bryan|cd','Zach Bryan','Zach Bryan','Zach Bryan','CD','WB725898.2','093624849780',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'43799930','2026-11-10 23:53:57','2026-11-10 23:53:57','/09362484978',NULL,0,'2023 release. The self-titled album from singer-songwriter-producer Zach Bryan is an expansive yet intimate 16-track set that explores the Grammy-nominated artist''s Oklahoma roots as well as his vast and varied confluence of musical and literary influences. Written and produced by Bryan himself, this album is a raw and unfiltered communique from the songs'' creator directly to the heart of his global audience. The album boasts appearances from The Lumineers on the song "Spotless," country superstar Kacey Musgraves on album highlight "I Remember Everything," as well as features from Sierra Ferrell on "Holy Roller" and The War and Treaty on "Hey Driver." Other standout tracks, which capture Bryan''s honest and relatable storytelling and poignant delivery, are "El Dorado," "Tourniquet," and album-closer "Oklahoma Son."','10/13/2023',0.1799999999999999934,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4246583-3038414.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
