INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180503,'it s been awful|isaiah rashad|isaiah rashad|lp','It''s Been Awful [Explicit Content]','Isaiah Rashad','Isaiah Rashad','LP','WB485809.1','093624858096',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'46273437','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-10 23:54:02','/09362485809','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 2026 release. It''s Been Awful is the third studio album by rapper Isaiah Rashad. Production on the album was handled by numerous record producers, including Julian Sintonia, Kal Banx, Hollywood Cole, and Jansport J, among others.','6/19/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4515383-3622080.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180504,'american idiot 20th anniversary red black splatter 2lp|green day|green day|lp','American Idiot (20th Anniversary Red & Black Splatter 2LP)','Green Day','Green Day','LP','RPRW714906B.1','093624862734',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'44590123','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-21 16:09:02','/093624862734','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Black, Anniversary Edition, Splatter)',0,'20th Anniversary Red & Black Splatter VINYL Green Day''s seventh studio albumAmerican Idiotwas released in September 2004 and has since sold over 23 million copies worldwide, including 9 million in the US. The album is a punk rock opera masterpiece that won the Best Rock Album at the 2005 Grammy Awards©. Five hit singles were released from the album: "Boulevard of Broken Dreams", "Holiday", "Wake Me Up When September Ends", "Jesus of Suburbia", and the title track, "American Idiot".This is a special, limited red with black splatter color 2 LP 20th Anniversary version of American Idiot.','10/25/2024',1.139999999999999902,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/4367932-3235464.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180505,'papercuts|linkin park|linkin park|lp','Papercuts','Linkin Park','Linkin Park','LP','WB726366.1','093624846000',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'44196950','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-10 23:54:02','/09362484600',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Papercuts is the first singles collection from innovative musical force Linkin Park. The career-spanning 20-track album compiles 18 essential anthems, plus the never-before-released track "Friendly Fire" recorded during the 2017 sessions for their seventh album One More Light and fan-favorite rarity "QWERTY". Linkin Park were inspired to thoughtfully curate Papercuts by their fans'' passionate reception of the 20th Anniversary Editions of Hybrid Theory in 2020 and Meteora last year. That enthusiasm led to this comprehensive retrospective of the band''s journey so far in the span of one album.','4/12/2024',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4304671-3123684.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180506,'three cheers for sweet revenge|my chemical romance|my chemical romance|cd','Three Cheers for Sweet Revenge [Explicit Content]','My Chemical Romance','My Chemical Romance','CD','RPRW48615.2','093624861522',8.519999999999999574,8.519999999999999574,'10016244','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-21 16:09:10','/093624861522','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'THREE CHEERS FOR SWEET REVENGE, the major-label debut album from My Chemical Romance, is one of the years most anticipated albums. With influences ranging from Iron Maiden and the Misfits to Morrissey. The first single is "I''m Not Ok (I Promis)."','6/8/2004',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/9/6/3/643693.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180507,'god said no|omar apollo|omar apollo|lp','God Said No','Omar Apollo','Omar Apollo','LP','WB858232.1','093624858232',25.71000000000000085,25.71000000000000085,'44397241','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-10 23:54:02','/09362485823','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold)',0,NULL,'6/28/2024',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4343587-3186678.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180508,'god said no|omar apollo|omar apollo|lp','God Said No','Omar Apollo','Omar Apollo','LP','WB724767.1','093624858256',25.71000000000000085,25.71000000000000085,'44396466','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-10 23:54:02','/09362485825','(Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Traversing the bounds of genre and language in his songs, singer-songwriter GRAMMY nominated Omar Apollo captures the adventurous spirit that this multi-hyphenate moment in pop demands, returning with his highly anticipated sophomore album, God Said No. God Said No is Omar''s interpretation of "lo que sera, sera" which translates to "whatever will be, will be". The phrase embodies the album with Omar''s tongue-in-cheek humorous outlook on the suffering that comes from surrendering and accepting whatever is thrown at you by life, a relationship, or lover. Omar believes his natural state is longing for love or stability, and elements of the album are about surrendering to that. The record was created with Teo Halm, Blake Slatkin, Carter Lang, Dylan Wiggins, and Oscar Santander, among other contributors. In 2022 with the release of Ivory, Apollo''s eclectic debut, his hit single and career first Billboard Hot 100 entry "Evergreen (You Didn''t Deserve Me at All)" was certified platinum, sold out his first headlining tour, and performed arenas with SZA and Daniel Caesar. Omar Apollo is a true visionary, whose one-of-a-kind pop synthesis unites listeners from all walks of life in a shared passion for rhythm and soul.','6/28/2024',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4343430-3185912.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180509,'i ve tried everything but therapy part 2 limited edition solid tangerine colored vinyl|teddy swims|teddy swims|lp','I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (Part 2) [Limited Edition Solid Tangerine Colored Vinyl]','Teddy Swims','Teddy Swims','LP','WB853145.1','093624853145',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'44706562','2026-11-10 23:54:02','2026-11-10 23:54:02','/09362485314','(Clear Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Limited Solid Tangerine colored vinyl LP pressing. "I''ve Tried Everything But Therapy (Part 2)" is the second part of Teddy Swims'' debut album, arriving January 24, 2025. It follows the massive success of Part 1, which includes his multi-platinum global smash hits, "Lose Control" and "The Door." This self-taught Atlanta-born vocal powerhouse has swiftly risen to the forefront of the music scene in 2024 with record breaking songs, sold-out global tours, and iconic performances. With a voice that effortlessly blends genres, including R&B, soul, and pop, Teddy Swims has captivated listeners with his raw emotion. His voice, full of soulful resonance, carries the weight of lived experience and his lyrics delve into themes of love, loss, and self-discovery.','1/24/2025',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/4379948-3315675.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop,Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180510,'it s been awful|isaiah rashad|isaiah rashad|lp','It''s Been Awful [Explicit Content]','Isaiah Rashad','Isaiah Rashad','LP','WB485813.1','093624858133',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'46273499','2026-11-10 23:54:03','2026-11-10 23:54:03','/09362485813','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'ISAIAH RASHAD / IT''S BEEN AWFUL - It''s Been Awful marks the moment Isaiah Rashad fully becomes his own genre. The Top Dawg Entertainment visionary returns with his third studio album, expanding his sonic world beyond hip-hop into cosmic jazz, psychedelic guitar rock, Soulquarian neo-soul, and flashes of genre-blurring experimentation. Featuring SZA, Dominic Fike, and Julian Sintonia, Rashad delivers his most vulnerable and fully-realized work yet after five transformative years, an unfiltered reflection on addiction, growth, self-confrontation, and redemption.','6/19/2026',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4515385-3611402.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180511,'greatest hits|red hot chili peppers|red hot chili peppers|lp','Greatest Hits [Explicit Content]','Red Hot Chili Peppers','Red Hot Chili Peppers','LP','WB48545.1','093624854517',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'30829114','2026-11-10 23:54:03','2026-11-10 23:54:03','/09362485451','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Limited double vinyl LP pressing. The Red Hot Chili Peppers'' first Warner Bros. Greatest Hits album spans almost 15 years of rock greatness. Featuring all of the band''s best- loved recordings, Greatest Hits includes "Under The Bridge" (#2 pop and gold), the Top 10 "Scar Tissue," six classic Modern Rock #1s, a pair of Modern Rock Top 20s and three other fan favorites plus two brand-new songs. One of the most successful acts in rock history, Red Hot Chili Peppers have sold more than 60 million albums, including five multi-platinum LPs, and won six Grammy Awards, including Best Rock Album for Stadium Arcadium, Best Rock Performance By a Duo or Group for "Dani California, Best Rock Song for "Scar Tissue," and Best Hard Rock Performance With Vocal for "Give It Away." The band holds the record for the most #1 singles of all time at alternative radio, a total of 11, and a combined 81 weeks at #1.','5/13/2016',1.0,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/9/0/4/3314092.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180512,'crack the skye 15th anniversary deluxe edition|mastodon|mastodon|lp','Crack The Skye (15th Anniversary Deluxe Edition)','Mastodon','Mastodon','LP','RPRW857570.1','093624857570',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'44607715','2026-11-10 23:54:03','2026-11-10 23:54:03','/09362485757','(Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Crack the Skye (15th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) 15th Anniversary Deluxe Edition of Mastodon''s fourth studio album, Crack the Skye, on 2LP Sky Blue Vinyl. Disc 1 is the original album remastered while Disc 2, Crack the Skye: The Score, features instrumental versions of each track. Originally released in March 2009, the album features "Oblivion", "Divinations" "The Last Baron" and more.','10/4/2024',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4369581-3232009.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180513,'illenium|illenium|illenium|lp','Illenium','Illenium','Illenium','LP','WB695236.1','093624869337',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'43322060','2026-11-10 23:54:03','2026-11-10 23:54:03','/09362486933','(Clear Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Double orange colored vinyl LP pressing. 2023 release. As one of the most successful crossover electronic artists today, Grammy Award nominated producer/DJ and instrumentalist Illenium (born Nick Miller) elevates dance music via his bold, progressive take on the genre. His expansive sound, which mixes elements of celestial electronic, mellow alternative, crushing dubstep, emotional indie and pop-tinged bass music, has topped the U.S. charts, garnered over 5 billion collective streams and solidified the Denver-based artist as a singular force in a crowded arena. Now Miller is returning to his roots with a novel sound that celebrates his love for raw guitar riffs and impactful rocktronica. Illenium spent the last year working on his soon-to-be-released fifth studio album, including the singles "Shivering" (with Spiritbox), "All That Really Matters" (with Teddy Swims), "From The Ashes" (with Skylar Gray) and "Worst Day" (with MAX).','4/28/2023',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4184501-2947416.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180514,'religiously the album|bailey zimmerman|bailey zimmerman|lp','Religiously. The Album.','Bailey Zimmerman','Bailey Zimmerman','LP','WNV712554.1','093624862970',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'43589166','2026-11-10 23:54:03','2026-11-10 23:54:03','/09362486297',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Warner Music Nashville - Bailey Zimmerman - Religiously. The Album. / Establishing himself as "one of the most exciting new names in the music industry" (Forbes), Bailey Zimmerman strikes a sweet spot between timeless American country, rafter-rattling arena rock, and authentic storytelling on his full-length debut LP, Religiously. The Album., available everywhere today via Warner Music Nashville/Elektra. Showcasing his passion for storytelling, the celebrated singer/songwriter is featured as a co-writer on 11 of the 16 tracks, including his current single, "Religiously."','8/4/2023',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/17/4225217-3015276.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
