INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180841,'the new abnormal|the strokes|the strokes|lp','The New Abnormal','The Strokes','The Strokes','LP','RCA970588.1','194397058819',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'40225654','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439705881','(180 Gram Vinyl, Poster)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Includes poster and digital download. 2020 release. The New Abnormal is the sixth studio album by The Strokes. Produced by Rick Rubin, it is their first album in seven years, following Comedown Machine (2013), and their first release since the Future Present Past EP (2016). The album artwork features the 1981 painting Bird on Money by American artist Jean-Michel Basquiat. The New Abnormal is packed full of the razor-sharp hooks, vintage vibes and NYC cool that made the Strokes an early-2000s phenomenon.','4/10/2020',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/3792084-3325393.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180842,'bat out of hell|meat loaf|meat loaf|lp','Bat Out Of Hell','Meat Loaf','Meat Loaf','LP','EPIC973310.1','194397331011',19.42000000000000171,19.42000000000000171,'40274850','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439733101','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Bat Out of Hell is the debut studio album by rock icon Meat Loaf, as well as his first collaboration with composer Jim Steinman and producer Todd Rundgren. The album was released on October 21, 1977. It''s musical style is influenced by Steinman''s appreciation of Richard Wagner, Phil Spector, Bruce Springsteen and The Who. Bat Out of Hell is one of the best-selling albums of all time, having sold over 43 million copies worldwide. Regarded as one of the most influential rock albums of all time, Bat Out of Hell''s songs have remained classic rock staples. Rolling Stone ranked it at number 343 on it''s list of the 500 Greatest Albums of All Time.','4/24/2020',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/3799942-2553888.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180843,'women in music pt iii|haim|haim|lp','Women In Music Pt. III [Explicit Content]','HAIM','HAIM','LP','SNY974831.1','194397483116',28.46999999999999887,28.46999999999999887,'40306452','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439748311','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 2020 release. Women in Music Pt. III is the third studio album by American band HAIM. Released through Columbia Records. It was produced by Danielle HAIM, Rostam Batmanglij and Ariel Rechtshaid, and was preceded by the singles ''Summer Girl'', ''Now I''m in It'' and ''Hallelujah''.','6/26/2020',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/3804163-2553894.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180844,'dopamine chamber|fontaines d c|fontaines d c|cd','Dopamine Chamber','Fontaines D.C.','Fontaines D.C.','CD','BQTX1673.2','191404167328',11.72000000000000063,11.72000000000000063,'46509864','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19140416732',NULL,0,'Fontaines D.C. release their fifth studio album, Dopamine Chamber, on October 16, 2026 via XL Recordings. Produced by James Ford, it follows 2024''s Romance, the album that took the Dublin five-piece from critical favorites to one of the biggest bands in the world. Romance debuted at No. 2 in the UK - since certified platinum there - and delivered the band their first entry on the Billboard 200. It earned two GRAMMY nominations (Best Rock Album, and Best Alternative Music Performance for "Starburster") and won International Group of the Year at the 2025 BRIT Awards, the band''s second BRIT win. It also took the Album Award at the 2024 Rolling Stone UK Awards and Ireland''s Choice Music Prize, and was shortlisted for the Mercury Prize. Announced with lead single "Marianne" and it''s accompanying Dave Meyers (Kendrick''s "HUMBLE", Travis Scott''s "SICKO MODE")-directed video, Dopamine Chamber arrives like a constellation behind undulating sighs of smog: potent balladry, anthemic melodies glinting through the murk. In a world tipping towards collapse, it asks how pleasure mutates amid peril-and what our pursuit of it reveals about us. It''s the sound of a band moving decisively away from the guitar language of their early records into something colder, stranger and more synthetic. Dopamine Chamber takes it''s title from the idea of a record as a room the listener steps into. "The album itself is a dopamine chamber, " says Chatten. "You step inside and we test these different mind- or mood-altering pieces of music on you." No Amazon: F','10/16/2026',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/4535033-3704528.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180845,'the new abnormal|the strokes|the strokes|cd','The New Abnormal','The Strokes','The Strokes','CD','RCA970588.2','194397058826',10.49000000000000021,10.49000000000000021,'40225647','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439705882','(O-Card Packaging)',0,'2020 release. The New Abnormal is the sixth studio album by The Strokes. Produced by Rick Rubin, it is their first album in seven years, following Comedown Machine (2013), and their first release since the Future Present Past EP (2016). The album artwork features the 1981 painting Bird on Money by American artist Jean-Michel Basquiat. The New Abnormal is packed full of the razor-sharp hooks, vintage vibes and NYC cool that made the Strokes an early-2000s phenomenon.','4/10/2020',0.2300000000000000099,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/3792085-2549017.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180846,'at folsom prison|johnny cash|johnny cash|lp','At Folsom Prison','Johnny Cash','Johnny Cash','LP','SNYL764011.1','194397640113',19.42000000000000171,19.42000000000000171,'40544991','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439764011','(150 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. "Hello... I''m Johnny Cash." With those four words, The Man in Black solidified his legend as outlaw country pioneer with his spirited live show as performed for 2,000 prisoners and armed guards in one of California''s most notorious penitentiaries. Recorded and released in 1968-a year marked by some of the fiercest political unrest of the 20th century-At Folsom Prison established Johnny Cash as one of popular music''s most distinctive voices.','8/7/2020',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/3831481-3554368.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180847,'oops i did it again 20th anniversary edition|britney spears|britney spears|lp','Oops I Did It Again (20th Anniversary Edition)','Britney Spears','Britney Spears','LP','SNYL975321.1','194397532111',22.75,22.75,'40470320','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439753211','(Picture Disc Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Limited picture disc vinyl LP pressing. The Britney Spears Oops! I Did It Again 20th Anniversary Edition Picture Disc features all 12 original hits, including "Oops!... I Did It Again," "Stronger," and "Lucky."','8/14/2020',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/3822458-2580862.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180848,'the very best of dolly parton|dolly parton|dolly parton|lp','The Very Best Of Dolly Parton','Dolly Parton','Dolly Parton','LP','SNYL975163.1','194397516319',22.75,22.75,'40476506','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439751631','(Reissue)',0,'Available on vinyl for the first time, The Very Best Of Dolly Parton collects a sample of the material that made her one of the best and brightest country music icons. In more than a half-century of recording, Dolly has earned 10 Grammy Awards, 10 Country Music Association Awards, two Oscar nominations, a Tony nomination and induction into the Country Music Hall of Fame, selling more than 100 million records along the way. But itΓÇÖs her music and songwriting to which all roads return. Her early heartfelt tales of growing up in Tennessee (ΓÇ£Coat Of Many Colors,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£My Tennessee Mountain HomeΓÇ¥) gave way to first a string of country chart-toppers (ΓÇ£Jolene,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£I Will Always Love You,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£The Bargain StoreΓÇ¥) then incredible pop crossover smashes in the ΓÇÿ70s and ΓÇÿ80s (ΓÇ£Here You Come Again,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£9 To 5,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Islands In The StreamΓÇ¥). Add to that some of her greatest collaborations (ΓÇ£EverythingΓÇÖs Beautiful (In Its Own Way)ΓÇ¥ with Willie Nelson, ΓÇ£To Know Him Is To Love HimΓÇ¥ with Emmylou Harris and Linda Ronstadt), and itΓÇÖs easy to realize what makes The Very Best Of Dolly Parton the perfect LP introduction to her unbroken country charm. DOLLY PARTON ΓÇ£THE VERY BEST OF DOLLY PARTONΓÇ¥','6/26/2020',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/3822785-3726113.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180849,'merry christmas|johnny mathis|johnny mathis|lp','Merry Christmas','Johnny Mathis','Johnny Mathis','LP','SNYL76414.1','194397641417',16.08999999999999986,16.08999999999999986,'40763927','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439764141','(140 Gram Vinyl, Reissue, Download Insert)',0,'Vinyl LP repressing of this classic Christmas album from the iconic crooner.','10/2/2020',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/3849499-2598735.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180850,'greatest hits volume 1|johnny cash|johnny cash|lp','Greatest Hits Volume 1','Johnny Cash','Johnny Cash','LP','SNYL764051.1','194397640519',19.60000000000000143,19.60000000000000143,'40545011','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439764051','(150 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Johnny Cash''s distinctive baritone and boom-chicka-boom guitar rhythm powered scores of songs that spoke to his deep, personal convictions of truth, faith and justice the world over. Released in 1967, this album chronicles the biggest hits from his first decade as a Columbia Records artist, including "I Walk The Line," "Ring Of Fire," "It Ain''t Me, Babe," "Orange Blossom Special" and, in it''s first appearance on a long-playing album "Jackson," his rollicking duet with future wife June Carter.','8/7/2020',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/3831483-2578756.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180851,'the greatest hits collection alan jackson|alan jackson|alan jackson|lp','The Greatest Hits Collection  Alan Jackson','Alan Jackson','Alan Jackson','LP','SNYL973726.1','194397372618',22.96999999999999887,22.96999999999999887,'40476483','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439737261','(Reissue)',0,'Alan Jackson has earned his place in country music history. Behind that guitar and knowing smile stands a singer-songwriter with a knack for creating simple yet impactful tunes, combining the honky-tonk sensibilities of vintage Music Row with contemporary production to make him a statesman of the genre. He found success by staying true to his love of traditional country music, putting 50 singles into the Top 10 of BillboardΓÇÖs country singles chartΓÇömore than half of them climbing all the way to No. 1. Originally released in 1995ΓÇöjust five short years after he broke into the mainstream with the Top 5 country album Here In The Real WorldΓÇöThe Greatest Hits Collection is the perfect survey of Alan JacksonΓÇÖs early hitmaking years. Available for the first time on vinyl as a 2LP set, The Greatest Hits Collection features chart-topping classics like ΓÇ£DonΓÇÖt Rock The Jukebox,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£SheΓÇÖs Got Rhythm (and I Got The Blues),ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£ChattahoocheeΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£Summertime Blues,ΓÇ¥ plus the exclusive new songs ΓÇ£Tall, Tall TreesΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£IΓÇÖll Try,ΓÇ¥ both of which topped BillboardΓÇÖs country singles chart as well. ALAN JACKSON ΓÇ£THE GREATEST HITS COLLECTIONΓÇ¥','6/26/2020',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3822782-2571443.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180852,'you and your friends|peach pit|peach pit|lp','You And Your Friends [Explicit Content]','Peach Pit','Peach Pit','LP','CLBI972020.1','194397202014',16.96999999999999887,16.96999999999999887,'40317984','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439720201','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2020 release the sophomore release from the Vancouver-based band. You And Your Friends is the follow up to 2017''s Being So Normal. "You and Your Friends is a collection of songs about me, people that the band and I care about, and some of the old friends we''ve had over the years," vocalist Neil Smith says. "All the songs are written from true stories, some have been exaggerated more than others. We can''t wait to finally let go of it and start playing these songs for you out on the road!" Includes the tracks ''Feelin'' Low (F***boy Blues)'', ''Shampoo Bottles'', and ''Black Licorice''.','4/3/2020',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/3805707-2553886.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180853,'show pony|orville peck|orville peck|lp','Show Pony','Orville Peck','Orville Peck','LP','CLBI978278.1','194397827811',20.73000000000000042,20.73000000000000042,'40525921','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439782781','(Colored Vinyl, Purple, Sticker / Stickers, Extended Play, Poster)',0,'Limited purple colored vinyl LP pressing. 2020 EP release. Orville is a critically-acclaimed rising country artist. This EP announces the release of a new track "No Glory In The West". This is an addition to the previously released track and video, "Summertime". Orville appears on upcoming Diplo country album Diplo Presents: Thomas Wesley Chapter 1: Snake Oil. Orville is known for his baritone voice, strong musicianship and songs that are sincere yet bold in their storytelling. Orville has never confirmed his identity and is known for hiding his face with a fringed Lone Ranger mask.','11/27/2020',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/3828519-2584995.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180854,'is this it international cover import|the strokes|the strokes|lp','Is This It (International Cover) [Import]','The Strokes','The Strokes','LP','SLEG9784471.1','194397844719',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'40937335','2026-11-10 23:54:39','2026-11-10 23:54:39','/19439784471','(Reissue, France - Import)',0,'2020 black vinyl reissue of The Strokes'' iconic 2001 debut. Known for it''s raw, garage-rock sound and post-punk influences, the record features hits like "Last Nite" and "Someday." Produced by Gordon Raphael, it captures early-2000s indie rock energy with scratchy guitars and laid-back vocals, defining a generation''s sound and style.','7/31/2020',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/3863392-2607910.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180855,'what could possibly go wrong|dominic fike|dominic fike|cd','What Could Possibly Go Wrong [Explicit Content]','Dominic Fike','Dominic Fike','CD','CLBI979827.2','194397982725',10.08000000000000007,10.08000000000000007,'41037805','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439798272','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Artist - Dominic Fike Title - WHAT COULD POSSIBLY GO WRONG Label Company - LEGACY Label - COLUMBIA Genre - ALTERNATIVE','11/13/2020',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/3872012-2631227.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180856,'fetch the bolt cutters|fiona apple|fiona apple|lp','Fetch The Bolt Cutters','Fiona Apple','Fiona Apple','LP','EPIC977403.1','194397740318',31.01999999999999958,31.01999999999999958,'40447582','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439774031','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 2020 release. Fetch the Bolt Cutters is the fifth studio album by American singer-songwriter Fiona Apple. It is Apple''s first release since The Idler Wheel... in 2012. The album was recorded from 2015 to 2020, largely at Apple''s home in Venice Beach. It was produced and performed by Apple alongside Amy Aileen Wood, Sebastian Steinberg and Dav├¡d Garza; recording consisted of long, often-improvised takes with unconventional percussive sounds. Rooted in experimentation, the highly percussive album resists genre categorization. While conventional instruments, such as pianos and drum sets, do appear, the album also features prominent use of non-musical found objects as percussion. Apple described the result as "percussion orchestras". These industrial-like rhythms are contrasted against traditional melodies, and the upbeat songs often subvert traditional pop structures.','7/17/2020',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/3820469-2573712.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180857,'i love rock n roll|joan jett and the blackhearts||lp','I Love Rock N Roll','Joan Jett and the Blackhearts',NULL,'LP','SNYL597682.1','19075976821',17.30000000000000071,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/joan-jett-and-the-blackhearts-i-love-rock-n-roll/19075976821',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180858,'graceland clear vinyl import|paul simon|paul simon|lp','Graceland (Clear Vinyl) [Import]','Paul Simon','Paul Simon','LP','SONI9801821.1','194398018218',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'41037355','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439801821','(Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, France - Import)',0,'Clear vinyl pressing of the seventh solo studio album by the American singer-songwriter, originally released on August 25, 1986. Several years of musical experimentation led to his most successful foray, which had a more South African vibe. The ''Graceland'' album went on to become his biggest selling album to date, winning a Grammy for ''Record of the Year''.','10/30/2020',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/3871962-2627276.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180859,'at san quentin|johnny cash|johnny cash|lp','At San Quentin','Johnny Cash','Johnny Cash','LP','SNYL764031.1','194397640311',19.60000000000000143,19.60000000000000143,'40545004','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439764031','(150 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. A year after the runaway success of At Folsom Prison, Johnny Cash took his stellar live concert behind the walls of California''s oldest penitentiary. The resulting album, At San Quentin, was The Man In Black''s first to top both Billboard''s country and pop charts, and spun off his biggest pop hit, "A Boy Named Sue." Released alongside the premiere of his successful television show and featuring classic renditions of "I Walk The Line" and the Bob Dylan-penned "Wanted Man," this album is a must for vinyl collectors seeking to discover the legend of Johnny Cash.','8/7/2020',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3831482-2578755.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180860,'monovision|ray lamontagne|ray lamontagne|lp','Monovision','Ray LaMontagne','Ray LaMontagne','LP','RCA977704.1','194397770414',17.91000000000000014,17.91000000000000014,'40520544','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439777041','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. 2020 release, the eighth studio album from singer/songwriter Ray LaMontagne. The 10-track album sees Ray not only writing and producing the album once again but also includes added duties of engineering as well as performing all the instruments for the tracks.','6/26/2020',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/3827852-2575638.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180861,'still woman enough|loretta lynn|loretta lynn|lp','Still Woman Enough','Loretta Lynn','Loretta Lynn','LP','SNYL982777.1','194398277714',19.42000000000000171,19.42000000000000171,'41237434','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439827771','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'The American music icon''s 50th studio album (excluding her 10 studio duet collaborations with Conway Twitty), Still Woman Enough celebrates women in country music. From her homage to the originators, Mother Maybelle Carter and the Carter Family (via her cover of "Keep On The Sunny Side") through a new interpretation of her very first single, "I''m A Honky Tonk Girl," Loretta Lynn acknowledges her role in the continuum of American country music while her duets with Reba McEntire and Carrie Underwood ("Still Woman Enough"), Margo Price ("One''s On The Way") and Tanya Tucker ("You Ain''t Woman Enough") find her sharing the musical torch with some of the brightest lights and biggest stars in contemporary pop-country. The album premieres 13 new Loretta Lynn recordings, intimate and electrifying performances of a career-spanning selection of songs illuminating different aspects of her repertoire. The collection is centered around Loretta''s original compositions--from new songs like "Still Woman Enough" (which shares its title and attitude with her 2002 autobiography and was cowritten with her daughter, Patsy Lynn Russell) through fresh interpretations of classics including "I''m a Honky Tonk Girl" (her first single, originally released March 1960), "You Ain''t Woman Enough" (the title track for her first #1 Billboard Hot Country Album in 1966), "My Love" (from 1968''s Here''s Loretta Lynn), "I Wanna Be Free" (1971) and a deeply emotional "Coal Miner''s Daughter Recitation," commemorating the 50th anniversary of the release of her signature song (October 5, 1970) and album (January 4, 1971). STILL WOMAN ENOUGH','3/19/2021',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/53/3897053-2668221.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180862,'facelift|alice in chains|alice in chains|lp','Facelift','Alice in Chains','Alice in Chains','LP','SNYL978386.1','194397838619',27.23000000000000042,27.23000000000000042,'40935874','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439783861','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Includes digital download. 30th Anniversary Edition. To celebrate the 30th anniversary of Alice in Chains debut studio album, Facelift, a standard black vinyl reissue with remastered audio. Not only did the album introduce the world to Layne Staley, Jerry Cantrell, Sean Kinney, and Mike Starr, it was also a pivotal album in the era of grunge music. Facelift has sold over 2 million copies in the US alone and includes the hits "Man in the Box, " "Bleed the Freak, " "We Die Young, " and "Sea of Sorrow."','11/13/2020',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/3863232-2645997.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180863,'blue weekend|wolf alice|wolf alice|lp','Blue Weekend','Wolf Alice','Wolf Alice','LP','RCA984061.1','194398406114',17.14000000000000056,17.14000000000000056,'41443828','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439840611','(140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Blue Weekend is the highly anticipated third album from one of BritainΓÇÖs most revered bands, Wolf Alice. Blue Weekend is the follow-up to the bandΓÇÖs 2017 Mercury Prize-winning album Visions of a Life. Personal storytelling is at the core of Blue Weekend, an album that sees Wolf Alice embrace a newfound boldness and vulnerability in equal measure. For Blue Weekend, the band decamped to an Airbnb in Somerset, and it was there that they reconfigured who they were together, and set to work on some fledgling demos in a converted church. These demos evolved into Blue Weekend, a record produced by Markus Dravs (Arcade Fire, Bj├╢rk, Brian Eno, Florence + The Machine) who has aided the band in refining their sound to an even sharper point. Wolf Alice are Ellie Rowsell (vocals, guitar), Joff Oddie (guitar, vocals), Theo Ellis (bass) and Joel Amey (drums, vocals). It has been a decade since the band began as a duo of Ellie Rowsell and Joff Oddie, then later expanded to a four-piece, with Joel Amey and Theo Ellis joining the group. Since then, the band saw their 2015 debut album My Love Is Cool soar to #2 on the UK charts, earned a GRAMMY nomination for Best Rock Performance and had their sophomore album Visions Of A Life win the 2018 Mercury Prize. Blue Weekend is the next chapter for Wolf Alice, and itΓÇÖs the work of a band who raise the bar with every release.','6/4/2021',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3943582-2701624.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180864,'boston|boston|boston|lp','Boston','Boston','Boston','LP','SNYL977736.1','194397773613',17.14000000000000056,17.14000000000000056,'41317884','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439777361','(150 Gram Vinyl)',1,'Limited vinyl LP including digital download. Boston is the debut studio album by Boston. Produced by Tom Scholz and John Boylan, the album was originally released on August 25, 1976. The album sold extremely well, breaking sales records, becoming the best-selling debut LP in the US at the time, and winning the RIAA Century Award as best selling debut album. The album''s singles, most notably "More Than a Feeling" and "Long Time", were both AM and FM hits, and nearly the entire album receives constant rotation on classic rock radio.','3/26/2021',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/3925496-2672826.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(180865,'post human survival horror import|bring me the horizon|bring me the horizon|lp','Post Human: Survival Horror [Explicit Content] [Import]','Bring Me the Horizon','Bring Me the Horizon','LP','CLBI80461.1','194398046112',20.76999999999999958,20.76999999999999958,'41040355','2026-11-10 23:54:40','2026-11-10 23:54:40','/19439804611','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2021 release. Post Human: Survival Horror is the newest release from world dominating, multi-award nominated Bring Me the Horizon. Continuing to push their creative boundaries, even during the 2020 global pandemic and lockdowns, the band have created a body of work that is arguably one of their most exciting, diverse, intricate pieces of music to date.','1/22/2021',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/3872558-2652461.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
