INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181022,'merry christmas 30th anniversary|mariah carey|mariah carey|lp','Merry Christmas (30th Anniversary)','Mariah Carey','Mariah Carey','LP','SNYL889145.1','196588914515',25.48999999999999844,25.48999999999999844,'44664138','2026-11-10 23:54:47','2026-11-10 23:54:47','/19658891451','(Picture Disc Vinyl)',0,'Mariah Carey - Merry Christmas (30th Anniversary) - Picture Disc Vinyl Celebrating the 30th anniversary of MariahΓÇÖs timeless album, Merry Christmas with a limited-edition picture disc pressing! Features all the festive hits including, ΓÇ£All I Want For Christmas Is You,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Christmas (Baby Please Come Home,)ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Joy To The World,ΓÇ¥ and more.','11/8/2024',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/98/4375598-3265631.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181023,'millennium 2 0|backstreet boys|backstreet boys|lp','Millennium 2.0','Backstreet Boys','Backstreet Boys','LP','SNYL89966.1','196588996610',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'44998516','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658899661','(Deluxe Edition, Bonus Tracks, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Backstreet Boys - Millennium 2.0 - Vinyl 2 LP In celebration of the 25th anniversary of one of the best-selling albums ever, The Backstreet Boys are back with Millennium 2.0.  This 2LP Deluxe Edition features all the original hits like "I Want It That Way," "The One," and "The Perfect Fan," along with 13 bonus tracks, including live and alternative versions, demos, and the never-before-heard track, "Hey." With brand new cover art, photos and "Thank Yous" from the band, Millennium 2.0 is a must-have for any fan.','7/11/2025',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4409784-3330576.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181024,'berlin|lou reed|lou reed|lp','Berlin','Lou Reed','Lou Reed','LP','MOFY555.1','196588772214',41.70000000000000285,41.70000000000000285,'44589813','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658877221','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'An Intense Journey into Toxic Relationships Balanced with Gorgeous Arrangements and Dark Humor: Lou Reed''s Conceptual Berlin Features A-List Cast and Bob Ezrin Production Sourced from the Original Master Tapes: Mobile Fidelity''s 180g 33RPM Vinyl 2LP Presents the Singer-Songwriter''s Landmark 1973 Album in Audiophile Quality for the First Time Like the records he made with his first band, Berlin finds Lou Reed decades ahead of the times. Though dismissed upon it''s original release in 1973, the former Velvet Underground member''s third solo effort ultimately landed on Rolling Stone''s 500 Greatest Albums of All Time and remains one of his most lauded works. Addressing mature issues in stark fashion, the rock opera blends autobiographical reality, poetic license, and ambitious arrangements to tell the story of a couple''s toxic relationship and it''s fallout. Produced by Bob Ezrin and featuring an array of ace musicians, Berlin is an emotionally harrowing and sonically eclectic journey into the many of the worst tendencies of the human condition. Sourced from the original master tapes, housed in a Stoughton jacket, and pressed at Fidelity Record Pressing, Mobile Fidelity''s numbered-edition 180g LP of Berlin presents the landmark recording in audiophile quality for the first time. The scope, balance, and reach of Ezrin''s explosive production comes to the fore. As does the ample spaciousness and separation that help give the songs breathing room even when the music builds to an orchestral pitch. Reed''s distinctive voice - central to every track - sounds direct, immediate, centered. The realism and clarity of his tone make it appear as if he''s entered the room. You can trace his breath control, reserved coolness, and commanding phrasing. And sense the implied violence, delusion, and sorrow in the questions and statements he issues in the persona of the protagonist Jim - as well as the empathy, fatigue, confusion, and frustration he projects in his guise as Caroline. Mobile Fidelity''s reissue also puts into a new, improved light the brilliant contributions of the standout session players. Steve Winwood (Hammond organ), Michael Brecker (tenor saxophone), Randy Brecker (trumpet), and Procol Harum drummer B.J. Wilson play key roles. The core band assisting Reed and Ezrin on a majority of Berlin - Alice Cooper guitarists Dick Wagner and Steve Hunter, drum maven Aynsley Dunbar, Cream bassist Jack Bruce - turn in a collective performance for the ages. None more so than Bruce, whose bass lines resonate on this LP with a roundedness, fatness, tautness, and control that give songs added depth and foundation. Ezrin''s restrained piano, full of body and decay, performs a similar function. Expanding on the gritty themes he explored with the Velvet Underground, and arranging them into a conceptual tale, Reed transforms Berlin into a candid report of what was happening behind closed doors everywhere. Deemed by the Chicago Tribune as ''a spare, understated song cycle of nearly suicidal intensity about a crumbling marriage,'' it deals head-on with heavyweight topics such as domestic abuse, drug addiction, mental illness, custodial rights, prostitution, and depression. Reed''s purple narratives detail issues that would attract mainstream attention many years later - and which continue to spur vital conversations. Akin to a classic film noir or hardboiled novel, Berlin skirts any attempt to varnish it''s rough interiors. Functioning as both a contrast and counterweight, the record''s beautiful, symphonic-leaning exteriors somehow both heighten and lessen the severity of the vignettes. The theatrical swells of woodwinds, strings, and brass feature the same streaks of black humor that inform Reed''s writing. That edginess and eccentricity, and Reed''s investment in the album''s three characters and situations, function as magnets that draw us in even when the sadness, meanness, and darkness prompt us to look away. Save for the opening romance of the title track and false hope of the damning (and downright nasty) ''Sad Song,'' Berlin largely trades in doom and depression. A record that starts off with a muted celebration and fond recollection ends with motherless children, slashed-wrists suicide, and a callous partner who feels no remorse for his brutal actions but professes gratitude for what becomes an unmiigated disaster. ''Life is meant to be more than this,'' Reed sings in combination protest and resignation on the ironically gorgeous ''Caroline Says II.'' Before the next song finishes - a bleak chronicle of behaviors and decisions relayed with intentional misogyny, hatred, and shaming, and whose subdued tenor gets fractured by the sounds of wailing children crying for their mother - that life has gotten far worse. Minutes later, when Reed and company shape the swirling fever dream called ''The Bed,'' that life is snuffed out. Oh, oh, what a feeling, indeed.','8/30/2024',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/4367888-3229032.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181025,'merry christmas 30th anniversary|mariah carey|mariah carey|lp','Merry Christmas (30th Anniversary)','Mariah Carey','Mariah Carey','LP','SNYL889146.1','196588914614',25.48999999999999844,25.48999999999999844,'44664169','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658891461',NULL,0,'Mariah Carey - Merry Christmas (30th Anniversary) - Zoetrope Vinyl Celebrating the 30th anniversary of MariahΓÇÖs timeless album, Merry Christmas with a limited-edition zoetrope vinyl! Features all of the festive hits including, ΓÇ£All I Want For Christmas Is You,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Christmas (Baby Please Come Home,)ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Joy To The World,ΓÇ¥ and more.','12/13/2024',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4375599-3265635.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181026,'when my heart finds christmas|harry connick jr|harry connick jr|lp','When My Heart Finds Christmas','Harry Connick Jr','Harry Connick Jr','LP','SNYL889138.1','196588913815',26.28999999999999915,26.28999999999999915,'44605124','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658891381',NULL,0,'CONNICK, HARRY JR. WHEN MY HEART FINDS CHRISTMAS - Harry Connick Jr.''s holiday album "When My Heart Finds Christmas" is an "I-Connick" representation of the festive season. This album beautifully showcases Connick''s unique blend of traditional Christmas carols and original songs, which he personally penned, such as "When My Heart Finds Christmas," "The Blessed Dawn Of Christmas Day," "I Pray On Christmas," and "(It Must''ve Been Ol'') Santa Claus." - Recorded at the renowned Capitol Studios, this album encapsulates the essence of Christmas through Connick''s jazz-infused interpretations and the rich accompaniment of a 70-piece orchestra and 42-voice choir. The album, which achieved triple Platinum status in the U.S., is a testament to Connick''s iconic musical style and remains a seasonal favorite for it''s heartfelt warmth and joyous melodiesΓÇï. Now on black vinyl.','10/4/2024',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4369421-3264035.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181027,'greatest hits|joan jett and the blackhearts|joan jett and the blackhearts|lp','Greatest Hits','Joan Jett and the Blackhearts','Joan Jett and the Blackhearts','LP','BLTQ8892861.1','196588928611',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'46516503','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658892861',NULL,0,'Joan Jett & The Blackhearts - Greatest Hits - Rock LP Unleash the rebel within with the electrifying Joan Jett & the Blackhearts Greatest Hits, a compilation album that brings together the fiercest and most beloved tracks from rock ''n'' roll''s eternal queen, Joan Jett. Perfect for the devoted Joan Jett & the Blackhearts fan, this album is a journey through the career of a woman who smashed through the glass ceilings of the music industry with her guitar, charisma, and unwavering determination.  The LP includes the hit songs ΓÇ£Bad Reputation,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£I Hate Myself For Loving You,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£I Love Rock NΓÇÖ RollΓÇ¥ and more.','5/31/2024',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4334301-3162931.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181028,'greatest hits|pitbull|pitbull|lp','Greatest Hits [Explicit Content]','Pitbull','Pitbull','LP','SNYL889216.1','196588921612',22.75,22.75,'44588496','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658892161','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'International superstar Pitbull presents his GREATEST HITS album available for the first time on stunning clear vinyl adorned with black swirls. The compilation features his chart-topping singles from 2009 to 2014, alongside electrifying tracks like "Jungle" (feat. E-40 and Abraham Mateo) and "Locas" (feat. Lil Jon). GREATEST HITS serves as a powerful testament to Pitbull''s prowess in crafting infectious, energetic, and celebratory anthems. The album features monumental hits such as "Give Me Everything" (feat. Ne-Yo, Afrojack and Nayer), "Timber" (feat. Kesha), "Time of Our Lives" (feat. Ne-Yo), "Fireball" (feat. John Ryan), and many more!','10/4/2024',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4367750-3232461.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181029,'globalization|pitbull|pitbull|lp','Globalization [Explicit Content]','Pitbull','Pitbull','LP','SNYL889967.1','196588996719',22.75,22.75,'44588489','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658899671','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'International superstar Pitbull presents his global-dominating album, GLOBALIZATION now available for the first time on a striking translucent green vinyl with black swirls, just in time to commemorate it''s 10th anniversary. The album boasts an impressive array of collaborations with artists like Jason Derulo, Juicy J, Sean Paul, Bebe Rexha, Chris Brown, Jennifer Lopez, and more. GLOBALIZATION features standout tracks like "Time of Our Lives" (feat. Ne-Yo) and "Fireball" (feat. John Ryan).','10/4/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4367749-3232460.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181030,'cowboy carter bead face|beyonc|beyonc|lp','Cowboy Carter (Bead Face) [Explicit Content]','Beyonc├⌐','Beyonc├⌐','LP','CLBI889493.1','196588949319',25.71000000000000085,25.71000000000000085,'44280192','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658894931','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'BEYONC├ë   COWBOY CARTER / Cowboy Carter (also referred to as Act II: Cowboy Carter) is the eighth studio Beyonc├⌐, released on March 29, 2024. The album is the second installment of Beyonc├⌐''s trilogy project, following Renaissance (2022). Beyonc├⌐ conceived Cowboy Carter as a journey through a reinvention of Americana.  Mostly labeled a country album, Cowboy Carter also blends together diverse musical genres such as R&B, pop, hip hop, blues, soul, rock and folk music. Conceptually, the album is presented as a radio broadcast by fictional station "KNTRY Radio Texas", with country singers Dolly Parton, Linda Martell and Willie Nelson acting as disc jockeys.','4/12/2024',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4327238-3727507.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181031,'think later|tate mcrae|tate mcrae|cd','Think Later [Explicit Content]','Tate McRae','Tate McRae','CD','RCA886644.2','196588664427',9.68999999999999951,9.68999999999999951,'44000257','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19658866442','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Multi-platinum singer/songwriter Tate McRae announces her sophomore album THINK LATER to be released December 8th via RCA Records. Executive produced with hitmaker Ryan Tedder (Taylor Swift, Beyonc├⌐), THINK LATER and it''s songsare steeped in pop appeal and infectious toplines. Showcasing Tate''s boundless vocal talent and evolution as a songwriter, this new body of work explores the all-too-relatable feelings of falling in love and embracing the raw emotions that you experience as a result of leading with your intuition and heart.','12/8/2023',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4274119-3078740.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181032,'summer s gone|odesza|odesza|lp','Summer''s Gone','Odesza','Odesza','LP','FOFM117.1','196852897773',23.42999999999999972,23.42999999999999972,'43194605','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19685289777','(With Bonus 7-Inch Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing + bonus 7" single.','2/10/2023',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4164538-2942748.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181033,'k i d s translucent yellow|mac miller|mac miller|lp','K.I.D.S. - Translucent Yellow','Mac Miller','Mac Miller','LP','RQTR734.1','196922265020',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'45259227','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19692226502','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Mac Miller''s seminal mixtape K.I.D.S. was originally released in 2010 by Rostrum Records. Featuring the tracks, "Nikes on My Feet," "Kool Aid & Frozen Pizza," and "Knock Knock," Miller''s first entry on the Billboard Hot 100. The title, an acronym for "Kickin'' Incredibly Dope Shit," is a reference to the 1995 film, Kids, which is quoted throughout. Double LP set on translucent yellow vinyl.','11/3/2023',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/4433788-3403996.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181034,'charm|clairo|clairo|cd','Charm','Clairo','Clairo','CD','CIRQ155269.2','196922870538',8.5,8.5,'44414801','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19692287053',NULL,0,'2024 release. Charm is the third studio album by American singer-songwriter Clairo. It is her first self-released studio album after her previous two albums were released by Fader and Republic respectively. It is the follow-up to her second album, Sling.','7/12/2024',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4345652-3208425.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181035,'best day ever|mac miller|mac miller|lp','Best Day Ever','Mac Miller','Mac Miller','LP','RQTR735.1','196922265037',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'44565343','2026-11-10 23:54:48','2026-11-10 23:54:48','/19692226503','(Colored Vinyl, Lavender)',0,'When most fans think of Mac Miller, the first thing that comes to mind is his seminal work Best Day Ever, it''s recognizable artwork, or it''s most popular track and Mac''s breakout single "Donald Trump." Mac Miller''s Best Day Ever served as a successful follow-up to his breakthrough mixtape K.I.D.S. (Kickin'' Incredibly Dope Shit). The 16 track project featured some notable guest appearances by Wiz Khalifa and Phonte of Little Brother/The Foreign Exchange. And while Miller has become known for his own production skill these days, Best Day Ever featured none of his own production. Producers involved in the project included Just Blaze, Chuck Inglish, Khrysis, Beanz N Kornbread, Blue of The Sore Losers and I.D. Labs.','12/1/2023',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/4365362-3363249.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
