INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181063,'time out|dave brubeck quartet|dave brubeck quartet|lp','Time Out','Dave Brubeck Quartet','Dave Brubeck Quartet','LP','SNYL803211.1','198028032117',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'44605094','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802803211',NULL,0,'The Dave Brubeck QuartetΓÇÖs definitive 1959 jazz album Time Out, available on 180g Black Vinyl. Time Out includes distinctive classics such as ΓÇ£Take Five,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Blue Rondo A La Turk,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Strange Meadow Lark,ΓÇ¥ and a must have in any record collection. The album peaked at No. 2 on the Billboard pop albums chart and was certified platinum by the Recording Industry Association of America. "Take Five" became a mainstream hit, reaching No. 25 on the Billboard Hot 100, and No. 5 on Billboard''s Easy Listening survey, the precursor to today''s Adult Contemporary charts.','10/4/2024',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4369419-3233632.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181064,'scarlet 2 claude|doja cat|doja cat|lp','Scarlet 2 CLAUDE [Explicit Content]','Doja Cat','Doja Cat','LP','RCA281401.1','198028140119',26.69999999999999929,26.69999999999999929,'44636272','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802814011','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Doja Cat - Scarlet 2 CLAUDE - Vinyl 2 LP To celebrate the one-year anniversary of Doja CatΓÇÖs critically acclaimed album, ΓÇ£Scarlet 2 CLAUDEΓÇ¥ deluxe vinyl is available now! The album features 24 tracks including smash hits such as ΓÇ£AttentionΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£Paint The Town RedΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£Agora HillsΓÇ¥, ΓÇ£OKLOSERΓÇ¥ and more. Her hit single, ΓÇ£Paint The Town RedΓÇ¥ spent three weeks on the Billboard Hot 100 Chart at No. 1; that marked the first rap song to hit No.1 on the Hot 100 Chart last year. In addition, the song was No. 1 for a total of four consecutive weeks on the Billboard Global 200 Chart. Furthermore, Doja CatΓÇÖs fan favorite track ΓÇ£Agora HillsΓÇ¥ went No. 1 at Top 40 Radio in February 2024 making it her eighth No. 1 at the format. ΓÇ£Agora HillsΓÇ¥ also peaked at No. 7 on the Billboard Hot 100 Chart.','10/18/2024',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4372465-3237274.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181065,'spaceships on the blade|larry june|larry june|lp','Spaceships on the Blade [Explicit Content]','Larry June','Larry June','LP','FRMI1101.1','197342839105',18.78999999999999915,18.78999999999999915,'44961862','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19734283910','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Spaceships on the Blade is the 2022 solo album from San Francisco legend, entrepreneur and rapper, Larry June. The 20-track album features the singles, "Private Valet," & "In My Pockets," and sees production from a wide range of producers such as, The Alchemist, Jake One, DJ Khalil, Cardo, DJ. Fresh, Chuck Inglish, Turbo & more. Enlisting the help from fellow rap luminaries such as 2 Chainz, Babyface Ray, Curren$y and more, Spaceships on the Blade shows that Uncle Larry always has an eye on expanding and diversifying income steams and will continue to do numbers for a long time. Good Job, Larry. 2xLP, Black Vinyl, Widespine Jacket, Printed Sleeves.','10/17/2025',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4406001-3327472.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181066,'am i okay|megan moroney|megan moroney|lp','Am I Okay?','Megan Moroney','Megan Moroney','LP','CLBI800521.1','198028005210',21.26999999999999958,21.26999999999999958,'44360368','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802800521','(Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Megan Moroney - Am I Okay? - Vinyl Am I Okay? is the massively anticipated sophomore album from breakout Country superstar Megan Moroney, and is an up-close look at the life-changing pain of heartbreak and the glory of moving on. As she doubles down on the gorgeously detailed storytelling of her blockbuster full-length debut Lucky, the Georgia-bred singer/songwriter lights up every track with her signature balance of raw emotional honesty and warmhearted sensitivityΓÇöas well as the endless supply of down-to-earth charm thatΓÇÖs made her one of Country musicΓÇÖs most dynamic new stars. A truly gifted songwriter, Moroney also brings a tremendous depth to Am I Okay?ΓÇÖs more fun-loving moments, such as ΓÇ£IndifferentΓÇ¥: a wildly euphoric track that weaves whistled melodies and pounding drumbeats through her full-tilt celebration of breaking free from infatuation with an old love. The album leaves the listener both undeniably dazzled and more deeply connected to the full expanse of their own emotional life. Am I Okay?ΓÇÖs finespun songwriting and high-powered sound is achieved with the help of MoroneyΓÇÖs longtime producer Kristian Bush (Sugarland).','7/12/2024',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4339202-3727508.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181067,'where i ve been isn t where i m going|shaboozey|shaboozey|lp','Where I''ve Been, Isn''t Where I''m Going [Explicit Content]','Shaboozey','Shaboozey','LP','ACDG1024.1','197342569361',13.68999999999999951,13.68999999999999951,'44301651','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19734256936','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Shaboozey - Where IΓÇÖve Been, IsnΓÇÖt Where IΓÇÖm Going - Vinyl 1xLP, Gatefold Jacket, Black Vinyl, Protective Poly-lined Sleeves, Marketing Sticker Rising multi-faceted artist Shaboozey is building a world of his own, carving a distinct lane in contemporary Country music. Born to parents of Nigerian descent and raised in the small town of Woodbridge, VA, Shaboozey grew up on an eclectic mix of music encompassing everything from Country and Blues to classic hip-hop and R&B. A true crossover artist, he set the stage for the ΓÇ£Modern CowboyΓÇ¥ takeover in 2024. ShaboozeyΓÇÖs epic run began in October 2023 with the release of ΓÇ£Let It BurnΓÇ¥ which quickly engaged audiences and caught the attention of Beyonc├⌐. The single organically led to Shaboozey being featured on Beyonce├¼ΓÇÖs culture shifting album COWBOY CARTERΓÇöthe only artist with multiple appearances on the project. ShaboozeyΓÇÖs latest body of work, the critically acclaimed Where IΓÇÖve Been, IsnΓÇÖt Where IΓÇÖm Going, debuted in the top five of the Billboard 200 and was praised by NPR for being ΓÇ£the future of country music.ΓÇ¥ The albumΓÇÖs smash single ΓÇ£A Bar Song (Tipsy),ΓÇ¥ made history as Shaboozey became the first Black male artist to reach the top of both the Billboard Hot 100 and Billboard Hot Country Charts for multiple weeks. He also became the first artist in history to reach the top of the charts at 4 radio formats - Country, Top 40, Rhythm and Hot Adult Contemporary. The song is now the most consumed song of 2024 according to Luminate data, 4X RIAA-certified platinum, launched him to mainstream stardom and has become the ΓÇ£song of the summerΓÇ¥ as described by Rolling Stone. With the meteoric rise of ΓÇ£A Bar Song (Tipsy),ΓÇ¥ Shaboozey and Beyonce├¼ became the first Black artists to score back-to-back leaders in the Billboard Hot Country SongsΓÇÖ 66-year history. True to his Virginia roots, Shaboozey aims to continue the regionΓÇÖs long-standing tradition of prolific creativity, this time by expanding the scope of contemporary country and introducing the sound to a global audience. In addition to his record breaking run on the charts, Shaboozey had standout performances on the Kelly Clarkson Show, Late Night with Jimmy Fallon, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, and was the first Country Artist to perform at the BET Awards in 2024. Shaboozey surprised audiences at Stagecoach and CapitalΓÇÖs Summertime Ball, and shut down Nashville with his performance at the2024 CMA Fest. In the Fall, Shaboozey will embark on his SOLD OUT headline tour and has dates with Jelly Roll across America.','9/27/2024',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4330793-3189577.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181068,'where the butterflies go in the rain deluxe|raveena|raveena|lp','Where the Butterflies Go in the Rain - Deluxe [Explicit Content]','Raveena','Raveena','LP','MRGG1071.1','197342716345',18.78999999999999915,18.78999999999999915,'45025730','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19734271634','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl, Deluxe Edition)',0,'Deluxe edition 2 LP set on clear vinyl. Where the Butterflies Go in the Rain is the third studio album from the enchanting songstress, Raveena. Blending powerful storytelling with early 2000s pop, Where the Butterflies Go in the Rain sees music continuing to play the central role as both a catalyst and medium in her personal and creative growth. With newfound clarity, Raveena delves into themes of new love, maturity, comfort, and domesticity that reflect the peace of mind she currently inhabits. Speaking on this evolution and how it informed the album''s creative, she shares, "Butterflies are so delicate that they have to hide in leaves and flowers until the rain passes so that their wings don''t get crushed in the rain. I felt like that was kind of a metaphor for where I was in my life. I needed to go back to comfort-to deep rest-and stop weathering storms." On the most instinctual level it''s an album that should conjure simple pleasures like the joy of a summer road trip with loved ones. Embracing the sounds of classic artists like Fleetwood Mac, Brandy, Bob Marley, Joni Mitchell, and Marvin Gaye, to name a few, Where the Butterflies Go in the Rain draws inspiration from people who, "are really good at capturing the beauty and loss of life in the same breath," she describes. In her signature style, Raveena seamlessly unites that expansive songwriting with traditional Indian instruments and feel-good early 2000s pop hits -putting forth a work that''s more unabashedly herself than any that''s come before. Raveena reflects on her forthcoming album, "I don''t think I''ve ever understood a record so well before-It wasn''t like the process I used to have with past albums where I was more anxious about being at my best. This time, it was all intuition, and I knew the album was right when I finally had the feeling of rest." The deluxe release sees the addition of 3 tracks. Sun Don''t Leave Me - contemplating the feeling of wanting to hold onto one more beautiful sunset, one more passionate embrace, before things change again and hard times strike again - and a reimagined version of Lose My Focus with UMI, bringing fresh energy to an album that''s more unapologetically Raveena than ever.','6/13/2025',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4412910-3337153.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
