INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181071,'fathers sons|luke combs|luke combs|lp','Fathers & Sons','Luke Combs','Luke Combs','LP','SMNV81426.1','198028142618',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'44481605','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802814261','(Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Luke Combs - Fathers & Sons - Vinyl A collection of 12 poignant tracks, Fathers & Sons was recorded entirely live and features Combs most personal songwriting to date, as he reflects on his own experiences being a dad to his two sons and the unique bond between parents and their children. Reflecting on ΓÇ£The Man He Sees In Me,ΓÇ¥ Combs shares a message he wrote to his young sons, ΓÇ£To my boys, first and foremost, I will always love you, no matter what. With this song I want you to know that even though IΓÇÖm not perfect, I try my hardest every day to be the best version of myself for you both. IΓÇÖll make mistakes along the way and some days youΓÇÖll be sick of your old man, IΓÇÖm sure, but, dang, weΓÇÖll have some fun too. I canΓÇÖt wait to see what you both turn out to be like and I hope someday down the road, I get to watch you and your kids do the same. Love, Dad.ΓÇ¥ In addition to Combs, Fathers & Sons also features acclaimed musicians Jim ΓÇ£MooseΓÇ¥ Brown (keys), Sam Bush (mandolin), Stuart Duncan (fiddle), Mark Hill (bass), Josh Hunt (drums), Joey Landreth (electric guitar), Steve Mackey (bass), Josh Matheny (dobro), Jerry Roe (drums), Jonathan Singleton (acoustic guitar), Bryan Sutton (acoustic guitar) and Charlie Worsham (acoustic guitar).','8/30/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4355714-3198027.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181072,'timeless|kaytranada|kaytranada|lp','Timeless [Explicit Content]','KAYTRANADA','KAYTRANADA','LP','RCA281402.1','198028140218',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'45242595','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802814021','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. When KAYTRANADA left the 2021 Grammys with two awards (Best Dance/Electronic Album for 2019''s BUBBA and Best Dance Recording for "10%"), he made history as the first Black and first openly gay artist to win the former category. The industry recognition was long overdue for the producer, who had been building a devout following for nearly a decade. "In my mind I was finally a true artist," he tells Apple Music''s Zane Lowe. After relocating to Los Angeles, he channeled that confidence into making his third solo album, TIMELESS: "It felt more serious-more legit. I was still having fun making TIMELESS, but making BUBBA was another type of fun where I didn''t really take it seriously." Like it''s predecessor, TIMELESS is a collection of club grooves for catching a vibe. It''s packed with guests who effortlessly acclimate to KAYTRANADA''s singular sound while imprinting their own touch. Ravyn Lenae offers breathy seductions on the hard-edged R&B of "Video," and Thundercat delivers comical disses in soothing falsetto on the jazzy hip-hop of "Wasted Words." Back-to-back tracks "Do 2 Me" (featuring Anderson.Paak and SiR) and "Witchy" (featuring Childish Gambino) hit an energy peak, their tales of late-night infatuation framed by sultry, body-enveloping production.','6/27/2025',1.189999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/34/4432134-3413203.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181073,'wasteland baby|hozier|hozier|lp','Wasteland, Baby!','Hozier','Hozier','LP','SNYL818751.1','198028187510',28.19000000000000127,28.19000000000000127,'44394561','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802818751','(180 Gram Vinyl, Bonus Tracks, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Includes bonus tracks. Wasteland, Baby! Is the sophomore album by Irish Singer-Songwriter Hozier. Originally released in 2019, featuring the singles ''Nina Cried Power'', ''Movement'' and ''Almost (Sweet Music)'', the album has gone on to be certified Platinum in Canada and Gold in multiple territories. This expanded edition includes the original album, b-sides, acoustic version of ''Be'' + brand new song ''Why Would You Be Loved''.','7/19/2024',1.270000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4343182-3186321.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181074,'birth of the blue|miles davis|miles davis|lp','Birth Of The Blue','Miles Davis','Miles Davis','LP','AGUE17245.1','198028166317',68.14000000000000056,68.14000000000000056,'46260536','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802816631','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Miles Davis''s Kind of Blue was the number-one jazz album in history. It totaled five songs. There are four more songs from that same historic group, recorded in the same time period and at the same studio. And here they are. These songs deserve to stand on their own with artwork to highlight the quality of the music and that matches the time period of the recording. This is a rare opportunity to have a smash follow-up to what many consider the greatest jazz record ever! Through the years, these four remarkable performances - all from a single recording session in 1958 and all exemplary of the sound of Miles Davis'' legend-loaded sextet of that year - have not been served well. They have been largely treated as add-ons for other compilations. Now, for the first time, Analogue Productions, the audiophile in-house reissue label of Acoustic Sounds, Inc., together with Quality Record Prssings, has deservedly given these tracks a stellar stand-alone release for jazz fans to savor! The once-in-a-generation lineup that recorded these tunes is the very same that would be immortalized for the enduring classic they would record almost a year later, Kind of Blue. Davis played trumpet sublime with his ensemble sextet featuring pianist Bill Evans, drummer Jimmy Cobb, bassist Paul Chambers, and saxophonists John Coltrane and Julian ''Cannonball'' Adderley. Undervalued since their recording, the tunes on this album reflect historial and musical significance. They offer early glimpses into the modal jazz that Kind of Blue would bring to the forefront. Using modes common in modern classical music, rather than the chords of popular songs, Miles had begun to experiment with the new approach on the Milestones recording sessions previously. Analogue Productions is proud to present Birth of the Blue in an exclusive first-of-it''s-kind stand-alone release that reflects our reputation for meticulous production, capturing authentic sound with clarity, depth and fidelity that exceeds the audiophile standard. 180-gram 45 RPM double LP pressed at Quality Record Pressings.','7/17/2026',1.510000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4513914-3667060.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181075,'de todas las flores|natalia lafourcade|natalia lafourcade|lp','De Todas Las Flores','Natalia Lafourcade','Natalia Lafourcade','LP','CI826241.1','198028262415',22.75,22.75,'44612788','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802826241','(Booklet, With CD, Boxed Set, Sticker / Stickers, Poster)',0,'"De Todas Las Flores" is Natalia''s first release of all new original material since her breakthrough 2015 album ''Hasta La Raiz. The result of this search is ''De Todas Las Flores,'' a dazzling and deeply sophisticated collection of original songs that feature Natalia''s trademark compositional virtues - the unusual melodic turns, the affecting poetry, her lightness of touch - while also revealing a musical maturity that hints at a new step in her career. ''De Todas Las Flores'' was inspired by themes of vulnerability, life and death, the feminine, nature, the mystical, love and heartbreak.','1/31/2025',1.330000000000000071,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4370022-3233504.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181076,'i used to know her|h e r|h e r|lp','I Used To Know Her','H.E.R.','H.E.R.','LP','SNYL82562.1','198028256216',32.0,32.0,'44620776','2026-11-10 23:54:49','2026-11-10 23:54:49','/19802825621','(Colored Vinyl, Gold, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double gold colored vinyl LP pressing. H.E.R. celebrates the 5th anniversary of her acclaimed sophomore album, "I Used To Know Her." For the first time, the album will be available on vinyl as a gatefold LP on slightly gold vinyl. This release includes all 19 original tracks, featuring fan favorites like "Could''ve Been" (featuring Bryson Tiller) and "Take You There."','10/18/2024',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4370897-3234552.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181077,'world of hans zimmer part ii a new dimension|hans zimmer|hans zimmer|lp','World of Hans Zimmer Part II - a New Dimension','Hans Zimmer','Hans Zimmer','LP','SCLL82615.1','198028261517',40.97999999999999687,40.97999999999999687,'44756079','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802826151','(Hans Zimmer)',0,'THE WORLD OF HANS ZIMMER ΓÇô PART II: A NEW DIMENSION is the highly anticipated sequel to the acclaimed 2019 album The World of Hans Zimmer ΓÇô A Symphonic Celebration. Melding the grandeur of symphonic music with the dynamic power of his cinematic compositions, Zimmer transforms 17 more of his most successful soundtracks into new epic orchestral suites on this double album. Highlights of the over 2 hours long record include a short, captivating ΓÇ£cello-concerto-likeΓÇ¥ version of Final Ascent from No Time to Die, a tranquil rendition of A Time of Quiet Between the Storms from Dune II, and a new romantic suite from The Prince of Egypt. Additionally, Zimmer revisits one of his classic 90s soundtracks with a newly crafted suite of The Rock. THE WORLD OF HANS ZIMMER ΓÇô PART II: A NEW DIMENSION features Zimmer accompanied by a stellar ensemble of soloists and collaborators, including singers Lebo M, Lisa Gerrard, Gan-ya Ben-gur Akselrod, and Nokukhanya Dlamini; multi-woodwind wizard Pedro Eustache; bass player Juan Garc├¡a-Herreros; guitarist Alexios Anest; pianist Eliane Correa; cellist Mariko Muranaka; violinist Rusanda Panfili; and percussionists Aleksandra ┬⌐uklar, Luis Ribeiro, and Lucy Landymore. Together, they perform alongside the Odessa Orchestra & Friends and the Nairobi Chamber Choir, under the baton of conductor Gavin Greenaway. 3 x 180g black vinyl, Gatefold, poly lined inner sleeve The World of Hans Zimmer Part II ΓÇô A New Dimension','1/31/2025',1.709999999999999965,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4385836-3288193.jpg?ae=4621895153','Classical Artists');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181078,'get lifted rising|john legend|john legend|lp','Get Lifted...Rising','John Legend','John Legend','LP','CLBI19802826771.1','198028267717',14.78999999999999915,14.78999999999999915,'44964542','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802826771','(RSD Exclusive, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'MORE STOCK ARRIVING SOON! Get Lifted... Rising from John Legend. Featuring unreleased songs from the original ''Get Lifted'' sessions. Available for the first time on black vinyl.','4/12/2025',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4406321-3328604.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181079,'leon|leon bridges|leon bridges|lp','Leon','Leon Bridges','Leon Bridges','LP','CLBI829311.1','198028293112',22.75,22.75,'44585075','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802829311',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. ''Leon'' is the highly anticipated fourth album from Grammy Award-winning recording artist, songwriter, and performer Leon Bridges. With 13 tracks featuring Leon''s signature storytelling and a unique blend of organic genre alchemy, ''Leon'' is his most poignant, powerful, and personal work to date. He takes fans on a trip through the heart of Ft. Worth he knows best, the things he holds dear, and the people and places that shaped him. Featuring production by Ian Fitchuk (Beyonce, Noah Kahan), Daniel Tashian (Kacey Musgraves), and Tyler Johnson (Harry Styles, Miley Cyrus), Leon describes the album as "somewhat of a self-portrait... I''m excited to share these stories about my home, about nostalgia, about my upbringing, about where I''m from, with all of you. I hope this music brings you back to your roots and your journey." Single standard weight black vinyl, Single-pocket gatefold w/ gloss varnish, Printed inner sleeve on uncoated stock w/ matte varnish, 12x12" insert on uncoated stock w/ matte varnish, Sticker','10/4/2024',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4367343-3226409.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181080,'magpie|peach pit|peach pit|lp','Magpie','Peach Pit','Peach Pit','LP','CLBI82968.1','198028296816',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'44596538','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802829681','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, White)',0,'Magpie, the fourth studio album from Peach Pit is due out October 25th. The album was written and recorded in the band''s hometown of Vancouver, BC. Single disc vinyl, standard jacket, printed sleeve, with poster. COLOR: Clear with White Swirl.','10/25/2024',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4368486-3269494.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181081,'where are you going the singles|dave matthews band|dave matthews band|lp','Where Are You Going: The Singles','Dave Matthews Band','Dave Matthews Band','LP','SNYL82936.1','198028293617',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'44727000','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802829361','(140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. In honor of their Rock & Roll Hall Of Fame Induction this year, we will announce this new hits compilation for Dave Matthews Band on October 18. The ceremony will take place on Oct. 19 at the Rocket Mortgage Fieldhouse in Cleveland, Ohio. It will stream live on Disney+ and be available to stream on Hulu the next day. A cut-down version of the broadcast is also expected to air on ABC on January 1, 2025.','2/7/2025',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4382550-3298352.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181082,'in keeping secrets of silent earth 3|coheed cambria|coheed cambria|lp','In Keeping Secrets Of Silent Earth: 3','Coheed & Cambria','Coheed & Cambria','LP','SNYL80678.1','198028067812',28.37000000000000099,28.37000000000000099,'44453091','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802806781','(Anniversary Edition, Reissue)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Coheed and Cambria''s second studio album, In Keeping Secrets of Silent Earth: 3 celebrated it''s 20th Anniversary in 2023. Revisit the complex arrangements, haunting vocals, and dark imagery on this 2-LP black vinyl reissue.','7/26/2024',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4352351-3210310.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181083,'home alone original soundtrack import|john williams|john williams|lp','Home Alone (Original Soundtrack) [Import]','John Williams','John Williams','LP','SNUK2834331.1','198028343312',40.72999999999999687,40.72999999999999687,'44765095','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802834331','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Celebrate director Chris Columbus'' classic hit film HOME ALONE and it''s well-loved soundtrack by the legendary composer John Williams with a new vinyl package. The two-time Academy Awards┬« - nominated soundtrack was released alongside the 1990 film, with the film''s theme "Somewhere in My Memory" becoming an instant classic in the cannon of both film and Christmas music. The album consists of 19 tracks including holiday classics such as "Carol of the Bells", "We Wish You a Merry Christmas" and "White Christmas". The package features 2x colored vinyl, one red and one gold, housed in a gatefold with printed inner sleeves. The artwork includes pictures from the film and original artwork for the vinyl.','11/1/2024',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4386675-3304823.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181084,'millennium 2 0|backstreet boys|backstreet boys|cd','Millennium 2.0','Backstreet Boys','Backstreet Boys','CD','SNYL83677.2','198028367721',11.58999999999999986,11.58999999999999986,'44998431','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802836772','(Deluxe Edition, Bonus Tracks, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Backstreet Boys Millennium 2.0 - In celebration of the 25th anniversary of one of the best-selling albums ever, The Backstreet Boys are back with Millennium 2.0. This 2CD Deluxe Edition features all the original hits like "I Want It That Way," "The One," and "The Perfect Fan," along with 13 bonus tracks, including live and alternative versions, demos, and the never-before-heard track, "Hey." With brand new cover art, photos and "Thank Yous" from the band, Millennium 2.0 is a must-have for any fan.','7/11/2025',0.25,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4409767-3337138.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181085,'violator|depeche mode|depeche mode|cd','Violator','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','CD','SNYL841092.2','198028410922',9.99000000000000021,9.99000000000000021,'45012600','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841092',NULL,0,'VIOLATOR Initially released in March 1990, Violator, Depeche Mode''s seventh album showcased the band''s maturity and ability to create dark, brooding atmospheres while achieving mainstream success. The album features some of Depeche Mode''s most iconic tracks, including "Personal Jesus," "Enjoy the Silence," "Policy of Truth," and "World in My Eyes." "Enjoy the Silence" became a breakout hit, earning the band their first top-10 single in the U.S. and winning a BRIT Award for Best Single. Violator reached the top 10 in numerous countries, including the USA and UK, earning critical acclaim.','4/4/2025',0.2300000000000000099,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/4411588-3335338.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181086,'reboot ii|brooks dunn|brooks dunn|lp','Reboot II','Brooks & Dunn','Brooks & Dunn','LP','SMNV82940.1','198028294010',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'44651992','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802829401',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 2024 release. After introducing a fresh concept with 2019''s Reboot, they''ve now pulled out all the stops. Reboot II is here, and it''s like nothing else. Not just a tribute - an experiment. The project is "No Rules," and it''s not an exaggeration. Featuring 18 Brooks & Dunn classics recreated from a blank slate, maximum creative freedom was given to a select group of today''s most engaging artists - not just from country, but from outside the genre as well. Each was given a near-impossible task by Brooks & Dunn themselves: Take an iconic hit and reimagine the song to fit their own taste and style. What came out is not a traditional tribute album - in fact it''s the exact opposite, a clear refusal to put these songs under glass in the museum of country history. Instead, it shows just how alive Brooks & Dunn''s influence is across today''s musical scene... and how versatile their songwriting really was.','11/15/2024',0.989999999999999992,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/17/4374117-3288476.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181087,'violator|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Violator','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL841081.1','198028410816',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45012617','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841081',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Initially released in March 1990, Violator, Depeche Mode''s seventh album showcased the band''s maturity and ability to create dark, brooding atmospheres while achieving mainstream success. The album features some of Depeche Mode''s most iconic tracks, including "Personal Jesus," "Enjoy the Silence," "Policy of Truth," and "World in My Eyes." "Enjoy the Silence" became a breakout hit, earning the band their first top-10 single in the U.S. and winning a BRIT Award for Best Single. Violator reached the top 10 in numerous countries, including the USA and UK, earning critical acclaim.','4/4/2025',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4411587-3335339.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181088,'unreal unearth unending|hozier|hozier|lp','Unreal Unearth Unending','Hozier','Hozier','LP','CLBI843921.1','198028439213',50.21000000000000085,50.21000000000000085,'44748654','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802843921','(Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Presenting Unreal Unearth Unending, HozierΓÇÖs collection of songs from the sessions behind his chart-topping 2023 album Unreal Unearth. The Deluxe Version contains all tracks released around the album from 2022-2024 including the 16 original album tracks plus 10 songs never-before pressed on vinyl including the global smash hit ΓÇ£Too SweetΓÇ¥ and a previously unreleased new track ΓÇ£Hymn To Virgil.ΓÇ¥  Available December 6 on 3 ΓÇ£Tooth WhiteΓÇ¥ colored LPs in an expanded trifold package plus 2 printed 12ΓÇ¥x12ΓÇ¥ inserts featuring drawings by Andrew Hozier-Byrne. FEATURES: 3LP Package Description: Color: Tooth White (White/Brown Swirl) Standard weight triple LP (double vinyl original album + 3rd disc with DLX tracks) Trifold jacket 3x Printed inner sleeves 12x12ΓÇ¥ Insert Sticker HOZIER / UNREAL UNEARTH UNENDING  3xVINYL LP','12/6/2024',1.820000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4384860-3288189.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181089,'music for the masses|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Music For The Masses','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL841121.1','198028411219',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'45012655','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841121',NULL,0,'MUSIC FOR THE MASSES - Music for the Masses is Depeche Mode''s sixth studio album, released in September 1987. It marked a shift toward a more expansive sound and featured standout tracks like "Never Let Me Down Again, " "Strangelove, " and "Behind the Wheel." The record''s success was supported by the groundbreaking "Music for the Masses Tour, " culminating in their legendary performance at the Rose Bowl in Pasadena on June 19, 1988. The show was recorded for the live album 101 and as part of the film of the same name.','4/4/2025',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4411439-3335344.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181090,'james taylor at christmas|james taylor|james taylor|lp','James Taylor At Christmas','James Taylor','James Taylor','LP','SNYL84197.1','198028419710',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'45467059','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841971',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Get into the holiday spirit with James Taylor At Christmas, a collection of 15 holiday favorites, including jazzy renditions of "Winter Wonderland" and "Santa Claus Is Coming to Town," a moving version of George Harrison''s "Here Comes the Sun" recorded with Yo-Yo Ma, a playful duet with Natalie Cole on "Baby, It''s Cold Outside," plus a new track "Mon Beau Sapin" a French version of "O Christmas Tree."','10/17/2025',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4453193-3463651.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181091,'songs of faith and devotion|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Songs Of Faith And Devotion','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL841211.1','198028412117',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'45012679','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841211',NULL,0,'SONGS OF FAITH AND DEVOTION - Released in March 1993, Songs of Faith and Devotion is Depeche Mode''s eighth studio album, marking a bold departure in the band''s sound. Tracks like "I Feel You," "Walking in My Shoes," and "In Your Room" explore themes of faith, love, and redemption and feature a grittier, more organic sound, blending live instrumentation with electronic textures. The album debuted at #1 in both the USA and the UK.','4/4/2025',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/4411441-3335346.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
