INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181093,'alice in chains|alice in chains|alice in chains|lp','Alice In Chains','Alice in Chains','Alice in Chains','LP','SNYL284869.1','198028486910',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'45669958','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802848691','(Colored Vinyl, Anniversary Edition, Reissue)',0,'Double yellow colored vinyl LP pressing. 30th Anniversary. Alice in Chains'' self-titled album, originally released in 1995, is a dark and introspective work that marked the band''s final studio effort with vocalist Layne Staley. The record blends heavy, sludgy riffs with haunting melodies and acoustic textures, creating a sound that is both aggressive and deeply melancholic. Now celebrating it''s 30th Anniversary, the album will see an official reissue, pressed on colored vinyl.','1/30/2026',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/79/4471379-3726120.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181094,'last christmas|wham|wham|lp','Last Christmas','Wham','Wham','LP','SNYL858931.1','198028589314',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'46685674','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802858931','(Extended Play, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Wham!''s ''Last Christmas'' is not only one of the most iconic songs of all time, it is a cultural phenomenon. Loved by generations around the world, George Michael and Andrew Ridgeley''s timeless Christmas classic celebrates it''s 40th anniversary in 2024. This release brings together all the versions together in one special festive package. It includes a stunning previously unreleased live version of the track performed by George at Wembley in 2006 plus the ''Pudding'' mix and instrumental version.','11/27/2026',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4386681-3305480.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181095,'the best of depeche mode 1|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','The Best Of Depeche Mode 1','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL841101.1','198028411011',45.68999999999999773,45.68999999999999773,'45012631','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802841101',NULL,0,'THE BEST OF VOLUME 1 The Best of Depeche Mode Volume 1, released in November 2006, celebrates the band''s illustrious career spanning two and a half decades. The collection features 17 of Depeche Mode''s most iconic tracks, including hits like "Personal Jesus," "Enjoy the Silence," "Just Can''t Get Enough," "People Are People," "Never Let Me Down Again," and "Everything Counts". The album also includes the new song "Martyr". The album is a perfect introduction for new fans and a retrospective for longtime followers.','4/4/2025',1.850000000000000088,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4411437-3335342.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181096,'bando stone and the new world|childish gambino|childish gambino|lp','Bando Stone And The New World [Explicit Content]','Childish Gambino','Childish Gambino','LP','RCA84022.1','198028402217',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'45058943','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802840221','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Childish Gambino - Bando Stone and The New World - Vinyl 2 LP Donald Glover has declared Bando Stone and the New World the last Childish Gambino album. The ostensible soundtrack to a feature-length movie of the same name, the hour-long project includes snippets of dialogue that hint at the filmΓÇÖs apocalyptic subject matter. The fact that the soundtrack is preceding the actual film is part of GloverΓÇÖs strategy: He wants listeners to work to figure out what theyΓÇÖre listening to. ΓÇ£The soundtrack forces the audience to participate in a way that I don''t feel like most things force you to participate,ΓÇ¥ he says. ΓÇ£It forces you to have an imagination. I already see people being like, ''This is very cinematic, this must be the part that... This feels like a credit sequence.'' A lot of stuff feels flat because it''s not asking you to participate. Art used to be you had to participate on some level and have some sort of thought process on it. You can''t just be like, ''Oh, this is mid.''ΓÇ¥ Even without the benefit of the full visuals, these 17 tracks make for a satisfying swan song that synthesizes what came before with fresher ideas gleaned from the threshold of finality.','4/18/2025',1.219999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4415993-3368112.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181097,'one more time part 2 blue vinyl|blink 182|blink 182|lp','One More Time (Part 2) [Blue Vinyl] [Explicit Content]','blink-182','blink-182','LP','CLBI85090.1','198028509015',31.28000000000000113,31.28000000000000113,'44603465','2026-11-10 23:54:50','2026-11-10 23:54:50','/19802850901','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double blue colored vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. 2025 release from the pop-punk trio featuring 27 Tracks including 10 new songs! ONE MORE TIME... PART-2 adds new tracks to blink-182''s #1 Billboard 200 album ONE MORE TIME... which was the first record featuring the group''s iconic lineup together again - Mark Hoppus [bass, vocals], Tom DeLonge [guitar, vocals], and Travis Barker [drums]. The trio recorded ONE MORE TIME... and ONE MORE TIME... PART-2 over the course of 2022 to 2024 in the midst of their blockbuster reunion tour, which sold out arenas, amphitheaters, and stadiums across the world. ONE MORE TIME... PART-2 features 10 new songs in addition to the original 17 tracks that capture the band at the top of their game, layering in themes of tragedy, triumph, and most importantly, brotherhood.','1/24/2025',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4369174-3308370.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
