INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181109,'so close to what|tate mcrae|tate mcrae|cd','So Close To What [Explicit Content]','Tate McRae','Tate McRae','CD','RCA885082.2','198028850827',9.68999999999999951,9.68999999999999951,'44803773','2026-11-10 23:54:51','2026-11-10 23:54:51','/19802885082','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Booklet)',0,'Tate McRae - So Close to What - CD Standard jewel case, multi-page booklet, shrink wrapped "So Close To What is the third studio album by Tate McRae. This LP represents the journey of growing up when the road ahead feels infinite and the destination increasingly elusive.ΓÇ¥','2/21/2025',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4390420-3299493.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181110,'wish you were here|pink floyd|pink floyd|lp','Wish You Were Here','Pink Floyd','Pink Floyd','LP','SNYL87674.1','198028767415',186.0,186.0,'45532535','2026-11-10 23:54:51','2026-11-10 23:54:51','/19802876741','(Oversize Item Split, Deluxe Edition, Boxed Set, Bonus LP, Bonus Tracks)',0,'Wish You Were Here 50 gives fans an exciting new perspective into one of Pink FloydΓÇÖs most iconic and best-loved records. This 50th anniversary edition features rarities and live recordings - at the core of this special collection are six previously unreleased alternate versions and demos presenting Pink Floyd''s eighth studio album in a brand-new way that demands repeat listening. This Blu-ray includes a Dolby Atmos mix of the album for the first time by James Guthrie, plus 25 bonus tracks made up of nine studio rarities, and 16 live recordings captured by the renowned bootlegger Mike Millard at Pink FloydΓÇÖs Los Angeles Sports Arena concert on April 26th, 1975, now receiving its first official release. The live audio has been meticulously restored and remastered by Steven Wilson. The Blu-ray also gives fans the chance to see three concert screen films from the bandΓÇÖs 1975 tour, plus a Storm Thorgerson short film. FEATURES: Contains the original 1975 5-track album + 25 bonus tracks Bonus tracks consist of: 9 studio rarities 6 of which have never before been released in any way 4 of these newly mixed by James Guthrie, 2 are original studio mixes 16 live bootleg tracks Full show, recorded live at the Los Angeles Sports Arena, April 26, 1975 If Pink Floyd ever decides to create a Bootleg Series, they should get their hands on MillardΓÇÖs master tapes ΓÇö starting with this 1975 Los Angeles gig.  ItΓÇÖs the band at the peak of their abilities as a live act and deserves to be heard as widely as possible. ΓÇô Rolling Stone, 2021 Recorded by Mike Millard Restoration and remastering by Steven Wilson Length of live concert:  2:13:53 VIDEO:  3 concert screen films from the 1975 tour + a Storm Thorgerson short film PINK FLOYD / WISH YOU WERE HERE    (VINYL LP)','12/12/2025',7.5,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/17/4458317-3454051.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181111,'construction time again|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Construction Time Again','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL288779.1','198028877916',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45342011','2026-11-10 23:54:51','2026-11-10 23:54:51','/19802887791','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Depeche Mode - CONSTRUCTION TIME AGAIN','8/22/2025',0.08000000000000000166,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4441343-3438778.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181112,'american romance|lukas nelson|lukas nelson|lp','American Romance','Lukas Nelson','Lukas Nelson','LP','SMNV289450.1','198028945011',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'45072772','2026-11-10 23:54:51','2026-11-10 23:54:51','/19802894501',NULL,0,'Lukas Nelson came of age in the dives and diners of this country and his itinerant life showed him America as few others get to see it. Nelson ponders his relationship with the country with all it''s joy and heartbreak on American Romance, his first solo album and first under Sony Music Nashville. - Recorded by Grammy Award-winning producer Shooter Jennings, it shows the singer-songwriter expanding his sound while doubling down on the fundamentals of his artistry. "It''s been a long and inspiring journey in the band," he says. "This is an opportunity to experiment with some new colors in the palette." - American Romance brings out those new colors in dazzling fashion, demonstrating Nelson to be a singer-songwriter of uncommon dexterity. He''s just as likely to wrestle with heady existential matters as he is to lament his losses, and he''s steeped in tradition without being strictly bound to it. Much like the land that provided it''s name, American Romance is a novelistic album teeming with great complexity and beauty that plays out like a series of chapters from his life.','6/20/2025',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4417202-3384046.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181113,'speak and spell|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Speak And Spell','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SNYL288769.1','198028876919',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45341380','2026-11-10 23:54:51','2026-11-10 23:54:51','/19802887691','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Speak & Spell is a remarkable debut album that put Depeche Mode on the world stage. Propelled by the #11 UK single "New Life" and by the international hit "Just Can''t Get Enough" the album positioned Depeche Mode as one of the most interesting of the emerging electronic music artists.','8/22/2025',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4441295-3438731.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
