INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181163,'tanzneid|electric callboy|electric callboy|lp','Tanzneid','Electric Callboy','Electric Callboy','LP','CEN933391.1','198029333916',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46370839','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802933391','(Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, Violet)',0,'Limited violet colored vinyl LP pressing. Electric Callboy return with TANZNEID, their most ambitious album to date, blending metalcore, EDM and pop into a sound that''s become unmistakably their own. Following a #1 album, multiple Gold certifications and hundreds of millions of streams and video views, the band continue to evolve while staying true to the energy and attitude that brought them here. With massive hooks, high-impact tracks, club-driven moments, standout collaborations and their signature sense of humor, TANZNEID feels bigger, louder and more dynamic than ever.','8/7/2026',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4522689-3621858.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181164,'lux|rosalia|rosalia|lp','Lux [Explicit Content]','Rosalia','Rosalia','LP','CLBI294325.1','198029432510',32.74000000000000198,32.74000000000000198,'45635243','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802943251','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl, Bonus Tracks, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',1,'LUX is the fourth studio album from GRAMMY Award winning singer, songwriter, and producer ROSAL├ìA. This is her most groundbreaking & global release to date. LUX is a monumental achievement in vision and craft.  ~  LUX vinyl features three additional songs which are exclusive to the physical format. LP FEATURES: Gatefold Jacket (w/either soft touch lamination or raised uv lamination) Double standard weight clear vinyl Cross shaped poster Bookmark Artist name/hits sticker Barcode sticker ROSAL├ìA  ~  LUX','11/7/2025',1.219999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4467675-3471553.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181165,'deadbeat|tame impala|tame impala|lp','Deadbeat [Explicit Content]','Tame Impala','Tame Impala','LP','CLBI95600.1','198029560015',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45505386','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802956001','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Booklet)',0,'Tame ImpalaΓÇÖs fifth full-length album, Deadbeat, available on Black Vinyl. On it, Parker sculpts a collection of wickedly potent club-psych explorations as a vehicle for some of his most direct, brain-wormy songwriting to date, recasting Tame Impala as a kind of future primitive rave act in the process. Deadbeat sounds like the work of an artist with a leveled up mastery and bristles with a revitalized energy for experimentation. 12 songs crafted with a newfound embrace of spontaneity for the renowned perfectionist. How that manifests is a distinct minimalism and crunch to many of the tracks, with a clutch of crucial details, timbres and textures that add an ineffably new dimension to the sound, as well as a richer, more playful vocal range than ever. TAME IMPALA / DEADBEAT   Wide Vinyl','10/17/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4456713-3447962.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
