INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181167,'addison|addison rae|addison rae|lp','Addison [Explicit Content]','Addison Rae','Addison Rae','LP','CLBI296198.1','198029619812',23.03999999999999915,23.03999999999999915,'45557712','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802961981','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Sticker / Stickers, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Addison Rae''s debut album featuring hits "Diet Pepsi," "Aquamarine," "High Fashion," and "Headphones On." Addison features 12 tracks and was written and produced by Addison, Luka Kloser and Elvira Anderfj├ñrd. Pressed on yellow marble vinyl. One-pocket gatefold jacket. 4/0 + gloss aq - Inner sleeve with no lip. 4/0 + gloss aq - 12in insert 4/4 + gloss aq - Two 4c labels - PA sticker.','10/31/2025',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4460613-3454760.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181168,'wrecking ball|bruce springsteen|bruce springsteen|lp','Wrecking Ball','Bruce Springsteen','Bruce Springsteen','LP','SNYL295583.1','198029558319',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'45859113','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802955831',NULL,0,'Marking his 17th studio album, Wrecking Ball features 11 original Springsteen recordings and was produced by Ron Aniello with Bruce Springsteen and executive producer Jon Landau. The record includes favorites, "We Take Care of Our Own," and "Shackled and Drawn." Said long-time manager Landau, "The writing is some of the best of his career, and both veteran fans and those who are new to Bruce will find much to love on Wrecking Ball."','1/30/2026',1.189999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4483863-3521743.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181169,'vie|doja cat|doja cat|lp','Vie [Explicit Content]','Doja Cat','Doja Cat','LP','RCA296775.1','198029677515',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'45465208','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802967751','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. Includes poster. 2025 release. Doja Cat''s highly anticipated fifth studio album, "Vie", is slated for release on September 26th. The 15-track album is rich with retro textures and a sonic background charged by various influences from the 70s and 80s. "Vie" highlights Doja''s own personal evolution and brings audiences into the world of love, life and the mess in between.','9/26/2025',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4453065-3440610.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181170,'the original freewheelin bob dylan|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','The Original Freewheelin'' Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL2967121.1','198029671216',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'45573675','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802967121','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'The first ever release of The Freewheelin'' Bob Dylan as it was originally conceived, including four tracks that were withdrawn before the album came out: Rocks And Gravel, Let Me Die in My Footsteps, Rambling, Gambling Willie and Talking'' John Birch Paranoid Blues. With the original never-before seen liner notes. Black vinyl','11/27/2025',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4462138-3458478.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181171,'memories and empties|colter wall|colter wall|lp','Memories And Empties','Colter Wall','Colter Wall','LP','RCA296457.1','198029645712',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'45567315','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802964571','(Colored Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Colter Wall - Memories and Empties - Vinyl Single LP standard weight Opaque Bone disc in pocket jacket, 12x12ΓÇ¥ lyric sheet insert, shrink wrapped. Memories and Empties is the 5th studio album from the timeless voice of Colter Wall. Recorded live at historic RCA Studio A, with his longtime road band, this new record contains 10 tracks, including hit single ΓÇ£1800 Miles.ΓÇ¥ Pressed on Opaque Bone colored vinyl, Memories and Empties finds Colter at the heart of traditional country music. Hints of Western swing and authentic honky tonk combine for a listening experience like an evening at your favorite hometown bar.','11/14/2025',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4461540-3456588.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181172,'pies descalzos|shakira|shakira|lp','Pies Descalzos','Shakira','Shakira','LP','SNYL296785.1','198029678512',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'45555077','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802967851','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Red, Anniversary Edition)',0,'SHAKIRA / PIES DESCALZOS VINYL LP Released in 1995, Pies Descalzos marked a pivotal moment in Shakira''s career, propelling her to global stardom. The album''s innovative fusion of pop-rock rhythms with Latin influences produced a fresh and distinctive sound. With hits like "Estoy Aqu├¡," "D├│nde Est├ís Coraz├│n?" and "Antolog├¡a," Shakira captivated a diverse audience, showcasing her ability to find memorable and unique turns of phrase that set her apart as a true songwriter and poet. Celebrate the 30th anniversary of this iconic album, now available again on a vibrant yellow with red swirl marble colored vinyl.','11/14/2025',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4460377-3454756.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181173,'stankonia|outkast|outkast|lp','Stankonia [Explicit Content]','OutKast','OutKast','LP','SNYL295459.1','198029545913',40.97999999999999687,40.97999999999999687,'45555114','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802954591','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Purple, Bonus Tracks, Anniversary Edition)',0,'OutKast / STANKONIA Celebrate 25 years of OutKast''s iconic Stankonia with this expanded 3LP set, pressed on eye-catching purple marble vinyl. Featuring exclusive bonus tracks, unreleased photos, and cover art by Andr├⌐ 3000, this collector''s edition also includes a glow-in-the-dark fold out "flag" poster.','10/31/2025',1.520000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4460376-3472184.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181174,'faith|george michael|george michael|lp','Faith','George Michael','George Michael','LP','SNYL297287.1','198029728712',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45805493','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802972871',NULL,0,'Few albums have defined an era and redefined a generation of pop music quite like Faith, George Michael''s groundbreaking 1987 debut solo album. Written, arranged, produced, and performed almost entirely by George, it includes the hit singles ''Faith'', ''Father Figure'', ''One More Try'' and ''Monkey''. Now available on vinyl for the first time in over a decade, this 9 track format is a replica of the original album.','2/20/2026',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4479600-3505819.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181175,'foo fighters|foo fighters|foo fighters|lp','Foo Fighters','Foo Fighters','Foo Fighters','LP','SNYL296965.1','198029696516',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'45600098','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802969651','(Indie Exclusive, Bonus Tracks)',0,NULL,'10/17/2025',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181176,'around the world in a day|prince the revolution|prince the revolution|lp','Around The World In A Day','Prince & the Revolution','Prince & the Revolution','LP','SNYL97342.1','198029734218',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45533150','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802973421','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Remastered)',0,'Prince''s seventh studio album, and the second to be credited to Prince and the Revolution, Around The World In A Day, was released on April 22, 1985. Featuring no fewer than four singles, Around The World In A Day saw Prince and the Revolution change musical direction yet again, experimenting with psychedelic textures, incorporating new instrumentation, and expanding the genres of songs within the album. With audio newly remastered by original mastering engineer Bernie Grundman, with additional mastering by Chris James, the Around The World In A Day 2025 Remaster will be available November 21, 2025 on blue marble color vinyl.','11/21/2025',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4458331-3455369.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181177,'essex honey|blood orange|blood orange|lp','Essex Honey','Blood Orange','Blood Orange','LP','RCA294496.1','198029449617',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'45398926','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802944961','(140 Gram Vinyl, 45 RPM, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressed at 45 RPM. 2025 release. Essex Honey explores themes of family grief, England, and the healing, communal power of music throughout a lifetime. Lyrically, the album is diaristic yet communal, existing in the haze of memory that often follows a loss. Musically, this is reflected sonically through analog recordings, recurring cello motifs, nods to earlier Blood Orange projects, and various musical interpolations from Hynes'' youth. Sonically, the album includes an array of arrangements and instruments like the acoustic guitar with a punk distortion and melodic ethereal tones that were woven into his dreams as a kid growing up in Essex, imagining his future. Essex Honey features contributions from The Durutti Column, Mustafa, Caroline Polachek, Daniel Caesar, Lorde, Zadie Smith, Tirzah, Brendan Yates (Turnstile), and Mabe Fratti.','8/29/2025',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4446838-3443903.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181178,'desire|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Desire','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL297465.1','198029746518',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'46506870','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802974651','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Originally released in 1976, Desire stands among the most celebrated albums of Bob Dylan''s career. Blending folk, rock, and world music influences, the album features vivid storytelling, rich instrumentation, and some of Dylan''s most memorable compositions. Highlights include the epic "Hurricane," the romantic "Sara," and the sweeping "Isis," showcasing Dylan''s gift for creating deeply personal yet universally resonant songs. With it''s adventurous musical arrangements and powerful lyrical narratives, Desire remains a landmark recording in Dylan''s legendary catalog.','9/18/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4534730-3708583.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181179,'wish you were here yellow flame colored vinyl import|pink floyd|pink floyd|lp','Wish You Were Here - Yellow Flame Colored Vinyl [Import]','Pink Floyd','Pink Floyd','LP','SNUK2974631.1','198029746310',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'45610523','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802974631','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'To mark the 50th anniversary of Wish You Were Here, the album first appears on "Yellow Flame" vinyl. With ''Shine On You Crazy Diamond'', the hypnotic ''Welcome To The Machine'', the snappy ''Have a Cigar'' and the indispensable title song, Wish You Were Here is undoubtedly one of the most important albums in the history of pop music. The album''s themes - absence, isolation, transience, and criticism of the insincerity of the music industry - are reflected in the iconic album cover. Even 50 years after it''s release, "Wish You Were Here" sounds as up-to-date and vibrant as ever.','12/19/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4465642-3469637.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181180,'the heat|toni braxton|toni braxton|lp','The Heat','Toni Braxton','Toni Braxton','LP','SNYL297422.1','198029742213',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'45804137','2026-11-10 23:54:53','2026-11-10 23:54:53','/19802974221',NULL,0,'Released in 2000, The Heat solidified Toni Braxton''s status as a powerhouse in the R&B genre, seamlessly blending elements of soul, pop, and hip-hop influencers to create a sound that is both fresh and timeless. Featuring chart-topping hits like "He Wasn''t Man Enough" and "Spanish Guitar," The Heat showcases Braxton''s sultry vocals and emotional depth, delivering a mix of upbeat anthems and poignant ballads.','1/23/2026',0.9200000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4479577-3504024.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181181,'secrets|toni braxton|toni braxton|lp','Secrets','Toni Braxton','Toni Braxton','LP','SNYL297421.1','198029742114',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'45804120','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802974211',NULL,0,'Secrets is the second studio album by American singer Toni Braxton, originally released in 1996. The album marked a pivotal moment in Braxton''s career, blending R&B, soul, and pop influences to create a sound that is both timeless and contemporary. Featuring powerhouse tracks like the Grammy-winning "Un-Break My Heart" and the sultry "You''re Makin'' Me High," Secrets showcases Braxton''s unparalleled vocal prowess and signature emotional storytelling.','1/23/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4479576-3504023.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181182,'even in arcadia indie exclusive|sleep token||lp','Even In Arcadia (Indie Exclusive)','Sleep Token',NULL,'LP','RCA296707.1','19802967071',29.8299999999999983,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/sleep-token-even-in-arcadia-indie-exclusive/19802967071',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181183,'nashville skyline|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Nashville Skyline','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL297464.1','198029746419',16.48000000000000042,16.48000000000000042,'45615023','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802974641',NULL,0,'Bob Dylan''s ninth studio album was recorded in Nashville over 10 days in February 1969, with a group of local session musicians, and released just two months later. It contains one of his most beloved and successful songs in "Lay Lady Lay" as well as a duet with Johnny Cash on a new version of the early Dylan classic "Girl From The North Country". Other singles from the album include "I Threw It All Away" and "Tonight I''ll Be Staying Here With You". This release brings the album back in print in vinyl in it''s original stereo version.','11/28/2025',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4466075-3469723.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181184,'who s the clown|audrey hobert|audrey hobert|lp','Who''s The Clown? [Explicit Content]','Audrey Hobert','Audrey Hobert','LP','RCA974951.1','198029749519',18.19000000000000127,18.19000000000000127,'45543111','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802974951','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Poster)',0,'Audrey Hobert''s Who''s the Clown? is her debut album, released via RCA Records. The 12-track LP features breakout hit "Sue me," among 11 other bona fide pop tracks. It was brought to life with close collaborator and producer, Ricky Gourmet.','11/21/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4459200-3480166.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181185,'deadbeat indie exclusive|tame impala|tame impala|lp','Deadbeat  (Indie Exclusive) [Explicit Content]','Tame Impala','Tame Impala','LP','CLBI97816.1','198029781618',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'45505553','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802978161','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Tame ImpalaΓÇÖs fifth full-length album, Deadbeat, available exclusively at Indie Record Stores on Coke Bottle Vinyl. On it, Parker sculpts a collection of wickedly potent club-psych explorations as a vehicle for some of his most direct, brain-wormy songwriting to date, recasting Tame Impala as a kind of future primitive rave act in the process. Deadbeat sounds like the work of an artist with a leveled up mastery and bristles with a revitalized energy for experimentation. 12 songs crafted with a newfound embrace of spontaneity for the renowned perfectionist. How that manifests is a distinct minimalism and crunch to many of the tracks, with a clutch of crucial details, timbres and textures that add an ineffably new dimension to the sound, as well as a richer, more playful vocal range than ever. TAME IMPALA / DEADBEAT   (Indie Exclusive)','10/17/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4456714-3448286.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181186,'after the sun goes down|khalid|khalid|lp','After The Sun Goes Down','Khalid','Khalid','LP','RCA297475.1','198029747515',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'45456886','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802974751','(Colored Vinyl, Turquoise, Blue, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Khalid - After the Sun Goes Down - Vinyl (Opaque Turquoise Blue 2 LP) After a period where his private life became public, Khalid chose to step out of his fear and embrace his sexuality on a worldwide scale. That boldness became the heartbeat of this new album ΓÇö AFTER THE SUN GOES DOWN. For someone who once preferred to create in isolation, opening up to collaboration built the soundscape for this album. This album is the result of Khalid stepping out of fear and into a space of freedom, honesty and community. The album celebrates escapism, intimacy, queer empowerment, lust, desire and love.','10/10/2025',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4452291-3438936.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181187,'thats the spirit|bring me the horizon|bring me the horizon|lp','Thats The Spirit [Explicit Content]','Bring Me the Horizon','Bring Me the Horizon','LP','SNYL978301.1','198029783018',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'45529740','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802978301','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Black, White, Anniversary Edition)',0,'A black and white splatter 12" vinyl re-issue of Bring Me the Horizon''s groundbreaking fifth studio record, That''s The Spirit. Featuring some of the band''s most successful singles such as Throne, Drown and Follow You, it is an album that saw the band transcend from UK-alternative mainstays to global superstars.','12/12/2025',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/56/4458056-3494340.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181188,'stranger things 5 soundtrack from the netflix series|various artists|various artists|lp','Stranger Things 5: (Soundtrack From The Netflix Series)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','SNYL297322.1','198029732214',17.94000000000000127,17.94000000000000127,'45741432','2026-11-10 23:54:54','2026-11-10 23:54:54','/19802973221',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Celebrate the epic conclusion of Netflix''s Stranger Things with the official Season 5 soundtrack, a nostalgic journey back to 1987. Featuring iconic tracks that underscore the final battle in Hawkins. Available on standard weight black vinyl.','1/30/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4475593-3509598.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
