INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181268,'boycott heaven|the format|the format|lp','Boycott Heaven [Explicit Content]','The Format','The Format','LP','TFQR2014211.1','198704713064',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'45567087','2026-11-10 23:54:57','2026-11-10 23:54:57','/19870471306','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Cream, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The Format - Boycott Heaven - Vinyl Translucent Swiss Coffee Vinyl in Gatefold Jacket After nearly two decades apart, Nate Ruess and Sam Means return to The Format, the indie pop band they helmed in the early 2000s. Teaming with Grammy-winning producer Brendan OΓÇÖBrien (Pearl Jam, Bruce Springsteen, The Killers) and drummer Matt Chamberlain (who''s played with David Bowie, Bob Dylan, and others), the duoΓÇÖs third album Boycott Heaven incorporates sonic nods to the alt-rock, grunge, and pop-punk sounds that Sam and Nate first bonded over as Arizona teenagers in the late 90s.','1/23/2026',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/4461525-3460345.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181269,'empty hands|poppy|poppy|lp','Empty Hands','Poppy','Poppy','LP','SUMR3638.1','198704720536',19.39999999999999857,19.39999999999999857,'45653025','2026-11-10 23:54:58','2026-11-10 23:54:58','/19870472053','(Colored Vinyl, White, Blue)',0,'White & Blue Vinyl. Metal and avant-pop artist Poppy returns with 13 bold new tracks on her seventh full-length, Empty Hands. Produced by Jordan Fish (Bring Me the Horizon), Poppy follows up her previous album, Negative Spaces, with a daring set of songs that blurs the lines between heavy and hypnotic, cementing her status as a rising visionary within the rock genre. Iridescent White w/ Blue Marble Color Vinyl in Gatefold Jacket.','1/23/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/4469462-3471873.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181270,'steel town|morgan evans|morgan evans|lp','Steel Town','Morgan Evans','Morgan Evans','LP','SQLR4745331.1','198704745331',15.58999999999999986,15.58999999999999986,'45592645','2026-11-10 23:54:58','2026-11-10 23:54:58','/19870474533','(Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Morgan Evans - Steel Town - Vinyl Morgan Evans is an Australian-born, Nashville-based country music artist whose blend of heartfelt storytelling and breezy melodies has earned him a global fanbase. With over 750 million global streams, a #1 U.S. Country Airplay single (ΓÇÿKiss SomebodyΓÇÖ), and consistent Top 10 placements on both U.S. and Australian charts, Evans has proven his commercial strength across markets.His emotionally raw single ΓÇÿOver for YouΓÇÖ struck a chord worldwide, debuting live to a standing ovation and quickly amassing millions of streams. As a dynamic live performer and CMA Global Country Artist Award winner, Evans brings both loyal fan engagement and commercial viability. His journey from Newcastle, Australia to the heart of country music in Nashville showcases not just talent, but resilience and evolutionΓÇömaking him one of the most relatable and refreshing voices in modern country today. 140g Steel Blue Vinyl in Standard Jacket with Printed Inner Sleeve','3/20/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/94/4463894-3463516.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181271,'boycott heaven|the format|the format|cassette','Boycott Heaven [Explicit Content]','The Format','The Format','Cassette','TFQR201421.4','198704744556',8.650000000000000355,8.650000000000000355,'45567070','2026-11-10 23:54:58','2026-11-10 23:54:58','/19870474455','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'After nearly two decades apart, Nate Ruess and Sam Means return to The Format, the indie pop band they helmed in the early 2000s. Teaming with Grammy-winning producer Brendan O''Brien (Pearl Jam, Bruce Springsteen, The Killers) and drummer Matt Chamberlain (who''s played with David Bowie, Bob Dylan, and others), the duo''s third album Boycott Heaven incorporates sonic nods to the alt-rock, grunge, and pop-punk sounds that Sam and Nate first bonded over as Arizona teenagers in the late 90s.','1/23/2026',0.2399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4461524-3456469.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181272,'omnium gatherum 2026 repress|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|lp','Omnium Gatherum (2026 Repress) [Explicit Content]','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','LP','KGWP8704714.1','198704714931',28.0,28.0,'45913419','2026-11-10 23:54:58','2026-11-10 23:54:58','/19870471493','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Omnium Gatherum''s sprawling 16 tracks of gonzoid prog jams, dizzying pop nuggets, rubber-legged hip-hop odysseys and passages of pure thrash-metal abandon offer plenty for Gizzard fans and neophytes alike to chew on. Typically, Gizzard albums pursue a single theme or style - but part of the thrill of O.G. for the group was the opportunity to present new ideas without committing the entire album to just one. It''s both the perfect entry point for newcomers, and a solid treat for the faithful. 180g Cosmic Black double LP.','3/13/2026',1.540000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/4486733-3511704.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181273,'piss in the wind|joji|joji|lp','Piss In The Wind [Explicit Content]','Joji','Joji','LP','PCEK4742828.1','198704742828',19.85000000000000143,19.85000000000000143,'45632679','2026-11-10 23:54:58','2026-11-10 23:54:58','/19870474282','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Joji - P*** In The Wind - Vinyl Joji returns with the long-awaited 4th studio album via Palace Creek. The new LP cements his place as one of the most distinctive and genre-defying artists of his generation, balancing haunting melodies with gritty yet atmospheric production. The album captures the quiet contradictions that always defined his music, wrestling inner turmoil into something strangely beautiful. Features ΓÇ£PIXELATED KISSES,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Past WonΓÇÖt Leave My Bed,ΓÇ¥ and more.','2/6/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/46/4467446-3595246.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
