INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181329,'the outlaw cherie lee other western tales|shaboozey|shaboozey|cd','The Outlaw Cherie Lee & Other Western Tales [Explicit Content]','Shaboozey','Shaboozey','CD','ACDG1329.2','199316590999',7.089999999999999858,7.089999999999999858,'46205674','2026-11-10 23:55:01','2026-11-10 23:55:01','/19931659099','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Digipack Packaging)',0,'Shaboozey - The Outlaw Cherie Lee & Other Western Tales - CD The Outlaw Cherie Lee is a cinematic outlaw revenge story with a tragic love at it''s center. After watching her sheriff father murdered by the Bootcut Boys, Cherie Lee abandons the badge and hunts the gang down one by one. In the middle of her vengeance, she falls for one of the outlaws - not the killer, but guilty by association. He believes loving her can redeem him; she hopes loving him can quiet her darkness. They''re both wrong. When the real killer resurfaces, her lover kills him in her name, proving that violence doesn''t end - it evolves. In the final act, Cherie chooses blood over love, killing the man who loves her most and fully becoming what she set out to destroy.','7/31/2026',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/98/4512098-3588716.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181330,'the outlaw cherie lee other western tales|shaboozey|shaboozey|lp','The Outlaw Cherie Lee & Other Western Tales [Explicit Content]','Shaboozey','Shaboozey','LP','ACDG1330.1','199316590982',18.78999999999999915,18.78999999999999915,'46205681','2026-11-10 23:55:01','2026-11-10 23:55:01','/19931659098','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Shaboozey - The Outlaw Cherie Lee & Other Western Tales - Vinyl 2xLP The Outlaw Cherie Lee is a cinematic outlaw revenge story with a tragic love at it''s center. After watching her sheriff father murdered by the Bootcut Boys, Cherie Lee abandons the badge and hunts the gang down one by one. In the middle of her vengeance, she falls for one of the outlaws - not the killer, but guilty by association. He believes loving her can redeem him; she hopes loving him can quiet her darkness. They''re both wrong. When the real killer resurfaces, her lover kills him in her name, proving that violence doesn''t end - it evolves. In the final act, Cherie chooses blood over love, killing the man who loves her most and fully becoming what she set out to destroy.','7/31/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4512099-3588719.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181331,'king of memphis 10 yr anniversary royalty blue gold|young dolph|young dolph|lp','King of Memphis (10 Yr Anniversary) Royalty Blue/ Gold [Explicit Content]','Young Dolph','Young Dolph','LP','PPRT1251.1','199316503470',15.99000000000000021,15.99000000000000021,'46043528','2026-11-10 23:55:01','2026-11-10 23:55:01','/19931650347','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Gold, Limited Edition)',0,'Ten years ago, Adolph Robert Thornton Jr. Planted his flag. Released on February 19, 2016, King of Memphis wasn''t just a debut studio album; it was a bold declaration of independence and a flawless blueprint for self-made success. To celebrate a decade of this foundational Southern rap masterpiece, Paper Route Empire is honoring Young Dolph''s legacy with a series of exclusive, limited-edition 10th Anniversary vinyl variants. Before King of Memphis, Dolph had already built a massive underground following through a relentless run of mixtapes. But this official debut elevated him from a local hero to a national powerhouse. By bypassing the major label system and releasing the project entirely through his own Paper Route Empire (PRE), Dolph proved that undeniable talent, relentless hustle, and business savvy were all you needed to take the crown. The album peaked in the Top 50 of the Billboard 200, an incredible feat for a fiercely independent artist at the time, and cemented his status as a CEO who called his own shots. King of Memphis is all killer, no filler. Over 11 tracks, Dolph''s signature slow-flow delivery and larger-than-life charisma glide over heavy-hitting, trap-defining production from a legendary lineup of producers, including Mike WiLL Made-It, Zaytoven, TM88, and Cassius Jay. With zero guest features, the project relies entirely on Dolph''s magnetic presence. From the motivational hustler''s anthem "Get Paid" to the menacing confidence of "Let Me See It" and "Royalty, " the album plays like a victory lap for a self-made king. 1xLP, Pressed on Royalty Blue & Gold Galaxy Vinyl. Includes insert & housed in a gatefold jacket.','6/12/2026',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/94/4496994-3537161.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181332,'whimsy green gold|destin conrad|destin conrad|lp','Whimsy! - Green/ Gold [Explicit Content]','Destin Conrad','Destin Conrad','LP','AVEG1338.1','199316609714',23.78999999999999915,23.78999999999999915,'46279705','2026-11-10 23:55:01','2026-11-10 23:55:01','/19931660971','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl, Green, Gold, Deluxe Edition)',0,'1xLP, Transparent Emerald and Gold A Side B Side vinyl, housed in a gatefold jacket. With wHIMSY!, Destin Conrad undergoes a striking sonic metamorphosis, trading the polished, digital sheen of his earlier R&B for the raw, organic warmth of live instrumentation and alternative jazz. Recorded during an intensive two-week session in Los Angeles under the creative direction of Mr. E, the album captures the "whims" of intimacy through a lens that feels less like a studio product and more like a live set in a late-night lounge. By prioritizing space and improvisation over rigid structures, Destin positions himself as a maestro of emotion, navigating the messy, beautiful stages of a relationship with a newfound sense of vulnerability. The project''s brilliance lies in it''s seamless fusion of traditional jazz foundations with contemporary soul storytelling. This synergy is immediate on the opening track "wHIP," where Keyon Harrold''s trumpet engages in a sultry call-and-response with Destin''s vocals, a dynamic that carries through to the Terrace Martin-assisted "wASH U AWAY." Between these high-level collaborations, the album breathes through intentional moments of reflection, such as the spoken-word beauty of "GLORY a poem by Bay Davis" and the atmospheric "AMBR├ê''S INTERLUDE BUT JAZZ," ensuring the listener remains fully immersed in the record''s cinematic, noir-tinged atmosphere. The guest list on wHIMSY! Further solidifies it''s status as a high-art collective effort, featuring contributions that push Destin into new creative pockets. From the vocal interplay with Vanisha Gould on "BOREDOM" and "A Lonely Detective" to the harmonic mastery of James Fauntleroy and Astyn Turr on "The W," the album is populated by musical architects who understand the "whimsical" vision. Closing with the raw honesty of "HARD!" and the high-energy closure of "LALALALA," Destin Conrad proves he is more than an R&B singer-he is a world-builder who can romanticize the mundane until it feels like a classic film.','10/9/2026',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4515650-3598248.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181333,'live at glasshaus|bilal||lp','Live at Glasshaus','Bilal',NULL,'LP','GLSU20.1','19928459593',44.60999999999999944,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:01','2026-11-10 23:55:01','/bilal-live-at-glasshaus/19928459593',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181334,'heavy is the crown iex pink grey|anderson paak|anderson paak|lp','Heavy Is the Crown (IEX) Pink/ Grey [Explicit Content]','Anderson Paak','Anderson Paak','LP','ATHI1366IEX.1','199316735253',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'46532763','2026-11-10 23:55:02','2026-11-10 23:55:02','/19931673525','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Pink, Gray)',0,'Nine-time GRAMMY┬« winner Anderson.Paak and GRAMMY┬«-nominated rapper Cordae have been operating on the same wavelength for years. What started as pure chemical reaction on 2019''s "RNP" slowly turned into one of hip-hop''s most natural, low-ego partnerships, fueled by back-and-forth gems like "Two Tens" and "Summer Drop" and a series of dynamic TV performances that felt more like two best friends hanging out than a polished routine. On their debut collaborative album, Heavy Is The Crown, that organic bond gets the full-length treatment it''s always deserved. At it''s core, the project is a tightrope walk between serious real-life stakes and uncompromising fun. The title isn''t just bravado-it speaks directly to the shared weight both artists carry as the primary providers and anchors for their families. But instead of letting that pressure crush the vibe,.Paak and Cordae lean into each other. Meeting as total equals,.Paak''s elastic, soul-drenched musicality anchors Cordae''s razor-sharp lyricism, allowing both to unpack the heavy reality of success and family responsibility without ever losing their spark. That balance is what makes the album tick. To drive the point home, the album art pays homage to the cult comedy Step Brothers-a nod to the silly, irreverent friendship that birthed the music in the first place. Heavy Is The Crown doesn''t feel like a forced corporate crossover or a calculated career move. It''s a record about brotherhood, family, and what happens when two masters of their craft step into the studio simply because nobody makes them laugh, rap, or create quite like the other. Indie Retail Exclusive Variant. Limited to 3000','10/23/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4536785-3695756.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181335,'whatchu bringing iex|dinner party|dinner party|lp','Whatchu Bringing? (IEX)','Dinner Party','Dinner Party','LP','SOCW1395.1','199316696271',17.5,17.5,'46458414','2026-11-10 23:55:02','2026-11-10 23:55:02','/19931669627','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Limited Edition)',0,'Since forming in 2020, Dinner Party has continued to erase the lines between jazz, soul, and hip-hop, building a discography celebrated for it''s warmth, musicianship, and effortless chemistry. Following their Grammy-nominated 2020 self-titled debut, the Dinner Party: Dessert reimagining, and 2023''s Enigmatic Society, Whatchu Bringing? finds the group as locked-in as ever - trading the same easy, in-the-room feel that has made them one of the most beloved collectives in modern music. Whatchu Bringing? arrives on the heels of a pair of 2026 Grammy nominations for Dinner Party co-founder Terrace Martin. Martin''s collaborative album with Kenyon Dixon, Come As You Are, was nominated for Best Progressive R&B Album, while it''s single "WeMaj" (feat. Rapsody) earned a nod for Best Melodic Rap Performance at the 68th Annual Grammy Awards. The nominations arrived in the middle of an especially prolific run for Martin, who spent early 2026 rolling out his ambitious four-part album series - Passion, Peace, Purpose, and Perspective - building toward the full-length Love Is Louder Than Algorithms. Whatchu Bringing? marks his next chapter, bringing that same restless creative energy back to Dinner Party. With Whatchu Bringing?, Dinner Party continues a run defined by joy, community, and genre-defying collaboration - an invitation, as always, to pull up a chair. 1xLP, Canary Yellow Vinyl, 12x12 Insert. Indie Retail Exclusive','10/30/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4530544-3674148.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
