INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181407,'heated rivalry original soundtrack|heated rivalry o s t|heated rivalry o s t|lp','Heated Rivalry (Original Soundtrack)','HEATED RIVALRY / O.S.T.','HEATED RIVALRY / O.S.T.','LP','MIL843999.1','199584399911',37.34000000000000342,37.34000000000000342,'46132765','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958439991','(Deluxe Edition, Trading Cards, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Red)',0,'HEATED RIVALRY / O.S.T. Whether you''re cheering for Montreal or Boston, Hollanov always comes out on top. Relive every beat of Shane and Ilya''s yearslong rivalry-turned-romance with the official Heated Rivalry soundtrack on vinyl, featuring a curated selection of needle-drops from the series by Wolf Parade, Feist, t.A.T.u, Harrison and more, alongside selections from Peter Peter''s pulse-pounding, heart-melting original score, from the Vegas penthouse all the way to the cottage. Pressed on two striking block-colored discs (Montreal Metros Blue/Red and Boston Raiders Black/Yellow), the deluxe gatefold edition includes printed sleeves, two trading cards, a foldout poster, and liner notes by show creator Jacob Tierney. Please note that there may be slight variations in the final LP color from the image shown, particularly in the exact ratios and where the colors meet. Each LP is individually pressed, so this is to be expected. MILAN RECORDS','7/10/2026',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4505373-3565151.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181408,'out of the blue|elo electric light orchestra|elo electric light orchestra|lp','Out Of The Blue','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','LP','SNYL843851.1','199584385112',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'46158406','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958438511','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. Written and produced by Jeff Lynne, Out of the Blue is ELO''s bestselling album. Certified platinum in both the US and UK and featuring the worldwide hit singles "Mr. Blue Sky," "Turn To Stone" and "Sweet Talkin Woman."','5/29/2026',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4507942-3599057.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181409,'midnight sun|zara larsson|zara larsson|lp','Midnight Sun','Zara Larsson','Zara Larsson','LP','EPIC844015.1','199584401515',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'46100344','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958440151',NULL,0,'Multi-platinum chart-topping global pop powerhouse Zara Larsson kicks her boldest era yet into overdrive with her heavily anticipated new album Midnight Sun. Created with frequent collaborator MNEK, alongside producer Margo XS and songwriter Helena Gao, this album is her best work to-date. It''s storytelling bursts with truth and vulnerability, plumbing the depth and growth of Zara''s artistry and journey over nearly 20 years in the public eye. It''s an album unafraid to show all sides of the 27-year-old: lovestruck, wistful, ambitious, cocky, flippant, and uncertain, often in the same breath.','6/5/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/4502325-3603111.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181410,'don t tap the glass|tyler the creator|tyler the creator|lp','Don''t Tap The Glass [Explicit Content]','Tyler, The Creator','Tyler, The Creator','LP','CLBI844002.1','199584400211',33.71000000000000085,33.71000000000000085,'46459374','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958440021','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',0,'Tyler, The Creator - Don''t Tap The Glass - Vinyl DON''T TAP THE GLASS (PA) (140g Vinyl/ Translucent Clear Vinyl/ Includes 2 Posters) (Non-Returnable) Official Don''T Tap The Glass Lp Pressing. Printed Gatefold Jacket, Translucent Clear Single Lp, And Two Posters Housed In A Clear Plastic O-Card. Interchange Posters To Create Multiple Background Colors.','7/24/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4530912-3680839.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181411,'stay gold|first aid kit|first aid kit|lp','Stay Gold','First Aid Kit','First Aid Kit','LP','SNYL843889.1','199584388915',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'46431882','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958438891','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'First Aid Kit''s Columbia Records debut, Stay Gold. The Swedish duo sisters Klara and Johanna Soderberg have honed their lush arrangements and blossomed as vivid storytellers in creating this ambitious 10-song collection of originals. Recorded at ARC studios in Omaha and produced by Mike Mogis (Bright Eyes, Monsters of Folk), the duo also enlisted the Omaha Symphony Orchestra to play on the record, with arrangements by Nate Walcott (Bright Eyes, Broken Bells, Rilo Kiley). Hailing from a southern suburb of Stockholm, Klara and Johanna began composing songs as teenagers in 2007. Their heart-wrenching song ''Emmylou'' off the Lion''s Roar was chosen by Rolling Stone as a Single of the Year'' in 2012.','8/21/2026',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4528082-3686768.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181412,'greatest hits|earth wind fire|earth wind fire|lp','Greatest Hits','Earth Wind & Fire','Earth Wind & Fire','LP','SNYL844120.1','199584412016',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46186539','2026-11-10 23:55:06','2026-11-10 23:55:06','/19958441201',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. During the 1970s a new brand of pop music was born and created by Earth, Wind & Fire - music that was steeped in African and African American styles - particularly jazz and R&B but appealing to a broader cross-section of the listening public. Rock and Roll Hall of Fame inductees Earth, Wind & Fire have notched seven Top 10 hits on the Hot 100, topped the Hot R&B/Hip-Hop Song chart eight times, and sold more than 90 million records worldwide. Greatest Hits features all the hits from one of music''s best-selling bands with certified classics such as "September," "Let''s Groove," "Boogie Wonderland," "After the Love Has Gone," "Fantasy," and "Shining Star."','6/5/2026',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4510639-3603202.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
