INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181435,'stray dogs|nothing but thieves|nothing but thieves|lp','Stray Dogs','Nothing But Thieves','Nothing But Thieves','LP','SIUK453511.1','199584535111',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'46324955','2026-11-10 23:55:07','2026-11-10 23:55:07','/19958453511','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Pink)',0,'Nothing But Thieves - Stray Dogs / Marking a decade of Nothing But Thieves last year, with four albums, billions of streams, thousands of worldwide live shows and a global dedicated fanbase, the Southend five-piece make their musical return today and launch their next chapter with euphoric new single ''Evolution'' out now via RCA/Sony Music.','9/25/2026',0.8699999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4518861-3608664.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
