INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181443,'meddle|pink floyd|pink floyd|lp','Meddle','Pink Floyd','Pink Floyd','LP','SNYL846114.1','199584611419',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'46608291','2026-11-10 23:55:07','2026-11-10 23:55:07','/19958461141','(Indie Exclusive)',0,'Pink Floyd''s 1971 album Meddle returns on San Tropez Orange Marble vinyl as a limited-edition release. The band''s sixth studio album includes "One of These Days," "A Pillow of Winds," "Fearless," "San Tropez," "Seamus," and "Echoes." Originally produced between touring commitments, Meddle marked a notable progression in the band''s development.','11/13/2026',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/18/4543718-3719606.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181444,'pearl|janis joplin|janis joplin|lp','Pearl','Janis Joplin','Janis Joplin','LP','SNYL846110.1','199584611013',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'46606822','2026-11-10 23:55:07','2026-11-10 23:55:07','/19958461101','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Pink, Splatter)',0,'Pearl is Janis'' second and final solo studio album, released posthumously on January 11, 1971. Recorded in the summer of 1970, it showcases her powerful vocals and emotional range, backed by the Full Tilt Boogie Band. Pressed on Pink Splatter vinyl this limited edition vinyl includes all the iconic tracks such as "Me and Bobby McGee, " "Mercedes Benz, " "Cry Baby, " and "Move Over." Pearl stands as a testament to Janis'' enduring influence on rock music and continues to resonate with audiences as a timeless classic, listed as one of the greatest albums of all time by Rolling Stone.','11/13/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4543567-3719624.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181445,'angel|lizzy mcalpine|lizzy mcalpine|cd','Angel','Lizzy McAlpine','Lizzy McAlpine','CD','RCA846469.2','199584646923',11.58999999999999986,11.58999999999999986,'46463906','2026-11-10 23:55:07','2026-11-10 23:55:07','/19958464692','(Booklet)',0,'Lizzy McAlpine returns with Angel, an intimate and emotionally resonant collection of songs that highlight her distinctive voice and heartfelt storytelling. Blending folk-pop sensibilities with lush arrangements, the album explores themes of love, growth, and self-discovery.','9/18/2026',0.2200000000000000011,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/4530748-3709200.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181446,'thriller|michael jackson|michael jackson|lp','Thriller','Michael Jackson','Michael Jackson','LP','SNYL846112.1','199584611211',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'46429612','2026-11-10 23:55:07','2026-11-10 23:55:07','/19958461121','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Black, Marble)',0,'Michael Jackson - Thriller - Vinyl Red and Black Marble Vinyl LP For the first time ever, Michael JacksonΓÇÖs Thriller is available on Red & Black Marble vinyl, celebrating the worldΓÇÖs biggest-selling album and the first album to be certified triple Diamond by the RIAA. Released in 1982, Thriller changed pop music forever, featuring seven U.S. Top 10 hits including ΓÇ£Billie Jean,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Beat ItΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£Thriller,ΓÇ¥ and helped Michael win a record-setting eight Grammy Awards in one night.','10/30/2026',0.05999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4527842-3666976.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
