INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181455,'graceless|suicide silence|suicide silence|lp','Graceless','Suicide Silence','Suicide Silence','LP','CEN747741.1','199584747415',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'46592804','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958474741','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Tan)',0,'SUICIDE SILENCE helped drag deathcore from garages, message boards, and sweat-soaked rooms into the modern extreme metal bloodstream. Suicide Silence return to peak form with "Graceless," an album that embraces the band''s early MySpace-era deathcore roots while sounding unmistakably fresh and contemporary. Seasoned but unsoftened, SUICIDE SILENCE remains vicious and instinctive. They''ve survived grief, reinvention, backlash, and mythmaking without mistaking endurance for safety. "Graceless" is the circle closing with sharpened teeth, and the sound of deathcore''s most recognizable survivors hungry for fresh conquest.','11/20/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4542276-3717119.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181456,'it is finished|nina simone|nina simone|lp','It Is Finished','Nina Simone','Nina Simone','LP','SNYL846882.1','199584688213',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'46608352','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958468821','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Filled with brilliant cover versions, as it''s title suggests Simone''s 1974 album marked the end of an era: her militant activism had largely concluded, it was her final album for RCA, and she bid farewell to the US as she moved to Barbados. A blend of live and studio performances, it is sought-after for her powerful rendition of Tina Turner''s ''Funkier Than A Mosquito''s Tweeter'', as well as takes on ''Mr Bojangles'', Steppenwolf''s ''The Pusher'', and the 1930s blues classic ''I Want a Little Sugar in My Bowl''. This limited-edition LP is pressed on sunhat yellow color vinyl.','11/13/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4543723-3719626.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181457,'lucro sucio unfinished business|the mars volta|the mars volta|lp','Lucro Sucio; Unfinished Business','The Mars Volta','The Mars Volta','LP','INOM471031.1','199584710310',26.9200000000000017,26.9200000000000017,'46413703','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958471031','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Lucro Sucio; Unfinished Business The Mars Volta "Lucro Sucio; Unfinished Business" is The Mars Volta''s first official live album since 2005''s Scabdates, released on Inside Out Music under Sony Music''s progressive rock label. It documents their Fall 2025 North American tour, which supported their 2025 studio album Lucro Sucio; Los Ojos del Vac├¡o.','11/20/2026',0.9200000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4526383-3650924.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181458,'classic christmas various artists|various artists|various artists|lp','Classic Christmas (Various Artists)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','SNYL846296.1','199584629612',16.48000000000000042,16.48000000000000042,'46463104','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958462961','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Classic Christmas celebrates captures the timeless magic of the holidays with performances from Darlene Love, Eartha Kitt, Elvis Presley, and more on Vintage Ornament Red vinyl. Packed with seasonal favorites and timeless charm, it''s the perfect record to fill your home with Christmas spirit year after year.','10/2/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4530684-3684312.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181459,'stardust|willie nelson|willie nelson|lp','Stardust','Willie Nelson','Willie Nelson','LP','SNYL846626.1','199584662619',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'46455147','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958466261','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Stardust is Willie Nelson''s best-selling album and was a sensation when it was released in 1978, confounding the industry. Produced by Booker T. Jones, the album collects Willie''s indelible take on 10 classics from the American Songbook, two of which became hits on the country charts, while the album stayed on the Billboard Album charts for a decade. Included are classics like "Blue Skies," "All Of Me," the title track and Willie''s Grammy winning take on "Georgia On My Mind."','8/28/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4530242-3676410.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181460,'christmas peace|elvis presley|elvis presley|lp','Christmas Peace','Elvis Presley','Elvis Presley','LP','SNYL847121.1','199584712116',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'46541505','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958471211',NULL,0,'A seasonal collection pairing Elvis Presley''s beloved holiday recordings with timeless messages of comfort and joy.','10/23/2026',0.8699999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4537536-3734226.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181461,'hungover|ella langley|ella langley|lp','hungover','Ella Langley','Ella Langley','LP','CLBI847071.1','199584707112',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46568816','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958470711','(Colored Vinyl, Red, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Ella Langley - hungover - Vinyl hungover is the debut album from rising country music maverick Ella Langley. SheΓÇÖs an Alabama-born singer/songwriter with a rafter-reaching voice that pulls no punches when it comes to writing about life, love, and everything else under the sun. Spiking her unfiltered true stories with unapologetic rock ΓÇÿnΓÇÖ roll grit and unassuming pop appeal, sheΓÇÖs quietly emerged as a phenomenon with millions of streams and a growing fan base. The album, which was recorded in Nashville, Tennessee and produced by Will Bundy, features 14 new songs (including hit single ΓÇ£you look like you love me (feat. Riley Green),ΓÇ¥ΓÇ£nicotine,ΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£paint the town blueΓÇ¥). Available exclusively on vinyl, the record is topped off with a very special monologue poem written by Langley and her mother, Heather.','10/9/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4539959-3707468.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181462,'deb tirar m s fotos|bad bunny|bad bunny|lp','DEB├ì TIRAR M├üS FOTOS','Bad Bunny','Bad Bunny','LP','BBNY9.1','199806106600',26.9200000000000017,26.9200000000000017,'45664793','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19980610660','(Colored Vinyl, White, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Bad Bunny "Debi Tirar Mas Fotos" Double Opaque vinyl. This is being pressed on a new color, Double Opaque Vinyl. The interior art on the gatefold jacket is new and exclusive to this pressing. Deb├¡ Tirar M├ís Fotos is the sixth solo studio album (seventh overall) by Puerto Rican rapper and singer Bad Bunny.   A reggaeton and house record that heavily blends together diverse elements of traditional Puerto Rican music that Bad Bunny listened to when growing up, including plena, j├¡baro, salsa, and bomba. BAD BUNNY / DEBI TIRAR MAS FOTOS','2/6/2026',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4470616-3595261.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181463,'unplugged|alice in chains|alice in chains|lp','Unplugged','Alice in Chains','Alice in Chains','LP','SNYL847312.1','199584731216',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'46478023','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958473121',NULL,0,'Alice in Chains / UNPLUGGED - Originally recorded in 1996, Alice in Chains MTV Unplugged captures one of the most powerful and intimate performances of the era. The set showcases Alice in Chains'' signature blend of haunting melodies, acoustic arrangements, and raw emotional depth. Recorded at Brooklyn Academy of Music in NYC, the performance finds the band reimagining fan favorites including "Nutshell," "Down in a Hole," "Rooster," "Would?," and "Brother" in a stripped-back setting that highlights the strength of their songwriting and harmonies. SONY LEGACY','9/25/2026',0.9000000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4532112-3701115.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181464,'bare|annie lennox|annie lennox|lp','Bare','Annie Lennox','Annie Lennox','LP','SNYL846191.1','199584619118',18.67000000000000171,18.67000000000000171,'46608369','2026-11-10 23:55:09','2026-11-10 23:55:09','/19958461911','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Bare is Annie''s third solo album, for which she wrote all the songs and received a Grammy nomination in the Best Pop Vocal category. First issued in June 2003, achieving a Top 5 chart placement and gold certification in both the UK and the US, as well as going Top 20 in a dozen other countries, it has never been commercially released on vinyl before. This limited-edition LP is pressed on white vinyl.','11/13/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4543721-3719627.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181465,'toxicity|system of a down|system of a down|lp','Toxicity','System of a Down','System of a Down','LP','SNYL847993.1','199584799315',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'46579201','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19958479931','(With Bonus 7-Inch Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Red, Anniversary Edition, Poster)',0,'Limited 25th Anniversary red marbled vinyl LP pressing Includes bonus 7" single with etched B-side plus poster. A ferocious blend of alternative metal, punk energy, Armenian musical influences, and sharp political commentary, Toxicity features some of System of a Down''s defining songs while balancing explosive aggression with unexpected melody.','11/20/2026',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4540944-3713674.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181466,'operation irie|pepper|pepper|lp','Operation Irie','Pepper','Pepper','LP','LA103.1','199806351666',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'45964817','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980635166','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'STOCK LIMITED TO ON HAND. Pepper and LAW Records present Operation Irie, a compilation record featuring 17 different artists covering punk songs from the 90s and 2000s in a reggae rock style. LAW Records is pleased to present the first ever pressing of the record on vinyl to Record Store Day with it''s own exclusive RSD Opaque White exclusive variant and 3 month physical exclusivity window.','4/18/2026',0.8499999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4490731-3521966.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181467,'happiness anytime|leon bridges|leon bridges|lp','Happiness Anytime','Leon Bridges','Leon Bridges','LP','CLBI847379.1','199584737911',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46444004','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19958473791','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Leon Bridges presents ''Happiness Anytime,'' his highly-anticipated fifth studio album produced by J. Lloyd and Lydia Kitto of Jungle. The album''s title serves as both a mission statement and an invitation. It''s music you can put on no matter how you''re feeling and be immediately transported somewhere coastal and warm. In crafting the album, Leon Bridges focused on feeling, storytelling, and his vocal performance. Lydia Kitto brought melodic intuition and harmonic detail, and J. Lloyd shaped the production, arrangements, and sonic structure. The result is an album that feels unusually cohesive, like three musicians discovering a shared vision, drawing inspiration from Fela Kuti''s Afrobeat, Brazilian music, soul, disco, and South American rhythms.','9/25/2026',0.4000000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4529197-3691290.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181468,'cabin in the sky|de la soul|de la soul|lp','Cabin In The Sky','De La Soul','De La Soul','LP','MSAL185A.1','199806315040',24.73000000000000042,24.73000000000000042,'45721328','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980631504','(Colored Vinyl, Light Blue, Alternate Cover)',0,'DE LA SOUL - CABIN IN THE SKY (Opaque sky blue vinyl) de la Soul returns with Cabin in The Sky, a deeply personal and emotionally charged album. More than just a collection of songs, this project serves as a journey through reflection, love, and healing, a space where pain transforms into art, and remembrance turns into rhythm. Cabin in The Sky is set to release on November 21. The album honors the legacy of Dave "Trugoy the Dove" Jolicoeur, and extends that tribute to all loved ones lost along the way. Through reflective lyricism, soulful samples, and the unmistakable de la groove, Cabin in The Sky captures the beauty and the heartbreak of carrying on.','1/23/2026',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4473843-3522040.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181469,'light years|nas|nas|lp','Light-Years','Nas','Nas','LP','NADJ186.1','199806387177',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45741999','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980638717','(Indie Exclusive)',0,'Nas and DJ Premier are releasing their highly-anticipated and long awaited album Dec 12th. The first edition of physical products is strictly for the Day 1 Fans and Indie Retail. 12" Vinyl','12/12/2025',0.910000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/15/4475615-3497973.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181470,'angel maiden fair vinyl indie exclusive opaque cream white|lizzy mcalpine|lizzy mcalpine|lp','Angel ΓÇö Maiden Fair Vinyl [Indie Exclusive] (Opaque Cream White)','Lizzy McAlpine','Lizzy McAlpine','LP','RCA847575.1','199584757513',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'46463890','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19958475751','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Cream, Poster)',0,'Angel - Maiden Fair Vinyl [Indie Exclusive] (Opaque Cream White) Lizzy McAlpine album "Angel" is described as "a clear sonic expansion" for McAlpine, with influences drawing from "classic" and "contemporary inspirations, from ''70s Laurel Canyon folk to rich 21st-century indie". Undergoing "profound self-discovery", Angel chronicles McAlpine''s "return to self through the themes of love, heartbreak and the endurance of community and friendship".','9/18/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4530749-3709198.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181471,'light years|nas|nas|lp','Light-Years','Nas','Nas','LP','NADJ186C.1','199806972656',25.46000000000000085,25.46000000000000085,'46137487','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980697265','(Colored Vinyl, Marble)',0,'On their long-awaited full-length collaboration, the ''90s rap legends keep their gaze focused squarely on the rear-view mirror. It''s unabashed nostalgia bait with flashes of vintage brilliance, and a solid effort that favors grit over the polished sound of Nas''s previous Hit-Boy collaborations, highlighting lyrical maturity over modern trend-chasing.','6/12/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/4505806-3594652.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181472,'rush|rush|rush|lp','Rush','Rush','Rush','LP','MRY233714.1','199957091060',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45929533','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19995709106','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Rush - "Rush" [180g LP] The 1974 debut album that started the 50-year-plus iconic career of Rush, featuring John Rutsey on drums. Island Records; Mercury; Rock; Catalog. 180g vinyl.','2/27/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4486013-3520050.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181473,'thy will be done|uicideboy|uicideboy|lp','Thy Will Be Done [Explicit Content]','$Uicideboy$','$Uicideboy$','LP','GFVN59001.1','199806713143',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'45899928','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980671314','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The 10-track album blends the duo''s signature hard-hitting, gritty sound with deeply personal reflections on life before and after sobriety, before and after finding God, and the ongoing tension between fame, money, and family. The focus track "BLOODSWEAT" anchors the project with brutal honesty and intensity, and will be accompanied by an official music video following the album''s release.','3/6/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4485683-3512602.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181474,'supreme clientele 2|ghostface killah|ghostface killah|lp','Supreme Clientele 2','Ghostface Killah','Ghostface Killah','LP','MSAL179B.1','199806990179',25.46000000000000085,25.46000000000000085,'46206138','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980699017',NULL,0,'Double blue and green swirl vinyl LP pressing. Variant cover. Includes stickers.','6/12/2026',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4512180-3594656.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181475,'show your bones|yeah yeah yeahs|yeah yeah yeahs|lp','Show Your Bones','Yeah Yeah Yeahs','Yeah Yeah Yeahs','LP','ICPE710621.1','199957106214',23.03999999999999915,23.03999999999999915,'45768439','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19995710621','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Yellow, Purple)',0,'Celebrating 20 years of Show Your Bones, the album has been selected as an Indie title and is newly pressed on Magenta, Yellow & Purple vinyl in similar effect as the cover art.','6/19/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4478157-3547884.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181476,'this music may contain hope|raye|raye|lp','This Music May Contain Hope','Raye','Raye','LP','HUSC2.1','199806975534',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'45950520','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980697553','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Mint Green)',0,'"Four-time GRAMMY Award-nominated global superstar Raye, is releasing her highly anticipated sophomore album THIS MUSIC MAY CONTAIN HOPE. The album, set in 4 "seasons" with each side of the vinyl being a different season, takes listeners on a sonic journey that begins with darkness and ends with light. ''Music is medicine. I''ve always said that, and I guess I''m in the process of making medicine for myself that I can share with the world. I want us all to say to ourselves that it''s going to be all right, and I''m going to have faith in the seeds that I''ve planted beneath the snow. I wanted to create something that is a hug or bed or soft place for that person who needs it.''" - Human Re Sources','3/27/2026',1.25,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4489682-3520515.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181477,'the night in question french exit outtakes|tv girl|tv girl|lp','The Night in Question: French Exit Outtakes','TV Girl','TV Girl','LP','BUFY61067.1','199874610672',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'45978456','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19987461067','(RSD Exclusive, Booklet)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. The Night in Question: French Exit Outtakes. A collection of unfinished songs considered and abandoned during the legendary "French Exit" sessions. Lightly mastered but mostly presented to you here in their unfinished "demo-esque" state.','4/18/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181478,'campfire punkrock 20 transparent yellow|frank turner|frank turner|lp','Campfire Punkrock 20  (Transparent Yellow)','Frank Turner','Frank Turner','LP','XTM203A.1','199806988213',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'46039149','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19980698821','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Celebrating 20 years of Frank Turner''s solo debut EP ''Campfire Punkrock'', Xtra Mile Recordings are excited to release a special anniversary extended edition of the seminal release. Featuring the original EP with two added songs (The Real Damage and The Ballad Of Me & My Friends, both of which were included on the US version in 2007), plus 7 further live tracks recorded from Frank''s 50th solo gig in London 2006 - taking listeners right back to where it all began at the very early days of Frank''s incredible solo career. The 12" LP features new reworked artwork with shiny gold campfire on matt black cover plus coloured vinyl. The original EP was recorded by Frank''s guitarist Ben Lloyd at the Oxford home of Turner''s bass player Tarrant Anderson and mixed by Tristan Ivemy. If features fan favourites ''Nashville Tennessee'', ''The Real Damage'' and ''Ballad Of Me And My Friends''. Throughout April, Frank will tour UK performing tracks from Campfire Punkrock and the early years of his solo career. All dates are sold out including two nights at London''s Scala.','6/26/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/4496558-3556114.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181479,'live at the paradise rock club 1978|tom petty the heartbreakers|tom petty the heartbreakers|lp','Live At The Paradise Rock Club, 1978','Tom Petty & the Heartbreakers','Tom Petty & the Heartbreakers','LP','ISC235364.1','199957003117',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'45991073','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19995700311','(RSD Exclusive, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. A wild night from the You''re Gonna Get It tour was recorded on 2-track at the Paradise Rock Club in Boston, MA, and broadcast by local rock radio station WBCN-FM. Bootleg recordings of the broadcast have been a fan favorite for decades. Now the Tom Petty Estate is making this concert officially available. The audio restoration was done by Tom Petty producer Ryan Ulyate. The show features 9 performances, including 5 classic cover versions. The LP is on 180g pink and green translucent splatter color vinyl and contains a vintage tour sticky pass.','4/18/2026',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/08/4492708-3561610.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181480,'icon|brent faiyaz|brent faiyaz|lp','Icon','Brent Faiyaz','Brent Faiyaz','LP','ISOS25.1','199826959590',21.82000000000000028,21.82000000000000028,'46023254','2026-11-10 23:55:10','2026-11-10 23:55:10','/19982695959',NULL,0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. Icon is a statement record-reflective, refined, and resonant-cementing Brent Faiyaz''s place as one of the most influential voices in modern R&B. Executive produced by the legendary Raphael Saadiq, the album blends classic soul foundations with forward-thinking R&B, brought to life through additional production from Benny Blanco, Chad Hugo, and Tommy Richman. The result is a richly layered and timeless soundscape that feels both intimate and cinematic. The album is mastered by Mike Dean, adding depth, warmth, and clarity to a project designed to be experienced front to back.','4/3/2026',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4495172-3533419.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181481,'sin miedo del amor y otros demonios|kali uchis|kali uchis|lp','Sin Miedo (del Amor y Otros Demonios) [Explicit Content]','Kali Uchis','Kali Uchis','LP','CAP240372.1','199957107495',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'45942150','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995710749','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Anniversary Edition)',0,'On Kali Uchis'' second studio album, Sin Miedo (del Amor y Otros Demonios) 8, Kali brings her artistic vision to life with gorgeous melodies, lush production and unparalleled storytelling. As her first Latin studio album with crossover hits like "telapat?a" and "fue major," this album solidified Kali as one of the most important and versatile voices in modern music. In celebration of it''s five-year anniversary, a freshly pressed Cielo Swirl vinyl variant is now available.','4/3/2026',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4488769-3521344.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181482,'thy will be done|uicideboy|uicideboy|cd','Thy Will Be Done [Explicit Content]','$Uicideboy$','$Uicideboy$','CD','GFVN59001.2','199806705414',9.65000000000000035,9.65000000000000035,'45899911','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19980670541','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'2026 release. The 10-track album blends the duo''s signature hard-hitting, gritty sound with deeply personal reflections on life before and after sobriety, before and after finding God, and the ongoing tension between fame, money, and family. The focus track "BLOODSWEAT" anchors the project with brutal honesty and intensity, and will be accompanied by an official music video following the album''s release.','3/6/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4485684-3509466.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181483,'positiva presents elton john the remixes|elton john|elton john|lp','Positiva Presents: Elton John - The Remixes','Elton John','Elton John','LP','RPBL240634.1','199957115308',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45978388','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995711530','(Colored Vinyl, 180 Gram Vinyl, Glow in the Dark)',0,'Curated by Elton John and released through the iconic dance label, Positiva Records, this limited-edition unique collection highlights Elton''s remarkable remix archive. Featuring mixes by the Blessed Madonna, Purple Disco Machine, The 2 Bears, Claptone, Roger Sanchez and KDME. Pressed on 180g glow-in-the-dark vinyl and housed in the signature Positiva sleeve for Record Store Day.','4/18/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4492011-3562323.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181484,'long long road|ringo starr|ringo starr|lp','Long Long Road','Ringo Starr','Ringo Starr','LP','RGOS240166.1','199957008297',21.10000000000000143,21.10000000000000143,'46085054','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995700829',NULL,0,'Ringo Starr - Long Long Road - Vinyl Long Long Road, the brand-new album from Ringo Starr, was co-written and produced by T Bone Burnett with Daniel Tashian and Bruce Sugar. The 10-song album includes collaborations with Billy Strings, Sheryl Crow and St. Vincent and is the highly anticipated follow-up to 2025ΓÇÖs chart-topping Look Up. With solid roots in country, Long Long Road layers an easy Americana vibe alongside RingoΓÇÖs classic rock roots with songs about life''s many journeys and finding love along the way.','4/24/2026',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4498666-3544483.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181485,'if it weren t for venetian blinds it would be curtains for us all|piebald|piebald|lp','If It Weren''t For Venetian Blinds, It Would Be Curtains For Us All','Piebald','Piebald','LP','IODN82.1','199806505038',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'45898020','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19980650503','(Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Double blue and white colored vinyl LP pressing. Originally released by Big Wheel Recreation in 1999.','4/17/2026',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4485482-3509190.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181486,'the real folk blues chess acoustic sounds series|muddy waters|muddy waters|lp','The Real Folk Blues (Chess Acoustic Sounds Series)','Muddy Waters','Muddy Waters','LP','CHE239991.1','199957164375',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'46156402','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995716437','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Muddy Waters -"The Real Folk Blues (Chess Acoustic Sounds Series)" [180gram Heavy Vinyl LP] In the mid-1960s, Chess Records released a series of The Real Folk Blues albums that compiled singles from the careers of some of it''s greatest artists. Howlin'' Wolf''s The Real Folk Blues combined singles recorded between 1956 and 1965 and is considered one of the best compilations of the Chess series. The music on this record paints a daring portrait of Howlin'' Wolf, presenting exceptional music that had not been presented in album format before. Classics on this record include "Killing Floor," "Tail Dragger," and "Built for Comfort." Bring home the sound of America''s greatest blues label in high fidelity with the Chess Records Acoustic Sounds Series. These audiophile reissues of classic albums and compilations from the Chess discography are remastered from the original analog tapes and pressed on 180-gram vinyl at Quality Record Pressings (QRP). Each disc is packaged in tip-on gatefold sleeves printed on high-grade board.','5/22/2026',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/4507741-3606178.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181487,'kpop demon hunters soundtrack from the netflix film huntr x edition|various|various|lp','Kpop Demon Hunters (Soundtrack from the Netflix Film)[HUNTR/ X Edition]','Various','Various','LP','RPBL240636.1','199957134408',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'45991288','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995713440','(RSD Exclusive, Sticker / Stickers, Poster, Card)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. 1 LP special effect vinyl featuring original art cover by official KPop Demon Hunters vis dev artist, Marion Bordeyne. Includes fold-out poster, sticker sheet, and 3 snapshot cards (3 of 12 versions). Record Store Day Exclusive. KPop Demon Hunters (Soundtrack From the Netflix Film) has taken over the world as a true pop-culture phenomenon. The biggest soundtrack of 2025, it has topped the Billboard 200 at #1 and is certified RIAA Platinum. Leading the charge is "Golden," the #1 most-streamed release of 2025 globally, which dominated the Billboard Hot 100 for eight weeks-marking the longest #1 reign of the 21st century by a female group. Applauded by fans and critics alike, the film and soundtrack have received five GRAMMY nominations including Song of the Year, two Academy Award nominations including Original Song, three Golden Globe nominations including Best Original Song, and won two Critics Choice Awards, including Best Song for "Golden."','4/18/2026',0.7900000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4492860-3528513.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181488,'wicked one wonderful night live|ariana grande|ariana grande|lp','Wicked: One Wonderful Night (Live)','Ariana Grande','Ariana Grande','LP','RPBL240219.1','199957192316',36.85000000000000142,36.85000000000000142,'45978234','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995719231','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Splatter)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. 2 LP set on splatter color vinyl with unique cover art. Record Store Day Exclusive. Available for the first time on vinyl, Wicked: One Wonderful Night (Live) - The Soundtrack was recorded live at the iconic Dolby Theatre in Los Angeles for NBC''s spectacular television event, Wicked: One Wonderful Night. The album captures breathtaking performances from Wicked stars and Academy Award┬« nominees Cynthia Erivo and Ariana Grande, alongside Jeff Goldblum, Bowen Yang, Ethan Slater, Marissa Bode and more. The live recording - backed by a 37-piece orchestra led by the executive music producer of Wicked and Wicked: For Good, Tony award and two-time Grammy award winner Stephen Oremus - offers listeners a front-row seat to the event''s reimagined arrangements, sweeping emotion, and unforgettable moments from the world of Oz.','4/18/2026',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4491955-3563924.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181489,'touch gabriela tour arrangements acapella versions|katseye|katseye|lp','Touch /  Gabriela (Tour Arrangements & Acapella Versions)','Katseye','Katseye','LP','BGHM240324.1','199957139625',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45982200','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995713962','(RSD Exclusive, Extended Play, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. This vinyl EP unites two defining eras in Katseye''s evolution, featuring previously unreleased tour arrangements and acapella versions of their breakout tracks, "Touch" and "Gabriela." Pressed on a Katseye logo-etched, limited-edition pink and red reversable splatter 12" vinyl for Record Store Day.','4/18/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4492430-3561837.jpg?ae=4621895153','K-Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181490,'ascension edition i ii verve vault series|john coltrane|john coltrane|lp','Ascension: Edition I & II (Verve Vault Series)','John Coltrane','John Coltrane','LP','VRV241657.1','199957117982',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'46195890','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995711798','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Released on Impulse! Records in 1966, Ascension stands as one of Coltrane''s most radical and influential works. Subtitled "Edition I & II" to reflect the two complete takes recorded at the session, the piece is a nearly 40-minute large-ensemble performance marking his embrace of the avant-garde. Recorded on June 28, 1965 at Rudy Van Gelder''s Englewood Cliffs studio and produced by Bob Thiele, the session assembled an expanded ensemble of 11 musicians. Alongside Coltrane''s tenor sax are trumpeters Freddie Hubbard & Dewey Johnson; saxophonists Pharoah Sanders, Marion Brown, John Tchicai, & Archie Shepp; pianist McCoy Tyner; bassists Art Davis & Jimmy Garrison; and drummer Elvin Jones. Initially controversial for it''s intensity, Ascension is now recognized as a landmark of modern jazz and a defining statement of the emerging free-jazz movement. Presented together on 2-LP for the first time, the Verve Vault series is always mastered from analog tapes and pressed on 180g vinyl at Optimal.','6/19/2026',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4509240-3595711.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181491,'live at easy street records vol ii|brandi carlile|brandi carlile|lp','Live at Easy Street Records, Vol. II','Brandi Carlile','Brandi Carlile','LP','LHWY240191.1','199957182485',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45978319','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995718248','(RSD Exclusive, Extended Play)',0,'RESTOCK ARRIVING SOON! Nearly two decades after recording her first live album at Seattle''s Easy Street Records, Brandi Carlile returned to the iconic record store for Live at Easy Street Records, Vol. II. Celebrating her 8th studio album, Returning To Myself, the show marked a full-circle moment for the 11x Grammy Award-winner. Joined by The Hanseroth Twins and SistaStrings, Carlile played to a full house and was met with an outpouring of love from fans who celebrated her return to the city where it all began. Featuring 7 tracks on 12" vinyl.','4/18/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181492,'a special kiss tour|kiss|kiss|lp','A Special KISS Tour','Kiss','Kiss','LP','MRY239561.1','199957134507',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45982217','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995713450','(Extended Play, 45 RPM, Colored Vinyl, White, Black)',0,'RESTOCK ARRIVING SOON! After the massive success of Kiss''s fourth studio album Destroyer, the band embarked on a 1976 summer tour. Casablanca Records released as a promo-only 12" EP with the four singles from the Destroyer album entitled, A Special Kiss Tour Album. Now commercially available for the first-time ever and released for Record Store Day 2026. Enhanced with spot-gloss details on the jacket, the EP is cut at 45 RPM and pressed for the first-time on black & white splatter vinyl.','4/18/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4492450-3562727.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181493,'bad music for bad people|the cramps|the cramps|lp','Bad Music For Bad People','The Cramps','The Cramps','LP','CAOL713272.1','199957132725',23.03999999999999915,23.03999999999999915,'45768392','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995713272','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Bad Music For Bad People is a compilation of stand-out psychobilly rock songs by The Cramps, including "Goo Goo Muck" and "Human Fly." There is no other band quite like The Cramps. Formed in 1976 and led by the subversive "Mad Daddy," Lux Interior (vocals), and femme fatale, Poison Ivy (guitar), their blend of rockabilly, punk, horror, and straight-up rock & roll continues to influence people all around the world. The Cramps recently reached a whole new world of young rock revelers as Wednesday Addams danced to "Goo Goo Muck" in her hit show. Lady Gaga has also been seen wearing The Cramps shirts and singing along to "Human Fly."','3/27/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4478001-3547484.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181494,'middle of nowhere rodeo clown edition|kacey musgraves|kacey musgraves|lp','Middle of Nowhere [Rodeo Clown Edition] [Explicit Content]','Kacey Musgraves','Kacey Musgraves','LP','LHWY240649.1','199957220385',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46096463','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995722038','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Kacey Musgraves - Middle of Nowhere - Vinyl Rodeo Clown Edition LP Middle of Nowhere is the sixth studio album from eight-time Grammy Award-winner Kacey Musgraves and is made for two-stepping. The collection draws from a love of Texas dancehall classics, humorous takes on the human condition, and the space where traditional Country borders many sounds, including Norte├▒o and even Zydeco. Fresh yet familiar, and classically Kacey: honest, fearless, immersive, and always ready to wink at lifeΓÇÖs twists and turns. Available on rodeo clown mix-colored vinyl. Rodeo Clown Edition LP is pressed on mix-colored vinyl. Retail Exclusive.','5/1/2026',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4501995-3727511.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181495,'everybody s gotta learn sometime red lp|beck|beck|lp','EverybodyΓÇÖs Gotta Learn Sometime [Red LP]','Beck','Beck','LP','CAP239694.1','199957140102',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45969775','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995714010','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'A lovingly curated collection of rarities, deep cuts and cover versions by Beck on red vinyl. Featuring iconic tracks like "Everybody''s Gotta Learn Sometime" from the Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind soundtrack and a soulful rendition of "I Can''t Help Falling In Love," this is a beautifully crafted collection of songs to add to Beck''s iconic catalog of releases. Also features new recordings of "True Love Will Find You in the End" and "Your Cheatin'' Heart."','2/13/2026',0.4799999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4491193-3527084.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181496,'detroit|big sean|big sean|lp','Detroit','Big Sean','Big Sean','LP','GDMS240154.1','199957197854',32.25,32.25,'45978296','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995719785','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'RESTOCK ARRIVING SOON! Big Sean''s 2000 mixtape, Detroit, released for the first time on vinyl. Presented for Record Store Day on standard black 2-LP.','4/18/2026',0.910000000000000031,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181497,'gish|smashing pumpkins|smashing pumpkins|lp','Gish','Smashing Pumpkins','Smashing Pumpkins','LP','VGNR724432.1','199957244329',23.03999999999999915,23.03999999999999915,'46015952','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995724432','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gray, Pink, Purple)',0,'Smashing Pumpkins Gish (35th Anniversary Edition) 35th Anniversary Limited Edition 180g Gray with Pink & Purple Splatter Vinyl LP! Smashing Pumpkins'' Landmark Debut Album! The Smashing Pumpkins'' spiritual debut and one of the best rock albums of the 1990s. Featuring the singles "Siva," "I Am One" and "Rhinoceros," on exclusive gray with pink and purple splatter 180-gram color vinyl, with original 1991 packaging in celebration of it''s 35th anniversary.','5/29/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4494531-3531367.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181498,'red bird|luke grimes|luke grimes|lp','Red Bird','Luke Grimes','Luke Grimes','LP','MERN239821.1','199957226479',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46013880','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995722647','(Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Limited green vinyl LP pressing. 2026 release. Mercury Nashville presents Luke Grimes'' sophomore studio album, Red Bird.','4/3/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4494374-3551967.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181499,'hidden treasures|megadeth|megadeth|lp','Hidden Treasures','Megadeth','Megadeth','LP','CAP239849.1','199957236546',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45982293','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995723654','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Remastered, Alternate Cover)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. This is the 1st time availble on vinyl EP that features 8 tracks, with this RSD Edition to include 4 extra tracks that was exclusive to the Japanese Version. Making this entire now 12 track album full of Covers, Soundtrack hits and Demos. Made with an alternate cover from the original in a 1LP Color Remastered Vinyl.','4/18/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/35/4492435-3561786.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181500,'dont smile at me limited clear vinyl import|billie eilish|billie eilish|lp','Dont Smile At Me - Limited Clear Vinyl [Import]','Billie Eilish','Billie Eilish','LP','UNUK5723626.1','199957236263',30.05999999999999873,30.05999999999999873,'46157805','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995723626','(Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'The debut extended play by the American singer/songwriter which contains several of her previously released singles, including ''Ocean Eyes'', ''Bellyache'', ''Watch'', ''Copycat'' and ''Idontwannabeyouanymore''.','5/8/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4507882-3569776.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181501,'when we all fall asleep where do we go limited baby blue colored vinyl import|billie eilish|billie eilish|lp','When We All Fall Asleep Where Do We Go - Limited Baby Blue Colored Vinyl [Import]','Billie Eilish','Billie Eilish','LP','UNUK5723627.1','199957236270',30.05999999999999873,30.05999999999999873,'46157812','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995723627','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Blue, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Limited Baby Blue BioVinyl edition. "When We All Fall Asleep, Where Do We Go?" from 2019 was the first full-length studio album by global pop star Billie Eilish - written, produced, and recorded by the then only 17-year-old one-woman force, in collaboration with her brother Finneas, in their childhood home. Following an already successful EP in 2017, Don''t Smile At Me, this debut album became the release that turned Billie into a superstar. The album includes, among others, the mega-hit Bad Guy, which remains one of the biggest songs of Billie Eilish''s career.','5/8/2026',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4507883-3569777.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181502,'love love love|stephen sanchez|stephen sanchez|lp','LOVE, LOVE, LOVE','Stephen Sanchez','Stephen Sanchez','LP','MRY240170.1','199957255615',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46086419','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995725561','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Stephen Sanchez - LOVE, LOVE, LOVE - Vinyl The follow-up album to Stephen Sanchez''s debut album ANGEL FACE with the global smash, ΓÇ£Until I Found You,ΓÇ¥ is finally here ΓÇô LOVE, LOVE, LOVE! On the new record, Stephen muses about love in its many forms ΓÇô partners, friends, neighbors, and even strangers ΓÇô brought to life by rich vocals and a technicolor pop sound. The title track epitomizes the albumΓÇÖs themes, as Stephen proclaims the importance of showing love to others, even (and especially) when they may not be expressing the same.','5/8/2026',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4501031-3547790.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181503,'yeehaw sessions|kaitlin butts|kaitlin butts|lp','Yeehaw Sessions','Kaitlin Butts','Kaitlin Butts','LP','RPBL240500.1','199957275613',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45982194','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995727561','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'RESTOCK ARRIVING SOON! Yeehaw Sessions combines two of Kaitlin Butts'' EPs never-before released on vinyl.','4/18/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181504,'love love love|stephen sanchez|stephen sanchez|lp','Love Love Love','Stephen Sanchez','Stephen Sanchez','LP','MRY240172.1','199957263207',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46086372','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995726320','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'The follow-up album to Stephen Sanchez''s debut album ANGEL FACE with the global smash, "Until I Found You," is finally here - LOVE, LOVE, LOVE! On the new record, Stephen muses about love in it''s many forms - partners, friends, neighbors, and even strangers - brought to life by rich vocals and a technicolor pop sound. The title track epitomizes the album''s themes, as Stephen proclaims the importance of showing love to others.','5/8/2026',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4501014-3576050.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181505,'diamond seas|sonic youth|sonic youth|lp','Diamond Seas','Sonic Youth','Sonic Youth','LP','GEF239971.1','199957204477',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45984617','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995720447','(Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Sonic Youth have a song "The Diamond Sea" which is a 20-min+ recording on the WASHING MACHINE album and generally about that long or longer in their live performances. It''s very similar to the Grateful Dead''s "Dark Star" which the band explores improvisationally with loads of Sonic Youth noise and well loved by fans as a live perf. Sonic Youth have approached us on wanting to work with John Oswald, who is very interested, on making a similar new mix of "The Diamond Sea" from loads of live perfs of the song as a RSD release.','4/18/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4492665-3569616.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181506,'the tiberi tapes a preview of the mythic recordings|john coltrane|john coltrane|lp','The Tiberi Tapes: A Preview of the Mythic Recordings','John Coltrane','John Coltrane','LP','VRV240326.1','199957257138',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'45982170','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995725713','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'STOCK LIMITED TO ON HAND. Among the most fabled and mythologized recordings of the last 65 years, the private recordings of John Coltrane''s group made by musician Frank Tiberi in the early 1960s have long been the subject of jazz world rumor and intense speculation. Tiberi followed Coltrane and his Classic Quartet into clubs in New York and Philadelphia, capturing the otherworldly music being created nightly on his portable tape recorder. For the first time ever, these recordings will be made available in September 2026 as part of John Coltrane''s Centennial celebrations. For Record Store Day 2026, we''re offering a single LP preview of these historic recordings - a project that will undoubtedly grow and enhance the legend of John Coltrane.','4/18/2026',0.4400000000000000022,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4492463-3562755.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181507,'anti|rihanna|rihanna|lp','Anti','Rihanna','Rihanna','LP','RONT239994.1','199957263740',32.25,32.25,'46196163','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995726374','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,NULL,'1/5/2026',1.260000000000000008,'lbs','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181508,'ii lucifuge|danzig|danzig|lp','II: Lucifuge','Danzig','Danzig','LP','AMDG730052.1','199957300520',23.03999999999999915,23.03999999999999915,'45952845','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995730052','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Red)',0,'DANZIG / II: LUCIFUGE - With Lucifuge, Danzig expanded their sound, balancing thunderous heaviness with moody, soulful undertones. Songs like "Her Black Wings" and "Long Way Back From Hell" showcase the band''s evolving songwriting. LP package includes standard LP jacket, printed sleeves, and pressed on translucent ruby vinyl.','5/29/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4489916-3598445.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181509,'trip|jhen aiko|jhen aiko|lp','Trip','Jhen├⌐ Aiko','Jhen├⌐ Aiko','LP','DEF240359.1','199957203227',36.85000000000000142,36.85000000000000142,'45982156','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995720322','(RSD Exclusive, Picture Disc Vinyl)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Record Store Day exclusive 2-LP pressing of Jhen├⌐ Aiko''s 2017 sophomore album, The Trip, on picture disc vinyl for the first time ever.','4/18/2026',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181510,'same difference|swae lee|swae lee|lp','SAME DIFFERENCE [Explicit Content]','Swae Lee','Swae Lee','LP','EADU242839.1','199957294645',34.42999999999999972,34.42999999999999972,'46162663','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995729464','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Limited yellow vinyl LP pressing. With a fruitful career that includes multiple platinum albums as a group (Rae Sremmurd) and numerous diamond single certifications, SAME DIFFERENCE officially marks the release of Swae Lee''s long-awaited debut solo album! Comprised of 16 tracks, Swae''s versatile artistry taps into each of the sonic lanes he''s become renowned within - spanning hip hop, R&B, pop & even Afrobeat. Backed by features from Jhene Aiko, Rich The Kid, French Montana, FKA Twigs, Post Malone & brother/Rae Sremmurd counterpart Slim Jxmmi, the end result is an album that blurs genre lines while reaffirming Swae''s place at the center of modern music!','6/12/2026',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4508231-3607546.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181511,'flicker|niall horan|niall horan|lp','Flicker','Niall Horan','Niall Horan','LP','CAP240409.1','199957280556',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'45982354','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995728055','(RSD Exclusive)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Songs from Flicker performed with the RTE Concert Orchestra. Released to DSPs in 2018, never released on vinyl','4/18/2026',0.4500000000000000111,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181512,'smoke mirrors|imagine dragons|imagine dragons|lp','Smoke + Mirrors','Imagine Dragons','Imagine Dragons','LP','ISC240240.1','199957306188',32.25,32.25,'46043092','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995730618','(Deluxe Edition)',0,'Super deluxe double vinyl LP pressing featuring eight bonus tracks including "Monster", "Battle Cry" and "Warriors". 2015 release from Imagine Dragons. Written and produced by Imagine Dragons (with additional production by Alex da Kid), Smoke + Mirrors uses the frenetic energy of life on the road to infuse their music with both raw tension and intense vulnerability. As on their platinum selling debut, Night Visions, the Grammy-winning band works with sharply crafted beats and grooves to dream up rhythm-driven rock music that''s artful yet visceral. Also revealing the band''s dedication to keeping it homespun, Smoke + Mirrors marked the first release recorded in their new, self-built home studio in Las Vegas.','4/10/2026',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4496949-3556149.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181513,'the real folk blues chess acoustic sounds series|john lee hooker|john lee hooker|lp','The Real Folk Blues (Chess Acoustic Sounds Series)','John Lee Hooker','John Lee Hooker','LP','CHE240905.1','199957307116',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'46252739','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995730711','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'In the mid-1960s, Chess Records released a series of The Real Folk Blues albums that compiled singles from the careers of some of it''s greatest artists. John Lee Hooker''s The Real Folk Blues differed from many of the other compilations as it featured newly recorded sessions for the label. These legendary 1966 recordings capture the essence of his signature sound and approach to the blues. Standout tracks include "One Bourbon, One Scotch, One Beer," "Stella Mae" and "I''m In The Mood." Bring home the sound of America''s greatest blues label in high fidelity with the Chess Records Acoustic Sounds Series. These audiophile reissues of classic albums and compilations from the Chess discography are remastered from the original analog tapes and pressed on 180-gram vinyl at Quality Record Pressings (QRP). Each disc is packaged in tip-on gatefold sleeves printed on high-grade board.','6/19/2026',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4513222-3611397.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181514,'dream a little dream|mama cass|mama cass|lp','Dream A Little Dream','Mama Cass','Mama Cass','LP','GEF240444.1','199957311717',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'45982248','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995731171','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Violet)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Originally released in 1968, Dream a Little Dream marked Cass Elliot''s powerful emergence as a solo artist - an elegant, confident statement that positioned her not as a pop star chasing trends, but as a timeless vocal interpreter with unmistakable emotional authority. Eschewing psychedelia for sophistication, the album blends classic pop, soul, and introspective songwriting, foregrounding Elliot''s warmth, vulnerability, and command. This Record Store Day exclusive edition deepens the album''s legacy by including two tracks from the original sessions previously unreleased on vinyl: "Darling Be Home Soon" (by John Sebastian) and "Sisotowbell Lane" (by Joni Mitchell), offering fans and collectors a richer, more complete portrait of one of the era''s most distinctive and underappreciated voices. Pressed on violet color vinyl.','4/18/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181515,'age of the ram mesa white vinyl|charley crockett|charley crockett|lp','Age Of The Ram    (Mesa White Vinyl)','Charley Crockett','Charley Crockett','LP','ISL240351.1','199957300261',21.10000000000000143,21.10000000000000143,'46003652','2026-11-10 23:55:11','2026-11-10 23:55:11','/19995730026','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, White, Alternate Cover)',0,'CHARLEY CROCKETT / AGE OF THE RAM (MESA WHITE VINYL) Charley Crockett, the two-time GRAMMY-nominated artist is back with Age of the Ram, the third and final installment of the Sagebrush Trilogy, co-produced by Shooter Jennings. Featuring 20 new recordings, Age of the Ram is the culmination of Charley''s incredible sonic exploration, spanning three albums, resulting in Charley''s most realized and compelling work to date.','4/3/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4493826-3551672.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181516,'i was walking through the woods chess acoustic sounds series|buddy guy|buddy guy|lp','I Was Walking Through The Woods (Chess Acoustic Sounds Series)','Buddy Guy','Buddy Guy','LP','CHE240906.1','199957307123',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'46252722','2026-11-10 23:55:12','2026-11-10 23:55:12','/19995730712','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'I Was Walkin'' Through The Woods gathers Buddy Guy''s early recordings for Chess Records - all recorded in the early 1960s. This collection spotlights the searing guitar work that demonstrates why Guy was one of the most talented of Chicago''s new generation of blues musicians. Key tracks include "First Time I Met The Blues" and "I Found A True Love." Bring home the sound of America''s greatest blues label in high fidelity with the Chess Records Acoustic Sounds Series. These audiophile reissues of classic albums and compilations from the Chess discography are remastered from the original analog tapes and pressed on 180-gram vinyl at Quality Record Pressings (QRP). Each disc is packaged in tip-on gatefold sleeves printed on high-grade board.','6/19/2026',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4513223-3611398.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
