INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181559,'essential john coltrane|john coltrane|john coltrane|lp','Essential John Coltrane','John Coltrane','John Coltrane','LP','IMP243716.1','199957759366',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'46473677','2026-11-10 23:55:13','2026-11-10 23:55:13','/19995775936',NULL,0,'John Coltrane''s legacy defies boundaries. From his early days in Philadelphia to his final explorations into the musical unknown, Coltrane stretched music to new dimensions. He used the saxophone as a means of projecting his inner spirit into the world by masterfully harnessing jazz, the blues and pure soul in each performance. From tender ballads to volcanic live performances and meditative suites, each track in this collection works to create a portrait of musical genius. Coltrane''s artistry reminds us that music goes far beyond the page - the sounds he created will keep us listening, feeling and marveling for generations. 2-LP set.','9/11/2026',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4531624-3702186.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181560,'move along|the all american rejects|the all american rejects|lp','Move Along','The All-American Rejects','The All-American Rejects','LP','ISC243394.1','199957807401',32.25,32.25,'46433046','2026-11-10 23:55:13','2026-11-10 23:55:13','/19995780740','(Limited Edition, Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Double deluxe white colored vinyl LP pressing. Originally released in 2005 via Interscope, ''Move Along'' is the sophomore studio album from The All-American Rejects. It is now available featuring three rare additional tracks - "Kiss Yourself Goodbye," "Bite Back," and "Eyelash Wishes". Featuring hits like the title track, "Dirty Little Secret," and "It Ends Tonight," the this album propelled the band to household-name status, achieving RIAA-certified 3X Platinum and packing out arenas at the height of a three-year tour cycle that rarely took a break.','9/4/2026',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/53/4528153-3697965.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181561,'visitor|sienna spiro|sienna spiro|cd','Visitor','Sienna Spiro','Sienna Spiro','CD','CAP244792.2','199957784009',11.64000000000000056,11.64000000000000056,'46302526','2026-11-10 23:55:13','2026-11-10 23:55:13','/19995778400',NULL,0,'Sienna Spiro -"Visitor" / A phenomenal new vocal talent with uncompromising vision, Sienna Spiro is here with her debut album, Visitor, a striking opening statement from an artist of undeniable longevity. Visitor features Billboard-charting & RIAA Platinum & Gold singles "Die On This Hill" & "You Stole The Show," as well as new hit single "The Visitor." Having amassed over 1.3 billion streams ahead of her debut album, SIENNA matches her dazzling musicality with a fierce dedication to crafting music of true substance. Capitol Music Group; Capitol; Pop.','7/3/2026',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4516795-3623149.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181562,'k pops the album limited pink colored vinyl import|anderson paak|anderson paak|lp','K-Pops: The Album - Limited Pink Colored Vinyl [Import]','Anderson Paak','Anderson Paak','LP','UNUK5781906.1','199957819060',38.78999999999999915,38.78999999999999915,'46358349','2026-11-10 23:55:13','2026-11-10 23:55:13','/19995781906','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Pink, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Anderson.Paak returns with ''K-POPS! (Music from and Inspired by K-POPS! Motion Picture)'', a bold cross-cultural soundtrack accompanying his Netflix directorial debut. Featuring an all-star lineup including G-DRAGON, aespa, JID, DEAN, NMIXX, and members of SEVENTEEN, ATEEZ, and i-dle, the 17-track project blends K-pop, R&B, hip-hop, and soul into a vibrant celebration of music and storytelling. More than a soundtrack, ''K-POPS!'' captures the spirit of collaboration, connection, and global creativity at the heart of the film.','8/28/2026',0.989999999999999992,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4521697-3629415.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
