INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181588,'somethin else blue note essentials series|cannonball adderley|cannonball adderley|lp','Somethin Else (Blue Note Essentials Series)','Cannonball Adderley','Cannonball Adderley','LP','BLUN247614.1','199957966788',13.33999999999999986,13.33999999999999986,'46513885','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/19995796678',NULL,0,'Somethin'' Else (Blue Note Essentials Series) is a landmark 1958 jazz album by alto saxophonist Cannonball Adderley, featuring an all-star lineup that includes Miles Davis (trumpet), Hank Jones (piano), Sam Jones (bass), and Art Blakey (drums). Widely regarded as one of the greatest hard bop recordings of all time, the album blends soulful blues, sophisticated improvisation, and memorable compositions, highlighted by classics such as "Autumn Leaves," "Love for Sale," and the title track. This Blue Note Essentials Series edition celebrates a timeless jazz masterpiece that remains essential listening for both longtime fans and new listeners alike.','9/25/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4535297-3737637.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181589,'smiling through the pain import|swimming paul|swimming paul|lp','Smiling Through The Pain [Import]','Swimming Paul','Swimming Paul','LP','UNUK2849191.1','3516628491917',32.0,32.0,'45459658','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/351662849191','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,NULL,'11/7/2025',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181590,'24 hr sports instrumental green|el michels affair|el michels affair|lp','24 Hr Sports (Instrumental) - Green','El Michels Affair','El Michels Affair','LP','BGCO193C1.1','349223019315',16.19999999999999929,16.19999999999999929,'45919428','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/34922301931','(Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'El Michels Affair''s 2025 instant classic 24 Hr Sports. The roster of vocal features on 24 Hr Sports is amazing, Clairo, Norah Jones, Florence Adooni, Shintaro Sakamoto, two different choirs, and even some singing from the man himself, Leon Michels. The background vocals contributions are amazing; Lady Wray and Kevin Martin from Brainstory to name a few. But alas, there''s a new energy that shows up in the listen when you pair it down to the impeccable musicianship and Leon''s tried and true "Midas Touch" production. Leon plays a ton of instruments across the album and is joined by the regular cast of heavy hitters; Homer Steinweiss, Nick Movshon, Dave Guy, Marco Benevento, Hether, and more. There is even a saxophone solo by the late, great Rahsaan Roland Kirk. Some would argue this is some of the best music being made by some of the best musicians of our time. We wouldn''t argue with anyone... we let the music do what it does.','3/20/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4487351-3513282.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181591,'studio ghibli mononoke chihiro piano collection import|joe hisaishi|joe hisaishi|lp','Studio Ghibli: Mononoke & Chihiro Piano Collection [Import]','Joe Hisaishi','Joe Hisaishi','LP','UNUK2851251.1','3516628512513',54.31000000000000227,54.31000000000000227,'46233226','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/351662851251','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'This collection features pianist Nicolas Horvath performing elegant solo arrangements of Joe Hisaishi''s legendary scores from Princess Mononoke and Spirited Away. The album reimagines these sweeping cinematic themes as intimate, evocative piano pieces that capture the whimsical and emotional spirit of Studio Ghibli''s most iconic films.','7/3/2026',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4512523-3588106.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181592,'ibiza house various import|various artists|various artists|lp','Ibiza House /  Various [Import]','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','WGAM7481746.1','3596974817463',27.14999999999999858,27.14999999999999858,'45176432','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/359697481746','(France - Import)',0,NULL,'8/15/2025',0.8800000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4426271-3394408.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181593,'sounding out in the city|el michels affair|el michels affair|lp','Sounding Out In The City','El Michels Affair','El Michels Affair','LP','BGCO22.1','349223002218',14.90000000000000035,14.90000000000000035,'31197359','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/34922300221',NULL,0,NULL,'7/8/2016',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/4/9/1/3391947.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181594,'24 hr sports iex red|el michels affair|el michels affair|lp','24 Hr Sports (IEX) Red','El Michels Affair','El Michels Affair','LP','BGCO133C2.1','349223013351',14.90000000000000035,14.90000000000000035,'45309144','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/34922301335','(Clear Vinyl, Red, RSD Exclusive)',0,'Leon Michels has quietly become one of the most sought-after producers in music. His signature sound has caught the attention of the mainstream while continuing to inspire the underground. Since 2023''s El Michels Affair & Black Thought album Glorious Game, Michels has been busy producing records for other artists; Norah Jones'' Grammy winning Visions, Clairo''s Grammy nominated Charm, Kali Uchis'' "Moonlight", as well as albums for labelmates Brainstory, Derya Y─▒ld─▒r─▒m & Grup Simsek, Thee Heart Tones, and Liam Bailey. His new album 24 Hr Sports marks the highly anticipated return to recording under his own moniker, El Michels Affair. 24 Hr Sports was inspired by the fashion and graphic design of ''80s & ''90s Sports Illustrated magazines, MF DOOM''s Special Herbs albums, the sample sources used on them, and gospel music a la Pastor T. L. Barrett. The sum of those influences with Michels'' impeccable creative touch prove to be the recipe for an instant classic that will surely be one of the most heralded releases of 2025. The album opener "Drum Line" is an anthemic, uplifting tune with marching band drumming and thundering brass arrangements that command undivided attention and set the tone for what''s to come. 24 Hr Sports sees a significant departure from the largely instrumental music of the El Michels Affair catalog with a roster of vocal features that manages to mirror the undefinable genre of his music. The first one on the album is "M├ígica" which features Brazil''s Rog├¬. He takes the already pumping energy of the track over the top with his f├║tbol inspired lyrics. Moving from Brazil to Ghana, "Say Goodbye" features Florence Adooni who touts her individuality with an effortless swag jumping between Frafra and English, telling it like it is in the earworm chorus, "never gonna find a girl like me... ". Labelmate and world renowned trumpeter from The Roots, Dave Guy joins the ''70s groove of "Oakley''s Car Wash" with his distinct horn lines before the track switches lanes, closing with a dubby outro. From raucous to serene, "Anticipate" featuring Clairo picks up on the musical synergy between her and Leon that created 2024''s Charm album. Clairo rides signature EMA arrangements perfectly as she pines for an unattainable love over the band''s airtight instrumentation. "Eastside" is a song that could soundtrack a sunrise over the ocean, putting Leon''s tasteful use of space and arrangement on a pedestal. By way of Japan, The Suginami Children''s Choir join in on the lush "Clean The Line" singing a song about the moon, the sun, and birds. Next, "Cortex" kicks in the door with gritty distorted guitars and thundering drums that puts a moment of pure cinematic intensity in the middle of the album. Leon himself handles lead vocals on "Shining," a song about looking for a friend to share the joys of a sunny day with. The universally adored Shintaro Sakamoto is featured on "Indifference", a swanky tune built on bouncing basslines and flute chops. Shintaro uses the arrangements to go from singing to speaking, musing over a fleeting love. The Grammy winning duo of Norah Jones and Michels reunite on "Carry Me Away" with Jones'' honeyed vocals soaring over a track that is hard to place but easy to love. Leon leans into El Michels Affair territory on the tune that sounds decidedly different from the Norah Jones records he has produced. "Take My Hand" puts gospel influence front and center with the Fabulous Rainbow Singers choir on the chorus and a saxophone solo from the late great Rahsaan Roland Kirk. "Open Season", a mid tempo, piano driven number with group vocals chanting "we want the gold, we want the gold... " could soundtrack a slow motion highlight reel, while the aptly titled album closer "Victory Lap" is a dreamy euphoric wind-down worthy of the record that just finished. When all is said and done, the trophy on the cover of the album speaks volumes. El Michels Affair is champion sound and 24 Hr Sports hammers that home.','9/5/2025',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4438283-3444306.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181595,'ibiza techno various import|various artists|various artists|lp','Ibiza Techno /  Various [Import]','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','WGAM7481756.1','3596974817562',24.23999999999999844,24.23999999999999844,'45176449','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/359697481756','(France - Import)',0,NULL,'10/10/2025',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4426272-3394409.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181596,'hurry up we re dreaming transparent pink blue vinyl import|m83|m83|lp','Hurry Up, We''re Dreaming - Transparent Pink & Blue Vinyl [Import]','M83','M83','LP','MRDG8769075.1','3700187690755',30.05999999999999873,30.05999999999999873,'45917226','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/370018769075','(Clear Vinyl, Pink, Blue, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'M83''S LEGENDARY ALBUM ''HURRY UP, WE''RE DREAMING'' IS FINALLY AVAILABLE AGAIN AS A DOUBLE CD AND DOUBLE COLOURED VINYL. The iconic and essential album ''Hurry Up, We''re Dreaming'' by French band M83, released in 2011 and featuring the global hit ''Midnight City'', will celebrate it''s 15th anniversary in 2026. The album was nominated for Best Alternative Music Album at the 2013 Grammy Awards and was ranked among the 200 best albums of the decade by Pitchfork in 2019. Hurry Up, We''re Dreaming'' is finally available again, in a 2CD digipack and 2LP coloured vinyl (pink/blue) edition!','1/30/2026',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4487342-3513332.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181597,'tragic magic|julianna barwick|julianna barwick|lp','Tragic Magic','Julianna Barwick','Julianna Barwick','LP','IFNE1100.1','3516628498411',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45649639','2026-11-10 23:55:14','2026-11-10 23:55:14','/351662849841',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2026 release. Having toured together over the years, Lattimore and Barwick now join forces to co-write and record this full-length album. Their creative synergy brings together harp, voice, and analogue synths in a deeply emotional, immersive sound journey. The album was recorded at the Philharmonie de Paris with co-producer Trevor Spencer (Fleet Foxes, Beach House). This album continues a unique series of collaborations between the label and the Mus├⌐e de la Musique, featuring historical instruments in contemporary composition.','3/6/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4469129-3471345.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181598,'daughter from hell|gracie abrams||lp','Daughter From Hell','Gracie Abrams',NULL,'LP','ISC244499.1','19995787325',31.58999999999999986,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/gracie-abrams-daughter-from-hell/19995787325',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181599,'live in reims cathedral 1974|nico|nico|lp','Live in Reims Cathedral 1974','Nico','Nico','LP','CULF783949.1','3700477839499',9.74000000000000021,9.74000000000000021,'45379932','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783949','(Colored Vinyl, Magenta)',0,'Live in Reims Cathedral, 1974 - This former member of THE VELVET UNDERGROUND - Singer/Songwriter, Model/Actress, Solo Artist/Music Icon. Nico seemed to be at the epicentre of all that was cool before sadly dying in 1988. This release has never been released on vinyl before and includes new vinyl mastering and all new album art work from the 1974 era. Past Nico, Culture Factory USA sales #''s include: (Nico/Live Library ''80 - 2k) (Nico/Live at Library ''83 - 2.1k) (Nico/Live Hacienda ''83 - 2.2k). This deluxe vinyl package includes: OBI side spine, full color printed inner sleeve and beautiful Crystal Clear Color vinyl.','11/27/2025',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4444930-3458571.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181600,'reggae best|toots the maytals|toots the maytals|lp','Reggae Best','Toots & The Maytals','Toots & The Maytals','LP','LLM783970.1','3700477839703',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'45351891','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783970','(Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Red, Remastered)',0,'The Maytals, known from 1972 to 2020 as Toots and the Maytals, are a Jamaican musical group, one of the best known ska and rocksteady vocal groups. The Maytals were formed in the early 1960s and were key figures in popularizing reggae music.','10/10/2025',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4442291-3415633.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181601,'louis armstrong and the dukes of dixieland|louis armstrong|louis armstrong|lp','Louis Armstrong and the Dukes of Dixieland','Louis Armstrong','Louis Armstrong','LP','LLM783790.1','3700477837907',9.74000000000000021,9.74000000000000021,'44373320','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783790','(Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Red, Remastered)',0,'The Dukes of Dixieland was an American, New Orleans "Dixieland"-style revival band, originally formed in 1948 by brothers Frank Assunto, trumpet; Fred Assunto, trombone; and their father Papa Jac Assunto, trombone and banjo. The original Dukes of Dixieland were featured on the very FIRST STEREO RECORD released November 1957.','8/30/2024',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4340792-3182294.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181602,'live in paris 1964 vol 2 translucent bright yellow|charlie mingus|charlie mingus|lp','Live in Paris, 1964 Vol. 2 - Translucent Bright Yellow','Charlie Mingus','Charlie Mingus','LP','LLM783826.1','3700477838263',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'45055249','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783826','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'Charles Mingus was an American jazz upright bassist, composer, bandleader, pianist, and author. A major proponent of collective improvisation, he is considered one of the greatest jazz musicians and composers in history with a career spanning three decades and collaborations with other jazz greats such as Duke Ellington, Charlie Parker, Max Roach, and Eric Dolphy','6/27/2025',0.3099999999999999978,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/4415658-3363797.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181603,'a necessary escape dakar chronicles original soundtrack transparent marbled turquoise|m83|m83|lp','A Necessary Escape - Dakar Chronicles (Original Soundtrack) - Transparent Marbled Turquoise','M83','M83','LP','MCIC8803.1','3700187688035',13.68999999999999951,13.68999999999999951,'45080159','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370018768803','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Turquoise, Limited Edition, Indie Exclusive)',0,'Transparent Marbled Turquoise. A Necessary Escape'' is the new M83 Soundtrack to the forthcoming film ''Dakar: Race Against The Desert''. The album will be available digitally from the 9th May with the physical release of the album following on the 27th June. Physical formats will include CD, regular vinyl and a limited coloured edition vinyl. This will be the 4th album soundtrack released by M83 and was recorded in both France and the US by M83''s leading man, Anthony Gonzalez, along with regular M83 contributors, Joe Berry & Clement Libes. The film ''Dakar: Race Against The Desert'' will be released digitally by Universal Pictures on the 12th May and the film will get it''s World-wide cinematic premiere on the 26th June at the MK2 Biblioth├¿que in in Paris. The film, which is directed by the French actor/director Jalil Lespert, follows the World famous Dakar Car Rally - an event that for 45 years has been the ultimate test of resilience, skill and endurance in the world of Motorsports. Spanning 9,000 kilometres, the race lasts for 14 gruelling days over harsh desert terrain. With unprecedented access, this film dives into the world''s toughest race, following legends like S├⌐bastien Loeb, reigning champion Nasser Al-Attiyah, and pioneers Carlos Sainz and St├⌐phane Peterhansel. It also spotlights rising stars like Mason Klein. * ''Dakar Chronicles'' is the film''s title in French version.','6/27/2025',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4417759-3381245.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181604,'upsetters green|lee perry|lee perry|lp','Upsetters - Green','Lee Perry','Lee Perry','LP','LLM783986.1','3700477839864',14.68999999999999951,14.68999999999999951,'45443954','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783986','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'Lee "Scratch" Perry was a Jamaican record producer, songwriter and singer noted for his innovative studio techniques and production style. Perry was a pioneer in the 1970s development of dub music with his early adoption of remixing and studio effects to create new instrumental or vocal versions of existing reggae tracks. He worked with and produced for a wide variety of artists, including Bob Marley and the Wailers, Junior Murvin, the Congos, Max Romeo, Adrian Sherwood, Beastie Boys, Ari Up, the Clash, the Orb, and many others.','11/14/2025',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4451028-3435742.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181605,'no parole from rock n roll rsd|alcatrazz|alcatrazz|lp','No Parole From Rock ''N'' Roll (RSD)','Alcatrazz','Alcatrazz','LP','CULF784097.1','3700477840976',25.96999999999999887,25.96999999999999887,'45951909','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047784097','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red, Orange, Deluxe Edition)',0,'Alcatrazz is an American rock band formed in 1983 by Graham Bonnet, Jimmy Waldo, and Gary Shea. They are best known for their songs "Island in the Sun", "Hiroshima Mon Amour", and "God Blessed Video". They are also notable for featuring a previously unknown Yngwie Malmsteen as their lead guitarist for a year, who was then replaced by Steve Vai, with whom they recorded one album.','4/18/2026',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4489797-3519581.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181606,'i wrote you a letter iex|m83|m83|lp','I Wrote You a Letter (IEX)','M83','M83','LP','MCIC9350.1','3700187693503',18.28999999999999915,18.28999999999999915,'46438072','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370018769350','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition)',0,'The iconic project returns late September with it''s milestone 10th studio album, ''I Wrote You A Letter''. Twenty-five years after his debut, M83 (Anthony Gonzalez) stands as a genuinely era-defining electronic act, renowned for pushing indie-electronic into the mainstream while maintaining absolute critical credibility. With a massive catalog compounding billions of streams-anchored by the timeless "Midnight City" (1.5B streams)-the iconic project returns late September with it''s milestone 10th studio album, ''I Wrote You A Letter''. Recorded between Los Angeles and Paris alongside Benoit de Villeneuve, this new record follows the highly acclaimed ''Fantasy'' (2023) and features striking artwork by celebrated Australian photographer Bill Henson. This release marks a historic chapter, encapsulating a quarter-century of sonic evolution. Commercially, M83''s power lies in an unmatched ability to transcend generations. Synonymous with cinematic emotion, nostalgia, and immense scale, M83''s sound is virtually a genre of it''s own, heavily sought after for film, TV, and sync. Live, the act holds top-tier global status, proven by headlining slots at major festivals like Coachella, Glastonbury, and Primavera. ''I Wrote You A Letter'' delivers exactly what M83 does best: big emotional scale, breathtaking cinematic atmospheres, and sharp hooks, all pushed into a fresh, modern palette.','9/25/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4528637-3670160.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181607,'a necessary escape dakar chronicles original soundtrack|m83|m83|lp','A Necessary Escape - Dakar Chronicles (Original Soundtrack)','M83','M83','LP','MCIC8699.1','3700187686994',13.68999999999999951,13.68999999999999951,'45080142','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370018768699','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'A Necessary Escape'' is the new M83 Soundtrack to the forthcoming film ''Dakar: Race Against The Desert''. The album will be available digitally from the 9th May with the physical release of the album following on the 27th June. Physical formats will include CD, regular vinyl and a limited coloured edition vinyl. This will be the 4th album soundtrack released by M83 and was recorded in both France and the US by M83''s leading man, Anthony Gonzalez, along with regular M83 contributors, Joe Berry & Clement Libes. The film ''Dakar: Race Against The Desert'' will be released digitally by Universal Pictures on the 12th May and the film will get it''s World-wide cinematic premiere on the 26th June at the MK2 Biblioth├¿que in in Paris. The film, which is directed by the French actor/director Jalil Lespert, follows the World famous Dakar Car Rally - an event that for 45 years has been the ultimate test of resilience, skill and endurance in the world of Motorsports. Spanning 9,000 kilometres, the race lasts for 14 gruelling days over harsh desert terrain. With unprecedented access, this film dives into the world''s toughest race, following legends like S├⌐bastien Loeb, reigning champion Nasser Al-Attiyah, and pioneers Carlos Sainz and St├⌐phane Peterhansel. It also spotlights rising stars like Mason Klein. * ''Dakar Chronicles'' is the film''s title in French version.','6/27/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/4417758-3381244.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181608,'feels good to me rsd|bruford|bruford|lp','Feels Good to Me (RSD)','Bruford','Bruford','LP','CULF784101.1','3700477841010',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'45951923','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047784101','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'Bill Bruford is an English drummer and percussionist who first gained prominence as a founding member of the progressive rock band Yes. After leaving Yes in 1972, Bruford spent the rest of the 1970s recording and touring with King Crimson (1972-1974), Roy Harper (1975), and U.K. (1978), as well as touring with Genesis (1976). In 1978, he formed his own group, Bruford, which was active until 1980.','4/18/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4489799-3519586.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181609,'from zorch with love the very best of the meteors 1981 1997 rsd|the meteors|the meteors|lp','From Zorch with Love: The Very Best of the Meteors 1981-1997 (RSD)','The Meteors','The Meteors','LP','CULF784106.1','3700477841065',25.96999999999999887,25.96999999999999887,'45951954','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047784106','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'The Meteors The Meteors performing in Pordenone, Italy in 2006 The Meteors performing in Pordenone, Italy in 2006 Background information Origin London, England Genres Psychobilly Years active 1980-present Labels Mutant Rock Records Members P. Paul Fenech Lobo Ivan The Meteors are an English psychobilly band formed in 1980. Originally from London, England, they are one of the pioneers of the psychobilly subgenre - which fuses punk rock with rockabilly - it''s distinctive sound and style. "Starting in the neo-rockabilly scene, the Meteors were initially shunned for being too spooky and mean. Excuses for exclusion from rockabilly concerts varied from the band having too extreme of a sound to their drummer having green hair." The Meteors blended elements of punk rock, 1960s garage band surf music, rockabilly, and horror film themes in their music and are thought to be one of the first bands to use the label ''Psychobilly'' to define a genre and musical style, though the term is used as a lyrical motif as part of the narrative in the Johnny Cash and The Tennessee Three song, "One Piece at a Time".','4/18/2026',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4489802-3519592.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181610,'from mars to sirius|gojira|gojira|cd','From Mars to Sirius','Gojira','Gojira','CD','LISB124.2','3760053841247',10.19999999999999928,10.19999999999999928,'26444871','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/376005384124',NULL,1,'The Legendary album ''From Mars to Sirius'' put Gojira on the path to Worldwide stardom. It is a concept album addressing environmental issues and the rebirth of a dead planet through a space travel storyline, with the underlying theme of a transition from war to peace. From Mars to Sirius was released in 2005 to critical acclaim. It has since been ranked amongst the Rolling Stone''s 100 Greatest Metal Albums of All Time.','5/27/2014',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/4/8/7/1567842.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181611,'rent money iex silver|pokey lafarge|pokey lafarge|lp','Rent Money (IEX) Silver','Pokey LaFarge','Pokey LaFarge','LP','DGGR702IEX.1','3701828400702',22.39000000000000056,22.39000000000000056,'46458841','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370182840070','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Silver)',0,'For two decades, Pokey LaFarge has walked his own effortlessly cool road as an exceptionally iconoclastic troubadour - forthright, genuine, and markedly keen to put it all out there. Rent Money now sees him pushing forward yet again in what can be safely declared his finest collection to date, both as an heartfelt expression of personal experience and as no-nonsense social commentary. With it''s twanging guitars, plucky rhythms, and undeniably captivating melodies, the album soars and swings, it''s joyous refrains belying the inescapable undercurrent of constant worry and angst that permeates these troubled times. As always, the Illinois native deftly traverses the genre boundaries, seamlessly integrating the myriad strains of 20th-century American music with a freewheeling command of earnest songcraft, inspired performance, and subversive creativity. Rent Money stands tall as an indisputable high-water mark for Pokey LaFarge - a defining collection from a one-of-a-kind artist of rare ingenuity and uncommon candor, now as ever, determinedly crafting a sure-footed brand of deeply human music all his own.','10/2/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4530609-3677348.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181612,'reflections rsd|gil scott heron|gil scott heron|lp','Reflections (RSD)','Gil Scott-Heron','Gil Scott-Heron','LP','CULF784102.1','3700477841027',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'45951930','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047784102','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'Gilbert Scott-Heron was an American jazz poet, singer, musician and author, known for his work as a spoken-word performer in the 1970s and 1980s. His collaborative efforts with musician Brian Jackson fused jazz, blues and soul with lyrics relative to social and political issues of the time, delivered in both rapping and melismatic vocal styles. He referred to himself as a "bluesologist", his own term for "a scientist who is concerned with the origin of the blues". His poem "The Revolution Will Not Be Televised", delivered over a jazz-soul beat, is considered a major influence on hip hop music.','4/18/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4489800-3519588.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181613,'from mars to sirius|gojira|gojira|lp','From Mars to Sirius','Gojira','Gojira','LP','LISB137.1','3760053841377',35.09000000000000342,35.09000000000000342,'26121406','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/376005384137','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'The Legendary album ''From Mars to Sirius'' put Gojira on the path to Worldwide stardom. It is a concept album addressing environmental issues and the rebirth of a dead planet through a space travel storyline, with the underlying theme of a transition from war to peace. From Mars to Sirius was released in 2005 to critical acclaim. It has since been ranked amongst the Rolling Stone''s 100 Greatest Metal Albums of All Time.','4/15/2014',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/1727130-3532668.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181614,'live in paris 1964 vol 1 translucent red|charlie mingus|charlie mingus|lp','Live in Paris, 1964 Vol. 1 - Translucent Red','Charlie Mingus','Charlie Mingus','LP','LLM783801.1','3700477838010',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'44912178','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/370047783801','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Deluxe Edition, Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'Charlie Mingus is A PIONEER OF THE JAZZ UPRIGHT BASS VINYL HAS BEEN OUT OF PRINT & UNAVAILABLE release features - Eric Dolphy, Cliff Jordan, Jacki Byard and Brooke Erwin ONE OF ERIC DOLPHY''S FINAL RECORDINGS TRANSLUCENT RED color vinyl','5/30/2025',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4400122-3318657.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181615,'hollywood story|john williams|john williams|lp','Hollywood Story','John Williams','John Williams','LP','DGGF27.1','3760300319451',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'43710096','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/376030031945','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'A graduate of the Juilliard School, John Williams is considered a prodigy of his generation. Conductor, composer, pianist, saxophonist... are all roles he plays. In his 64-year career, he has had the honor of composing the soundtracks for Harry Potter, Jaws, E.T, Jurassic Park, Superman, Schindler''s List and more. An award-winning composer, he is without a doubt one of the pioneers of the international music scene.','1/5/2024',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4239919-3035178.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181616,'terra incognita|gojira|gojira|lp','Terra Incognita','Gojira','Gojira','LP','LISB325.1','3760053843258',35.09000000000000342,35.09000000000000342,'31448406','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/376005384325',NULL,0,'Originally dubbed Godzilla, after the scaly, green film star with an equally huge reputation as the newfound band''s sound, the brothers Duplantier - guitars/vocalist Joe and Drummer Mario - and fellow Frenchman Michel Labadie on bass and Christian Andreu on guitar, quickly released several demos, ultimately changing the band''s name and independently releasing the first Gojira album, "Terra Incognita" in 2001, offering up a brief glimpse into the giant Gojira would eventually become through persistent hard work and years of toiling in the metal underground. Now remastered and for the very first time avialable in LP version with 3 exclusive live bonuses, Gojira''s "Terra Incognita" album, seen by their fans as the band''s ultimate classic, will undoubtly draw major interest worldwide as the band is destroying festivals across Europe!','11/4/2016',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/3446110-3543049.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181617,'revolverlution tour 2003|public enemy||lp','Revolverlution Tour 2003','Public Enemy',NULL,'LP','LLM783743.1','370047783743',13.0,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/public-enemy-revolverlution-tour-2003/370047783743',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181618,'the hobbit the lord of the rings film music collection|city of prague philharmonic orchestra|city of prague philharmonic orchestra|lp','The Hobbit & The Lord of the Rings: Film Music Collection','City of Prague Philharmonic Orchestra','City of Prague Philharmonic Orchestra','LP','DGGF0013.1','3760300311103',25.98999999999999844,25.98999999999999844,'40578743','2026-11-10 23:55:15','2026-11-10 23:55:15','/376030031110',NULL,0,'Immerse yourself into the universe of orcs, hobbits and elfs through the soundtracks of the Hobbits & Lord of the Ring of this limited edition 2LP.','12/18/2020',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3835182-2578238.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181619,'from mars to sirius|gojira|gojira|lp','From Mars to Sirius [Explicit Content]','Gojira','Gojira','LP','LISB894.1','3760053848949',38.34000000000000342,38.34000000000000342,'46199652','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376005384894','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Picture Disc Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'"Originally released in 2005, The Legendary album ''From Mars to Sirius'' put Gojira on the path to Worldwide stardom. Now having reached it''s 20th anniversary, this classic album is still a massively Heavy Monster! ''From Mars to Sirius'' concept relates the resurrection of a dead planet through an interplanetary quest, tackling environmental issues such as climate change and impacts on marine life as well as broader themes of life, death, and rebirth. Explaining the meaning behind the album title, Joe Duplantier (vocals) said in an interview that "In some cultures, Mars symbolizes war and Sirius peace. (...) it can be a war within us, in our flesh, in our mind, a war with ourselves". The song ''Flying Whales'' is a homage to whales and their intelligence. The concept emerged during the second album''s tour and resulted in the imagery and artwork for From Mars to Sirius. The cover art was created by Joe Duplantier. It has since been ranked amongst the Rolling Stone''s 100 Greatest Metal Albums of All Time and considered as a masterpiece. It is now released as a 20th anniversary Limited Edition de Luxe double gatefold Zoetrope picture disc with exclusive and never seen band photos.','8/28/2026',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4511552-3575643.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181620,'waiting game|eggy|eggy|lp','Waiting Game','Eggy','Eggy','LP','DGGF338.1','3760396024338',22.80000000000000071,22.80000000000000071,'44779665','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376039602433',NULL,0,'This album is something we''ve wanted to make for the past five years, but funny enough, it only took us three weeks to complete. Planning for this project came about rather serendipitously, when Dani and Alex met James Petralli following a White Denim concert in September. By April, we had taken up residence at his home studio in Pasadena, sharing beds and sleeping on sofas in the control room. We didn''t see much more than the four walls of the studio, save for the three blocks that surrounded, the two coffee houses within walking distance and the single sandwich shop around the corner. Like many of our favorite albums, this effort captures a very specific moment in time. For us, that means the amalgamation of experiences from four friends who have lived in the same house together through the pandemic, and shared in the same van rides for nearly three hundred days touring on the road. To us this album feels like a step towards maturity, as it sees the acceptance and departure from our 20''s (for most of us). Alex, our drummer and lone holdover at 27 years-old, was ushered into the lead vocalist role for the entire record. This was entirely by design during the songwriting process. Being a band born out of a music scene that emphasizes the live rendition, we chose to go against tradition and record music that had never been performed before. There was a sense of freedom in the writing process, that we didn''t have to imitate anything we had done before. Instead we felt encouragement to lean into every creative calling, push our own boundaries, and discover our limitations. A reflection of our own lives cemented over thirty-six minutes.','1/31/2025',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4388213-3316102.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181621,'two star the dream police green|mk gee|mk gee|lp','Two Star & the Dream Police - Green','Mk.Gee','Mk.Gee','LP','RARQ0225.1','3760396026196',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'44558451','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376039602619','(Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Green vinyl. Two Star & The Dream Police is the latest album by songwriter, producer, and multi-instrumentalist Mk. Gee, released on February 9, 2024, through R&R. Two Star & The Dream Police blends ''80s pop, rock, and R&B, the record brimming with expansive, genre-defying, and loosely structured songs that evoke dreaminess and emotion. The record is nearly entirely self-produced along with Mk. Gee''s frequent collaborator Dijon. The record received widespread love from fans along with critical acclaim from major outlets such a Pitchfork, Rolling Stone, Stereogum, Billboard, NPR, Complex, and many many more.','11/6/2024',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4364592-3535062.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181622,'the holy enchilada|scary goldings|scary goldings|lp','The Holy Enchilada','Scary Goldings','Scary Goldings','LP','DGGF76.1','3760420428828',22.80000000000000071,22.80000000000000071,'45740275','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376042042882',NULL,0,'From collab project of Scary Pockets & their hero Larry Goldings'' new album, featuring Kaveh Rastegar (Bruno Mars, de la Soul) & Kane Ritchotte (sombr, Portugal The Man). It was written/recorded on the spot & features artwork via The New Yorker''s Barry Blitt; while previous records feat. John Scofield & Louis Cole. Scary Pockets is Pomplamoose''s Jack Conte & writer/producer Ryan Lerman (Vulfpeck, Lizzy McAlpine); Grammy-nom Larry Goldings worked with John Mayer, James Taylor, Melody Gardot etc.','2/13/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4475360-3493801.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181623,'live in bologna 1985|chet baker|chet baker|lp','Live in Bologna 1985','Chet Baker','Chet Baker','LP','DGGF004.1','3760420425148',25.98999999999999844,25.98999999999999844,'45460661','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376042042514',NULL,0,'Two years before the legendary trumpeter mysteriously fell from the window of a Dutch hotel, he delivered this high-level live performance on a stage in Bologna, Italy, in 1985. Accompanied by Philippe Catherine on guitar and Jean-Louis Rassinfosse on double bass, Baker drew on his natural charm, that utterly disarming magnetism which made him deeply moving, even when decline was looming. Baker carried within him that inner fracture, that haunting depth that rendered every note fragile. Released for the first time as a 2 ├ù 180 g vinyl LP with HD vinyl mastering and a new mastering for the CD version.','11/7/2025',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4452661-3439860.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181624,'blueprints|umphrey s mcgee|umphrey s mcgee|lp','Blueprints','Umphrey''s McGee','Umphrey''s McGee','LP','DGGF2139.1','3760420427326',25.98999999999999844,25.98999999999999844,'45498060','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376042042732','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'With over 2,800 live shows, 14 studio albums, and more than 27 years of musical evolution, Umphrey''s McGee continues to defy classification and expectation. Drawing fans from around the globe and across musical boundaries, the band has cultivated a devoted community rooted in spontaneity, precision, and connection. Pioneers at the intersection of music and technology, their live experience fuses cutting-edge production with fan-centric innovation, creating a space where longtime followers and newcomers alike feel at home. Genre lines blur as progressive rock, funk, jazz, metal, electronic, and beyond converge into something unmistakably Umphrey''s. More than just a band, Umphrey''s McGee is a living, breathing organism - constantly evolving, yet grounded in a singular mission: to create bold, immersive, and memorable musical experiences. Their latest project, Blueprints, offers a rare glimpse into the band''s creative DNA. Revisiting early demos, reimagined ideas, and unreleased material, the album bridges past and present, inviting listeners to trace the evolution of songs from their raw inception to their fully realized form. Blueprints stands as both a celebration of Umphrey''s history and a testament to their relentless drive to explore new musical terrain.','11/21/2025',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4455983-3446256.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181625,'joytime i|marshmello|marshmello|lp','Joytime I','Marshmello','Marshmello','LP','DGGF16001.1','3760420428279',22.80000000000000071,22.80000000000000071,'45594472','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376042042827',NULL,0,'For the first time ever, Marshmello''s breakout debut studio album Joytime is available on vinyl. Celebrating 10 years of euphoric beats and genre-defying energy, this definitive anniversary edition honors the album that introduced the world to Marshmello''s signature sound. From the booming trap of "Know Me" to "Want U 2," Joytime is a masterclass in melodic dance music that dares to be bold. Joytime also includes the debut single "Keep It Mello" featuring Omar Linx, a crossover anthem that has remained one of Marshmello''s iconic offerings. Celebrate the album that launched a global phenomenon. Joytime on vinyl is more than a collector''s item, it''s a piece of electronic music history.','12/26/2025',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4464273-3462014.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181626,'best of rsd|gotan project|gotan project|lp','Best of (RSD)','Gotan Project','Gotan Project','LP','DGGF691.1','3760434480850',27.98000000000000042,27.98000000000000042,'45913365','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376043448085','(RSD Exclusive, Limited Edition)',0,'"On the occasion of Record Store Day 2026, Gotan Project reissues it''s Best Of, available on vinyl. The Franco-Argentine trio, pioneers of electro-tango, have sold over 4 million albums and performed more than 450 concerts worldwide. From Santa Mar├¡a (Del Buen Ayre) to Diferente, this Best Of brings together the essential tracks that marked a musical journey which has become cult.','4/18/2026',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4486719-3511711.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181627,'rent money|pokey lafarge|pokey lafarge|lp','Rent Money','Pokey LaFarge','Pokey LaFarge','LP','DGGR7705RT.1','3760434487705',22.39000000000000056,22.39000000000000056,'46458858','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376043448770',NULL,0,'For two decades, Pokey LaFarge has walked his own effortlessly cool road as an exceptionally iconoclastic troubadour - forthright, genuine, and markedly keen to put it all out there. Rent Money now sees him pushing forward yet again in what can be safely declared his finest collection to date, both as an heartfelt expression of personal experience and as no-nonsense social commentary. With it''s twanging guitars, plucky rhythms, and undeniably captivating melodies, the album soars and swings, it''s joyous refrains belying the inescapable undercurrent of constant worry and angst that permeates these troubled times. As always, the Illinois native deftly traverses the genre boundaries, seamlessly integrating the myriad strains of 20th-century American music with a freewheeling command of earnest songcraft, inspired performance, and subversive creativity. Rent Money stands tall as an indisputable high-water mark for Pokey LaFarge - a defining collection from a one-of-a-kind artist of rare ingenuity and uncommon candor, now as ever, determinedly crafting a sure-footed brand of deeply human music all his own.','10/2/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4530610-3674982.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181628,'takin off|herbie hancock|herbie hancock|lp','Takin'' Off','Herbie Hancock','Herbie Hancock','LP','EMTG22718.1','3770024957181',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'45696435','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/377002495718',NULL,0,'The producer Alfred Lion (co-founder of Blue Note Records) was known for spotting young talent and giving them creative freedom: he bet on Herbie Hancock was mostly a sideman (he''d played with Donald Byrd and Coleman Hawkins) until this point and he was only 22 years old at the time of this recording. Takin'' Off, recorded on May 28, 1962 at Van Gelder Studio in New Jersey, sign his debut as a leader. The record will be release in 1962 and it''s a landmark recording not only because it introduced Hancock as a major new jazz pianist and composer, but also because it featured a track that became a jazz standard: "Watermelon Man". This composition often considered one of the strongest jazz debuts of the 1960s and became an unexpected hit, crossing over into popular music; it was later reimagined by Mongo Santamar├¡a and reached the pop charts, helping establish Hancock''s reputation early in his career. With an incredible all stars as Freddie Hubbard, Dexter Gordon, Butch Warren and Billy Higgins this album blends hard bop with catchy, soulful grooves: all the compositions already show Hancock''s gift for memorable melodies, rich harmonies, and rhythmic inventiveness, qualities that would define his career in both acoustic and electric jazz. HERBIE HANCOCK / TAKIN'' OFF','1/16/2026',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4471465-3476067.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181629,'at studio 54 new york city|james brown||lp','At Studio 54 New York City','James Brown',NULL,'LP','LLM783675.1','370047783675',9.74000000000000021,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/james-brown-at-studio-54-new-york-city/370047783675',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181630,'blues roots|charlie mingus|charlie mingus|lp','Blues & Roots','Charlie Mingus','Charlie Mingus','LP','EMTG22708.1','3770024957082',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'44946135','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/377002495708',NULL,0,'Blues & Roots is not only a cornerstone in Charles Mingus'' body of work but also a testament to the enduring power of the blues as a foundation for jazz. Mingus managed to both honor tradition and push the boundaries of jazz, all while making a deeply personal and politically charged musical statement. The album remains one of the most vital and influential recordings in the history of jazz music. Released in 1960 this album stands out in Mingus'' discography as a raw, vibrant homage to the roots of blues and gospel traditions in jazz. Mingus sought to return to his musical roots, drawing from blues and gospel traditions he grew up with, particularly from the African American church music of his youth. The album is a powerful statement of how deeply the blues tradition influenced modern jazz. It combines the unfiltered emotional intensity of the blues with Mingus'' forward-thinking and often unconventional compositional techniques. The album''s tracks are imbued with a strong sense of the blues, which is especially apparent in songs like "Wednesday Night Prayer Meeting" and "Moanin''." The album carries a loose, jam-session feel, reflecting the church and street-based roots of blues music. The use of call-and-response patterns in several tracks also hints at gospel traditions. Blues & Roots is often cited as a critical album in the development of jazz as a genre that embraced both it''s past and future. Mingus'' ability to integrate traditional musical forms (such as blues and gospel) with more modern, experimental elements opened up new possibilities for jazz. His compositional style, which juxtaposed tightly arranged sections with freewheeling solos, influenced generations of musicians, from avant-garde jazz artists to rock musicians and composers in other genres','3/28/2025',0.4799999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4380163-3321978.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181631,'thelonious in action|thelonious monk|thelonious monk|lp','Thelonious In Action','Thelonious Monk','Thelonious Monk','LP','EMTG22724.1','3770024957242',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'45696497','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/377002495724',NULL,0,'In the early 1950s, Monk''s career was hampered when his cabaret card (a license to work in city venues that served alcohol, and therefore, for a jazz musician a most important identification document) was revoked after a drug-related incident. His meant for years he couldn''t legally play in nightclubs. By 1957, Monk regained his cabaret card and his career reignited. He took up a residency at the Five Spot Caf├⌐ in New York where this album was recorded on August 7, 1958: It was a heyday for Monk, with live interactions showcasing both his edgy, eccentric style and his band''s ability to blend with his unique musical vision. It is an essential document of Monk''s work in the late 1950s, along with Misterioso. The records captures not just the music but the feel of a tight New York club -- glasses clinking, audience reactions, and a charged energy in the air. Producer Orrin Keepnews purposefully left these sounds in, to give listeners the feeling of being there. Thelonious in Action documents Monk at a moment of renewal and recognition, finally back in the spotlight, shows Monk''s ability to thrive in live performance, where his wit, timing, and eccentricity come through more vividly than in some studio sessions. THELONIOUS MONK / THELONIOUS IN ACTION','1/16/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4471471-3476073.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181632,'artificial selection|dance gavin dance|dance gavin dance|lp','Artificial Selection [Explicit Content]','Dance Gavin Dance','Dance Gavin Dance','LP','RISE160920.1','4050538391091',21.87000000000000099,21.87000000000000099,'36114702','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053839109','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Dance Gavin Dance is a name that instantly has people talking. One listen to any of their albums, and it''s no secret why. The band has found a way to combine elements of various genres in a way that wouldn''t seem likely for most, yet seems e ortless for them. Their unique blend of screamo, funk and experimental music makes their sound easily recognizable to many, and is what has won them loyal fans around the world. After seven full-lengths, an EP and a live album, Dance Gavin Dance are back at it with another killer record! "Artificial Selection" was recorded with producer Kris Crummett (Issues, Sleeping With Sirens) and co-produced by Erik Ron (Godsmack, I See Stars). The new album includes 14 tracks that showcase the band on a new level, while still staying true to their roots. This album is some of the band''s best work to date and is sure to please their existing, die-hard fans, while also intriguing new listeners. After supporting Underoath on their "No Fix" tour, Dance Gavin Dance will be setting o on their heading tour around the release of "Artificial Selection."','6/8/2018',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/4385627.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181633,'one piece into the grand line original netflix series soundtrack|sonya belousova|sonya belousova|lp','One Piece: Into the Grand Line (Original Netflix Series Soundtrack)','Sonya Belousova','Sonya Belousova','LP','DGGR85442.1','3760434485442',27.94000000000000127,27.94000000000000127,'46152503','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/376043448544','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Prepare your turntable for the ultimate high-seas adventure with the Audiophile Edition of One Piece: Into the Grand Line (Soundtrack from the Netflix Series). Capturing the core of the Straw Hat Crew''s journey Into the Grand Line, this 2LP set features the massive score by award-winning composers Sonya Belousova & Giona Ostinelli. This edition is designed for the true audiophile, ensuring every orchestral swell and pirate anthem is heard with crystal-clear precision. 2LP Audiophile Black Vinyl: Two 12" records pressed on high-quality black vinyl for a classic look and superior sound fidelity. Double Gatefold Jacket: A premium gatefold featuring vibrant, cinematic artwork of the Straw Hat Crew in action. Epic Orchestral Score: Immerse yourself in the world of One Piece with a soundtrack that perfectly balances grand adventure with character-driven emotion. Netflix''s epic high-seas pirate adventure, ONE PIECE, returns for Season 2-unleashing fiercer adversaries and the most perilous quests yet. Luffy and the Straw Hats set sail for the extraordinary Grand Line-a legendary stretch of sea where danger and wonder await at every turn. As they journey through this unpredictable realm in search of the world''s greatest treasure, they''ll encounter bizarre islands and a host of formidable new enemies.','8/28/2026',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4507340-3562094.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181634,'the revenge of alice cooper|alice cooper|alice cooper|lp','The Revenge Of Alice Cooper','Alice Cooper','Alice Cooper','LP','ERMU221194.1','4029759211945',34.67999999999999972,34.67999999999999972,'45964213','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/402975921194','(RSD Exclusive, Picture Disc Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Limited Picture Disc pressing of the now-infamous Alice Cooper Group reunion album! For the first time in over 50 years, Alice Cooper and the original band reunite to bring rock ''n'' roll back from the shadows! The Revenge of Alice Cooper is a high-voltage journey into vintage horror and classic ''70s shock rock. Together, they''ve created an album packed with the sound, energy, and mischief that made them legendary. This album throws you straight into the golden era of Killer, Billion Dollar Babies, School''s Out, and Love It to Death-packed with electrifying riffs, raw energy, and Alice''s signature storytelling. From the venomous bite of Black Mamba to the rebellious charge of Wild Ones, and the soft, haunting melodies of See You on the Other Side, every track feels like a lost rock ''n'' roll classic.','4/18/2026',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4490675-3565451.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181635,'two dreams|circa survive|circa survive|lp','Two Dreams','Circa Survive','Circa Survive','LP','RISE160974.1','4050538713220',26.46999999999999887,26.46999999999999887,'43099481','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053871322','(Clear Vinyl, Red, White, Blue, Yellow)',0,'Two Dreams Clear W/ Red, Yellow & Blue Splatter - Two Dreams - Circa Survive - Two Dreams Clear w/ Red, Yellow & Blue Splatter Vinyl LP - Limited to 500! - Rise Records.','1/13/2023',1.389999999999999903,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4147882-2913507.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181636,'dr feelgood|motley crue|motley crue|lp','Dr. Feelgood','Motley Crue','Motley Crue','LP','BGRT782554.1','4050538782554',20.28000000000000113,20.28000000000000113,'42746003','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053878255',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Dr. Feelgood is M├╢tley Cr├╝e''s fifth album originally released in 1989. Dr. Feelgood topped the Billboard 200 chart. It was the first album M├╢tley Cr├╝e recorded after their quest for sobriety and rehabilitation in 1989. In addition to being M├╢tley Cr├╝e''s best selling album, it is highly regarded by music critics and fans as the band''s best studio album. This was also the band''s last album to be recorded with lead singer Vince Neil until the 1997 album Generation Swine.','7/22/2022',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4104268-2842961.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181637,'count your blessings|bring me the horizon|bring me the horizon|cd','Count Your Blessings [Explicit Content]','Bring Me the Horizon','Bring Me the Horizon','CD','BGRT241152.2','4050538014501',8.789999999999999147,8.789999999999999147,'46369260','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053801450','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'The debut studio album by the British metalcore band, recorded at DEP International Studios in Birmingham with producer Dan Sprigg. Named after a lyric in the album''s opening song ''Pray for Plagues'', ''Count Your Blessings'' is representative of the band''s early deathcore sound, which was phased out on later releases and eventually abandoned in favour of other, less aggressive styles.','7/31/2026',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4415513-3379095.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181638,'the revenge of alice cooper|alice cooper|alice cooper|lp','The Revenge Of Alice Cooper','Alice Cooper','Alice Cooper','LP','ERMU220680.1','4029759206804',30.80000000000000071,30.80000000000000071,'45166884','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/402975920680','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The first time in over 50 years, Alice Cooper and the original band reunite to bring rock ''n'' roll back from the shadows! The Revenge of Alice Cooper is a high-voltage journey into vintage horror and classic ''70s shock rock. Together, they''ve created an album packed with the sound, energy, and mischief that made them legendary. This album throws you straight into the golden era of Killer, Billion Dollar Babies, School''s Out, and Love It to Death-packed with electrifying riffs, raw energy, and Alice''s signature storytelling. From the venomous bite of Black Mamba to the rebellious charge of Wild Ones, and the soft, haunting melodies of See You on the Other Side, every track feels like a lost rock ''n'' roll classic.','7/25/2025',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4425489-3389381.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181639,'the unraveling of puptheband|pup|pup|lp','The Unraveling Of Puptheband [Explicit Content]','PUP','PUP','LP','RISE160976.1','4050538759488',20.94000000000000127,20.94000000000000127,'42425656','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053875948','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Pup return with their fourth album, The Unraveling of Puptheband, which finds the Toronto outfit teaming up with Sarah Tudzin (Illuminati Hotties), Kathryn McCauhey (Nobro), Mel St. Pierre (Casper Skulls) and Erik Paulson (Remo Drive), as well as producer Peter Katis. "It''s hands down my favourite PUP record, and I don''t think it could''ve been made under any other circumstances," bandleader Stefan Babcock said. "As the weeks passed, we seemed less and less rational, objective, and sane. You can hear the band start to fall off the cliff, and because of that, I think this record is our truest and most genuine to date. There is nothing more Pup than a slow and inevitable descent into self-destruction." The 12-track collection is introduced by the singles "Robot Writes a Love Song," "Waiting," and "Grim Reaping."','4/1/2022',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4058516-2791393.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181640,'too fast for love|motley crue|motley crue|lp','Too Fast For Love','Motley Crue','Motley Crue','LP','BGRT782592.1','4050538782592',20.28000000000000113,20.28000000000000113,'42745952','2026-11-10 23:55:16','2026-11-10 23:55:16','/405053878259',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Too Fast for Love is M├╢tley Cr├╝e''s debut studio album released in 1981. While the album only reached number 77 on the Billboard 200 album chart in the United States, it would ultimately reach platinum status. The songs "Stick to Your Guns" and "Live Wire" were released as singles from the album.','7/22/2022',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4104272-2843046.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181641,'back to earth|cat yusuf stevens|cat yusuf stevens|lp','Back To Earth','Cat (Yusuf) Stevens','Cat (Yusuf) Stevens','LP','DKHR162832.1','4050538899665',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'45018466','2026-11-10 23:55:17','2026-11-10 23:55:17','/405053889966','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Lenticular Cover)',0,NULL,'4/11/2025',0.75,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181642,'alpha games lp|bloc party|bloc party|lp','Alpha Games   LP','Bloc Party','Bloc Party','LP','IFMC753554.1','4050538753554',21.94000000000000127,21.94000000000000127,'42300465','2026-11-10 23:55:17','2026-11-10 23:55:17','/405053875355',NULL,0,'ΓÇ£Alpha Games was conceived on the road, playing in front of amazing crowds on our last tour and then brought to life with the fire and the frustrations of 2020,ΓÇ¥ says Kele Okereke on Bloc PartyΓÇÖs first new album in seven years. The first Bloc Party album written and recorded as this four piece; adding the musicality of Justin Harris (bass) and the unbridled energy and power of Louise Bartle on the drums to capture the spark of their live shows and to deliver the most exciting Bloc Party album yet. ΓÇ£We wanted to can what was happening at those massive gigs in 2019, to showcase what Louise can do, what Russell is capable of and most importantly the electricity coming off the audience. We knew that Nick & Adam were the right choice of producers to do that and the result feels like fire in a bottle.ΓÇ¥ Produced by Nick Launay & Adam Greenspan (Nick Cave, Yeah Yeah Yeahs, IDLES), the 12 tracks of Alpha Games veer from the intense & confrontational (Traps, Day Drinker) to melodic and introspective (If We Get Caught, By Any Means Necessary) and marks a new and important chapter in one of musicΓÇÖs most important voices in Kele Okereke and important bands in Bloc Party. BLOC PARTY / ALPHA GAMES     LP ΓÇô Indie Exclusive','4/29/2022',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4036469-2772382.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181643,'girls girls girls|motley crue|motley crue|lp','Girls, Girls, Girls [Explicit Content]','Motley Crue','Motley Crue','LP','BGRT782561.1','4050538782561',20.28000000000000113,20.28000000000000113,'42745983','2026-11-10 23:55:17','2026-11-10 23:55:17','/405053878256','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Girls, Girls, Girls is M├╢tley Cr├╝e''s fourth studio album originally released in 1987. The album contains the hit singles "Girls, Girls, Girls", "You''re All I Need", and the MTV favorite "Wild Side". It was the band''s final collaboration with producer Tom Werman, who had produced the band''s two previous albums, Shout at the Devil and Theatre of Pain. Like those albums, Girls, Girls, Girls would achieve quadruple platinum status, selling over 4 million copies and reaching number two on the Billboard 200. The album marked a change to a blues-rock influenced sound, which was met with positive reception.','7/22/2022',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4104269-2842987.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181644,'tell em i m gone|cat yusuf stevens|cat yusuf stevens|lp','Tell ''em I''m Gone','Cat ( Yusuf ) Stevens','Cat ( Yusuf ) Stevens','LP','DKHR163443.1','4050538899696',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45658631','2026-11-10 23:55:17','2026-11-10 23:55:17','/405053889969','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Yusuf/Cat Stevens - "Tell ''Em I''m Gone!" - Tell ''Em I''m Gone was produced with the legendary Rick Rubin and sees Yusuf explore some of his bluesier influences. In many ways, the album ties in with Foreigner and Numbers in that he is temporarily putting aside his more recognizable folky sound to indulge in other musical traditions that have had a significant impact upon him. True fans may be aware that Leadbelly has always been one of Yusuf''s favorite artists and this is now overwhelmingly evident in his music. Alongside it''s original compositions, Tell ''Em I''m Gone contains covers of songs that are dear to Yusuf such as Edgar Winter''s "Dying to Live," Luther Dixon/Al Smith''s "Big Boss Man," and a bluesy reworking of Jimmie Davies/Charles Mitchell''s "You Are My Sunshine." Sonically, the album feels authentic to the blues, but the presence of Yusuf''s unique musical sensibilities is unmistakable. The album cover was designed by Yusuf and illustrated by the artist William Stout. Available on yellow vinyl','12/5/2025',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4469999-3473838.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
