INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181739,'an ending in itself|sleeping with sirens|sleeping with sirens|lp','An Ending In Itself','Sleeping with Sirens','Sleeping with Sirens','LP','RISE243250.1','4099964248067',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46188779','2026-11-10 23:55:24','2026-11-10 23:55:24','/409996424806','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Black, White, Red)',0,'Iconic alternative rock band Sleeping with Sirens release their new album, An Ending In Itself. Produced by Will Yip (Turnstile, Circa Survive, Movements), the band''s 8th studio album represents both a homecoming and recoming for them as they revive the restless spirit of their classic sounds with the nuanced experience of recent years. The album is described as both a culmination and continuation, compelling the recent emotional, thematic arc of How It Feels To Be Lost and Complete Collapse while reconnecting with the spirit that the first propelled the band forward. The band - Kellin Quinn (vocals), Nick Martin (guitar), Justin Hills (bass), Matty Best (drums), and newest addition Tony Pizzuti (guitar) - continues to hone it''s signature sound while boldly exploring new creative frontiers. Pressed on black, white & red swirl vinyl. Indie Exclusive.','6/12/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4510880-3600665.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181740,'my kinda party|jason aldean|jason aldean|lp','My Kinda Party','Jason Aldean','Jason Aldean','LP','BBRM247444.1','4099964258387',25.94999999999999929,25.94999999999999929,'46427519','2026-11-10 23:55:24','2026-11-10 23:55:24','/409996425838',NULL,0,'Jason Aldean -"My Kinda Party" / My Kinda Party is the fourth studio album from Jason Aldean, released in 2010 and widely considered his commercial breakthrough. Blending country with arena-ready rock and a touch of hip-hop influence, the album features massive hits like "Dirt Road Anthem," "Don''t You Wanna Stay," and the title track. It marked a turning point in Aldean''s career, expanding his audience and helping define the modern country sound of the 2010s. First time on vinyl! BMG Rights Management; BBR Music Group; Country; Catalog.','9/18/2026',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4527621-3671482.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181741,'plagues|the devil wears prada|the devil wears prada|lp','Plagues','The Devil Wears Prada','The Devil Wears Prada','LP','RISE247947.1','4099964267150',21.10000000000000143,21.10000000000000143,'46585585','2026-11-10 23:55:24','2026-11-10 23:55:24','/409996426715','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Pink, Black)',0,'A breakthrough release in modern metalcore, Plagues expanded the band''s audience with heavier songwriting, technical musicianship, and memorable hooks.','10/23/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4541549-3734241.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181742,'the best of a flock of seagulls yellow|a flock of seagulls|a flock of seagulls|lp','The Best Of A Flock Of Seagulls (yellow)','A Flock of Seagulls','A Flock of Seagulls','LP','BGRT248906.1','4099964282399',32.25,32.25,'46598370','2026-11-10 23:55:24','2026-11-10 23:55:24','/409996428239','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Remastered)',0,'A Flock of Seagulls -"The Best of A Flock of Seagulls" This comprehensive Best Of product is a celebration of an iconic English new wave band who were as alien as they were playful, as nostalgic as they were futuristic. Synonymous with the MTV generation and part of the Second British Invasion, referenced in Pulp Fiction, Friends, and featured in Grand Theft Auto, A Flock Of Seagulls'' sound is marked by expansive sonic landscapes that evoke themes of futurism, isolation, romance, and exploration. This Vinyl LP includes 15 of the band''s biggest and best-loved hits, all newly remastered. 4-page booklet included.','11/20/2026',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4542868-3717110.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181743,'kids|noga erez|noga erez|lp','Kids','Noga Erez','Noga Erez','LP','CTSG50248A.1','4250506837105',22.0,22.0,'41314586','2026-11-10 23:55:24','2026-11-10 23:55:24','/425050683710','(Sticker / Stickers, Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing. Includes digital download. Musician and producer, Noga Erez finds her feet on KIDS, her bold second album for City Slang made with her creative and life partner Ori Rousso. Building from the raw politics of her 2017 debut, Off The Radar, KIDS moves closer to home while retaining her signature smarts and swagger. It''s earworms and crisp productions are locked around lyrics that deal with the personal and the political; mortality and loss; war and peace, insecurity and ambition. As with Off The Radar, Erez never pulls her punches, whether that''s with politics or production. After a series of singles, KIDS comes packed with chart-worthy outspoken pop anthems for the 21st century. KIDS replaces the shadow and fury of Off The Radar with neon brights, bold lines, in determinedly audacious and confident productions that swap ferocity for bounce, gloomy moods for fierce swagger. Erez has truly found her style, growing into a crisp bombastic sound she crafts with Rousso, that contains tension and release, anxiety and remedy, and masterly melodic licks in swipes of stomping brass, all wrapped around Erez''s versatile vocals that quick-switch from clipped flow to smoky purr; from stadium chorus to street-ready beats.','3/26/2021',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/3924413-3075500.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
