INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181828,'cornucopia live|bjork|bjork|lp','Cornucopia: Live','Bjork','Bjork','LP','OLI2008.1','5016958108397',43.64000000000000056,43.64000000000000056,'45419447','2026-11-10 23:55:31','2026-11-10 23:55:31','/501695810839',NULL,0,'Following the global cinematic release of Bj├╢rk: Cornucopia, the visionary live experience is now set for its first-ever physical release The film is produced by S101 and Snowstorm, in association with Level Forward (also acting as Impact Producer). Executive producers include Derek Birkett; Adrienne Becker and Roger Clark for Level Forward; and Dav├¡├░ Helgason for Foobar.vc. Co-executive producers are Ian Wheeler for Talkhouse; Susan Lord and Brogan Bamborgan for Level Forward; Benjamin Ratz for Foobar.vc; and Sigrid Dyekj├ªr. Talking about the film Bj├╢rk said: ΓÇ£I am so thrilled to share the film for my concert Cornucopia with you. This has been a long journey with hundreds of people helping. I am so beyond enormously grateful to every single one of them. I feel the modern concert film is a matriarchally friendly construct, welcomed in the current climateΓÇöwhere female musicians can share their worlds uncorrupted.ΓÇ¥ Directed by ├ìsold Uggad├│ttir, Cornucopia is Bj├╢rkΓÇÖs most ambitious live production to date ΓÇö a powerful fusion of nature, technology, and sound. The film features creative direction, musical arrangements, production, and performance by Bj├╢rk, showcasing her singular vision throughout. Visual co-creative direction is led by James Merry, with additional contributions from a stellar lineup of artists: Andrew Thomas Huang, Gabr├¡ela Fri├░riksd├│ttir, Pierre-Alain Giraud, Nick Knight, Tobias Gremmler, and Warren Du Preez & Nick Thornton-Jones. Their boundary-pushing visuals merge seamlessly with Bj├╢rkΓÇÖs avant-garde sonic landscapes. The production also features the talents of producers Sara Nassim and Kat Mansoor, with Bergur ├₧├│risson serving as musical director and re-recording mixer. Artur Tort provides the filmΓÇÖs stunning cinematography, while editing comes from Walter Mauriot. BJORK / CORNUCOPIA: LIVE','10/24/2025',1.939999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4448849-3430489.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
