INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181921,'air moon safari the athens concert|air||lp','Air Moon Safari: The Athens Concert','Air',NULL,'LP','RHI416233.1','502685416233',21.73999999999999843,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:36','2026-11-10 23:55:36','/air-air-moon-safari-the-athens-concert/502685416233',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181922,'bigger than all of us|above beyond|above beyond|lp','Bigger Than All Of Us','Above & Beyond','Above & Beyond','LP','ANJB160.1','5039060332870',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'45445392','2026-11-10 23:55:36','2026-11-10 23:55:36','/503906033287',NULL,0,'"This album is us appreciating how amazing this thing we have is. The realization of how lucky we are that we get to be part of something like this for 25 years, and to have built a community that cares for each other in the way it does. It''s not about any of us individually. When we all work together to make something happen, something bigger happens." - Jono, Paavo and Tony - Above & Beyond. If much of the mindset and mantra behind Above & Beyond over the last quarter of a century has been born from the idea of connection, then their fifth artist album ''Bigger Than All Of Us'' is best summed up in one word: reconnection. It''s been seven years since Jono Grant, Paavo Siljam├ñki and Tony McGuinness released their fourth electronic album, Common Ground. A #3 on the Billboard charts - an achievement that speaks to the British band''s huge, arena-to-amphitheatre scale profile in America, a level of success replicated in pretty much every other corner of the world. The time since has seen a series of projects come to life both collectively and individually: 2019''s ambient, yoga-and-meditation-friendly album Flow State, streamed over 400 million times worldwide; a series of club ready instrumentals under the Tranquility Base moniker; radio records ''See The End'', ''Over Now'' and ''Crazy Love''. In the meantime, the band embarked on personal projects outside of the Above & Beyond framework. Grant collaborated with long time friend Daren Tate on 2022''s self-titled synthwave JODA album. In 2023 Siljam├ñki, reprised his P.O.S. alias, releasing dance floor focussed album Deeper Tales. Last year, McGuinness dug in his own crates for Salt, an album based on a studio-freshened selection of emotional singer-songwriter compositions originally written as the ''90s rave and Britpop fever-dreams faded. A worldwide touring schedule, their weekly Group Therapy radio show, and overseeing a family of iconic dance labels, Anjunabeats, Anjunadeep and, most recently, Anjunachill - it''s never quiet in the world of Above & Beyond. But it''s the spirit of music uniting us all championed through their studio albums ''Tri-State'', ''Group Therapy'', '' We Are All We Need'' and ''Common Ground'' that has been their most enduring appeal. Real life stories of hope, heartbreak and healing that bring together dance musics'' biggest global community. "There are songs on here that have stood the test of time in our little world and have had a new life breathed into them by the process that we''ve adopted. But they''re classic Above & Beyond songs, and I think they speak to the huge, worldwide effect that Above & Beyond has. A worldwide meaning. A worldwide connection." - Above & Beyond','10/17/2025',1.139999999999999902,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4451181-3436494.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181923,'what s the story morning glory|oasis|oasis|lp','(What''s The Story) Morning Glory?','Oasis','Oasis','LP','BBRH151.1','5051961151053',63.53000000000000113,63.53000000000000113,'45345029','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505196115105','(Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Newly mixed by Noel Gallagher, this brand new Unplugged version of Acquiesce is the 1st track taken from the forthcoming Deluxe 30th Anniversary Edition of the monumental album (What''s The Story) Morning Glory? Originally released as b-side to Some Might Say, the band''s first number 1 single. Released as anticipation reaches fever pitch for global Oasis Live ''25 tour which starts this week, which saw over 10M fans from 158 countries applying for tickets.','10/3/2025',2.080000000000000071,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4441642-3456000.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181924,'what s the story morning glory crystal clear vinyl|oasis|oasis|lp','(What''s The Story) Morning Glory?   (Crystal Clear Vinyl)','Oasis','Oasis','LP','BBRH151A.1','5051961151091',55.28000000000000113,55.28000000000000113,'45345074','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505196115109','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Cast No Shadow'' Inspired Crystal Clear Vinyl Oasis (What''s the Story) Morning Glory? (30th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) Indie Exclusive 3LP (Crystal Clear Vinyl) (What''s the Story) Morning Glory? [Deluxe 30th Anniversary Edition] features newly unplugged versions of five classic tracks: "Cast No Shadow," "Morning Glory," "Wonderwall," "Acquiesce" and "Champagne Supernova," all newly mixed by Noel Gallagher. Available on limited edition 3LP formats, including indie exclusive "Cast No Shadow" inspired crystal clear 3LP. All formats will include the 2014 remastered version of the album alongside the new bonus versions. 30th Anniversary Deluxe Edition - Limited Edition - Indie Exclusive - "Cast No Shadow" Crystal Clear Vinyl - 3LP - Unplugged Versions of 5 Tracks Newly Mixed by Noel Gallagher - 2014 Remastered Version of the Original Album','10/3/2025',2.129999999999999894,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4441644-3437235.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181925,'archangel|kettama|kettama|lp','Archangel','Kettama','Kettama','LP','SCYD9347X.1','5053760149347',31.83999999999999986,31.83999999999999986,'46146366','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505376014934','(Colored Vinyl, Limited Edition, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'On October 3rd, Kettama unveiled his highly anticipated debut album Archangel. Cementing the moment with his biggest London headline show selling out Brixton Academy, Kettama followed this feat with subsequent sold-out tours across Europe, North America and Australia. The album debut received overwhelming critical acclaim by global editorial platforms including Billboard, Rolling Stone UK and The Guardian as well as reaching multiple national and international chart positions including #1 Dance Album and #6 in the Independent Album UK Charts, alongside a Top 10 Album Debuts in Australia''s Charts. Real name Evan Campbell, the Galway born, London based artist has spent the best part of the last decade refining his sound to exist in a powerful yet delicate state: a product of his many influences, ranging from 90s hard-house and trance, to hip-hop and beyond. Archangel is an elevated testament to the young artist''s maturity in sound, a magnum opus of 15 tracks encompassing a plethora of melodic textures flexing Kettama''s production dexterity; while also celebrating the fusion of his sonic world with that of equally pioneering collaborators Interplanetary Criminal, Prospa, Clouds, DJ HEARTSTRING, S├╕lv, Shady Nasty, Fred again.. and more. The record consistently overtook airwaves of international radio stations and counts the world''s leading tastemakers such as Jack Saunders, Danny Howard, Sarah Story and Tim Sweeney as firm champions. An echoing roar of support can be found across the digital landscape with countless videos that capture the excitement from fans old and new, in response to Kettama''s affable persona and raw sonic identity. Spreading his wings across the globe with an unrelenting DJ touring schedule including appearances at Coachella, Glastonbury, Seismic, Creamfields, Arc Festival, Portola, and many other premier events, Kettama is now a name that inspires euphoric frenzy amongst his widescale international audience. In the lead up of his album release, Kettama sold out 8,500 tickets a month in advance in his home territory and undertook generational feats such as playing some of the largest DJ shows to date in the UK including a b2b with Chris Stussy to 20,000 punters in Belfast. The momentum continues in 2026 with over 26,900 tickets sold on his forthcoming US tour of 8 dates across March - May, including a 15,000 capacity takeover of Factory Town during Miami Music Week, LIV Las Vegas residency, two Coachella performances and a slew of sold out headline shows in San Francisco, San Diego, Austin, El Paso, Portland, Seattle, Boston, Chicago, Atlanta, Detroit. Adding to the excitement, Kettama follows-up his debut 16-week Ibiza residency in 2025, with a subsequent 9-date residency across June & July 2026. Bringing the sounds of his native ''G-Town'' to the world, turning heads with every evolution and expression of his art, Archangel marked a crucial culmination in Kettama''s development - a debut album which engraves the young artist''s craft within the cultural fabric of electronic music''s most respected legacy acts.','5/15/2026',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/4506732-3562834.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181926,'be here now|oasis|oasis|lp','Be Here Now','Oasis','Oasis','LP','BBRH85.1','5051961085013',30.21999999999999887,30.21999999999999887,'31456692','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505196108501','(Remastered)',0,'Double heavyweight vinyl LP pressing includes digital download containing rarities and b-side bonus content including the highly anticipated Mustique Demos. Digitally remastered and expanded edition of the third studio album from Britpop legends Oasis originally released in 1997. Oasis had achieved worldwide success with their 1994 debut album Definitely Maybe and 1995 follow up (What''s the Story) Morning Glory? The third album was highly anticipated by both fans and music critics. On the first day of release, Be Here Now sold over 424,000 copies, becoming the fastest-selling album in British chart history, while initial reviews were overwhelmingly positive. As of 2008, the album had sold eight million copies worldwide.','10/14/2016',1.260000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/3092876-2614296.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181927,'cracker island|gorillaz|gorillaz|lp','Cracker Island','Gorillaz','Gorillaz','LP','PRW712528.1','5054197199738',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'42992684','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419719973',NULL,0,'''Cracker Island'' is the eight studio album from Gorillaz, an energetic, upbeat, genre-expansive collection of 10 tracks featuring yet another stellar line-up of artist collaborators: Thundercat, Tame Impala, Bad Bunny, Stevie Nicks, Adeleye Omotayo, Bootie Brown and Beck. Recorded in London and LA earlier this year, it is produced by Gorillaz, Remi Kabaka Jr. And eight-time Grammy Award-winning producer / multi-instrumentalist / songwriter extraordinaire Greg Kurstin. Title track ''Cracker Island'' kickstarted the new campaign this Summer hitting the charts across the globe with a top 10 video racking up 10M views in 10 days. The virtual band exploded onto TikTok gaining over 2.1 m followers in the space of a few months where they continue to innovate, taking virtual characters where no character has been before','2/24/2023',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4134110-2880380.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181928,'boatshoes|brian ennals blockhead|brian ennals blockhead|lp','Boatshoes','Brian Ennals & Blockhead','Brian Ennals & Blockhead','LP','PTOL63.1','5053760152576',17.53999999999999915,17.53999999999999915,'46591395','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505376015257',NULL,0,'Veteran NYC producer Blockhead teams up with rising Baltimore MC Brian Ennals (usually seen in his lauded partnership with Infinity Knives) for vital, skillsharing new album Boatshoes, a canny and celebratory ride through everything that makes these artists great.','10/9/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4542184-3713496.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181929,'subtract|ed sheeran|ed sheeran|lp','- (Subtract)','Ed Sheeran','Ed Sheeran','LP','ATL70577.1','5054197170577',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'43369775','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419717057','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Limited yellow colored vinyl LP pressing. 2023 release. An album that revisits Ed Sheeran''s singer/songwriter roots, and one that was written against a backdrop of personal grief and hope, "-" presents one of the biggest stars on the planet at his most vulnerable and honest. Growing up with the likes of Damian Rice, Bruce Springsteen and Bob Dylan playing on repeat in his parents'' house - artists that his dad, John, introduced him to - "-" was always on Ed''s horizon. Yet as the songs and writing process took on a whole new meaning and direction after a series of hard-hitting events impacted Ed''s world in 2022, one thing that remained untouched was his strong desire to make a record anchored in his love of singer/songwriter compositions. And now, as he gears-up for the release of his most soul-baring work to date, "-" serves as a timely reminder for why Sheeran remains one of the most gifted lyricists of his generation; an artist who breaks down his own experiences for fans to seek comfort and belonging. "-" is the result of Sheeran pushing the boundaries of his songcraft, as he delivers the most profound songwriting of his career. Teaming-up with Aaron Dessner (The National) on writing and production after the pair joined forces following an introduction from mutual friend Taylor Swift, Ed and Aaron began crafting the album in February last year. Writing over 30 songs during their month-long studio stint, the album''s tracks are seamlessly tied together by exquisite production from paired back, folk-leaning textures to bolder, full-band/orchestral arrangements.','5/5/2023',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4192065-2957335.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181930,'actual life 3 january 1 september 9 2022 clear vinyl import|fred again|fred again|lp','Actual Life 3 (January 1-September 9 2022) - Clear Vinyl [Import]','Fred Again','Fred Again','LP','WETL9743999.1','5054197439995',23.26999999999999958,23.26999999999999958,'43394203','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419743999','(Clear Vinyl, Canada - Import)',0,'Fred Again.. returns with the third in his series of Actual Life albums ''Actual Life 3 (January 1 - September 9 2022)''. Fred''s latest single ''Turn On The Lights again..'', a collaboration with dance music giants Swedish House Mafia and featuring eminent US rapper Future is his highest charting single in the UK to date, set to eclipse his breakthrough hit Marea (we''ve lost dancing) this week on the OCC chart.','4/7/2023',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4195729-2968120.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181931,'crash|charli xcx|charli xcx|lp','Crash','Charli XCX','Charli XCX','LP','ATL132902.1','5054197132902',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'44178567','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419713290',NULL,0,'Crash is the fifth studio album by singer and songwriter Charli XCX. Visuals for the album include "femme fatale powers and a multitude of dark spells and curses" as well as signature nods to both cars and car crashes.','3/18/2022',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4151440-2910018.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181932,'a head full of dreams|coldplay|coldplay|lp','A Head Full Of Dreams','Coldplay','Coldplay','LP','ATL607448.1','5054197607448',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'44507787','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419760744',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. A Head Full of Dreams is the 7th studio album by Coldplay. The album produced by Rik Simpson and Stargate includes collaborations with Beyonce, Noel Gallagher, Tove Lo, Khatia Buniatishvili and Merry Clayton. The album is manufactured on black recycled vinyl and includes the singles Adventure of a Lifetime, Hymn for the Weekend, Everglow and Up & Up.','11/8/2024',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4358684-3204502.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181933,'modern life is rubbish 30th anniversary edition|blur|blur|lp','Modern Life Is Rubbish (30th Anniversary Edition)','Blur','Blur','LP','WB543296.1','5054197543296',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'43865833','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419754329','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Anniversary Edition)',0,'To celebrate National Album Day, Blur will be releasing a special colored vinyl edition of Modern Life Is Rubbish in line with the record''s 30th anniversary. The record will be released on transparent orange 12" vinyl andwill be out on October 27th.','10/27/2023',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4254809-3049199.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181934,'home 10th anniversary edition|rudimental|rudimental|lp','Home (10th Anniversary Edition)','Rudimental','Rudimental','LP','ATL724831.1','5054197388651',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'43421640','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419738865','(Anniversary Edition)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Includes four bonus remixes. New anniversary edition of British drum and bass group debut album, ''Home''. The album features hit singles ''Feel The Love'' and "Waiting All Night''. In celebration of 10 years since the original release of Rudimental''s ''Home'', this anniversary edition includes 4 new exclusive remixes never previously heard.','4/28/2023',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4199374-3218744.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181935,'hombres g import|hombres g|hombres g|lp','Hombres G [Import]','Hombres G','Hombres G','LP','WETL9756089.1','5054197560897',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'44007706','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419756089','(Holland - Import)',0,'1985 debut album from the Spanish rock band. The band recorded "Venezia", a new version of the previous single, and the soon-to-be hit, "Devu├⌐lveme a mi chica". Among the album''s ballads was a cover of Alice Cooper''s "I Never Cry", which they named "No llorar├⌐". They also adapted Vladimir Cosma''s song "Reality" from the motion picture, La Boum, and called it "Sin ti".','2/9/2024',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/4274764-3092005.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181936,'definitely maybe|oasis|oasis|lp','Definitely Maybe','Oasis','Oasis','LP','BBRH125.1','5051961125054',63.53000000000000113,63.53000000000000113,'44411466','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/5051961125054','(Oversize Item Split, Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'4 LP Set. 30th Anniversary edition. Oasis'' debut album ''Definitely Maybe'' celebrates it''s 30th anniversary this August. The fastest-ever selling debut in the UK on release, this seminal album marked the point when Oasis became a cultural phenomenon. Including the classic singles ''Supersonic'', ''Live Forever'' and ''Cigarettes & Alcohol'', it''s songs sound as fresh and relevant as they did in 1994. Limited-Edition Deluxe edition includes 2014 remastered album plus the previously unreleased and discarded original recording session from Monnow Valley along with outtakes from Sawmills Studios plus a demo of Sad Song featuring Liam''s vocal - all recently mixed for this release by Noel Gallagher and Callum Marinho.','8/30/2024',2.569999999999999841,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4345271-3206759.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181937,'duran duran 2010 remaster|duran duran|duran duran|lp','Duran Duran (2010 Remaster)','Duran Duran','Duran Duran','LP','RPLH640865.1','5054197640865',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'44385392','2026-11-10 23:55:37','2026-11-10 23:55:37','/505419764086','(Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The debut album was originally released in 1981 and includes the hits ''Planet Earth'' and ''Girls On Film''. It''s considered a significant album in the new-wave and synth-pop movements of the early 80s.','7/19/2024',0.4000000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4341881-3198698.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
