INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181951,'cocoa sugar|young fathers|young fathers|lp','Cocoa Sugar','Young Fathers','Young Fathers','LP','NJAT248A.1','5054429131963',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'35709114','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442913196','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Young Fathers will release their third studio album, Cocoa Sugar, on March 2nd, 2018 via Ninja Tune. The UK-based & Mercury Prize-winning trio recently shared their latest track & video ''LORD'', which was described as ''Spectacular'' by FADER, Crack, and Clash & earned praise by Stereogum, Paste, NME, Complex & more. The band will then return to the USA with a run of shows this Spring. Following their work on the score of Danny Boyle''s Trainspotting 2, Young Fathers deliver their third and most ambitious record to date. See How Fee Fi In My View Turn Lord Tremolo Wow Border Girl Holy Ghost Wire Toy Picking You','3/9/2018',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/6/1/1/3761165.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181952,'superdream|big wild|big wild|lp','Superdream','Big Wild','Big Wild','LP','CNRR169A.1','5054429154832',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'42388012','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442915483','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red, Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited red colored vinyl LP pressing. Includes digital download. As Big Wild, producer and composer Jackson Stell crafts lush soundscapes and sweeping melodies that challenge the status quo of electronic music. A former hip-hop producer, previously going by J Beatz in his native Massachusetts, Stell launched the Big Wild project in 2012 following a life-altering trip to Big Sur, California. His musical muse and spiritual home at the time of it''s inception, California was the ultimate inspiration that fueled the Big Wild sound: atmospheric electronic music powered by a wide-spanning emotional range. The Big Wild moniker itself is a direct reflection of the state''s natural glory and open spaces. Stell now takes his journey to the next chapter via Superdream, his debut album as Big Wild.','3/11/2022',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4050557-2804228.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181953,'radical optimism clear vinyl|dua lipa|dua lipa|lp','Radical Optimism  (Clear Vinyl)','Dua Lipa','Dua Lipa','LP','WB726547.1','5054197943386',23.98999999999999844,23.98999999999999844,'44246549','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505419794338','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Radical Optimism (Clear Vinyl) by Dua Lipa / Inspired by Dua''s own self-discovery, Radical Optimism is an album that taps into the pure joy and happiness of having clarity in situations that once seemed impossible to face. The hard goodbyes and vulnerable beginnings that previously threatened to crush your soul, become milestones as you choose optimism and start to move with grace through the chaos. Infused with the energy of Dua''s hometown, London, the attitude of the album embodies the rawness, honesty, confidence and freedom of ''90s Britpop. Radical Optimism transports it''s listener to a dreamy pop world rich in musicality, lyrically unapologetic and sonically liberating. The 3x GRAMMY and 7x Brit Award-winning global pop powerhouse worked with a team of core collaborators throughout the project including Caroline Ailin, Danny L. Harle, Tobias Jesso Jr. And Kevin Parker.','5/3/2024',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4321159-3133446.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181954,'usb volume 1|fred again|fred again|lp','USB (Volume 1) [Explicit Content]','Fred Again','Fred Again','LP','ATL957161.1','5054197957161',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'44492731','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505419795716','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing.','7/26/2024',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4356066-3199542.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181955,'the last goodbye|odesza|odesza|lp','The Last Goodbye','Odesza','Odesza','LP','NJAT280B.1','5054429170023',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'45135118','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442917002','(Colored Vinyl, Green, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'Odesza are making their Grammy-nominated album "The Last Goodbye" available on a dark green LP, Latin America exclusive LP. ''The Last Goodbye'' was one of 2022''s most celebrated electronic releases, landing at #2 on the Top Dance/Electronic Albums chart and #11 on the Billboard 200. Billboard named ''The Last Goodbye'' one of the "25 Best Dance Albums of 2022", calling it "their most expansive and intricate record to date... The Last Goodbye is grand, soft, hard, memorable, emotional and just unmistakably Odesza," while Associated Press said it''s "an indescribable, immersive listening experience". The album, which includes collabs with Bettye LaVette, The Knocks, ├ôlafur Arnalds, Julianna Barwick, Izzy Bizu, Charlie Houston, L├Ñpsley, & MARO, was also the focal point for a groundbreaking North America tour. "The Last Goodbye Tour" sold over 450k tickets throughout it''s amphitheater run with numerous sold-out, multi-night runs including in their hometown of Seattle at Climate Pledge Arena, LA''s The Forum, and New York''s Forest Hills Stadium and more (making them the first electronic artists to attempt such a tour). The recent tour also earned high praise with a Pollstar cover feature proclaiming that "Odesza makes history", while Billboard added "Odesza is meant to be seen, and heard, live", and the Seattle Times called them "a ticket selling, dance music force that raised the live performance bar for electronic artists." Symphonic, vast, and emotionally stirring, A1. This Version Of You (feat. Julianna Barwick) A2. Wide Awake (feat. Charlie Houston) A3. Love Letter (feat. The Knocks) A4. Behind The Sun B1. Forgive Me (feat. Izzy Bizu) B2. North Garden B3. Better Now (feat. MARO) C1. The Last Goodbye (feat. Bettye LaVette) C2. All My Life C3. Equal (feat. Lapsley) D1. Healing Grid D2. I Can''t Sleep D3. Light Of Day (feat. Olafur Arnalds)','5/5/2023',1.219999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4423043-3524708.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181956,'moment apart|odesza|odesza|lp','Moment Apart','Odesza','Odesza','LP','CNRR118A.1','5054429119152',25.62999999999999901,25.62999999999999901,'33096629','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442911915',NULL,0,'Odesza (Harrison Mills, Clayton Knight) is one of the most celebrated groups in electronic music, winning over fans online and at their consistently sold-out live shows. Today, they announced their new 16-track album ''A Moment Apart'' out September 8 on Counter Records (a Ninja Tune imprint) and a world tour to immediately follow. ''A Moment Apart'' represents Odesza''s growth, delivering a more mature sound through weighted atmospheres, shimmering synth lines and familiar feelings of nostalgia, optimism, and hope. The album''s featured guests include Leon Bridges, Regina Spektor, and RY X, creating an eclectic mix that showcases Odesza''s dynamic range.','9/8/2017',1.239999999999999992,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/5/4/9/3659452.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181957,'ants from up there|black country new road|black country new road|lp','Ants From Up There','Black Country, New Road','Black Country, New Road','LP','NJAT278.1','5054429151428',22.0,22.0,'42151746','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442915142','(Booklet, 140 Gram Vinyl, Black, Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'Double vinyl LP box set. Includes booklet and digital download. Contains bonus live material. 2022 release. Black Country, New Road release their second album. On Ants From Up There, the band has harnessed the momentum from their debut and run full pelt into their second. They manage to strike a skilful balance between feeling like a bold stylistic overhaul of what came before, as well as a natural progression. Their debut For The First Time was a certain 2021 Album of the Year, having received ecstatic reviews from publications including as NPR, Stereogum, Pitchfork, The Fader, Crack, Uncut, The Quietus, Loud & Quiet, The Face, Paste, The Needle Drop, DIY, NME, Clash and fans alike, as well as recently being shortlisted for the UK''s prestigious Mercury Music Prize. The album made a significant dent on the UK Albums Chart where it landed at #4 in it''s first week, as well as breaking into multiple Billboard Charts. For The First Time melded klezmer, post-rock, indie and an often intense spoken word delivery. On Ants From Up There, they have expanded on this unique concoction to create a singular sonic middle ground that traverses classical minimalism, indie-folk, pop, alt rock and a distinct tone that is already unique to the band.','2/4/2022',1.360000000000000097,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/4020727-2791795.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181958,'fragments|bonobo|bonobo|lp','Fragments','Bonobo','Bonobo','LP','NJAT279A.1','5054429152951',33.0,33.0,'42138594','2026-11-10 23:55:39','2026-11-10 23:55:39','/505442915295','(Clear Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, 140 Gram Vinyl, Digital Download Card)',0,'Fragments is the most emotionally intense record that Simon Green has ever had to make. It''s no surprise that it''s also his masterpiece. The album features Jamila Woods, Joji, Kadhja Bonet, Jordan Rakei, O''Flynn and Miguel Atwood-Ferguson. Born first out of fragments of ideas and experimentation, the album ultimately was fused together in a burst of creativity fueled by both collaboration and Green''s escape into the wild. ΓÇïΓÇïThe artwork for Fragments is by Neil Krug who returns after creating the art for 2017''s Migration. Fragments is a series of 12 sonic affirmations, featuring some of the hardest and most hip-shaking grooves that Green has ever created. The ballads are perfectly placed throughout; they capture a world in flux and glow with hope. "Tides," featuring Chicagoan singer and poet Jamila Woods, acted as a catalyst, and the album began to click into place around it. "I knew I had a centrepiece, I knew how it was all going to sound," he says. Working with Miguel Atwood-Ferguson, musical themes began to emerge. Recording orchestral musicians in actual studios helped bring the songs "out of the box" even more.','1/21/2022',1.479999999999999983,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4019442-2784963.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181959,'the last goodbye|odesza|odesza|lp','The Last Goodbye','Odesza','Odesza','LP','NJAT280.1','5054429156287',23.42999999999999972,23.42999999999999972,'42576556','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442915628','(Limited Edition, 140 Gram Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'Odesza return after four years with their new album "The Last Goodbye" available on crystal clear LP, indie exclusive version crystal clear LP with limited edition print, standard CD, deluxe CD with a patch and stickers, and transparent green cassette. -Symphonic, vast, and emotionally stirring, ''The Last Goodbye'' is set to be the GRAMMY-nominated duo''s most ambitious album to date. A project rife with brightness and emotion, nostalgic yet rooted in the present, it serves as a sweeping sonic experience that speaks to themes of connection, reminiscence and the impact we impart on one another. It''s a vivid celebration of the people and moments that have left fingerprints on our existence, echoing throughout the record. "The Last Goodbye" features collaborations with L├Ñpsley, ├ôlafur Arnalds, Julianna Barwick, The Knocks, Bettye LaVette, Izzy Bizu, MARO, and Charlie Houston. -With over 5 billion total streams, Odesza have masterfully reemerged to remind the world what has made the duo of Harrison Mills and Clayton Knight cornerstones of the modern electronic landscape. Their last album ''A Moment Apart'' was not only a commercial success (going gold and debuting at no. 3 on the Billboard 200), but it also earned critical acclaim including two GRAMMY nominations and praise from the likes of NPR, Rolling Stone, Billboard, Complex, Consequence and more.-The duo has cultivated a diehard fanbase of massive proportions: known for their groundbreaking, awe-inspiring and immersive live performance, that reached 2.85m+ fans over the course of their ''A Moment Apart'' tour. They also have had headline performances at the likes of Coachella, Lollapalooza, Bumbershoot & more, as well as performed on Jimmy Kimmel Live! And Conan, and launched their own music festival SUNDARA in Riviera Maya, Mexico in 2019. A1. This Version Of You (feat. Julianna Barwick) A2. Wide Awake (feat. Charlie Houston) A3. Love Letter (feat. The Knocks) A4. Behind The Sun B1. Forgive Me (feat. Izzy Bizu) B2. North Garden B3. Better Now (feat. MARO) C1. The Last Goodbye (feat. Bettye LaVette) C2. All My Life C3. Equal (feat. Lapsley) D1. Healing Grid D2. I Can''t Sleep D3. Light Of Day (feat. Olafur Arnalds)','7/22/2022',1.219999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4080001-2863688.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181960,'anomaly|what so not|what so not|lp','Anomaly','What So Not','What So Not','LP','CNRR238.1','5054429155037',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'42738886','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442915503','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Pink, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited pink colored vinyl LP pressing. What So Not is the Gold-selling, surf-obsessed Australia-based producer Chris Emerson. What So Not returns after 4 years with his sophomore LP, bringing along an impressive list of friends and collaborators including Oliver Tree, Killer Mike, Louis The Child, M├ÿ, Captain Cuts, Herizen and more. With over 1 billion streams, 150k tickets sold in over 75 countries and collaborations with the likes of Skrillex, RL Grime, Run the Jewels, Toto, Jagwar Ma, Daniel Johns (Silverchair), San Holo, Flux Pavillion, RomeFortune, What So Not is a force to be reckoned with. Anomaly arrives as WSN''s most varied yet cohesive project yet, providing a sonic connective tissue between the worlds of dance, hip-hop, alt rock and much more. The album was created in various parts of the world: The Netherlands, Nicaragua, Germany, Australia, Atlanta (at the iconic Stankonia Studios) and Los Angeles. What each of these locations had in common was a creative ecosystem which WSN seamlessly became a part of. In every city, WSN connected with different collaborators.','9/23/2022',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4103129-2890282.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181961,'when will we land|barry can t swim|barry can t swim|lp','When Will We Land?','Barry Can''t Swim','Barry Can''t Swim','LP','NJAT291.1','5054429173130',22.0,22.0,'43578054','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442917313','(Colored Vinyl, Pink, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'Multi-faceted Scottish artist Barry Can''t Swim releases his debut album ''When Will We Land?'' on Ninja Tune, out October 20th. His broadest and most diverse project yet, the 11-track project moves from deep house to jazz, from ambience to the percussive charge of afrobeat. It''s all held together by his singular sense of purpose and that trademark vivacity; deftly finessed, it''s an album that works as a form of musical autobiography.','10/20/2023',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/4222996-3057504.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181962,'|fcukers|fcukers|lp','├âΓÇô','Fcukers','Fcukers','LP','NJAT324B.1','5054429208375',22.0,22.0,'45922824','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442920837','(140 Gram Vinyl, Digital Download Card)',0,'├╢ is the hugely anticipated debut album from New York City''s white-hot duo, Fcukers. Having quickly built a reputation for their electric live shows and irresistibly catchy hooks, Shanny Wise and Jackson Walker Lewis have gone from playing standing-room only shows at Baby''s All Right to packed out stadiums supporting Tame Impala, Justice, and Dom Dolla and selling out their own 1k+ headline shows in the space of just 2 years! Along the way they''ve played every major festival including Coachella, Glastonbury, Primavera, Lollapalooza and opened for Haim, multiple dates for LCD Soundsystem and gained a long list of including Harry Styles, Charli xcx, David Byrne, Clairo, Fontaines DC and Beck, who recently joined them on stage at their LA headline show. After 2024''s Baggy$$ EP, which spawned the band''s biggest hit "Bon Bon" as well as earworm "Homie Don''t Shake", all eyes have been firmly on the pair to find out what happens next, and Fcukers do not disappoint. A brief meeting with Kenneth Blume (FKA Kenny Beats) - fresh off producing Geese''s Getting Killed - turned into a whirlwind session at Blume''s studio, where they recorded the entirety of their new album. With 100 gecs'' Dylan Brady providing additional production on tracks across the album, and multi-Grammy-winning engineer Tom Norris (Lady Gaga, Charli xcx, The Weeknd) coming on board to mix the album. The result is 11 tracks that make you feel like you''re at the afterparty. Fcukers will follow up their album release with their first full North American headline tour and another round of summer festivals. There''s no sign of slowing down for this band continually on the rise.','3/27/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4487726-3513757.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181963,'love heart cheat code|hiatus kaiyote|hiatus kaiyote|lp','Love Heart Cheat Code','Hiatus Kaiyote','Hiatus Kaiyote','LP','BRFE144A.1','5054429192278',22.0,22.0,'44278052','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442919227','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Digital Download Card)',0,'Limited blue colored vinyl LP pressing. Includes digital download. Three time Grammy nominated Hiatus Kaiyote return with their eagerly anticipated new album Love Heart Cheat Code. The band have warmed up fans with standout single ''Everything''s Beautiful'' and what awaits is a masterfully crafted album from a band who are firing on all cylinders and totally in sync. LHCC is a mix of their classic neo-soul sound, fused with jazz, soul and rock - which is on full display on their cover of the Jefferson Airplane classic ''White Rabbit'' and a fan favorite from their live shows, ''Cinnamon Temple''. The album also includes a feature from BMO from the cult classic animated series Adventure Time (Cartoon Network/Adult Swim). Throughout the campaign the band will build a bright and vibrant world for fans to dive into, with games, artifacts, mazes and all other matter of zaniness that one can expect from Hiatus Kaiyote.','6/28/2024',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4326900-3202973.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181964,'forever howlong mixed variable color marble vinyl|new road|new road|lp','Forever Howlong - Mixed Variable Color Marble Vinyl','New Road','New Road','LP','NJAT314C.1','5054429212778',25.62999999999999901,25.62999999999999901,'46280015','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442921277','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Forever Howlong is Black Country, New Road''s first studio release since 2022''s UK #3 album Ants From Up There, which gave the band their second Top 5 UK album in 12 months alongside their Mercury Prize shortlisted debut For the first time, and follows 2023''s Live at Bush Hall, an album The Guardian claimed was a "magical resurgence" in a triumphant five-star review. Now, on studio album three, the band are once again building from the ground up in yet another miraculous musical transformation. The long-awaited new record was produced by James Ford (Fontaines D.C., Arctic Monkeys, Depeche Mode, Blur) and sees Black Country, New Road settled into a new shape in which vocal duties - and most of the song writing - is split between Tyler Hyde, Georgia Ellery, and May Kershaw. "It created a real through line for the album, having three girls singing," says Ellery. "It''s definitely very different to Ants From Up There, because of the female perspective - and the music we''ve made also compliments that." Forever Howlong is an ambitious, meticulously detailed record that includes everything from folk to prog via baroque pop and touches of alt-rock - with nods to everything from Joanna Newsom to Randy Newman via Fiona Apple and Janis Ian - yet all the while retaining that unmistakably unique sound that only this combination of musicians can come up with. Although hugely varied and expansive, the album also feels deeply cohesive and focused, as it takes three distinct voices and styles and seamlessly intersperses them into a new collective sound.','7/17/2026',1.350000000000000088,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4515681-3610324.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181965,'loner|barry can t swim|barry can t swim|lp','Loner','Barry Can''t Swim','Barry Can''t Swim','LP','NJAT312.1','5054429197518',22.0,22.0,'45063275','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442919751','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Loner / Barry Can''t Swim - Following a meteoric rise over the past couple of years, 2025 will see Barry Can''t Swim cement his place at the upper echelons of dance music with the release of sophomore album Loner. The album title sums up the philosophy which Barry went into the album making process with. Despite his gregarious presence on and off the stage, Barry himself has always been an incredibly thoughtful and introverted person. It''s only now, after the last several years of pushing himself, that he''s been able to embrace this side of his personality and present it to the world. Anticipation could not be higher for this album, Barry is not only the biggest breakthrough artist in electronic music over the past two years, he''s one of the most in-demand artists across all genres on the planet right now. Throughout 2024 Barry has been playing to record breaking audiences, selling hundreds of thousands of tickets and picking up media acclaim across continents. In support of the album release, Barry will be playing his biggest ever shows in North America and Europe and headlining festivals in the UK and Australia. All of his singles to date have yielded incredible support across radio and press, not to mention clocking up millions of streams. He has been named number three in the BBC Sound of 2025 list as well as one of Spotify''s Artists To Watch 2025. Previous album When Will We Land? was nominated for the Mercury Prize 2024 and named as an album of the year by Billboard as well as many others.','7/11/2025',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/4416327-3376208.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181966,'distracted iex black marbled smoke effect|thundercat|thundercat|lp','Distracted (IEX) Black Marbled Smoke Effect','Thundercat','Thundercat','LP','BRFE165IE.1','5054429209723',22.0,22.0,'45960086','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442920972','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Black)',0,'Black Marbled Smoke Effect Vinyl, Poster insert + designed by Neil Krug [w/ download card]. Thundercat fans rejoice! The longest album drought of his career is officially OVER. Distracted will be released on April 3, 2026 - 6 years to the day after release of his previous LP, the 2020 GRAMMY Award winning record It Is What It Is. Distracted was primarily created in close collaboration with a new creative partner for Thundercat - the super producer Greg Kurstin, known for his work with some of the biggest names in pop like Adele, Paul McCartney, Sia, Beyonc├⌐, Beck and more. The record features 15 tracks and a host of exciting collaborators including Mac Miller, A$AP Rocky, Willow Smith, Tame Impala, Channel Tres, and production from Thundercat & Greg Kurstin, Flying Lotus, Kenny Beats & more. Over the past six years, Thundercat''s been a very busy man. Beyond releasing two new tracks this past September ("I Wish I Didn''t Waste Your Time" & "Children of the Baked Potato (feat. Remi Wolf)", Thunder has collaborated with Tame Impala, Silk Sonic, Gorillaz, Justice & Yo Gabba Gabba, played bass with the Spinal Tap guys on Kimmel, won a GRAMMY Award for Best Progressive R&B Album at the 2020 GRAMMYs, has gone viral no less than 5 times on TikTok, his hit records "Funny Thing" & "Them Changes" went Platinum, toured arenas with The Red Hot Chili Peppers, and oh yeah, he made his acting debut in the Star Wars universe in The Book of Boba Fett.','4/3/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4490302-3557202.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181967,'distracted red vinyl|thundercat|thundercat|lp','Distracted (RED VINYL)','Thundercat','Thundercat','LP','BRFE165C.1','5054429208740',22.0,22.0,'45960079','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442920874','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Red Vinyl, 3mm sleeve, printed inners, poster insert, designed by Neil Krug [w/ download card]. Thundercat fans rejoice! The longest album drought of his career is officially OVER. Distracted will be released on April 3, 2026 - 6 years to the day after release of his previous LP, the 2020 GRAMMY Award winning record It Is What It Is. Distracted was primarily created in close collaboration with a new creative partner for Thundercat - the super producer Greg Kurstin, known for his work with some of the biggest names in pop like Adele, Paul McCartney, Sia, Beyonc├⌐, Beck and more. The record features 15 tracks and a host of exciting collaborators including Mac Miller, A$AP Rocky, Willow Smith, Tame Impala, Channel Tres, and production from Thundercat & Greg Kurstin, Flying Lotus, Kenny Beats & more. Over the past six years, Thundercat''s been a very busy man. Beyond releasing two new tracks this past September ("I Wish I Didn''t Waste Your Time" & "Children of the Baked Potato (feat. Remi Wolf)", Thunder has collaborated with Tame Impala, Silk Sonic, Gorillaz, Justice & Yo Gabba Gabba, played bass with the Spinal Tap guys on Kimmel, won a GRAMMY Award for Best Progressive R&B Album at the 2020 GRAMMYs, has gone viral no less than 5 times on TikTok, his hit records "Funny Thing" & "Them Changes" went Platinum, toured arenas with The Red Hot Chili Peppers, and oh yeah, he made his acting debut in the Star Wars universe in The Book of Boba Fett.','4/3/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4490301-3557201.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181968,'distance in static iex blue pastel vinyl|bonobo|bonobo|lp','Distance in Static (IEX) Blue Pastel Vinyl','Bonobo','Bonobo','LP','NJAT328C.1','5054429212372',28.60000000000000142,28.60000000000000142,'46336484','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442921237','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl, Poster)',0,'"I want to reinforce this idea that you can be more than one thing," Green explains. It''s that duality - of live artist and DJ, introspective composer and club-focussed selector - that sits at the heart of latest album ''Distance in Static'', a record that is full of depth, detail and emotion; both beautiful and banging; quintessentially Bonobo, yet pushing beyond the contours of what a Bonobo album has traditionally been. A large portion of the record was created at Neil Young''s legendary Broken Arrow Ranch studio in Woodside, California - an environment Green describes as deeply immersive and creatively transformative. A pivotal track to emerge from these Ranch sessions was the enchanting "Fire on the Water", featuring Arooj Aftab, who travelled down from her NYC base to record what became a breakthrough moment during the album''s creation. Evolving, almost accidentally, from a rough acoustic guitar loop recorded while Green was testing studio inputs one morning. Elsewhere, tracks like "Drift" and "Me and You" perfectly encapsulate the album''s club-focussed leanings, with both quickly emerging as firm fan favorites in Green''s recent DJ sets. Buried within the ''Distance in Static'' universe, there is also a sense that this record - and particularly the accompanying live tour - marks something quite monumental, too. It''s a moment of transition, a celebration of Bonobo''s 25 years, but also, perhaps his last record in the traditional sense: complete with expansive guest features and a multi-year full live-band world tour.','9/11/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4519760-3626553.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181969,'1983|flying lotus|flying lotus|lp','1983','Flying Lotus','Flying Lotus','LP','BRFE164X.1','5054429213942',22.0,22.0,'46430878','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505442921394','(Reissue)',0,'Brainfeeder presents a special remastered vinyl repress of the inimitable Flying Lotus'' seminal 2006 debut album: 1983. A record that defined the emerging LA beat scene and established Flying Lotus as it''s talismanic figurehead. Remastered audio by Daddy Kev; a brand new sleeve design incorporating a sleek iridescent gold metallic sleeve with emboss detailing on black vinyl. A generational talent, GRAMMY-winning FlyLo is known for his boundary-defying approach to music and storytelling and has cemented his status as one of the most influential and creative voices in modern experimental music and visual art. Across seven critically acclaimed studio albums, Ellison has carved out a distinct sonic universe - fusing jazz, hip-hop, IDM, soul, and psychedelic textures - while collaborating with a staggering array of artists including Thom Yorke, Erykah Badu, Thundercat, David Lynch, and Kendrick Lamar, notably contributing production to the Pulitzer Prize-winning To Pimp A Butterfly. His production on Thundercat''s 2020 album It Is What It Is earned him a Grammy Award for Best Progressive R&B Album, and another nod for Producer of the Year, Non-Classical that year. Prior to this he picked up 2016 Grammy noms for Best Dance Recording (''Never Catch Me''), and Album of the Year (To Pimp a Butterfly - producer). As the founder of Brainfeeder in 2008, Flying Lotus has cultivated one of the most forward-thinking rosters in music, home to game-changers like Kamasi Washington, Hiatus Kaiyote, and Thundercat. The label has become a global hub for experimental music, jazz futurism, and cross-genre innovation.','9/25/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/34/4527934-3677229.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181970,'from beyond iex|||lp','From Beyond (IEX)','','','LP','THIC27.1','5055006502763',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'46423429','2026-11-10 23:55:40','2026-11-10 23:55:40','/505500650276','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red, Green, Limited Edition)',0,NULL,'7/10/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4494670-3531246.jpg?ae=4621895153',NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181971,'the lion s roar|first aid kit|first aid kit|lp','The Lion''s Roar','First Aid Kit','First Aid Kit','LP','WHTR320.1','5055036213202',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'16278790','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505503621320',NULL,0,'The Lion''s Roar is the second studio album by Swedish folk duo First Aid Kit. It was produced by Mike Mogis and features contributions from Bright Eyes'' Conor Oberst and the Felice Brothers. The Guardian awarded the album 4 stars out of 5.','1/24/2012',0.75,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/2/3/3/1913320.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181972,'white christmas original soundtrack|bing crosby|bing crosby|lp','White Christmas (Original Soundtrack)','Bing Crosby','Bing Crosby','LP','SEPI3001.1','5055122130017',24.98000000000000042,24.98000000000000042,'45352782','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505512213001','(Colored Vinyl, White, Remastered, Collector''s Edition)',0,'First time on heavyweight white vinyl, 180 gram. The soundtrack to the all time favorite holiday movie "White Christmas" starring Bing Crosby and Rosemary Clooney.','9/26/2025',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4442419-3417024.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181973,'forever howlong|black country new road|black country new road|lp','Forever Howlong','Black Country, New Road','Black Country, New Road','LP','NJAT314B.1','5054429199758',25.62999999999999901,25.62999999999999901,'44955045','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505442919975','(140 Gram Vinyl, Booklet, Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'2LP, 140g Recycled Black In Curious Matter Gatefold Sleeve With 20-Page Booklet [w/ download card] 2025 release. Forever Howlong is Black Country, New Road''s first studio release since 2022''s UK #3 album Ants From Up There, which gave the band their second Top 5 UK album in 12 months alongside their Mercury Prize shortlisted debut For The First Time. The long-awaited album was produced by James Ford (Fontaines D.C., Arctic Monkeys, Depeche Mode, Blur) and sees Black Country, New Road settled into a new shape in which vocal duties - and most of the song writing - is split between Tyler Hyde, Georgia Ellery, and May Kershaw. Forever Howlong is an ambitious, meticulously detailed record that includes everything from folk to prog via baroque pop and touches of alt-rock - with nods to everything from Joanna Newsom to Randy Newman via Fiona Apple and Janis Ian - yet all the while retaining that unmistakably unique sound that only this combination of musicians can come up with. Although hugely varied and expansive, the album also feels deeply cohesive and focused, as it takes three distinct voices and styles and seamlessly intersperses them into a new collective sound.','4/4/2025',1.320000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/4405262-3383002.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181974,'classics|aphex twin|aphex twin|lp','Classics','Aphex Twin','Aphex Twin','LP','RASR35035.1','5055274710976',27.8299999999999983,27.8299999999999983,'45494376','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505527471097','(Sticker / Stickers)',0,'"Undoubtedly one of the most important and influential electronic artists to have emerged in popular music, the sonic misfit from Cornwall, the Aphex Twin, released a breathtaking slew of early singles and albums from 1991 onwards (and continues to present day). The first clutch of groundbreaking works came on the legendary Belgium label R&S Records and were collected on a compilation album ''Classics'', released in 1995, and followed the global success of the timeless album ''Selected Ambient Works 85-92''.','10/17/2025',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4455655-3446265.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181975,'loner|barry can t swim|barry can t swim|lp','Loner','Barry Can''t Swim','Barry Can''t Swim','LP','REYG100056.1','5054429203110',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45063282','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505442920311','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold, Red, Digital Download Card)',0,NULL,'7/11/2025',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/4416333-3376210.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181976,'sleep s holy mountain|sleep|sleep|lp','SLEEP''S HOLY MOUNTAIN','Sleep','Sleep','LP','ERRE79RS.1','5055006907971',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'46122964','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505500690797',NULL,0,NULL,'8/15/2025',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4426452-3562837.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181977,'selected ambient works 85 92|aphex twin|aphex twin|lp','Selected Ambient Works 85-92','Aphex Twin','Aphex Twin','LP','RASR3922.1','5055274703046',23.42999999999999972,23.42999999999999972,'42546269','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505527470304',NULL,0,'2013 reissue. Import vinyl LP. Irish DJ Richard James (a.k.a. Aphex Twin) got into the techno sound at it''s very dawn. He soon became a master of the "ambient" techno sound, later inspiring many other artists. Many critics consider his double album "Selected Ambient Works 85-92" as his most seminal recording. More than just a thumping raver groove, intricate melodies woven into and around the beats keep the music anything but dull. Some of it''s most noted cuts are "Tha," "Heliosphan," "Hedphelym," "Schottkey 7th Path" and "Delphium." In all there are 13 tracks on this 2-LP import. This version of "Selected Ambient Works 85-92" is a reissue.','9/3/2013',0.8699999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/18/4076818-3075572.jpg?ae=4621895153','Ambient');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181978,'apricot princess|rex orange county|rex orange county|lp','Apricot Princess','Rex Orange County','Rex Orange County','LP','REXO1.1','5056167106890',17.21999999999999887,17.21999999999999887,'36150076','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616710689','(Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Limited orange vinyl LP pressing. It''s been a pretty crazy 12 months for Rex Orange County - AKA 19-year-old Alex O''Connor - from Haslemere, Surrey. After two guest slots on Tyler the Creator''s album Flower Boy, he''s played live with Frank Ocean and Skepta, all the while working on his debut album, Apricot Princess. The self-released record is full of sumptuous hooks, jazzy piano figures and musical left-turns that suggest a true original at work. He placed second after winner Sigrid in the BBC Sound of 2018 Poll, and recently performed on Jimmy Fallon''s Tonight Show.','7/27/2018',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/54/3505654-3158130.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181979,'street worms cloudy clear|viagra boys|viagra boys|lp','Street Worms - Cloudy Clear [Explicit Content]','Viagra Boys','Viagra Boys','LP','YER53.1','5056167111719',17.5,17.5,'43525775','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616711171','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Cloudy Clear Vinyl. Deluxe bonus Tracks on Download Card. This is an album about illusions of realness, the absurdum of existence and the joke of humanity. Street Worms is Viagra Boys debut studio album, a debut that instantly let them occupy their absolute own space in music history.  Produced by Daniel Fagerstr├╢m (Skull Defekts, Chronic Heist) and Pelle Gunnerfeldt (Fireside, The Hives) for YEAR0001, now on CD for the first time in 2019, and limited vinyl, with 5 additional bonus tracks.','9/1/2023',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/3654433-3727638.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181980,'mtv unplugged 2 0|dashboard confessional|dashboard confessional|lp','MTV Unplugged 2.0','Dashboard Confessional','Dashboard Confessional','LP','HDNO3.1','5056167116608',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'40542850','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616711660',NULL,0,'At long last, Dashboard Confessional''s RIAA Platinum-certified MTV Unplugged 2.0 arrives on vinyl for the first time, September 25, releasing as part of The Early Days, a vinyl reissue series spotlighting the albums that defined the band''s formative years, and cemented singer/songwriter Chris Carrabba as one of the most vital voices that would Recorded in 2002 on the era-defining show - MTV Unplugged, the performance holds a significant place in Dashboard Confessional lore. The set was released as the iconic emo band''s first live album on the heels of studio releases The Swiss Army Romance, The Places You Have Come To Fear The Most, and the So Impossible EP. The performance showcases re-imagined versions of seminal tracks such as "Hands Down" and "So Impossible" which receive a full-band treatment for the first time.','9/25/2020',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/3831152-3158181.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181981,'geography|tom misch|tom misch|lp','Geography','Tom Misch','Tom Misch','LP','BYV20.1','5056167103424',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'35486640','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616710342',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. 2018 release, the debut album from 22 year-old South-East Londoner Tom Misch. Tom''s music is an intrepid and invigorating adventure in sound, bursting with inventiveness. This highly talented, multi-instrumentalist has built an auspicious online fanbase and has earned the reputation as one of the best UK producers! Tom has self-released several EPs and mix tapes to date (Beat Tape 1, Beat Tape 2 and Reverie) as well as the unique project 5 Day Mischon, which was recorded over a period of five consecutive days in his bedroom where he collaborated with the likes of Carmody, Novelest, Will Heard and more.','4/6/2018',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/3429984-3158120.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181982,'the swiss army romance|dashboard confessional|dashboard confessional|lp','The Swiss Army Romance','Dashboard Confessional','Dashboard Confessional','LP','HDNO8.1','5056167116639',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'40406596','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616711663',NULL,0,'Dashboard Confessional''s highly sought-after 2000 debut album, The Swiss Army Romance, took the punk and emo rock world by storm, becoming an instant classic amongst the angsty and emotional. This collection of emo anthems, kick started by smash hit "Screaming Infidelities'' '', was the beginning of a journey that would lead Chris Carrabba from a bedroom and DIY performer to a global sensation.','8/28/2020',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/79/3814479-3158183.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(181983,'the places you have come to fear the most|dashboard confessional|dashboard confessional|lp','The Places You Have Come To Fear The Most','Dashboard Confessional','Dashboard Confessional','LP','HDNO9.1','5056167116615',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'40406633','2026-11-10 23:55:41','2026-11-10 23:55:41','/505616711661',NULL,0,'Dashboard Confessional''s 2001 emo album The Places You Have Come to Fear the Most, marked the first time Chris Carrabba''s hyper-personal acoustic sing-alongs were amplified by additional instrumentation. The album was produced by longtime collaborator James Paul Wisner, and features emo anthem "Screaming Infidelities," as well as cult favorites like "Again I Go Unnoticed" and the title track.','7/31/2020',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/3814481-3158182.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
