INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182020,'no hard feelings|beaches|beaches|lp','No Hard Feelings [Explicit Content]','Beaches','Beaches','LP','BCHG4.1','5056167181668',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'45148309','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718166','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Light Blue, Explicit Cover/Content)',0,'The Beaches have spend the past decade building something unstoppable. Their third album ''No Hard Feelings'' finds the band blaming themselves (rather than their exes), embracing their partying ways and accepting the occasional semi-self destructive thoughts and actions. The LP includes the last-call anthem "Last Girls At The Party", fan favorite "Jocelyn" and self-reflective "Takes One to Know One."','8/29/2025',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/4424041-3428671.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182021,'crybaby|lil peep|lil peep|lp','Crybaby','Lil Peep','Lil Peep','LP','DNOM1A.1','5056167183211',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'45964824','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718321','(RSD Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, White, Black, Die-Cut)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Crybaby was Lil Peep''s third solo mixtape and the first body of work that Gus made in the studio with producers that he met online and had previously communicated with only via email, Twitter and texts. Featuring the breakout hit "white tee", Gus was branching out and experimenting with new musical styles including samples from The Postal Service, Brand New, Oasis, Modest Mouse and more. A special 10 Year Anniversary RSD Edition will be pressed for Record Store Day 2026.','4/18/2026',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4490726-3565456.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182022,'crux deluxe import|djo|djo|cassette','Crux Deluxe [Import]','Djo','Djo','Cassette','TWTY6718286.4','5056167182863',15.18999999999999951,15.18999999999999951,'45936906','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718286','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Djo, the musical project of Joe Keery, returns with his fourth studio album, The Crux Deluxe an expansive, 12-track companion album to The Crux, written, recorded and produced by Keery and his collaborator Adam Thein. Following the massive success of his single End of Beginning, which topped both the US and Global Spotify charts and amassed over 2 billion streams worldwide, the deluxe record is full of songs that were written at the same time as The Crux album sessions and recorded at Electric Lady Studios in NYC.','5/1/2026',0.1199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4488938-3527025.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182023,'blink clear with red black splatter vinyl|bob moses|bob moses|lp','Blink    (Clear with Red + Black Splatter Vinyl)','Bob Moses','Bob Moses','LP','BOBM1A.1','5056167182603',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'45443671','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718260','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Red, Black, Splatter)',0,'Clear with Red + Black Splatter Vinyl Bob Moses returns with their highly anticipated fifth studio album, BLINK - a profound exploration of reconciling the past with the present. Created in a form of isolation, the album highlights the duo''s mastery of liminal spaces, where they draw inspiration from the gray areas between rock and dance, light and dark, rhythm and reflection. Built on a foundation of atmospheric keyboard riffs, hypnotic drum loops, and introspective lyrics, BLINK poses a poignant question: "How do you reconcile the desire to live a meaningful life with the realization that it can vanish in an instant?" Bob Moses consists of Vancouver-born musicians and producers Tom Howie and Jimmy Vallance. The Grammy-winning duo has amassed a catalog with over 700 million global streams','10/17/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4451176-3436496.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182024,'going going gone|hemlocke springs|hemlocke springs|lp','Going...Going...Gone!','Hemlocke Springs','Hemlocke Springs','LP','GLHF2.1','5056167183112',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'45964701','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718311','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gold, Sticker / Stickers)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Hemlocke Springs'' debut EP going... going... gone! #captures the singular voice of one of pop''s most inventive new artists-a kinetic blend of eccentric bedroom-pop sensibility and razor-sharp songwriting. Powered by the viral success of "girlfriend" (75M streams) and "heavun," the EP solidified hemlocke as a left-of-center force capable of fusing internet-era with with timeless hooks. This RSD edition of the EP would mark the first time the physical product is available at independent retailers!','4/18/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4490728-3565455.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182025,'nocturne|wasia project|wasia project|lp','Nocturne','Wasia Project','Wasia Project','LP','LAO1A.1','5056167183853',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'46278326','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718385','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Sibling duo Wasia Project chart a new sonic hinterland with their debut album Nocturne. Across 12 tracks, Olivia Hardy and Will Gao alchemise their classical training with kinetic club-adjacent dance music, soulful electronica, and cinematic piano-pop. Nocturne arrives as a bold evolution, scaling the success of their early EPs and a string of dewy-eyed singles. A definitive Gen-Z narrative, it captures the friction and frisson of youth today, turning coming-of-age angst into a cathartic journey represented within the hours of dusk until dawn, from heady twilight introspection to the euphoric commune of the dancefloor.','9/18/2026',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/03/4515603-3600052.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182026,'a matter of time the final hour|laufey|laufey|lp','A Matter Of Time: The Final Hour','Laufey','Laufey','LP','LAFY3E.1','5056167183334',30.80000000000000071,30.80000000000000071,'46054487','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718333','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Blue, Yellow, Booklet)',0,'Limited green, blue, and yellow marbled vinyl. Includes booklet. Die-cut inner sleeve. Expanded edition of the Icelandic singer/songwriter''s 2025 album. A Matter of Time is the third studio album by Laufey. The album''s original release includes the singles "Silver Lining", "Tough Luck", "Lover Girl" and "Snow White".','4/10/2026',1.530000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/46/4497546-3541291.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182027,'preacher s daughter|ethel cain|ethel cain|cassette','Preacher''s Daughter','Ethel Cain','Ethel Cain','Cassette','AMIO718390.4','5056167183907',8.25,8.25,'46379665','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718390','(Clear Cassette)',0,'CASSETTE. Preacher''s Daughter is the debut studio album by the American singer-songwriter and record producer Ethel Cain, originally released in 2022 through her independent record label Daughters of Cain. The album was entirely written and produced by Cain, with assistance from Steven Mark Colyer and Matthew Tomasi on certain tracks.','9/18/2026',0.08999999999999999667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4523420-3626664.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182028,'the apple tree under the sea|hemlocke springs|hemlocke springs|lp','The Apple Tree Under The Sea','Hemlocke Springs','Hemlocke Springs','LP','GLHF1.1','5056167182955',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'45726156','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718295','(Colored Vinyl, Purple, Blue)',0,'Hemlocke Springs / APPLE TREE UNDER THE SEA (Standard Purple & Blue Sunburst Vinyl) the apple tree under the sea, the debut album from breakout alt-pop artist Hemlocke Springs, marks an exciting new chapter for the singer/songwriter/producer. This is a fever dream of a concept album in which our heroine sets off on a journey of self-discovery-one that requires her to confront the chaos and repression of her past in order to claim the full, liberatory life she once didn''t even know was possible. Throughout the project hemlocke displays her most adventurous songcraft and playful vocals yet, while co-producing the apple tree under the sea with close collaborator BURNS (Lady Gaga, Britney Spears, Charli xcx).','2/13/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4474023-3493754.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182029,'sunshine|jungle|jungle|lp','Sunshine','Jungle','Jungle','LP','TFYP3A.1','5056167183945',25.46000000000000085,25.46000000000000085,'46132680','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718394','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Peach)',0,'Jungle cemented their status as a major global force with their 2023 album, ''Volcano'' - a record that earned them their first BRIT Award and featured their worldwide smash hit single, ''Back On 74''. The trio - J Lloyd, Tom McFarland and Lydia Kitto - return with their eagerly anticipated album, Sunshine.','8/14/2026',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4505382-3713455.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182030,'preacher s daughter|ethel cain|ethel cain|cd','Preacher''s Daughter','Ethel Cain','Ethel Cain','CD','AMIO718389.2','5056167183891',9.65000000000000035,9.65000000000000035,'46379641','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718389','(Booklet, Jewel Case Packaging)',0,'Preacher''s Daughter is the debut studio album by the American singer-songwriter and record producer Ethel Cain, originally released in 2022 through her independent record label Daughters of Cain. The album was entirely written and produced by Cain, with assistance from Steven Mark Colyer and Matthew Tomasi on certain tracks.','8/7/2026',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/4523419-3626663.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182031,'hellboy|lil peep|lil peep|lp','Hellboy [Explicit Content]','Lil Peep','Lil Peep','LP','DNOM2.1','5056167184478',30.80000000000000071,30.80000000000000071,'46637826','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718447','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Lil Peep - Hellboy - Music & Performance - CD Death Note Music GENRE: Rap / Hip-Hop','11/20/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4546192-3729707.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182032,'inbred|ethel cain|ethel cain|lp','Inbred','Ethel Cain','Ethel Cain','LP','AMIO3.1','5056167183433',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'45964169','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718343','(RSD Exclusive, Postcard)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Florida-born multimedia artist Ethel Cain wrote, produced, and mixed Inbred from the church basement she called home in Indiana while constructing the EP. Cain is the creative force behind the entire project with the EP originally released in 2021. Inbred will be pressed on vinyl for the first time for Record Store Day 2026.','4/18/2026',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/93/4490493-3565457.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182033,'a matter of time live at madison square garden|laufey|laufey|lp','A Matter Of Time: Live At Madison Square Garden','Laufey','Laufey','LP','LAFY26.1','5056167183099',30.80000000000000071,30.80000000000000071,'46025791','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718309','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'A Matter of Time: Live at Madison Square Garden is the definitive concert album from GRAMMY┬«-winning Icelandic-Chinese artist Laufey recorded during her sold out A Matter of Time North American Tour. This Record Store Day Exclusive vinyl captures the electricity of her debut 2025 performances at Madison Square Garden and preserves an unforgettable evening where Laufey met the grandeur of one of the world''s most iconic stages. This Big Apple Red colored 2LP live record comes with a booklet and never-before-seen drafts of the tour production and inspiration behind the tour creative that immerses listeners in the spellbinding performance that has made Laufey''s live show a global phenomenon."','4/18/2026',1.260000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4495350-3565454.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182034,'nymph|shygirl|shygirl|lp','Nymph','Shygirl','Shygirl','LP','BMIC556107.1','5056556107415',20.53000000000000113,20.53000000000000113,'42680901','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505655610741',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2022 release. Shygirl is a multidisciplinary artist from the East London club scene. She has finished her first major body of work, her debut album entitled, Nymph. Written and produced by Shygirl, alongside long-term collaborator Sega Bodega, it features additional production by Mura Masa, Bloodpop, Danny L Harle, and Noah Goldstein among others. The 12-track album is a stunningly innovative and diverse collection of songs exploring themes of friendship, community, escapism, love, and loss.','9/30/2022',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/17/4096017-2975201.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182035,'hyperdrama|justice|justice|lp','Hyperdrama','Justice','Justice','LP','BMIC143874.1','5056556133704',27.69000000000000127,27.69000000000000127,'44133542','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505655613370',NULL,0,'Justice are back with their fourth album entitled, Hyperdrama, which includes the tracks "Generator," and "One Night/All Night," feat. Tame Impala.','4/26/2024',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4296650-3124712.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182036,'dream fatigue|rex orange county|rex orange county|lp','Dream Fatigue','Rex Orange County','Rex Orange County','LP','BPLL1.1','5056167184683',23.76000000000000156,23.76000000000000156,'46626257','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505616718468','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Over the past decade, Rex Orange County has discreetly become one of the most emotionally resonant artists of his generation, transforming vulnerable, diary-like lyricism into global anthems while amassing over 9 billion of streams and topping albums charts worldwide. In 2026, Rex Orange County returns with his most self-assured album yet, Dream Fatigue. Moving beyond his DIY roots, the 12-track album features collaborations with Daniel Caesar, Mustafa, and Turnstile''s Brendan Yates. Driven by gentle melodies and curious hooks, Dream Fatigue occupies the liminal space between soul, pop, and classic singer-songwriter storytelling.','11/6/2026',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4545126-3725820.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182037,'loved|parcels|parcels|lp','Loved','Parcels','Parcels','LP','BMIC176244.1','5056556157588',21.82000000000000028,21.82000000000000028,'45176555','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505655615758',NULL,0,'Parcels - "Loved". Loved, Parcels'' third album, is exuberant and euphoric, but also reflective. It''s an album of unity - with each other, with the listeners, in the grooves - and that''s indisputable. "We do have a purpose as a band to our audience: we''re giving people joy," says guitarist/vocalist Jules Crommelin. "I see it as spirit, and it''s an incredibly powerful thing." Includes "Safeandsound," and "Yougotmefeeling."','9/12/2025',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4426280-3398498.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182038,'dots and loops|stereolab|stereolab|lp','Dots And Loops','Stereolab','Stereolab','LP','DPHC17.1','5056818800399',24.19999999999999929,24.19999999999999929,'44870003','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505681880039',NULL,0,'STEREOLAB / DOTS AND LOOPS - On February 28, 2025, Stereolab are making seven of their studio albums available again as 2LP editions. These utilise the same remasters as the 2019 expanded album editions, cut from the original 1/2" tapes by Bo Kondren at Calyx Mastering and overseen by Tim Gane, but without any of the bonus material from the 3LP versions (which have now been discontinued), the idea being to make more cost-effective versions of these sought-after titles available to fans and shops. Each record comes housed in a single 5mm printed sleeve with printed inner sleeves, and a protective PVC outer bag. Dots And Loops is the fifth studio album by Stereolab and was originally released in 1997.','2/28/2025',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4396580-3336827.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182039,'swallow|shygirl|shygirl|lp','SWALLOW! [Explicit Content]','Shygirl','Shygirl','LP','BMIC250650.1','5056556182931',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'46561701','2026-11-10 23:55:43','2026-11-10 23:55:43','/505655618293','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Shygirl calls SWALLOW! a reintroduction. Her 2022 debut, Nymph, took her from the electronic underground to the foreground of contemporary pop. She''s collaborated with Sega Bodega and Mura Masa, Charli xcx, Arca, SOPHIE, fka twigs, and Bj├╢rk. Swallow! Is a new kind of rapturous indie songwriting, woven through the electronica she came from, recorded with Karma Kid and Casey MQ. "I want people to remember how big the world is even when you feel so small and singular" she says. Available on classic black vinyl.','11/6/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4539320-3712381.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182040,'fire from the hip|finn wolfhard|finn wolfhard|lp','Fire From The Hip','Finn Wolfhard','Finn Wolfhard','LP','NSHF2.1','5056167184096',22.30000000000000071,22.30000000000000071,'46243737','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505616718409','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Light Blue, White)',0,'Half Moon (Baby Blue + White) Following last year''s critically acclaimed debut solo album from Finn Wolfhard, Happy Birthday (45M streams TD), the historic global finale of Stranger Things, and Finn''s widely shared and lauded Saturday Night Live Hosting appearance in January. This record represents a definitive "hi-fi" evolution for Finn, moving from the raw, 16mm-aesthetic of his Happy Birthday, to a broader, 35mm-fidelity sound. Inspired by pivotal rock albums like Exile on Main Street and Beggars Banquet, Finn is leaning into a more expansive, collaborative sound on this record. The music is upbeat, guitar-driven, and captures the lightning-in-a-bottle energy of his live band, positioning Finn not just as a familiar face in the zeitgeist, but as a definitive and respected leader in the modern alternative music space.','8/21/2026',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4512824-3591131.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182041,'instant holograms on metal film|stereolab|stereolab|lp','Instant Holograms On Metal Film','Stereolab','Stereolab','LP','DPHC46.1','5056818801013',25.62999999999999901,25.62999999999999901,'45126574','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505681880101','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Instant Holograms on Metal Film is the first Stereolab album in 15 years, featuring 13 new studio recordings. Played by Laetitia Sadier, Tim Gane, Andy Ramsay, Joe Watson and Xavi Mu├▒oz, with contributions from Cooper Crain and Rob Frye of Bitchin Bajas, Ben LaMar Gay (composer/jazz multi instrumentalist), Holger Zapf (Cavern of Anti Matter), Marie Merlet (Monade) and Molly Read among others. The album follows Not Music released in 2010.','5/23/2025',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/4421932-3397595.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182042,'veckatimest|grizzly bear|grizzly bear|lp','Veckatimest','Grizzly Bear','Grizzly Bear','LP','WRP182B.1','5056818803659',25.62999999999999901,25.62999999999999901,'45246890','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505681880365','(Colored Vinyl, Magenta)',0,'Grizzly Bear never broke up. In the six years that have passed since their most recent shows, the four members who first drifted into the group two decades ago as loose friends and even total strangers-Chris Bear, Ed Droste, Daniel Rossen, Chris Taylor-have drifted out into other things. They''ve made other music, pursued other careers, cultivated other families, lived other lives beyond the bounds of being this band. And now, for the first time since 2019, these four musicians and friends will drift back into Grizzly Bear, to test the ties that made them one of this century''s most engrossing and beloved acts and see where else those old connections may yet lead. Because Grizzly Bear never broke up, their first shows in six years are not a reunion; they are a simultaneous point of arrival and departure, their next destination still unknown. That sort of open-ended approach, after all, is what still makes Grizzly Bear one of this young century''s defining acts. Twenty years ago, they quickly morphed from a lo-fi songwriter project to a full band with an instantly singular sound, uncanny harmonies slipping around arrangements that paired the glow of a chamber orchestra to the grit of a rock group. They helped to redefine what was possible within indie rock by balancing lushness with looseness, a technical excellence with an emotional openness. Their musical traces remain ubiquitous, bits of their unorthodox perspective on sound and texture now part of the firmament. Hearing these songs live in 2025 will feel less like shaking hands with the past, then, than seeing their fingerprints in the present, as if for the first time. These live shows will be accompanied by color vinyl album reissues of Yellow House, Veckatimest, Shields and Painted Ruins.','10/31/2025',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4432613-3401287.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182043,'loved|parcels|parcels|lp','Loved','Parcels','Parcels','LP','BMIC176245.1','5056556157595',21.82000000000000028,21.82000000000000028,'45176470','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505655615759','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Clear Vinyl, Blue, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,NULL,'9/12/2025',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182044,'pompeii utility indie exclusive gumby green vinyl|earl sweatshirt|earl sweatshirt|lp','POMPEII / /  UTILITY ( INDIE EXCLUSIVE, GUMBY ( GREEN ) VINYL )','Earl Sweatshirt','Earl Sweatshirt','LP','TKRE10029IE.1','5056818807725',51.36999999999999745,51.36999999999999745,'46072122','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505681880772','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Green, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'POMPEII // UTILITY unites two kindred spirit rappers from opposite coasts within SURF GANG''s world-building genius. Structured as a true double album - MIKE on one side, Earl on the other - POMPEII // UTILITY unfolds through a rotating cast of side quests and characters from within it''s shared creative ecosystem. Jadasea, Anysia Kym, Niontay, Na-Kel Smith, and Lerado Khalil all make appearances, passing through the album''s vast terrain, while behind the scenes, SURF GANG producers Harrison, EvilGiane, Elipropperr, and Flea Diamonds (with input from additional producers) wield the gritty, raspy, animated beats that build it''s container. SURF GANG''s previous production credits include Baby Keem, Kendrick Lamar, A$AP Rocky & Playboi Carti. Arriving on the heels of 2025 albums from both rappers - MIKE''s Showbiz! And Earl''s Live, Laugh, Love - POMPEII // UTILITY plays like a victory lap that traces their friendship back over more than a decade. Where two rappers going head-to-head might otherwise incite rivalry or comparison, POMPEII // UTILITY offers something rooted and communal - a shared understanding of care, joy, grief, process, and responsibility to something larger than yourself. A joint release via all three artists'' respective labels: 10k, Tan Cressida and Surf Gang Records.','5/8/2026',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/4500204-3569819.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182045,'alias|shygirl|shygirl|lp','Alias [Explicit Content]','Shygirl','Shygirl','LP','BMIC212298.1','5056556166566',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'45592256','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505655616656','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Extended Play, Colored Vinyl, Pink, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Shygirl celebrates the 5th anniversary of ''Alias,'' the cult 7-track EP/mini album that revealed her before her 2022 debut album, Nymph. Released physically for the first time with retail on light pink color vinyl. Includes "Slime" & "Tasty."','11/21/2025',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4463826-3480135.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182046,'drukqs|aphex twin|aphex twin|lp','Drukqs','Aphex Twin','Aphex Twin','LP','WRP920.1','5056818810046',40.3299999999999983,40.3299999999999983,'46395542','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505681881004',NULL,1,'Drukqs will be released on 30th October 2026 via Warp Records. Twenty-five years after it''s original release, Warp Records reissues Aphex Twin''s Drukqs on vinyl and CD. The release marks the first time in years the album has been available across physical formats and means every Aphex Twin album is once again in print on vinyl.','11/13/2026',1.699999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4524722-3628879.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182047,'pompeii utility|earl sweatshirt|earl sweatshirt|lp','POMPEII / /  UTILITY','Earl Sweatshirt','Earl Sweatshirt','LP','TKRE10029.1','5056818807695',36.63000000000000255,36.63000000000000255,'46072108','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505681880769',NULL,0,'POMPEII // UTILITY unites two kindred spirit rappers from opposite coasts within SURF GANG''s world-building genius. Structured as a true double album - MIKE on one side, Earl on the other - POMPEII // UTILITY unfolds through a rotating cast of side quests and characters from within it''s shared creative ecosystem. Jadasea, Anysia Kym, Niontay, Na-Kel Smith, and Lerado Khalil all make appearances, passing through the album''s vast terrain, while behind the scenes, SURF GANG producers Harrison, EvilGiane, Elipropperr, and Flea Diamonds (with input from additional producers) wield the gritty, raspy, animated beats that build it''s container. SURF GANG''s previous production credits include Baby Keem, Kendrick Lamar, A$AP Rocky & Playboi Carti. Arriving on the heels of 2025 albums from both rappers - MIKE''s Showbiz! And Earl''s Live, Laugh, Love - POMPEII // UTILITY plays like a victory lap that traces their friendship back over more than a decade. Where two rappers going head-to-head might otherwise incite rivalry or comparison, POMPEII // UTILITY offers something rooted and communal - a shared understanding of care, joy, grief, process, and responsibility to something larger than yourself. A joint release via all three artists'' respective labels: 10k, Tan Cressida and Surf Gang Records.','5/8/2026',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4500202-3595525.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182048,'hounds of love fish people edition 180gm purple vinyl obi strip version import|kate bush|kate bush|lp','Hounds Of Love - Fish People Edition - 180gm Purple Vinyl OBI Strip Version [Import]','Kate Bush','Kate Bush','LP','FISP9820092.1','5057998200924',34.90999999999999658,34.90999999999999658,'45916786','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505799820092','(180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Purple, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Limited 180gm raspberry beret colored vinyl LP pressing housed in spot varnish jacket. Hounds Of Love was Kate''s fifth studio album, and her second no. 1. Featuring "Running Up That Hill (A Deal with God)", it has since been certified Double Platinum in the UK by the British Phonographic Industry. No Obi strip edition.','2/6/2026',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4487136-3527403.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182049,'golden skans||ed banger|12 single','Golden Skans',NULL,'Ed Banger','12" Single','EDBG5772075.1','5060107720756',11.53999999999999915,11.53999999999999915,'15947017','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/506010772075',NULL,0,'The French 12'' edition of Klaxons'' new single ''Golden Skans'' features Exclusive Remixes from Institubes'' very own Surkin + Ed Banger'' beat wizard SebastiAn. On the flip, find Erol Alkan''s 9 minute-full-vocal remix, formely available on a one sided LTD 12'' only.','8/2/2011',0.4799999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/8/0/7/1037084.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182050,'best of the other sides 180gm green marble vinyl import|kate bush|kate bush|lp','Best Of The Other Sides - 180gm Green Marble Vinyl [Import]','Kate Bush','Kate Bush','LP','FISP9820093.1','5057998200931',35.88000000000000255,35.88000000000000255,'45563188','2026-11-10 23:55:44','2026-11-10 23:55:44','/505799820093','(180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Green, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Limited 180gm marbled green colored vinyl LP pressing. 2025 compilation. The release is due to demand from those unable to access the original release of ''The Other Sides'', which was part of the 2018 remastered box sets featuring B sides and extra tracks that had never appeared on an album. ''The Other Sides'' is no longer available. 3 of the tracks on ''Best of The Other Sides'' have been remastered. The release comes at a time when Kate''s song ''Army Dreamers'' is skyrocketing online, looking set to become her second most streamed track after ''Running Up That Hill''. Perhaps the popularity of ''Army Dreamers'' right now is a reflection of the current conflicts around the world, a theme Kate has recently returned to with her award-winning anti -war short film ''Little Shrew'' - winner of Best Animation at the New York Animation Festival.','11/14/2025',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4461152-3455056.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
