INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182140,'getting killed|geese|geese|cd','Getting Killed','Geese','Geese','CD','PASN3188009.2','5400863188009',9.49000000000000021,9.49000000000000021,'45351921','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318800',NULL,1,'Geese return with their 3rd album, ''Getting Killed''. They tracked the album with Kenneth Blume in 10 fast-paced days. With scant time for overdubbing, what emerged is a chaotic comedy, shambolic in structure but passionately performed, informed by an exacting vision. Big riffs are layered on choir samples; hissing drum machines pulse softly behind screeching guitars. They balance a disarming tenderness with an intensified anger, trading their love of classic rock for a disdain for music itself.','9/26/2025',0.04000000000000000083,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/98/4442298-3456710.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182141,'the hives forever forever the hives|the hives|the hives|lp','The Hives Forever Forever The Hives','The Hives','The Hives','LP','PITS1579.1','5400863186388',17.39000000000000056,17.39000000000000056,'45104343','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318638',NULL,0,'Pressed on black vinyl. Housed in a single outer sleeve with spot UV gloss cover and printed inner sleeve. The Hives Forever, Forever The Hives is the bands 7th studio LP, a razor-sharp culmination of their rupturing, signature powder-keg (The New York Times) rock n roll energy that initially captured the zeitgeist during the garage rock revival in the early 2000s. The Hives continue to reach sky-high on the new album, with the majority of it recorded in one take at Yung Lean/YEAR0001s studio and riksmixningsverket a studio owned by Benny Andersson of ABBA in Stockholm. The record was produced by their longtime collaborator Pelle Gunnerfeldt (Viagra Boys, Yung Lean, Elvira) as well as the bands old tourmate Mike D of the Beastie Boys, who flew out to Sweden specifically to work on the album and hosted the band at his studio in Malibu. Josh Homme of Queens of the Stone Age consulted on the record, too.','8/29/2025',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4419949-3383681.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182142,'the hives forever forever the hives gold|the hives|the hives|lp','The Hives Forever Forever The Hives - Gold','The Hives','The Hives','LP','PITS1579C.1','5400863186395',19.08999999999999986,19.08999999999999986,'45104374','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318639','(Colored Vinyl, Gold, Limited Edition)',0,'Limited Edition Gold Colour Vinyl. Housed in a single outer sleeve with spot UV gloss cover and printed inner sleeve. The Hives Forever, Forever The Hives is the bands 7th studio LP, a razor-sharp culmination of their rupturing, signature powder-keg (The New York Times) rock n roll energy that initially captured the zeitgeist during the garage rock revival in the early 2000s. The Hives continue to reach sky-high on the new album, with the majority of it recorded in one take at Yung Lean/YEAR0001s studio and riksmixningsverket a studio owned by Benny Andersson of ABBA in Stockholm. The record was produced by their longtime collaborator Pelle Gunnerfeldt (Viagra Boys, Yung Lean, Elvira) as well as the bands old tourmate Mike D of the Beastie Boys, who flew out to Sweden specifically to work on the album and hosted the band at his studio in Malibu. Josh Homme of Queens of the Stone Age consulted on the record, too.','8/29/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4419952-3383682.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182143,'live at carnegie hall iex red|cameron winter|cameron winter|lp','Live at Carnegie Hall (IEX) Red [Explicit Content]','Cameron Winter','Cameron Winter','LP','PASN70IEX.1','5400863199814',19.85000000000000143,19.85000000000000143,'46497031','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086319981','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Cameron Winter''s Live at Carnegie Hall documents the Geese frontman''s historic Dec 2025 performance. Alone at the piano, he reshapes songs from his acclaimed debut Heavy Metal and debuts three previously unreleased compositions. There is an undeniable sense of occasion running through the performance, capturing the momentous feeling of witnessing an artist stepping into the spotlight in real time. The release preserves one unforgettable night while cementing Winter''s emergence as one of the defining voices of his generation, with the sense that this is only the beginning. 2xLP Indie Retail Exclusive Deep Red Vinyl in Gatefold Jacket.','10/9/2026',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4533851-3699283.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182144,'live at carnegie hall|cameron winter|cameron winter|cd','Live at Carnegie Hall [Explicit Content]','Cameron Winter','Cameron Winter','CD','PASN70.2','5400863199791',9.49000000000000021,9.49000000000000021,'46497024','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086319979','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Cameron Winter''s Live at Carnegie Hall documents the Geese frontman''s historic Dec 2025 performance. Alone at the piano, he reshapes songs from his acclaimed debut Heavy Metal and debuts three previously unreleased compositions. There is an undeniable sense of occasion running through the performance, capturing the momentous feeling of witnessing an artist stepping into the spotlight in real time. The release preserves one unforgettable night while cementing Winter''s emergence as one of the defining voices of his generation, with the sense that this is only the beginning. CD in Card Wallet.','10/9/2026',0.08000000000000000166,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4533850-3699281.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182145,'live god|nick cave the bad seeds|nick cave the bad seeds|lp','Live God','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','LP','PITS28.1','5400863190446',30.48999999999999844,30.48999999999999844,'45563096','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086319044',NULL,0,'Live God is a stunning testament to Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds'' Wild God World Tour 2024/2025. Across 15 tracks, the album captures the transcendent nature of those unforgettable shows, which were in Nick Cave''s own words, "an antidote to despair." The tracklist includes performances of the entirety of the acclaimed 2024 studio album WILD GOD, as well as catalog favorites like "Papa Won''t Leave You," "Henry," "From Her To Eternity," and "Into My Arms."','12/5/2025',1.5,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/4461106-3497621.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182146,'getting killed|geese|geese|lp','Getting Killed','Geese','Geese','LP','PASN3188023.1','5400863188023',15.49000000000000021,15.49000000000000021,'45351938','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318802','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Geese return with their 3rd album, ''Getting Killed''. They tracked the album with Kenneth Blume in 10 fast-paced days. With scant time for overdubbing, what emerged is a chaotic comedy, shambolic in structure but passionately performed, informed by an exacting vision. Big riffs are layered on choir samples; hissing drum machines pulse softly behind screeching guitars. They balance a disarming tenderness with an intensified anger, trading their love of classic rock for a disdain for music itself.','9/26/2025',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4442299-3595272.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182147,'for the people 2 lp|dropkick murphys|dropkick murphys|lp','For the People - 2 LP','Dropkick Murphys','Dropkick Murphys','LP','PITS5.1','5400863189501',24.48999999999999844,24.48999999999999844,'45259579','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318950','(Poster)',0,'Black Vinyl (2 LP). On Dropkick Murphys'' 13th studio album, the stories run deep, the memories push hard, and the joy remains infectious. This double LP includes five unreleased tracks and an etching of a black rose on Side D. Across the album''s 12 songs, the Boston band imbue the same kind of joy one might celebrate with family and friends. And even when the moods are sad and pensive, it''s hard not to feel personally invested in the band''s emotional spectrum. For The People shows courage and confidence, speaking up against the injustices happening in the United States, doing so with the strength and power that harkens back to Dropkick Murphys'' earliest punk rock roots. Whether it''s politics, family, friends or simply "life," Dropkick Murphys continue to write music that regular people can identify with. The poignant album cover was created by renowned social/political artist Shepard Fairey''s design firm Studio Number One, and the album was produced and mixed by longtime Dropkick Murphys collaborator Ted Hutt. For The People includes guest features form Mary Wallopers, The Scratch, Bill Bragg, and original band member Al Barr.','10/10/2025',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4433810-3468254.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182148,'ambiguous desire|arlo parks|arlo parks|lp','Ambiguous Desire','Arlo Parks','Arlo Parks','LP','TGSS930.1','5400863201630',15.28999999999999915,15.28999999999999915,'45921810','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086320163','(140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',0,'Twice Grammy-nominated, Mercury Prize and BRIT Award-winning artist Arlo Parks announces her new album, Ambiguous Desire, due April 3rd via Transgressive Records. Ambiguous Desire is Parks at her most confident and experimental, supplanting live band sessions for modular synths, Ableton plugins and samplers that channel the frenetic, vibrant spaces she was immersed in, all while spotlighting the acclaimed poetry and lyricism she''s beloved for. Reflecting on the making of the record, Parks shares, "I danced more than ever as I made this record, I made more friends than ever too, found myself in the weird underbelly of New York juke nights, unleashed, laughed and laughed and laughed. This record has desire at it''s centre. Desire is a life force, it''s a wanting, a yearning, a momentum - we are all alive because there is something or someone we want - desire is an engine. But it is also mysterious, tangled, random, enlightening and HUMAN." Parks crafted the album with producer Baird (Brockhampton, Kevin Abstract). Their process unfolded between NYC''s vibrant, community-rooted nightlife and long, introspective days spent in Baird''s downtown loft. The result is Parks'' most vulnerable, self-affirming, and euphoric work to date. 140g black 12" vinyl, Gatefold sleeve, reverse board with spot gloss to the front, 12" mirri-board inner sleeve, reverse board, Fold out poster and insert','4/3/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/80/4487580-3514123.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182149,'ambiguous desire iex blue|arlo parks|arlo parks|lp','Ambiguous Desire (IEX) Blue','Arlo Parks','Arlo Parks','LP','TGSS930IEX.1','5400863201654',17.39000000000000056,17.39000000000000056,'45921827','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086320165','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Twice Grammy-nominated, Mercury Prize and BRIT Award-winning artist Arlo Parks announces her new album, Ambiguous Desire, due April 3rd via Transgressive Records. Ambiguous Desire is Parks at her most confident and experimental, supplanting live band sessions for modular synths, Ableton plugins and samplers that channel the frenetic, vibrant spaces she was immersed in, all while spotlighting the acclaimed poetry and lyricism she''s beloved for. Reflecting on the making of the record, Parks shares, "I danced more than ever as I made this record, I made more friends than ever too, found myself in the weird underbelly of New York juke nights, unleashed, laughed and laughed and laughed. This record has desire at it''s centre. Desire is a life force, it''s a wanting, a yearning, a momentum - we are all alive because there is something or someone we want - desire is an engine. But it is also mysterious, tangled, random, enlightening and HUMAN." Parks crafted the album with producer Baird (Brockhampton, Kevin Abstract). Their process unfolded between NYC''s vibrant, community-rooted nightlife and long, introspective days spent in Baird''s downtown loft. The result is Parks'' most vulnerable, self-affirming, and euphoric work to date. 140g marble blue 12" vinyl, Gatefold sleeve, reverse board with spot gloss to the front, 12" mirri-board inner sleeve, reverse board, Fold out poster and insert.','4/3/2026',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4487581-3514124.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182150,'for the people iex jade green 2 lp with side d etching|dropkick murphys|dropkick murphys|lp','For the People (IEX) Jade Green - 2 LP with Side D Etching','Dropkick Murphys','Dropkick Murphys','LP','PITS50.1','5400863189525',25.08999999999999986,25.08999999999999986,'45259593','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086318952','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Indie Exclusive, Poster)',0,'2LP on Jade Green Vinyl with Side D Etching. On Dropkick Murphys'' 13th studio album, the stories run deep, the memories push hard, and the joy remains infectious. This double LP includes five unreleased tracks and an etching of a black rose on Side D. Across the album''s 12 songs, the Boston band imbue the same kind of joy one might celebrate with family and friends. And even when the moods are sad and pensive, it''s hard not to feel personally invested in the band''s emotional spectrum. For The People shows courage and confidence, speaking up against the injustices happening in the United States, doing so with the strength and power that harkens back to Dropkick Murphys'' earliest punk rock roots. Whether it''s politics, family, friends or simply "life," Dropkick Murphys continue to write music that regular people can identify with. The poignant album cover was created by renowned social/political artist Shepard Fairey''s design firm Studio Number One, and the album was produced and mixed by longtime Dropkick Murphys collaborator Ted Hutt. For The People includes guest features form Mary Wallopers, The Scratch, Bill Bragg, and original band member Al Barr.','10/10/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4433812-3404592.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182151,'tubthumper|chumbawamba|chumbawamba|lp','Tubthumper','Chumbawamba','Chumbawamba','LP','IEGA92000.1','5400863207731',26.23000000000000042,26.23000000000000042,'46517319','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086320773','(Expanded Version, Reissue)',0,'Making it''s long-awaited debut on vinyl, Chumbawamba''s multi-million-selling Tubthumper returns in a special expanded 2LP edition curated by the band themselves. Originally released in 1997, the album became a global success, selling more than 3. 5 million copies worldwide and over 3 million copies in the United States alone, reaching No. 3 on the Billboard 200 and earning Platinum and Multi-Platinum certifications across numerous territories. At it''s heart is the era-defining anthem "Tubthumping", one of the biggest singles of the 1990s, which reached No. 2 in the UK, No. 6 on the US Billboard Hot 100 and No. 1 in multiple countries including Australia, Canada, Ireland, Italy and New Zealand. The song has since become a fixture of popular culture through extensive use in film, TV, advertising, video games, and sporting events around the world. This newly expanded edition features the original album alongside a bonus fourth side personally curated by the band, including "Enough Is Enough (Kick It Over)", "Farewell To The Crown", "Top Of The World (Ole Ole Ole)", "Bella Ciao" and "Tony". This definitive release is further enhanced with newly compiled credits, complete lyrics and exclusive song notes from the band, offering fresh insight into one of the most successful and enduring alternative albums of the 1990s. Exp','10/23/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4535743-3691486.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182152,'fenian red|kneecap|kneecap|lp','Fenian - Red','KNEECAP','KNEECAP','LP','HEVL02320.1','5400863202613',17.39000000000000056,17.39000000000000056,'45959905','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540086320261','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Black)',0,'KNEECAP return to bend genre, language, and rules. The most talked about artists in the world are turning the page. A new chapter, new sounds, new manifestos. A blistering album that revels in darkness while bursting through the void with illuminated revery. This is FENIAN. Produced by Dan Carey (Fontaines D.C., Kae Tempest, Wet Leg), FENIAN upends expectations with an expansive sonic palate, traversing acid house, trip-hop, dubstep, and more - Masters of rave and rap theatre, FENIAN represents Kneecap''s most sophisticated exploration of language and sounds. More darkness. More confrontation. More craic. More energy. More solidarity. More absolute bangers. And more fuel for the unrelenting engine that powers this unstoppable force. For their remarkable second album, Kneecap have come out fighting. Throughout, the sirens and alarms ring, and the chorus''s blast. Revolutionary and rebellious, confrontational and impossibly catchy, inescapably intelligent and brilliantly rendered, FENIAN doesn''t just represent the next phase in Kneecap''s trajectory but stands as a remarkable record that thrills as much as it surprises. The mayhem of their breakout year is a memory now. But Kneecap are neither dwelling on that nor merely persevering through it. In FENIAN they excel, reaching a new peak that is undeniable in it''s mastery. Pressure makes diamonds, and FENIAN glistens with Kneecap''s uncut gems.','5/1/2026',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4490249-3588758.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182153,'take me back to eden|sleep token|sleep token|cd','Take Me Back To Eden','Sleep Token','Sleep Token','CD','SPEF800055.2','5401148000559',10.23000000000000042,10.23000000000000042,'43346097','2026-11-10 23:55:51','2026-11-10 23:55:51','/540114800055',NULL,0,'2023 release. With fan worship more intense than ever, and worldwide interest and intrigue growing at runaway speed, Sleep Token are set to reach bold new heights with their third studio album, Take Me Back To Eden. This is the spectacular final chapter to the trilogy that started with their 2019 debut album, Sundowning. More than an hour of music across 12 distinctive tracks, it features the heaviest moments thus far recorded by Sleep Token ("Chokehold" & "The Summoning"), along with some of the most commercial and certainly the most emotional, with a slew of other tones, textures and tangents touched on in-between. Sleep Token boldly reconfirm a true love of the epic (the title track is eight minutes plus), whilst further exploring and developing those elements that keep the music removed from any kind of pack, howling at a moon that''s all it''s own. What comes next, only time will tell, but what''s certain is that it won''t be bound by convention.','5/19/2023',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4188039-2959268.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182154,'endtroducing|dj shadow|dj shadow|lp','Endtroducing.....','DJ Shadow','DJ Shadow','LP','PIAA1129.1','5400863210021',26.23000000000000042,26.23000000000000042,'46438126','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540086321002',NULL,0,'Celebrate three decades of a cinematic masterpiece. Originally released in 1996, DJ Shadow''s debut Endtroducing... stands as a monumental achievement in electronic music, famously recognized by the Guinness World Records as the first album created entirely from samples. It''s influence reverberates through the years, inspiring countless artists and solidifying DJ Shadow''s place as a visionary in the realm of sample-based production. Each track tells a unique story, from the hypnotic groove of "Building Steam With a Grain of Salt" to the cinematic atmosphere of "Midnight in a Perfect World." Shadow''s meticulous craftsmanship shines through, showcasing his unparalleled skill in constructing beats that resonate with both intensity and emotion. This 30th Anniversary Edition is the ultimate celebration of a record that changed hip-hop, electronic music and production culture forever','9/18/2026',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4528643-3669225.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182155,'3d country iex|geese|geese|lp','3D Country (IEX)','Geese','Geese','LP','PASN102IEX.1','5400863208240',17.94999999999999929,17.94999999999999929,'46266903','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540086320824','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Red, Reissue)',0,NULL,'8/28/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4514573-3594766.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182156,'3cag|kneecap|kneecap|lp','3Cag','KNEECAP','KNEECAP','LP','HEVL242.1','5400863211066',20.46999999999999887,20.46999999999999887,'46490278','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540086321106',NULL,0,'Originally released in 2018, 3CAG is the breakthrough mixtape from Belfast trio Kneecap, featuring the tracks that first put the band on the map, including "CEARTA" and the live favorite "Your Sniffer Dogs Are Shite." Originally mastered by Ciar├ín Byrne in Dublin, 3CAG laid the foundation for a career that has since seen Kneecap release the acclaimed albums Fine Art and FENIAN, star in their self-titled feature film, make international television appearances, and perform on some of the world''s biggest stages, from Coachella and Glastonbury to sold-out arena shows. Available on vinyl for the first time, 3CAG captures the energy and irreverence of the release that started it all.','9/25/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/15/4533215-3683910.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182157,'new england forever iex blue|dropkick murphys|dropkick murphys|lp','New England Forever (IEX) Blue','Dropkick Murphys','Dropkick Murphys','LP','PITS60.1','5400863209407',17.39000000000000056,17.39000000000000056,'46296689','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540086320940','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Boston punk veterans Dropkick Murphys link up with rising hardcore band Haywire for an 8-song LP built out of time spent touring together in Europe last fall. Each band contributes three original tracks, plus a cover of the other-Haywire taking on "The Boys Are Back," and Dropkick Murphys reworking "Always By My Side." The collaboration carried over to the stage during Dropkick Murphys'' "For the People... In The Pit" St. Patrick''s Day Tour which marked the bands 30th Anniversary run this February and March, where both bands shared the bill. A straightforward split that connects two generations of the same city and same scene.','6/26/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4516385-3600647.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182158,'black magic rituals perversions vol 1 crystal meth marble|electric wizard|electric wizard|lp','Black Magic Rituals & Perversions Vol. 1 - Crystal Meth Marble','Electric Wizard','Electric Wizard','LP','SPEF800201.1','5401148002010',26.23000000000000042,26.23000000000000042,'45169694','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114800201','(Colored Vinyl, Explicit Cover/Content)',0,'Formed in 1993, Electric Wizard''s brand of doom metal incorporates stoner and sludge traits, with lyrics focusing on the occult, witchcraft, H.P. Lovecraft, horror films, and cannabis. Black Magic Rituals & Perversions Vol.1, a one-take dungeon session, features some of their most classic moments, captured live, raw and uncensored. This is a career-defining collection, and a must-have for followers of this iconic British metal band.','5/30/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4425689-3395413.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182159,'this place will become your tomb|sleep token|sleep token|lp','This Place Will Become Your Tomb','Sleep Token','Sleep Token','LP','SPEF800533.1','5401148005332',23.6700000000000017,23.6700000000000017,'44044756','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114800533',NULL,0,'This Place Will Become Your Tomb is the second studio album by anonymous English rock band Sleep Token. Recorded at G1 Productions in Wells, Somerset, it was produced by George Lever, with whom the group had previously worked on their 2019 debut Sundowning.','9/24/2021',1.320000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4284168-3595273.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182160,'setting fire to the sky turquoise|urne|urne|lp','Setting Fire to the Sky - Turquoise','Urne','Urne','LP','SPEF800825.1','5401148008258',16.39000000000000056,16.39000000000000056,'45743573','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114800825','(Colored Vinyl, Turquoise)',0,'London three-piece Urne have spent the last few years whipping up a firestorm of grit, swagger and grandiosity. Snarling hardcore, extreme inflections, and a strong sense of heavy metal''s inherent classicism, all burn together within Urne''s burial chamber and propel the band forward. Like the best metal albums, Setting Fire to the Sky is about the culture itself. Produced by SikTh co-vocalist Justin Hill, and featuring guest appearances from Troy Sanders (Mastodon) and Jo Quail Setting, Fire to the Sky has a freshness and bite that will tear through the uniform and often flat-sounding metal scene; their incandescent form of modern metal promises to become a supernova.','2/27/2026',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4475595-3494277.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182161,'getting killed iex|geese||lp','Getting Killed (IEX)','Geese',NULL,'LP','PASN3191467.1','540086319146',15.49000000000000021,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/geese-getting-killed-iex/540086319146',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182162,'the end is not the end orange|atreyu|atreyu|lp','The End Is Not the End - Orange','Atreyu','Atreyu','LP','SPEF801076.1','5401148010763',17.39000000000000056,17.39000000000000056,'46034342','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114801076','(Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'The End is Not the End is undeniably Atreyu''s heaviest and most adventurous album ever. "We realized what made Atreyu great in the beginning was that we didn''t sound like anyone else," frontman Brandon Saller explains. "We didn''t really make sense anywhere. We weren''t an emo band, a metal band, a punk band - but somehow it all worked. We kind of just carved our own path." Unburdened by false restrictions about anything sounding "too heavy" or "too pop," ATREYU remains a creative beacon of hope for those shaken by the suggestion that "rock is dead." They''ve entered the Top 10 of the Billboard 200 more than once, and two of their albums are certified gold. Produced by Matt Pauling, Atreyu''s tenth album is vibrant, inventive, and beautifully aggressive. "It''s our heaviest, most metal record we''ve made," Saller points out. "But it''s also the biggest musical journey we''ve taken in years."','4/24/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4496082-3570422.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182163,'oil of every pearl s un insides import|sophie|sophie|lp','Oil Of Every Pearl''s Un-Insides [Import]','Sophie','Sophie','LP','TRGS5600002.1','5413356000023',39.75999999999999802,39.75999999999999802,'43131990','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/541335600002','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Sophie - Oil Of Every Pearl''s Un-Insides - SOPHIE''s debut album, OIL OF EVERY PEARL''s UN-INSIDES, adapts many of the technical strategies heard on her previous work to looser, more sprawling compositions. Instead of chaining together compact singles as on 2015''s PRODUCT, the album builds and releases narrative tension. Beat-heavy romps like "Ponyboy" and "Faceshopping" nestle together at the top of the tracklist after "It''s Okay to Cry," giving way to celestial swells of synthesizer and voice. Where SOPHIE''s early singles exhibited a keen feel for economy and a killer sense of humor, OIL makes a bid for transcendent beauty.','11/4/2022',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4153977-3325945.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182164,'dark sun|dayseeker|dayseeker|lp','Dark Sun','Dayseeker','Dayseeker','LP','SPEF124.1','5401148001242',15.28999999999999915,15.28999999999999915,'43641062','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114800124','(Colored Vinyl, Black, White, Reissue)',0,'Black/White Vinyl Reissue','9/8/2023',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4231442-3023503.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182165,'monarch iex peach cream vinyl|dead poet society|dead poet society|lp','Monarch (IEX) Peach Cream Vinyl','Dead Poet Society','Dead Poet Society','LP','SPEF801268.1','5401148012682',20.46999999999999887,20.46999999999999887,'46479426','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/540114801268','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Peach)',0,'Indie Exclusive Peach Cream Vinyl. Before Dead Poet Society carved out it''s place as one of modern rock''s most distinctive voices, the band began as an obsessive study in emotional contrast, a spirit that courses through Monarch. Across songs like "Hollywood On Fire," "Roach," "Sinner Systems," "Lost In My Head," and "Art Of Suffering," the album takes listeners on a cinematic journey through deconstruction, fury, and ultimately, resolve. For Dead Poet Society, true connection begins where thought gives way to feeling. Produced by Mutemath frontman Paul Meany (Twenty One Pilots, Pierce The Veil, Yungblud) and mixed by GRAMMY Award-winning Adam Hawkins (Turnstile, Twenty One Pilots, mgk), Monarch stands as the natural culmination of the band''s signature alt-rock sound, building on the anthemic foundation of it''s first two albums while continuing to balance vulnerability with confidence. Since forming in 2013 and releasing a handful of EPs, Dead Poet Society''s relentless pursuit of that vision has propelled the band past 200 million streams, yielded multiple Top 10 rock radio singles, and earned spots at major international festivals including Reading & Leeds, Welcome To Rockville, Sonic Temple, Graspop, and 2000trees. Peach Cream LP','10/2/2026',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4532250-3723528.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182166,'let love in|nick cave the bad seeds|nick cave the bad seeds|lp','Let Love In [Explicit Content]','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','LP','MTEU160822.1','5414939710810',22.26000000000000157,22.26000000000000157,'42950554','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/541493971081','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Remastered)',0,'Heavyweight 180 gram vinyl. Vinyl transfer approval overseen by Mick Harvey in Summer 2014 and cut at Abbey Road Studios. This edition, personally approved by Nick Cave, is finally available again on it''s original format. ''Let Love In'', the eighth studio album by Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds, was originally released in 1994. ┬╖ Their first full-length studio album in over two years, ''Let Love In'' preserves the same line-up (Nick Cave, Mick Harvey, Blixa Bargeld, Conway Savage, Martyn Casey and Thomas Wydler) as established on it''s two immediate predecessors: ''Henry''s Dream'' (1992), the band''s troubled collaboration with producer David Briggs and ''Live Seeds'' (1993), an interim concert compilation. Vinyl transfer approval overseen by Mick Harvey during Summer 2014 and cut at Abbey Road studios. Heavyweight 180 gram vinyl. This edition, approved personally by Nick Cave, is finally available again on it''s original format.','2/17/2015',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/2156478-2493953.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182167,'alf leila wa leila|om kalsoum|om kalsoum|lp','Alf Leila Wa Leila','Om Kalsoum','Om Kalsoum','LP','SUMS1A.1','5414165088646',28.37000000000000099,28.37000000000000099,'46369802','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/541416508864',NULL,0,'Souma Records present a vinyl reissue of Om Kalsoum''s Alf Leila Wa Leila, originally released in 1969. They call her "The Rose of the Nile", "The Queen of the Nile", "The Daughter of the Nile", or even "The 4th Pyramid of Egypt" since she''s known as the greatest Egyptian singer of all times. Om Kalsoum''s mythical life story of a poor peasant girl who grew up to become the face of Egypt is a 20th-century fairytale. Almost half a decade after her death the power of her music and singing is still moving the hearts of millions of people worldwide. At the end of her overwhelming career she was introduced to the young but brilliant composer Baligh Hamdy who wrote this 30-minute lasting monument for her in 1969. In the footsteps of Mohamed Abdel Wahab, the godfather of Egyptian modern music, Baligh Hamdy refreshed the classical Egyptian orchestra sound with the addition of stylish instruments like electric guitar (Omar Khorshid), organ (Hany Mehanna), accordion, and horns that were adapted to the eastern tonal system. The studio version of this immortal "Alf Leila We Leila" must undeniably be archived under the best recordings ever made in music history. A Radio Martiko product.','7/17/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/3651167-3607122.jpg?ae=4621895153','International');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182168,'murder ballads|nick cave the bad seeds|nick cave the bad seeds|lp','Murder Ballads [Explicit Content]','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds','LP','MTEU160823.1','5414939710919',27.14999999999999858,27.14999999999999858,'42950561','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/541493971091','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds was originally formed in 1984 by two former members of the Australian band the Birthday Party: Nick Cave (vocals, songwriter, keyboards, harmonica) and multi-instrumentalist Mick Harvey. They were joined by Einst├╝rzende Neubauten member Blixa Bargeld (guitar), Hugo Race (guitar), and former Magazine member Barry Adamson (bass, piano). Cave''s former girlfriend Anita Lane was also a creative influence and occasional lyricist. This line-up recorded their debut album, from Her to Eternity, released in 1984. During their initial Australian tour, Birthday Party bass guitarist Tracy Pew also performed with the band. With the Bad Seeds, Cave continued to explore his obsessions with religion, death, love, America, and violence with a bizarre, sometimes self-consciously eclectic hybrid of blues, gospel, rock, and arty post-punk, although in a more subdued fashion than his work with the Birthday Party. Cave also allowed his literary aspirations to come to the forefront; the lyrics are narrative prose, heavy on literary allusions and myth-making, and take some inspiration from Leonard Cohen. Cave''s gloomy lyrics, dark musical arrangements, and deep baritone voice recall the albums of Scott Walker, who also obsessed over death and love with a frightening passion. However, Cave brings a hefty amount of post-punk experimentalism to Walker''s epic dark pop.','2/17/2015',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4411157.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182169,'hijos del sol|hermanos gutierrez|hermanos gutierrez|lp','Hijos Del Sol','Hermanos Gutierrez','Hermanos Gutierrez','LP','HGUT2020.1','600385306911',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'44366766','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/60038530691',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing.','10/11/2024',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4366339-3232191.jpg?ae=4621895153','International');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182170,'1192|weezer|weezer|lp','1192','Weezer','Weezer','LP','EJRC236.1','600064803618',25.46000000000000085,25.46000000000000085,'45972669','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/60006480361','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gray)',0,'STOCK DEPLETED. Weezer founding member and original bassist, Matt Sharp, while working on a series of "lost-albums" from the cutting room floor of his creative-life, stumbled upon a curious multi-track reel of analog tape. This mysterious reel found at the bottom of a treasure chest of other master recordings just happened to contain Weezer''s very first studio sessions. These were the very same recordings that were responsible for earning the band a record contract for their iconic debut "Blue" album. These newly discovered sessions feature raw, vividly emotional and ecstatic versions of the band''s timeless hit songs Say It Ain''t So and Undone (The Sweater Song.) Sharp and legendary music producer Joe Chicarrelli took these recordings to Los Angeles'' famed East/West Studios, where the Beach Boys created Pet Sounds and Sinatra recorded My Way, to take a deeper look into this mythic reel of 1-inch Ampex tape. What the two men quickly discovered was the original lineup (with guitarist Jason Cropper) in an infectious, explosively joyful, feral form. Making the decision to honor the original intention of the music and the traditional technology of the era, the songs were remixed from top to bottom, from tape to vinyl, in a 100% analog process. With Sharp as producer and Chicarrelli on the mix, the result of these sessions makes up the entirety of the new Weezer album titled "1192" (named after the month and year it was originally recorded.) The illuminating spirit of the performances on 1192 are guaranteed to turn the world upside down for blue album fans everywhere. This album stands on it''s own as an essential entry into the band''s discography and is crucial to understanding the first chapter in Weezer''s storied history.','4/18/2026',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4491483-3565458.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182171,'1192|weezer|weezer|lp','1192','Weezer','Weezer','LP','EJRC236A.1','600064803625',25.46000000000000085,25.46000000000000085,'46442819','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/60006480362',NULL,0,'WEEZER / 1192 - Weezer founding member and original bassist, Matt Sharp, while working on a series of "lost-albums" from the cutting room floor of his creative-life, stumbled upon a curious multi-track reel of analog tape. This mysterious reel found at the bottom of a treasure chest of other master recordings just happened to contain Weezer''s very first studio sessions. These were the very same recordings responsible for earning the band a record contract for their iconic debut "Blue" album. These newly discovered sessions feature raw, vividly emotional and ecstatic versions of the band''s timeless hit songs Say It Ain''t So and Undone (The Sweater Song. ) Sharp and legendary music producer Joe Chicarrelli took these recordings to Los Angeles'' famed East/West Studios to take a deeper look into this mythic reel of 1-inch Ampex tape. What the two men quickly discovered was the original lineup (with guitarist Jason Cropper) in an infectious, explosively joyful, feral form. Making the decision to honor the original intention of the music and the traditional technology of the era, the songs were remixed from top to bottom, from tape to vinyl, in a 100% analog process. With Sharp as producer and Chicarrelli on the mix, the result of these sessions makes up the entirety of "1192" (named after the month and year it was originally recorded. ) The illuminating spirit of the performances on 1192 are guaranteed to turn the world upside down for blue album fans everywhere. This album stands on it''s own as an essential entry into the band''s discography and is crucial to understanding the first chapter in Weezer''s storied history.','9/25/2026',0.4000000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4529075-3704600.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182172,'hound|nothing hey|nothing hey|lp','Hound','Nothing Hey','Nothing Hey','LP','ISC247801.1','600574155481',32.25,32.25,'46444585','2026-11-10 23:55:52','2026-11-10 23:55:52','/60057415548','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Smoke, Poster)',0,'Limited red and smoke split color vinyl LP pressing. Hey, nothing be a lover, be a hound! Here is our #1 best-selling album, "Hound." It''s REALLY good. #available on red smoke split color vinyl with poster included.','9/11/2026',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4529200-3704050.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
