INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182179,'songs in the key of life 2 lp 7|stevie wonder|stevie wonder|lp','Songs In The Key Of Life [2 LP+7"]','Stevie Wonder','Stevie Wonder','LP','MOT5316422.1','600753164228',28.75,28.75,'14377280','2026-11-10 23:55:53','2026-11-10 23:55:53','/60075316422','(180 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'2 LP+7". When you''re in the zone, you go with it, night and day-and that''s what Stevie did in the mid-''70s when Motown gave him full artistic control and his blazing creativity and prolific studio sessions yielded this hugely anticipated double album. "Songs in the Key of Life" became one of the most successful albums of all time, and a personal favorite of Stevie''s, Michael Jackson''s, Prince''s and decades of future musicians and Stevie Wonder fans. This Motown reissue is the one to have if you want the very best: double 180-gram vinyl plus the bonus 7" vinyl EP that accompanied the album''s original release: "Saturn," "Ebony Eyes," "All Day Sucker" and "Easy Goin'' Evening (My Mama''s Call)." Those join his twin #1 smashes "Sir Duke" and "I Wish," the hits "Another Star" and "As," his beautiful instant classic "Isn''t She Lovely"... an absolute thing of beauty, and that goes for this album and this triple-disc edition! Motown.','5/5/2009',1.540000000000000035,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/6/8/3/1493860.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
