INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182397,'luke grimes|luke grimes|luke grimes|lp','Luke Grimes','Luke Grimes','Luke Grimes','LP','MERN144011.1','602465148527',22.26000000000000157,22.26000000000000157,'44214098','2026-11-10 23:56:03','2026-11-10 23:56:03','/60246514852',NULL,0,'Luke Grimes self-titled album will be released on vinyl and will include 13 tracks including "Burn", "Hold On", "Oh Ohio" and 10 more tracks. Known for his role as Kayce Dutton on the hit television series, "Yellowstone," Grimes has been making music for years and he closed out 2023 with a sold-out tour after playing fairs and festivals around the country, including Stagecoach, Pilgrimage Music and Cultural Festival, Under the Big Sky Festival and more. Grimes grew up playing music in the church as the son of a Pentecostal pastor. His father also laid the foundation for the music he loves, introducing him to the works of Johnny Cash, Merle Haggard, Willie Nelson, and Waylon Jennings.','5/17/2024',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4312231-3130718.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182398,'the filth the fury limited red white colored vinyl import|the sex pistols|the sex pistols|lp','The Filth & The Fury - Limited Red & White Colored Vinyl [Import]','The Sex Pistols','The Sex Pistols','LP','UNUK5895607.1','602458956078',45.5799999999999983,45.5799999999999983,'44346911','2026-11-10 23:56:03','2026-11-10 23:56:03','/60245895607','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Limited red & white colored vinyl. Back in the year 2000, Julien Temple directed this account of Punk pioneers The Sex Pistols short but hugely influential initial career. The soundtrack - a mix of their classic tracks, rarities and a sprinkling of diverse artists from the Bay City Rollers and Sailor to Tappa Zukie and The Who - was only ever available on CD, making this it''s vinyl debut. Uncluttered by the other artists tracks, the OST spread across 2 slices of red and white vinyl includes sing along family favourites Liar, Anarchy In The UK and No Fun alongside lesser known but no less essential cuts Don''t Give Me No Lip, Road Runner and What''cha Gonna Do About It. The latter cover of The Small Faces classic comes complete with amended lyrics reflecting the spirit of the times. Limited Edition and numbered to 3k units.','4/26/2024',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/34/4338134-3179226.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182399,'the tortured poets department ghosted white 2 lp|taylor swift|taylor swift|lp','The Tortured Poets Department [Ghosted White 2 LP] [Explicit Content]','Taylor Swift','Taylor Swift','LP','RPBL146549.1','602458933314',37.59000000000000342,37.59000000000000342,'44256463','2026-11-10 23:56:03','2026-11-10 23:56:03','/60245893331','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Taylor Swift - THE TORTURED POETS DEPARTMENT  [Ghosted White 2 LP] - Pop Double white colored vinyl LP pressing. 2024 release. The Tortured Poets Department (also shortened to Tortured Poets) is the eleventh studio album by the American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift. Shortly after finishing work on Midnights, Swift conceived The Tortured Poets Department and developed it during the Eras Tour (2023-2024). She described the album as her "lifeline" record, a product of imperative songwriting. It consists of sixteen songs, featuring collaborations with the American rapper Post Malone features on "Fortnight" and the English indie rock band Florence and the Machine on "Florida!!!". Each of the four physical versions of the album include one additional bonus track.','4/19/2024',1.510000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4322267-3244614.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182400,'found heaven target exclusive|conan gray|conan gray|cd','Found Heaven (Target Exclusive)','Conan Gray','Conan Gray','CD','RPBL144065.2','602465166118',11.64000000000000056,11.64000000000000056,'44147983','2026-11-10 23:56:03','2026-11-10 23:56:03','/60246516611','(Alternate Cover)',0,'Conan Gray, the critically acclaimed global pop superstar, is back with his third studio album, ''FOUND HEAVEN.'' The highly anticipated 3rd LP includes singles "Never Ending Song," "Winner," "Killing Me," and "Lonely Dancers." Conan reigns in his magnetic new era and sound as he expresses his undeniable authenticity and originality through his art.','4/5/2024',0.2000000000000000111,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4298322-3122210.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
