INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182433,'access all areas|flo|flo|lp','Access All Areas [Explicit Content]','Flo','Flo','LP','RPBL167073.1','602465364460',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'44734848','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246536446','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. 2024 release. Introducing Flo''s debut album: Access All Areas. A body of work imbued with Flo''s unapologetic, contagious force. Blending the rich tones and luscious melodies of R&B and soul with futuristic production, contagious hooks and candid, relatable lyricism, the project is an iconic milestone for the group. Featuring singles such as "Walk Like This," new single "Check," plus many more.','11/15/2024',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/4383345-3291696.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182434,'postcards from texas|miranda lambert|miranda lambert|lp','Postcards From Texas [Explicit Content]','Miranda Lambert','Miranda Lambert','LP','RPBL161151.1','602465920352',32.25,32.25,'44551346','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246592035','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Postcard)',0,'Postcards from Texas captures the country siren''s freewheeling, funny, at times feisty take on swing, shuffles, bluegrass and ballads with unbridled gusto. Co-produced with Jon Randall, Postcards delivers Lambert''s glorious, wild Lone Star freedom. Vinyl Packaging: 2 LP set on sea blue color vinyl with 4x6 postcard of Miranda included.','9/13/2024',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4363938-3217956.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182435,'the secret of us|gracie abrams|gracie abrams|lp','The Secret Of Us [Explicit Content]','Gracie Abrams','Gracie Abrams','LP','ISC162332.1','602465931266',32.25,32.25,'44742959','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246593126','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Deluxe Edition, Clear Vinyl)',0,'Gracie Abrams returns with the deluxe version of her sophomore album, The Secret of Us (Deluxe)released via Interscope Records. This is Gracie''s most expansive body of work both sonically and narratively. Building onto a massive year for Gracie, she adds 4 new songs including fan favorite ''That''s So True''. Gracie''s growth as a songwriter and vocalist is showcased in her most extroverted album yet, as she continues to work with longtime collaborator Aaron Dessner. A portion of these songs were also written with Gracie''s best friend, Audrey Hobert. This album was written with the urgency with which you run home to detail every moment of a night to your friend, with her live experiences over the past year having deeply shaped the identity of this album. EXPLICIT','1/17/2025',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4384355-3283735.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182436,'wonderful world the best of louis armstrong|louis armstrong|louis armstrong|lp','Wonderful World: The Best Of Louis Armstrong','Louis Armstrong','Louis Armstrong','LP','VRV159518.1','602465937398',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'44561406','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246593739',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2024 collection. Louis Armstrong made his first studio records in Richmond, Indiana 101 years ago, recording acoustically because microphones hadn''t yet been invented. Microphones eventually allowed Armstrong to begin recording electrically to disc and, later, to tape in the mono and "hi-fi" eras. Beginning in the late 1950s, Armstrong began making records in revolutionary stereophonic sound. He had seen and conquered every trend in recording technology between 1923 and his death in 1971-and he continues to conquer them into the 21st century, over 50 years since he passed away. Today, with the advent of streaming and the resurgence of popularity in LPs, there is more music available to the public to listen to than at any previous time in history. Yet, day after day, week after week, month after month, year after year, people from around the world still choose to listen to Louis Armstrong, much more so than any other artist born at the turn of the 20th century. The question remains: Why? This new collection helps to provide answers.','9/13/2024',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4364965-3258466.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182437,'cut limited orange colored vinyl import|the slits|the slits|lp','Cut - Limited Orange Colored Vinyl [Import]','The Slits','The Slits','LP','UNUK6592780.1','602465927801',28.12000000000000099,28.12000000000000099,'44676179','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246592780','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Formed in London during the first wave of punk, in 1976, The Slits were all-female firebrands whose influence stretches far beyond music, shaping fashion trends and forcing a wholesale rethink of cultural attitudes towards women in rock. Mixing African rhythms and Jamaican dub into their unique sonic blend, Ari Up (vocals), Viv Albertine (guitar) and Tessa Pollitt (bass) transcended barriers of all kinds - social, political and musical - inspiring generations of female musicians to give the finger to the establishment and follow their own paths. With it''s DNA traceable in everything from the riot grrrl movement of the 1990s to the music of grunge pioneer Courtney Love, electro-punk agitator Peaches, rapper and activist M.I.A. and returning Arkansas rockers Gossip, The Slits'' seminal debut album, Cut, has lost none of it''s power. With it''s densely layered sound providing a backdrop to songs that tackle such unlikely subject matter as shoplifting, consumerism, sexual politics and the commercial exploitation of women, it remains an inspirational album from an era in which women were beginning to take the reins in the creative arts.','11/1/2024',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4376777-3274311.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182438,'kansas anymore|role model|role model|lp','Kansas Anymore [Explicit Content]','Role Model','Role Model','LP','ISC155396.1','602465688368',23.25,23.25,'44434243','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246568836','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Role Model''s sophomore album "Kansas Anymore" is inspired by homesickness, heartbreak, and the process of redefining oneself. He began the project in 2022 but, faced with the ending of a formative relationship, he scrapped much of this early work. On his own and reinspired, he started anew, collaborating with Noah Conrad, Ian Fitchuk, Scott Harris & Jonah Shy to craft "Kansas Anymore" - a folk-tinged, lyric driven album featuring 13 new songs including "Oh Gemini" and "Deeply Still in Love." BLUE LP','7/19/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4349336-3204179.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182439,'hurry up tomorrow|the weeknd|the weeknd|lp','Hurry Up Tomorrow [Explicit Content]','The Weeknd','The Weeknd','LP','XOR167994.1','602465994759',13.83999999999999986,13.83999999999999986,'44834579','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246599475','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Hurry Up Tomorrow is the sixth studio album by the Canadian singer-songwriter The Weeknd. It is the final part of an album trilogy that began with After Hours (2020) and continued with Dawn FM (2022). The Weeknd announced the new album saying "This album represents the creative apex of the project, serving as the third and final chapter crafted with existential and self-referential themes as seen with the latest visionary teasers that have set fans ablaze with anticipation for this concluding installment." EXPLICIT','1/31/2025',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4393637-3324904.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182440,'aerosmith legendary edition|aerosmith|aerosmith|lp','Aerosmith (Legendary Edition)','Aerosmith','Aerosmith','LP','CAP192066.1','602465852424',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45942174','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246585242','(180 Gram Vinyl, Booklet, Remastered, Photo / Photo Card)',0,'Aerosmith -"Aerosmith (Legendary Edition)" [180g LP] Aerosmith''s blistering eponymous debut showcases the legendary band''s high-energy riffs, powerful rhythm section and soaring vocals which would become their trademark sound for over 50 years. Pressed on 180g black vinyl, this newly mixed and remastered Legendary Edition features timeless classics like "Mama Kin," "Movin'' Out" and "Make It," plus the enduring anthem "Dream On" accompanied by a 12-page booklet with previously unseen photos.','3/20/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/68/4488768-3543999.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182441,'who believes in angels|elton john brandi carlile|elton john brandi carlile|lp','Who Believes In Angels?','Elton John & Brandi Carlile','Elton John & Brandi Carlile','LP','ISC168600.1','602465958034',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'44966324','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246595803','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Pink, Orange)',0,'Elton John & Brandi Carlile - "Who Believes in Angels? " [Pink Spiral LP] Written and recorded over 20 days, ''Who Believes In Angels?'' is a collaborative studio album between Elton John and Brandi Carlile. It mixes Elton-led songs and Brandi-led songs, with long-term collaborator Bernie Taupin and Brandi both contributing lyrics, and producer and co-writer Andrew Watt acting as the producer, mediator and creative conduit. They are backed by a world-class band of musicians comprising of Chad Smith, Pino Palladino and Josh Klinghoffer. Available on pink swirl color vinyl. Limited Edition. Indie Exclusive.','4/4/2025',1.040000000000000035,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4406447-3329085.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182442,'portrait|samara joy|samara joy|lp','Portrait','Samara Joy','Samara Joy','LP','VRV161443.1','602468013167',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'44598303','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246801316',NULL,0,'SAMARA JOY / PORTRAIT Born out of her time on the road, Samara Joy took her touring band into legendary Van Gelder Studios in February of 2024. This record, appropriately entitled Portrait, is a collection of standards (as well as one original) and features her singular voice, alongside arrangements from this tight-knit young group. The recording tells the story of the community sheΓÇÖs created with a new generation of young players and is evocative of the energy of her incredible live show. SAMARA JOY / PORTRAIT','10/11/2024',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4369122-3234543.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182443,'the death of slim shady coup de gr ce red blue 2 lp|eminem|eminem|lp','The Death of Slim Shady (Coup de Gr├óce) [Red/ Blue 2 LP] [Explicit Content]','Eminem','Eminem','LP','ISC162086.1','602468081425',32.25,32.25,'44538217','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246808142','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Red, Blue)',0,'Double red and blue colored vinyl LP pressing. In this riveting journey throughout his 12th studio album, The Death of Slim Shady (Coupe de Gr├óce), Eminem delves into uncharted territories, exploring the demise and rebirth of his iconic alter ego. With raw lyrical prowess and captivating storytelling, Eminem delivers an emotional rollercoaster that showcases his evolution. The Death of Slim Shady (Coupe de Gr├óce) is a bold and groundbreaking chapter in Eminem''s discography that will not let any Stans down in the slightest.','10/25/2024',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4362410-3214931.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182444,'songs of a lost world|the cure|the cure|lp','Songs Of A Lost World','The Cure','The Cure','LP','CAP164259.1','602468089216',26.96000000000000085,26.96000000000000085,'44692988','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246808921','(180 Gram Vinyl, Ecopak - Biodegradable PKG)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2024 release. After 16 years, The Cure is back with their 14th studio album, SONGS OF A LOST WORLD. Songs from the record were previewed during their 90-date, 33-country ''Shows Of A Lost World'' tour for more than 1.3 million people to overwhelming fan and critical acclaim. Speaking about, "Alone," the opening track on the album, Robert Smith says, "It''s the track that unlocked the record; as soon as we had that piece of music recorded, I knew it was the opening song and I felt the whole album come into focus... that was the moment when I knew the song - and the album - were real." Robert Smith created the sleeve concept and Andy Vella, a longtime Cure collaborator, handled the album''s art and design. The cover art features ''Bagatelle,'' a 1975 sculpture by Janez Pirnat.','11/1/2024',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4378451-3271153.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182445,'say it like you mean it|the starting line|the starting line|lp','Say It Like You Mean It','The Starting Line','The Starting Line','LP','GEF161259.1','602465943306',21.51999999999999958,21.51999999999999958,'44684358','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246594330',NULL,0,NULL,'10/18/2024',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4369892-3302972.jpg?ae=4621895153',NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182446,'sing the sorrow|afi|afi|lp','Sing The Sorrow','AFI','AFI','LP','ISC161238.1','602465982664',26.96000000000000085,26.96000000000000085,'44612924','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246598266','(45 RPM)',0,'Double vinyl LP set pressed at 45rpm and housed in gatefold jacket. Sing The Sorrow is AFI''s breakthrough sixth studio album, which reached the Top 5 on the Billboard 200 when it was originally released in 2003. Co-produced by Jerry Finn and Butch Vig, the album retains the Bay Area outfit''s signature aggression and pathos - forging ever forward into uncharted territory like the virtuoso guitar intro of "The Leaving Song Pt. 2" or the industrial-leaning break and Dead Can Dance-worthy outro of "Death Of Seasons."','9/27/2024',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4365224-3270679.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182447,'the show live from madison square garden translucent yellow lp|niall horan|niall horan|lp','The Show: Live from Madison Square Garden [Translucent Yellow LP]','Niall Horan','Niall Horan','LP','CAP162650.1','602468032038',21.82000000000000028,21.82000000000000028,'44603489','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60246803203','(Clear Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Niall Horan is celebrating the incredible run of his ongoing 2024 world tour with The Show: Live from Madison Square Garden, collecting some of the finest moments of Horan''s sold-out, two-night takeover of the legendary New York venue. The songs captured on this release hail from all three solo albums, including The Show, which debuted at No. 1 on Billboard''s Top Album Sales tally and also topped the charts in the U.K., Ireland, Australia, New Zealand, Holland and Belgium, among others. Listeners can relive striking, full-band renditions of the triumphant, harmony-rich "Heaven," groove-steeped pop gem "Slow Hands," and Horan''s first solo release, the intimate, acoustic "This Town," alongside fan favorites from the past eight years of powerful songcraft. Horan''s latest outing has been a landmark one - his biggest tour yet, and his first headline run since 2018''s Flicker World Tour. Niall Horan -"The Show: Live On Tour" Pressed on 140-gram translucent yellow 12" vinyl.','12/13/2024',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4369172-3232870.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182448,'live from fenway park|noah kahan|noah kahan|lp','Live From Fenway Park [Explicit Content]','Noah Kahan','Noah Kahan','LP','MRY167479.1','602475017332',40.25,40.25,'44966669','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:10','/602475017332','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',1,'Noah Kahan - Live From Fenway Park - Vinyl 2 LP Grammy-nominated Noah Kahan celebrates an incredible season of accolades by releasing a live album of his high point thus far ΓÇô selling out 2 nights at his New England hometown Fenway Park, which saw over 70,000 fans in attendance with special guests Gracie Abrams, The Lumineers and more! Noah debuts many songs on tour as he writes towards his next album. This live album sees the first release of ΓÇ£Pain Is Cold Water,ΓÇ¥ a song so new that Noah hasn''t even recorded it yet. 2 LP set.','3/7/2025',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4406483-3328593.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182449,'worlds 10th anniversary edition|porter robinson|porter robinson|lp','Worlds (10th Anniversary Edition)','PORTER ROBINSON','PORTER ROBINSON','LP','ASK163690.1','602475098997',37.59000000000000342,37.59000000000000342,'44856076','2026-11-10 23:56:05','2026-11-10 23:56:05','/60247509899','(Limited Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Double pearl colored vinyl LP pressing. PORTER ROBINSON''s debut studio album, Worlds, took the electronic music landscape by storm in 2014. Inspired by themes of fantasy, escapism, fiction, and nostalgia, Worlds continues to transport listeners to new realms a decade later. Worlds (10th Anniversary Edition) comes with holographic cover art and a brand-new bonus song, "Hollowheart (ft. Amy Millan)," originally recorded during the Worlds sessions but never released until now. Enjoy and escape with this electronic classic ten years later.','1/31/2025',0.939999999999999947,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/4395707-3323116.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
