INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182496,'anthology collection 2025 edition|the beatles|the beatles|lp','Anthology Collection (2025 Edition)','The Beatles','The Beatles','LP','CAP204765.1','602475840435',297.7799999999999727,297.7799999999999727,'45466663','2026-11-10 23:56:09','2026-11-10 23:56:09','/60247584043','(Oversize Item Split, Boxed Set, Bonus Tracks, 180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'The Beatles - "Anthology Collection (2025 Edition)" [180g 12 LP Boxset] The Anthology Collection 12LP set includes the 3 groundbreaking Anthology albums from the mid-90s, remastered in 2025 by Giles Martin, plus a new compilation, Anthology 4. Containing 191 tracks, the collection''s studio outtakes, live performances, broadcasts and demos reveal the development of The Beatles from 1958 to 2023''s final single, "Now And Then." Anthology 4 features 13 unreleased tracks and 17 songs selected from Super Deluxe versions of 5 classic albums. In addition to fascinating outtakes from 1963-1969, the album includes new 2025 mixes by JeffLynne of "Free As A Bird," and "Real Love." Furthermore, Anthology 4 presents 26 tracks previously unavailable on vinyl. Pressed on 180g vinyl, each 3LP set is housed in a triple-gatefold sleeve featuring original art, sleeve notes by Mark Lewisohn, and restored photos for Anthology 1-3. Anthology 4 has new sleeve notes by Kevin Howlett, plus photos. The outer slipcase features the original Klaus Voorman triptych art.','11/21/2025',9.30000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4453082-3441416.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182497,'beautiful chaos|katseye|katseye|lp','Beautiful Chaos [Explicit Content]','Katseye','Katseye','LP','BGHM169915.1','602475849827',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'45199530','2026-11-10 23:56:09','2026-11-10 23:56:09','/60247584982','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Extended Play, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Limited neon green colored vinyl LP pressing. Katseye''s 2nd EP, BEAUTIFUL CHAOS, via HYBE x Geffen Records, embraces the key message of "celebrating confusion." By incorporating a wide range of genres, the EP goes beyond any boundaries, expressing the chaos in various creative that comes with pushing the limits as an artist, while portraying Katseye''s journey of growth. The six members of Katseye are: DANIELA (USA); LARA (USA); MANON (Switzerland); MEGAN (USA); SOPHIA (Philippines); and YOONCHAE (South Korea). EXPLICIT','6/27/2025',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/4428164-3413255.jpg?ae=4621895153','K-Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182498,'live from austin city limits|brittany howard|brittany howard|lp','Live From Austin City Limits','Brittany Howard','Brittany Howard','LP','ISL168823.1','602475749677',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'44955243','2026-11-10 23:56:09','2026-11-10 23:56:09','/60247574967','(RSD Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'ALLOCATED AND STOCK DEPLETED. Grammy-winning singer-songwriter Brittany Howard presents Live From Austin City Limits, recorded on April 29, 2024 at the Moody Theater. Celebrating it''s 50th anniversary, Austin City Limits is the longest-running music series in television history. The electrifying performance, which aired on October 26, 2024, features the Nashville-based musician backed by her stellar 8-piece band with backing vocalists Shanay Johnson and Karita Law. Released for Record Store Day 2025, this limited-edition release is pressed on vibrant 12" electric blue vinyl and offers an exclusive live experience, showcasing Howard''s powerful vocals and dynamic stage presence. Perfect for collectors and fans alike.','4/12/2025',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4405282-3328088.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182499,'this wasn t meant for you anyway|lola young|lola young|lp','This Wasn''t Meant For You Anyway [Explicit Content]','Lola Young','Lola Young','LP','ISL168373.1','602475766995',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'44915056','2026-11-10 23:56:10','2026-11-10 23:56:10','/60247576699','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Clear Vinyl, Red)',0,'Lola Young - "This Wasn''t Meant For You Anyway" [Transparent Red LP] "Here is my first-born child, a fck you to all my exes, and basically me just trying to figure out some shit openly and honestly on record. First of many and if you don''t like it, then this wasn''t meant for you anyway." - Lola Young This Wasn''t Meant For You Anyway marks a remarkable shift in Lola''s sound as an artist. Recorded in LA and produced by friend and collaborator Solomonophic (Remi Wolf, BROCKHAMPTON, Dominic Fike), This Wasn''t Meant For You Anyway is a multi-faceted, fearless concept. As irresistible as it is unexpected, Lola''s album is crackling with kinetic energy and lyrically fueled by rage, passion, narrative flair and comedy derision. A contemporary break-up album, This Wasn''t Meant For You Anyway encapsulates the sound of what it means to be young and in constant romantic chaos. Released in June 2024, the album is now available on transparent red vinyl. EXPLICIT','2/28/2025',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4400423-3329202.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
