INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182638,'pholks|leon thomas|leon thomas|lp','Pholks [Explicit Content]','Leon Thomas','Leon Thomas','LP','MOT212253.1','602478815072',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'45585296','2026-11-10 23:56:15','2026-11-10 23:56:15','/60247881507','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Extended Play, Clear Vinyl, Black)',0,'Limited clear and black vinyl pressing. Grammy Award-winning Leon Thomas returns with PHOLKS, a love letter to beautiful chaos and the need to feel. Following the acclaim of MUTT, PHOLKS doubles down on raw creativity - marking a movement as bold as it is timeless, an experience meant to be disruptive, not just heard. Blending the groove of funk, the golden age of R&B, and the raw defiance of classic rock, the EP showcases his command as a multi-instrumentalist and visionary. Available on black/clear 12" vinyl.','1/30/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/4463225-3469281.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182639,'songs for swingin lovers blue note tone poet edition|frank sinatra|frank sinatra|lp','Songs For Swingin'' Lovers (Blue Note Tone Poet Edition)','Frank Sinatra','Frank Sinatra','LP','BLUN239867.1','602478949104',29.8299999999999983,29.8299999999999983,'46013965','2026-11-10 23:56:15','2026-11-10 23:56:15','/60247894910','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Frank Sinatra - "Songs For Swingin'' Lovers (Blue Note Tone Poet Edition)" [180g Heavy Vinyl LP] Following his melancholy masterpiece In The Wee Small Hours, legendary vocalist Frank Sinatra brightened the mood with the exuberant Songs For Swingin'' Lovers released on Capitol Records in 1956 and featuring uptempo numbers arranged by Nelson Riddle. This mono Blue Note Tone Poet Edition was produced by Joe Harley, mastered by Kevin Gray from the original analog master tapes, pressed on 180g vinyl at RTI, and packaged in a deluxe gatefold tip-on jacket featuring session photos by William Claxton & Ken Veeder.','3/27/2026',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4491589-3551885.jpg?ae=4621895153','Crooners');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(182640,'o brother where art thou original motion picture soundtrack 25th anniversary|various artists|various artists|lp','O Brother, Where Art Thou? (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack) (25th Anniversary)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','LHWY213128.1','602478861192',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'45760327','2026-11-10 23:56:15','2026-11-10 23:56:15','/60247886119','(Anniversary Edition, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'O Brother, Where Art Thou? (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack) (25th Anniversary) - Various Artists - Vinyl 2 LP O Brother, Where Art Thou? sparked a 21st-century cultural renaissance. The soundtrack, which is certified 8 times platinum by the RIAA, reintroduced traditional American roots music to the masses and brought genres like bluegrass, gospel, blues, country, and folk back to the mainstream. The albumΓÇÖs critical success took the world by surprise, and subsequently by storm, influencing the next wave of popular music, rooted in the American South. 2 LP set on standard black vinyl in bona fide gatefold jacket.','2/20/2026',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4477286-3500641.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
