INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183061,'eodm presents boots electric performing the beat songs we never wrote import|eagles of death metal|eagles of death metal|lp','EODM Presents Boots Electric Performing The Beat Songs We Never Wrote [Explicit Content] [Import]','Eagles of Death Metal','Eagles of Death Metal','LP','UMEB002972301.1','602577394911',28.67999999999999972,28.67999999999999972,'38999901','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257739491','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. 2019 release. Eagles of Death Metal''s Jesse "Boots Electric" Hughes is tipping his hat to 13 of his favorite songs with his first covers album, titled Eagles of Death Metal Presents Boots Electric Performing The Best Songs We Never Wrote. Hughes recorded and produced electrifying renditions of 13 songs he loves, including covers of KISS, Guns N'' Roses, AC/DC, Love & Rockets, Ramones, Steve Miller Band, George Michael/Wham, Mary J. Blige, Queens of the Stone Age, The Distillers, David Bowie and others.','6/7/2019',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/3664891-2471193.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183062,'happiness begins|jonas brothers|jonas brothers|lp','Happiness Begins','Jonas Brothers','Jonas Brothers','LP','RPBLB003042401.1','602577863592',27.48999999999999844,27.48999999999999844,'39055125','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257786359',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Happiness Begins is the fifth studio album by the Jonas Brothers, released on June 7, 2019. It is their first album since 2013''s Live, and first studio album since 2009''s Lines, Vines and Trying Times. It was preceded by their comeback single "Sucker" as well as "Cool". Happiness Begins debuted atop the US Billboard 200 with the largest sales week for an album since 2017.','8/16/2019',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/9/3/2/3922399.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183063,'jackson 5 greatest hits|the jackson 5|the jackson 5|lp','Jackson 5 - Greatest Hits','The Jackson 5','The Jackson 5','LP','MOTB003071601.1','602577974632',22.16000000000000014,22.16000000000000014,'39515575','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257797463',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing containing the rare ''quad mix'' of the album. The original release of The Jackson 5''s Greatest Hits LP in 1971 was cause for celebration, as it encapsulated an extraordinary 18-month strings of back-to-back-to-back-back-etc. Hits and was itself a hit souvenir of Jacksonmania. It featured eight smash records, led by the group''s phenomenal Motown debut, "I Want You Back," plus two immensely popular B-sides - "I Found That Girl" and "Who''s Lovin'' You" - and something new: "Sugar Daddy," a just-dropped single which went top 10 pop.','11/15/2019',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/3728609-2518744.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183064,'my way|frank sinatra|frank sinatra|lp','My Way','Frank Sinatra','Frank Sinatra','LP','CAPB003069201.1','602577959318',21.73000000000000042,21.73000000000000042,'39445018','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257795931',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Celebrating the 50th anniversary of one of the most iconic recordings of all time! Reissued for the first time in decades is the album My Way, first issued in 1969 and featuring the hit title song as well as Sinatra''s indelible performance on "All My Tomorrows," from the film in which he had a starring role, A Hole In The Head. My Way, arranged by Don Costa, and coproduced by him with Sonny Burke, also includes Sinatra''s versions of more contemporary material.','10/11/2019',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/3720507-2505826.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183065,'americana|the offspring|the offspring|lp','Americana [Explicit Content]','The Offspring','The Offspring','LP','ROUMB003067101.1','602577951398',21.51999999999999958,21.51999999999999958,'39301116','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257795139','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Americana is the fifth studio album by punk rock band The Offspring. The original was a major success, debuting at #6 on the Billboard 200 and is the band''s second best-selling album to their 1994 breakout Smash. Americana has sold more than 10 million copies worldwide, with over nine million copies certified, while achieving 5x platinum status alone in the United States for five million copies shipped. The album contains the hit singles "Pretty Fly (for a White Guy)", "Why Don''t You Get a Job?" and "The Kids Aren''t Alright".','8/30/2019',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/98/3701398-2471469.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183066,'abbey road anniversary 1lp|the beatles|the beatles|lp','Abbey Road Anniversary (1LP)','The Beatles','The Beatles','LP','CAPB003071901.1','602577915123',23.25,23.25,'39400352','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257791512',NULL,0,'Standard vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remixed 50th Anniversary edition of The Beatles'' musical masterpiece. This Abbey Road release features the new stereo album mix, sourced directly from the original eight-track session tapes. To produce the mix, Giles Martin working with Sam Okell, was guided by the album''s original stereo mix supervised by his father, George Martin. It is time to experience Abbey Road again!','9/27/2019',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/3715025-3244663.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183067,'rockin around the christmas tree|brenda lee|brenda lee|lp','Rockin'' Around The Christmas Tree','Brenda Lee','Brenda Lee','LP','MCANB003061401.1','602577928987',23.21000000000000085,23.21000000000000085,'39402349','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257792898',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The world''s favorite Christmas classic, ''Rockin'' Around The Christmas Tree,'' by Brenda Lee is making it''s vinyl debut on standard weight vinyl. This chart-topping and nostalgic album has sold over 25 million copies and is the fourth most digital downloaded Christmas music of all time.','9/27/2019',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/79/3715379-2505812.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183068,'dr dre 2001|dr dre|dr dre|lp','Dr. Dre 2001 [Explicit Content]','Dr Dre','Dr Dre','LP','AFTMB003021701.1','602577656897',31.46999999999999887,31.46999999999999887,'39261564','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257765689','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'After a seven-year hiatus Dr. Dre returned with ''2001'' the follow-up to his debut album, ''The Chronic.'' In the interim between the two monumental projects, Dr. Dre assembled an all-star cast of rap superstars including, Eminem, Snoop Dogg, Kurupt, Nate Dogg, and Xzibit who would assist in executing his vision on one of the most flawless albums in hip-hop history. Dr. Dre''s production reached a mythical tier on songs like, "Still D.R.E", "The Next Episode", and "Forgot About Dre".','11/15/2019',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/3689297-2514353.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183069,'at war with the mystics 20th anniversary deluxe edition|the flaming lips|the flaming lips|lp','At War With the Mystics (20th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) [Explicit Content]','The Flaming Lips','The Flaming Lips','LP','RHI729334.1','603497802791',97.9599999999999938,97.9599999999999938,'46656964','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780279','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Boxed Set, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Rhino / Warner Records will celebrate the 20th anniversary of The Flaming Lips'' 2006 Grammy-award-winning album At War With The Mystics, to be released on 6CD, 6LP and Digital formats on 13th November. The 6CD set features the original album remastered for the very first time, 19x previously unreleased Demos, 14x previously unreleased studio recordings, a further 42x non-album tracks, and U.F.O.''s At The Zoo and the previously unreleased Live At The Hollywood Bowl concerts, both recorded in 2006 and on CD for the very first time','11/13/2026',3.930000000000000159,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4547942-3754350.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183070,'lover version 4|taylor swift|taylor swift|cd','Lover (Version 4)','Taylor Swift','Taylor Swift','CD','RPBLB003061102.2','602577928222',16.25,16.25,'42950066','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257792822','(Deluxe Edition, Poster, Photo / Photo Card)',0,'Taylor Swift''s seventh studio album Lover was released in 2019 and includes the Top 10 hits, "You Need to Calm Down," "Lover," and "Me!" featuring Brendon Urie from Panic! At the Disco. Deluxe CD contains 2 songwriting voice memos of "I Forgot That You Existed" (piano/vocal) and "Lover" (piano/vocal), a poster (varies by version), and 30+ pages of Taylor''s personal journal entries, lyrics, and photos (varies by version).','8/23/2019',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4129039-2960319.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183071,'submarine bells|the chills|the chills|lp','Submarine Bells','The Chills','The Chills','LP','RHI803125.1','603497803125',24.69000000000000127,24.69000000000000127,'46559678','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780312','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'The Chills'' second album from 1990 is their much-praised major label debut. A rich tapestry of sound built around Martin Phillipps'' off-kilter vocal; all accent, all attitude, it reels around folk-like couplets with brusque punk swagger fed through psychedelic hues; so timeless it still simmers beautifully. It includes the effervescent, euphoric opener ''Heavenly Pop Hit''.','10/30/2026',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4539139-3740335.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183072,'dont smile at me|billie eilish|billie eilish|cd','Dont Smile At Me','Billie Eilish','Billie Eilish','CD','ISCB003075202.2','602577992025',8.689999999999999503,8.689999999999999503,'39230867','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60257799202',NULL,0,'CD issue. Don''t Smile at Me is the debut EP by American singer and songwriter Billie Eilish. It was originally released on August 11, 2017 and contains several of her previously released singles, including "Ocean Eyes", "Bellyache", "Watch", "Copycat" and "Idontwannabeyouanymore".','7/19/2019',0.1900000000000000022,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/3686523-2415483.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183073,'the serenity of suffering|korn|korn|lp','The Serenity of Suffering [Explicit Content]','Korn','Korn','LP','ATL729186.1','603497803736',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46373748','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780373','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Originally released by Roadrunner Records in 2016, The Serenity of Suffering was the twelfth album from American nu-metal band, Korn. Featuring the singles "Rotting in Vain," "Take Me," "Black Is the Soul," "Insane," "A Different World," The Serenity of Suffering found Korn returning to their earlier, heavier sound. The album debuted at number 4 on the US Billboard 200.','7/31/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4522969-3714514.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183074,'iii remember who you are metal matters|korn|korn|lp','III: Remember Who You Are (Metal Matters) [Explicit Content]','Korn','Korn','LP','ATL729196.1','603497803644',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46509437','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780364','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 140 Gram Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Korn reconnects with the raw aggression and uneasy atmosphere of it''s early work on this back-to-basics studio album.','9/25/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/90/4534990-3719791.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183075,'curtis|curtis mayfield|curtis mayfield|lp','Curtis','Curtis Mayfield','Curtis Mayfield','LP','RHI728954.1','603497804337',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46373922','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780433',NULL,0,'Acclaimed self-titled debut by legendary soul man and titan of R&B, Curtis Mayfield. Written and produced by Mayfield for his own label Curtom Records, this chart-topping album releases on black vinyl and features some of his timeless classics like "Move On Up", "If a There''s A Hell Below..." and "The Makings Of You."','7/31/2026',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/4523007-3680489.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183076,'fillmore auditorium san francisco ca 7 3 66 live|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|cd','Fillmore Auditorium, San Francisco, CA (7/ 3/ 66) [Live]','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','CD','GRDW780405.2','603497804054',20.67000000000000171,20.67000000000000171,'46303202','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780405',NULL,0,'Two CDs. One of the earliest live recordings by The Grateful Dead, July 3, 1966, at the Fillmore Auditorium shows a band with a bright, long, exciting future ahead. A year into their performing career, Jerry, Bobby, Phil, Billy, and Pigpen perform live nearly a year before their first record came out. Playing Grateful Dead classics that would stick around their repertoire for decades such as "I Know You Rider, " "Cold Rain and Snow, " "New, New Minglewood Blues, " and "Beat It On Down The Line, " along with shorter-lived tracks including the covers "Gangster Of Love, " "Viola Lee Blues, " and "Don''t Mess Up A Good Thing." Early originals including "Tastebud, " "You Don''t Have To Ask, " and "Cream Puff War" also appear in a rare live performances, demonstrating that The Grateful Dead were terrific songwriters right from the start. This live recording, produced by Owsley "Bear" Stanley, is some of the peppiest, most inspired live Grateful Dead put to tape."','7/3/2026',0.1400000000000000134,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4516930-3633644.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183077,'a b 10th anniversary deluxe edition|kaleo|kaleo|lp','A/ B (10th Anniversary Deluxe Edition)','Kaleo','Kaleo','LP','EA780709.1','603497807093',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'46255051','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780709','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Double white colored vinyl LP pressing. Celebrating 10 years ofKALEO''s platinum-certified album, A/B with a new 2LP Deluxe Edition. Includes analternate version of "No Good," studio rarities, iconic live performances and more.','6/19/2026',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4513516-3612229.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183078,'white pepper|ween|ween|lp','White Pepper','Ween','Ween','LP','RHI62449.1','603497807192',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46038043','2026-11-10 23:56:34','2026-11-10 23:56:34','/60349780719','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'White Pepper is hands down Ween at their most accessible. The album''s title combines the Beatles White Album and Sgt. Pepper''s titles, hinting at what lies within. It''s a genius only Ween could conjure up across White Pepper''s twelve tracks. Long out of print, this new colored vinyl reissue of the original album is on green pepper vinyl. Featuring "Bananas and Blow", "Even If You Don''t", "Stay Forever" and more.','5/8/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/4496464-3612239.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183079,'quebec|ween|ween|lp','Quebec [Explicit Content]','Ween','Ween','LP','RHI728750.1','603497807185',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'46038036','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780718','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl)',0,'Double red vinyl LP pressed at 45rpm. Is Quebec the best album from Ween? Opinions will vary, but it is certainly up there as one of the finest from the brothers Ween. A solemnly psychedelic album full of mournful laments, Quebec is the album that makes the most serious case for Dean and Gene Ween as two of the greatest living American songwriters. Long out of print, this new colored vinyl reissue of the original album sees it spread across 2LPs and cut at 45rpm for maximum sound quality. Featuring "Transdermal Celebration", "Chocolate Town", "Tried and True" and more.','5/8/2026',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4496465-3594545.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183080,'read my mind 25th anniversary edition|reba mcentire|reba mcentire|lp','Read My Mind (25th Anniversary Edition)','Reba McEntire','Reba McEntire','LP','MCANB003075301.1','602577992278',23.92999999999999972,23.92999999999999972,'39755889','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60257799227','(Bonus Tracks, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered and expanded 25th Anniversary edition features bonus tracks including a 2019 live version of "And Still". Reba McEntire''s 3-times platinum album features five Top 15 hits including: #1 hit- "The Heart Is A Lonely Hunter" as well the Top 5 hits "Why Haven''t I Heard From You", "Till You Love Me" and "And Still".','12/6/2019',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/3752504-2516202.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183081,'steal your face|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Steal Your Face','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','RHI780537.1','603497805372',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'46332493','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780537','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Blue, Brick & Mortar Exclusive, Anniversary Edition)',0,'The Grateful Dead - Steal Your Face 50th Anniversary Limited Edition Blue & Red Splatter. Grateful Dead Logo - Robert D. Thomas.','7/24/2026',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/4519345-3612809.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183082,'fear of music 2026 remaster|talking heads|talking heads|lp','Fear Of Music (2026 Remaster)','Talking Heads','Talking Heads','LP','RHI728704.1','603497807895',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'46657183','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780789','(140 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'The third album from Talking Heads, 1979''s Fear of Music, is the bridge between the angular art rock of the Heads'' early work and the P-Funk-inspired modalism of their early-''80s output. Fear of Music is more than just a bridge, though. It''s the water under the bridge, the air, the animals, the cities the river flows through, and the heaven on top of it all: "... a place where nothing ever happens."','11/13/2026',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4547975-3754357.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183083,'the singles|phil collins|phil collins|lp','The Singles','Phil Collins','Phil Collins','LP','RHI780810.1','603497808106',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45737800','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780810','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl)',0,'To celebrate Phil Collins'' 75th birthday, we will be releasing a special, limited edition colour vinyl edition of Phil Collins'' greatest hits The Singles. The career-spanning compilation initially released back in 2018 is filled full of hits such asIn The Air Tonight, Sussudio, Against All Odds and so much more. It will be the first color vinyl edition of The Singles.','1/30/2026',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4475150-3520834.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183084,'greatest hits deluxe edition|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|cd','Greatest Hits (Deluxe Edition)','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','CD','RHI780390.2','603497803903',19.73999999999999843,19.73999999999999843,'46363954','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780390','(Deluxe Edition)',0,'Deluxe two CD edition of Fleetwood Mac''s multi-platinum hits collection, featuring more classics including "Landslide," "The Chain," "Silver Springs (Live)," "Never Going Back Again" and "Think About Me".','7/31/2026',0.02000000000000000041,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4522111-3680484.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183085,'greatest hits|the ramones|the ramones|lp','Greatest Hits','The Ramones','The Ramones','LP','RHI728699.1','603497808007',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'45760747','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780800','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'The Ramones / GREATEST HITS - This 1-LP compilation of Ramones sub-2 minute zingers (for the most part) collects highlights from the band''s extensive career from their first release in 1976 through 1994. Includes everything you''d want and expect from "Blitzkreig Bop" and "Sheena Is A Punk Rocker" to "Pinhead" and "Wart Hog."','1/9/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4477463-3598790.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183086,'12 golden country greats deluxe edition|ween|ween|cd','12 Golden Country Greats (Deluxe Edition) [Explicit Content]','Ween','Ween','CD','EA728690.2','603497808021',25.64000000000000056,25.64000000000000056,'46302205','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780802','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Deluxe Edition, Softpak)',0,'Of all the adventurous things the rock band known as Ween has done over their career, recording a straight-up country album with legendary Nashville session musicians was probably the most surprising. There was that great moment in the ''60s when everybody went to Nashville to record, whether it was Bob Dylan, or Leonard Cohen, etc. 12 Golden Country Greats is one of those records. Nobody did that in 1996; an alternative rock act going to Nashville to record an album at the legendary Bradley''s Barn. Ween did, though... To celebrate the 30th anniversary of the release of 12 Golden Country Greats, Rhino is remastering the 1996 album (the non-sample version) alongside two bonus discs inclusive of previously unreleased and rare demos and studio outtakes. 36 tracks total across three discs!','7/31/2026',0.2899999999999999801,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4516769-3719989.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183087,'live in the u s a 1978 winterland ballroom san francisco|sex pistols||lp','Live In The U.S.A. 1978 - Winterland Ballroom, San Francisco','Sex Pistols',NULL,'LP','UME166572.1','60256708811',22.78999999999999915,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/sex-pistols-live-in-the-u-s-a-1978-winterland-ballroom-san-francisco/60256708811',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183088,'the astonishing|dream theater|dream theater|lp','The Astonishing','Dream Theater','Dream Theater','LP','ATL174931.1','603497807765',70.79999999999999716,70.79999999999999716,'46008213','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780776','(Limited Edition, Boxed Set)',0,'Limited quadruple clear vinyl LP pressing. The Astonishing is the thirteenth studio album by Dream Theater. The Astonishingis set in a dystopian future United States and follows the Ravenskill Rebel Militia in their efforts to defy the Great Northern Empire of the Americas using the magical power of music. It was inspired by contemporary fantasy and science fiction franchises such as Game of Thrones and Star Wars, as well as John Petrucci''s observations on the ubiquity of technological automation in modern-day society.','3/27/2026',2.379999999999999894,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/18/4494018-3557290.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183089,'everything must go|steely dan|steely dan|lp','Everything Must Go','Steely Dan','Steely Dan','LP','RHI48435.1','603497808335',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'45760723','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780833','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. Steely Dan''s final studio album, Everything Must Go (2003), returns in a beautifully remastered 180-gram clear vinyl edition. Featuring Donald Fagen and Walter Becker''s unmistakable blend of jazz-steeped sophistication, sharp wit, and immaculate studio precision, this reissue presents the album with new depth, warmth, and definition. Highlights like "Blues Beach," "Godwhacker," and the groove-driven title track showcase the band''s late-era confidence and cohesion, recorded largely with a live-in-the-room feel that sets it apart from their earlier work. Pressed on premium 180-gram clear vinyl and housed in a faithful reproduction of the original packaging, this edition offers a rich listening experience worthy of Steely Dan''s storied legacy.','1/9/2026',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4477461-3504826.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183090,'pain in my heart|otis redding|otis redding|lp','Pain In My Heart','Otis Redding','Otis Redding','LP','RHI780931.1','603497809318',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45901881','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780931',NULL,0,'Pain in My Heart is Otis Redding''s historic debut album. Released in 1964, the album contains Otis'' first self-penned hit, "These Arms of Mine" along with his beloved covers of "Stand By Me" and "Pain in My Heart." In honor of Black History Month, this album has been cut from the original analog mono master by Matthew Lutthans at The Mastering Lab and is pressed locally on 180 gram premium-quality vinyl at Fidelity Record Pressing''s plant in Oxnard, California as part of the Rhino Reserve line.','2/6/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4485771-3527388.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183091,'two against nature|steely dan|steely dan|lp','Two Against Nature','Steely Dan','Steely Dan','LP','RHI24719.1','603497808328',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'45760709','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780832','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Double clear vinyl LP pressing. Steely Dan''s Grammy-winning 2000 comeback album Two Against Nature finally arrives in a stunning 180-gram clear vinyl edition. Meticulously remastered and pressed on high-quality audiophile vinyl, this reissue brings new dimension to the duo''s sly grooves, razor-sharp arrangements, and ultra-precise production. Featuring standout tracks like "Cousin Dupree," "Jack of Speed," and "What a Shame About Me," the album showcases Donald Fagen and Walter Becker at their most sophisticated-melding jazz-inflected harmonies, immaculate studio craft, and their signature dark-humored storytelling. Housed in a faithful reproduction of the original artwork, this deluxe pressing offers exceptional clarity, warmth, and presence-an essential upgrade for Steely Dan devotees and audiophiles alike.','1/9/2026',1.070000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4477459-3541425.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183092,'12 golden country greats|ween|ween|lp','12 Golden Country Greats [Explicit Content]','Ween','Ween','LP','EA780803.1','603497808038',62.81000000000000227,62.81000000000000227,'46302212','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780803','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Deluxe Edition)',0,'Ween - 12 Golden Country Greats Deluxe Edition [explicit_lyrics] Of all the adventurous things the rock band known as Ween has done over their career, recording a straight-up country album with legendary Nashville session musicians was probably the most surprising. There was that great moment in the ''60s when everybody went to Nashville to record, whether it was Bob Dylan, or Leonard Cohen, etc. 12 Golden Country Greats is one of those records. Nobody did that in 1996; an alternative rock act going to Nashville to record an album at the legendary Bradley''s Barn. Ween did, though... To celebrate the 30th anniversary of the release of 12 Golden Country Greats, Rhino is remastering the 1996 album (the non-sample version) alongside two bonus discs inclusive of previously unreleased and rare demos and studio outtakes. 36 tracks total across three discs!','7/31/2026',1.570000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4516770-3719990.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183093,'rent original soundtrack|rent o s t|rent o s t|lp','Rent (Original Soundtrack)','RENT - O.S.T.','RENT - O.S.T.','LP','RHI49455A.1','603497809936',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45716454','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780993',NULL,0,'RENT Original Motion Picture Soundtrack For the first time ever and in celebration of the 20th anniversary of the film, Rent (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack) is coming to vinyl! Based on the 1996 award-winning and beloved musical produced by Jonathan Larson, the broadway to film soundtrack takes you on the journey of struggle, resilience, and community in the midst of the AIDS epidemic in New York City. The album contains 6 of the original 8 Broadway cast members and features the hits "Seasons of Love" and "Take Me Or Leave Me."','1/2/2026',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4473400-3528186.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183094,'the twilight saga eclipse original soundtrack|twilight saga eclipse o s t|twilight saga eclipse o s t|lp','The Twilight Saga: Eclipse (Original Soundtrack)','TWILIGHT SAGA: ECLIPSE - O.S.T.','TWILIGHT SAGA: ECLIPSE - O.S.T.','LP','ATL728335.1','603497811168',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45553967','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781116','(Clear Vinyl, White, Black Ice)',0,'Double transparent white and black ice colored vinyl LP pressing. The original soundtrack to the 2010 motion picture, the third film in the successful ''Twilight Saga'' franchise. Features 15 tracks including cuts from Muse, Metric, The Bravery, The Dead Weather, Vampire Weekend, Florence & The Machine, The Black Keys and many others.','10/31/2025',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4460277-3453841.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183095,'the soul album|otis redding|otis redding|lp','The Soul Album','Otis Redding','Otis Redding','LP','RHI780932.1','603497809325',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45901904','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349780932',NULL,0,'Otis Redding''s The Soul Album vinyl features 11 tracks, split across two sides, including hits like "Cigarettes and Coffee," "Chain Gang," "634-5789," and "Good to Me," showcasing his raw soul with backing by Booker T. & the MG''s and the Memphis Horns on it''s 1966 release.','2/6/2026',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4485772-3523843.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183096,'giant steps|john coltrane|john coltrane|lp','Giant Steps','John Coltrane','John Coltrane','LP','ATL1311.1','603497812608',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45369247','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781260',NULL,0,'A game-changer in jazz and an RIAA-certified Gold classic, Giant Steps marks John Coltrane''s legendary Atlantic Records debut, featuring some of his most iconic compositions-including the groundbreaking title track "Giant Steps" and the soulful "Naima." Now pressed locally on 180-gram premium-quality vinyl at Fidelity Record Pressing''s new plant in Oxnard, California, as part of Rhino''s exclusive Rhino Reserve line.','8/29/2025',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/46/4443946-3419463.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183097,'bella donna|stevie nicks|stevie nicks|lp','Bella Donna','Stevie Nicks','Stevie Nicks','LP','ATL813193.1','603497813193',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45369599','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781319','(Limited Edition, Brick & Mortar Exclusive, Hi-Fidelity)',0,NULL,'8/29/2025',1.330000000000000071,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4443975-3419555.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183098,'bedtime stories the silver colllection|madonna|madonna|lp','Bedtime Stories (The Silver Colllection)','Madonna','Madonna','LP','WB45767.1','603497812691',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45617102','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781269','(Colored Vinyl, Silver)',0,'2025 Limited edition 11-track LP pressed on opaque silver vinyl*Originally released on October 25, 1994, BEDTIME STORIES found Madonna collaborating with a variety of producers, including Dallas Austin, Babyface, Dave "Jam" Hall, and Nellee Hooper, and she approached the proceedings with an eye (and an ear) toward a more mainstream sound than she''d pursued on her previous album, Erotica. Stories is now reissued on silver vinyl as the next release from the Silver Collection.','11/28/2025',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4466352-3602549.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183099,'the eternal idol|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','The Eternal Idol','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RHI25548.1','603497813629',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45297182','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781362',NULL,0,'The Eternal Idol is the thirteenth studio album by English rock band Black Sabbath, released in November 1987. It is the first Black Sabbath album to feature vocalist Tony Martin. This 2025 remaster marks the first time this album has been available on vinyl in decades.','8/8/2025',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/39/4437139-3418298.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183100,'the spongebob squarepants movie original soundtrack|spongebob squarepants|spongebob squarepants|lp','The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie (Original Soundtrack)','SpongeBob Squarepants','SpongeBob Squarepants','LP','WB811489.1','603497811489',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45533723','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781148','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,'Celebrate the SpongeBob Squarepants Movie with the iconic movie soundtrack. Dive into the Bikini Bottom with tracks like "Goofy Goober Rock" and "Ocean Man," and songs from Wilco, Ween, and Avril Lavigne transporting you to the whimsical world under the sea. This soundtrack is a must-have addition to any music collection. On Yellow Vinyl','10/24/2025',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4458361-3469675.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183101,'tango in the night|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Tango In The Night','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI25471.1','603497812622',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'45369278','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781262',NULL,0,'Fleetwood Mac Tango in the Night - This 3x Platinum-certified 1987 studio album features the classic lineup of Stevie Nicks, Christine McVie, Lindsey Buckingham, John McVie, and Mick Fleetwood. This is their most sonically advanced album featuring stellar production work by Lindsey Buckingham and longtime associate Richard Dashut. Pressed locally on 180 gram premium-quality vinyl at Fidelity Record Pressing''s brand new plant in Oxnard, California as part of Rhino''s new Rhino Reserve line.','8/29/2025',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4443955-3433428.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183102,'paranoid|black sabbath|black sabbath|lp','Paranoid','Black Sabbath','Black Sabbath','LP','RPRW781527.1','603497815272',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45200922','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781527','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive, Hi-Fidelity)',0,NULL,'6/13/2025',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4428311-3395431.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183103,'buckingham nicks|buckingham nicks|buckingham nicks|lp','Buckingham /  Nicks','Buckingham / Nicks','Buckingham / Nicks','LP','RHI813667.1','603497813667',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45406744','2026-11-10 23:56:35','2026-11-10 23:56:35','/60349781366','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive, Hi-Fidelity)',0,'The legendary debut studio album from Stevie Nicks & Lindsey Buckingham. Buckingham Nicks is the only studio album by Lindsey Buckingham and Stevie Nicks as a duo, prior to them joining Fleetwood Mac. Originally released in 1973 and unavailable for decades, the album has been sourced from the original analog master tapes for its long-awaited return to vinyl. Released on September 5, 1973, Buckingham Nicks quickly faded from commercial view but never disappeared from the cultural conversation. Recorded at Sound City Studios in Los Angeles and produced by Keith Olsen, the album introduced Nicks and BuckinghamΓÇÖs tightly wound harmonies and sharply contrasting songwriting voices across 10 tracksΓÇöranging from the folk-rock shimmer of ΓÇ£CrystalΓÇ¥ to the sunbaked strut of ΓÇ£DonΓÇÖt Let Me Down Again.ΓÇ¥ BUCKINGHAM / NICKS  (Hi-Fi)(Un-Numbered)(Brick & Mortar Exclusive)','9/19/2025',1.189999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4447572-3425994.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183104,'golden doors 2|the doors|the doors|lp','Golden Doors 2','The Doors','The Doors','LP','EA978138.1','603497813841',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'45242779','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781384','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'For the very first time, The Doors'' Golden Doors 2, their 1970 Japanese compilation, is available worldwide. This is an authentic re-creation now pressed on purple vinyl. / With an intoxicating, genre-blending sound, provocative and uncompromising songs, and the mesmerizing power of singer Jim Morrison''s poetry and presence, The Doors had a transformative impact not only on popular music but on popular culture. The Doors'' arrival on the rock scene in 1967 marked not only the start of a string of hit singles and albums that would become stone classics, but also of something much bigger - a new and deeper relationship between creators and audience. They released six studio albums in all, as well as a live album and a compilation, before Morrison''s death in 1971. Their electrifying achievements in the studio and onstage were unmatched in the annals of rock. In the decades since The Doors'' heyday, the foursome has loomed ever larger in the pantheon of rock - and they remain a touchstone of insurrectionary culture for writers, activists, visual artists and other creative communities.','7/25/2025',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/98/4432198-3401127.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183105,'live ep|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Live EP','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL815296.1','603497815296',16.0,16.0,'45421495','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781529',NULL,0,'The new LIVE E.P. features live recordings of ΓÇ£In My Time Of DyingΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£Trampled Under FootΓÇ¥ from Earls Court, 1975, alongside ΓÇ£Sick AgainΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£KashmirΓÇ¥ from Knebworth, 1979. These live performances were originally released on the 2003 Led Zeppelin DVD and appear on vinyl for the very first time. Following the 10-week North American tour that ran from January through March, 1975, Led Zeppelin played five sold-out nights at LondonΓÇÖs EarlΓÇÖs Court in May, 1975. Initially, three shows were announced, with another two added after the tremendous demand for tickets. The band headlined both nights of the Knebworth Festival, which took place at Knebworth House, Hertfordshire, England on August 4 and 11, 1979. These were Led ZeppelinΓÇÖs first live dates since their 1977 North American tour, and their first U.K. dates since the EarlΓÇÖs Court 1975 shows. LED ZEPPELIN / LIVE EP','9/12/2025',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4448923-3433673.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183106,'fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI813346.1','603497813346',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'45412813','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781334','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive, Hi-Fidelity)',0,NULL,'9/5/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4448114-3427890.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183107,'physical graffiti 50th anniversary deluxe edition 3lp|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Physical Graffiti (50th Anniversary Deluxe Edition 3LP)','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL815333.1','603497815333',51.1700000000000017,51.1700000000000017,'45421273','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781533','(Deluxe Edition, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Led Zeppelin Physical Graffiti (50th Anniversary Deluxe Edition) 180grAm 3LP - Jimmy Page began the initial work at his home studio in Plumpton, Sussex, England, in the summer and autumn of 1973, with the first recording sessions taking place that October at Headley Grange, using Ronnie Lane''s Mobile Studio. Further sessions at Headley continued in January 1974. Additional overdubs were recorded at Olympic Studios, where Page completed mixing of the album in July 1974.','9/12/2025',1.780000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/4448925-3433675.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183108,'buckingham nicks|buckingham nicks|buckingham nicks|lp','Buckingham Nicks','Buckingham Nicks','Buckingham Nicks','LP','RHI727699.1','603497813674',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46041852','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781367','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'The legendary debut studio album from Stevie Nicks & Lindsey Buckingham. Buckingham Nicks is the only studio album by Lindsey Buckingham and Stevie Nicks as a duo, prior to them joining Fleetwood Mac. Originally released in 1973 and unavailable for decades, the album has been sourced from the original analog master tapes and will be available for the first time on CD. Released on September 5, 1973, Buckingham Nicks quickly faded from commercial view but never disappeared from the cultural conversation. Recorded at Sound City Studios in Los Angeles and produced by Keith Olsen, the album introduced Nicks and Buckingham''s tightly wound harmonies and sharply contrasting songwriting voices across 10 tracks-ranging from the folk-rock shimmer of "Crystal" to the sunbaked strut of "Don''t Let Me Down Again. "','4/3/2026',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/59/4496759-3559543.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183109,'chicago ix greatest hits expanded|chicago|chicago|lp','Chicago Ix: Greatest Hits Expanded','Chicago','Chicago','LP','RHI727498.1','603497816118',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45333293','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781611','(Expanded Version)',0,'Originally released in 1975, Chicago IX gathered the band''s most iconic tracks from their early albums into one definitive hits collection. Celebrating it''s 50th anniversary, this expanded edition offers 21 remastered tracks - including fan favourites like "25 or 6 to 4," "Saturday in the Park," and "If You Leave Me Now" - showcasing the legendary "rock band with horns" at their peak. A must-have for both long-time fans and new listeners alike.','8/8/2025',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4440495-3414964.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183110,'rumours|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|cd','Rumours','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','CD','RHI3010.2','603497816156',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'44948078','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781615',NULL,1,'Reissue of the band''s 21x platinum-certified 1977 album. Rumours became Fleetwood Mac''s most celebrated album and one of the best-selling albums of all time. Featuring the hit singles "Dreams," "The Chain," "You Make Loving Fun," "Go Your Own Way" & "Don''t Stop".','3/7/2025',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4404557-3324627.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183111,'rumours|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Rumours','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI3010.1','603497816163',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'44909970','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781616',NULL,0,'The undisputed crown-jewel of the Fleetwood Mac catalog, Rumours has been certified an incredible nineteen times platinum and is one of the best-selling albums in music history. A rare effort that transcends genre, generations, and the personnel that created it, Rumours is quite possibly the definitive album of the ''70s and unquestionably, one of the most vital rock LPs ever made. With classic rock staples galore such as "Dreams," "Don''t Stop," "Go Your Own Way," "You Make Loving Fun," "The Chain," and "Gold Dust Woman," Rumours reads like a greatest hits package. Stevie Nicks, Lindsey Buckingham, Mick Fleetwood, and Co. Simply make magic on every track. And while celebrated as one of the best break-up releases to enter the public realm, Rumours succeeds primarily because of the impeccable songwriting and passioned playing. Vinyl LP pressing of the British-American rock band''s monumental 1977 album.','2/28/2025',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4399955-3553551.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183112,'snakes arrows|rush|rush|lp','Snakes & Arrows','Rush','Rush','LP','ATL816545.1','603497816545',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'45588174','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781654','(Limited Edition)',0,'Rush - Snakes & Arrows - The eighteenth studio album from Rush, originally released in 2007. Features the Grammy-nominated track "Malignant Narcissism". Street Date: 01/02/26','1/2/2026',1.120000000000000107,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/08/4463508-3479382.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183113,'chicago ix greatest hits expanded|chicago|chicago|cd','Chicago IX: Greatest Hits Expanded','Chicago','Chicago','CD','RHI727498.2','603497816101',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'45324727','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781610',NULL,0,'Chicago''s first greatest hits collection, Chicago IX, was originally released in 1975. The chart-topping album collected the hit singles and fan favorite album cuts from their first eight studio recordings. In celebration of the album''s 50th Anniversary, Chicago IX: Greatest Hits Expanded provides a 21 track expanded look at the legendary "Rock Band With Horns" top tracks from this period.','8/8/2025',0.08000000000000000166,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/4439675-3414933.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183114,'blues for allah 50th anniversary remaster|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Blues For Allah (50th Anniversary Remaster)','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','GRDW727448.1','603497816293',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45410963','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781629','(Picture Disc Vinyl, Anniversary Edition, Remastered)',0,'In their 10th year, The Grateful Dead recorded one of their most ambitious albums since the late 1960s, with songwriting and songs that were as out-there, jam-filled, and as psychedelic as the music they were making in 1968-1969. Re-mastered by GRAMMY┬« Award-winning engineer David Glasser from the original analog tapes, with speed-correction and tape restoration by Plangent Processes.','9/12/2025',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4447924-3444218.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
