INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183119,'mr bad example|warren zevon|warren zevon|lp','Mr. Bad Example','Warren Zevon','Warren Zevon','LP','RHI821600.1','603497821600',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'45482045','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349782160',NULL,0,NULL,'10/24/2025',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4454552-3495114.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183120,'walk this road|the doobie brothers|the doobie brothers|lp','Walk This Road','The Doobie Brothers','The Doobie Brothers','LP','RHI727362.1','603497818433',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'44942151','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349781843',NULL,0,'Legendary hitmakers The Doobie Brothers'' new 10-track album ''Walk This Road'' features a reunited lineup of members Patrick Simmons, Tom Johnston, John McFee and Michael McDonald. "Walk This Road'' was recorded with producer John Shanks and showcases the band''s unique songwriting process and diverse stylistic perspectives, for what would be melded into one cohesive work, featuring the signature Doobie Brothers sound. Recurring themes on the album include recovery, enlightenment - "waking up to see the important things you''ve been missing," says Simmons. The title track on the album, "Walk This Road," featuring Mavis Staples, embodies a sense of hope and togetherness, in terms of searching for the right path forward."','6/6/2025',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4404201-3390672.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183121,'harry potter and the sorcerer s stone original soundtrack|john williams|john williams|lp','Harry Potter and The Sorcerer''s Stone (Original Soundtrack)','John Williams','John Williams','LP','ATL83491.1','603497821914',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'45148163','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349782191',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. The soundtrack to Harry Potter and the Sorcerer''s Stone was originally released in 2001. The film''s score was composed and conducted by John Williams. The soundtrack was nominated for Best Original Score at the 74th Academy Awards.','6/6/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4424012-3387172.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183122,'ready to die 30th anniversary edition|the notorious b i g|the notorious b i g|lp','Ready To Die (30th Anniversary Edition)','The Notorious B.I.G.','The Notorious B.I.G.','LP','BAD823871.1','603497823871',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'44528546','2026-11-10 23:56:36','2026-11-10 23:56:36','/60349782387',NULL,0,'Ready To Die (30th Anniversary Edition) September 13 marks the 30th anniversary of the release of Biggie''s debut LP, which has gone on to earn it''s place asRolling Stone''s #1 hip hop album of all time, become a radio staple, and influenced generations of MCs, fans, and athletes.','9/13/2024',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4361291-3213519.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
