INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183146,'a sailor s guide to earth crystal clear vinyl|sturgill simpson|sturgill simpson|lp','A Sailor''s Guide To Earth  (Crystal-Clear Vinyl)','Sturgill Simpson','Sturgill Simpson','LP','ATL706340.1','603497836963',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'43658350','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783696',NULL,0,'Crystal-Clear Vinyl LP pressing. The alt-country understated star''s Grammy-Award winning album features lead single "Brace for Impact (Live a Little)", a track that also boasts an enigmatic music video which includes, among other visuals, and hot rod coffin, a cover of Nivana''s "In Bloom", and the orchestrally enhanced "Breakers Roar." A respected and celebrated record, it has received a score of 86 from metacritic signalling "universal acclaim."','9/1/2023',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4233601-3492077.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183147,'wish 30th anniversary edition syeor|the cure|the cure|lp','Wish (30th Anniversary Edition) (syeor)','The Cure','The Cure','LP','EA61309.1','603497837830',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'42950219','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783783','(Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'''30th Anniversary Edition of The Cure''s best-selling, Grammy-nominated album ''WISH.'' Newly remastered by Robert Smith and Miles Showell at Abbey Road Studios. Featuring the hit singles "High," "Friday I''m In Love," and "A Letter To Elise". Presented as a 2LP set in a single sleeve with a wide spine and 2 x Printed Inner bags.','1/27/2023',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/4129058-2918798.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183148,'little creatures|the talking heads|the talking heads|lp','Little Creatures','The Talking Heads','The Talking Heads','LP','RHI25305.1','603497830855',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43777495','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783085',NULL,0,'Little Creatures, originally released in 1985 includes the classics "And She Was" and "Road To Nowhere". Reissued for the first time since the original release.','10/6/2023',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4244795-3035694.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183149,'lady soul|aretha franklin|aretha franklin|lp','Lady Soul','Aretha Franklin','Aretha Franklin','LP','ATL8176B.1','603497837540',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43311163','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783754','(Colored Vinyl, Silver)',0,'Limited silver colored vinyl LP pressing. Lady Soul is a landmark statement of female empowerment and inspired vocal performance. Featuring massive hits such as "Chain of Fools," "(You Make Me Feel) Like A Natural Woman," "(Sweet, Sweet Baby) Since You''ve Been Gone" and "Ain''t No Way," Lady Soul topped the R & B charts and reached #2 on the Billboard 200. Aretha also provides her own unique and soulful interpretations of James Brown''s "Money Won''t Change You," Ray Charles'' "Come Back Baby" and Curtis Mayfield''s civil rights anthem, "People Get Ready." Rolling Stone recently named Aretha Franklin as the #1 Greatest Singer of All Time and it''s all in evidence on Lady Soul.','3/3/2023',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4182876-2946193.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183150,'john prine|john prine|john prine|lp','John Prine','John Prine','John Prine','LP','ATL19156B.1','603497835010',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'43658336','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783501',NULL,0,'The country singer/songwriter legend''s debut Atlantic Album, which was included in Rolling Stone''s list of 500 greatest records of all time. In 2009, Bob Dylan told the Huffington Post that Prine was one of his favorite songwriters of all time, and critics generally agree that his simple song structures support both sarcasm and wry observation and commentary on life that is generally unparalleled. - CLEAR LP','9/1/2023',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4233600-3052764.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183151,'crosby stills nash|crosby stills nash|crosby stills nash|lp','Crosby, Stills & Nash','Crosby, Stills & Nash','Crosby, Stills & Nash','LP','ATL8229A.1','603497837045',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43660261','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783704',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. The first release from the folk rock supergroup was a wild success, bringing together members of Buffalo Springfield, The Byrds and The Hollies in Crosby, Stills, and Nash after a meeting at a Laurel Canyon party. Their self-titled debut, featuring the famous cover photo by Henry Diltz, features their trademark harmonies and guitar work, as well as memorable classics from "Marrakesh Express" to "Suite: Judy Blue Eyes," "Helplessly Hoping" to "Wooden Ships," all of which became canon of the folk-rock foundation that drove the cultural sea change out of Lauren Canyon in the latter half of the 60s. CLEAR VINYL','9/1/2023',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4233774-3034422.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183152,'the last waltz|the band|the band|lp','The Last Waltz','The Band','The Band','LP','RHI7801.1','603497832606',52.18999999999999773,52.18999999999999773,'43807031','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783260',NULL,0,'One of the most famous music concert films of all time, The Last Waltz gets the 45th anniversary treatment with this audiophile pressing. The concert featured a who''s who of great rock stars from Joni Mitchell, The Staples Sisters & Neil Young to Eric Clapton, Emmylou Harris, Muddy Waters, and many more, joining The Band onstage in one of the most musical Thanksgiving celebrations ever, and presents a snapshot through the Great Americana Songbook.','10/6/2023',1.780000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4247452-3040923.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183153,'led zeppelin iv clear vinyl atl75|led zeppelin|led zeppelin|lp','Led Zeppelin IV (Clear Vinyl) (ATL75)','Led Zeppelin','Led Zeppelin','LP','ATL7208.1','603497837076',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43834969','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783707','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. Led Zeppelin''s iconic LP, Led Zeppelin IV, will be released on October 27th as part of the Atlantic 75 campaign. Offered on a special crystal clear 180gram vinyl pressing and limited edition release of Led Zeppelin''s best-selling studio album.','10/27/2023',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/4251062-3047060.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183154,'curtis syeor|curtis mayfield|curtis mayfield|lp','Curtis (syeor)','Curtis Mayfield','Curtis Mayfield','LP','RHI535580.1','603497837717',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'43179176','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783771','(140 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,NULL,'1/27/2023',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4162421-2920813.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183155,'now playing|america|america|lp','Now Playing','America','America','LP','WB828524.1','603497828524',16.32000000000000028,16.32000000000000028,'44010430','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349782852',NULL,0,'Now Playing compiles ten of the band''s essential tracks, a selection of timeless classics including "A Horse with No Name," "I Need You," "Sandman," "Ventura Highway," "Tin Man," "Lonely People" and "Sister Goldenhair." America had several Top Ten hits, including the number ones "A Horse with No Name" and "Sister Golden Hair."','1/5/2024',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/4275307-3079441.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183156,'live at fillmore east 1969|crosby stills nash young|crosby stills nash young|cd','Live At Fillmore East, 1969','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','CD','ATL839612.2','603497839612',10.33000000000000007,10.33000000000000007,'44641719','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783961',NULL,0,'After famously playing their second show at Woodstock in August 1969, David Crosby, Stephen Stills, Graham Nash, and Neil Young spent the rest of the year touring and writing songs for what would become CSNY''s 1970 debut, D├⌐j├á Vu. Live at Fillmore East, 1969 is a newly discovered multi-track recording of the band''s September 20, 1969, concert at the historic Fillmore East in New York City captures an early moment from that first tour. Including both Acoustic and Electric sets, as well as hit tracks such as "Suite: Judy Blue Eyes", "Our House", "I''ve Loved Her So Long", etc. Stephen Stills and Neil Young compiled and mixed the original eight-track concert recordings at Sunset Studios to keep the production entirely analog. Young recently said: "[We] have the tapes, and they sound so real. We mixed at Sunset Sound - the analog echo chamber, no digital echo. We''re staying all analog throughout the production... Pure. Analog. No digital."','10/25/2024',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4373060-3285836.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183157,'l a woman|the doors|the doors|lp','L.A. Woman','The Doors','The Doors','LP','EA839728.1','603497839728',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'42867999','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783972',NULL,0,'The DOORS released six studio albums in all, as well as a live album and a compilation, before Morrison''s death in 1971. The last album The Doors recorded, L.A. Woman, was also their best seller. Released in 1971, this instant classic gave the world "Riders on the Storm", "Love Her Madly", and the radio staple "L.A. Woman".','8/26/2022',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4118857-2863970.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183158,'little earthquakes|tori amos|tori amos|lp','Little Earthquakes','Tori Amos','Tori Amos','LP','ATL82358A.1','603497839049',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'43139217','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783904',NULL,0,'Tori Amos became the voice of a generation of young girls when she delivered her first solo record in 1992. Each of the tracks on Little Earthquakes painted an evocative picture, and the album delivered 5 singles: "Crucify," "Silent All These Years," "Winter," "China," "Me and A Gun." The album has already received the deluxe treatment in 2006, and this 2-LP is the first time the tracks have been remastered for this format. Notes are the same as those featured in the 2015 reissue, but the remastering was done lovingly by Jon Astley at Abbey Road Studios. In 2022, to coincide with the 30th anniversary of the record, Z2 announced a graphic novel of the album, and Tori toured the US and Europe.','1/6/2023',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4154989-2912199.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183159,'fragile|yes|yes|lp','Fragile','Yes','Yes','LP','ATL7211.1','603497838240',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'43179060','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783824','(Clear Vinyl, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,NULL,'1/6/2023',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/34/4162434-2920820.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183160,'a collection|third eye blind|third eye blind|lp','A Collection','Third Eye Blind','Third Eye Blind','LP','EA78779.1','603497841516',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'42693659','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784151',NULL,0,'THIRD EYE BLIND / A COLLECTION - A Collection is a greatest hits album by Third Eye Blind, originally released in 2006. The album contains all of their singles (with the exception of "Anything"), a handful of fan and band favorites, as well as three unreleased-via-LP songs: "Tattoo of the Sun", "My Time in Exile" and "Slow Motion" (with lyrics). The package also includes liner notes from renowned rock writer James Hunter and track-by-track commentary from Stephan Jenkins.','7/15/2022',0.8599999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4097387-2833847.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183161,'bad company rocktober|bad company|bad company|lp','Bad Company (ROCKTOBER)','Bad Company','Bad Company','LP','ATL8410B.1','603497837113',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'43807062','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783711','(Clear Vinyl)',0,NULL,'10/6/2023',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4247392-3042521.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183162,'third eye blind|third eye blind|third eye blind|lp','Third Eye Blind','Third Eye Blind','Third Eye Blind','LP','EA62012A.1','603497841509',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'42693666','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784150',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Third Eye Blind is the debut studio album by Third Eye Blind, originally released in 1997. The album was collectively written by Stephan Jenkins and Kevin Cadogan, while production was helmed by Jenkins and Eric Valentine. Recorded in and around San Francisco at Toast Studios, Skywalker Ranch, and H.O.S., the album incorporates elements of alternative rock, post-grunge, and power pop. Thematically, the album focuses on topics such as relationships, drug addiction, suicide prevention, and the band''s experience of being signed to a major record label. Includes the singles: "Semi-Charmed Life", "Graduate", "How''s It Going to Be", "Losing a Whole Year", and "Jumper".','9/2/2022',0.8699999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4097385-3457452.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183163,'foreigner rocktober atl75 crystal clear diamond vinyl|foreigner|foreigner|lp','Foreigner (ROCKTOBER /  ATL75) [Crystal Clear Diamond Vinyl]','Foreigner','Foreigner','LP','RHI1910.1','603497837021',22.07000000000000028,22.07000000000000028,'43806942','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783702','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Foreigner''s debut album features "Cold as Ice" and "Feels Like the First Time," and those are just warmups for some of the tight production and epic storytelling on the non-single cuts on this classic.','10/6/2023',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4247443-3042511.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183164,'dazed and confused music from the motion picture|dazed and confused music from the motion picture|dazed and confused music from the motion picture|lp','Dazed And Confused (Music From The Motion Picture)','Dazed and Confused (Music From the Motion Picture)','Dazed and Confused (Music From the Motion Picture)','LP','ATL24533.1','603497843886',30.53999999999999915,30.53999999999999915,'41754764','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784388','(Colored Vinyl, Purple, Clear Vinyl, Brick & Mortar Exclusive)',0,'The 1993 hit movie Dazed and Confused is well known for it''s 70s rock themed soundtrack, featuring songs by Alice Cooper, War, ZZ Top, Black Sabbath, and others. Pressed on purple translucent vinyl.','7/23/2021',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/3979347-2714586.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183165,'court and spark 2022 remaster|joni mitchell|joni mitchell|lp','Court And Spark (2022 Remaster)','Joni Mitchell','Joni Mitchell','LP','EA841325.1','603497841325',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43753437','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784132',NULL,0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Remastered by Bernie Grundman under the supervision of Joni Mitchell. Includes "Help Me," "Free Man In Paris," and "Raised On Robbery"','9/29/2023',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4243124-3463596.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183166,'fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI2281.1','603497839650',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'42981138','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349783965',NULL,0,'2017 Remaster Vinyl LP pressing. Fleetwood Mac is the tenth studio album by Fleetwood Mac, originally released in 1975. This was the first Fleetwood Mac album with Lindsey Buckingham as guitarist and Stevie Nicks as vocalist. The album peaked at #1 on the US Billboard 200 chart and spawned three top-twenty singles: "Over My Head", "Rhiannon", and "Say You Love Me".','10/14/2022',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/4132624-3030459.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183167,'clouds|joni mitchell|joni mitchell|lp','Clouds','Joni Mitchell','Joni Mitchell','LP','RHI6341.1','603497844197',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43567232','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784419',NULL,0,'JONI MITCHELL / CLOUDS - Featuring "Chelsea Morning," "The Fiddle and the Drum" and one of Joni Mitchell''s best known songs "Both Sides, Now," the accomplished singer/songwriter''s second album Clouds is certified gold and won the 1969 Grammy (her first of nine) for Best Folk Performance. Originally released in May of 1969, all ten tracks were written by Mitchell and the album features a self-portrait as it''s artwork. Uncut wrote, "... it''s hard to pinpoint one single quality that makes Clouds so impressive. It''s content perfectly matches it''s delivery, the delight of language employed with such precision ideally suited to music even more lively... It confirmed Mitchell not only as a writer of unusually versatile songs open to endless reinvention but as a performer of exquisite sensitivity able to shed light on our passions and doubts." 2021 remaster on vinyl LP. 180-Gram Vinyl. Newly Remastered by Bernie Grundman. Under the Supervision of Joni Mitchell.','7/14/2023',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4220982-2986639.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183168,'blue|joni mitchell|joni mitchell|lp','Blue','Joni Mitchell','Joni Mitchell','LP','RHI2038.1','603497844173',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'42981169','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784417',NULL,0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Joni Mitchell''s Blue was Named the #3 Greatest Album of All Time by Rolling Stone. Now Newly Remastered by Bernie Grundman Under the Supervision of Joni Mitchell. Includes California, River, and A Case Of You.','10/7/2022',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4132623-2878221.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183169,'core 2017 remaster|stone temple pilots|stone temple pilots|lp','Core (2017 Remaster)','Stone Temple Pilots','Stone Temple Pilots','LP','ATL82418.1','603497845651',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'40984452','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784565','(Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. When an album peaks at #3 on the Billboard Top 200, amasses a large fanbase worldwide, and quickly becomes certified platinum, it''s clear it''s something worth plugging into. With their debut album, the socially-charged Core, San Diego''s Stone Temple Pilots deliver a hard-hitting grunge record that delves into dark lyrical territory, driven home by Scott Weiland''s powerful vocals. With hit singles "Plush" and "Sex Type Thing" going on to become definitive songs of the 1990s, the band garnered a great deal of media attention - at times incredibly negative - for their whirlwind success. Rolling Stone readers named the group the Best New Band of 1992, whereas it''s staff christened them the Worst New Band. Despite their polarizing reception, the Pilots would secure a Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance for "Plush" and Core would be certified eight times platinum in 2001. Songwriting, you could say, is the band''s definite core.','11/13/2020',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/3867064-2617102.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183170,'deja vu 2021 remaster|crosby stills nash young|crosby stills nash young|lp','Deja Vu (2021 Remaster)','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','LP','ATL7200.1','603497842025',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'42828945','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784202','(Remastered)',0,'Crosby, Stills, Nash and Young''s immensely popular second album, D├⌐j├á vu, which featured "Teach Your Children, "Woodstock, " "Our House, " "Helpless, " and "Almost Cut My Hair."','8/26/2022',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4115267-2854378.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183171,'ladies of the canyon|joni mitchell|joni mitchell|lp','Ladies Of The Canyon','Joni Mitchell','Joni Mitchell','LP','RHI844180.1','603497844180',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'43753420','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784418',NULL,0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Remastered by Bernie Grundman under the supervision of Joni Mitchell. Includes "Woodstock" & "The Circle Game".','9/29/2023',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/38/4243138-3033580.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183172,'ready to die|the notorious b i g|the notorious b i g|lp','Ready To Die','The Notorious B.I.G.','The Notorious B.I.G.','LP','BAD94567.1','603497843343',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'41972106','2026-11-10 23:56:40','2026-11-10 23:56:40','/60349784334','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. Ready to Die is the debut studio album by rapper The Notorious B.I.G., originally released in 1994. The album features productions by Bad Boy founder Sean "Puffy" Combs, Easy Mo Bee, Chucky Thompson, DJ Premier, and Lord Finesse, among others. It was recorded from 1993 to 1994 at The Hit Factory and D&D Studios in New York City. The partly autobiographical album tells the story of the rapper''s experiences as a young criminal, and was the only studio album released during his lifetime.','10/8/2021',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/35/4003135-2754179.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183173,'purple|stone temple pilots|stone temple pilots|lp','Purple','Stone Temple Pilots','Stone Temple Pilots','LP','ATL82607B.1','603497845743',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'41205860','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784574','(Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Purple is the second studio album by the rock band Stone Temple Pilots, released on June 7, 1994 by Atlantic Records. The album, building off the foundations laid by the band''s debut album Core, was a huge success for the band, debuting at number one on the Billboard 200 chart and remaining there for three weeks, eventually selling over six million copies. It spawned a number of successful singles - "Vasoline" and "Interstate Love Song" both topped the Mainstream Rock Tracks chart and hit number 2 on the Modern Rock Tracks chart, while "Big Empty" also cracked the top ten on both charts.','1/15/2021',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/3893430-2653424.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183174,'christmas eve and other stories|trans siberian orchestra|trans siberian orchestra|lp','Christmas Eve and Other Stories','Trans-Siberian Orchestra','Trans-Siberian Orchestra','LP','ATL92736.1','603497845934',28.75,28.75,'42073147','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784593','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Christmas Eve and Other Stories is the debut studio album by Trans-Siberian Orchestra, originally released in October 1996. It was the first album in the band''s Christmas trilogy, with The Christmas Attic (1998) and The Lost Christmas Eve (2004) coming afterward.','10/29/2021',1.310000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4014109-2750467.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183175,'kick|inxs|inxs|lp','Kick','INXS','INXS','LP','ATL81796C.1','603497846122',22.51000000000000157,22.51000000000000157,'40930473','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784612','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. The best-selling, multi-platinum album from INXS, featuring the hit singles "Need You Tonight", "New Sensation", "Devil Inside" and "Never Tear Us Apart".','11/6/2020',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/3862914-2607594.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183176,'skeletons from the closet best of grateful dead|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Skeletons From The Closet: Best Of Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','GRDW2764Z.1','603497847792',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'40658865','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784779',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Originally released in February 1974, this is the best-selling Grateful Dead greatest hits collection to date. Features Truckin'', Sugar Magnolia, and Mexicali Blues.','9/4/2020',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/3842587-2585037.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183177,'the crow original motion picture soundtrack|various|various|lp','The Crow (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack)','Various','Various','LP','ATL82519B.1','603497846146',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'40857183','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784614',NULL,0,'The Crow (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack) Vinyl, LP - Genre: Electronic, Rock, Stage & Screen - Style: Soundtrack, Alternative Rock, Industrial, Goth Rock, Heavy Metal','10/30/2020',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/3856840-2601407.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183178,'american beauty|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','American Beauty','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','GRDW1893B.1','603497847778',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'40923048','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784777',NULL,0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. 50th Anniversary remastered audio. American Beauty is the fifth studio album by rock band The Grateful Dead. Released November 1, 1970, by Warner Bros. Records, the album continued the folk rock and country music style of their previous album Workingman''s Dead, issued earlier in the year. Though the Americana approach is still evident in the songwriting, comparatively the sound focused more on folk harmonies and major-key melodies, showing influence from Bob Dylan and Crosby, Stills, Nash, & Young.','11/13/2020',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/3862545-3493667.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183179,'brothers in arms|dire straits|dire straits|lp','Brothers In Arms','Dire Straits','Dire Straits','LP','RHI25264.1','603497848577',32.46999999999999887,32.46999999999999887,'41183120','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784857','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'DIRE STRAITS / BROTHERS IN ARMs - original album on 180 gram vinyl. Dire Straits'' 1985 album on 180g vinyl. Featuring the hits "Money For Nothing" and "Walk Of Life".','1/22/2021',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/3890974-2651532.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183180,'workingman dead|the grateful dead|the grateful dead|lp','Workingman'' Dead','The Grateful Dead','The Grateful Dead','LP','GRDW1869C.1','603497847754',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'40632643','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784775',NULL,0,'Workingman''s Dead (180 Gram Vinyl) lLP pressing. Workingman''s Dead is the fourth Grateful Dead studio album. It was recorded in February 1970 and originally released on June 14, 1970. The album and it''s studio follow-up, American Beauty, were recorded back-to-back using a similar style, eschewing the psychedelic experimentation of previous albums in favor of Jerry Garcia and Robert Hunter''s Americana-styled songcraft.','8/21/2020',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/33/3840233-2582996.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183181,'dire straits|dire straits|dire straits|lp','Dire Straits','Dire Straits','Dire Straits','LP','RHI3266.1','603497848614',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'41183144','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784861',NULL,0,'Dire Straits - Original album on 180 gram vinyl. Sourced from the Original Master Tapes and Pressed at Fidelity Record Pressing: Mobile Fidelity''s 45RPM 2LP Set Engages With Natural Tones, Superb Balances, Reference Imaging, Sterling Clarity. 1/4" / 15 IPS analog master to DSD 256 to analog console to lathe. Dire Straits'' arresting self-titled debut arrived in the midst of punk''s reign but couldn''t have been further removed from the era''s slash-and-burn style. Recorded in West London in February 1978, the band''s tasteful, jazz-inflected set embraces folk, blues, and pub rock while also tracing a direct line back to the beat-oriented sound of early rock n'' roll. Country and roots accents further distinguish the British quartet''s stripped-down music from any 1970s peers, as does the transparent production, which has remained revered among audiophiles the world over - and which has never been better than on this meticulous pressing.','1/22/2021',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4399649-3506450.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183182,'live at fillmore east 1969|crosby stills nash young|crosby stills nash young|lp','Live At Fillmore East, 1969','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','LP','ATL839629.1','603497839629',27.64000000000000056,27.64000000000000056,'44641726','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349783962',NULL,0,'After famously playing their second show at Woodstock in August 1969, David Crosby, Stephen Stills, Graham Nash, and Neil Young spent the rest of the year touring and writing songs for what would become CSNY''s 1970 debut, D├⌐j├á Vu. Live at Fillmore East, 1969 is a newly discovered multi-track recording of the band''s September 20, 1969, concert at the historic Fillmore East in New York City captures an early moment from that first tour. Including both Acoustic and Electric sets, as well as hit tracks such as "Suite: Judy Blue Eyes", "Our House", "I''ve Loved Her So Long", etc. Stephen Stills and Neil Young compiled and mixed the original eight-track concert recordings at Sunset Studios to keep the production entirely analog. Young recently said: "[We] have the tapes, and they sound so real. We mixed at Sunset Sound - the analog echo chamber, no digital echo. We''re staying all analog throughout the production... Pure. Analog. No digital."','10/25/2024',1.389999999999999903,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4373061-3276314.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183183,'so far|crosby stills nash young|crosby stills nash young|lp','So Far','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','LP','ATL18100A.1','603497854066',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'38975608','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785406',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. So Far is the fourth album by Crosby, Stills & Nash, their third as Crosby, Stills, Nash & Young, and the first compilation album released by the group. Shipping as a gold record and peaking at #1 on the Billboard Top Pop Albums chart, it was the band''s third chart-topping album in a row. It has been certified six times platinum by the RIAA, and is the second best-selling album by any configuration of the quartet in tandem after their 1970 studio album, D├⌐j├á Vu.','12/18/2020',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/0/4/7/3917401.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183184,'james taylor s greatest hits 2019 remaster|james taylor|james taylor|lp','James Taylor''s Greatest Hits (2019 Remaster)','James Taylor','James Taylor','LP','WB3113.1','603497852543',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'40224879','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785254',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Greatest Hits is the first compilation album by American singer-songwriter James Taylor. Originally released in November 1976, it is the best-selling album of his career and one of the best-selling albums of all time, having sold over 11 Million copies. It features redone versions of "Carolina in My Mind" and "Something in the Way She Moves", both of which had been previously included on Taylor''s self-titled debut album in 1968. This new release contains a brand new remaster of the classic album, with the remastering process being overseen by Peter Asher.','3/27/2020',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3791582-2605493.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183185,'like a virgin|madonna|madonna|lp','Like A Virgin','Madonna','Madonna','LP','WB25157B.1','603497849284',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'39540638','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784928','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Clear vinyl LP pressing. Like a Virgin is the second studio album by Madonna, originally released on November 12, 1984, by Sire Records. Following the success of her self-titled debut album, Madonna wanted to become the record producer of her next album. However, her label was not ready to give her the artistic freedom and she chose Nile Rodgers instead to produce the album due to his work with David Bowie. Madonna wrote six songs on the record, five of which feature Steve Bray as a co-writer. The album was recorded at Power Station Studio in New York at a quick pace. Rodgers enlisted the help of his former Chic bandmates Bernard Edwards, who was the bassist, and Tony Thompson, who played drums. Jason Corsaro, the record''s audio engineer, persuaded Rodgers to use digital recording, a new technique introduced at that time.','11/8/2019',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/3731304-2494206.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183186,'say you will|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Say You Will','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','WB48394.1','603497856817',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'36694778','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785681',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. After the huge comeback success of the live reunion album, The Dance, in 1997, Fleetwood Mac were back in a big way. The obvious question was all over the place: Was there going to be another studio album by the band? Even though it was preceded by a short round of drama (it''s Fleetwood Mac, after all), they answered with Say You Will on April 15, 2003, which marked the return of Lindsey Buckingham and Stevie Nicks but also saw the departure of Christine McVie. After 1987''s Tango in the Night, Buckingham left the band to concentrate on his solo career. The group soldiered on and issued two more albums, Behind the Mask (in 1990) and Time (in 1995), by which time Nicks had also split.','10/12/2018',0.839999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/3571922.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183187,'aretha s gold|aretha franklin|aretha franklin|lp','Aretha''s Gold','Aretha Franklin','Aretha Franklin','LP','ATL8227A.1','603497854080',20.42999999999999972,20.42999999999999972,'38975592','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785408',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Released in 1969, Aretha''s Gold is the chart-topping greatest hits compilation that features her biggest hits from her early Atlantic albums: ''Respect'', ''Think'', ''(You Make Me Feel Like) A Natural Woman'', ''Chain of Fools'', and more.','12/13/2019',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/0/4/7/3917402.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183188,'atlantic singles collection 1967 1970|aretha franklin|aretha franklin|lp','Atlantic Singles Collection 1967-1970','Aretha Franklin','Aretha Franklin','LP','ATL571351.1','603497858040',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'36576234','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785804',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. The Atlantic Singles Collection 1967-1970 features 25 tracks which Franklin released during her first three years with Atlantic Records. Includes classics like "Respect", "A Natural Woman (You Make Me Feel Like)" and "Chain Of Fools." When Aretha Franklin joined Atlantic Records in 1967, it was the beginning of an unprecedented run that would ultimately cement her place as a music legend, a global household name, and one of the most influential singers of all time. Within the space of just three years, her name was almost never out of U.S Pop and R&B Top 20, garnering nine gold singles, three gold albums, as well as three Grammy Awards and her first string of international hits.','9/28/2018',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/2/0/8/3818028.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183189,'the best of otis redding|otis redding|otis redding|lp','The Best Of Otis Redding','Otis Redding','Otis Redding','LP','ATL640686.1','603497847037',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'40753966','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349784703',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing.','9/18/2020',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/3848706-2595168.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183190,'greatest hits|the notorious b i g|the notorious b i g|lp','Greatest Hits','The Notorious B.I.G.','The Notorious B.I.G.','LP','BAD101830B.1','603497859245',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'36575701','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785924',NULL,0,'It''s time to celebrate the legacy of the best rapper that ever did it. Notorious BIG wasn''t just a rapper, he was a storyteller, a prolific poet, and through his words, persona, life and music he opened doors and opportunies for Hip-Hop as a whole. The release of Greatest Hits denotes the commemoration of one of the most historic bodies of work in Hip-Hop.','8/24/2018',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/6/1/2/3792163.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183191,'the dance|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','The Dance','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','WB46702.1','603497856824',32.78000000000000113,32.78000000000000113,'36694761','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785682',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. The Dance is a live album by Fleetwood Mac, released in 1997. It hailed the return of the band''s most successful line-up of Lindsey Buckingham, Mick Fleetwood, Christine McVie, John McVie and Stevie Nicks, who had not released an album together since 1987''s Tango in the Night a decade earlier. It was the first Fleetwood Mac release to top the U.S. album charts since 1982''s Mirage. The Dance became the fifth best-selling live album of all time in the United States, selling a million copies within eight weeks, spending more than seven months within the Top 40, and eventually selling over 6,000,000 copies worldwide.','10/12/2018',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/3571921-3549358.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183192,'csny 1974|crosby stills nash young|crosby stills nash young|cd','Csny 1974','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','Crosby Stills Nash & Young','CD','ATL541732.2','603497899920',10.64000000000000056,10.64000000000000056,'26483078','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349789992',NULL,0,'Long-rumored and highly anticipated CSNY 1974 captures the band''s one-of-a-kind harmonic alchemy during it''s remarkable outdoor stadium tour, a trek that spanned more than two months and included 31 concerts, in 24 cities, with combined audiences of over a million people. Produced by Graham Nash and Joel Bernstein, this 40th anniversary CD features 16 live tracks, electric and acoustic, selected from the band''s boxed set.','7/8/2014',0.1400000000000000134,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/9/2/3/2583293.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183193,'rumours live|fleetwood mac|fleetwood mac|lp','Rumours Live','Fleetwood Mac','Fleetwood Mac','LP','RHI567113.1','603497860395',32.14999999999999858,32.14999999999999858,'43676927','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349786039',NULL,0,'Fleetwood Mac was at the top of its game in August 1977 when the band returned to its adopted home in Southern California to play three shows at The Forum in Los Angeles. RUMOURS had only been out a few weeks when the band left in February to tour the world, returning six months later to play three shows at The Forum for nearly 50,000 fans. RUMOURS LIVE captures the energy and excitement of the bandΓÇÖs opening night at The Forum on August 29, 1977. The concertΓÇÖs setlist draws almost exclusively from FLEETWOOD MAC and RUMOURS, the first two albums recorded by the bandΓÇÖs latest incarnation: Mick Fleetwood, John McVie, and Christine McVie, and the newest members, Stevie Nicks, and Lindsey Buckingham. The lone nod to Fleetwood MacΓÇÖs other nine studio albums is a performance of ΓÇ£Oh Well,ΓÇ¥ a rock-guitar masterpiece originally released in 1969 and written by the bandΓÇÖs founder, guitarist Peter Green. The concert remained unreleased for decades until 2021, when ΓÇ£Gold Dust WomanΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£World TurningΓÇ¥ from the show were included as a bonus tracks on LIVE: DELUXE EDITION, RhinoΓÇÖs expanded version of Fleetwood MacΓÇÖs 1980 concert album. The other 16 songs on the collection have never been released before. Engineer Ken Caillat, who helped record RUMOURS, also recorded the concert at The Forum using the Record PlantΓÇÖs mobile recording truck. He captured the bandΓÇÖs impassioned performance at a moment of peak RUMOURS  frenzy, including powerful versions of ΓÇ£Landslide,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Never Going Back Again,ΓÇ¥ ΓÇ£Songbird,ΓÇ¥ and ΓÇ£The Chain.ΓÇ¥ FEATURES: 180-Gram 2LP Gatefold Jacket Laquers Cut By Chris Bellman at Bernie Grundman Mastering FLEETWOOD MAC / RUMOURS LIVE    VINYL LP','9/8/2023',1.219999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/03/4235703-3022688.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183194,'swagger|flogging molly|flogging molly|lp','Swagger','Flogging Molly','Flogging Molly','LP','USOD71324.1','603967132410',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'12086801','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60396713241','(Limited Edition, Reissue)',0,'Just in time for St. Patrick''s Day, Side One Dummy is proud to re-issue Flogging Molly''s three studio albums on vinyl. All have gatefold packaging and are pressed on green vinyl. The band''s catalog has sold over a million copies worldwide, and this limited pressing series will become a must own for fans. Look for a full US tour in February and March. "Swagger" is the group''s first album, featuring fan favorites "Salty Dog", "Devil''s Dance Floor", and "Black Friday Rule".','3/6/2007',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/9/2/2/1032296.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183195,'autobahn|kraftwerk|kraftwerk|lp','Autobahn','Kraftwerk','Kraftwerk','LP','PRL791145.1','603497911455',23.1700000000000017,23.1700000000000017,'14689246','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349791145','(Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,NULL,'12/8/2009',0.9000000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/9/1/4/2314198.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183196,'road to ruin|the ramones|the ramones|lp','Road To Ruin','The Ramones','The Ramones','LP','RHI6063A.1','603497858262',22.94999999999999929,22.94999999999999929,'39465764','2026-11-10 23:56:41','2026-11-10 23:56:41','/60349785826','(Remastered)',0,'Ramones'' fourth studio album from 1978. Features the classic song I Wanna Be Sedated. - The Ramones ignited the punk-rock movement with their eponymous 1976 debut album, revitalizing rock and roll at one of it''s lowest ebbs with attitude, energy and a loud, fast new sound. By cutting music down to it''s bare essentials - four chords; a simple, catchy melody; a sped up tempo and irresistibly inane lyrics, the Ramones blazed the trail for thousands of bands that followed, influencing everyone from The Clash and The Sex Pistols to Green Day and The Offspring. Although The Ramones never achieved mainstream financial success, they released 21 live and studio albums, had a devoted fan base and were inducted into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame in 2002.','9/6/2019',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/3722316-2505868.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183197,'man machine 2009 remaster|kraftwerk|kraftwerk|lp','Man Machine (2009 Remaster)','Kraftwerk','Kraftwerk','LP','PRL791143.1','603497911431',22.73000000000000042,22.73000000000000042,'14689277','2026-11-10 23:56:42','2026-11-10 23:56:42','/60349791143','(Limited Edition, Remastered)',0,'In 2009, Kraftwerk have upgraded their Kling Klang masters with the latest studio technology and these magnificent recordings still sound like nothing else in the history of music. Kraftwerk are unique, pristine, profound and beautiful. Decades may pass, but their streamlined synthetic symphonies stand outside time, as fresh as tomorrow, transcendent and sublime. The 1978 synth-pop album The Man Machine is classic mid-period Kraftwerk and it''s the group''s most commercially successful release. Building on Trans Europe Express, the album brilliantly embodies Kraftwerk''s ethos, style and musical agenda with an elegance that very few artists have been able to rival.  LP Track Listing:1. The Robots (Die Roboter) 2. Spacelab 3. Metropolis 4. The Model (Das Model) 5. Neon Lights (Neonlicht) 6. The Man Machine (Die Mensch-Maschine)','12/8/2009',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/9/1/4/2314196.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
