INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183584,'a6extended|lights|lights|lp','A6EXTENDED [Explicit Content]','Lights','Lights','LP','LGSQ261.1','680889105951',30.0,30.0,'45889776','2026-11-10 23:57:02','2026-11-10 23:57:02','/68088910595','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Green)',0,'Nearly half a billion streams worldwide, alt-pop expert Lights announces A6EXTENDED - a supercharged deluxe treatment of her latest album A6 with 8 brand new songs that expand the album''s universe. First taste "EDUCATION" is a deep, synth-driven stand-out - a fun, mildly dramatic take on how love makes you grow and learn more about yourself. Having spent her career learning from some of the best pop songwriters and producers in the world, Lights flexes her skills as the album''s primary writer/producer. 2xLP on "Orange Crush" and Teal Colored Vinyl','2/27/2026',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4484476-3505282.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
