INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183899,'for young hearts|soccer mommy|soccer mommy|lp','For Young Hearts','Soccer Mommy','Soccer Mommy','LP','FAPO17093.1','767981170930',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'46253972','2026-11-10 23:57:23','2026-11-10 23:57:23','/76798117093',NULL,0,'Soccer Mommy celebrates the 10th anniversary of ''For Young Hearts'' with a special edition limited pressing on pink vinyl. The 2016 album''s eight tracks are noticeably different than anything she''d released previously. While not a drastic sonic departure from it''s two preceding bedroom recordings, it certainly separates itself with a strong sense of newfound confidence. Allison bridges the gap between singer-songwriter and full on performer with warm honey-like vocals, playful pop hooks, and energetic melodies. For Young Hearts doesn''t just shimmer, it blooms from start to finish.','6/19/2026',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/97/4513697-3597342.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183900,'interstate 8|modest mouse|modest mouse|lp','Interstate 8','Modest Mouse','Modest Mouse','LP','GLPE7981149219.1','767981149219',15.49000000000000021,15.49000000000000021,'28125198','2026-11-10 23:57:23','2026-11-10 23:57:23','/76798114921',NULL,0,NULL,'4/21/2015',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/2755481-3165069.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183901,'rarely do i dream|youth lagoon|youth lagoon|lp','Rarely Do I Dream','Youth Lagoon','Youth Lagoon','LP','FAPO18413.1','767981184135',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'44906085','2026-11-10 23:57:23','2026-11-10 23:57:23','/76798118413','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'YOUTH LAGOON: It was this time 2 years ago that we were headed into the holidays, getting ready for the return of Youth Lagoon with the announcement of his 4th album, Heaven Is a Junkyard. That would go on glowing reviews, including Youth Lagoon''s 3rd Best New Music from Pitchfork. Here we are again, just 3 weeks shy of announcing the 5th album, Rarely Do I Dream, Youth Lagoon''s most comprehensive and audacious album to date. It''s a treasure trove of home movies, twangy fuzz guitars, sun-bleached synths, classical pianos, blown-out drums, and Powers'' spellbinding melodies, all which feel like an old photograph that''s been reanimated in a strange and distant future. - Rooted in love and childhood memoir, Rarely Do I Dream is a triumph of American gothic imagination - where storybook innocence dissolves into a radioactive billow of teenage drifters, drug-addled hustlers, and old-world folklore. Drifting between propulsive electronica and hallucinatory rock songs, Powers'' singular voice always glows front and center as the neon road sign pointing home.','2/21/2025',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4399523-3320062.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
