INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(183920,'hailbound queen|widespread panic|widespread panic|lp','Hailbound Queen','Widespread Panic','Widespread Panic','LP','WSPR700311.1','781057003113',21.51999999999999958,21.51999999999999958,'44637767','2026-11-10 23:57:25','2026-11-10 23:57:25','/78105700311','(Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Widespread Panic Hailbound Queen LP (Opaque Pylon Orange Vinyl) Fresh off the heels of their acclaimed Spring 2024 release Snake Oil King, Widespread Panic is thrilled to announce the vinyl release of Hailbound Queen. Hailbound Queen features fan favorites like "Trashy," a Bloodkin original, and "Halloween Face," alongside new standout tracks "King Baby," "Blue Carousel," and "Keep Me in Your Heart" by Warren Zevon. These songs have happily made their way into Widespread Panic''s live performances and fans'' hearts. Grab a copy of Hailbound Queen on pylon orange vinyl!','11/8/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/4372602-3292333.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
