INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184144,'ben folds live with the national symphony orchestra|ben folds the national symphony orchestra|ben folds the national symphony orchestra|lp','Ben Folds Live with the National Symphony Orchestra','Ben Folds & The National Symphony Orchestra','Ben Folds & The National Symphony Orchestra','LP','NSO121.1','810038862118',14.68999999999999951,14.68999999999999951,'45242632','2026-11-10 23:57:41','2026-11-10 23:57:41','/81003886211',NULL,0,'Culminating more than two decades of performing with some of the world''s greatest orchestras, indie music icon Ben Folds performs his hits and new music with the National Symphony Orchestra in a live orchestral concert album conducted by Steven Reineke and recorded to soldout audiences over two nights at the John F. Kennedy Center for the Performing Arts in the Fall of 2024. Widely regarded as one of the major music influences of our generation, the Emmy-nominated artist''s enormous body of genre-bending sound includes pop anthems with Ben Folds Five, multiple solo albums, and numerous collaborative records. In 2015, his Concerto for Piano and Orchestra debuted at #1 on both the Billboard classical and classical crossover charts. His latest pop album was released in 2023 to rave reviews and sold-out performances, and was followed with the release of his critically-acclaimed holiday album in 2024.','7/4/2025',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4432152-3415840.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184145,'guns don t kill people lazers do|major lazer|major lazer|lp','Guns Don''t Kill People...Lazers Do','Major Lazer','Major Lazer','LP','MDEC5942.1','810072049339',21.42999999999999972,21.42999999999999972,'44692001','2026-11-10 23:57:41','2026-11-10 23:57:41','/81007204933',NULL,0,'Making a crater-sized impact upon arrival in 2009, the music on Major Lazer''s Guns Don''t Kill People... Lazers Do has undoubtedly endured, sounding as fresh today as it did 15 years ago. Diplo and Switch''s first full-length under the long-running moniker represented a pitch-perfect mix of effervescent dancehall, tangy electronic melodies, and beats so hard-hitting that they feel like they''re leaping out of your speakers to give you a walloping themselves. Upon release, very little in the North American musical landscape sounded like Guns Don''t Kill People... Lazers Do-and 15 years later, the record remains utterly singular even as it''s influence is pervasive. It was the perfect party-hardy record to close out the 2000s, and it hasn''t lost an ounce of it''s ribald and truly pleasurable audaciousness since. This 15th anniversary repress contains 2xLP 12" vinyls in a double sleeve gatefold.','11/15/2024',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/56/4378356-3270983.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184146,'fear of the dawn|jack white|jack white|lp','Fear Of The Dawn','Jack White','Jack White','LP','TMVQ752A.1','810074420785',17.55999999999999873,17.55999999999999873,'42276739','2026-11-10 23:57:41','2026-11-10 23:57:41','/81007442078','(Black)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2022 release. Fear of the Dawn is the fourth studio album from Jack White, founding member of The White Stripes, The Raconteurs, and The Dead Weather. True to his DIY roots, this record was recorded at White''s Third Man Studio throughout 2021, mastered by Third Man Mastering.','4/8/2022',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4033223-3169745.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
