INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184211,'let god sort em out|clipse|clipse|cassette','Let God Sort Em'' Out [Explicit Content]','Clipse','Clipse','Cassette','ROCX4813.4','810182964935',8.300000000000000711,8.300000000000000711,'45581946','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81018296493','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'In the 15+ years since Clipse''s last album hit the shelves of record stores, the music world has been upended several times over. Through it all, enthusiasm for the duo from Virginia never waned. ''Let God Sort ''Em Out'' - Clipse''s new independent release in partnership with Roc Nation Distribution - is one of the most highly anticipated releases in recent memory, a fact that underlines the singular talent and lasting influence of Pusha-T and Malice.','10/24/2025',0.1300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/83/4462883-3458870.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184212,'tell the truth essentials edition|billy squier|billy squier|lp','Tell The Truth (essentials Edition)','Billy Squier','Billy Squier','LP','FTIN2033X.1','810137044217',37.63000000000000255,37.63000000000000255,'46566737','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/810137044217','(Indie Exclusive, Gatefold LP Jacket, Reissue)',0,'Billy Squier had a string of multi-platinum albums released throughout the 1980s that still dominate radio playlists and resonate with fans to this day. Tell the Truth was Billy''s eighth and final album for Capitol Records, scheduled for release in spring of 1993. Label brass informed Billy it was the best album Capitol had in the pipeline for the current year. They also told him that they were pulling the plug on it. The full story is even more bizarre than it sounds. Produced by Mike Chapman (Sweet, Blondie, Material Issue, etc.), Tell the Truth was a powerhouse rock effort that radio seemed to love. Lead-off track ''Angry'' received more radio ''adds'' than any prior Billy Squier track during it''s first week on-air! This is Billy Squier at his absolute best. This new deluxe reissue (never released on vinyl until 2026!) was initially issued in April and sold out on the day of release. We''re now making it available again as part of the Record Store Day Essentials program. Fans won''t want to miss this second opportunity to get this lavish set. Housed in a gorgeous, thick tip-on sleeve, the album contains not only complete liner-notes detailing the story of the LP, but also related bonus material, extended content, and lyrics. Newly remastered by Chris Muth (Rolling Stones, AC/DC, etc.) and pressed on high quality vinyl, the album sounds better than it ever has. This is an essential piece of the Billy Squier story and it''s time the Truth be told.','11/27/2026',1.449999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4539751-3705149.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184213,'how to train your dragon original soundtrack|john powell|john powell|lp','How To Train Your Dragon (Original Soundtrack)','John Powell','John Powell','LP','MDO342.1','810196430891',86.56999999999999317,86.56999999999999317,'45335495','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81019643089','(Colored Vinyl, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Mondo Music, in partnership with Back Lot Music, is proud to present the HOW TO TRAIN YOUR DRAGON - Original Motion Picture Soundtrack 3xLP. Featuring the soaring original score by John Powell, this triple LP is pressed on 3x 140 gram Night Fury Colored Vinyl with fire-singed labels and features a tri-fold jacket housed inside a deluxe textured board slipcase. From three-time Oscar┬« nominee and Golden Globe winner Dean DeBlois, the creative visionary behind DreamWorks Animation''s acclaimed HOW TO TRAIN YOUR DRAGON trilogy, comes a stunning live-action reimagining of the film that launched the beloved franchise.','2/20/2026',2.430000000000000159,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/89/4440689-3414086.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184214,'x s for eyes|the red jumpsuit apparatus|the red jumpsuit apparatus|lp','X''S For Eyes','The Red Jumpsuit Apparatus','The Red Jumpsuit Apparatus','LP','BTNO36.1','810202530362',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'45437533','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253036',NULL,0,'Formed in 2004 in Jacksonville, FL, The Red Jumpsuit Apparatus has accrued Gold and multi-Platinum singles-including their massive 5x Platinum hit single "Face Down," 2x Platinum "Your Guardian Angel"-and 2x Platinum-certified debut album, DON''t YOU FAKE IT, alongside numerous high-ranking radio chart positions and a robust digital history of over 1.5 billion career streams. Their new album "X''s For Eyes" is their first with Better Noise Music and their first new studio album since 2018''s "The Awakening". "X''s For Eyes" features 11 tracks in total including the two previously released singles "Home Improvement" and "Slipping Through (No Kings)", and guest appearances from Craig Mabbit from Escape The Fate, and Kellin Quinn from Sleeping With Sirens. Available on this indie exclusive, recycled cherry vinyl. Packaged in a matte finish gatefold jacket with printed inner sleeve.','11/7/2025',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4450511-3450760.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184215,'reflections purple|from ashes to new|from ashes to new|lp','Reflections - Purple [Explicit Content]','From Ashes to New','From Ashes to New','LP','BTNO431.1','810202534315',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'45809071','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253431','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Purple, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'After making their mark as a hugely successful band with a #1-charting album - 2023s Blackout, From Ashes to New are set to release their highly anticipated follow-up, Reflections. The band returns with their high-energy fusion of rap, nu metal, electronic, and alternative rock but with darker themes and an even more dynamic sound. Given the momentum from their previous releases, including strong-charting singles and a steadily growing fan base, Reflection is poised to attract both longtime fans and newcomers looking for powerful, emotionally charged rock with cross-genre appeal. Reflections has 12 tracks, periwinkle color vinyl, a sleeve jacket, and a printed inner sleeve with lyrics and credits.','4/17/2026',0.4799999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4479795-3502582.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184216,'best of volume 2|five finger death punch|five finger death punch|lp','Best of - Volume 2','Five Finger Death Punch','Five Finger Death Punch','LP','BTNO11.1','810202530119',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'45426353','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253011','(Colored Vinyl, Black, Gold, Anniversary Edition, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The follow-up to "Best of Volume 1" from multi-platinum hard rock powerhouse Five Finger Death Punch commemorating the band''s 20 year anniversary. "Best Of Volume 2" - mirrors it''s counterpart "Best of Volume 1". It''s the second half of the collection of re-recorded epic Five Finger Death Punch hits. Together, these two albums define the band''s impressive history. With over 8 billion streams, 16 #1 hits at Active Rock Radio, and a massive catalog of RIAA-certified gold and platinum releases, Five Finger Death Punch stands as one of the dominating forces in rock. "Best Of - Volume 2" includes a brand-new version of "The End" featuring Japan''s very own Baby Metal. This release celebrates the band''s past while charging full-force into the future. Available on 2LP golden smoke vinyl.','11/7/2025',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/05/4449405-3431273.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184217,'hun|the hu|the hu|cd','Hun','The HU','The HU','CD','BTNO412.2','810202534124',10.19999999999999928,10.19999999999999928,'46302632','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253412','(Digipack Packaging)',0,'Mongolian folk metal band The Hu return with a new album on Better Noise Music called Hun, pushing the limits of rock and taking the world along with them. Building on the international breakthroughs of The Gereg and Rumble of Thunder, the band sharpens it''s fusion of traditional Mongolian instrumentation and throat singing with modern active rock production. The album, which features tracks like "The Real You," "The Men," and "Lost Soul", continues the band''s global appeal with rock fans across all borders. Hun is available as a digipak CD with booklet insert.','7/24/2026',0.1499999999999999945,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/4516806-3601840.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184218,'7 seas blue|dirty heads|dirty heads|lp','7 Seas - Blue [Explicit Content]','Dirty Heads','Dirty Heads','LP','BTNO611.1','810202536111',17.5,17.5,'46070388','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253611','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Dirty Heads have built a career out of soundtracking the best moments of people''s lives, and with 7 Seas, they''re not slowing down. The RIAA Platinum Certified Southern California outfit returns with their much-anticipated ninth full-length album, building on their signature balance of carefree energy and reflective songwriting while inviting fans into their next chapter of freedom, positivity, and forward motion. From sun-soaked, laid-back anthems made for a day at the beach to hard-hitting late-night bangers, the album moves fluidly across moods without ever losing the infectious Dirty Heads energy fans have come to love. With over 3 billion career streams worldwide and multiple #1 singles on alternative and rock radio, Dirty Heads have built a dedicated global following by seamlessly fusing reggae, hip-hop, alternative rock, and pop. 7 Seas vinyl has 10 tracks, sleeve packaging with a lyric insert, and palisades blue marble vinyl.','6/12/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/4498964-3542899.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184219,'the rain just follows me|hawthorne heights|hawthorne heights|lp','The Rain Just Follows Me','Hawthorne Heights','Hawthorne Heights','LP','PUNO3141.1','810540032948',14.25,14.25,'41901311','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81054003294',NULL,0,'Limited red colored vinyl LP pressing. Hawthorne Heights'' The Rain Just Follows Me is the sound of an outbound train falling off the tracks. The train is lost and exhausted. The train is simply expected to execute a series of itineraries that are never ending. The train just doesn''t want to leave the station anymore. The train is me. There are times that it feels like a total nightmare, yet there are times where the melody soars into something so melancholy and beautiful, but most importantly... it never let''s up. Just like the never ending itinerary, The Rain Just Follows Me was written and recorded under extreme exhaustion and stress. The exact way that most people live their lives. Tired, strained, and searching for a moment where you can just hit pause... but you can''t, because here comes the next song.','11/5/2021',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/3994806-3170107.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
