INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184222,'7 seas iex blue green|dirty heads|dirty heads|lp','7 Seas (IEX) Blue/ Green','Dirty Heads','Dirty Heads','LP','BTNO616.1','810202536166',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'46070401','2026-11-10 23:57:46','2026-11-10 23:57:46','/81020253616','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Green, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Dirty Heads have built a career out of soundtracking the best moments of people''s lives, and with 7 Seas, they''re not slowing down. The RIAA Platinum Certified Southern California outfit returns with their much-anticipated ninth full-length album, building on their signature balance of carefree energy and reflective songwriting while inviting fans into their next chapter of freedom, positivity, and forward motion. From sun-soaked, laid-back anthems made for a day at the beach to hard-hitting late-night bangers, the album moves fluidly across moods without ever losing the infectious Dirty Heads energy fans have come to love. With over 3 billion career streams worldwide and multiple #1 singles on alternative and rock radio, Dirty Heads have built a dedicated global following by seamlessly fusing reggae, hip-hop, alternative rock, and pop. 7 Seas Indie exclusive vinyl has 10 tracks, sleeve packaging with a lyric insert, and algae splatter vinyl.','6/12/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4498966-3542904.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
