INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184392,'you can t imagine how much fun we re having|atmosphere|atmosphere|lp','You Can''t Imagine How Much Fun We''re Having [Explicit Content]','Atmosphere','Atmosphere','LP','RYMS69.1','826257006943',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'41973394','2026-11-10 23:57:56','2026-11-10 23:57:56','/82625700694','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'After being out of print for years, Atmosphere''s fifth studio album, You Can''t Imagine How Much Fun We''re Having, returns on vinyl. Following the breakthrough success of their fourth album, Seven''s Travels, the group returned in 2005, showing impressive growth and inventiveness in their new compositions. Citing inspirations from a list of less-than-expected sources, including Tom Waits, Mark Lanegan, Shawn Phillips, Spoon, The Mars Volta, alopecia, Public Enemy, Boogie Down Productions, The Beauty Pill, infected wisdom teeth, Craig Finn, TV On The Radio, Australia and I-94 East, among others, the album pushed boundaries without overreaching.','10/22/2021',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4003261-2738412.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
