INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184497,'pain of truth iex|pain of truth|pain of truth|lp','Pain of Truth (IEX) [Explicit Content]','Pain of Truth','Pain of Truth','LP','DAZE1281.1','840526515226',18.42000000000000171,18.42000000000000171,'46458193','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651522','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Poster)',0,'Since forming in 2020, Long Island hardcore band Pain of Truth have had an immense six years - releasing an EP, two splits, and a full-length, and touring across the globe. Today the band announces their sophomore album, Pain of Truth, set for release on September 25th through DAZE. Working with GRAMMY winning producer Will Putney (Body Count, Incendiary, Counterparts), Pain of Truth''s sound has been amplified tenfold across the eleven track album. The band blends old school style with new school swagger, as lyrics build from a place of resistance, struggle, and drive. Expect aggressive vocals backed by unified shouts, riffs that move from dirty grooves to electrifying, and drums that provide a pulsating rhythmic backbone made to intensify every mosh part. Includes a 24"x36" poster.','9/25/2026',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/22/4530522-3677390.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184498,'dimensional bleed iex|holy fawn|holy fawn|lp','Dimensional Bleed (IEX)','Holy Fawn','Holy Fawn','LP','WXBO87690IEX.1','840526515615',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'46549051','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651561','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'Yellow Insomnia Indie Retail Exclusive Vinyl. Physically tethered to this reality, yet creatively unmoored from any earthly restraints, Holy Fawn freely slip in and out of metal, shoegaze, electronic, alternative, and rock as if inhabiting multiple states of sonic existence all at once. Blazing new trails both seen and unseen as well as heard and unheard (but always felt), the Arizona quartet-Ryan Osterman, Evan Phelps, Alexander Rieth, and Austin Reinholz-continue to cover uncharted territory on their second full-length offering, Dimensional Bleed. The group emerged in 2018 as a critical and fan favorite with their debut LP, Death Spells. Stereogum said the music is "all so beautiful," while Heavy Blog Is Heavy went as far as to christen it "a landmark." Thrice and Deafheaven each invited the band on tour, and Lamb of God''s Randy Blythe was effusive in his praise.  In 2020, Holy Fawn shared The Black Moon EP, which the Phoenix New Times hailed as "a ferocious slab of twilight guitar crunch." In the midst of the Global Pandemic, Holy Fawn carefully assembled what would become Dimensional Bleed. Due to the closure of their practice space and de facto headquarters, the bulk of creation and recording happened remotely. Ryan performed vocals and electronics at home, while Austin and Evan tracked and mixed out of Evan''s studio. This time around, they enlisted Mike Watts [The Dillinger Escape Plan, Glassjaw, The Dear Hunter] for mixing and additional production and Mike Kalajian for mastering.','11/20/2026',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4538257-3700193.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184499,'i love my computer cobalt blue glitter|ninajirachi|ninajirachi|lp','I Love My Computer  (Cobalt Blue Glitter)','Ninajirachi','Ninajirachi','LP','MHED347.1','840526514014',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'46566829','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651401','(Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Cobalt Blue Glitter Vinyl Nina Wilson, better known as Ninajirachi, is an Australian electronic producer who released her debut album I Love My Computer is a concept record built on her connection with her PC, swiping between genres of EDM, tech-house, speed garage, dubstep, and hyperpop. Wilson builds on the legacy of early-2000s and 2010s Australian electronic artists like PNAU and Flume using technology as a medium, a motif, and a mirror for reflection. Between remixing Princess Nokia, Deadmau5 & The Neptunes, releasing on Nina Las Vegas'' NLV Records and RL Grime''s Sable Valley, Ninajirachi has performed at Lollapalooza, EDC, Laneway, Listen Out, Splendour, Falls Festival, and more and toured with Mallrat, Charli XCX, Porter Robinson and Cashmere Cat.','11/13/2026',0.7700000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4539760-3729171.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184500,'i m like a virgin losing a child 20th anniversary|manchester orchestra|manchester orchestra|lp','I''m Like a Virgin Losing a Child (20th Anniversary)','Manchester Orchestra','Manchester Orchestra','LP','FVQG98677.1','840526514878',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'46520241','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651487','(Colored Vinyl, Anniversary Edition, Reissue)',0,'Gold Vinyl. What''s most striking about Manchester Orchestra''s debut full-length, I''m Like a Virgin Losing a Child, isn''t how much the Atlanta-based group have evolved in the two decades since it''s release, but how much of their identity was already there from the very beginning. Recorded without a label, outside expectations or even a surplus of material, the album found the band embracing spontaneity over perfection and, in the process, establishing the emotional and sonic hallmarks that would become their defining quality. The organ that swells throughout the album-opening "Wolves at Night" recalls the band''s Southern gospel upbringing, but when laid atop a dirty, downtuned guitar riff indebted to ''90s fuzz, it creates competing impulses that ripple through every corner of the record. It''s that transparency and fearlessness that helped Virgin transcend the scene that first embraced it, leading to it''s re-release through the band''s Favorite Gentlemen imprint in partnership with Canvasback/Sony and paving the way for tours with Kings of Leon, appearances at festivals like Lollapalooza, Bonnaroo and Reading and Leeds and a national TV debut on the Late Show with David Letterman. To celebrate that enduring legacy, Manchester Orchestra is marking I''m Like a Virgin Losing a Child''s 20th anniversary with a deluxe reissue featuring all-new packaging, arriving alongside a series of special performances honoring the first entry in one of rock''s most consistently adventurous catalogs.','10/16/2026',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4535912-3694208.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184501,'the sound a body makes when it s still iex|hot mulligan|hot mulligan|lp','The Sound a Body Makes When It''s Still (IEX)','Hot Mulligan','Hot Mulligan','LP','WXBO0050.1','840526515318',17.5,17.5,'46514981','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651531','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Blue and Red A-Side/B-Side Vinyl Hot Mulligan is a ride-or-die testament to staying true to yourself. When the emo band formed in 2014 and cut their teeth playing house shows and naming songs by closing their eyes and typing into auto-correct on their phones, no one expected they''d be selling out thousand-cap venues, one of their scene''s most respected bands a decade later. But as Hot Mully releases their phenomenal fourth LP, The Sound a Body Makes When It''s Still, that''s exactly where they''re at. Hot Mulligan is a resounding success story, the #1 Hot New Band (11 years running, just ask them), and ready to keep fighting the good fight. A sense of fear lives and breathes throughout the album, in blistering choruses alongside the most vulnerable moments Hot Mulligan has ever laid to tape. That being said, this is still a Hot Mulligan record, and that means it rocks. Through it all, Hot Mulligan and longtime producer Brett Romnes laid down a masterclass. The Sound a Body Makes When It''s Still grabs your attention with all it''s fight-or-flight hooks, but it''s the little nuances and connective tissue that make it Hot Mulligan''s most cohesive album yet.','11/6/2026',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/18/4535518-3690559.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184502,'abyss iex|pastel ghost|pastel ghost|lp','Abyss (IEX)','Pastel Ghost','Pastel Ghost','LP','ASDE6517053IEX.1','840526517053',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'46548580','2026-11-10 23:58:03','2026-11-10 23:58:03','/84052651705','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'Purple Smoke Indie Retail Exclusive. Pastel Ghost''s debut album Abyss, containing her biggest song "Dark Beach. Both haunting and hypnotic, the album captures a sense of weightless melancholy, pulling listeners into a world that feels at once intimate and otherworldly.','11/6/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/10/4538210-3700214.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184503,'they re only chasing safety iex|underoath|underoath|lp','They''re Only Chasing Safety (IEX)','Underoath','Underoath','LP','MHED79555.1','840526516100',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'46520395','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651610','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Ultra Clear Vinyl. Underoath reinvents the balance between chaos and harmony with each successive release. Their compositions, conjured from creative tension, become iconoclastic anthems. They''re Only Chasing Safety is the fourth studio album by American melodic hardcore band Underoath, released June 15, 2004 through Solid State Records. In the heavy and punk music scene, the album is considered a watershed moment; the blend of heavy metal and hardcore influences with a strong pop/punk sensibility spawned a new branch of heavy music that became synonymous with the screamo scene of the mid-2000s. The record went gold in 2011.','10/30/2026',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/4535927-3694210.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184504,'define the great line iex|underoath|underoath|lp','Define the Great Line (IEX)','Underoath','Underoath','LP','MHED4563.1','840526516117',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'46520388','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651611','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Jade Colored Vinyl. Underoath reinvents the balance between chaos and harmony with each successive release. Their compositions, conjured from creative tension, become iconoclastic anthems. This year the band celebrates 20 years of their album Define The Great Line. Coming on the heels of 2004''s They''re Only Chasing Safety, Define The Great Line saw Underoath pivoting towards a more aggressive sound. The record''s unconventional, and at times jarring, intensity served as a stark contrast to the pop-leaning trends taking over heavy music at the time. Featuring fan favorites like "Writing On The Walls," "In Regards To Myself," and "You''re Ever So Inviting," Define the Great Line defied expectations when it debuted at No. 2 on the Billboard 200.','10/30/2026',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/26/4535926-3694211.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184505,'normal heights iex|briston maroney|briston maroney|lp','Normal Heights (IEX)','Briston Maroney','Briston Maroney','LP','MHED566.1','840526517107',16.10000000000000143,16.10000000000000143,'46534101','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651710','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'Baby blue vinyl. "These songs were written just before and while in my first stint in rehab at 20 years old. They were recorded about 4 days after I got out. Broke, walking on freshly sober baby giraffe legs, I sold my car and moved back in with my mom to make that recording happened. At a time where I had no direction, the mission of capturing sonically the love that unraveled my heart at that age became my North Star. These songs have sat in the vault for 8 years, and somehow never managed to collect dust. Anytime I''d revisit them, the glow they carried upon conception still shined bright. For years I''ve known there would be a time to let them loose, and that time has finally come. It took nearly a decade of gaining life experience and perspective to truly appreciate the beauty of young love, courage in the face of unknowing at such a formative time in a lifespan, and belief in magic that can break your heart as quickly as it can mend it. I hope these songs can serve as a reminder of the lessons we all learn from early heartbreak and that belief, and even more so, a looking glass at how our hearts are capable of forever expanding to find love that''s true." - Briston Maroney','11/6/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/21/4536921-3696764.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184506,'|xxxtentacion|xxxtentacion|lp','? [Explicit Content]','XXXTentacion','XXXTentacion','LP','BDVI210672.1','842812106729',15.18999999999999951,15.18999999999999951,'36169016','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84281210672','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2018 album from the late rapper. Known for cathartic honesty that''s turned millions of fans into believers, Xxxtentacion''s ? showcases his most poignant, powerful, and personal writing to date. He personally contributed guitar and keys in addition to writing every single song. Close collaborator John Cunningham handled the bulk of production and features include Travis Barker, Matt Ox, JoeyBada$$ and PnB Rock. Fans have taken the charge now and officially made him the post-millennial Generation Z''s answer to Kurt Cobain. Xxxtentacion began writing music after being released from a youth correction center and released his first song on SoundCloud in June 2013, titled "News/Flock". He was a popular figure in SoundCloud rap, a trap scene that takes elements of lo-fi music and harsh 808s.','7/13/2018',0.7199999999999999734,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/1/1/0/3790118.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184507,'i want to die in new orleans|uicideboy|uicideboy|lp','I Want To Die In New Orleans [Explicit Content]','$Uicideboy$','$Uicideboy$','LP','GFN59039.1','842812109126',16.07999999999999829,16.07999999999999829,'36568710','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84281210912','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. From New Orleans'' crime-ridden, neglected, violent 7th Ward section rap duo and cousins $uicideboy$ ($lick + Ruby Da Cherry) started out in 2014, their name referencing a mutual pact: if they didn''t make it to 30 they''d end their lives. I Want To Die in New Orleans is inspired by touring experiences and the extravagance that comes with fame. The duo strives to create clever, thought-provoking music that pushes boundaries while remaining true to their mission. Via music sharing platform SoundCloud, the duo rose to popularity for their abrasive, self-produced beats, as well as their harsh lyrical content and themes featuring addiction and suicidal ideation. The duo are considered one of the most popular acts in the underground rap scene, and are also considered to have a cult following.','11/2/2018',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/3559911.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184508,'everything so far 11th anniversary edition iex 3xlp|pinegrove|pinegrove|lp','Everything So Far - 11th Anniversary Edition (IEX) 3XLP [Explicit Content]','Pinegrove','Pinegrove','LP','RRDG486.1','840526518593',31.0,31.0,'46607973','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651859','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Anniversary Edition)',0,'The original double album of Pinegrove tracks from 2010-2015, now updated with a third LP of 8 unreleased recordings from that time period. Includes new artwork along with the original 12x12 16 page full color booklet. Indie/Retail Exclusive Yellow Vinyl','11/13/2026',1.699999999999999956,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4543685-3719132.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184509,'i want to disappear in the usa iex|the story so far|the story so far|lp','I Want to Disappear in the USA (IEX)','The Story So Far','The Story So Far','LP','MHED24IEX.1','840526519026',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'46633347','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651902','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Reissue)',1,'Ultra Clear Vinyl. The Story So Far is an American pop-punk band from Walnut Creek, California, formed in 2007. This is the third pressing of their live record recorded between shows in Boston and LA in 2025.','12/18/2026',1.0,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184510,'i m in your mind fuzz|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|lp','I''m In Your Mind Fuzz','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','LP','KGLW149726.1','842812149726',18.25,18.25,'43340415','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84281214972','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,NULL,'6/17/2022',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/32/4187332-3464214.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184511,'l w|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|lp','L.W.','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','LP','KGLW213991.1','842812139918',16.0,16.0,'41280072','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84281213991',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2021 release. Serving as both a standalone work and a companion piece to 2020 predecessor K.G., L.W. sees the Melbourne-based innovators produce a truly original album. As the band enter their second decade, the creative future of this most 21st century of outfits only promises to be bolder, madder and more imaginative than ever.','5/28/2021',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/56/3906256-2707397.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184512,'heavenly body if i m the bottle you re the message red|eartheater|eartheater|lp','Heavenly Body: If I''m the Bottle You''re the Message - Red','Eartheater','Eartheater','LP','MDEC240.1','840536901897',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'46360113','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84053690189','(Colored Vinyl, Red, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Red Vinyl, Gatefold Jacket. Eartheater''s seventh album, Heavenly Body: If I''m the Bottle You''re the Message, is as personal as it is universal. Exploring the pregnant body as a vessel for something greater than itself, it''s an intimate look at what it means to carry and birth another human. It''s a record of deep introspection, peeing in cups, and pregnancy sex. A mix of dance lullabies, post-wave bangers, prismatic anthems, and stadium-stretching art-pop, Heavenly Body offers a new chapter in Drewchin''s already deep discography. While it''s the singular experience of one woman, versatile composer, singer, producer, and multi - instrumentalist, Alexandra Drewchin, Heavenly Body explores the feelings other people have experienced, in other ways, without having to be a parent.','8/21/2026',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4521823-3616907.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184513,'notes from the archive recordings 2011 2016|maggie rogers|maggie rogers|lp','Notes From The Archive: Recordings 2011-2016','Maggie Rogers','Maggie Rogers','LP','DBAY121373.1','842812137303',18.25,18.25,'41084014','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84281213730','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Double colored vinyl LP pressing. 2020 collection. Grammy- nominated producer/songwriter/performer Maggie Rogers releases a special collection of archival music: Notes From The Archives: Recordings 2011-2016. The 16 track collection features newly remastered versions of tracks from Maggie''s early albums and six previously unreleased songs. Rogers'' 2019 Capitol Records debut album, Heard It In A Past Life entered Billboard''s Top Album Sales Chart at No. 1, debuted at #2 on the Billboard 200 and received widespread critical acclaim.','5/7/2021',1.350000000000000088,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/3877845-2650353.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
