INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184516,'space of the heart iex|goldford|goldford|lp','Space of the Heart (IEX)','Goldford','Goldford','LP','MHED34788.1','840526512751',22.08999999999999986,22.08999999999999986,'46374226','2026-11-10 23:58:04','2026-11-10 23:58:04','/84052651275','(Indie Exclusive)',0,'Cloudy Clear with Orange Splatter Indie Retail Exclusive. Goldford''s soul music is rooted in truth. His raw, unvarnished songs are a balance of introspection and catharsis, grappling with heartbreak, healing, and the quiet revelations that come with growth. After spending a decade in corporate America, the St. Louis native (now based in Los Angeles) turned to music as a means of survival following a devastating personal loss. "I was more afraid of dying with regret than I was of failing," he says of his decision to finally choose the path at 30, a choice that set his entire trajectory in motion. That initial fearlessness has since fueled extraordinary momentum. With over 4 million monthly listeners on Spotify, Goldford has rapidly become one of the most compelling emerging voices in contemporary music. His breakout EP, Orange Blossoms (Oct 2024), has surpassed 100M streams, and his latest project, Space of the Heart (Sept 2025), has already generated 90.8M streams, 2.7M saves, and over 153,000 pieces of user-generated content across TikTok and Instagram. The standout track "Easy Does It" has reached 43.5M streams and continues to accelerate with more than 250K new weekly discoveries on Spotify.','9/18/2026',0.6800000000000000488,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/4522982-3621996.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
