INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184703,'ow 8 iex|sylvan esso|sylvan esso|lp','Ow 8 (IEX)','Sylvan Esso','Sylvan Esso','LP','PCHT69C1.1','850068258802',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'46430205','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85006825880','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Purple)',0,'On their new album, Sylvan Esso metabolizes a life of making music with people into making art that you just love, a tactile and enveloping freefall. Written across four years in the woods in Chapel Hill, the longest the band has ever spent writing a record, Ow Γê₧ (pronounced ''Ow Infinity'') arrives with an intense immediacy. Most of the tracks here are Meath''s first vocal takes, and the clarity and humanness of her singular voice anchors the album in something real. It was born from a time of experimentation and collaboration, resulting in a sinewy, punchy, explosive work where the songs want to claw their way out. A technicolor totem of personal destruction, the feeling of being pummeled to silly putty and built back into something that feels almost human, almost familiar but freakish and new - a cartoonish, slapstick grin printed across a ruin.','9/11/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4527892-3677673.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184704,'mercy|armand hammer alchemist|armand hammer alchemist|lp','Mercy','Armand Hammer & Alchemist','Armand Hammer & Alchemist','LP','RYMS808.1','850063560313',25.98999999999999844,25.98999999999999844,'45498527','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85006356031',NULL,0,'Armand Hammer and The Alchemist build worlds. Their first was Haram and it remains locked in orbit, equal parts lush and foreboding. Their new one is called Mercy and it''s made out of blood and empire, children''s laughter, unpaid parking tickets, and things that haven''t happened yet. TRACKLIST: Rappers ELUCID and billy woods are joined on the mic by Earl Sweatshirt, Quelle Chris, Cleo Reed, Pink Siifu, Kapwani, and Silka. The Alchemist did everything else.','11/7/2025',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4456042-3448680.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184705,'sylvan esso 10 year anniversary edition|sylvan esso|sylvan esso|lp','Sylvan Esso - 10 Year Anniversary Edition','Sylvan Esso','Sylvan Esso','LP','PCHT12C1.1','850056058131',25.98999999999999844,25.98999999999999844,'44241421','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85005605813','(Colored Vinyl, Black, White, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Recorded in a little bedroom studio out in Durham, North Carolina, Amelia Meath and Nick Sanborn''s debut LP as Sylvan Esso arrived in 2014 at the juncture of pop and experimental. Even now, years later, the LP remains an urgent and fitting introduction to a push-and-pull that would go on to inform the duo''s sound - a thoughtful headiness that also wants you to get out on the dance floor. A blend of analog and digital, Meath and Sanborn were two unexpected puzzle pieces fitting together with singular ease, producing a ten-track LP that was both minimalist and shimmering, with dark undulations rippling beneath the synthy-surface and crystalline quality of Meath''s voice. Before all of the international touring and festival headlining and critical acclaim and Grammy nominations, Sylvan Esso was just a shot-in-the dark of musical chemistry gone right. The original album bio for the self-titled presciently sets the stage for the thesis that has gone on to guide Meath and Sanborn''s writing since then: "a collection of vivid addictions concerning suffering and love, darkness and deliverance" arriving as "a necessary pop balm, an album stuffed with songs that don''t suffer the longstanding complications of that term." And so, even as the band continues to evolve and becomes amorphous, there''s still that argument about what pop can be at it''s core. This is just the beginning of that conversation captured on tape. In honor of the record''s ten year anniversary, North Carolina-based indie label Psychic Hotline will release a deluxe reissue, complete with previously unreleased material. Featuring essential singles "Coffee", "Hey Mami," and "H.S.K.T.", the expanded edition also includes remixes from J Rocc, Rick Wade, Helado Negro, Dntel, and more. The deluxe 2LP package sports an all-over foil inversion of the original album''s iconic foil "SE" logo.','5/17/2024',1.189999999999999947,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/27/4320427-3131993.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184706,'self medicated|jelly roll|jelly roll|lp','Self Medicated [Explicit Content]','Jelly Roll','Jelly Roll','LP','STGM4833.1','850068274833',18.25,18.25,'45585586','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85006827483','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'For the first time ever on vinyl, Jelly Roll gives fans the project that thrust him into superstardom: ''Self Medicated''. This gatefold 2-disc LP features the multi-platinum smash hit "Save Me" and is the perfect collector''s item for any Jelly Roll fan.','12/5/2025',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/53/4463253-3460062.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184707,'tha doggfather iex|snoop doggy dogg|snoop doggy dogg|lp','Tha Doggfather (IEX) [Explicit Content]','Snoop Doggy Dogg','Snoop Doggy Dogg','LP','DRRG63588IEX.1','850079803039',21.42999999999999972,21.42999999999999972,'45588471','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85007980303','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'The definitive sound of a rap legend''s evolution. Originally released in 1996, Tha Doggfather is Snoop''s defiant, Double Platinum sophomore album. With production helmed by Daz Dillinger, this album delivers an essential dose of laid-back G-Funk, including the classic tracks "Doggfather" and "Vapors." It''s the sound of an untouchable icon cementing his legacy amidst chaos. Available now on vinyl for the first time in 5 years.','12/12/2025',1.260000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4463540-3460741.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184708,'teenage sex and death at camp miasma iex original soundtrack|various artists|various artists|lp','Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma (IEX) (Original Soundtrack)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','WXWQ247IEX.1','850078789822',25.0,25.0,'46582256','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85007878982','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Waxwork Records presents the soundtrack to Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma, the provocative new coming-of-age horror from MUBI and Plan B. Alex G''s haunting original score collides with a nostalgic, unexpected mix of needle drops from R.E.M., Counting Crows, Donna Lewis, Okay Kaya, Sally Shapiro, and more. Capturing the film''s intoxicating blend of youth, desire, danger, and dread, this essential soundtrack brings the unforgettable world of Camp Miasma home. Indie/Retail Exclusive Translucent Red with Glitter Vinyl','12/4/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/4541245-3737402.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184709,'a beautiful disaster|jelly roll|jelly roll|lp','A Beautiful Disaster [Explicit Content]','Jelly Roll','Jelly Roll','LP','STGM4826.1','850068274826',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'45585579','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85006827482','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Jelly Roll is releasing ''A Beautiful Disaster'' on vinyl for the first time ever! With hit singles like "Bottle and Mary Jane╫┤ and "Creature", this classic LP is a must have for any Jelly Roll fan.','12/5/2025',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4463252-3460061.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184710,'pixie|olivia o brien|olivia o brien|lp','Pixie','Olivia O''Brien','Olivia O''Brien','LP','GMMA100.1','850079803572',21.42999999999999972,21.42999999999999972,'46266859','2026-11-10 23:58:16','2026-11-10 23:58:16','/85007980357','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'This summer, Olivia O''Brien steps back into the light with PIXIE- her highly anticipated sophomore album. The 15-track project showcases her strongest, most honest songwriting yet, extending the textured, indie-leaning sound she introduced on 2024''s everywhere i go, there i am. Built on a catalog of career-defining moments - from her viral cover of Avril Lavigne''s "Complicated" to the genre-defining Hot 100 hit "hate u love u" - PIXIE finds Olivia turning the page with clarity and conviction, stepping into a chapter that feels less like reinvention and more like a true arrival. Iridescent Gold 2LP in gatefold jacket and Side D etching.','7/17/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4514567-3594789.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
