INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184748,'indigos|duke ellington|duke ellington|lp','Indigos','Duke Ellington','Duke Ellington','LP','IMPX6010.1','856276002107',35.74000000000000198,35.74000000000000198,'16758377','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85627600210','(180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition)',0,'A set of late night ballads released by Duke Ellington in 1958. This is a reissue of the original 6 eye Columbia Records version. Side 1. Solitude, Where Or When, Mood Indigo, Autumn Leaves. Side 2. Prelude to a Kiss, Willow Weep for Me, Tenderly, Dancing in the Dark. 180 gram vinyl, limited edition of 2500.','8/4/2023',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/1745888.jpg?ae=4621895153','Big Band');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184749,'bloodless|samia|samia|lp','Bloodless','Samia','Samia','LP','GJUY913.1','855579007628',20.85000000000000143,20.85000000000000143,'44917500','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85557900762','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Smoke)',0,'SAMIA: (clear smoke edition) On her third album Bloodless, Samia seeks comfort in absence. "It''s easier to be what someone wants you to be if you give as little as possible," she says. Drawing inspiration from unsolved mysteries - inexplicable cattle mutilations, the presence of God, the impossibility of femininity - Samia examines how shadows can loom larger than their source. "I noticed a pattern in my life of wanting to live up to the person I became in someone''s head; you become a lot bigger with distance," she reflects, exploring the allure of existing as a fantasy. Through haunting harmonies and spectral imagery, the album seeks a path through that space between void and flesh-and-blood presence. Samia would like to be both, to be whole, to be impossible. Rich with layers that shift seamlessly from sparse folk to sweeping indie-pop epics, Bloodless explores Samia''s relationship with a fragmented, symbolic version of Men-a patchwork of expectations and imagined standards she tried to meet, which ultimately shaped her sense of self. "I''ve spent the past two decades unintentionally conflating men with my understanding of God," Samia explains. "The person I became in order to impress this imagined figure is inseparable from who I am today. With this album, I''ve tried to confront that head-on." Written & produced in both North Carolina and her new home of Minneapolis throughout 2024, Bloodless finds Samia reuniting with longtime-collaborator Caleb Wright and Jake Luppen for the highly-anticipated follow-up to 2023''s revered Honey, which followed Samia''s 2020''s breakthrough debut The Baby. Across these thirteen songs, Samia grapples with the hollow form she once embodied - a vessel that gained value through it''s own absence, until playing dead became it''s own form of life. With Bloodless, she endeavors to unearth the self buried beneath these carefully constructed personas, ultimately reaching a place of acceptance for her whole, imperfect being.','4/25/2025',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/4400957-3320584.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184750,'nurture|porter robinson|porter robinson|lp','Nurture','PORTER ROBINSON','PORTER ROBINSON','LP','MMPO460.1','858275059519',29.32000000000000028,29.32000000000000028,'41342701','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85827505951','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Double clear viny LP pressing in gatefold jacket. "Nurture is an album about hope, overcoming despair, faithfully pursuing a sense of purpose, and trying to prove that it''s worthwhile to try. This album came about during a period of intense creative and emotional struggle. I had structured my life around the expectation that the only thing that made me happy was writing music. But it was exactly that obsession and imbalance that made writing music an impossibility for me for years. I wanted it too much, was highly self-critical, and I was so scared that I wouldn''t ever be able to write music again. And the more desperate I became to write music, the harder it became. Only by accepting that I might never be able to do it again, and by embracing and trying to find happiness in aspects of life outside of music, was I able to slowly claw my way into being able to do it again. And on the other side of all this fear and anxiety, I found this life-giving sort of light and beauty. I felt a gratitude towards real life that I used to only feel towards fiction. I''m really, deeply glad that I wrote this album. It''s my favorite music I''ve ever made, and it made me feel purposeful and happy to write music again. I want to write music that tells people that an earnest and sincere effort to overcome that thing you''re struggling with is the best path forward. There''s no shortage of fuel for despair and nihilism, but I''ve found that those things don''t help. I want the listener to know that even when it seems impossible and insurmountable, it''s worthwhile to do your best, that there''s no shame in hope, and that purpose and meaning are worth pursuing."','5/28/2021',1.399999999999999912,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/3929771-2711648.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184751,'by and by|caamp|caamp|cd','By And By','Caamp','Caamp','CD','MMPO429.2','858275056525',11.0,11.0,'39068309','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85827505652',NULL,0,'Caamp formed when childhood friends Taylor Meier and Evan Westfall bonded over a shared love for Ohio and music. Their self-titled debut (2016) exceeded 52 million plays and climbed the Spotify charts. Thereafter, Caamp toured with Rainbow Kitten Surprise, headlined the US, released Boys EP (2K sold) and added a third member, Matt Vinson. The band has built their grassroots audience from touring all over the world and have sold 25K tickets over the last 8 months. In 2019 they will play worldwide festivals including Shaky Knees, The Great Escape, Outside Lands, Edmonton Folk Festival, Austin City Limits, and more. By & By was co-produced by Josh Block and Austin Jenkins (Leon Bridges, White Denim) at Ft. Worth''s Niles City Sound. The much-awaited album By and By includes key tracks "Penny Heads Up", "No Sleep", "By and By" and "Peach Fuzz".','7/26/2019',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/3672028-3076392.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184752,'by by import|caamp|caamp|lp','By & By [Import]','Caamp','Caamp','LP','IMT7505651.1','858275056518',46.54999999999999716,46.54999999999999716,'45556340','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85827505651','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,NULL,'7/26/2019',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4460476.jpg?ae=4621895153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184753,'blame game|beach bunny|beach bunny|lp','Blame Game','Beach Bunny','Beach Bunny','LP','MMPO508.1','858275061512',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'41120989','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85827506151','(Extended Play)',0,'Limited hot pink colored vinyl LP pressing. 2021 EP from the alternative rockers.','1/15/2021',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/75/3882375-2662437.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184754,'simulcast|tycho|tycho|lp','Simulcast','Tycho','Tycho','LP','MMPO459.1','858275059410',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'40185934','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85827505941','(Black)',0,'Simulcast follows the highly anticipated release of Tycho''s fifth studio album Weather earlier in the year. Simulcast features instrumental versions of the album tracks. Tycho are the double Grammy nominated, electronic music project led by Scott Hansen as primary composer, songwriter and producer. The group is taking a step towards their previous output and signature Tycho sound. Simulcast will be available on Mom + Pop Music X Ninja Tune.','2/28/2020',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/82/3787682-2544294.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184755,'offering|cults|cults|lp','Offering','Cults','Cults','LP','SIDY80059.1','858458005982',14.5,14.5,'33561356','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85845800598','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing includes digital download. Cults made their name in black and white. A pair of film school dropouts who burst onto the New York scene with a perfect single and a darkly retro sound, the band''s first two albums play like noirish documentaries on a lost girl group. Four years after Static, Cults returns with Offering, an exciting collection of songs bursting with heart, confidence, shimmering melody and buzzing life. The time off has given the band new energy and new ideas-Cults are working in Technicolor now. The core duo remains the same. Madeline Follin and Brian Oblivion, both 28, still live in New York. They still finish each other''s thoughts and still share a love of catchy music and black humor. But the pair have put some blood on the tracks since their breakout debut: they''ve toured the world, built a devoted audience, survived a breakup, grown up in green rooms, parted ways with their old label and made a home of their new one. Offering is the work of two artists who know what they want and how to make it happen.','10/6/2017',0.6899999999999999467,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/6/7/9/3719762.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184756,'ride the lightning|metallica|metallica|lp','Ride The Lightning','Metallica','Metallica','LP','BKRGND004R.1','858978005059',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'30730830','2026-11-10 23:58:20','2026-11-10 23:58:20','/85897800505','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition of the second studio album by Metallica, originally released in 1984. The album was recorded in three weeks with producer Flemming Rasmussen at the Sweet Silence Studios in Copenhagen, Denmark. The artwork, based on a concept by the band, depicts an electric chair in the midst of a thunderstorm. The title was taken from a passage in Stephen King''s novel The Stand. Although rooted in the thrash metal genre, the album showcased the band''s musical maturity and lyrical sophistication. This was partly because bassist Cliff Burton introduced the basics of music theory to the rest of the band and had more input in the songwriting. Instead of relying strictly on fast tempos as on Kill ''Em All, Metallica broadened it''s approach by employing acoustic guitars, extended instrumentals, and more complex harmonies.','4/15/2016',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4397400-3726216.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184757,'from the road vol 1 covers|brown zac||lp','FROM THE ROAD VOL 1: COVERS','BROWN,ZAC',NULL,'LP','FGTV18843.1','85163600564',27.75,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/zac-brown-from-the-road-vol-1-covers/85163600564',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184758,'weather|tycho|tycho|lp','Weather','Tycho','Tycho','LP','MMPO427.1','858275056211',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'39094650','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85827505621',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. With a hugely impressive over a million combined album sales and over a billion streams under their belt, Tycho are the Grammy-nominated electronic music project led by Scott Hansen as primary composer, songwriter and producer. Respected for both their musical output and Scotts graphic design work, under the ISO50 moniker, Tycho has produced and released a hugely successful back catalogue which has drawn comparisons to the likes of Boards of Canada, Ulrich Schnauss and Jon Hopkins. The highly anticipated release of Tycho''s fifth studio album Weather is an exciting progression from his previous output, with most of the new tracks being vocal lead, while still retaining the signature Tycho sound. The sonic shift is enhanced by a collaboration with a young exciting new voice - vocalist Saint Sinner who will be joining the live band following her time in the studio. The release will see Mom + Pop partner for this exciting new chapter in the artists career. The new album will be supported by an extensive world tour in 2020 and a US Fall 2019 tour hitting major US cities and festivals to be announced soon.','7/12/2019',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/3674472-2476187.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184759,'ride the lightning|metallica|metallica|cd','Ride The Lightning','Metallica','Metallica','CD','BKRGND004R.2','858978005141',8.519999999999999574,8.519999999999999574,'30730847','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800514',NULL,0,'Digitally remastered edition of the second studio album by Metallica, originally released in 1984. The album was recorded in three weeks with producer Flemming Rasmussen at the Sweet Silence Studios in Copenhagen, Denmark. The artwork, based on a concept by the band, depicts an electric chair in the midst of a thunderstorm. The title was taken from a passage in Stephen King''s novel The Stand. Although rooted in the thrash metal genre, the album showcased the band''s musical maturity and lyrical sophistication. This was partly because bassist Cliff Burton introduced the basics of music theory to the rest of the band and had more input in the songwriting. Instead of relying strictly on fast tempos as on Kill ''Em All, Metallica broadened it''s approach by employing acoustic guitars, extended instrumentals, and more complex harmonies.','4/15/2016',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/3018099-3324788.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184760,'kill em all|metallica|metallica|lp','Kill Em All','Metallica','Metallica','LP','BKRGND003R.1','858978005035',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'30732001','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800503','(180 Gram Vinyl, Remastered)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition of Metallica''s 1983 debut album. Kill ''Em All is regarded as a groundbreaking album for thrash metal because of its precise musicianship, which fuses New Wave of British Heavy Metal riffs with hardcore punk tempos. Its musical approach and lyrics were markedly different from rock''s mainstream of the early ΓÇÿ80s and inspired a number of bands who followed in similar manner. Metallica is easily one of the best, most influential heavy metal band of the ''80s. Responsible for bringing the genre back to Earth, the bandmates looked and talked like they were from the street, shunning the usual rockstar games of metal musicians during the early ''80s. They expanded the limits of thrash, using speed and volume not for their own sake, but to enhance their intricately structured compositions.','4/15/2016',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/8/7/0/3300788.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184761,'the double ep a sea of split peas|courtney barnett|courtney barnett|lp','The Double Ep: A Sea Of Split Peas','Courtney Barnett','Courtney Barnett','LP','MMPO160.1','858275016017',24.9200000000000017,24.9200000000000017,'25905526','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85827501601','(Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'2 vinyl LPs. Courtney Barnett has already taken Australia with her special blend of folk music and ''90s garage band rock. Through the joys of the South by Southwest Music Festival, she''s rapidly making in roads with the American music scene. 2014''s "Double EP: A Sea of Split Peas" really is 2 EPs in one package. Those EPs are "How to Carve a Carrot into a Rose" and "I''ve Got a Friend Called Emily Ferris." Her "Sea" actually cracked the Billboard 200 chart and made it''s way up to #165. With her pluck and deadpan delivery, Courtney Barnett is going places.','4/15/2014',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/8/5/2/2512582.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184762,'master of puppets|metallica|metallica|cd','Master Of Puppets','Metallica','Metallica','CD','BKRG05.2','858978005202',8.519999999999999574,8.519999999999999574,'33590998','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800520','(Remastered)',0,'Digitally remastered edition. Master of Puppets was originally released on March 3rd, 1986, on Elektra Records and went on to become the first Metallica album to be certified Platinum by the RIAA. The album has been certified six-times Platinum in the United States and has sold over 10 million copies worldwide. In 2016, the album became the first metal album to be added to the National Recording Registry of the Library of Congress, an honor granted to works deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant".','11/10/2017',0.0100000000000000002,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/3250270-3324789.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184763,'kill em all|metallica|metallica|cd','Kill Em All','Metallica','Metallica','CD','BKRGND003R.2','858978005134',8.679999999999999716,8.679999999999999716,'30730878','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800513',NULL,0,'Standard single disc. Digitally remastered edition of Metallica''s 1983 debut album. Kill ''Em All is regarded as a groundbreaking album for thrash metal because of it''s precise musicianship, which fuses New Wave of British Heavy Metal riffs with hardcore punk tempos. It''s musical approach and lyrics were markedly different from rock''s mainstream of the early ''80s and inspired a number of bands who followed in similar manner. Metallica is easily one of the best, most influential heavy metal band of the ''80s. Responsible for bringing the genre back to Earth, the band mates looked and talked like they were from the street, shunning the usual rockstar games of metal musicians during the early ''80s. They expanded the limits of thrash, using speed and volume not for their own sake, but to enhance their intricately structured compositions.','4/15/2016',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/88/3018088-3324787.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184764,'and justice for all|metallica|metallica|lp','And Justice For All','Metallica','Metallica','LP','BKRG7A.1','858978005776',32.46999999999999887,32.46999999999999887,'36717132','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800577','(Remastered)',0,'Double 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Includes digital download. Digitally remastered edition... And Justice for All is the fourth studio album by heavy metal icons Metallica, originally released on August 25, 1988. It was the first Metallica studio album to feature bassist Jason Newsted after the death of Cliff Burton in 1986... And Justice for All was recorded in early 1988 at One on One Recording Studios in Los Angeles. It features long and complex songs, fast tempos, and few verse-chorus structures. The lyrics feature themes of political and legal injustice seen through the prisms of censorship, war, and nuclear brinkmanship... And Justice for All was acclaimed by music critics. It was included in The Village Voice''s annual Pazz & Jop critics'' poll of the year''s best albums, and the single "One" earned Metallica it''s first Grammy Award (and the first ever in the Best Metal Performance category) in 1990.','11/2/2018',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/3573623.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184765,'master of puppets|metallica|metallica|lp','Master Of Puppets','Metallica','Metallica','LP','BKRG5.1','858978005219',20.03000000000000113,20.03000000000000113,'33591001','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800521','(Remastered)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Master of Puppets was originally released on March 3rd, 1986, on Elektra Records and went on to become the first Metallica album to be certified Platinum by the RIAA. The album has been certified six-times Platinum in the United States and has sold over 10 million copies worldwide. In 2016, the album became the first metal album to be added to the National Recording Registry of the Library of Congress, an honor granted to works deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant". Recorded at the Sweet Silence Studios with producer Flemming Rasmussen, it was their third album overall. Master of Puppets was the band''s last album to feature bassist Cliff Burton, who died in a bus accident in Sweden during the album''s promotional tour.','11/10/2017',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/3250271-3726218.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184766,'acid rap|chance the rapper|chance the rapper|lp','Acid Rap [Explicit Content]','Chance the Rapper','Chance the Rapper','LP','CTLL349721.1','859772349721',36.36999999999999745,36.36999999999999745,'45470585','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85977234972','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Anniversary Edition, Reissue)',0,'Chance the Rapper''s Acid Rap is a mixtape that defined a generation and put Chicago hip-hop on the map globally. For it''s 10th anniversary, we''ve pressed a special edition vinyl-the first official physical release of a project fans have only ever streamed or downloaded. This is more than a reissue-it''s a piece of hip-hop history that collectors, day-one fans, and new listeners alike will want to own. EXPLICIT','11/7/2025',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/4453678-3465892.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184767,'big fudge 6 in 1 vinyl record care cleaning kit big0000423s000s|||vinyl accessories','Big Fudge 6-IN-1 Vinyl Record Care & Cleaning Kit BIG0000423S000S','',NULL,'Vinyl Accessories','BFUG02688','85002070268',16.48999999999999843,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/big-fudge-6-in-1-vinyl-record-care-and-cleaning-kit-big0000423s000s/85002070268',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184768,'and justice for all|metallica|metallica|cd','And Justice For All','Metallica','Metallica','CD','BKRG7A.2','858978005783',8.679999999999999716,8.679999999999999716,'36715800','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85897800578','(Remastered)',0,'Digitally remastered edition.... And Justice for All is the fourth studio album by heavy metal icons Metallica, originally released on August 25, 1988. It was the first Metallica studio album to feature bassist Jason Newsted after the death of Cliff Burton in 1986.... And Justice for All was recorded in early 1988 at One on One Recording Studios in Los Angeles. It features long and complex songs, fast tempos, and few verse-chorus structures. The lyrics feature themes of political and legal injustice seen through the prisms of censorship, war, and nuclear brinkmanship.... And Justice for All was acclaimed by music critics. It was included in The Village Voice''s annual Pazz & Jop critics'' poll of the year''s best albums, and the single "One" earned Metallica it''s first Grammy Award (and the first ever in the Best Metal Performance category) in 1990.','11/2/2018',0.1199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/3573624-3324790.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184769,'23 classiques inoubliables unforgettable classics|edith piaf|edith piaf|lp','23 Classiques Inoubliables (Unforgettable Classics)','Edith Piaf','Edith Piaf','LP','VNLP80712.1','8712177063796',23.26999999999999958,23.26999999999999958,'26310756','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871217706379','(Edith Piaf)',0,'No information available.','6/10/2014',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/3/9/3/2553937.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184770,'joyful sky|robin trower|robin trower|lp','Joyful Sky','Robin Trower','Robin Trower','LP','PRRD770912.1','8712725751397',21.57999999999999829,21.57999999999999829,'45762253','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871272575139','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, Reissue)',0,'Blue vinyl pressing. For six decades, Robin Trower''s career has been an act of quiet rebellion. Rewind the reels of the British guitarist''s backstory and you''ll find an artist who has always rolled the dice rather than take the path of least resistance. Fast-forward to 2023 and Trower''s new studio album, Joyful Sky, represents vindication for his latest flash of artistic instinct. Always receptive to singers who can elevate his emotive guitar touch, the 78-year-old heard a quality in the smoky power of the acclaimed New Yorker Sari Schorr that made him want to tear down and rebuild his songcraft around her. "I''ve worked with some great vocalists over the years but Sari is dynamite, just an absolute knockout," reflects Trower. "This album really pushed me, made me write in different keys and arrange songs for her voice. I went more down the R&B route this time, because I knew she''d be great with that flavour. But the blues still underpins everything I do - and there''s definitely elements from my ''70s stuff in this new album."','1/30/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4477455-3495283.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184771,'one moment in time live in the usa|robin trower|robin trower|lp','One Moment in Time - Live in the USA','Robin Trower','Robin Trower','LP','PRRD76941.1','8712725752110',26.9200000000000017,26.9200000000000017,'45625961','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871272575211',NULL,0,'For Robin Trower, stage and studio are two sides of the same coin. If you''ve followed the seven-decade career of the award-winning British bluesman, you''ll know every song on One Moment In Time: Live In The USA. But unless you''ve pushed your way to the front of his sell-out shows, you''ve never heard them like this before. "I''m a different player on the stage," considers the 80-year-old. "It''s almost impossible to get to that point in the studio. It''s the sound of the guitar, it''s the volume, it''s the crowd. For what I do, it takes one hundred per cent commitment for it to work. But if you do it well, it''s life-affirming."','2/6/2026',1.020000000000000017,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4466774-3466839.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184772,'rock out iex|wolfmother|wolfmother|lp','Rock Out (IEX)','Wolfmother','Wolfmother','LP','VTWO5086IEX.1','8717931355612',26.6700000000000017,26.6700000000000017,'45893292','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871793135561','(Colored Vinyl, 180 Gram Vinyl, Indie Exclusive)',0,'Andrew Stockdale, founder of Grammy-winning act Wolfmother and creator of hits like "Woman" and "Joker & the Thief," has built a career on towering riffs and vintage hard-rock swagger. His 2021 album Rock Out channels that same electric energy, delivering straightforward, riff-heavy rock with a raw, jam-like feel and unmistakable ''70s-inspired attitude.','4/24/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4485031-3576092.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184773,'pacific standard time|poolside|poolside|lp','Pacific Standard Time','Poolside','Poolside','LP','POSE5.1','859708548983',21.82000000000000028,21.82000000000000028,'36518746','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/85970854898',NULL,0,'Poolside began as a recording project in a converted Los Angeles backyard pool house in early 2011, producing sunny tracks of subaquatic indie dance music in this makeshift recording studio. Surfacing first in the form of a YouTube video for the catchy track "Do You Believe?" Poolside were soon gaining local and national attention, with DJs like by James Murphy of LCD Soundsystem, techno legend Derrick May, and disco don Todd Terje spinning these tracks at events and a growing online following. Throughout 2011 Poolside continued making waves with a sound called "daytime disco" through tracks like a cover of Neil Young''s "Harvest Moon" as well as original tunes. In 2012 Poolside worked on a remix for longtime disco punks The Rapture and held fans over with a new single and video for a song called "Slow Down" as they prepared to release their debut album. That album, Pacific Standard Time, was released in July of 2012 on their own Day & Night label. After the album''s release, remixes for artists like Matthew Dear, Little Dragon and Fool''s Gold soon followed, rehearsing and touring with a live band, and doing DJ sets around the world. Eventually, as thoughts turned to a second album, Poolside went on ice for a year; to regroup. Beginning to work in earnest on another album Fall of 2016. While still revolving around the sunny, laid-back disco sound of PST, additions of uptempo dance songs and more guitars, and generally fleshed out the arrangements with more instruments and sounds.','8/17/2018',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/3554485-2882765.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184774,'where the light is import|john mayer|john mayer|lp','Where the Light Is [Import]','John Mayer','John Mayer','LP','MUVN4898295.1','8713748982959',63.03999999999999915,63.03999999999999915,'16390966','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871374898295','(Holland - Import)',0,'Heavyweight 180gm vinyl LP repressing of this 2008 album from the American singer/songwriter. Music on Vinyl.','3/6/2012',2.399999999999999912,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/0/1/8/1958109.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184775,'taj mahal import|taj mahal|taj mahal|lp','Taj Mahal [Import]','Taj Mahal','Taj Mahal','LP','IMT5048475.1','8718469536306',27.14999999999999858,27.14999999999999858,'31923095','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871846953630','(Holland - Import)',0,'Limited 180 gram audiophile vinyl LP pressing. Taj Mahal is the 1968 debut album by the American blues artist. Mahal often incorporates elements of world music into his works, and therefore has done much to reshape the definition and scope of blues music over the course of his almost 50-year career by fusing it with non-traditional forms, including sounds from the Caribbean, Africa and the South Pacific. The result shows in tracks like Sleepy John Estes'' ''Diving Duck Blues'' with textures resembling the mix on the early Cream albums, while ''The Celebrated Walkin'' Blues'' has the sound of a late release by Muddy Waters. Blind Willie McTell''s ''Statesboro Blues'' and Robert Johnson''s ''Dust My Broom'' are also represented.','2/10/2017',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/0/2/8/3528204.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184776,'morning view import|incubus|incubus|lp','Morning View [Import]','Incubus','Incubus','LP','MUVN6953213.1','8718469532131',32.96999999999999887,32.96999999999999887,'20030667','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871846953213','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,NULL,'2/19/2013',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/2/7/7/2147728.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184777,'tchaikovsky nutcracker suite grieg peer gynt suite import|duke ellington his orchestra|duke ellington his orchestra|lp','Tchaikovsky: Nutcracker Suite /  Grieg: Peer Gynt Suite [Import]','Duke Ellington & His Orchestra','Duke Ellington & His Orchestra','LP','VLP9005468.1','8719039005468',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'38803857','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871903900546','(Holland - Import)',0,'Featuring jazz interpretations of Tchaikovsky''s ''The Nutcracker'', the album has come to be recognized as one of Duke Ellington''s most important albums of the 1960s. Award winning New York based conductor Steven Richman has done a great job with the winning combination of Tchaikovsky and Duke Ellington & Billy Strayhorn (the hippest cats of jazz-a-tooty) on the one album. Bonus tracks on this album are selections from ''Peer Gynt'' suites No. 1 and 2 written by Edward Grieg adapted by Duke Ellington including five movements: "Morning Mood," "Hall of the Mountain King," "Solvejg''s Dance," "Ase''s Death," and "Anitra''s Dance."','5/3/2019',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/0/1/7/3907106.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184778,'make yourself import|incubus|incubus|lp','Make Yourself [Import]','Incubus','Incubus','LP','MUVN6953212.1','8718469532124',32.96999999999999887,32.96999999999999887,'20030650','2026-11-10 23:58:21','2026-11-10 23:58:21','/871846953212','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Hard Rock Classic Double LP album 180 gram audiophile pressing gatefold sleeve. Music On Vinyl proudly presents no less than FIVE Incubus albums on 180 gram vinyl! Starting off with their second full length S. C. I. E. N. C. E. (1997) all the way to their 2006 offering Light Grenades, this batch spans the heyday of this seminal Alt-Rock band. Merging Nu-Metal grooves with Funk, Rock and Hip Hop, Incubus carved their own musical niche and earned a huge following by tireless touring and releasing ever-improving quality albums. Their Southern Californian vibe resonated with fans all over the world, highlighted on Double Platinum album Make Yourself (with the radio hit "Drive"), the Incubus essential Morning View ("Wish You Were Here", "Nice To Know You") and it''s follow-up A Crow Left Of The Murder ("Megalomaniac").','2/19/2013',1.229999999999999983,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/3/7/7/2147731.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184779,'korn import|korn|korn|lp','Korn [Import]','Korn','Korn','LP','MOVL2750774.1','8718469536375',38.78999999999999915,38.78999999999999915,'26832630','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871846953637','(Holland - Import)',0,'Limited double 180 gm vinyl LP pressing with six page insert. KORN is the eponymous debut studio album by the American Nu-Metal band Korn. It was released in 1994, right after the band toured with Biohazard and House of Pain. The album''s themes mainly consisted of both drug and child abuse. ''Korn'' was well received by music critics. The band stormed the alternative scene virtually overnight, and is said to have established Nu-Metal. Bands like Coal Chamber and Limp Bizkit were inspired by the album''s rage, emphasizing similar grooves and song structures, including some Hip Hop elements. Slipknot, Machine Head, and Sepultura were also inspired by the album. The album launched the career of record producer Ross Robinson.. a little more than a year after release, the album went Gold in the United States. The album spawned 4 singles; ''Blind'', followed by ''Need To'', ''Shoots and Ladders'' and ''Clown''.','7/29/2014',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/7/7/0/2750774.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184780,'music from the lord of the rings themes various ltd 180gm crystal clear white vinyl import|various artists|various artists|lp','Music From The Lord Of The Rings: Themes /  Various - Ltd 180gm Crystal Clear & White Vinyl [Import]','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','VLP3900749.1','8719039007493',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'45438745','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871903900749','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, White, Holland - Import)',0,'Limited white colored vinyl LP pressing. Dive into the enchanting world of Middle-earth with our compilation LP featuring the most iconic tracks from "The Lord of the Rings - Themes". This stunning collection captures the heart and spirit of the epic saga, making it a must-have for fans and music lovers alike. The Lord of the Rings film trilogy, directed by Peter Jackson, is based on the classic novels by J.R.R. Tolkien with "The Fellowship of the Ring" (2001), "The Two Towers" (2002) and "The Return of the King" (2003).','8/22/2025',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/4444178-3419515.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184781,'at newport forbidden fruit ltd 180gm turquoise vinyl import|nina simone|nina simone|lp','At Newport /  Forbidden Fruit - Ltd 180gm Turquoise Vinyl [Import]','Nina Simone','Nina Simone','LP','VLP3900739.1','8719039007394',24.23999999999999844,24.23999999999999844,'45438721','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871903900739','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Turquoise, Holland - Import)',0,'This 2LP set brings you the LP "Forbidden Fruit" & the LP "At Newport" by Nina Simone. "Gin House Blues" is later re-recorded in a more upbeat way. "Work Song", written by Oscar Brown, Jr. And Nat Adderley tells the story of a chain gang. The title song "Forbidden Fruit" is an humorous up-tempo take on Adam and Eve was part nursery rhyme, part call and response. Nina was supported by Al Shackman (piano), Chris White (Guitar), Bobby Hamilton (Bas) by both performances. "At Newport" is another fine Nina live show, starting off with blues and a stunning reading of "Porgy". She then uses her major spot at Newport jazz festival to show off her diversity going into folk, rhythmic jams and an instrumental version of "You''d Be So Nice To Come Home To" that is almost like a classical recital.','9/12/2025',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/4444176-3419513.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184782,'time out ltd 180gm aquamarine vinyl import|dave brubeck quartet|dave brubeck quartet|lp','Time Out - Ltd 180gm Aquamarine Vinyl [Import]','Dave Brubeck Quartet','Dave Brubeck Quartet','LP','VLP3900760.1','8719039007608',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'46063779','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871903900760','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Aqua, Holland - Import)',0,'A landmark in jazz history, Time Out (1959) by the Dave Brubeck Quartet broke conventions with it''s bold exploration of unusual time signatures. From the fiery 9/8 rhythm of "Blue Rondo ├á la Turk" to the cool, hypnotic 5/4 pulse of "Take Five", this album fuses complexity with accessibility. "Strange Meadow Lark" and "Three to Get Ready" blend lyrical piano with dynamic interplay, while "Kathy''s Waltz", "Everybody''s Jumpin''", and "Pick Up Sticks" round out Side B with vibrant energy and rhythmic innovation. A timeless classic that redefined modern jazz.','4/24/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4498369-3543670.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184783,'this is|nina simone|nina simone|lp','This Is','Nina Simone','Nina Simone','LP','VNYP90189.1','8719039007936',19.64000000000000056,19.64000000000000056,'46442727','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871903900793','(Colored Vinyl, Orange, White, 180 Gram Vinyl, Limited Edition)',0,'Before becoming one of America''s most beloved vocalists, Emerging in the late fifties as one of the most distinctive voices in jazz and soul, Nina Simone captivated audiences with her emotional depth, unique phrasing, and genre-defying style. This collection brings together some of her finest early recordings up to 1962, showcasing the remarkable artistry that made her a legend. Featuring timeless classics such as ''My Baby Just Cares for Me,'' ''I Loves You, Porgy,'' and ''Mood Indigo,'' the album blends jazz, blues, gospel, and classical influences into an unforgettable listening experience. From intimate ballads to sophisticated jazz interpretations, this compilation is a perfect introduction to one of music''s most influential and enduring artists.','9/11/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4529069-3742840.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184784,'for always ltd 180gm red vinyl import|willie nelson|willie nelson|lp','For Always - Ltd 180gm Red Vinyl [Import]','Willie Nelson','Willie Nelson','LP','VLP3900780.1','8719039007806',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'46063816','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871903900780','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Red, Holland - Import)',0,'Step back into the roots of American country music with Willie Nelson - For Always, a timeless LP that captures the rise of one of music''s most iconic storytellers. In 1955, Nelson made his very first recordings "The Storm Has Just Begun" and "When I''ve Sung My Last Hillbilly Song" humble beginnings that hinted at the genius to come. Soon after, while touring as a bass player with Ray Price''s Cherokee Cowboys, his songwriting lit up the charts for other artists. "Funny How Time Slips Away" became a hit for Billy Walker, and "Crazy," made famous by Patsy Cline, went on to become the biggest jukebox hit of all time. This LP also celebrates Nelson''s early success as a performer, featuring his first charting singles "Willingly" (a heartfelt duet with Shirley Collie) and "Touch Me," both early glimpses of the smooth, soulful sound that would define his career. A must-have for every country music lover, this record tells the story of where the legend began.','4/24/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4498373-3543669.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184785,'all n all import|earth wind fire|earth wind fire|lp','All N All [Import]','Earth Wind & Fire','Earth Wind & Fire','LP','MOVL2006720.1','8719262006720',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'36598540','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926200672','(Holland - Import)',0,'Limited 180gm audiophile vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. All ''N All is the eighth and most well-known studio album by Earth, Wind & Fire. The album features hit singles such as ''Fantasy'' and ''Serpentine Fire''. Everything comes together in this excellent mix of different music styles and also shows their variety in pop music. Their funk is so full of sounds in classics like ''Jupiter'' and ''Serpentine Fire''. Earth, Wind & Fire became famous during the 1970s with their contagious mix of soul, funk, disco, pop, rock and Latin. They have won many awards and been inducted into both the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame as well as the Vocal Group Hall of Fame.','9/14/2018',0.969999999999999974,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/0/2/9/3819200.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184786,'call me by your name original motion picture soundtrack|call me by your name|call me by your name|lp','Call Me by Your Name (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack)','CALL ME BY YOUR NAME','CALL ME BY YOUR NAME','LP','MCVL184B.1','8719262006041',42.9200000000000017,42.9200000000000017,'35656517','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926200604','(Black, 180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited double 180gm vinyl LP pressing including poster, insert and printed inner sleeves. Call Me By Your Name, the 2017 film by Luca Guadagnino, is a sensual and transcendent tale of first love, based on the acclaimed novel by Andre Aciman. Summer of 1983, Northern Italy. An American-Italian is enamored by an American student who comes to study and live with his family. Together they share an unforgettable summer full of music, food, and romance that will forever change them. The film received critical acclaim upon it''s release, being already positively compared to Brokeback Mountain and Moonlight. Luca Guadagnino wanted the film''s music to be connected to Elio, a young pianist who likes to transcribe and adapt pieces in order to get close to Oliver. The music is used to reflect the time, the characters'' family, level of education and ''the kind of canon they would be a part of''. Guadagnino found himself resonating with Sufjan Stevens'' lyricism through his work and initially asked Stevens to record an original song. Eventually, Stevens contributed three songs to the soundtrack: ''Visions of Gideon'', which was used at the end of the film, ''Mystery of Love, '' which was featured in the film''s first trailer and a new rendition of ''Futile Devices'' with piano. Stevens penned the songs by using the script, the book, and the conversations with the director about the characters. It marks Sufjan Stevens'' first soundtrack for a feature film. The soundtrack also features songs by Ryuichi Sakamoto, Giorgio Mororder, The Psychedelic Furs and many others.','2/16/2018',1.5,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/3447628-3405515.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184787,'everything in transit 180 gram black vinyl import|jack s mannequin|jack s mannequin|lp','Everything In Transit [180-Gram Black Vinyl] [Import]','Jack''s Mannequin','Jack''s Mannequin','LP','MOVL2017719.1','8719262017719',27.14999999999999858,27.14999999999999858,'41150542','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926201771','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Holland - Import)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing. Jack''s Mannequin is the name of a side project headed by Andrew McMahon, the lead singer of Something Corporate. It is a concept album centered around McMahon''s return to California and the demise of a long-standing relationship.','2/19/2021',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/64/3887264-2729470.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184788,'funky divas 180 gram black vinyl import|en vogue|en vogue|lp','Funky Divas 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','En Vogue','En Vogue','LP','MOVL6203001.1','8719262030015',27.14999999999999858,27.14999999999999858,'43407620','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926203001','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Holland - Import)',0,'180 gram audiophile black vinyl. Funky Divas is en Vogue''s most commercially and critically successful album. The album stands as one of the best pop/R&B albums to emerge from that time, incorporating soul, hip-hop, pop, dance, and rock to create one of the era''s most diverse, dazzling, and exciting pieces of work. The album scored no less than five hit singles, three of which became Top 10 pop hits.','5/5/2023',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4197463-2961532.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184789,'moontan remastered explanded gatefold 180 gram black vinyl import|golden earring|golden earring|lp','Moontan - Remastered & Explanded Gatefold 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','Golden Earring','Golden Earring','LP','MOVL6203002.1','8719262030022',33.93999999999999773,33.93999999999999773,'43514953','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926203002','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Gatefold LP Jacket, Remastered, Expanded Version)',0,'Remastered & expanded 180-gram black vinyl edition from the first-generation master tapes on 2LP''s featuring 3 previously unreleased mixes and 4 bonus tracks. Originally released in 1973, Moontan is the album that gained Golden Earring an enormous amount of international popularity, primarily on the strength of the hit single and enduring radio favourite "Radar Love". To this day, their ninth album Moontan is their most successful album internationally - being the only Golden Earring album to be certified Gold by the RIAA - and paved the way for these Dutch rockers in the US. "Radar Love" reached #13 on the Billboard Single Charts and has been covered over 500 times ever since, including by U2, R.E.M. and Def Leppard.','6/9/2023',1.409999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4212950-2977517.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184790,'hidden treasures of taj mahal 1969 1973 limited 180 gram clear blue marble colored vinyl import|taj mahal|taj mahal|lp','Hidden Treasures Of Taj Mahal (1969-1973) - Limited 180-Gram Clear & Blue Marble Colored Vinyl [Import]','Taj Mahal','Taj Mahal','LP','MOVL6203059.1','8719262030596',31.03000000000000113,31.03000000000000113,'43832798','2026-11-10 23:58:22','2026-11-10 23:58:22','/871926203059','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Limited edition of 1500 individually numbered copies on crystal clear & blue marbled 180-gram audiophile vinyl. As one of the most prominent figures in late 20th century blues, singer/multi-instrumentalist Taj Mahal played an enormous role in revitalizing and preserving traditional acoustic blues. The 2LP The Hidden Treasures Of Taj Mahal was originally released in 2012 and a compilation of some of Mahal''s finest work. LP 1 features studio tracks that were previously unreleased, recorded between 1969 and 1973. LP 2 contains the full live concert from April 18, 1970, at the Royal Albert Hall in London.','11/3/2023',1.320000000000000062,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4250787-3043304.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184791,'deliverance limited 180 gram crystal clear vinyl with etching import|corrosion of conformity|corrosion of conformity|lp','Deliverance - Limited 180-Gram Crystal Clear Vinyl with Etching [Import]','Corrosion of Conformity','Corrosion of Conformity','LP','MOVL6203074.1','8719262030749',50.42999999999999972,50.42999999999999972,'44635374','2026-11-10 23:58:23','2026-11-10 23:58:23','/871926203074','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, Etched, Holland - Import)',0,'Limited edition of 1500 numbered copies on crystal clear 180-gram audiophile vinyl. Corrosion of Conformity''s 1994 album, Deliverance, is a land- mark in the band''s evolution, blending heavy metal, stoner rock, and southern rock influences. Released on Columbia Re- cords, the album propelled the band to mainstream success, with standout tracks like "Clean My Wounds" and "Albatross" becoming iconic hits. Deliverance showcases Corrosion of Conformity''s groove-driv- en sound, featuring heavy riffs, dynamic rhythms, and the powerful vocals of Pepper Keenan. It marks a shift from their earlier punk roots to a more melodic and structured style that appeals to both metal and rock fans alike. Praised for it''s gritty, Southern-influenced vibe, Deliverance remains one of COC''s most influential albums, solidifying their place in the metal scene.','11/1/2024',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/65/4372365-3263047.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
