INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184814,'musas vol 1 180 gram black vinyl import|natalia lafourcade|natalia lafourcade|lp','Musas Vol. 1 - 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','Natalia Lafourcade','Natalia Lafourcade','LP','MOVL6204449.1','8719262044494',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'46165688','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204449','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Canada - Import)',0,'For her sixth album, Natalia Lafourcade delved deeper into the history and culture of her Latin American roots. With the help of the acoustic guitar duo Los Macorinos, she created a Latin American classic, drawing inspiration from her local musical heroes. Even on "Que He Sacado Con Quererte" she gets help from Buena Vista Social Club lead singer Omara Portuondo. Musas Vol. 1 was praised by critics and even received a nomination for the Latin American Grammy Awards. Musas Vol. 1 is available on black vinyl.','5/15/2026',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/61/4508661-3574536.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184815,'anthems ultimate singles collected|armin van buuren|armin van buuren|lp','Anthems (Ultimate Singles Collected)','Armin Van Buuren','Armin Van Buuren','LP','MCVL3500X.1','8719262040830',39.75999999999999802,39.75999999999999802,'45332548','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204083','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'It''s easy to forget how many life-changing songs Armin has produced over his staggering career, including records like his early UK chart hit ''Blue Fear'' and his smash hit ''This Is What It Feels Like'', which was certified Platinum, Gold, and Silver around the globe. Armin van Buuren has had the fortitude to stay true to his values throughout an unrivalled DJ career, in which he was voted DJ Mag''s #1 DJ more than anyone in history. In addition to pioneering never-before-seen techniques in his live shows and concerts, Armin has always had his number one priority be the music itself. And so, with a deep respect for his loyal fans, Armin set out to create a different kind of record: one in which the fans played a key role. He reached out during his radio show and through his website and social media, giving the fans and the fans alone the chance to determine the track list of this incredible compilation album. And they responded in droves. While each listener''s top 5 Armin-favorites may be different, combined these are the fan-voted, greatest ARMIN ANTHEMS of alltime. Anthems (Ultimate Singles Collection) is available on black vinyl and includes an insert with liner notes by Armin van Buuren. LISTEN: https://youtu. be/-L274HVdK98 * 180 GRAM AUDIOPHILE VINYL * 6MM SLEEVE * INCLUDES INSERT WITH LINER NOTES BY ARMIN VAN BUUREN * 2LP FEATURING A SELECTION OF HIS GREATEST ANTHEMS, INCLUDING ''THIS IS WHAT IT FEELS LIKE'', ''BLUE FEAR'', ''IN AND OUT OF LOVE'', ''COMMUNICATION'', ''BURNED WITH DESIRE''& ''SHIVERS'' * BLACK VINYL Track listing: SIDE A 1. This Is What It Feels Like (feat. Trevor Guthrie) 2. In And Out Of Love (feat. Sharon Den Adel) 3. Not Giving Up On Love (vs Sophie Ellis-Bextor) 4. Ping Pong 5. Blue Fear SIDE B 1. Drowning (Avicii Remix) (feat. Laura V) 2. Burned With Desire (Rising Star Vocal Mix) (feat. Justine Suissa) 3. Hystereo 4. We Are Here To Make Some Noise 5. Communication SIDE C 1. Shivers (feat. Susana) 2. Intense (feat. Miri Ben-Ari) 3. Feels So Good (feat. Nadia Ali) 4. Love You More (feat. Racoon) 5. Alone (feat. Lauren Evans) SIDE D 1. Yet Another Day (feat. Ray Wilson) 2. Serenity (Feat. Jan Vayne) 3. Going Wrong (Armin Van Buuren''s Remix) (with DJ Shah feat. Chris Jones) 4. Save My Night 5. Sail','8/1/2025',1.030000000000000026,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4440401-3413705.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
