INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184817,'black swan original soundtrack|clint mansell|clint mansell|lp','Black Swan (Original Soundtrack)','Clint Mansell','Clint Mansell','LP','MCVL80.1','8719262043688',32.96999999999999887,32.96999999999999887,'45976513','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204368','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Black Swan is a 2010 American psychological thriller film directed by Darren Aronofsky and starring Natalie Portman, Vincent Cassel, Mila Kunis and Winona Ryder. The plot revolves around a production of Tchaikovsky''s Swan Lake ballet by a prestigious New York City company. Usually described as a psychological thriller, Black Swan can be also interpreted as a metaphor for achieving artistic perfection, with all the psychological and physical challenges one might encounter. The original score for the film was composed by Clint Mansell, an English musician, composer, and former lead singer of the band Pop Will Eat Itself. Mansell was introduced to film scoring when director Darren Aronofsky hired him to score his debut film, Pi. Ever since Mansell wrote the score for many of Aronofsky''s films. Notable film scores include Pi, The Fountain, Moon, Smokin'' Aces, Requiem for a Dream, The Wrestler, Doom, Black Swan, and High-Rise. Black Swan is available on black vinyl and includes a 4-page booklet with liner notes. The record comes in a sleeve finished with linen laminate. LISTEN: https://youtu. Be/5jaI1XOB-bs * 180 GRAM AUDIOPHILE VINYL * GATEFOLD SLEEVE FINISHED WITH LINEN LAMINATE * INCLUDING 4 PAGE BOOKLET WITH LINER NOTES * PVC PROTECTIVE SLEEVE * BLACK VINYL Track listing: SIDE A 1. Nina''s Dream 2. Mother Me 3. The New Season 4. A Room Of Her Own 5. A New Swan Queen 6. Lose Yourself 7. Cruel Mistress 8. Power, Seduction, Cries 9. The Double 10. Opposites Attract SIDE B 1. Night Of Terror 2. Stumbled Beginnings... 3. It''s My Time 4. A Swan Is Born 5. Perfection 6. A Swan Song (For Nina)','3/20/2026',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4491785-3531528.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184818,'red clay gatefold 180 gram black vinyl import|freddie hubbard|freddie hubbard|lp','Red Clay - Gatefold 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','Freddie Hubbard','Freddie Hubbard','LP','MOVL6204629.1','8719262046290',28.12000000000000099,28.12000000000000099,'46413673','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204629','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Gatefold LP Jacket, Holland - Import)',0,'Gatefold 180-gram black vinyl. Freddie Hubbard''s fusion jazz of Red Clay is something that the younger generations within jazz and hip hop admire and aspire to. The title track "Red Clay" was sampled by both A Tribe Called Quest on "Jazz (We''ve Got)" and Freestyle Fellowship in "Parkbench People", only to be covered by today''s new vocal jazz singer Jos├⌐ James. It would take half a day to explain the intricacies of a song like "The Intrepid Fox". Red Clay seamlessly blends bop with soul jazz and fusion in a way that will remain unsurpassed for a long time.','8/28/2026',0.07000000000000000667,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/95/4526395-3665015.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184819,'i love to love orange gold vinyl import|nina simone||lp','I Love To Love - Orange & Gold Vinyl [Import]','Nina Simone',NULL,'LP','VLP3900790.1','871903900790',14.53999999999999915,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/nina-simone-i-love-to-love-orange-and-gold-vinyl-import/871903900790',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184820,'couldn t stand the weather limited expanded 180 gram yellow red orange colored vinyl import|stevie ray vaughan|stevie ray vaughan|lp','Couldn''t Stand The Weather - Limited Expanded 180-Gram Yellow, Red & Orange Colored Vinyl [Import]','Stevie Ray Vaughan','Stevie Ray Vaughan','LP','MOVL6204716.1','8719262047167',37.82000000000000028,37.82000000000000028,'46605481','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204716','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Red)',0,'Hailed as one of the greatest guitarists of all time, Stevie Ray Vaughan''s second album with his band Double Trouble did everything a second album should do. It confirmed that Vaughan was no fluke and cemented his status as one of the modern blues giants. This double album, Couldn''t Stand the Weather, also includes original takes, outtakes and alternate takes of songs from the posthumous release The Sky Is Crying. In 1995, Q-Music wrote of the late Texan bluesman: ''Vaughan''s post-Hendrix Stratocasting still sparkles... a reminder of the wit that often informed his phrasing and his willingness to torch the boundaries''. Couldn''t Stand The Weather is a limited edition of 3000 individually numbered copies on yellow, red & orange coloured vinyl.','11/13/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/46/4543446-3719232.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184821,'if not now when 180 gram black vinyl import|incubus|incubus|lp','If Not Now When - 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','Incubus','Incubus','LP','MOVL6204586.1','8719262045866',39.75999999999999802,39.75999999999999802,'46311719','2026-11-10 23:58:25','2026-11-10 23:58:25','/871926204586','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Holland - Import)',0,'If Not Now, When? is the comeback album by Incubus after an half decade hiatus. Just like their success albums A Crow Left Of The Murder... and Light Grenades, Brendan O''Brien covered the production for the band. The producer, who is best known for producing records for Pearl Jam, Korn and Audioslave, helped reinventing their sound. The band''s seventh installment is recognized by less use of guitars compared to their earlier works. The album reached #2 in the US Billboard Charts. Singles "Adolescents" and "Promises, Promises" ended up in the Billboard Alternative and Rock Charts. If Not Now, When? is available on black vinyl','7/24/2026',1.159999999999999921,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/43/4517643-3604802.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184822,'civil wars gatefold 180 gram black vinyl import|the civil wars|the civil wars|lp','Civil Wars - Gatefold 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','The Civil Wars','The Civil Wars','LP','MOVL6204705.1','8719262047051',40.72999999999999687,40.72999999999999687,'46553539','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/871926204705','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Gatefold LP Jacket, Holland - Import)',0,'The Civil Wars is the second and final album by alternative folk band The Civil Wars (Joy Williams and John Paul White). In their short existence, the band won 4 Grammy Awards, worked with Taylor Swift, and toured with Adele. The Civil Wars entered at number 1 in the Billboard 200 chart and features the Grammy Award Winning Song "From This Valley" plus the singles "The One That Got Away" & "Dust To Dust". The album also includes a brilliant cover of the Smashing Pumpkins classic "Disarm". The Civil Wars is available on 180g black vinyl.','10/23/2026',1.260000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4538681-3704670.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184823,'cave world|viagra boys|viagra boys|cd','Cave World [Explicit Content]','Viagra Boys','Viagra Boys','CD','YER164.2','8720766055749',9.5,9.5,'42643647','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872076605574','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'In this time of strife, insanity and confusion, only one band is depraved enough to offer themselves up as herald. Like sin-eaters if sins had to be ingested from a very small spoon, Viagra Boys have consumed the utterly incomprehensible chaos of our era and distilled it into 12 immaculate tracks of post-truth-cow-funk-kraut-wave-enlightenment.','7/15/2022',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4090586-2824971.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184824,'antibloom opaque magenta|silverstein|silverstein|lp','Antibloom - Opaque Magenta','Silverstein','Silverstein','LP','UFD192.1','8721093739012',13.39000000000000056,13.39000000000000056,'44735005','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872109373901','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Opaque magenta vinyl. 2025 is a milestone year for Silverstein. The post-hardcore giants will not only be celebrating 25 years as a band, but also the release of their ambitious two-part 11th studio album project - the first part titled Antibloom will be released on February 21, 2025. In May of 2024, the band headed to Joshua Tree, CA to fully indulge themselves in the solitude of the desert and begin studio work on their new album. They found themselves so deeply inspired by the atmosphere that they ended up with more songs than could fit on one piece of music - thus birthing the double album concept. "Antibloom is a reference to the desert, the empty vastness, the harshness, something we experienced while making the record. This is not a concept record, the concept was making a record in this space, and while the lyrics/songs are not directly connected in any shape or form, the concept of death or mortality does appear a lot". (Shane Told/Singer)','2/21/2025',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4383351-3302656.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184825,'viagr aboys|viagra boys|viagra boys|cd','Viagr Aboys','Viagra Boys','Viagra Boys','CD','SHRI1.2','8721253931539',9.0,9.0,'44932206','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872125393153',NULL,0,'Viagr aboys is the fourth studio album from Viagra Boys. Featuring single "Man Made of Meat", the LP sees VB turn inwards, leaving the acid-laced, conspiracy-addled societal commentary of previous LP Cave World behind to journey into the acid-laced, conspiracy-addled landscape within. Absurd, intense and surprisingly tender, viagr aboys shuts out the noise to find that the important part of being alive in the big, stupid world is figuring out that the world inside of you that is equally big and stupid.','4/25/2025',0.2200000000000000011,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/03/4404203-3389632.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184826,'musas vol 2 180 gram black vinyl import|natalia lafourcade|natalia lafourcade|lp','Musas Vol. 2 - 180-Gram Black Vinyl [Import]','Natalia Lafourcade','Natalia Lafourcade','LP','MOVL6204450.1','8719262044500',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'46165695','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/871926204450','(180 Gram Vinyl, Black, Canada - Import)',0,'After the successful release of Musas Vol. 1 and Natalia Lafourcade''s contribution to the Disney Pixar hit film Coco, Lafourcade continued the Musas project where the cultural heritage of Latin American folk music is centralized. A follow-up was more than welcome, fans and critics received Musas Vol. 2 with loving words. This time the album was not only nominated for the Latin Grammys, but also for the international Grammy Awards. Musas Vol. 2 was maybe the last part of this series, but it was the start and introduction for many fans in this new wave of Latin American folk music and cemented Natalia Lafourcade even more as a household name for After the successful release of Musas Vol. 1 and Natalia Lafourcade''s contribution to the Disney Pixar hit film Coco, Lafourcade continued the Musas project where the cultural heritage of Latin American folk music is centralized. A follow-up was more than welcome, fans and critics received Musas Vol. 2 with loving words. This time the album was not only nominated for the Latin Grammys, but also for the international Grammy Awards. Musas Vol. 2 was maybe the last part of this series, but it was the start and introduction for many fans in this new wave of Latin American folk music and cemented Natalia Lafourcade even more as a household name for folk fans all over the world.','5/15/2026',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/62/4508662-3574327.jpg?ae=4621895153','Latin Pop/Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184827,'pink moon blue|silverstein|silverstein|lp','Pink Moon - Blue','Silverstein','Silverstein','LP','UFD192B.1','8721253952688',13.39000000000000056,13.39000000000000056,'45175657','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872125395268','(Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Following the release of Antibloom, Silverstein returns with Pink Moon: the second chapter in their ambitious 16-song double album, conceived and recorded during a transformative stretch in the high desert of Joshua Tree. Born from the same sessions as Antibloom, the songs on Pink Moon were sequenced with intention, offering a distinct yet complementary listening experience. Known for their meticulous attention to flow and emotional pacing, the band crafted both halves to stand on their own while also telling a broader, interconnected story, one that ebbs and crashes like the desert winds that shaped it. Pink Moon features the only guest appearances on the project, with stunning contributions from Cassadee Pope and Rory Rodriguez of Dayseeker - voices chosen mid-process when the band sensed the need to push certain songs into new sonic territory. The result is a bold and diverse body of work that expands Silverstein''s dynamic range while staying true to their emotional core. By releasing the project in two halves, the band has given every song the room to breathe, resonate, and evolve: a fitting strategy for a year packed with touring, celebration, and reflection. The moon has risen. The story continues.','9/12/2025',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/25/4426225-3395318.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184828,'stovall 10 year anniversary|microwave|microwave|lp','Stovall (10 Year Anniversary)','Microwave','Microwave','LP','MYHX16041.1','8721416663635',18.80000000000000071,18.80000000000000071,'45652103','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872141666363','(Colored Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Half Clear/Half Baby Blue with Pink Splatter Vinyl. Microwave is celebrating 10 years of their beloved debut album Stovall, released August 2014, with this special anniversary vinyl. Atlanta-based Microwave are strongholds in the emo/post-hardcore scene, releasing four full-length albums over the last 10 years including 2024''s Let''s Start Degeneracy.','1/2/2026',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/42/4469342-3471435.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184829,'silence outlives the earth|erra|erra|lp','Silence Outlives the Earth','Erra','Erra','LP','UFD205.1','8721416586262',16.98999999999999843,16.98999999999999843,'45889851','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872141658626',NULL,0,'Metalcore giants Erra return with their 7th studio album ''silence outlives the earth'' out March 6, 2026.','3/20/2026',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4484484-3505292.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184830,'consistency of energy call of the wild|viagra boys|viagra boys|lp','Consistency of Energy /  Call of the Wild','Viagra Boys','Viagra Boys','LP','YER6821.1','8721416547843',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'45596193','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872141654784',NULL,0,'Available for the first time in general retail, this 12" combines V*gra Boys explosive debut EP "Consistency Of Energy" (2016) with the enigmatic "Call Of The Wild" EP. Featuring stand-out tracks like "Research Chemicals" and "Call Of The Wild", this edition comes in a embossed + foiled jacket with both original covers (designed by singer Sebastian Murphy) printed on the inner sleeve.','12/19/2025',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/31/4464431-3462036.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184831,'limbo|namasenda|namasenda|lp','Limbo','Namasenda','Namasenda','LP','YER211.1','8721465808377',19.48000000000000042,19.48000000000000042,'46034380','2026-11-10 23:58:26','2026-11-10 23:58:26','/872146580837',NULL,0,'Naomi Namasenda emerged from a small town in southern Sweden to become one of modern pop music''s most unabashed talents. What began as a career in DIY bands has since evolved into a wholly solo endeavour, with her recent work in particular showcasing her prowess as both songwriter and performer. Through this, she defines a distinctly personal vision of pop creativity - a "perishable good," as she calls it, meant to be shared when the moment calls for it. Limbo, her most personal and fully realised body of work yet, will be released this year on YEAR0001. A cathartic explosion of emotion through sound and substance alike, it''s a record that finds Namasenda at her rawest, most vulnerable state. Limbo has blossomed from a relentless artistry that has been waiting to be unleashed for years.','5/8/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4496086-3535148.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
