INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184942,'palace for the people|greta van fleet|greta van fleet|lp','Palace For The People','Greta Van Fleet','Greta Van Fleet','LP','LAAV248190.1','881061162926',44.85999999999999944,44.85999999999999944,'46562869','2026-11-10 23:58:34','2026-11-10 23:58:34','/88106116292','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Gray, Black, White)',0,'GRETA VAN FLEET / PALACE FOR THE PEOPLE - Greta Van Fleet''s new album, Palace for the People, is available as a signed, first pressing Oracle Variant, with a smokey quartz marble finish. Includes two 12-inch discs, signed double-sided insert, booklet, sleeves, gatefold.','10/9/2026',1.389999999999999903,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/28/4539428-3721585.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184943,'seth macfarlane sings the muppets|seth macfarlane|seth macfarlane|lp','Seth MacFarlane Sings The Muppets','Seth MacFarlane','Seth MacFarlane','LP','RPBL247781.1','881061145646',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46509819','2026-11-10 23:58:34','2026-11-10 23:58:34','/88106114564',NULL,0,'Seth MacFarlane celebrates the timeless music of The Muppets with a heartfelt collection that reimagines beloved songs from the iconic franchise. Backed by lush orchestral arrangements, MacFarlane''s classic vocal style brings warmth and sophistication to these cherished melodies while preserving the charm, humor, and heart that have made The Muppets beloved across generations.','9/18/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/14/4535014-3709568.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184944,'king of having fun|medium build|medium build|lp','King Of Having Fun [Explicit Content]','Medium Build','Medium Build','LP','ISL247209.1','881061081357',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46407672','2026-11-10 23:58:34','2026-11-10 23:58:34','/88106108135','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Written in the heat of summer and recorded live with friends and collaborators, King of Having Fun traces the distance between the curious kid riding his bike too far from home and the grown man searching for relief in all the wrong places. Blending country, rock, and indie, the album explores friendship, freedom, addiction, anxiety, love, and the pursuit of feeling fully alive.','9/4/2026',0.7900000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/81/4525781-3652709.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184945,'mud|remi wolf|remi wolf|cd','Mud [Explicit Content]','Remi Wolf','Remi Wolf','CD','ISL248175.2','881061197515',11.64000000000000056,11.64000000000000056,'46540898','2026-11-10 23:58:34','2026-11-10 23:58:34','/88106119751','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Remi Wolf -"Mud" - If Remi Wolf''s first two albums, 2021''s Juno and 2024''s Big Ideas, were in technicolor, her third LP Mud is it''s more neutral, earthy and grounded sibling. Still colorful, as Wolf tends to be, but from a more rooted & grounded place. The rawness with which Wolf wrote the album is delivered in the sound: stripped away of synths and programmed drums, Mud is Remi Wolf at her most lyrically and sonically vulnerable. The songs evoke the feeling of singing around a campfire with just your friends and a couple guitars because that''s how it felt for Wolf to make it. But to find the clearing in the forest, she needed to make a whole new trail first. CD Jewel Case. EXPLICIT','10/9/2026',0.0100000000000000002,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4537429-3702170.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184946,'ride lonesome|beck|beck|lp','Ride Lonesome','Beck','Beck','LP','CAP247419.1','881061117698',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46445315','2026-11-10 23:58:34','2026-11-10 23:58:34','/88106111769',NULL,0,'Beck -"Ride Lonesome" Beck returns with Ride Lonesome, his first album of all-new material since the GRAMMY-winning Hyperspace, arriving September 18, 2026 via Capitol Records. Harkening back to the rich, atmospheric sounds of Morning Phase and Sea Change, the album reunites Beck with musicians from those acclaimed releases. Produced by Beck and mixed by Nigel Godrich, Ride Lonesome marks a compelling return to the intimate, cinematic style that defines some of his most celebrated work.','9/18/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/29/4529229-3673019.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
