INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184950,'christmas in the city|pentatonix|pentatonix|lp','Christmas In The City','Pentatonix','Pentatonix','LP','RPBL248380.1','881061325482',36.85000000000000142,36.85000000000000142,'46553744','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106132548','(Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Gold)',0,'The Grammy-winning vocal group brings their signature a cappella arrangements to a festive collection of modern and classic holiday songs.','10/30/2026',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4538701-3712187.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184951,'rent original soundtrack|rent o b c r|rent o b c r|lp','Rent (Original Soundtrack)','RENT / O.B.C.R.','RENT / O.B.C.R.','LP','DBWY254019.1','881061314332',73.48000000000000397,73.48000000000000397,'46607263','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106131433','(Anniversary Edition)',0,'For the first time, the original cast recording of Rent is available on vinyl, in celebration of the musical''s 30th anniversary. Jonathan Larson''s Tony & Pulitzer Prize-winning sensation transformed Broadway, helping a new generation find their voice on stage. Featuring unforgettable numbers like, "La Vie Boheme," and the immortal standard, "Seasons of Love," Rent remains as powerful and moving today as when it first opened in 1996. Created in collaboration with the original company, this edition is presented in a custom quad book-style gatefold jacket with a premium rigid cover. Archival materials celebrate Larson''s life and creative process. Exclusive to this edition is a deluxe, stitched 24pg booklet with lyrics and a new oral history of the album and it''s songs, drawing on new interviews with original cast members, director Michael Greif, and musical director Tim Weil, theatre historian Jennifer Ashley Tepper. Mastered for vinyl by Ryan K. Smith at Sterling Sound on 3 LPs.','11/13/2026',3.25,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/84/4543584-3719580.jpg?ae=4621895153','Musical Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184952,'stupid song stupid song piano version||interscope records|7 single','Stupid Song /  Stupid Song (Piano Version)',NULL,'Interscope Records','7" Single','ISC248036.7','881061216537',12.25,12.25,'46539373','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106121653','(Clear Vinyl, Pink)',0,'Olivia Rodrigo''s "stupid song" is available as a special 7" vinyl pressing in translucent pink. Featuring the fan-favorite track, the pressing is a standout addition to any Olivia Rodrigo vinyl collection.','9/25/2026',0.1499999999999999945,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4537316-3714607.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184953,'she s the best navy blue vinyl lp|troye sivan|troye sivan|lp','She''s The Best   (Navy Blue Vinyl LP) [Explicit Content]','Troye Sivan','Troye Sivan','LP','ISC248681.1','881061258056',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46526410','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106125805','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Poster)',0,'Troye Sivan''s highly anticipated album She''s The Best, out October 9, 2026. Available on navy vinyl with poster included. Indie Exclusive.','10/9/2026',0.75,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4536511-3723949.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184954,'forward iex ultra clear vinyl|first day back|first day back|lp','Forward (IEX) Ultra Clear Vinyl','First Day Back','First Day Back','LP','FDBQ11110.1','881626820711',17.53999999999999915,17.53999999999999915,'46396112','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88162682071','(Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl)',0,'First Day Back''s self-released DIY masterstroke Forward, heralded as the rightful torchbearers of second wave emo, recalls the vocal exasperation of Cap''n Jazz, the twinkle of American Football, and the youthful exuberance of Braid, all while reinventing the sound with the organic additions of violin and harmonica. A love letter to the past, post-dated well into the future. Indie exclusive variant on Ultra Clear Vinyl.','9/11/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4524791-3629031.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184955,'a very kacey christmas 10th anniversary|kacey musgraves|kacey musgraves|lp','A Very Kacey Christmas (10th Anniversary)','Kacey Musgraves','Kacey Musgraves','LP','LHWY248737.1','881061377559',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46598325','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106137755','(Limited Edition, Picture Disc Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Kacey Musgraves - A Very Kacey Christmas (10th Anniversary) - Picture Disc Vinyl LP Celebrate the 10th anniversary of Kacey MusgravesΓÇÖ 2016 classic Christmas album, A Very Kacey Christmas, with a limited-edition picture disc vinyl and a flurry of shiny, decorative snowflakes.','10/30/2026',0.4899999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/4542874-3740394.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184956,'in order|devon again|devon again|lp','In Order [Explicit Content]','Devon Again','Devon Again','LP','ISC248364.1','881061327097',20.60999999999999944,20.60999999999999944,'46672278','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88106132709','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Extended Play, Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Devon Again -"In Order" [Brick Red 12" EP] [Signed] Celebrating it''s one-year anniversary, Devon Again''s beloved ''In Order'' EP is available on vinyl for the first time with SIGNED sleeve, featuring "cherry cola," "skittles," and a brand-new bonus track "heavy bend," available only on vinyl. Pressed on brick red color 12" vinyl. Limited Edition. EXPLICIT','11/6/2026',0.589999999999999969,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/51/4549451-3736842.jpg?ae=4621895153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184957,'warpaint|warpaint|warpaint|lp','Warpaint','Warpaint','Warpaint','LP','RTUS680.1','883870068017',24.19999999999999929,24.19999999999999929,'22715784','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88387006801','(MP3 Download)',0,'Warpaint was recorded and mixed by Flood, aside from two songs that were mixed by Nigel Godrich. The album was conceived after some truly inspirational writing and recording sessions that took place in the Joshua Tree late last year. The band was joined there by visionary director Chris Cunningham, who has partnered with them for many of the album visuals including the cover. He spent two years filming and photographing the band as they made new music.','1/21/2014',1.199999999999999956,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/9/7/4/2394798.jpg?ae=4621895153','Indie Rock/Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184958,'dancing on the people ep rsd|sofi tukker|sofi tukker|lp','Dancing On The People EP (RSD)','Sofi Tukker','Sofi Tukker','LP','STKK5631.1','881626556313',12.99000000000000021,12.99000000000000021,'40113821','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88162655631',NULL,0,'"DANCING ON THE PEOPLE" EP (with three bonus tracks) is a collection of songs in English, Portuguese, and Spanish that expand Sofi Tukker''s global and inclusive vision of dance music with songs full of adventurous ideas and joy. Issued as a digital only release on September 20th, this is first time vinyl release of the EP and for the bonus tracks as well, which includes their collaboration with ZHU "Mi Rumba", and EP track remixes by Mahmut Orhan & R3HAB. About SOFI TUKKER: SOFI TUKKER is the genre-defying duo of Sophie Hawley-Weld and Tucker Halpern celebrated for their inclusive and global perspective on electronic music and their work''s themes of liberation, unity, and self-empowerment. Their debut single "Drinkee" was nominated for a Best Dance Recording Grammy,┬« which was followed by a Best Dance/Electronic Album Grammy┬« nomination for their debut album Treehouse. SOFI TUKKER''s records have achieved Gold or Platinum status on every continent other than Antarctica. Their electric and energetic live show has sold out venues and graced major festival stages across the planet, and SOFI TUKKER has also performed on major TV shows such as The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon (USA), X-Factor (Italy), Sunday Brunch (UK), Late Show (Russia) and BuzzRhythm (Japan). SOFI TUKKER are also passionate activists who have raised funds and awareness for Planned Parenthood, The Trevor Project, and the March for Our Lives.','9/26/2020',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/3780869-2604224.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184959,'sunbathing animal|parquet courts|parquet courts|lp','Sunbathing Animal','Parquet Courts','Parquet Courts','LP','RTUS710.1','883870071017',20.51999999999999958,20.51999999999999958,'45597275','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88387007101',NULL,0,'Originally released in 2014, Sunbathing Animal is being made available via Rough Trade Records on November 28, 2025. The year and change since the release of Parquet Courts monumental Light Up Gold is reflected in ways expected and not with Sunbathing Animal, it''s sharper, harder follow up. Light Up Gold caught the ears of everyone paying even a little bit of attention, garnering glowing reviews across the board for it''s weird colors and raw energy, saturated punk songs that offered crystal clear lyrical snapshots of city life. It was immediately memorable, a vivid portrait of ragged days, listlessness, aimlessness and urgency, broadcast with the intimacy of hearing a stranger''s thoughts as you passed them on the street. As it goes with these things, the band went on tour for a short eternity, spending most of 2013 on the road, their sound growing more direct in the process and their observations expanding beyond life at home. Constant touring was broken up by three recording sessions that would make up the new album, and the time spent in transit comes through in repeated lyrical themes of displacement, doubt and situational captivity. To be sure, Sunbathing Animal isn''t a record about hopelessness, as any sort of incarceration implies an understanding of freedom and peace of mind. Fleeting moments of bliss are also captured in it''s grooves and extended at length as if to preserve them. Pointed articulations of these ideas are heard as schizoid blues rants, shrill guitar leads, purposefully lengthy repetition and controlled explosions, reaching their peak on the blistering title track. A propulsive projection of how people might play the blues 300 years from now, "Sunbathing Animal" is a roller coaster you can''t get off, moving far too fast and looping into eternity.','11/28/2025',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/00/4464500-3525963.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184960,'best of nine inch nails redux various artists|various artists|various artists|lp','Best of Nine Inch Nails (Redux) (Various Artists) [Explicit Content]','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','MGEY893535.1','884388893535',30.53999999999999915,30.53999999999999915,'45562952','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88438889353','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Silver, Black, White)',0,'Enhance your Redux experience of Magnetic Eye Records and friends, who are respectfully paying homage to US-industrial rock legends NINE INCH NAILS and their 1994 milestone album "The Downward Spiral", by adding even more spectacular deep cuts and classics that are offered on the companion album "Best of Nine Inch Nails Redux". At this moment, the world''s reliance on machines, algorithms, and artificial intelligence has never been greater. This makes now the perfect time to reflect on the emergence of a musical force whose blend of mechanized instrumentation and raw emotion was singular and revolutionary. NINE INCH NAILS were formed in Cleveland, Ohio in 1988. They arrived around the same time as grunge when Generation X was developing an awareness of itself, but while there was cross-appeal, the sound they created was clearly and intentionally something very different. NINE INCH NAILS were at least twice as cynical as everyone else and reflected the singular, driven musical expression of mastermind Trent Reznor. Of NINE INCH NAILS'' seminal breakthrough album, Spin magazine respectfully had this to say in 2024: "As The Downward Spiral turns 30 this year, it still stands as an act of artistic transgression against the limits of popular music. Pushing the boundaries of creative censorship, it is still considered Nine Inch Nails'' most daring and uncompromising album." The Magnetic Eye Redux Series features hand-picked classic albums from across the history of rock and metal re-imagined in their entirety from start to finish. Artists we love from within and outside the heavy rock landscape choose tracks to make their own, bringing these milestone records into the new millennium with crushing heaviness and searing energy. Join us for our tenth foray into Redux territory as we pay proper respect to the US industrial rock legends NINE INCH NAILS!','12/19/2025',1.060000000000000053,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4461092-3454991.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184961,'chronchitis|slightly stoopid|slightly stoopid|lp','Chronchitis','Slightly Stoopid','Slightly Stoopid','LP','STOO7861.1','884501478618',15.02999999999999937,15.02999999999999937,'16046146','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88450147861',NULL,0,NULL,'10/11/2011',0.4000000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/2/6/5/1885621.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184962,'little neon limelight|houndmouth|houndmouth|lp','Little Neon Limelight','Houndmouth','Houndmouth','LP','RTUS762.1','883870076210',19.03000000000000113,19.03000000000000113,'27814567','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88387007621',NULL,0,'SELLING POINTS- Little Neon Limelight was produced by Dave Cobb (Beck, Sturgill Simpson, Jason Isbell)- Previous album has scanned over 17K to date- NPR premiered first album track For No One in November- Pre-release late-night TV scheduling now; past appearances include Conan, Letterman- Music video for Sedona premiered Jan 20; music video for Say It to premiere before street date- Commercial Triple-A radio campaign starts in January- Full US headline tour, festivals, and support dates scheduled throughout 2015- Southeast/Midwest tour for Feb/Mar; multiple SXSW appearances.','3/17/2015',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/0/8/6/2836801.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184963,'forever beyond blue|black lung|black lung|lp','Forever Beyond - Blue','Black Lung','Black Lung','LP','MGEY894501.1','884388894501',20.14000000000000056,20.14000000000000056,'45831690','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88438889450','(Colored Vinyl, Blue, 140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'When you find yourself adrift at zero gravity with a dreamy smile on your face, you''ve probably booked a flight into space on Black Lung''s latest inter-dimensional transport "Forever Beyond". The veteran trio from Baltimore, Maryland have fine-tuned the recipe of their musical rocket fuel, distilled from stoner doom, psychedelic rock, and other fiery ingredients. Black Lung''s unique concoction drives every track with captivating tunes, melodic riffing, pumping rhythms, and the inimitable vocal cords of Dave Cavalier taking it home. Every single song on "Forever Beyond" hits it''s mark perfectly. Undertones of anger and defiance manifest as many of the songs are artistic reactions to the historic political upheaval in the USA, dealing lyrically with the lure of fascism, blind nationalism, and corporate oligarchy. Black Lung came into being when two founding members of Baltimore''s well-established psych rock band THE FLYING EYES, guitarist and organ player Adam Bufano and drummer Elias Schutzman, teamed up with multi-instrumentalist Dave Cavalier in early 2014. The trio set themselves apart from the crowded field of psych doom and heavy blues with a sonic interchange of fuzzed-drenched guitars, deep driving drumbeats, and Cavalier''s raw, blues-tinged vocals. During the pandemic years, Black Lung managed to push forward with new guitarist Dave Fullerton, which resulted in the fourth album "Dark Waves". On this milestone, they abandoned some pet ideas such as eschewing bass guitar live in favour of guitars through bass amps, along with the black and white aesthetics that had dominated their artwork of their first three full-lengths. With "Forever Beyond", Black Lung demonstrate that it is possible to rage against injustice with an utmost joyful defiance!','3/6/2026',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4483966-3504464.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184964,'yours conditionally|tennis|tennis|lp','Yours Conditionally','Tennis','Tennis','LP','MYDL1.1','886446299426',18.14999999999999857,18.14999999999999857,'45743542','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88644629942','(Colored Vinyl, Deluxe Edition, Booklet)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing of the 2017 release, the fourth album from the critically acclaimed group Tennis. The record was composed both on land and at sea during a five-month sailing trip through the Sea of Cortez. Upon returning, Tennis'' husband-and-wife team of Patrick Riley and Alaina Moore self-produced the record in a small cabin in Fraser, CO. It was mixed by Spoon''s Jim Eno at Public HiFi. Yours Conditionally comes on the heels of the group''s 2014 release Ritual in Repeat, which received rave reviews from The New York Times, NPR''s All Things Considered and Fresh Air, Time, Vogue, Pitchfork, The Fader, Entertainment Weekly and many more.','3/6/2026',0.8800000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4475586-3494303.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184965,'slightly not stoned enough to eat breakfast yet stoopid|slightly stoopid|slightly stoopid|lp','Slightly Not Stoned Enough To Eat Breakfast Yet Stoopid','Slightly Stoopid','Slightly Stoopid','LP','STOO2.1','884501478625',15.02999999999999937,15.02999999999999937,'16046160','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88450147862',NULL,0,NULL,'10/11/2011',1.050000000000000044,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/0/8/5/1885806.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184966,'sports|modern baseball|modern baseball|cd','Sports','Modern Baseball','Modern Baseball','CD','LAEO19491.2','884501949118',9.0,9.0,'26609843','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88450194911',NULL,1,'∩┐╝Modern Baseball was formed in 2011 by friends and guitarists Jacob Ewald and Brendan Lukens, who were soon joined by Ian Farmer on bass and Sean Huber on drums. The band self-released their first EP The Nameless Ranger in 2011 while still in high school. Shortly after the members relocated to Philadelphia to attend college and quickly gained a strong following in the Philadelphia music community, teaming up with locals Marietta to release the Couples Therapy split in the spring of 2012. Modern Baseball released their debut full-length Sports later that year on Lame-O Records, which they self-recorded and produced. After spending the summer of 2013 touring heavily across the US, the band headed into Studio A in Philadelphia to self-record You''re Going to Miss It All. Mixed by Jonathan Low at Minor Street Recordings and mastered by Will Yip, You''re Going to Miss It All features 12 tracks that showcase the band''s signature witty indie-pop.','6/24/2014',0.1199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/5/1/8/2598157.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184967,'graceland 25th anniversary edition|paul simon|paul simon|lp','Graceland: 25th Anniversary Edition','Paul Simon','Paul Simon','LP','SNYL191472.1','886919147216',20.94000000000000127,20.94000000000000127,'16441194','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88691914721','(180 Gram Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'180 RAgm vinyl LP pressing with download card. Digitally re-mastered and expanded 25th Anniversary edition of this groundbreaking album from the iconic singer/songwriter. In 1986, Graceland sold 14 million copies worldwide and garnered both the Album and Song of the Year Grammy in 1987. Simon and the members of Ladysmith Black Mambazo performed on Saturday Night Live and appeared on the cover of Rolling Stone. It generated three hit singles and it kept Paul Simon and the Graceland tour on the road for five years. It''s music was heard across the globe. Today, it''s music and it''s reputation still reach generations of music enthusiasts yet so many are unaware of how pivotal that one album was during the 1980 s, how it helped birth the idea of World Music and revived the career of one of America''s most important songwriters. How it influenced the political progress of South Africa a country divided by institutionalized racism, causing and then transcending years of controversy. How in fact the album came to be in the first place.','6/5/2012',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/6/1/5/1965162.jpg?ae=4621895153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(184968,'from the hills below the city|houndmouth|houndmouth|lp','From the Hills Below the City','Houndmouth','Houndmouth','LP','RTUS662.1','883870066211',20.51999999999999958,20.51999999999999958,'20727345','2026-11-10 23:58:35','2026-11-10 23:58:35','/88387006621','(Digital Download Card)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Houndmouth is comprised of four musicians from New Albany, IN, across the river from Louisville - spent the past year building a passionate following in their hometown and touring with the Alabama Shakes, the Lumineers, Grace Potter, and the Drive-By Truckers. The 12 original songs on from the Hills Below the City are packed with tales of down-on-their-luck drug runners, casinos, riverboats, recession-era scraping, and more.','6/4/2013',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/2/0/5/2215028.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
