INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185219,'halloween howls fun scary music|andrew gold|andrew gold|lp','Halloween Howls: Fun & Scary Music','Andrew Gold','Andrew Gold','LP','CRF243952.1','888072788206',21.10000000000000143,21.10000000000000143,'46330550','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807278820','(Clear Vinyl, Orange)',0,'Limited clear orange vinyl LP pressing. Shake those chains, rattle those bones and let the ghoul times roll for this new translucent orange crush color vinyl edition of Andrew Gold''s Halloween Howls: Fun & Scary Music. The album includes "Spooky, Scary Skeletons" - a cult favorite, thanks to it''s popularity on YouTube and TikTok - along with 12 other sweetly scary songs with guest appearances by Linda Ronstadt and David Cassidy. As a special bonus, the catchy "Undead Tombstone Remix" of the popular song is included in this edition of the album.','7/24/2026',0.7600000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/45/4519245-3671795.jpg?ae=4621895153','Children''s Video');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185220,'marrow deep|mastodon|mastodon|lp','Marrow Deep','Mastodon','Mastodon','LP','LMVT247058.1','888072790742',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46441669','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807279074','(Limited Edition, Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl)',0,'MASTODON / MARROW DEEP CLEAR VINYL 2xLP Equal parts crushing & cathartic, Marrow Deep, finds GRAMMY winners Mastodon pushing their sound into new depths without sacrificing what makes them one of heavy music''s most forward-thinking forces. Mastodon channel profound grief into one of the most emotionally charged albums of their storied career. A 13 song testament of the effect those close to us can have on our lives-effects that can extend well beyond the time we have with them. An album ultimately representing resilience & solidarity.','8/28/2026',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4528971-3691613.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185221,'los ojos del condor|hermanos gutierrez|hermanos gutierrez|lp','Los Ojos Del Condor','Hermanos Gutierrez','Hermanos Gutierrez','LP','EASE244680.1','888072795167',21.10000000000000143,21.10000000000000143,'46334435','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807279516','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl)',0,'Hermanos Gutierrez presents a new world of sound on their latest album Los Ojos del Condor, leaving behind the cosmos for the coastal mist of Lima, Peru, where the brothers'' lineage takes root. On their third collaboration with Easy Eye Sound, Alejandro and Estevan Gutierrez craft an odyssey through lush musical soundscapes, trading the wide-open canyons of the American West for the rhythmic pulses of South America. Produced by Dan Auerbach.','9/25/2026',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4519630-3702669.jpg?ae=4621895153','International');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185222,'shrek original motion picture score|williams harry gregson powell john|williams harry gregson powell john|lp','Shrek (Original Motion Picture Score)','WILLIAMS,HARRY GREGSON / POWELL,JOHN','WILLIAMS,HARRY GREGSON / POWELL,JOHN','LP','VAR244334.1','888072780408',26.42999999999999972,26.42999999999999972,'46279644','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807278040','(Picture Disc Vinyl)',0,'Harry Gregson-Williams/John Powell -"Shrek (Original Motion Picture Score)" Get out of his swamp! In celebration of the 25th anniversary of the silver screen debut of everyone''s favorite ogre, Var├¿se Sarabande presents a brand-new picture disc edition of Harry Gregson-Williams & John Powell''s classic score for Shrek, featuring a hero shot of our heroes on Side A, and the dynamic duo of Shrek and Donkey on Side B. Concord Music Group; Varese Sarabande; Soundtrack.','8/28/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/4515648-3600533.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185223,'happier now|movements|movements|lp','Happier Now [Explicit Content]','Movements','Movements','LP','FEL244260.1','888072797390',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'46266255','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807279739','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Orange)',0,'So-Cal''s Movements remain on a steady upward trajectory. Their fourth album Happier Now builds on the tension-and-release sound they''ve perfected on their previous releases. Once again produced by Grammy-winner Will Yip, Happier Now holds fast to Movements'' dissonant grooves, while incorporating melodic flourishes in the mix as heard in "Dissolve Me" and the moody "Back in My Ways." With over 600M total global streams, Movements to remain faithful to the distinct sound their fans love.','9/4/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4514612-3697967.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185224,'looking for people to unfollow|ecca vandal|ecca vandal|lp','Looking For People To Unfollow','Ecca Vandal','Ecca Vandal','LP','LMVT244013.1','888072796003',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'46261526','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807279600','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue)',0,'For Ecca Vandal, punk was survival; a way in, and a way out. Born to a Sri Lankan family in South Africa and raised in Australia, she grew up under pressure to fit a mold. Punk blew that open. It was her way of pushing back, of refusing silence. Trained in jazz but craving something louder, she found freedom in being raw and unapologetic. Turning rebellion into identity, and identity into sound.','9/4/2026',0.05000000000000000277,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/47/4514047-3697616.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185225,'misadventures|pierce the veil|pierce the veil|lp','Misadventures [Explicit Content]','Pierce the Veil','Pierce the Veil','LP','FEL247361.1','888072786905',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46463081','2026-11-10 23:58:51','2026-11-10 23:58:51','/88807278690','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Picture Disc Vinyl)',0,'Pierce the Veil delivers an energetic collision of post-hardcore urgency, pop-minded hooks, intricate guitars, and emotionally heightened vocals.','9/25/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4530671-3713325.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
