INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185317,'supermodel|foster the people|foster the people|lp','Supermodel','Foster the People','Foster the People','LP','SNY377758.1','888837775816',16.96999999999999887,16.96999999999999887,'25875157','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88883777581',NULL,0,'LP Vinyl Pressing. 2014 release from the California indie pop band. SUPERMODEL, Foster the People''s sophomore release, is the follow-up to their hit album TORCHES and includes 11 tracks including the hit single ''Coming of Age''.','3/18/2014',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/4/4/3/2503446.jpg?ae=4621895153','Indie Rock/Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185318,'in colour|jamie xx|jamie xx|lp','In Colour','Jamie xx','Jamie xx','LP','REYG100624.1','889030022998',33.71000000000000085,33.71000000000000085,'45249570','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903002299',NULL,0,'Jamie xx will release a remastered version of his debut album In Colour on Dec 11 2020 on Young Turks. Jamie''s definitive In Colour is a bold, celebratory and emotional artistic statement that received critical acclaim across the board as well achieving huge commercial success.','11/14/2025',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/63/4432863-3460912.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185319,'process|sampha|sampha|lp','Process','Sampha','Sampha','LP','YNGT158.1','889030015815',19.03000000000000113,19.03000000000000113,'31888493','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903001581',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Sampha hails from Morden, south London and has spent the last six years generously dividing his musical talents across solo and collaborative work. In addition to his own revered solo releases (his debut Sundanza EP, 2013''s Dual EP and "Too Much / Without You" single), Sampha contributed majorly to SBTRKT''s acclaimed debut and follow up Wonder Where We Land as cowriter and featured vocalist, and went on to tour worldwide as half of the SBTRKT live show (spanning Glastonbury, Primavera, Coachella, Brixton Academy, Terminal 5...) Equally in demand as a songwriter, singer, producer and player, Sampha has been sampled by and produced for Drake ("The Motion" and "Too Much ft Sampha"), Kanye West ("Saint Pablo ft Sampha"), Beyonce ("Mine ft Drake"), Katy B ("Play ft Sampha") and FKA twigs (LP1 standout "Numbers") and Solange''s "Don''t Cut My Hair."','2/3/2017',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/9/3/8/3508399.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185320,'in colour|jamie xx|jamie xx|lp','In Colour','Jamie xx','Jamie xx','LP','YNGT229A.1','889030022912',20.51999999999999958,20.51999999999999958,'41121689','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903002291',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. Digitally remastered edition. Jamie''s definitive In Colour is a bold, celebratory and emotional artistic statement that received critical acclaim across the board as well achieving huge commercial success.','12/18/2020',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/19/3882419-3532381.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185321,'i see you|the xx|the xx|lp','I See You','The xx','The xx','LP','YNGT161.1','889030016119',20.51999999999999958,20.51999999999999958,'31852616','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903001611',NULL,0,'XX / I SEE YOU - vinyl - I See You is marked by a tonal shift to something close to pure, crisp pop structure, adorned by unusual crescendos that echo a dextrous DJ inching their dancer toward climax without ever quite lifting the house lights. It''s lyric sheet moves from the danger and hopelessness of love to it''s deliciousness and rapture; a move into a more outward looking proposition. I See You is recognizably still The xx but is now powered by the voluble ambition of it''s three perfect counterweights to one another starting to not just realize but harness their full potential. You might even want to think of the decisive move from Joy Divi-sion to New Order here, too. When they take their plum festival slots in 2017, armed with the ten most robust songs of their career, The xx should prick the skin and touch gently the shoulder of an audience reaching to the back of the field.','1/13/2017',0.5,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/2/0/6/3516020.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185322,'in waves|jamie xx|jamie xx|lp','In Waves','Jamie xx','Jamie xx','LP','YUNG356A.1','889030035615',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'44438036','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903003561',NULL,0,'The long-awaited new album by Jamie xx In Waves is the next chapter in the career of one of the most in demand producers of his generation. With In Waves, Jamie replicates the emotional crescendos and thrilling volatility of an almost mystical night out- one where you return home in the cigarette ash dawn, the specifics of the last eight hours already blurring, but aware that these feelings will remain a crystalline memory. In Waves is a melancholy paradise of bliss, heartbreak, and introspection. The story of a journey where you merge into the divine pulse of shadows, light, and dancefloor rhythms. A strobelight epiphany about the illimitable possibilities and spiritual capacities of humanity. Nine years after his debut solo masterpiece, In Colour the London producer has not only eclipsed the heights of it''s predecessor, he''s somehow made all supernatural adjectives and analogies seem understated','9/20/2024',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/91/4349991-3192643.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185323,'lp1|fka twigs|fka twigs|lp','LP1','FKA Twigs','FKA Twigs','LP','BQTX118.1','889030011817',19.03000000000000113,19.03000000000000113,'26695266','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903001181',NULL,0,'FKA Twigs is a London-based producer, singer, songwriter, video director, classically trained ballerina, and choreographer. Although Twigs (as her friends call her) has only officially released 2 EPs to date - one self-released and one for Young Turks, she has racked up more than 6 million Youtube views for her assorted videos - 2.5 million on the video for ''Water Me'' alone.','8/25/2014',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/6/3/8/2598368.jpg?ae=4621895153','Alternative Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185324,'malibu|anderson paak||lp','Malibu','Anderson Paak',NULL,'LP','SWOA222.1','88891517986',15.99000000000000021,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/anderson-paak-malibu/88891517986',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185325,'mid air|romy|romy|lp','Mid Air','Romy','Romy','LP','YUNG320.1','889030032010',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'43587698','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903003201',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2023 release. Mid Air is the debut solo album from Romy Madley-Croft, beloved for her work as 1/3 of The xx; as a formidable pop songwriter for artists including Dua Lipa, Halsey, and King Princess; and for her powerful and emotional vocals on songs by Fred Again.. and Jamie xx. According to Romy, "Mid Air is an album about celebration, sanctuary, and salvation on the dance floor. It''s an album that deals with love, grief, relationships, identity, and sexuality. It''s a love letter to the queer clubs where I''ve found community and connection."','9/8/2023',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4224630-3026608.jpg?ae=4621895153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185326,'we were wild|esme patterson|esme patterson|lp','We Were Wild','Esme Patterson','Esme Patterson','LP','GJUY241.1','889326556442',18.94000000000000127,18.94000000000000127,'30945395','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88932655644',NULL,0,'Limited ''magenta with black & white splatter'' colored vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2016 album by the singer/songwriter from Portland, OR. She began as a member of the Denver folk pop septet, Paper Bird, and has released two albums as a solo act including 2012''s All Princes, I and 2013''s Woman to Woman. She was a featured writer/vocalist on Shakey Graves'' album, Dearly Departed. She has performed on Conan, Leno and Letterman.','6/10/2016',0.4699999999999999734,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/03/3040803-2623198.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185327,'random access memories import|daft punk|daft punk|cd','Random Access Memories [Import]','Daft Punk','Daft Punk','CD','SNY371686.2','888837168625',8.97000000000000064,8.97000000000000064,'20431518','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88883716862',NULL,0,'In their 20-year history, Daft Punk have redefined electronic music, pioneered the live dance concert experience and shaped pop culture. Daft Punk is noted for it''s elaborate live shows, in which visual elements and effects are incorporated with the music. They are also known for it''s use of disguises, particularly the ornate robot costumes, while in public and/or performing. RANDOM ACCESS MEMORIES is Daft Punk''s first studio album in eight years and is already the most anticipated album of 2013.','5/21/2013',0.2300000000000000099,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/3/4/9/2199433.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185328,'sexistential|robyn|robyn|lp','Sexistential','Robyn','Robyn','LP','YUNG467A.1','889030046703',21.23000000000000042,21.23000000000000042,'45908699','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903004670','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'Sexistential is the most ecstatic record that Robyn has ever made, the sound of one of contemporary music''s most influential artists coming home. After the club music meditations of 2018''s Honey, the album features nine playful pop songs that tie back to her era-defining Body Talk trilogy, designed to feel "like a spaceship coming through the atmosphere at a really high speed and crash landing", she says. "That''s how I felt, like I''d had all these experiences searching too far out into space, and now I''m crashing back into myself." Co-produced with longtime collaborator Klas ├àhlund, and featuring Max Martin among the writing credits, Sexistential heralds one of the decade''s most celebrated comebacks. Featuring singles "Dopamine", "Talk To Me" and "Sexistential", it''s emphatic and punchy, defiant about emotional and biological pleasure, need and softness. The album''s title started as an in-joke before she realised it said everything she wanted to say. "Exploring my sensual life is the same feeling as when I make a good song," she explains. "It''s such a beautiful kind of sensitive vibration that takes so much work to keep afloat. I feel like the purpose of my life is to stay horny - it doesn''t even have to be about sex, but it''s feeling sensual and attracted to things that I enjoy, and not letting anything take over that." The album news follows a run of public appearances - including performing on CNN''s NYE Live with Anderson Cooper and Andy Cohen and two sold-out Brooklyn Paramount shows - that have created huge anticipation for new music. Whether performing with David Byrne to celebrate SNL''s fiftieth, making show-stopping live appearances with Charli xcx and Gracie Abrams, collaborating with Yung Lean and Charli or soundtracking Acne Studio''s 2025 Paris show, Robyn continues her immeasurable impact on popular culture.','3/27/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4486337-3511244.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185329,'takin off import|herbie hancock|herbie hancock|lp','Takin Off [Import]','Herbie Hancock','Herbie Hancock','LP','DOL7218829.1','889397218829',15.50999999999999979,15.50999999999999979,'35746294','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88939721882','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Deluxe gatefold 180-gram vinyl release of the jazz pioneer''s 1962 debut album. DOL.','2/16/2018',0.8000000000000000444,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/9/8/3/3763891.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185330,'before the world blows the abi and alan experiment|erykah badu the alchemist|erykah badu the alchemist|lp','Before The World Blows: The Abi and Alan Experiment','Erykah Badu & The Alchemist','Erykah Badu & The Alchemist','LP','YUNG515.1','889030051516',31.51999999999999958,31.51999999999999958,'46534552','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903005151',NULL,0,'In the eleven years since her last project, Erykah Badu has gathered not conclusions but a series of existential insights. Before the World Blows: The Abi and Alan Experiment exists within the tension between introspection and growth. Abi is Badu. Alan is The Alchemist. Recorded over 18 months in Dallas and Los Angeles, the album is the inevitable collision of two iconoclasts-hypnotic, funny, blunt, deeply personal, and impossible to categorize neatly. Meditative and fluid, Before the World Blows finds Badu contemplating which parts of ourselves and our stories are worth protecting before the world breaks and fragments. Love, innocence, dreams, memories, womanhood. The album unfolds in four movements, charting the progression of self through the prisms of love, art, and identity, inviting us to sit with difficult feelings. Passion blurs with desire, hope with grief, each song revealing another illuminating facet of the inner Baduverse. Alchemist sent Badu a collection of instrumental beats, which she deconstructed and sculpted into tracks that felt uniquely hers, looping his warm, punchy samples with instruments from soft kalimba notes to immersive chords and drums. The result moves fluidly between soul, blues, funk, rock, jazz, and underground hip-hop, yet belongs entirely to none of them. From 2024 to 2025, Abi and Alan road-tested the entire album live, performing in intimate, phone-free settings with Badu''s digital collective, The Cannabinoids, and Alchemist on the MPC, fine-tuning the tracks along the way. Badu has always seen art as an inevitable, infinite extension of the self. At any point in space and time, that means evolution is inevitable, too. Before the world blows, it''s worth it to keep exploring. To have one more kiss. Before the world blows, it''s worth it to get to know thyself.','12/11/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/66/4536966-3712190.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185331,'sexistential|robyn|robyn|lp','Sexistential','Robyn','Robyn','LP','YUNG467.1','889030046710',21.23000000000000042,21.23000000000000042,'45908682','2026-11-10 23:58:55','2026-11-10 23:58:55','/88903004671',NULL,0,'Sexistential is the most ecstatic record that Robyn has ever made, the sound of one of contemporary music''s most influential artists coming home. After the club music meditations of 2018''s Honey, the album features nine playful pop songs that tie back to her era-defining Body Talk trilogy, designed to feel "like a spaceship coming through the atmosphere at a really high speed and crash landing", she says. "That''s how I felt, like I''d had all these experiences searching too far out into space, and now I''m crashing back into myself." Co-produced with longtime collaborator Klas ├àhlund, and featuring Max Martin among the writing credits, Sexistential heralds one of the decade''s most celebrated comebacks. Featuring singles "Dopamine", "Talk To Me" and "Sexistential", it''s emphatic and punchy, defiant about emotional and biological pleasure, need and softness. The album''s title started as an in-joke before she realised it said everything she wanted to say. "Exploring my sensual life is the same feeling as when I make a good song," she explains. "It''s such a beautiful kind of sensitive vibration that takes so much work to keep afloat. I feel like the purpose of my life is to stay horny - it doesn''t even have to be about sex, but it''s feeling sensual and attracted to things that I enjoy, and not letting anything take over that." The album news follows a run of public appearances - including performing on CNN''s NYE Live with Anderson Cooper and Andy Cohen and two sold-out Brooklyn Paramount shows - that have created huge anticipation for new music. Whether performing with David Byrne to celebrate SNL''s fiftieth, making show-stopping live appearances with Charli xcx and Gracie Abrams, collaborating with Yung Lean and Charli or sound-tracking Acne Studio''s 2025 Paris show, Robyn continues her immeasurable impact on popular culture.','3/27/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/35/4486335-3557309.jpg?ae=4621895153','Electronic');
