INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185343,'live at the capitol theatre 2017 be myself tour|sheryl crow|sheryl crow|lp','Live At The Capitol Theatre: 2017 Be Myself Tour','Sheryl Crow','Sheryl Crow','LP','CLE7260.1','889466726019',22.48999999999999843,22.48999999999999843,'46164902','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88946672601','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Purple, Marble)',0,'Double purple marbled vinyl pressing. Recorded at the historic Capitol Theatre in Port Chester, New York, on a night when even Crow admits her killer band elevated the set to "another level entirely!" Includes phenomenal performances of Crow''s best-loved songs from old favorites "All I Wanna Do," "If It Makes You Happy," and "Strong Enough" to the newer hits "Soak Up The Sun," "The First Cut Is The Deepest," and more! Full color printed sleeves with beautiful photos from that magical night!','5/29/2026',0.989999999999999992,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4508550-3568173.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185344,'pressure drop the golden tracks|toots maytals|toots maytals|lp','Pressure Drop: The Golden Tracks','Toots & Maytals','Toots & Maytals','LP','CLE5745.1','889466574511',11.49000000000000021,11.49000000000000021,'44267315','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88946657451','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Green, Red, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Hits compilation features "Pressure Drop", "54-46 Was My Number" and 3 covers. Then 5 mixes (including Ska, Dub, Instrumental and more)','7/26/2024',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/4324340-3214337.jpg?ae=4621895153','Reggae');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185345,'christmas spirit import|johnny cash|johnny cash|lp','Christmas Spirit [Import]','Johnny Cash','Johnny Cash','LP','DOL7577506.1','889397577506',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'36848331','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88939757750','(Colored Vinyl, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Johnny Cash was a musical phenomenon and an American icon with his legendary musical career starting in the 1950''s at Sun Records. His plethora of hit recordings led to a major move to Columbia Records, and the late legend charted recordings in all the major formats like country, rock , pop, folk, and gospel genres, sharing his legendary vocal, guitar and songwriting persona for millions of fans worldwide. With 1963''s The Christmas Spirit Lp, Johnny Cash teams up with producer Don Law (Ray Price) and created one of the most revered holiday and inspirational hit albums of all time. The album features Johnny''s stellar interpretations of both popular and religious favorites like the definitive hit version of "I Heard The Bells On Christmas Day," the Tex Ritter favorite "Here Was A Man," June Carter Cash''s "Christmas As I Knew It," plus more traditional fare such as "Blue Christmas" and "The Little Drummer Boy." His impressive readings of inspirational favorites like "Silent Night, Holy Night," plus Johnny''s own "The Christmas Spirit" and "Who Kept The Sheep," truly made the The Christmas Spirit Lp a groundbreaking effort for this sorely missed legend. This fine album has been out of print for decades on vinyl, and it is our honor to announce the first time 180-gram audiophile vinyl presentation of The Christmas Spirit by the late great Johnny Cash on Friday Music. This limited edition audiophile masterpiece is now impeccably mastered by Joe Reagoso and is pressed by RTI on 180-gram translucent blue vinyl for the holidays. Also, the LP features the original artwork not seen in years, in a first time gatefold presentation exclusively from the Columbia Records archives. JOHNNY CASH / CHRISTMAS SPIRIT','11/2/2018',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/8/1/5/3835180.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185346,'the essential bob dylan|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','The Essential Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNY530955.1','889853095513',22.75,22.75,'31084048','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985309551',NULL,0,'Limited double vinyl LP pressing containing 23 classics from the iconic folk/rock singer/songwriter. Definitive, career-spanning and comprehensive, The Essential series features the biggest hits and best-loved songs from the most famous names in music history! An incredible value, each package features classic hits and signature songs by superstar artists. This vinyl set by Bob Dylan includes ''Blowin'' In The Wind,'' ''The Times They Are A-Changin'','' ''Maggie''s Farm,'' ''Like A Rolling Stone,'' "Jokerman," "Lay Lady Lay" and more. Bob Dylan has been influential in popular music and culture for more than five decades. Much of his most celebrated work dates from the 1960s when his songs chronicled social unrest, although Dylan repudiated suggestions from journalists that he was a spokesman for his generation. Nevertheless, early songs such as "Blowin'' in the Wind" and "The Times They Are a-Changin''" became anthems for the American civil rights and anti-war movements.','6/10/2016',0.8900000000000000133,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/6/2/9/3369261.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185347,'folk singer import|muddy waters|muddy waters|lp','Folk Singer [Import]','Muddy Waters','Muddy Waters','LP','DOL7219789.1','889397219789',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'36106103','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88939721978','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Gatefold 180-gram vinyl. Folk Singer is the fourth studio album by Muddy Waters, released in April 1964 by Chess Records. The album features Waters on acoustic guitar, backed by Willie Dixon on string bass, Clifton James on drums, and Buddy Guy on acoustic guitar. It is Waters''s only all-acoustic album.','4/20/2018',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/4/8/5/3785849.jpg?ae=4621895153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185348,'very best of darryl hall john oates import|hall oates|hall oates|lp','Very Best Of Darryl Hall & John Oates [Import]','Hall & Oates','Hall & Oates','LP','SNUK0533097.1','889853309719',28.12000000000000099,28.12000000000000099,'32778021','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985330971',NULL,0,'2001 collection from the pop/soul duo. The Very Best of Daryl Hall & John Oates features 18 of their biggest hits spread over two LP''s. Includes "Sara Smile," "One On One," "Kiss On My List," "Maneater," "Out Of Touch," "Private Eyes," "I Can''t Go For That (No Can Do)" and many more. Hall & Oates achieved their greatest fame from the late 1970s to the mid-1980s with a fusion of rock and roll and rhythm and blues, which they dubbed "rock and soul". The duo has sold an estimated 40 million records throughout their career, making them the third best-selling music duo of all time.','8/12/2016',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/3192806-2721923.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185349,'101 import|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','101 [Import]','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','IMT5058182.1','889853377114',31.03000000000000113,31.03000000000000113,'31501682','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985337711','(Holland - Import)',0,'Documenting the band''s Music for the Masses tour, "101" came out as a concert film directed by D.A. Pennebaker and live album released by Mute Records. While the film captured the band on and off stage across the tour, the album presented Depeche Mode''s June 18, 1988 concert at the Pasadena Rose Bowl in California. Reissued here on import double vinyl, "101" captures the band at their peak of popularity, brilliantly arranging their studio synth-pop creations for the stage: "Just Can''t Get Enough, " "Everything Counts, " "People Are People, " "Master and Servant, " "Blasphemous Rumours, " "Shake the Disease, " "Stripped, " "A Question of Time, " "Never Let Me Down Again, " "Behind the Wheel, " "Everything Counts" and more! Sony UK.','10/21/2016',1.429999999999999938,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/4/9/4/3454947.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185350,'boston|boston|boston|lp','Boston','Boston','Boston','LP','SNYL535547.1','889853554713',22.75,22.75,'31695312','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985355471','(Picture Disc Vinyl)',0,'Limited 40th Anniversary 150 gram picture disc vinyl LP pressing of Boston''s seminal eponymous 1976 debut album. Produced by Tom Scholz and John Boylan, the album was released on August 25, 1976, in the United States by Epic Records. Epic wanted the band to record in Los Angeles with a record producer, but Scholz was unwilling and wanted to record the album in his basement studio, so he hired Boylan to run interference with the label. In an elaborate ruse, Scholz tricked the label into thinking the band was recording on the West Coast, when in reality, the bulk was being tracked solely by Scholz at his Massachusetts home. The album sold extremely well, breaking sales records and becoming one of the best-selling debut albums of all time. Boston''s style was appropriated by label executives and imitated by bands to create radio-friendly "corporate rock", the creation of which the band was also accused. The album''s singles, most notably "More Than a Feeling" and "Long Time", were both AM and FM hits, and nearly the entire album receives constant rotation on classic rock radio.','12/2/2016',0.6999999999999999556,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/1/6/8/3488610.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185351,'violator import|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Violator [Import]','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','SONI5058113.1','889853367511',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'31501040','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985336751','(Holland - Import)',0,'Gatefold sleeve, 180-Gram pressing. Violator is the seventh studio album by English electronic music band Depeche Mode. It was first released on 19 March 1990 by Mute Records internationally and by Sire and Reprise Records in the United States. Mute/Sony Music. 2017.','10/21/2016',0.8800000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/7/8/4/3454879.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185352,'lemonade|beyonc|beyonc|cd','Lemonade [Explicit Content]','Beyonc├⌐','Beyonc├⌐','CD','CLBI533682.2','889853368228',14.82000000000000028,14.82000000000000028,'31000376','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985336822','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, With DVD, Brilliant Box)',0,'CD/DVD.','5/6/2016',0.2600000000000000088,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/1/1/4/3354114.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185353,'walls|kings of leon|kings of leon|lp','Walls','Kings of Leon','Kings of Leon','LP','RCA536264.1','889853626410',21.89000000000000056,21.89000000000000056,'31474061','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985362641','(180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited 180 gram vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including digital download. 2016 release, the seventh album from multi-platinum selling rock band Kings of Leon. The Grammy Award winning group decided to return to their recording roots in Los Angeles and worked with famed producer Markus Dravs (Arcade Fire, Coldplay, Florence + the Machine). The album comes three years after their Grammy Nominated album Mechanical Bull. Lyrically, the album touches on band members'' personal stories, which Q Magazine calls "goosebump inducing" and "worth holding your breath for." Kings of Leon formed in Nashville, Tennessee, in 2000. The band is composed of brothers Caleb, Nathan and Jared Followill with their cousin Matthew Followill.','10/14/2016',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/2/5/0/3450526.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185354,'this one s for you|luke combs|luke combs|lp','This One''s For You','Luke Combs','Luke Combs','LP','SNY538883.1','889853888313',19.23000000000000042,19.23000000000000042,'32671964','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985388831',NULL,0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing. 2017 release from the 27 year-old Asheville, North Carolina country music sensation. With gritty, grizzled vocals, brazen songwriting talent and one hell of a live show, Luke Combs stormed onto country music landscape as a force to be reckoned with. Combs'' debut smash radio single Hurricane quickly became a staple anthem for country fans. After attending Appalachian State, Combs, a true road warrior, built his avid fan base, delivering over 200 rowdy, hold-nothing-back shows per year.','6/2/2017',0.05999999999999999778,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/1/5/0/3610518.jpg?ae=4621895153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185355,'ten|pearl jam|pearl jam|lp','Ten','Pearl Jam','Pearl Jam','LP','EPIC537687.1','889853768714',17.14000000000000056,17.14000000000000056,'33715377','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985376871','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing. Ten is the debut studio album by Pearl Jam, released on August 27, 1991 through Epic Records. Following the disbanding of bassist Jeff Ament and guitarist Stone Gossard''s previous group Mother Love Bone, the two recruited vocalist Eddie Vedder, guitarist Mike McCready, and drummer Dave Krusen to form Pearl Jam in 1990. Most of the songs began as instrumental jams, to which Vedder added lyrics about topics such as depression, homelessness, and abuse. Ten was not an immediate success, but by late 1992 it had reached #2 on the Billboard 200 chart. The album produced three hit singles: "Alive", "Even Flow", and "Jeremy".','11/10/2017',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/3259449-3726242.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185356,'rock n soul part 1|hall oates|hall oates|lp','Rock N Soul Part 1','Hall & Oates','Hall & Oates','LP','RCA540080.1','889854008017',17.30000000000000071,17.30000000000000071,'32047417','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985400801','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 150gm vinyl LP pressing including digital download. Rock ''n Soul Part 1 (also titled Greatest Hits - Rock ''n Soul Part 1) was released on RCA in October 1983. The album featured mostly hit singles recorded by the duo and released by RCA, along with one single from the duo''s period with Atlantic Records and two previously unreleased songs recorded earlier in the year: "Say It Isn''t So" and "Adult Education". The album was originally released on LP and cassette, with sides labeled "Side One" and "Side A", and was the duo''s first album to be released on the then-new compact disc format. Collector''s note: this compilation mostly features single versions of the songs.','4/14/2017',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/4/4/0/3550442.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185357,'this is christmas|luther vandross|luther vandross|lp','This Is Christmas','Luther Vandross','Luther Vandross','LP','SNYL534622.1','889853462216',16.08999999999999986,16.08999999999999986,'31495417','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985346221',NULL,0,'Limited vinyl LP repressing of this soulful holiday release. This Is Christmas is the tenth studio album and first Christmas album by Luther Vandross released in 1995. This is Christmas lent it''s name to a syndicated television special Vandross hosted which aired in November and December 1995, and featured songs from this album. Throughout his career, Vandross was an in-demand background vocalist for several different artists including Judy Collins, Chaka Khan, Bette Midler, Diana Ross, David Bowie, Janet Jackson, Barbra Streisand, Ben E. King, and Donna Summer. He later became the lead vocalist of the group Change. After Vandross left the group, he was signed to Epic Records as a solo artist and released his debut solo album in 1981. During his career, Vandross sold over 35 million records worldwide, and received eight Grammy Awards including Best Male R&B Vocal Performance four different times.','11/4/2016',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/4/9/5/3455946.jpg?ae=4621895153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185358,'screaming for vengeance|judas priest|judas priest|lp','Screaming For Vengeance','Judas Priest','Judas Priest','LP','SNYL539086.1','889853908615',21.14000000000000056,21.14000000000000056,'35414872','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985390861','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP repressing. Screaming for Vengeance is the eighth studio album by British heavy metal band Judas Priest, originally released on 17 July 1982. The album, considered the band''s commercial breakthrough, sold in excess of five million units worldwide and has been certified double platinum in the United States of America as well as platinum in Canada. The album includes the hit single "You''ve Got Another Thing Comin''", which became one of the band''s signature songs and a perennial radio favorite. Screaming for Vengeance was recorded at Ibiza Sound Studios, Ibiza, Spain (during this period, it was commonplace for UK-based musicians to record in continental Europe for tax purposes) and mixed at Beejay Recording Studios and Bayshore Recording Studios in Coconut Grove, Florida. Stylistically, Screaming for Vengeance showcased a harder, heavier sound than British Steel and saw the band quickly reverse direction back into straight heavy rock after the melodically styled direction of Point of Entry.','12/1/2017',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/9/0/1/3741095.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock,Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185359,'british steel|judas priest|judas priest|lp','British Steel','Judas Priest','Judas Priest','LP','SNYL539095.1','889853909513',21.14000000000000056,21.14000000000000056,'35415008','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985390951','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP repressing including digital download. British Steel is the sixth studio album by British heavy metal heroes Judas Priest, released on 14 April 1980. It is also the band''s first album with Dave Holland on drums. British Steel saw the band reprise the commercial sound they had established on Killing Machine. This time, they abandoned some of the dark lyrical themes which had been prominent on their previous releases, but some of it still remains. British Steel was recorded at Tittenhurst Park, home of former Beatle Ringo Starr, a recording studio located on Tittenhurst''s grounds, after a false start at Startling Studios in December 1979. Digital sampling was not yet widely available at the time of recording, so the band used analog recording of smashing milk bottles to be included in "Breaking the Law", as well as various sounds in "Metal Gods" produced by billiard cues and trays of cutlery.','12/1/2017',0.6099999999999999867,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/5/4/2/3742453.jpg?ae=4621895153','Heavy Metal,Music Video (Concert/Performance)');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185360,'grace ltd gold vinyl import|jeff buckley|jeff buckley|lp','Grace - Ltd Gold Vinyl [Import]','Jeff Buckley','Jeff Buckley','LP','SONI5415691.1','889854156916',21.32999999999999829,21.32999999999999829,'42051343','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985415691','(Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Gold, Italy - Import)',0,'The 25th anniversary of ''Grace'' is commemorated with this limited release of the album on gold vinyl.','3/28/2017',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4012499-2749865.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185361,'the search for everything|john mayer|john mayer|lp','The Search For Everything','John Mayer','John Mayer','LP','CLBI542239.1','889854223915',22.75,22.75,'32672138','2026-11-10 23:58:56','2026-11-10 23:58:56','/88985422391','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double 180 gram vinyl LP pressing including digital download. On his 10th album, The Search For Everything, John Mayer meditates on getting older. "Time''s been talking to me/Whispering in my ear," he sings on Changing, a wistful song about embracing life''s complexities. While some of the album''s songs read like diary entries from a man in reflection, others display a forward momentum. Shrugging off some of that inner torment in the name of fun, The Search For Everything is loose, lively, and delightfully diverse, finding him dabbling in funk, folk, blues, and soul, with support from the John Mayer Trio. It''s taken John Mayer two decades to sound this peaceful, and now, he wants us to go with the flow, too.','5/26/2017',1.209999999999999965,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/7/5/2/3592575.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185362,'birds in the trap sing mcknight|travis scott|travis scott|lp','Birds In The Trap Sing Mcknight [Explicit Content]','Travis Scott','Travis Scott','LP','EPIC537771.1','889853777112',22.75,22.75,'31735230','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985377711','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,NULL,'11/25/2016',0.9200000000000000399,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/5/6/2/3492652.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185363,'a seat at the table|solange|solange|lp','A Seat At The Table','Solange','Solange','LP','CLBI538747.1','889853874712',18.48000000000000042,18.48000000000000042,'31579148','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985387471',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. A Seat At The Table the 2016 album written and performed by Solange Knowles. The album features collaborations with Q-Tip, Kelly Rowland, The Dream, BJ The Chicago Kid, Kelela, Tweet, Moses Sumney, Sampha, Sean Nicholas Savage, Nia Andrews, Devonte Hynes of Houston Texas and Lu of Carolina. A Seat at the Table is the third studio album by Solange. Following the release of her second studio album Sol-Angel and the Hadley St. Dreams (2008), Knowles began work on her third studio album, during which she suffered a "breakdown" due to the amount of time and emotion she was putting into the recording process. Writing for the album began as early as 2008, while the albums recording sessions took part from 2013 to June 2016.','12/9/2016',0.930000000000000048,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/7/2/0/3470274.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185364,'all over the world the very best of electric light orchestra|elo electric light orchestra|elo electric light orchestra|lp','All Over The World: The Very Best Of Electric Light Orchestra','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','LP','SNYL531794.1','889853179411',23.4200000000000017,23.4200000000000017,'31447836','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985317941','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double 150gm vinyl LP pressing of this collection by one of the biggest and most successful bands of the ''70s. Comes housed in a gatefold jacket. Originally released exclusively in the band''s home market (the UK), the album sold very well, becoming the ELO''s first Top Ten entry since 1994. All Over the World sold over 300,000 copies in the UK alone within a year and a half of it''s release. Following the band''s appearance at the Glastonbury Festival in the legends slot in 2016, the album re-entered the chart, reaching #1 in the week ending 4 August 2016, and passed it''s million sales mark 11 years after it''s release.','9/30/2016',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/3/0/4/3444031.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185365,'aha shake heartbreak 180 gram import|kings of leon|kings of leon|lp','Aha Shake Heartbreak(180-gram) [Import]','Kings of Leon','Kings of Leon','LP','IMT5421771.1','889854217716',33.93999999999999773,33.93999999999999773,'33143606','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985421771','(MP3 Download, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'180-gram, EU Import, 2017 pressing. Aha Shake Heartbreak is the second studio album by American rock band Kings of Leon. It was released in November 2004 in the UK and February 2005 in the United States. It is the only album by Kings of Leon to have a Parental Advisory label because of the strong language in "Rememo," "Soft," and "Four Kicks." The cover is reminiscent of Queen''s A Night at the Opera. "The Bucket," "Four Kicks" and "King of the Rodeo" were released as singles in the UK. The original UK/Ireland version of the album featured a black cover and an orchid, whereas the later US version featured a white background with a different kind of orchid. The album also contains the bonus track "Where Nobody Knows".','7/14/2017',1.229999999999999983,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/40/3219840-2762612.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185366,'hard rain|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Hard Rain','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL543818.1','889854381813',17.14000000000000056,17.14000000000000056,'33782850','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985438181','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited 150gm vinyl LP pressing including digital download. Hard Rain is a live album by singer/songwriter Bob Dylan, released on September 13, 1976 by Columbia Records. The album was recorded during the second leg of the Rolling Thunder Revue. The album was partly recorded on May 23, 1976, during a concert at Hughes Stadium in Fort Collins, Colorado; the penultimate show of the tour, the concert was also filmed and later broadcast by NBC as a one-hour television special in September. (Hard Rain''s release coincided with this broadcast). Four tracks from the album ("I Threw It All Away, " "Stuck inside of Mobile with the Memphis Blues Again, " "Oh, Sister, " and "Lay, Lady, Lay") were recorded on May 16, 1976 in Fort Worth, Texas.','11/10/2017',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/57/3263557-2477092.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185367,'harry styles|harry styles|harry styles|lp','Harry Styles','Harry Styles','Harry Styles','LP','CLBI543903.1','889854390310',21.26999999999999958,21.26999999999999958,'32701746','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985439031','(180 Gram Vinyl, Booklet, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited 180gm vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket with booklet. Harry Styles, the highly anticipated 2017 self-titled debut album from the global superstar. The ten track album features the lead single "Sign of the Times," which topped the charts in over 80 countries upon it''s release day. "Sign of the Times" was produced by Jeff Bhasker and co-written by Styles, with additional production by Alex Salibian and Tyler Johnson. Harry is known as a member of the pop boy band One Direction. He made his debut as a singer with his band White Eskimo, who performed locally in Holmes Chapel, Cheshire. In 2010, Styles auditioned as a solo artist for the British television series The X Factor. After being eliminated as a solo performer, Styles was brought back into the competition, along with four other contestants, Niall Horan, Zayn Malik, Liam Payne and Louis Tomlinson, to form One Direction.','5/12/2017',0.949999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/07/3187907-3550023.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185368,'leonard cohen greatest hits|leonard cohen|leonard cohen|lp','Leonard Cohen Greatest Hits','Leonard Cohen','Leonard Cohen','LP','SNYL543536.1','889854353612',19.60000000000000143,19.60000000000000143,'35573852','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985435361','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Leonard Cohen - Greatest Hits album by Leonard Cohen, originally released in 1975. In some countries from Europe, it was released under the title Greatest Hits. This alternative title was used for the original vinyl release and for CD reissues from the 1980s onwards. The front cover photograph was taken in 1968 in a Milan hotel room, according to Cohen''s liner notes. Alternative rock band Ween based the album cover for their 1991 album, The Pod, after this photograph.','1/26/2018',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/4/3/3/3743346.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185369,'bob dylan in concert brandeis university 1963 import|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Bob Dylan In Concert: Brandeis University 1963 [Import]','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','IMT5438261.1','889854382612',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'33474731','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985438261','(Holland - Import)',0,NULL,'9/1/2017',0.6199999999999999956,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/6/0/1/7/3707106.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185370,'unpeeled|cage the elephant|cage the elephant|lp','Unpeeled','Cage the Elephant','Cage the Elephant','LP','RCA542819.1','889854281915',22.96999999999999887,22.96999999999999887,'33263793','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985428191','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double 140gm vinyl LP pressing. 2017 live release from the Grammy-winning alt-rock band. Unpeeled was recorded over a series of intimate shows in cities including Los Angeles, Washington DC, Knoxville, and Nashville where the band performed in a stripped down arrangement with a string quartet and additional percussion. Unpeeled features twenty-one tracks: eighteen curated songs from their past four albums plus three re-imagined versions of existing songs. Cage the Elephant received their first Grammy Award for Best Rock Album for their fourth studio album, Tell Me I''m Pretty, which was produced by Dan Auerbach of The Black Keys. At radio, Cage the Elephant holds the record for the most #1 Alternative songs of any artist this decade. Long celebrated as one of the most explosive live bands in the world, Cage the Elephant have sold out several headlining runs including a summer 2016 arena tour and recent sold out UK and European tour.','8/25/2017',1.149999999999999911,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/24/3228724-2573807.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185371,'good apollo i m burning star iv volume one from fera through the eyes of madness|coheed cambria|coheed cambria|lp','Good Apollo I''m Burning Star IV Volume One: From Fera Through The Eyes Of Madness','Coheed & Cambria','Coheed & Cambria','LP','SNY544052.1','889854405212',23.4200000000000017,23.4200000000000017,'32885309','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985440521','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double 150 gram vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. Includes digital download. Good Apollo, I''m Burning Star IV, Volume One: From Fear Through the Eyes of Madness is the third studio album by Coheed and Cambria, originally released on September 20, 2005. It is the third installment of a projected tetralogy, as well as the final studio album to feature drummer Josh Eppard before his original departure. On their previous album, In Keeping Secrets of Silent Earth: 3, the phrase "My dearest Apollo, I''ll be burning Star IV" is written after the lyrics for the song "The Light & the Glass".The album begins to resolve the issues of Claudio Kilgannon''s quest to protect the Keywork, and sheds more light on the demise of Coheed and his wife Cambria. Also, it expands on the issues of the Monstar virus and Jesse''s involvement in the saga. A graphic novel based upon the entire story of the album was released on the same day. This album, unlike the others, tells the story through the eyes of The Writer.','6/30/2017',1.179999999999999938,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/4/7/3/3623747.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185372,'lemonade|beyonc|beyonc|lp','Lemonade','Beyonc├⌐','Beyonc├⌐','LP','CLBI544675.1','889854467517',25.21000000000000085,25.21000000000000085,'32854060','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985446751','(180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Yellow, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited double 180gm yellow vinyl LP pressing. 2016 release, the sixth studio album by R&B superstar Beyonc├⌐. It was released on April 23, 2016, by Parkwood Entertainment and Columbia Records. Primarily an R&B album, Lemonade encompasses a variety of genres, including pop, reggae, blues, rock, hip hop, soul, funk, Americana, country, gospel, electronic, and trap music. The album features guest vocals from James Blake, Kendrick Lamar, The Weeknd, and Jack White. The album contains samples and interpolations of a number of hip-hop and rock songs. Lemonade was widely acclaimed by critics, who praised it as Beyonc├⌐''s boldest work to date. The album includes the singles "Formation", "Sorry", "Hold Up", "Freedom" featuring Kendrick Lamar, and "All Night"; alongside a promotional single, "Daddy Lessons" featuring Dixie Chicks.','9/15/2017',1.669999999999999929,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/3198448-3727521.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185373,'ctrl|sza|sza|lp','CTRL [Explicit Content]','SZA','SZA','LP','RCA544919.1','889854491918',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'33798271','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985449191','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 150 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Green, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited double colored vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. 2017 release. Ctrl is the debut studio album by singer/songwriter SZA. Following the release of debut extended play Z (2014), SZA began writing for other artists and working on her debut, however her debut project was met with various setbacks. SZA followed an analog process and contributed heavily to the album''s lyrics. Recording continued until 2017 by which SZA had created two hundred songs. During the recording process SZA opted for a freestyle method, relying on moments in the studio. The album debuted at #3 on the US Billboard 200. It generated the singles "Drew Barrymore", "Love Galore", and "The Weekend". As of October 2017, the album has been certified gold by the Recording Industry Association of America for accumulating over 500,000 in album-equivalent units and pure sales.','11/17/2017',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/3264623-3726244.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185374,'greatest hits 1969|miles davis|miles davis|lp','Greatest Hits (1969)','Miles Davis','Miles Davis','LP','SNYL544612.1','889854461218',19.60000000000000143,19.60000000000000143,'36099443','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985446121','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Limited vinyl LP repressing including digital download. Miles Davis'' Greatest Hits is a compilation album by Miles Davis released in vinyl in 1969. This collection includes tracks from the albums Seven Steps To Heaven, My Funny Valentine, Someday My Prince Wil Come, In Person Friday Night At The Blackhawk, E.S.P., ''Round About Midnight and Kind Of Blue. Miles Davis was an iconic jazz trumpeter, bandleader, and composer. He is among the most influential and acclaimed figures in the history of jazz and 20th century music. Davis adopted a variety of musical directions in his five-decade career which kept him at the forefront of a number of major stylistic developments in jazz.','5/11/2018',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/3499777.jpg?ae=4621895153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185375,'experience hendrix the best of jimi hendrix|jimi hendrix|jimi hendrix|lp','Experience Hendrix: The Best Of Jimi Hendrix','Jimi Hendrix','Jimi Hendrix','LP','SNYL544787.1','889854478711',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'33384153','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985447871','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double 150gm vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. Experience Hendrix: The Best of Jimi Hendrix is a compilation album of Jimi Hendrix songs released in 1997. The set collects 20 songs spanning his career from his first recordings with the Jimi Hendrix Experience in 1966 to his last with Billy Cox and Mitch Mitchell in 1970. It is the first comprehensive collection of Hendrix''s songs overseen by Experience Hendrix, a family company that took over management of his recording legacy in 1997. Fifteen songs with the Experience are included and five with Hendrix''s later groups, often referred to as Gypsy Suns and Rainbows and the Cry of Love touring band. No songs from the Band of Gypsys lineup with Buddy Miles are included.','9/8/2017',1.169999999999999929,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/3237278-3493676.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185376,'best of depeche mode vol 1 import|depeche mode|depeche mode|lp','Best Of Depeche Mode Vol 1 [Import]','Depeche Mode','Depeche Mode','LP','IMT5451301.1','889854513016',45.5799999999999983,45.5799999999999983,'33553269','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985451301','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Triple vinyl LP pressing. The Best of Depeche Mode Volume 1 is a greatest hits album by synthpop icons Depeche Mode. The album consists of select Depeche Mode singles from their then-25-year career, as well as the previously unreleased track "Martyr"-recorded during the Playing the Angel sessions-which was released as a single in late October 2006. The album has sold over one million copies in Europe alone and has been awarded the IFPI Platinum Europe Award. Includes "Personal Jesus", "People Are People", "Enjoy The Silence", "Just Can''t Get Enough" and many more.','10/6/2017',1.899999999999999912,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/7/8/8/3718870.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185377,'something to tell you|haim|haim|lp','Something To Tell You','HAIM','HAIM','LP','CLBI545226.1','889854522612',23.19000000000000127,23.19000000000000127,'32923353','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985452261',NULL,0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 release, the highly anticipated sophomore album from HAIM. When the time came to record the eleven tracks that make up Something To Tell You, HAIM decided to "go in and record as a band, keeping it a little more organic. That was kind of a mission statement for the album" offered Danielle HAIM. Includes the singles ''Want You Back'' and ''Right Now''. HAIM consists of three sisters: Este HAIM (bass), Danielle HAIM (guitars and lead vocals), and Alana HAIM (guitars and keyboards), as well as drummer Dash Hutton. In addition to their primary instruments, each member is also proficient in several others. The group''s pop sound on their studio work stands in contrast to the more rock-based music of their live shows.','8/18/2017',0.9000000000000000222,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/2/6/2/3632622.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185378,'ctrl|sza|sza|cd','CTRL [Explicit Content]','SZA','SZA','CD','RCA544919.2','889854491925',7.610000000000000319,7.610000000000000319,'32869538','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985449192','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'2017 debut album from the neo-soul singer/songwriter. In October 2012, SZA self-released an EP titled See. SZA. Run, which she then followed up with her second EP, titled S, in October 2013. In July 2013, it was revealed that she had signed to the hip hop record label Top Dawg Entertainment, through which she released Z, her third EP and first retail release, in April 2014. SZA''s music is described as alternative R&B, with elements of soul, hip hop, minimalist R&B, cloud rap, ethereal R&B, witch house and chillwave. Rowe''s lyrics are described as "unravelling", that revolve around themes of sexuality, nostalgia, and abandonment. Rowe cites a variety of artists as influences including Billie Holiday, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Bj├╢rk, Jamiroquai, and Wu-Tang Clan.','6/9/2017',0.2099999999999999923,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/3/9/5/3645930.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185379,'american teen|khalid|khalid|lp','American Teen [Explicit Content]','Khalid','Khalid','LP','RCA541432.1','889854143213',19.03999999999999915,19.03999999999999915,'32162486','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985414321','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including digital download. 2017 release from the El Paso-based singer/songwriter. Khalid burst onto the music scene with his first single "Location", which received great critical acclaim. By 18-years-old, Khalid, who is classically vocal trained, had drawn on his experiences with moving often and the unique experience of growing up having lived in two continents and parlayed them into the creation of his viral smash, "Location". Khalid released "Location" before his high school graduation and it garnered over 1.52 million plays in less than two months, along with critical praise from various music tastemakers. And to think he became a sensation right out of high school!','4/14/2017',1.09000000000000008,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/0/5/0/4/3564050.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185380,'flower boy|tyler the creator|tyler the creator|cd','Flower Boy [Explicit Content]','Tyler, The Creator','Tyler, The Creator','CD','CLBI544113.2','889854411329',11.10999999999999944,11.10999999999999944,'33139302','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985441132','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Digipack Packaging)',0,'Artist Tyler, The Creator Title FLOWER BOY Tyler, The Creator has his fourth full-length album, Flower Boy. It includes recently released tracks ''Who Dat Boy'' featuring A$AP Rocky and ''911/Mr. Lonely'' featuring Frank Ocean.','7/21/2017',0.1499999999999999945,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/3/3/9/3679337.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185381,'the best of earth wind fire vol 1 1978|earth wind fire|earth wind fire|lp','The BEST of EARTH, WIND & FIRE Vol. 1 (1978)','Earth Wind & Fire','Earth Wind & Fire','LP','SNYL543234.1','889854323417',17.30000000000000071,17.30000000000000071,'35476504','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985432341','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'The Best of Earth, Wind & Fire, Vol. 1 is a 1978 compilation album collecting the charting singles of Earth, Wind & Fire. In addition to collecting previously charting songs, the album also included three new tracks for the band: a cover of The Beatles'' song "Got to Get You Into My Life" and the original track "September", both of which also became charting singles, the former also winning a Grammy Award, and "Love Music." Love Music was sampled by Ghostface Killah on his track Good featured on his 2006 album More Fish. "September" has been sampled by Crystal Waters on her track "Say... If You Feel Alright" from her 1996 album Crystal Waters.','1/19/2018',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/02/3429002-2477083.jpg?ae=4621895153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185382,'audioslave|audioslave|audioslave|lp','Audioslave','Audioslave','Audioslave','LP','SNYL545533.1','889854553319',23.19000000000000127,23.19000000000000127,'33221397','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985455331','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',1,'Limited double 150gm vinyl LP pressing including digital download. Audioslave is the eponymous debut studio album by American rock supergroup Audioslave. The band consisted of Soundgarden lead singer/rhythm guitarist Chris Cornell and Rage Against the Machine members Tom Morello (lead guitar), Tim Commerford (bass/backing vocals), and Brad Wilk (drums). The album was originally released on November 19, 2002, by Epic Records and Interscope Records. The album features the hit singles "Cochise", "Show Me How to Live", "What You Are", "Like a Stone", and "I Am the Highway". The album was later certified three-times platinum by the Recording Industry Association of America in the United States. "Like a Stone" was nominated for a 2004 Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance.','8/18/2017',1.110000000000000098,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/1/7/6/3676711.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185383,'desire mov transition import|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Desire (MOV Transition) [Import]','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','IMT5455301.1','889854553012',26.17999999999999972,26.17999999999999972,'35393887','2026-11-10 23:58:57','2026-11-10 23:58:57','/88985455301','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Desire is the seventeenth studio album by American singer-songwriter Bob Dylan, released on January 5, 1976, through Columbia Records. It is one of Dylan''s most collaborative efforts, featuring the same caravan of musicians as the acclaimed Rolling Thunder Revue tours the previous year.','12/8/2017',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/1/1/1/3741111.jpg?ae=4621895153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185384,'out of the blue|elo electric light orchestra|elo electric light orchestra|lp','Out Of The Blue','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','Elo ( Electric Light Orchestra )','LP','EPIC545616.1','889854561611',26.96999999999999887,26.96999999999999887,'33492216','2026-11-13 00:13:04','2026-11-13 00:13:04','/88985456161','(Picture Disc Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited double picture disc vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including digital download. Celebrate the 40th anniversary of Electric Light Orchestra''s Out Of The Blue with this double picture disc vinyl package! Written and produced by Jeff Lynne, Out of the Blue is ELO''s bestselling album, certified platinum in both the US and UK and featuring the worldwide hit singles "Mr. Blue Sky," "Turn To Stone" and "Sweet Talkin Woman." All four sides feature images from Shusei Nagoka s iconic sleeve art, including ELO''s instantly recognizable spaceship logo. Out of the Blue also includes "It''s Over" (which also charted), "Across the Border," "Night in the City," "Starlight," "Steppin" Out" and more.','11/24/2017',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/5/9/0/3710958.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185385,'flower boy|tyler the creator|tyler the creator|lp','Flower Boy [Explicit Content]','Tyler, The Creator','Tyler, The Creator','LP','CLBI546905.1','889854690519',22.75,22.75,'35486374','2026-11-13 00:13:05','2026-11-13 00:13:05','/88985469051','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'The fifth studio album by the American rapper and producer Tyler, The Creator, released on July 21, 2017, by Columbia Records. Produced entirely by Tyler, the album features guest vocals from a range of artists, including Frank Ocean, ASAP Rocky, Anna of the North, Lil Wayne, Kali Uchis, Steve Lacy, Estelle, Jaden Smith and Rex Orange County.','12/1/2017',1.100000000000000089,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/3429978-3482053.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185386,'american dream|lcd soundsystem|lcd soundsystem|lp','American Dream','LCD Soundsystem','LCD Soundsystem','LP','CLBI8545611.1','889854561116',31.01999999999999958,31.01999999999999958,'33433257','2026-11-13 00:13:05','2026-11-13 00:13:05','/88985456111','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double 140gm vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 release, the fourth studio album by the alt-rock band led by James Murphy. American Dream acts as the band''s first album in seven years, following This Is Happening (2010). Prior to the album''s release, LCD Soundsystem performed at large music festivals as well as smaller shows to promote their reunion. Two album tracks, "Call the Police" and "American Dream", were released together as the album''s lead single. LCD Soundsystem announced their breakup in early 2011 and also announced that they would end with a show at Madison Square Garden on April 2, 2011. In October 2015, online publication Consequence of Sound reported that "multiple sources" could confirm that LCD Soundsystem would be reuniting in 2016 and that they would be headlining "high-profile music festivals in the US and UK." Two months afterward, the band released the Christmas-themed track "Christmas Will Break Your Heart" acting as their first single in four years.','9/1/2017',1.129999999999999893,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/6/2/4/3704262.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185387,'greatest hits|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','Greatest Hits','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL854556.1','889854556112',16.80999999999999873,16.80999999999999873,'35643517','2026-11-13 00:13:06','2026-11-13 00:13:06','/88985455611','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing including digital download. Bob Dylan''s Greatest Hits is the first compilation album by Bob Dylan, released in March 1967 on Columbia Records. It contains every Top 40 single Dylan enjoyed through 1967. It peaked at #10 on the pop album chart in the United States, and went to #3 on the album chart in the United Kingdom. Greatest Hits serves as Dylan''s de facto singles collection for the 1960s. With the exception of "The Times They Are a-Changin''," "It Ain''t Me Babe," and "Mr. Tambourine Man," all tracks on this album were released as 45 RPM singles in the United States during that decade. It is worth noting that in 1963 "Blowin'' in the Wind" became a #2 hit single for Peter, Paul and Mary, and that in 1965 "Times" made it to #9 as a single release in the United Kingdom. That same year of 1965 a truncated rock and roll version of "Mr. Tambourine Man" had been a number one hit for The Byrds in the summer, and the Turtles took a folk-rock version of "It Ain''t Me Babe" to #8. The remaining six tracks all made the Billboard Top 40 in 1965 and 1966.','2/16/2018',0.8299999999999999601,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/1/1/1/3741112.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185388,'sigh no more|mumford sons|mumford sons|lp','Sigh No More','MUMFORD & SONS','MUMFORD & SONS','LP','GLSN167809.1','892038002244',23.0,23.0,'15088161','2026-11-13 00:13:06','2026-11-13 00:13:06','/89203800224','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2010 release from the West London Indie Rock quartet. Mumford & Sons, have created a gutsy, old-time sound that marries the magic of Crosby, Stills & Nash with the might of Kings of Leon and the harmonies of Fleet Foxes. Sigh No More was recorded at East coast Studios and produced by Markus Dravs who has worked with such superstar acts as Arcade Fire, Bjork and Peter Gabriel. Formed in 2007, the band''s goal since day one has been to make music that matters.','5/18/2010',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/1551530-3175907.jpg?ae=4662083153','Alt-Country & Americana');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185389,'the freewheelin bob dylan|bob dylan|bob dylan|lp','The Freewheelin'' Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','Bob Dylan','LP','SNYL545528.1','889854552817',16.80999999999999873,16.80999999999999873,'35979241','2026-11-13 00:13:06','2026-11-13 00:13:06','/88985455281','(140 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing including digital download. The Freewheelin'' Bob Dylan is the second studio album by legendary singer/songwriter Bob Dylan. Whereas his self-titled debut album Bob Dylan had contained only two original songs, Freewheelin'' represented the beginning of Dylan''s writing contemporary words to traditional melodies. Eleven of the thirteen songs on the album are Dylan''s original compositions. The album opens with "Blowin'' in the Wind", which became an anthem of the 1960s, and an international hit for folk trio Peter, Paul & Mary soon after the release of Freewheelin''. The album featured several other songs which came to be regarded as among Dylan''s best compositions and classics of the 1960s folk scene: "Girl from the North Country", "Masters of War", "A Hard Rain''s a-Gonna Fall" and "Don''t Think Twice, It''s All Right".','4/6/2018',0.5999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/74/3482974-2477110.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185390,'rainbow|kesha ke ha|kesha ke ha|lp','Rainbow [Explicit Content]','Kesha ( Ke$Ha )','Kesha ( Ke$Ha )','LP','RCA545936.1','889854593612',23.4200000000000017,23.4200000000000017,'33606521','2026-11-13 00:13:07','2026-11-13 00:13:07','/88985459361','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 album from the pop star, her first album in nearly five years. Rainbow marks a new beginning for Kesha, one based around inner strength and musical exploration as she achieves her vision for the album by enlisting a roster of collaborators ranging from Eagles of Death Metal to Dolly Parton. Ben Folds produced the title track with Kesha, while Ricky Reed produced and wrote numerous tracks as well. Wrabel co-wrote a collaboration that features the Dap-Kings horn section. Eagles of Death Metal are featured on two tracks, while Parton guests on a version of her 1980 country chart-topper "Old Flames Can''t Hold a Candle to You." The track was co-written by Kesha''s mother Pebe Sebert, who also has other songwriting credits on Rainbow.','10/27/2017',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/3251623-3551788.jpg?ae=4662083153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185391,'camp|childish gambino|childish gambino|lp','Camp [Explicit Content]','Childish Gambino','Childish Gambino','LP','GLSN167821.1','892038002404',26.0,26.0,'16028524','2026-11-13 00:13:07','2026-11-13 00:13:07','/89203800240','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2011 album from TV writer, actor, standup comedian and rapper Donald Glover AKA Childish Gambino. A unique blend of Hip Hop with multiple genres, combined with lyrical genius, Gambino has gone from a viral cult following to a mega sensation. Tri-fold.','12/6/2011',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/18/4398818-3464239.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185392,'h e r|h e r|h e r|lp','H.E.R.','H.E.R.','H.E.R.','LP','RCA546758.1','889854675813',24.23999999999999844,24.23999999999999844,'35431053','2026-11-13 00:13:07','2026-11-13 00:13:07','/88985467581','(Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including digital download. 2016 release from singer/songwriter Gabi Wilson, better known by her stage name H.E.R. (acronym for "Having Everything Revealed"). Gabi''s debut EP, H.E.R. Vol. 1, made iTunes'' Best of 2016 R&B/Soul Albums list, with the track "Losing" making the iTunes Best R&B/Soul Singles list, it''s video viewed over seven million times on YouTube. The release also included a cover of Drake''s "Jungle". Addressing the secrecy over her identity, H.E.R. has said: "The mystery is a metaphor for who I am, or who I was at the time of creating the project... I feel like oftentimes we don''t like to be open as people about our emotions or things that we are going through. At the time [of recording], I was very closed off except for when I was writing or when I was in the studio."','12/8/2017',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/7/5/3/3743577.jpg?ae=4662083153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185393,'little dark age|mgmt|mgmt|lp','Little Dark Age [Explicit Content]','MGMT','MGMT','LP','SNY547606.1','889854760618',31.16000000000000014,31.16000000000000014,'35696179','2026-11-13 00:13:07','2026-11-13 00:13:07','/88985476061','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, 180 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Double 180gm vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including digital download. 2018 release. Little Dark Age was produced by MGMT, Patrick Wimberly (Chairlift, Kelela, Blood Orange), and long-time collaborator Dave Fridmann (Flaming Lips, Spoon, Tame Impala). MGMT recorded Little Dark Age at Tarbox Road Studios in Cassadaga, NY. The album includes the previously released title song "Little Dark Age," and the tracks "When You Die" and "Hand It Over." Formed in 2002 by Andrew VanWyngarden (lead vocals, guitar, keyboard, bass guitar, drums, percussion) and Ben Goldwasser (vocals, keyboards, guitar, percussion), MGMT released their influential, Grammy-nominated, debut album Oracular Spectacular in 2007. This was followed by 2010''s Congratulations and 2013''s self-titled album MGMT.','2/9/2018',1.300000000000000044,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/1/5/0/2/3762051.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185394,'the squirrely years revisited|ministry||lp','The Squirrely Years Revisited','Ministry',NULL,'LP','CEOT6338.1','88946663381',23.76000000000000156,NULL,NULL,'2026-11-13 00:13:07','2026-11-13 00:13:07','/ministry-the-squirrely-years-revisited/88946663381',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185395,'now that s what i call halloween various artists|various artists|various artists|lp','Now That''s What I Call Halloween (Various Artists)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','SNYL546373.1','889854637316',19.42000000000000171,19.42000000000000171,'33493046','2026-11-13 00:13:15','2026-11-13 00:13:15','/88985463731','(150 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Purple)',0,'Limited double orange colored vinyl LP pressing. This Halloween-themed collection includes tracks from Mike Oldfield, Warren Zevon, John Carpenter, Rockwell, The Specials, Rob Zombie, Bobby Boris Pickett & The Crypt Kickers and others. Now That''s What I Call Music is the most successful compilation album series in the history of recorded music. With over 96 million units of the series scanned to date in the US, the #1 Billboard charting album NOW 53 sold 100,000 units during the first week of release. Many of NOW''s brand extension collections of recent Pop Chart-topping hits such as NOW Party Anthems and NOW #1''s continue to scan over 100K units per title.','9/29/2017',0.8800000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/9/5/9/0/3710959.jpg?ae=4662083153','Pop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185396,'neon bible|arcade fire|arcade fire|lp','Neon Bible','Arcade Fire','Arcade Fire','LP','SNYL546246.1','889854624613',23.19000000000000127,23.19000000000000127,'35419600','2026-11-13 00:13:16','2026-11-13 00:13:16','/88985462461','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited double vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. Neon Bible is the second studio album by Canadian indie rock band Arcade Fire, released in March, 2007. The majority of the album was recorded at a church the band bought and renovated in Farnham, Quebec. The album is the first to feature drummer Jeremy Gara, and the first to include violinist Sarah Neufeld among the band''s core line-up. Neon Bible became Arcade Fire''s highest-charting album at the time, debuting on the Billboard 200 at #2. Neon Bible was cited as an example of the popularization of indie rock. Having produced most of the album themselves, the band decided to bring in someone else for the mixing. Tracks were sent to several well-known mixers/producers to experiment with and after deciding they liked Nick Launay''s ideas best, the band invited him to their studio to work on the songs further.','12/22/2017',0.959999999999999965,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/7/9/2/3742974.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185397,'babel|mumford sons|mumford sons|lp','Babel','MUMFORD & SONS','MUMFORD & SONS','LP','GLSN167831.1','892038002633',19.85000000000000143,19.85000000000000143,'18631494','2026-11-13 00:13:16','2026-11-13 00:13:16','/89203800263','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2012 release, the sophomore album from the British Indie/Folk band. As with their 2009 debut, Sigh No More, Babel was produced by producer Markus Dravs. "We are more than excited to release Babel into the world. We had started writing new songs well before we got into the studio to record. At first, we peeled ourselves off the road quite reluctantly. We love playing live, obviously, but it had also become an important part of our creative process, we had been writing and rehearsing in soundchecks, and sort of ''road-testing'' new songs on our very gracious audiences. But then we fell in love with recording again. The album started to come together, and with the help of Markus Dravs once more (and engineer Robin Baynton), we started to relish the challenge of making this album. As a band, we''ve never been closer or more collaborative, all working to our strengths. And so we feel that this record is a natural progression that we''re proud of, and we cannot wait to take it out on the road."','9/25/2012',0.7800000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/58/1257458-3175915.jpg?ae=4662083153','Alt-Country & Americana');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185398,'stranger things seasons one and two music from the netflix original series|various artists|various artists|lp','Stranger Things: Seasons One and Two (Music From the Netflix Original Series)','Various Artists','Various Artists','LP','SNYL548090.1','889854809010',22.75,22.75,'35451549','2026-11-13 00:13:16','2026-11-13 00:13:16','/88985480901','(Sticker / Stickers, Gatefold LP Jacket, Poster)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket including bonus poster and stickers. Stranger Things: Music from the Netflix Original Series contains songs from Seasons 1 & 2! This 2LP set contains a mini 8x12 fold-out poster and a crack-and-peel sticker! The album features nineteen songs and eleven audio clips from the show. Stranger Things is an American science fiction-horror web television series created, written, directed and co-executive produced by the Duffer Brothers, as well as co-executive produced by Shawn Levy and Dan Cohen. The first season, released in July 2016, stars Winona Ryder, David Harbour, Finn Wolfhard, Millie Bobby Brown, Gaten Matarazzo, Caleb McLaughlin, Natalia Dyer, Charlie Heaton, Cara Buono and Matthew Modine, with Noah Schnapp and Joe Keery in recurring roles. For the second season, Schnapp and Keery were promoted to series regulars, along with the additions of Sadie Sink, Dacre Montgomery, Sean Astin and Paul Reiser.','12/15/2017',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/54/3426954-3262592.jpg?ae=4662083153','Soundtrack');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185399,'christmas with elvis presley and the royal philharmonic orchestra|elvis presley|elvis presley|lp','Christmas with Elvis Presley and the Royal Philharmonic Orchestra','Elvis Presley','Elvis Presley','LP','RCA546305.1','889854630515',18.12999999999999901,18.12999999999999901,'33594149','2026-11-13 00:13:24','2026-11-13 00:13:24','/88985463051','(150 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Vinyl LP pressing including digital download. 2017 holiday release. Christmas with Elvis and The Royal Philharmonic Orchestra brings together Elvis Presley''s best-loved yuletide performances taken from Elvis'' Christmas Album (1957) and Elvis Sings the Wonderful World of Christmas (1971) re-imagined with sublime and exquisite new arrangements performed by The Royal Philharmonic Orchestra. Includes "Blue Christmas," "Here Comes Santa Claus (Right Down Santa Claus Lane)," "Merry Christmas Baby," "Silent Night" and more. Produced by Nick Patrick and Don Reedman and recorded at Abbey Road Studio 2, Christmas with Elvis and The Royal Philharmonic Orchestra follows in the phenomenal worldwide success of 2015''s If I Can Dream: Elvis Presley with The Royal Philharmonic Orchestra and last year''s The Wonder Of You: Elvis Presley with The Royal Philharmonic Orchestra.','10/6/2017',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/8/7/5/2/3732578.jpg?ae=4662083153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185400,'the suburbs|arcade fire|arcade fire|lp','The Suburbs','Arcade Fire','Arcade Fire','LP','SNYL546263.1','889854626310',29.5,29.5,'35419624','2026-11-13 00:13:24','2026-11-13 00:13:24','/88985462631','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited double vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. The Suburbs is the third studio album by Canadian indie rock band Arcade Fire, released in August 2010. The album debuted at #1 on the Irish Albums Chart, the UK Albums Chart, the US Billboard 200 chart, and the Canadian Albums Chart. It won Album of the Year at the 2011 Grammy Awards, Best International Album at the 2011 BRIT Awards, Album of the Year at the 2011 Juno Awards, and the 2011 Polaris Music Prize for best Canadian album. Two weeks after winning Grammy''s Album of the Year, the album jumped from #52 to #12 on the Billboard 200, the album''s highest ranking since August 2010.','12/22/2017',1.229999999999999983,'lbs','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/7/9/2/3742975.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185401,'funeral|arcade fire|arcade fire|lp','Funeral','Arcade Fire','Arcade Fire','LP','SNYL546242.1','889854624217',20.73000000000000042,20.73000000000000042,'35419594','2026-11-13 00:13:24','2026-11-13 00:13:24','/88985462421','(150 Gram Vinyl, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Limited vinyl LP pressing in gatefold jacket. Funeral is the debut studio album by Canadian indie rock band Arcade Fire, released on September 14, 2004. Preliminary recordings for Funeral were made during the course of a week in August 2003 at the Hotel2Tango in Montreal, Quebec, and the recording was completed later that year all in an analogue recording format. The album produced five singles. The most successful, "Rebellion (Lies)", peaked at #19 on the UK Singles Chart. The album was nominated for a Grammy Award in 2005 for Best Alternative Music Album. It received widespread critical acclaim and topped many year-end and decade-end lists.','12/22/2017',0.7299999999999999823,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/3/7/9/2/3742973.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185402,'prism blue yellow|john butler|john butler|lp','PRISM - Blue & Yellow [Explicit Content]','John Butler','John Butler','LP','INEE24LTD.1','9324690424078',27.28999999999999915,27.28999999999999915,'45351853','2026-11-13 00:13:24','2026-11-13 00:13:24','/932469042407','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Yellow)',0,'BLUE & YELLOW COLORED LIMITED VARIANT John Butler is stepping into a bold new era. The ARIA Award-winning musician has officially announced his tenth studio album, PRISM, which is set to arrive Sept. 5. John Butler is one of Australia''s premiere songwriters and storytellers with accolades spanning from #1 charting albums, in excess of 20 x platinum accreditations and several ARIA Awards across his illustrious career as one of the country''s most successful independent musicians!','9/5/2025',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4442287-3450521.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185403,'encore du pain splatter green vinyl import|buzzcocks|buzzcocks|lp','Encore Du Pain - Splatter Green Vinyl [Import]','Buzzcocks','Buzzcocks','LP','RSUE7400119.1','9010974001195',20.35999999999999944,20.35999999999999944,'44836566','2026-11-13 00:13:32','2026-11-13 00:13:32','/901097400119','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Germany - Import)',0,NULL,'3/21/2025',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/20/4393820-3323890.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185404,'encore du pain 3mm spinned sleeve import|buzzcocks|buzzcocks|lp','Encore Du Pain - 3mm Spinned Sleeve [Import]','Buzzcocks','Buzzcocks','LP','RSUE7400015.1','9010974000150',23.26999999999999958,23.26999999999999958,'44836078','2026-11-13 00:13:32','2026-11-13 00:13:32','/901097400015','(Germany - Import)',0,'Limited colored vinyl LP pressing of this live album from the Punk icons. The album was recorded during their 1995 tour and features classic Buzzcocks tracks including "Love You More", "Orgasm Addict", "Ever Fallen In Love", "What Do I Get?", and more.','3/21/2025',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/71/4393771-3323858.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185405,'freedom sessions where to now|xavier rudd|xavier rudd|lp','Freedom Sessions/ Where to Now','Xavier Rudd','Xavier Rudd','LP','SATX11.1','9332727137020',14.81000000000000049,14.81000000000000049,'45859632','2026-11-13 00:13:32','2026-11-13 00:13:32','/933272713702','(Clear Vinyl)',0,'Bringing together two distinct yet connected chapters of Xavier Rudd''s journey, this special double-EP vinyl captures an artist in constant evolution. Side A - Freedom Sessions (2024) Originally released in 2024, Freedom Sessions marked Xavier''s first EP in 25 years-a celebration of the simple but powerful right to "freedom." Across six tracks including World Order, High Times, Road Trippin'', Free The People, and the luminous closer Moments, Xavier invites listeners into an intimate, reflective space born from a unique period of solitude and growth. Side B - Where to Now (2025) Fast-forward to September 2025, and Where to Now expands that introspection into a search for new horizons. Rooted in earth and spirit, the EP pulses with themes of resilience, human connection, and the call to move forward despite uncertainty. Layered rhythms, soulful vocals, and rich instrumentation guide listeners through questions of purpose and belonging, capturing the sound of a songwriter exploring fresh territory while remaining grounded in the natural world that inspires him. Pressed on transparent vinyl and wrapped in striking artwork, this release is more than a collector''s item-it''s a seamless narrative of reflection and forward motion. The visual presentation pairs evocative photography by acclaimed Spanish photographer Xavi Martin with elegant graphic design by Kylie Strachan of Nomad Create (Australia), and includes a beautifully printed full lyric sheet so fans can immerse themselves in every word of the music. Both EPs combined on vinyl for the very first time! 1LP Transparent color vinyl in Gatefold Jacket with printed lyric insert','3/6/2026',0.660000000000000031,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4483912-3504479.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185406,'the suburbs|arcade fire|arcade fire|cd','The Suburbs','Arcade Fire','Arcade Fire','CD','SNYL546248.2','889854624828',7.799999999999999823,7.799999999999999823,'35518785','2026-11-13 00:13:32','2026-11-13 00:13:32','/88985462482',NULL,0,'Reissue. The Suburbs is the third studio album by Canadian indie rock band Arcade Fire, originally released in August 2010. The album''s lyrical content is inspired by band members Win and William Butler''s upbringing in The Woodlands, Texas, a suburb of Houston. According to Win Butler, the album "is neither a love letter to, nor an indictment of, the suburbs - it''s a letter from the suburbs". The album was recorded in Win Butler and R├⌐gine Chassagne''s residence in Montreal, with some parts being recorded at the band''s studio in Quebec and in New York City. Win Butler describes the overall sound of The Suburbs as "a mix of Depeche Mode and Neil Young", stating that he wanted the album to sound like "the bands that I heard when I was very young, and wondered what those crazy noises were".','1/5/2018',0.08000000000000000166,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/c/500/7/0/6/8/3748607.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185407,'truth or consequence|amyl the sniffers|amyl the sniffers|cd','Truth or Consequence','Amyl & the Sniffers','Amyl & the Sniffers','CD','AYTS2007.2','9332727137457',8.5,8.5,'46420077','2026-11-13 00:13:32','2026-11-13 00:13:32','/933272713745','(Digipack Packaging)',0,'Truth or Consequence is a live album following the concert film of the same title, in which Amyl and The Sniffers perform country-influenced versions of their songs, two unreleased tracks, and a cover of the Slim Dusty classic ''Lights On The Hill''. It was recorded and filmed in front of an intimate and increasingly rowdy audience at El Coyote in Los Angeles, on 28 April 2025, by the band''s long-time collaborator, John Angus Stewart. The hope for this record is that it is listened to as it was made, in a ruckus exclamation between a cherished group of friends. Enjoy!','9/4/2026',0.02000000000000000041,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4526913-3651375.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185408,'bully|ye|ye|lp','Bully','Ye','Ye','LP','GMMA10.1','9120005656048',18.23999999999999843,18.23999999999999843,'45995309','2026-11-13 00:13:42','2026-11-13 00:13:42','/912000565604',NULL,0,'Ye - Bully - Vinyl A new album from Ye, the artist formerly known as Kanye West, is set to arrive on March 27. The rapper has inked a partnership deal with the independent music company gamma. For the release of Bully, his 12th studio album.','3/27/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/4493106-3595334.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185409,'french import|buzzcocks|buzzcocks|lp','French [Import]','Buzzcocks','Buzzcocks','LP','RSUE7400017.1','9010974000174',32.96999999999999887,32.96999999999999887,'44836085','2026-11-13 00:13:42','2026-11-13 00:13:42','/901097400017','(Gatefold LP Jacket, Germany - Import)',0,'Double colored vinyl LP pressing housed in gatefold jacket. Recorded live at L''Arapho Club, Paris, France on April 12, 1995. When the Buzzcocks announced their decision to reunite and tour after an almost 8-year hiatus, fans could be forgiven for exhibiting either a certain skepticism or an overly optimistic attitude. After all, the Buzzcocks were one of the punk revolution''s tightest bands, and their short, frenetic bursts of guitar pop and angelic harmonies require a certain level of professionalism to be put across in a live setting. Thankfully, subsequent tours and American shows showcased the Buzzcocks as a tight, lean pop machine. French, a live document from one of these shows, is an excellent souvenir of the band at it''s best. The album is also an excellent introduction for those nay-sayers who insist that punk doesn''t work on the live stage. Whether running through the perfect anguish of "Ever Fallen in Love..." and "What Do I Get?'' or the goofily risque "Orgasm Addict, " French presents the Buzzcocks as one of the premier live bands of their era. Anyone who doesn''t get a lump in his throat during the anthemic "I Believe" has no business listening to music. Some bands age like moldy cheese; the Buzzcocks have aged like fine wine.','3/21/2025',0.8800000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4393772-3323859.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185410,'live around the globe part v|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|king gizzard and the lizard wizard|lp','Live Around The Globe: Part V','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard','LP','BRPE27911.1','9006472044864',42.6700000000000017,42.6700000000000017,'45198786','2026-11-13 00:13:42','2026-11-13 00:13:42','/900647204486','(Colored Vinyl)',0,'Colored vinyl LP pressing. With "Live Around The Globe - Part V," the collaboration between the Australian indie-psychedelic rockers and Blind Rope Records, ongoing since 2021, enters it''s fifth round with undiminished energy. Formed in 2010 in Melbourne, King Gizzard & The Lizard Wizard are the famous exception to the infamous rule. Close to 30 studio albums speak a clear workaholic language, proving that this wild collective continues to celebrate the joy of creation with unshakable enthusiasm. Their distinctive style feels almost ecstatic in a live setting, with no two shows ever alike. "Live Around The Globe - Part V" is, once again, a carefully mastered compilation of the best of these moments, flowing seamlessly from start to finish.','7/11/2025',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/41/4428041-3395636.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185411,'b b king s blues summit 100|joe bonamassa|joe bonamassa|lp','B.B. King''s Blues Summit 100','Joe Bonamassa','Joe Bonamassa','LP','KTBA10126.1','990481101269',29.98999999999999844,29.98999999999999844,'45536014','2026-11-13 00:13:53','2026-11-13 00:13:53','/99048110126',NULL,0,'Joe Bonamassa - B.B. King''s Blues Summit 100 - Vinyl (3 LP) This groundbreaking project celebrates the centennial birthday of B.B. King, honoring his monumental legacy with a one-of-a-kind Collaboration Album. The album will feature a double album worth of curated tracks of B.B. King''s most iconic songs, recorded/tracked by Blues Rock Icon Joe Bonamassa and his all-star band, with production led by 2-time Grammy-nominated producers Joe Bonamassa and Josh Smith. The reimagined tracks will include a stellar lineup of guest musicians from both contemporary and legacy backgrounds that will unite multiple generations and genres to pay tribute to the King of Blues with 32 tracks and including 40 special guests! Working directly with B.B. King''s estate, this project is deeply personal to Joe, reflecting his lifelong admiration for B.B. and the profound impact B.B. had on his career and life. Joe''s connection with B.B. began in 1989 when, as a 12-year-old prodigy, he had the life-changing opportunity to open for Mr. King. Over the years, their friendship grew as they toured together on dozens of occasions, cementing a bond that Joe cherishes to this day. 180g 3xLP Black Vinyl in Gatefold Jacket with 20-page booklet and download card.','2/6/2026',2.160000000000000143,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/35/4458535-3451723.jpg?ae=4662083153','Blues');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185412,'atlas|rufus du sol|rufus du sol|lp','Atlas','Rufus Du Sol','Rufus Du Sol','LP','SWEA530142.1','9361385301429',36.36999999999999745,36.36999999999999745,'46066084','2026-11-13 00:13:53','2026-11-13 00:13:53','/936138530142',NULL,0,'Black vinyl version of R├£F├£S DU SOL''s debut LP ''ATLAS'' that hit Number 1 in Australia. The album was a testament to the band''s passion, work ethic and DIY approach to music, featuring the much-loved singles ''Take Me'' and ''Desert Night''. ''ATLAS'' was originally released in 2013 and R├£F├£S DU SOL have since emerged as one of the world''s preeminent live electronic acts, with performances throughout the world. The Australian three-piece is comprised of members Tyrone Lindqvist, Jon George and James Hunt.','5/15/2026',0.8199999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/69/4498669-3600490.jpg?ae=4662083153','Dance');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185413,'wolfgang amadeus phoenix digital download card|phoenix|phoenix|lp','Wolfgang Amadeus Phoenix [Digital Download Card]','Phoenix','Phoenix','LP','GLSN167806.1','892038002183',23.0,23.0,'14420764','2026-11-13 00:13:53','2026-11-13 00:13:53','/89203800218',NULL,0,'Vinyl LP pressing. 2009 album from the French Electro-Rockers. Born out of restlessness and a steady hunt for inspiration, Wolfgang Amadeus Phoenix is a career-defining album filled with the band''s signature melding of synthetics and organics, sharp, danceable rhythms, infectious choruses with a considerable dose of aural panache and candy-colored pop sensibilities.','5/26/2009',0.6400000000000000133,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/76/1256576-3175906.jpg?ae=4662083153','Indie Rock/Pop,French');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185414,'truth or consequence|amyl the sniffers|amyl the sniffers|lp','Truth or Consequence','Amyl & the Sniffers','Amyl & the Sniffers','LP','AYTS2007.1','9332727137440',16.89000000000000056,16.89000000000000056,'46420060','2026-11-13 00:13:53','2026-11-13 00:13:53','/933272713744',NULL,0,'Truth or Consequence is a live album following the concert film of the same title, in which Amyl and The Sniffers perform country-influenced versions of their songs, two unreleased tracks, and a cover of the Slim Dusty classic ''Lights On The Hill''. It was recorded and filmed in front of an intimate and increasingly rowdy audience at El Coyote in Los Angeles, on 28 April 2025, by the band''s long-time collaborator, John Angus Stewart. The hope for this record is that it is listened to as it was made, in a ruckus exclamation between a cherished group of friends. Enjoy!','9/4/2026',0.5300000000000000266,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4526912-3651372.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185415,'sungazer|the temper trap|the temper trap|lp','Sungazer [Explicit Content]','The Temper Trap','The Temper Trap','LP','MSRQ30.1','9341004150171',16.0,16.0,'46133755','2026-11-13 00:13:53','2026-11-13 00:13:53','/934100415017','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Indie-rock group The Temper Trap make a triumphant return with Sungazer, a decade on from their last album. An explosive, anthemic new record that looks to the future as much as embodying their wildly successful past. Including singles ''Giving Up Air'', ''Lucky Dimes'' and ''Into The Wild'', Sungazer sees a new era of The Temper Trap unfurl. The past few years have seen the band return to live stages around the world, huge dance remixes of their hit ''Sweet Disposition'' by John Summit, Lost Frequencies and BUNT., and a long-awaited official release of Mac Miller bootleg ''Love Lost''.','7/10/2026',0.6500000000000000222,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/77/4505477-3556355.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185416,'sungazer iex blue|the temper trap|the temper trap|lp','Sungazer (IEX) Blue [Explicit Content]','The Temper Trap','The Temper Trap','LP','MSRQ300.1','9341004150188',16.0,16.0,'46133779','2026-11-13 00:14:02','2026-11-13 00:14:02','/934100415018','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, Blue, Gatefold LP Jacket)',0,'Indie-rock group The Temper Trap make a triumphant return with Sungazer, a decade on from their last album. An explosive, anthemic new record that looks to the future as much as embodying their wildly successful past. Including singles ''Giving Up Air'', ''Lucky Dimes'' and ''Into The Wild'', Sungazer sees a new era of The Temper Trap unfurl. The past few years have seen the band return to live stages around the world, huge dance remixes of their hit ''Sweet Disposition'' by John Summit, Lost Frequencies and BUNT., and a long-awaited official release of Mac Miller bootleg ''Love Lost''.','7/10/2026',0.6700000000000000399,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/79/4505479-3557376.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185417,'equus caballus import|men i trust|men i trust|lp','Equus Caballus [Import]','Men I Trust','Men I Trust','LP','IMT1240604.1','990312406044',43.64000000000000056,43.64000000000000056,'45455865','2026-11-13 00:14:03','2026-11-13 00:14:03','/99031240604','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,NULL,'9/5/2025',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://webami.aent.com/content/img/no_image_CD_lrg.gif','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185418,'the canyon|jjerome87|jjerome87|lp','The Canyon [Explicit Content]','Jjerome87','Jjerome87','LP','MSRQ340.1','9341004148345',16.0,16.0,'46017567','2026-11-13 00:14:03','2026-11-13 00:14:03','/934100414834','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'Jjerome87 is the solo moniker of British songwriter, musician and frontman of the critically acclaimed Mercury Prize and Ivor Novello-winning band, alt-J. Recorded in LA alongside producer Carlos de la Gaza, a dedicated group of session musicians and a trio of female vocalists, The Canyon is a collection of alt-J (esque) songs with a Californian, Motown, Blues and Gospel energy.','6/26/2026',0.5400000000000000355,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/78/4494678-3531306.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185419,'forever live sessions vol 2 import|men i trust|men i trust|lp','Forever Live Sessions Vol 2 [Import]','Men I Trust','Men I Trust','LP','IMT1202072.1','990312020721',38.78999999999999915,38.78999999999999915,'45054327','2026-11-13 00:14:03','2026-11-13 00:14:03','/99031202072','(United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Men I Trust, a Canadian indie band formed in 2014, has quietly but profoundly left it''s mark on the music scene. Comprising Emma Proulx (guitar and vocals), Jessy Caron (guitar and bass), and Dragos Chiriac (keyboards), the trio''s enchanting sound, blending dream pop and indie elements, resonates with a global audience. Renowned for their hypnotic melodies and captivating vocals, the band has earned acclaim for their distinct approach to music. Self-producing their tracks, they showcase a maturity beyond their years in the industry. Men I Trust''s influence extends from their evocative compositions to their understated yet compelling live performances, offering audiences a genuine and intimate musical experience. In an era where music defies easy categorization, Men I Trust stands out for their ability to create a sound that transcends genres, shaping the indie music landscape with grace and authenticity.','4/4/2025',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/37/4415537-3379173.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185420,'prism|john butler|john butler|lp','PRISM [Explicit Content]','John Butler','John Butler','LP','INEE24.1','9324690424061',27.28999999999999915,27.28999999999999915,'45351839','2026-11-13 00:14:03','2026-11-13 00:14:03','/932469042406','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'John Butler is stepping into a bold new era. The ARIA Award-winning musician has officially announced his tenth studio album, PRISM, which is set to arrive Sept. 5. John Butler is one of Australia''s premiere songwriters and storytellers with accolades spanning from #1 charting albums, in excess of 20 x platinum accreditations and several ARIA Awards across his illustrious career as one of the country''s most successful independent musicians!','9/5/2025',1.010000000000000008,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4442285-3415698.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
