INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185456,'one thing at a time|morgan wallen|morgan wallen|cd','One Thing At A Time','Morgan Wallen','Morgan Wallen','CD','MQRG3757002.2','602455190611',12.90000000000000035,12.90000000000000035,'43305148','2026-11-21 16:08:38','2026-11-21 16:08:38','/60245519061',NULL,0,'Morgan Wallen''s 3rd studio album, One Thing At A Time, is set for release via Big Loud/Mercury/Republic on 3/3/23. Wallen''s 36-song, deeply personal album combines his musical influences (country/alternative/hip-hop). With so much new music, the stage is set for his 63-date/30 stadium One Night At A Time World Tour. This album follows the success of his 4x platinum, Dangerous: The Double Album, which notched historical chart status at Billboard''s longest running Top 10 album for a solo artist. Morgan Wallen - One Thing At A Time - 2CD','3/3/2023',0.2800000000000000267,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/09/4182109-2945031.jpg?ae=4662083153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185457,'portishead 180 gram|portishead|portishead|lp','Portishead (180-gram)','Portishead','Portishead','LP','MRY253981.1','602557150995',30.55000000000000071,30.55000000000000071,'46695086','2026-11-21 16:08:39','2026-11-21 16:08:39','/60255715099','(180 Gram Vinyl)',0,'Portishead - "Portishead". Portishead''s self-titled second album arrived in 1997, three years after their breakthrough debut, Dummy. Geoff Barrow and Adrian Utley recorded original material to sample for it''s backing tracks, building a darker, more abrasive setting for Beth Gibbons'' vocals. The horn-driven "All Mine" frames Gibbons'' voice with orchestral drama, while opener "Cowboys" draws it''s tension from an insistent, repeating rhythm. Pressed on 180g black vinyl 2LP.','12/4/2026',0.979999999999999983,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/6/9/9/3519965.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185458,'the christmas attic|trans siberian orchestra|trans siberian orchestra|lp','The Christmas Attic','Trans-Siberian Orchestra','Trans-Siberian Orchestra','LP','ATL724883.1','603497832903',29.6700000000000017,29.6700000000000017,'43715558','2026-11-21 16:08:40','2026-11-21 16:08:40','/60349783290','(Anniversary Edition)',0,'Double vinyl LP pressing. The Christmas Season''s favorite prog-rock band delivers a 25th anniversary album of the second installation of their classic Christmas Trilogy, The Christmas Attic. Features annual favorites including "Music Box Blues," "Boughs of Holly," "Ghosts of Christmas Eve," and "Christmas Canon." This chapter tells the story of an angel that The Lord has challenged to visit earth to leave behind the one thing that would most benefit mankind.','9/29/2023',1.229999999999999983,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/16/4240616-3030784.jpg?ae=4662083153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185459,'22 a million 10th anniversary|bon iver|bon iver|lp','22, a Million - 10th Anniversary','Bon Iver','Bon Iver','LP','JAGJ300C1.1','617308049305',24.03999999999999915,24.03999999999999915,'46637567','2026-11-21 16:08:40','2026-11-21 16:08:40','/61730804930','(Colored Vinyl, Silver, Anniversary Edition)',0,'22, A Million is a record of dualities. First released in 2016, Bon Iver''s third album found Justin Vernon reckoning with pain and love, suffering and redemption, omens and happenstance. Such ambiguity is the core of how Justin composes words: there are always two ways to see something. Inside a fragmented language of symbols and numbers is a sonic distillation of past years of turbulence and how to recover. Across ten songs, 22, A Million shattered expectations of what a Bon Iver record could be. Through different groups of friends-close, passing, new, old-he began to assemble proto-melodies, vague textures and specific moods from hundreds of hours of recorded improvisations. Songs like "22 (OVER S∞∞N)," "33 ''GOD''," "715 - CRΣΣKS" and "8 (circle)" traded familiar structures for fractured electronics, pitch-shifted vocals and dense layers of sound. What initially felt like a radical departure has since become one of the most influential and enduring works in Bon Iver''s catalog. 2026 marks the ten-year anniversary of 22, A Million. To celebrate, Bon Iver and Jagjaguwar will release a deluxe anniversary edition pressed on Frosted Silver vinyl, featuring new alternative artwork with soft-touch finish and spot UV gloss detailing. The package will include the original 28-page lyric booklet, represented here in 3x silver inks, with an additional 12-page full-color inlay booklet documenting the album''s creative process through previously unseen artwork and an essay penned by Eric Timothy Carlson. The Brooklyn-based artist''s visual work has shaped the Bon Iver world since 22, A Million and his visual language has become inseparable from the album itself. A custom 12-panel ''inverted cross'' CD edition will also be available.','12/4/2026',1.469999999999999974,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4546170-3727339.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185460,'mother of my children|black belt eagle scout|black belt eagle scout|lp','Mother Of My Children','Black Belt Eagle Scout','Black Belt Eagle Scout','LP','SDLE280.1','648401028096',18.32000000000000028,18.32000000000000028,'44436865','2026-11-21 16:08:40','2026-11-21 16:08:40','/64840102809','(Colored Vinyl, Splatter)',0,'"Having this identity-radical indigenous queer feminist-keeps me going. My music and my identity come from the same foundation of being a Native woman." Katherine Paul (aka KP) is Black Belt Eagle Scout, and Mother of My Children is her debut album. Recorded in the middle of winter near her hometown in Northwest Washington, Paul''s connection to the landscape''s eerie beauty are palpable throughout as the album traces the full spectrum of confronting buried feelings and the loss of what life was supposed to look like.','8/2/2024',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4349787-3192619.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185461,'dead pioneers|dead pioneers|dead pioneers|lp','Dead Pioneers','Dead Pioneers','Dead Pioneers','LP','HSS0460.1','5060626469082',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'45434068','2026-11-21 16:08:40','2026-11-21 16:08:40','/506062646908','(Clear Vinyl, Reissue)',0,'Limited clear vinyl LP pressing. The self-titled debut album from Dead Pioneers, the punk band formed by Indigenous American artist and activist Gregg Deal. Who were the first punks? Do The Damned have more of a shout than The Sex Pistols? The Stooges or Ramones? Gregg Deal, the acclaimed visual and performance artist behind his new project Dead Pioneers, is making a claim that Indigenous Americans were the first real punks. Gregg Deal is an artist and activist and a member of the Pyramid Lake Paiute Tribe. Much of his work includes exhaustive critiques of American colonialism, society, politics, popular culture and history. The band is made up of guitarists Josh Rivera and Abe Brennan, drummer Shane Zweygardt and bassist Lee Tesche (who is also lead guitarist for Algiers), with Deal on vocals. Deal suggests that the overarching theme of the Dead Pioneers self-titled album is "an introduction to the band itself." Created with a DIY disposition and the "love of a scene that saves lives", they reel off a roll call of marginalised groups and protected characteristics: "Indigenous rights, Black rights, Brown rights, Asian rights, Gay rights, Trans rights, Workers rights and beyond...". This is central to their identity and focus, saying that "with a North American Indigenous person as the vocalist, being unapologetically upfront on the social, political and cultural side of things doesn''t seem necessary, but paramount to the overall tone of the band." This self-titled debut, coming in at a lithe 22 minutes with only one of the twelve tracks exceeding three minutes, is almost over before it begins, but covers a huge amount of ground in that time. Musical touchstones are varied, ranging from Black Flag and The Minutemen via Suicidal Tendencies and Rage Against The Machine through to La Dispute or Idles. Thematically, as much as sonically, it channels the taut energy and directed rage of Fugazi or Henry Rollins at their peak. Regardless of who was really punk first, Dead Pioneers are here now, continuing to ask questions and stand up for the voiceless.','9/26/2025',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4450186-3434045.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185462,'euro country live at st anne s|cmat|cmat|lp','Euro-country (live At St Anne''s)','CMAT','CMAT','LP','CMTB12.1','5056167184973',14.31000000000000049,14.31000000000000049,'46559821','2026-11-21 16:08:40','2026-11-21 16:08:40','/505616718497','(10-Inch Vinyl, Clear Vinyl, Blue)',0,'Hey all!! We are back with a new CMAT product! EURO COUNTRY - Live at St Anne''s Dublin! We have a very limited number coming to North America on transparent blue vinyl. Tell accounts to grab it while it''s hot! CMAT marks the one-year anniversary of her Ivor- and Choice-winning / Mercury-losing EURO-COUNTRY with the vinyl release of four live songs from the album! Recorded with The Very Sexy CMAT Band at their 20,000-capacity headliner at St Anne''s Park in Dublin, the tracks capture the energy, humour and infectious joy that make confirms the Dunboyne Diana as one of this era''s standout live acts.','12/11/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4539111-3712154.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185463,'audio technica atn3600lc conical stylus white||audio technica|','Audio Technica ATN3600LC Conical Stylus (White)',NULL,'Audio-Technica',NULL,'ADT62542','4961310162542',23.98999999999999844,23.98999999999999844,'44633172','2026-11-21 16:08:41','2026-11-21 16:08:41','/496131016254','(White)',0,NULL,NULL,0.04000000000000000083,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/23/4372323-3266136.jpg?ae=4662083153',NULL);
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185464,'christmas island|jimmy buffett|jimmy buffett|lp','Christmas Island','Jimmy Buffett','Jimmy Buffett','LP','UME140056.1','602458571325',21.51999999999999958,21.51999999999999958,'43939169','2026-11-21 16:08:41','2026-11-21 16:08:41','/60245857132',NULL,0,'Christmas Island is Jimmy Buffett''s first Christmas album and is his twenty-first studio album overall. It features covers of popular Christmas songs in Buffett''s musical stylings as well as two tracks which Buffett wrote for the album. "Twas the Night Before Christmas" is a hidden track. It was his last release with MCA Records. Vinyl LP pressing.','12/15/2023',0.5500000000000000444,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/96/4265796-3082782.jpg?ae=4662083153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185465,'greatest christmas hits|chicago|chicago|lp','Greatest Christmas Hits','Chicago','Chicago','LP','RHI725534.1','603497830275',17.80000000000000071,17.80000000000000071,'43834044','2026-11-21 16:08:41','2026-11-21 16:08:41','/60349783027','(Colored Vinyl, Red)',0,'Limited red colored vinyl LP pressing. Holiday collection from the iconic rock / jazz/ pop band. The festive compilation shines a spotlight on Chicago''s unmistakable sound across 13 yuletide favorites, including "Let It Snow! Let It Snow! Let It Snow," "All Over The World," "Wonderful Christmas Time" (featuring Dolly Parton), and "Winter Wonderland." The tracks originally appeared on Chicago XXV: The Christmas Album (1998), What''s It Gonna Be, Santa?(2003), Chicago XXXIII: O Christmas Three (2011), and Chicago XXXVII: Chicago Christmas (2019). Earlier this year, Chicago XXV: The Christmas Album and What''s It Gonna Be, Santa? were both certified gold by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA).','11/3/2023',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4250949-3043821.jpg?ae=4662083153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185466,'stranger in the alps|phoebe bridgers|phoebe bridgers|cd','Stranger In The Alps','Phoebe Bridgers','Phoebe Bridgers','CD','DEDO514422.2','656605144221',9.5,9.5,'33292045','2026-11-21 16:08:41','2026-11-21 16:08:41','/65660514422',NULL,0,'Phoebe Bridgers'' debut album, released September 22, 2017 by Dead Oceans.','9/22/2017',0.1300000000000000044,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/5/3/8/6/3686835.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185467,'bad self portraits remastered|lake street dive|lake street dive|lp','Bad Self Portraits - Remastered','Lake Street Dive','Lake Street Dive','LP','SIGN7067.1','701237706726',19.80000000000000071,19.80000000000000071,'46681850','2026-11-21 16:08:42','2026-11-21 16:08:42','/70123770672','(Reissue)',0,'Lake Street Dive''s acclaimed breakthrough album, Bad Self Portraits has been fully remastered. When Bad Self Portraits was released in 2014 Rolling Stone deemed Lake Street Dive "The year''s best new band" and the album debuted at #18 on the Billboard Top 200 chart. Their television performances have included The Late Show With David Letterman, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, The Ellen DeGeneres Show and the Today Show. Over the years, they''ve captivated massive audiences at esteemed festivals such as the Newport Folk Festival, Telluride Bluegrass Festival, and Toronto Jazz Festival, in addition to headlining tours across the globe and sharing stages with acts like Brandi Carlile and Sheryl Crow. Lake Street Dive continues to push the possibilities of pop music as a unifying force, not only through their eclectic sound - a boldly original cross-pollination of soul, folk, jazz, classic pop, and more - the five-piece''s all-embracing ethos has also made them a beloved live band known for building a potent connection among every crowd.','12/11/2026',0.05999999999999999778,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/72/4550372-3750888.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185468,'visitor|sienna spiro|sienna spiro|lp','Visitor','Sienna Spiro','Sienna Spiro','LP','CAP243736.1','199957783972',22.78999999999999915,22.78999999999999915,'46302519','2026-11-21 16:08:42','2026-11-21 16:08:42','/19995778397','(Indie Exclusive, Limited Edition, Colored Vinyl, Red, Alternate Cover)',0,'Sienna Spiro - Visitor - Indie Exclusive Red Vinyl W/ Alternative Cover edition - Sienna Spiro continues her rapid rise with Visitor, a deeply intimate and cinematic body of work that expands on the emotional storytelling and soulful vocal performances that have quickly made her one of the most talked-about new artists in contemporary pop, drawing on soul and jazz to create a sound that feels both timeless and modern. Building on the momentum of breakthrough songs "Die On This Hill," "You Stole The Show," and "The Visitor," Spiro delivers a collection of songs highlighting striking vocal performances that have made her the standout artist of the moment.','7/3/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/94/4516794-3623829.jpg?ae=4662083153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185469,'the universal bubba|willi carlisle|willi carlisle|lp','The Universal Bubba','Willi Carlisle','Willi Carlisle','LP','SIGN7068.1','701237706825',27.8299999999999983,27.8299999999999983,'46443915','2026-11-21 16:08:42','2026-11-21 16:08:42','/70123770682',NULL,0,'With a heavy-duty catalog of new material for a career first double album, The Universal Bubba marks a half dozen releases for folksinger Willi Carlisle and reaches new heights with the added accelerant of first time producer Tyler Childers. In an all-time DIY effort, Childers and his band convened to a makeshift home studio nestled in the Bywater District of New Orleans for two weeks to cut 17 tracks that expand Carlisle''s sonic scrapbook and capture the off-kilter characters living in his songs. Hailed as "One of country music''s most important and unmistakable voices." by PASTE, Carlisle embraced the freedom to wander across genres both familiar and new, testing out instrumentation and toying with the surreality of traditions being turned on their head. "I think this one goes to outer space," says Carlisle. "This is the widest range of influences that I''ve ever had. It touches on funk, Americana, Cajun, oldtime, and experimental music." Exploration aside, Carlisle''s mission as a folksinger largely remains the same - documenting the stories and struggles of the people and balancing the humor and hope of existence. "I want to write songs that prove the old weird America didn''t go anywhere, that we are living and dying for it everyday. I believe there''s noble work to do in that context. That if we feel despair, we don''t need to because there''s so much good work to do."','11/13/2026',1.080000000000000072,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/86/4529186-3685142.jpg?ae=4662083153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185470,'cocoon|morphine|morphine|lp','Cocoon','Morphine','Morphine','LP','PASN30671.1','720841306719',18.25,18.25,'46541314','2026-11-21 16:08:43','2026-11-21 16:08:43','/72084130671',NULL,0,'At the height of grunge, Morphine sounded like nobody else. The Boston trio built their own strange, seductive musical language (coined "low rock" by frontman Mark Sandman), built around Sandman''s two-string slide bass and unmistakable voice, Dana Colley''s baritone & tenor saxophone, and stripped-back drums (Jerome Deupree, Billy Conway). Morphine became one of the defining cult bands of the ''90s, but their story came to an abrupt end in 1999, when Sandman suffered a fatal heart attack on stage during a concert in Italy. More than 25 years later, Cocoon offers an extraordinary final chapter. It''s eight songs were recorded during Morphine''s late-''90s sessions before Sandman ultimately shelved the material on the path toward what would become their final album. Rediscovered in the band''s archives decades later, Sandman''s life partner and Morphine estate manager Sabine Hrechdakian and producer Paul Q. Kolderie (Radiohead, Pixies) transferred the original tapes and carefully assembled this unified collection of Morphine songs. Dana Colley returned to add new saxophone parts, and Kolderie then brought new mixes to the table. Rather than a collection of demos or outtakes, Cocoon is a fully realized Morphine album revealing a band still pushing forward that somehow waited nearly three decades to find it''s way into the world.','12/4/2026',0.7099999999999999645,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/11/4537511-3698693.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185471,'the war on errorism white|nofx|nofx|lp','The War on Errorism - White','NOFX','NOFX','LP','FWR397.1','751097039717',17.5,17.5,'46633279','2026-11-21 16:08:43','2026-11-21 16:08:43','/75109703971','(Indie Exclusive, Colored Vinyl, White)',0,'PUNK ROCK MASTERPIECE Features a New Clown on the Album Cover Warning: owning this record might piss off your army recruiter, grizzled grampa, or those wacky flag-wavin'' nationalist buddies of yours. Reissue of NOFX''s first studio full length on Fat! The band tackles serious matters (punk culture and politics) with their trademark wit and sarcasm. The album peaked at #3 on OCC UK Rock and Metal albums chart, #4 on OCC UK Independent Albums, and #48 on OCC UK Albums charts. NOFX has retired but their legacy lives forever. The band is currently the subject of their first comprehensive exhibit at the Punk Rock Museum in Las Vegas. Their documentary 40 Years of F***in Up makes it premiere at SXSW 2026 and widely available in April (Score & soundtrack coming soon, feat. new NOFX music). The next volume in the A-Z trilogy I to Q is set for a late 2026 release. And keep an eye on Fat Mike, rumor is he''s got some opinions on the current state of the world.','12/4/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/49/4545749-3725862.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185472,'rites of spring|noah gundersen|noah gundersen|lp','Rites Of Spring','Noah Gundersen','Noah Gundersen','LP','NOGU1A.1','732388049486',20.12999999999999901,20.12999999999999901,'46727022','2026-11-21 16:08:43','2026-11-21 16:08:43','/73238804948','(Colored Vinyl, Yellow)',0,NULL,'12/18/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/73/4554373-3752166.jpg?ae=4662083153','Folk');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185473,'abysskiss|adrianne lenker|adrianne lenker|lp','Abysskiss','Adrianne Lenker','Adrianne Lenker','LP','FOUR855.1','191400085510',21.23000000000000042,21.23000000000000042,'46668349','2026-11-21 16:08:43','2026-11-21 16:08:43','/19140008551',NULL,0,'Adrianne Lenker has been writing songs since she was 10 years old. Despite, or more likely because of the constant touring and studio work, the last few years have been some of the most prolific for Lenker as a writer. Songs pop out at soundcheck. They pop out on late night drives between cities. They pop out in green rooms, hotel stairwells, gardens, and kitchens around the world. In the hands of Lenker songwriting is not an old dead craft. It is alive. It is vital. With little regard for standard album cycle practice or the idea of resting at all, Lenker set out to make a document. Songs can be slippery and following years on the road with Big Thief, Lenker felt a growing need to document this particular time in her life in an intimate, immediate way. "I want to archive the songs in their original forms every few years," explains Lenker. "My first solo record I made was Hours Were the Birds. I had just turned 21 and moved to New York City where I was sleeping in a warehouse, working in a restaurant and photographing pigeons. Now five years later, another skin is being shed." Following a two week road trip through the southwestern United States, Lenker headed into the studio with longtime friend Luke Temple. The songs chosen for this collection were the songs that felt the most alive in the room. The thread that connects these songs is not something that can easily be put down in words. Intuition connects these songs. They are a record of a time. Here we have a songwriter of the highest order, following her voice and the greater Voices that pass through her with an unflinching openness and clarity of translation.','12/11/2026',0.5699999999999999512,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/48/4549048-3749182.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185474,'puberty 2|mitski|mitski|cd','Puberty 2','Mitski','Mitski','CD','DEDO51423.2','656605142326',9.5,9.5,'31001922','2026-11-21 16:08:43','2026-11-21 16:08:43','/65660514232',NULL,0,'2016album. The follow-up to 2014''s ''Bury Me At Makeout Creek'', named after a Simpsons quote and hailed by Pitchfork as "a complex 10-song story [containing] some of the most nuanced, complex and articulate music that''s come from the indiesphere in a while," ''Puberty 2'' picks up where it''s predecessor left off.','6/17/2016',0.1000000000000000055,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/b/500/4/4/2/4/3314244.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185475,'dust the halls vol 2|the infamous stringdusters|the infamous stringdusters|lp','Dust the Halls Vol. 2','The Infamous Stringdusters','The Infamous Stringdusters','LP','AMVB163.1','823375380085',13.78999999999999915,13.78999999999999915,'46700896','2026-11-21 16:08:44','2026-11-21 16:08:44','/82337538008',NULL,0,'The Infamous Stringdusters, celebrating 20 years as a band, comes back this Holiday season with a new holiday album. Fresh off the release of their 20th studio album, 20/20, the grammy award winning bluegrass group bring the Holiday spirit on Dust The Halls Vol. 2. After the success of Dust The Halls Vol. 1, which continue to be a dominate product in the bands catalog year after year, Dust The Halls Vol. 2 brings 10 more winter festive tracks including three brand new songs written by the Dusters.','12/18/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/53/4551953-3743882.jpg?ae=4662083153','Xmas Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185476,'all the king s men|chvrches|chvrches|cd','All the King''s Men','Chvrches','Chvrches','CD','FMGU8.2','823375153498',10.0,10.0,'46672797','2026-11-21 16:08:44','2026-11-21 16:08:44','/82337515349',NULL,0,'Chvrches return with their fifth studio album, All The King''s Men, a bold new chapter from the acclaimed Scottish synth-pop trio. Reuniting after a brief hiatus with a renewed creative energy, the band deliver what may be their most compelling and fully realized album to date. Available on CD, this release celebrates the unmistakable sound that has made Chvrches one of the defining electronic pop acts of their generation.','1/22/2027',0.2399999999999999912,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/87/4549487-3735614.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185477,'take me back to eden vinyl voice|sleep token|sleep token|lp','Take Me Back to Eden (Vinyl Voice)','Sleep Token','Sleep Token','LP','SPEF801289.1','5401148012897',29.0,29.0,'46669643','2026-11-21 16:08:44','2026-11-21 16:08:44','/540114801289','(Colored Vinyl, Green)',0,'Sleep Token Take Me Back To Eden "Olive Green" Vinyl Voice Exclusive','12/4/2026',1.139999999999999902,'lbs','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/92/4549192-3734448.jpg?ae=4662083153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185478,'operation doomsday|mf doom|mf doom|cd','Operation: Doomsday','MF Doom','MF Doom','CD','MFCR352.2','826257035226',9.5,9.5,'45707391','2026-11-21 16:08:44','2026-11-21 16:08:44','/82625703522',NULL,0,'Underneath his mysterious metal mask, MF Doom hides the cachet underground legends are made of. After his first group KMD''s sophomore album Black Bastards was shelved by Elektra in 1994, and his blood brother Subroc - one half of the sibling rap duo - passed away, surviving frontman Zev Love X slowly mutated into the supervillain MC known as MF Doom, and the rap world is better for it. The 1999 release of Operation: Doomsday marked MF Doom''s official debut, reintroducing a mysterious figure who would soon become one of underground rap''s greatest voices. Within it''s 19 tracks, Operation: Doomsday reveals the confluence of DOOM''s tragic past, personal interests and daring creativity. His clever rhymes and remarkable schemes stood out against the landscape, and every sound he touched - from cartoon theme songs, to ''80s soul, to rap classics and more - got reinterpreted into something brand new and surreal. Decades later, MF Doom is still celebrated for all facets of his work and influence. In the face of tragedy, DOOM re-infiltrated the rap game on his own terms, and crafted an instant cult classic. Operation: Doomsday stands as a testament to the power of betting on yourself against all odds.','3/31/2023',0.1199999999999999956,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/85/4472485-3479068.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185479,'still hungover|ella langley|ella langley|cd','still hungover','Ella Langley','Ella Langley','CD','CLBI848014.2','199584801421',12.33999999999999986,12.33999999999999986,'46568823','2026-11-21 16:08:44','2026-11-21 16:08:44','/19958480142',NULL,0,'Ella Langley - still hungover - CD still hungover is the deluxe version of rising country maverick Ella Langley’s breakout debut record, which includes 4 additional tracks, available for the first time on physical CD. RIAA Certified Platinum and CMA award-winning Ella Langley is an Alabama-born singer/songwriter with a rafter-reaching voice that pulls no punches when it comes to writing about life, love, and everything else under the sun. Spiking her unfiltered true stories with unapologetic rock ‘n’ roll grit and unassuming pop appeal, she’s quietly emerged as a phenomenon, now with over 960 million streams and a rapidly growing fan base. The album, which was recorded in Nashville, Tennessee and produced by Will Bundy, features 19 songs (including hit single “you look like you love me (feat. Riley Green),” plus new tracks “weren’t for the wind” and “made it out of Mexico – acoustic”).','10/9/2026',0.2200000000000000011,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/60/4539960-3707465.jpg?ae=4662083153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185480,'demo|fatal realm|fatal realm|lp','Demo [Explicit Content]','Fatal Realm','Fatal Realm','LP','DAZE031.1','840526519811',18.42000000000000171,18.42000000000000171,'46711533','2026-11-21 16:08:45','2026-11-21 16:08:45','/84052651981','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Colored Vinyl, Purple)',0,'CLOUDY PURPLE GALAXY VINYL. Fatal Realm FROM THE HUDSON VALLEY OF NEW YORK.. BRUTAL HARDCORE INFLUENCED METAL. SOUNDS LIKE 90S CANNIBAL CORPSE MIXED WITH ALL OUT WAR. THIS CD FEATURES REMIXES OF ALL THE DEMO TRACKS AS BONUS TRACKS!','12/18/2026',0.5,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/99/4552999-3746659.jpg?ae=4662083153','Heavy Metal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185481,'the best of van morrison|van morrison|van morrison|lp','The Best of Van Morrison','Van Morrison','Van Morrison','LP','VNMO100.1','823375301776',23.5,23.5,'46641946','2026-11-21 16:08:46','2026-11-21 16:08:46','/82337530177','(Expanded Version, Reissue)',0,'Reissue, on Van Morrison''s Exile label, of the iconic 1990 compilation that has sold more than 5,000,000 worldwide. Featuring 20 classic songs from 1964-1989 including Brown Eyed Girl, Sweet Thing, Moondance, Bright Side of the Road & Have I Told You Lately and three songs from his time in Them; Gloria, Baby Please Don''t Go & Here Comes The Night. Expanded double vinyl with four additional songs that were on the original CD but not the vinyl; Wonderful Remark, Full Force Gale, Queen of the Slipstream & Dweller on the Threshold.','12/11/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/12/4546412-3728027.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
