INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185499,'npr tiny desk concert iex|scarface|scarface|lp','NPR Tiny Desk Concert (IEX) [Explicit Content]','Scarface','Scarface','LP','RPAL6IN.1','823375436546',18.0,18.0,'46668653','2026-11-21 16:08:49','2026-11-21 16:08:49','/82337543654','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Indie Exclusive, Clear Vinyl, Blue, Red)',0,'Scarface''s acclaimed NPR Tiny Desk performance arrives across all formats this December as part of Rap-A-Lot Records'' ongoing 40 Years campaign. Backed by a live band featuring legendary producer Mike Dean on keys, the Houston icon delivers intimate, reimagined renditions of career-defining classics including ''On My Block,'' ''Mary Jane,'' ''Smile,'' ''I Seen a Man Die'' and the Geto Boys'' ''Mind Playing Tricks on Me.'' Arriving just in time for the holidays, this special release commemorates one of Scarface''s most celebrated performances and an unforgettable moment in his storied career. Indie Exclusive "Smoke Signal'' vinyl, with blue, red, and black smoke ribbons on a clear disc 8 × 10" black-and-white performance photo of Scarface and Mike Dean','12/11/2026',0.5600000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/01/4549101-3734491.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rap/Hip Hop');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185500,'the rise and fall of a midwest princess|chappell roan|chappell roan|lp','The Rise and Fall of a Midwest Princess [Explicit Content]','Chappell Roan','Chappell Roan','LP','ISL251229.1','881061325529',45.10000000000000142,45.10000000000000142,'46634795','2026-11-21 16:08:50','2026-11-21 16:08:50','/88106132552','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Limited Edition, Deluxe Edition, Colored Vinyl, Anniversary Edition)',0,'Chappell Roan -"The Rise and Fall of a Midwest Princess (3-Year Anniversary) "This 3-Year Anniversary Edition is pressed on "My Kink Is Coral" color vinyl in deluxe gatefold packaging with new foil slipcase. Includes 1 of 4 exclusive posters and exclusive digital download card for "Love Me Anyway (Live from Buenos Aires)." 2-LP set with Side-D etching. Limited Edition. EXPLICIT','12/11/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/36/4545836-3727599.jpg?ae=4662083153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185501,'where i ve been isn t where i m going the complete edition|shaboozey|shaboozey|cd','Where I''Ve Been, Isn''t Where I''m Going: The Complete Edition [Explicit Content]','Shaboozey','Shaboozey','CD','ACDG1143.2','199316409093',8.089999999999999858,8.089999999999999858,'45831461','2026-11-21 16:08:50','2026-11-21 16:08:50','/19931640909','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics, Deluxe Edition, Digipack Packaging)',0,'The Complete Edition of Shaboozey''s magnum opus, Where I''ve Been, Isn''t Where I''m Going. Containing 6 additional tracks, including the smash hits, "Good News," & "Blink Twice," the album served as a major breakthrough for Shaboozey and it''s deluxe release caps off an impressive year where Shaboozey exploded onto the national scene. Shaboozey is building his own world, carving a lane in the alternative country and hip-hop space. Born to parents of Nigerian descent and raised in the small town of Woodbridge, VA, the multi-faceted artist grew up on an eclectic mix of music encompassing classic hip-hop and R&B, to country and blues icons like Johnny Cash, Kenny Rogers, Garth Brooks, and Lead Belly, to master lyricists, such as Bob Dylan and Leonard Cohen. A true crossover artist, he began his epic rise to stardom with two standout features on Beyoncé''s COWBOY CARTER. His latest body of work, the critically acclaimed RIAA-Platinum certified masterpiece Where I''ve Been, Isn''t Where I''m Going, debuted in the top five of the Billboard 200 and was praised by Rolling Stone for "honoring country tradition and moving it forward." NPR calls him "the future of country music," and the Los Angeles Times crowned him as "the breakout country artist of the year." The album''s breakthrough anthem, the 8X RIAA-Platinum certified, "A Bar Song (Tipsy)" holds the record for the longest-leading Hot 100 No. 1 while also topping Billboard''s Hot Country Songs, Country Airplay Chart, and Mediabase/Country Aircheck charts. The single has accumulated over a billion streams across DSPs and made history, making Shaboozey the first Black male artist to simultaneously top Billboard''s Hot Country Songs and Hot 100. Shaboozey earned three nominations at the 2026 GRAMMY® Awards including Best Country Song for "Good News," Best Country Solo Performance for "Good News," and Best Country Duo/Group Performance with Jelly Roll for "Amen." He also earned five nominations at the 2025 GRAMMY® Awards including Best New Artist and Song of the Year. He won the New Artist of 2024 and New Artist Song of 2024 awards at the People''s Choice Country Awards, garnered Best New Artist and Song of the Summer nominations at the 2024 MTV Video Music Awards, and was nominated for New Artist of the Year and Single of the Year at the 2024 Country Music Association Awards. He was also named a TIME100 NEXT honoree and Billboard Country Power Player. Shaboozey was crowned Newcomer Of The Year at Variety''s Hitmakers 2024 and picked up 2024 Billboard Music Awards for Top Song Sales Artist, Top Selling Song, and Top Country Song. Most recently, Shaboozey was nominated for New Male Artist of the Year and Single of the Year at the 2025 Academy of Country Music Awards. Highlighting not only his musical vision but also his commitment to influencing modern culture, Shaboozey debuted his collaboration for YSL Beauty''s MYSLF Le Parfum for a groundbreaking campaign. Honoring his Virginia roots, Shaboozey continues the region''s long-standing tradition of prolific creativity by expanding the scope of contemporary hip-hop, introducing modern Americana to a global audience, and bringing a unique sense of artistry to the world. His debut headline Where I''ve Been, Isn''t Where I''m Going tour sold out in every market across North America, Europe, and the UK, and he played arenas nationwide as part of Jelly Roll''s Beautifully Broken tour.','2/6/2026',0.1100000000000000005,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/13/4483913-3504384.jpg?ae=4662083153','Country');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185502,'getz gilberto import|getz stan gilberto joao|getz stan gilberto joao|lp','Getz /  Gilberto [Import]','GETZ,STAN / GILBERTO,JOAO','GETZ,STAN / GILBERTO,JOAO','LP','DOL7310134.1','889397310134',14.53999999999999915,14.53999999999999915,'36324231','2026-11-21 16:08:50','2026-11-21 16:08:50','/88939731013','(Bonus Tracks, United Kingdom - Import)',0,'Gatefold 180-gram vinyl. Getz/Gilberto is an album by American saxophonist Stan Getz and Brazilian guitarist João Gilberto, featuring pianist and composer Antônio Carlos Jobim, who also composed many of the tracks. It was released in March 1964 by Verve Records.','6/15/2018',0.7399999999999999912,'lb','https://media.aent-m.com/graphics/items/sdimages/a/500/2/4/3/0/3800342.jpg?ae=4662083153','Jazz');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185503,'mr soul limited 180 gram orange colored vinyl import|sam cooke|sam cooke|lp','Mr. Soul - Limited 180-Gram Orange Colored Vinyl [Import]','Sam Cooke','Sam Cooke','LP','MOVL6204326.1','8719262043268',29.08999999999999986,29.08999999999999986,'46246165','2026-11-21 16:08:50','2026-11-21 16:08:50','/871926204326','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Orange, Holland - Import)',0,'Limited to 1000 Copies on Orange Colored Vinyl. Sam Cooke, inventor and true King of Soul, recorded Mr. Soul in the same year as Night Beat, and seems to be it''s more adult counterpart, with soulful ballads taking up most of the album. A laidback tempo and rich arrangements lay the foundation for Sam''s somewhat melancholy voice floats, creating an uplifting spirit that can mend anyone''s broken heart. With standards such as Willow Weep For Me, I Wish You Love, and For Sentimental Reasons, Cooke shows a quiet emotive side of himself without losing his keen sense of melody, using the strength of his voice without overpowering the listener. Had Sam Cooke lived longer, we might have had more music of this rare quality. As it stands, we must make do with the treasures he left behind.','6/26/2026',0.6300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/30/4512930-3593256.jpg?ae=4662083153','Soul/R & B');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185504,'heads tails volume 2|jerry garcia band|jerry garcia band|lp','Heads & Tails Volume 2','Jerry Garcia Band','Jerry Garcia Band','LP','RRQO2713812.1','880882713812',18.0,18.0,'46672964','2026-11-21 16:08:50','2026-11-21 16:08:50','/88088271381','(Colored Vinyl, Purple)',0,'Vol. 2 shares a double dose of previously unreleased live JGB splendor, pressed on Lavender colored Eco-Mix vinyl. One side showcases exquisite versions of "Russian Lullaby" and "Who Was John?," captured during Grateful Dead bandmates Keith & Donna Jean Godchaux''s debut on January 26th, 1976 at Keystone Berkeley. The other side highlights transcendent covers of Van Morrison''s "And It Stoned Me" and Daniel Lanois''s "The Maker," recorded on August 8th, 1993, at Oregon''s Portland Meadows.','12/4/2026',0.5799999999999999601,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/06/4549506-3735625.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185505,'wheatus 2020|wheatus|wheatus|lp','Wheatus 2020','Wheatus','Wheatus','LP','MQTK2020.1','859779960745',25.33999999999999986,25.33999999999999986,'46465122','2026-11-21 16:08:51','2026-11-21 16:08:51','/85977996074','(Colored Vinyl, Green, Gatefold LP Jacket, Remastered)',0,'A re-recorded & reimagined version of the Wheatus debut album, including their generation-defining smash "Teenage Dirtbag," as well as fan favorites "Truffles," "Leroy," and "Hump''em and Dump''em." A second disc includes ten additional "lost songs," also newly recorded, from throughout the band''s history and available for the first time.','12/11/2026',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/67/4530867-3676848.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185506,'type it up|matt berninger|matt berninger|lp','Type It Up','Matt Berninger','Matt Berninger','LP','COJ251265.1','888072837218',17.69999999999999929,17.69999999999999929,'46586209','2026-11-21 16:08:51','2026-11-21 16:08:51','/88807283721','(Limited Edition, Extended Play, Colored Vinyl, Pink)',0,'Matt Berninger - "Type It Up". ''Type It Up'' is produced by Sean O''Brien. The EP consists of six tracks, one of which is exclusively available on vinyl ("Martini Me Fatso" - d Acoustic Live in Australia). NPR called Matt Berninger''s sophomore album ''Get Sunk'' a "creative awakening... some of these songs are the best he''s done." ''Type It Up'' is the follow up to ''Get Sunk,'' but it''s grittier, moodier, and maybe even bolder. Pressed on limited-edition, hot pink 12" vinyl.','12/4/2026',0.5200000000000000177,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/44/4541644-3713322.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185507,'prima|adela|adela|cd','PRIMA [Explicit Content]','Adela','Adela','CD','CAP247513.2','881061081265',9.74000000000000021,9.74000000000000021,'46436849','2026-11-21 16:08:52','2026-11-21 16:08:52','/88106108126','(Parental Advisory Explicit Lyrics)',0,'ADÉLA - PRIMA - CD Adela presents her heavily anticipated 2026 debut studio album, PRIMA. Featuring lead singles "KGB" & "Red Bottoms," the full-length album finds AD?LA in her prime, with a range of hard-hitting pop bangers & vulnerable ballads, making her debut album a must-listen introduction to fans and newcomers alike.','9/4/2026',0.1900000000000000022,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/52/4528452-3700975.jpg?ae=4662083153','Vocal');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185508,'best buds|mom jeans|mom jeans|lp','Best Buds','Mom Jeans','Mom Jeans','LP','CUTI10E.1','885288606850',19.39000000000000056,19.39000000000000056,'46704030','2026-11-21 16:08:53','2026-11-21 16:08:53','/88528860685','(Colored Vinyl, Orange, Mint Green, Splatter)',0,'2016 debut album from Bay Area Emo/Pop-Punk favorites Mom Jeans, featuring ''Edward 40hands.'' Counter Intuitive.','12/4/2026',0.5100000000000000088,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/55/4552255-3744453.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185509,'a long way from kansas|hot chip|hot chip|lp','A Long Way From Kansas','Hot Chip','Hot Chip','LP','DOMI534.1','887828053414',29.32000000000000028,29.32000000000000028,'46678430','2026-11-21 16:08:53','2026-11-21 16:08:53','/88782805341','(Gatefold LP Jacket, Digital Download Card)',0,'A Long Way From Kansas, Hot Chip''s new album, finds them at their most primal. Paraphrasing The Wizard of Oz, the title is a nod towards Dorothy, her dog and the distance they needed to travel to get back home and find some sense of normality. The world seems to be spinning faster, it''s story harder to read. Deaths, wars for no reason, the climate catastrophe burning through the seasons. Reactive to all that bleakness, and echoing it with distortion and decay, the band''s ninth album finds it''s own way to celebrate life even as the edges all around it burn. A beaming signal arriving just in time to remind the listener that no matter how bad the outside world is, there''s no place like home, whether that''s surrounded by like-minded souls on the dancefloor or closing the curtains in your own living room.','1/8/2027',1.0,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/70/4550070-3738237.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185510,'sam s town|the killers|the killers|lp','Sam''s Town','The Killers','The Killers','LP','ISL254921.1','881061376897',23.51999999999999958,23.51999999999999958,'46693464','2026-11-21 16:09:02','2026-11-21 16:09:02','/88106137689','(Limited Edition, 180 Gram Vinyl, Colored Vinyl, Red, Anniversary Edition)',0,'The Killers - "Sam''s Town (20th Anniversary)" The Killers'' sophomore studio album, Sam''s Town, mastered for vinyl and cut from the assembled analog masters by Ryan Smith at Sterling Sound. Pressed on limited-edition, 180g red smoke color vinyl. Featuring the hits, "When You Were Young" and "Read My Mind."','12/4/2026',0.8100000000000000533,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/04/4551304-3760644.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
INSERT INTO webami_products VALUES(185511,'carnaval de luz|u2|u2|cd','Carnaval De Luz','U2','U2','CD','ISC252587.2','881061171140',16.58999999999999986,16.58999999999999986,'46626431','2026-11-21 16:09:02','2026-11-21 16:09:02','/88106117114','(Booklet, Digipack Packaging)',0,'2026 release. ''Carnaval de Luz'' is the exhilarating 16th studio album from U2, 12 melodically rich new songs from one of the most celebrated & enduring bands of all time. Acknowledged as one of the best live acts in the world, U2 has sales of over 175m & won numerous awards, including 22 Grammys. Set for release in the year Bono, The Edge, Adam Clayton & Larry Mullen Jr. Will mark 50 years together in U2, ''Carnaval de Luz'' includes lead tracks "Street of Dreams, " "Silencio" and the extraordinary "Torn (ft. Dolly Parton)."','11/13/2026',0.1300000000000000044,'lb','https://mediacdn.aent-m.com/prod-img/500/50/4545150-3725486.jpg?ae=4662083153','Rock');
